1,17,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:20:22','2023-06-24 13:20:23'),(128,'judge-event-evaluation-464-1687577000',464,8,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7065,6328,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:23:20','2023-06-24 13:23:20'),(129,'judge-event-evaluation-234-1687577210',234,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7319,4451,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Need more texture and depth.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:26:50','2023-06-24 13:26:50'),(130,'judge-event-evaluation-465-1687577387',465,8,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7067,6328,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:29:47','2023-06-24 13:29:47'),(131,'judge-event-evaluation-588-1687577626',588,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7365,5804,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,52.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:33:46','2023-06-24 13:33:46'),(132,'judge-event-evaluation-227-1687577838',227,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7318,4451,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:37:18','2023-06-24 13:37:18'),(134,'judge-event-evaluation-1063-1687578420',1063,10,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7281,1467,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Good to see you using some basic techniques of cross hatching and stippling as well as directive lines and broken lines.  We are so blessed by God to have things at our finger tips we can draw.  One thing you could do to enhance your life drawings from nature is to accentuate the contrasts between dark and light.  Make your dark really dark and perhaps even use an ink wash to create delicacy in the petals of the flower.  Putting in a background against the flower may have provided a good contrast so that the flower stands out from the page.  I would love to know what type of flower it is because it looks so pretty.  I love the way you have emphasized the curves and curls in the leaves and in the flower.  In the center of the flower you have done well to create a 3 D effect with good perspective drawing of the petals.  Darkening the underneath more of the petal nearest the stem would make it stand out more rather than blending into the next petal.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 13:47:00','2023-06-24 13:47:00'),(135,'judge-event-evaluation-1192-1687579510',1192,21,1,5,1,2023,182,'463',NULL,7131,5805,7462,13,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Great effort Joon ! Message was clear and well explained, but I feel this would\'ve been great as a Powerpoint Presentation entry rather than a Graphic Design entry. It follows Powerpoint guidelines rather well , but it falls short in the Graphic Design category\r\nGraphic Design requires a one page flyer, brochure , tract etc designed completely on your own without the use of templates, using properly credited images. For future events , don\'t hesitate to check up on guidelines to help you prepare. Keep designing , and stay blessed Joon !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 14:05:10','2023-06-26 11:38:22'),(138,'judge-event-evaluation-1307-1687581003',1307,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7402,4200,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'You really have a story going on in this picture with the depiction of Rupunzel in the tower with the cross on top of the tower.  Her hair is long and there is no handsome prince.  I would love to know what you are saying here and your thinking behind everything.  Next time remember to put in a report with your work.  As far as the work goes I love the background their is a lot of movement and textures laid down in your background.  There is no real light direction in your picture though you do have some dark contrasts against the light.  Your cloud movement and formation is almost Vincent Van Gogh like in formation and reminds me of his painting \"The Starry Night.\"  Van Gogh was an Impressionist painter.  I would love to know what your influences were.  You have a definite foreground, midground and background.  Tower could have been made to look more 3 dimensional by more shading to give where the light and shadow falls as the tube of the tower disappears.  Your style is would be suitably placed in an illustration in a child\'s book or in a comic strip or as part of a compendium of things that a child or young girl could color in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 14:30:03','2023-06-24 14:30:03'),(139,'judge-event-evaluation-441-1687581794',441,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7405,4200,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'You have beautifully integrated and placed your circles to create some beautiful repeating patterns.  I would love to know if there is symbolism or a story behind what you have done.  Why did you do what you did?  What influenced you?  Where did you get your inspiration from?  You have an awesome even balance between your positive space and your negative space and have created a variety of texture and contrasts with your lines and patterns.  I look forward to seeing your art work and paper work next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 14:43:14','2023-06-24 14:43:14'),(140,'judge-event-evaluation-1107-1687582844',1107,13,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7196,4208,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'I like the way you have chosen to draw from memory a Native American Shawl Dancer.  The picture has movement and the way the feathers flow is a lovely touch.  You have cartooned the woman you have depicted in the picture and there is a definite place in this world for cartooning.  Do you know the significance behind the American Shawl dance?  The women\'s fancy shawl dance represents the opening of a cocoon when the butterfly emerges. The shawl is usually the most extravagant piece. The fringed shawls are colourful and flashy, often featuring embroidery or ribbon work. The fringe on the shawl has movement that coincides with the dancer.  You have done some patterning on the edges of the shawl and the headband and that contrasts but I believe you could put a lot more into the picture if you also focused on creating a direction for light and a place for shadows to fall.  More textures could be used as well.  More could be done to enhance the perspective overall.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:00:44','2023-06-24 15:00:45'),(141,'judge-event-evaluation-433-1687584347',433,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7407,4200,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Sheryl you have completed a beautiful pen and ink drawing of the bird.  It looks so life like and cuddly at the same time.  I love the way you have used your lines with the feathers and also the way that you have put in your light at the side in your background and where it touches the bird.  You have created an excellent contrast through your rough cross hatching of the back ground.  I would love to know what inspired you?  Did you go by a picture?  If so where did it come from? Filling out a report and accounting for your source is a very important part of the art making process.  I look forward to reading your report on your art work next year.  It almost looks like the background is pencil and not pen in ink but I could be wrong and would be interested to know your technique to get the areas rubbed out where the light is.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:25:47','2023-06-24 15:25:47'),(142,'judge-event-evaluation-1180-1687584918',1180,46,1,5,1,2023,301,'925',NULL,7442,4504,7373,46,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'The script supplied is far from what the story teller said. Also, need to improve the facial expression to make the story more alive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:35:18','2023-06-24 15:35:18'),(143,'judge-event-evaluation-1263-1687584947',1263,11,1,5,1,2023,301,'925',NULL,7025,613,7373,46,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'The story is good. The story teller needs to see the audience often than seeing the properties, also need to improve the facial expression and gesture. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:35:47','2023-06-24 15:35:47'),(144,'judge-event-evaluation-488-1687584971',488,3,1,5,1,2023,301,'925',NULL,6980,1678,7373,46,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,-1.00,'The story is interesting. The story teller should shows the emotion more and pay attention to the properties position, so it can help to illustrate the story maximally. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:36:11','2023-06-24 15:36:11'),(145,'judge-event-evaluation-724-1687585412',724,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7408,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'You have made an awesome perspective drawing, lovely birds eye view.  Remember when sourcing work from the internet to note down the source address of your art work as we need to make sure that copyright is not breeched.  You have used curved line very effectively to create the tiles on the roof and your pen and ink wash has worked enhanced your work.  The fine detail and different techniques you have used are effective. Your use of circular scribble, line are very effective.  It is hard to mark a person\'s creativity when you do not know if it is copied or not so I can only mark on your application techniques with the ink media which are excellent.  I love the way you have some heavy shadows going across the cats and the roof from outside of the picture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:43:32','2023-06-24 15:43:32'),(146,'judge-event-evaluation-1514-1687585670',1514,17,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7389,4200,7240,44,'Open','24',100,77.00,-10,-1.00,'Nicely done Excellent.\r\nSome areas to work on are - you can use your hands to give dramatic variety\r\n                                                   - using changes to your voice (e.g. low n raspy for older character/ high and soft for younger character)\r\n                                                   - using facial expressions when looking at the audience\r\nIf you have a stand or pulpit on which to place your script,that you definitely help to free up your hands for future entries.\r\nWas blessed by your entry and am looking forward seeing more of what God will do through you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 15:47:50','2023-06-24 15:47:50'),(148,'judge-event-evaluation-1186-1687586484',1186,46,1,5,1,2023,301,'925',NULL,7445,4504,7373,46,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'The script supplied is far from what the story teller said. Also, need to improve the facial expression and voice projection and inflection to emphasize the flow of story. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 16:01:24','2023-06-24 16:01:24'),(149,'judge-event-evaluation-1531-1687586674',1531,17,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7393,4200,7240,44,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Handsam.\r\nJust an area to work on is the enunciation of certain words,\r\nand please be sure the full script is supplied as the second page was missing.\r\nIf you happen to have a stand or pulpit with which to place your script on\r\nthis would allow you use both hands for more dramatic effects.\r\nLooking forward to the things God will continue to do through you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 16:04:34','2023-06-24 16:04:34'),(150,'judge-event-evaluation-1437-1687587894',1437,13,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7195,4208,7240,44,'Open','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Lachlan.\r\nJust a few tips to help with future entries\r\n*Try holding the script in one hand, this will allow you use your free hand to give more dramatic variety.\r\n*Practicing stand firmly, and not swaying to much from side to side.\r\nIf you have a stand or pulpit that could use, this would definitely free up both your hands to add more expression\r\nLooking forward to all that God will continue to do through you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 16:24:54','2023-06-24 16:24:54'),(151,'judge-event-evaluation-1114-1687589141',1114,21,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7118,5805,7240,44,'Open','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Maimoaga.\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll continue to do great things\r\nLooking forward to all God will do through you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 16:45:41','2023-06-24 16:45:42'),(152,'judge-event-evaluation-1502-1687590506',1502,17,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7413,4200,7240,44,'Open','24',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Stevan.\r\nJust some tips to help in future entries\r\n* Reminder to enunciation words\r\n* You can add facial expressions to give more dramatic variety\r\nIf you happen to have a stand or pulpit  you could use it to help free up both hands to be used for more dramatic effect.\r\nLooking forward to see what God will continue to do through you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-24 17:08:26','2023-06-24 17:08:26'),(153,'judge-event-evaluation-533-16875912