ects to make them stand out more or use texture to help.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 08:37:24','2023-06-26 08:37:24'),(226,'judge-event-evaluation-629-1687732825',629,3,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,6969,1678,7467,11,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,NULL,NULL,'Great subject but perhaps use a bit more colour especially in the garden. Also complete the face to make it look more human. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 08:40:25','2023-06-26 08:40:25'),(227,'judge-event-evaluation-498-1687732975',498,15,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7043,4679,7467,11,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Invokes the emotion of joy peace and happiness. Great use of texture. Lacks a bit in the subject perhaps use someone on the swing to tell your story.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 08:42:55','2023-06-26 08:42:55'),(228,'judge-event-evaluation-826-1687733101',826,25,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7360,5804,7467,11,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,NULL,NULL,'Beautiful colour usage. Could add a bit more texture and rendering to make it look a bit more 3d.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 08:45:01','2023-06-26 08:45:01'),(229,'judge-event-evaluation-920-1687733274',920,32,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7334,5826,7467,11,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Great use of colour and layers to help with perspective. Could use a bit darker shading in your water to make the waterfall stand out. Perhaps move your waterfall bit off