udge-event-evaluation-816-1687737764',816,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7347,5804,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Jamesa, It\'s great to see you taking part in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.  Your drawing is confidently done and it\'s nice to see the texture of the fur of the giraffe.  \r\n\r\nThe main issue that you could have done to improve your mark is to show the shadows and highlights on the animal.  When you add shading (using pen, this will be done using stippling, hatching and similar techniques), that will really bring your animal alive, making it look three dimensional.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:02:44','2023-06-26 10:02:44'),(234,'judge-event-evaluation-604-1687738164',604,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7355,5804,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Japheth, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour drawing is confidently done with good detail.  I like the way you have focussed in on the head of the giraffe to provide more information about the animal\'s portrait.  You have made some effort to provide a sense of the texture of the fur with shadows and highlights, though it\'s not exactly clear from which direction the light is coming (see the judging points above).\r\n\r\nA highlight and more detail in the eyes would bring the giraffe to life on the page.\r\n\r\nWell done.  Make sure you use your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:09:24','2023-06-26 10:09:24'),(235,'judge-event-evaluation-602-1687738621',602,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7354,5804,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,52.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Levani, It\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nIt\'s great to see that you drew something from life (not a picture that you copied).  That will provide you with more ability to draw than if you copied someone else\'s drawing.  \r\n\r\nWhile you have some perspective in your drawing - the spine and front of the Bible - you have drawn the two parts as if laid flat, not angled against each other.  The perspective is therefore not clearly defined.  You have also not used more than one type of line - just an outline.  You also need to add some shading to create a sense of three-dimensionality.   If you do these things, you will greatly increase your mark next year.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:17:01','2023-06-26 10:17:01'),(236,'judge-event-evaluation-490-1687739206',490,15,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7049,4679,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Liora, its great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour visual art report is a bit confusing as you seem to have described using watercolours to produce a coloured painting rather than an ink and pen piece as has been appropriately submitted to this section.  I am assuming that you may have progressed your pen and ink to include colour for another category?  Make sure you provide the correct details for the correct category.\r\n\r\nYour picture is very interesting and I am pleased that you have used different line weights and have some shading in a few areas of shadow.\r\n\r\nIn general, when drawing in pen and ink, the heaviest (darkest) lines should be in the foreground, with progressively lighter lines towards the distance to provide a sense of perspective.  Shading in the foreground should also be much darker than that in the background.  You have done this to some extent in your drawing.  Did you use a real scene or pictures to draw from?  If so, it would be helpful to know for me as a judge.  Drawing from something real (rather than a photograph) will provide much more information to draw from and a photograph will provide more information than your imagination unless you have had a lot of practice.\r\n\r\nWell done.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:26:46','2023-06-26 10:26:46'),(237,'judge-event-evaluation-557-1687739600',557,3,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,6983,1678,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Great atmosphere and colour. Photo is a bit low resolution. Focus area should be more in focus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:33:20','2023-06-26 10:33:20'),(238,'judge-event-evaluation-412-1687739727',412,7,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7163,6785,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Great composition. With enhancements you could darken the background a bit so your subject is more prominent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:35:27','2023-06-29 09:27:42'),(239,'judge-event-evaluation-453-1687739982',453,17,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7390,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Marevie, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, your visual art report has not been submitted, so you have lost all the marks for that area.\r\n\r\nI really like your abstract style picture.  It reminds me of the work of Vincent Van Gogh.  However, for convention, a significant part of the marking is the use of tones (light and dark ranges) to provide a sense of form (the shape of an object) and the way the light would fall on the object.  The clouds give a great sense of form, although the linework could have been finer for such light objects.  The texture on the cactuses is visually interesting but doesn\'t give a sense of the curve of the plants.  \r\n\r\nI appreciate the density of the ground plane, which gives a sense of appropriate weight to that area.\r\n\r\nWork on using the density of your linework to express the lightness or darkness of an area to create a sense of perspective in your drawing.  That and using the direction of your linework to express form will mean your mark will be much higher next year.\r\n\r\nWell done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:39:42','2023-06-26 10:39:42'),(240,'judge-event-evaluation-777-1687740406',777,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7045,4679,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Great use of colour. Photo may need more focus on the subjects and less on the background.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:46:46','2023-06-26 10:46:46'),(241,'judge-event-evaluation-832-1687740419',832,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7360,5804,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sailosi, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nThe pencil you have drawn is a fairly simple subject.  I was pleased to see the texture on the wooden section exposed by sharpening.  Your drawing could have been more interesting had you shown the whole pencil with a strong light coming on it from an angle.  The shadow you have drawn is directly under the object but you have shown no shading on the actual pencil.  If the light was from above, there should have been a shadow on the under surface of the pencil, showing the roundness of the shaft.  \r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:46:59','2023-06-26 10:46:59'),(242,'judge-event-evaluation-571-1687740601',571,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7053,4679,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Love the subject. You may be able to enhance your colour a bit and saturate the ice cream a bit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:50:01','2023-06-26 10:50:01'),(243,'judge-event-evaluation-560-1687740796',560,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7040,4679,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'I can almost taste it. You could enhance your foreground by lightening the photo a bit so your perspective is a bit better. I would also look at the composition and perhaps have less background.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:53:16','2023-06-26 10:53:16'),(244,'judge-event-evaluation-552-1687740955',552,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7041,4679,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Very nice atmosphere and colours. Perhaps enhance your photo slightly so your black is darker.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 10:55:55','2023-06-26 10:55:55'),(245,'judge-event-evaluation-1208-1687741110',1208,13,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,717