ve a clear focal point.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:33:35','2023-06-26 11:33:35'),(264,'judge-event-evaluation-1509-1687743334',1509,17,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7393,4200,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Great use of shadow and the outlines are nice and crisp. Beautiful colour. Wow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:35:34','2023-06-26 11:35:34'),(265,'judge-event-evaluation-1054-1687743429',1054,28,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7258,5806,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Nice photo. Bit too out of focus so there is no clear point of view. Perhaps pic a spot to focus on next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:37:09','2023-06-26 11:37:09'),(266,'judge-event-evaluation-980-1687743468',980,10,1,5,1,2023,181,'462',NULL,7281,1467,7460,12,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your wonderful submission, Kerenhapukh! This poster serves its purpose very well - it\'s eye-catching, delivers its message concisely and is very artistic. The contrast between the colours of the image and the font blends very beautifully. The size of the text, as well as the font itself, are most ideal and really bring out the message of the poster.\r\n\r\nBecause there aren\'t any credits given to any sources, I assume the photo is your own work; however, it would have been appreciated if such was acknowledged for the sake of clarity. This is a beautiful poster! You\'ve done a brilliant job. I\'m excited for you as you continue to honour God with your creativity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:37:48','2023-06-26 11:37:48'),(267,'judge-event-evaluation-630-1687743531',630,8,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7073,6328,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely moody photo. When you use enhancements next time get some blur on the cars. Great colour but could use a bit more colour contrast.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:38:51','2023-06-26 11:38:51'),(268,'judge-event-evaluation-989-1687743629',989,21,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7113,5805,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Nice use of colour and interesting perspective. Composition could be enhanced by using the shell on the left a bit more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:40:29','2023-06-26 11:40:29'),(269,'judge-event-evaluation-996-1687743730',996,21,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7115,5805,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Great use of colour and texture. I like the slightly tilted perspective, perhaps tilt it a bit more to make it obvious.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:42:10','2023-06-26 11:42:10'),(270,'judge-event-evaluation-1104-1687743837',1104,13,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7194,4208,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Love the colour and a nice straight horizon line.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:43:57','2023-06-26 11:43:57'),(271,'judge-event-evaluation-647-1687743949',647,3,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,6970,1678,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Nice colour usage, make sure you have a clear focus of your subject, tilt your perspective slightly to make it more interesting as the building is beautiful subject.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:45:49','2023-06-26 11:45:49'),(272,'judge-event-evaluation-984-1687744058',984,21,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7124,5805,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Nice point of view but when you tilt the horizon make sure its intentional and clearly defined.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:47:38','2023-06-26 11:47:38'),(273,'judge-event-evaluation-361-1687744093',361,19,1,5,1,2023,181,'462',NULL,7326,4451,7460,12,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your wonderful poster, Christopher! The concept behind your artwork is beautiful - the Scripture verse matches perfectly with the image as it depicts a sense of peace that coincides with the verse. The placement of your text is also very agreeable; however, it may have been better to use a bolder font and increase the size of the text. \r\n\r\nI encourage you to challenge your creativity to see how you can most effectively bring out the message of your artwork that God has inspired you to deliver in your own unique, God-gifted way. \r\nYou did a fantastic job! I\'m excited for you as you continue to use your talent of creativity to honour God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:48:13','2023-06-26 11:48:13'),(274,'judge-event-evaluation-702-1687744215',702,17,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7424,4200,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Nice use of colour and texture, just make sure there is a bit more perspective in the photo. When photographing landscapes it sometimes help if you turn your camera landscape to have more of a point of view.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:50:15','2023-06-26 11:50:15'),(275,'judge-event-evaluation-1055-1687744289',1055,28,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7278,5806,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful perspective. Great colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:51:29','2023-06-26 11:51:29'),(276,'judge-event-evaluation-869-1687744357',869,3,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,6968,1678,7467,2,NULL,NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo perhaps enhance your colours a bit more to make it more interesting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:52:37','2023-06-26 11:52:37'),(277,'judge-event-evaluation-197-1687744367',197,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7174,4208,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed reading your report, Aliyah.  I particularly liked the way you have included your opinion of the book and the reasons why you liked it.  Also, well done for writing about the Biblical principles that can be learned.  Remember to check your work for errors. Reading your report out loud to yourself might help you to find mistakes.  Keep reading and learning more about the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 11:52:47','2023-06-26 11:52:47'),(280,'judge-event-evaluation-557-1687744805',557,3,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,6983,1678,6990,2,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Benaya,\r\n\r\nIt\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you. \r\n\r\nI\'m glad that the sunset scene made you think of God\'s word.  I believe that this photograph fits better in a landscape category, even though you are thinking partially of the tower.  The category \"General\" is for: \"a photo of objects, food, toys, and other general goods\".\r\n\r\nThe focus is a little blurry since you have used an iphone.  Low light scenes also really need a tripod to stabilise the camera since our hands move slightly.\r\n\r\nMay you always be reminded of God\'s love and care for His people in the things around you.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 12:00:05','2023-06-26 12:00:05'),(281,'judge-event-evaluation-282-1687745023',282,10,1,5,1,2023,181,'462',NULL,6988,1467,7460,12,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your lovely submission, Lael. It\'s such an interesting piece! The poster has really great quality. The colours blend together nicely - you\'ve chosen the colours well! What is especially fascinating is the process of making this poster. It is evident that you had a very clear vision for it and executed it as best as you could, and you did a beautiful job! \r\n\r\nUsing a bolder font for the Scripture verse reference would have been ideal, so as to give it the emphasis needed to draw viewers to the verse. \r\nThis is an awesome piece of artwork! I\'m excited for you as you continue to honour God with your creativity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 12:03:43','2023-06-26 12:03:43'),(284,'judge-event-evaluation-802-1687746549',802,32,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7333,5826,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I really enjoyed reading your report, Leilani.  You have included your opinions, used examples and described the Biblical principles that your learned.  Well done.  I hope you keep reading and learning more about the Lord as you progress in your pilgrimage on this earth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 12:29:09','2023-06-26 12:29:09'),(285,'judge-event-evaluation-1367-1687748461',1367,25,1,5,1,2023,283,'901','1',0,5804,7460,39,'Collection',NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your dramatic dialogue, Juzdaiiy and Toroangtoka! This script that the two of you have chosen has a really interesting story - good job to the both of you for the great pick! It\'s one of those stories that make you pause and reflect.\r\n\r\nYou both did a wonderful with memorising and for the most part your voice inflections really matched with your lines. However, it did not translate so much in your movement - both gestures and facial expressions. I encourage you both to put yourselves in the story you\'re telling - imagine that it is you in this story and not your character. In that way, you\'ll be inspired to act as though you are really experiencing the story for yourselves. \r\n\r\nIt is clear that you both are immensely talented and with each Convention you participate in, you\'ll gain more confidence and insight, and you\'ll learn to pull your audience into the story with you and deliver the message that God has inspired you with. I am excited to see what God has ahead of both you with the talents He has entrusted you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 13:01:01','2023-06-26 13:01:01'),(287,'judge-event-evaluation-898-1687749924',898,28,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7278,5806,7451,45,'Open','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Victoria, \r\nThank you for your performance. I like your script and performance. However, you will perform better if you delivery it slowly and add more facial expressions. Great job! See you in the next student convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 13:25:24','2023-06-26 13:25:24'),(288,'judge-event-evaluation-1545-1687750060',1545,20,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7093,394,7451,45,'Open','25',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Trisha,\r\nThank you for your performance. I like your original script and performance. First thing is about the mask that you\'re wearing. The mask is covering your facial expression, and that costs you points. Also, you will perform better if you add body gestures and memorize the script properly before recording the video. Great job! See you in the next student convention.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 13:27:40','2023-06-26 13:27:40'),(289,'judge-event-evaluation-1370-1687750550',1370,25,1,5,1,2023,283,'901','2',0,5804,7460,39,'Collection',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this dramatic dialogue! It\'s such a funny script and you both delivered the comedic aspect of it quite well. It also deals with the topic of salvation in a really creative way. Well done to the both of you on choosing a great script!\r\n\r\nYour memorisation of the script as well as your voice projections and inflections were great for the most part! However, your facial expressions and body movements/gestures did not always match your delivery. You both can improve this by really getting yourselves involved in the story. You both work very well together - the way your characters interacted was brilliantly done. You both did a very good job! I hope to see more platform events from the both of you in the future. I am excited for you both as you continue to use your talents to glorify God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 13:35:50','2023-06-26 13:35:50'),(295,'judge-event-evaluation-1142-1687752394',1142,21,1,5,1,2023,283,'901','1',0,5805,7460,39,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your excellent dramatic dialogue, Galilee and Jordan! This was a funny script with a really fun approach to sincerity. It definitely has a worthwhile message. Good job to the both of you for choosing an awesome script as your dialogue.\r\n\r\nThe costumes were great! Your costume choices really placed the two of you in the story and helped bring the story to life. Your voice projections and inflections were brilliantly delivered, and you really matched them with your body movements/gestures and facial expressions. The way your characters interacted with each other was also great. The timing of line delivery was seamless, making the story feel like a genuine experience.\r\n\r\nOne minor point I would like to make, however, is to pay attention to your approach and departure - more the latter than the former in this case. Finish off your performance with a smile. Otherwise, you both did an incredible job! I am excited for you both as you continue to use your talents to honour and glorify God!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:06:34','2023-06-26 14:06:34'),(300,'judge-event-evaluation-625-1687754069',625,15,1,5,1,2023,224,'706',NULL,7040,4679,7239,23,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your ministry, Marvella.....just a couple of reminders......\r\n1. With the accompanying paperwork for tambourine, the actual tambourine movements \r\n     eg. trills, criss-cross, side-step tap; overhead circle are supposed to be written above the \r\n     words, so the judge\'s can check that the choreography is being followed (the tambourine \r\n     movement names can be found on tambourine videos on Youtube).\r\n2. It\'s good to choose movements that match words in the song eg. if the words are talking \r\n     about something overhead in the sky, then choose a tambourine movement that involves \r\n     something overhead...in that way, those watching will receive the message from the song \r\n     lyrics through your tambourine movements.\r\n3. Entry and Exit are important parts of a Convention presentation. If you have someone looking\r\n     after the starting and stopping of the video, you can then walk on and off nicely.\r\n\r\nI\'ll look forward to seeing you develop your Tambourine ministry more for next year\'s Convention, Marvella...be blessed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:34:29','2023-06-26 14:34:29'),(303,'judge-event-evaluation-667-1687754546',667,19,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7331,4451,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Your voice is beautiful! But you should give more eye contact to the audience (camera lens) and make sure you have mastered the lyrics properly, so we could see you\'re truly ready to sing the song as well. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:42:26','2023-06-26 14:42:26'),(304,'judge-event-evaluation-1272-1687754563',1272,28,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7266,5806,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Kindly please show face expression and gestures while you\'re singing and be more confident.\r\nThank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:42:43','2023-06-26 14:42:43'),(305,'judge-event-evaluation-485-1687754589',485,3,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,6980,1678,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'You should sing the song more confidently and more practices in balancing the tone, training your breathing technique and intonation as well. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:43:09','2023-06-26 14:43:09'),(306,'judge-event-evaluation-1445-1687754619',1445,25,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7357,5804,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a beautiful voice! \r\nI think your performance will be more can be felt if you are with musical accompaniment as well.\r\nThank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:43:39','2023-06-26 14:43:39'),(307,'judge-event-evaluation-1253-1687754644',1253,11,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7025,613,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'You have such wonderful voice! I hope for the next time you might be singing a more challanging song so you coould be showing that you\'re having a good tone quality and intonation as well. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:44:04','2023-06-26 14:44:04'),(308,'judge-event-evaluation-481-1687754668',481,15,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7047,4679,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a powerful and firm voice!\r\nBut kindly please have more practices optimally and regularly in the next day, and use musical accompaniment to avoid a false tone and have pitch control as well, so you can give your best performance to show and well-prepared. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:44:28','2023-06-26 14:44:28'),(309,'judge-event-evaluation-1206-1687754685',1206,21,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7155,5805,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'You have such beautiful voice and good pitch control! And thank you for delivering the \'message\' to us, we do appreciate it! For the next performance, kindly please choose the key that suits your tone of voice so it wouldn\'t be heard too low. Thank you! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:44:45','2023-06-26 14:44:45'),(313,'judge-event-evaluation-1491-1687754891',1491,21,1,5,1,2023,307,'951','2',0,5805,7460,39,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this dramatic dialogue, Ronald and Christian! This was a really fun script and the both of you did such an awesome job at delivering the humour. Well done to the both of you for choosing a great script! \r\n\r\nThe costumes were great and really fit the overall theme of your script. The timing of line delivery between the two of you was impeccable and really added to the humour. Your voice projections and inflections were also incredible, and they went so well with your body movements/gestures and facial expressions. \r\n\r\nYou both are so talented, and I pray you continue using your talents to honour God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:48:11','2023-06-26 14:48:11'),(321,'judge-event-evaluation-1191-1687755142',1191,46,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7442,4504,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'You have such soft and melodious voice! Keep improving your singing skill. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 14:52:22','2023-06-26 14:52:22'),(343,'judge-event-evaluation-709-1687756783',709,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7408,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'You have created an amazing piece of art Yugyeong ! Great use of shading and cross hatch techniques.\r\nKeep it up ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:19:43','2023-06-26 15:19:43'),(346,'judge-event-evaluation-798-1687756903',798,3,1,5,1,2023,232,'714','1',0,1678,7239,26,'Collection','21',100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Thank-you, girls for your presentation.....just a couple of things to work on for next year:\r\n1. In the paperwork, the actual tambourine movements are supposed to be written above the words to the song, so \r\n    that the judge can follow the choreography eg. trill right to left; overhead circle; criss-cross; toss etc.(you can\r\n    find the correct names on tambourine videos on Youtube).\r\n2. Remember to smile in your presentation so that your face matches the mood and lyrics of the song.\r\n3. The timing involved in tossing the tambourine in the air and/or exchanging to each other requires a lot of \r\n    practice and even more so, when you are two different heights as one will have to toss less than the other so the\r\n    tambourines land back in your hands at the same time.\r\n4. The final movement is the \'punchline\' of your presentation...in this case one tambourine was still while the other\r\n     one was being shaken, so lessened the impact of your ending (as we\'re doing Online Convention this year, you \r\n     could have overcome this by recording your video then watching the recording, seeing errors that needed \r\n     correcting then recording again. It might be tiring to make many video takes to get the final presentation you\'re\r\n     happy with, but it\'s worth it when you know judges will be watching a video they can forward and back-track to\r\n     check for errors).\r\nOnce again, thank-you for your ministry and keep practicing for next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:21:43','2023-06-26 15:21:43'),(349,'judge-event-evaluation-480-1687757697',480,15,1,5,1,2023,198,'510',NULL,7047,4679,7032,53,'Collection',NULL,100,65.00,-10,0.00,'This artwork is confidently expressed by showing the color tones balance and correct techniques are used in this art.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:34:57','2023-06-26 15:34:57'),(351,'judge-event-evaluation-201-1687757925',201,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7175,4208,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort, Maraia.  I like the way that you wrote about why you enjoyed reading the book and also the Biblical principles that you learned.  Remember to check over your work for errors.  It also would have helped to put your character descriptions as part of the introduction rather than towards the end of your report.  Keep reading and learning more about Jesus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:38:45','2023-06-26 15:38:45'),(352,'judge-event-evaluation-823-1687758131',823,25,1,5,1,2023,198,'510',NULL,7343,5804,7032,53,'Collection',NULL,100,57.00,-10,0.00,'This artwork is good because it use the correct techniques and the media is well integrated. The colour is good, but need a little more bold colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:42:11','2023-06-26 15:42:11'),(354,'judge-event-evaluation-631-1687758353',631,15,1,5,1,2023,232,'714','3',0,4679,7239,26,'Collection','22',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you girls, for your presentation....just a couple of reminders.....\r\n1. Above the accompanying song lyrics should be written the names of the tambourine movements , so that a \r\n    judge can follow your choreography eg. trill overhead, criss-cross etc. (these names can be found on \r\n    Tambourine videos on Youtube).\r\n2. Though you had different location changes, much of the tambourine movements were the same for all three \r\n    girls. Remember in a duet or trio there should be variations in movements at times then other times when you\'re \r\n    all doing the same movement in unison (just like in a vocal music trio presentation).\r\n3. I liked the choice of quite a lot of your actions to match the words to the song which meant the viewer received\r\n    the message from the song through your tambourine actions.\r\n4. For safety, just remember to wear shoes which will grip on a slippery, tiled floor, as sliding can affect the timing \r\n    of movements when you\'re working in a group.\r\n\r\nThank-you for your effort and we\'ll look forward to seeing you next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:45:53','2023-06-26 15:45:53'),(357,'judge-event-evaluation-860-1687759107',860,10,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7283,1467,7032,2,'Open','7',100,80.00,-10,0.00,'The photography is good in using lighting and exposure. It is a good composition and focus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 15:58:27','2023-06-26 15:58:27'),(360,'judge-event-evaluation-1430-1687759220',1430,21,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','1',0,5805,6995,1,'Open','3',100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Overall, it is good. \r\nThe photos are good. \r\nIt is understood that a written report is provided but It would be better if the display states why renewable energy is excellent (did you mean as it is compared with non renewable? but I think you meant why using different kinds of renewable energy is excellent) and how it can serve in large scale with some charts or graphs. Exhibit needs to illustrate the advantages and disadvantages of using different kinds of renewable energy (section II. A and B in the judges form). These must be shown on your display board as well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:00:20','2023-06-26 16:00:20'),(362,'judge-event-evaluation-1134-1687759353',1134,46,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7444,4504,7032,2,'Open','7',100,82.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph shows a good composition and expression of the human as the subject. The focus and the colour balance is good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:02:33','2023-06-26 16:02:33'),(363,'judge-event-evaluation-988-1687759676',988,21,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7121,5805,7032,2,'Open','7',100,75.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph shows originality of the smile of people. It shows good lighting and exposure, and a good focus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:07:56','2023-06-26 16:07:56'),(368,'judge-event-evaluation-1105-1687759973',1105,13,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7211,4208,7032,2,'Open','7',100,64.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph is not that focus, but the originality is good. The colour is balance and the lighting is balance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:12:53','2023-06-26 16:12:53'),(369,'judge-event-evaluation-637-1687760134',637,3,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,6967,1678,7032,2,'Open','7',100,72.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph is good because it is focus. But the exposure is to high so it is to light. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:15:34','2023-06-26 16:15:35'),(371,'judge-event-evaluation-202-1687760566',202,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7185,4208,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A good effort at writing a book report, Meli. A little more description of the main characters would enhance your introduction.  You could also leave out the first two sentences about the author\'s achievements as it is not really helpful in introducing the book which should be the main focus.  It was good that you ended your report with some important thoughts on what you learned.   I hope you keep reading Christian literature.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:22:46','2023-06-26 16:22:46'),(378,'judge-event-evaluation-1123-1687761353',1123,46,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7447,4504,7032,2,'Open','7',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph shows a good composition and focus. Even the lightning and exposure is balance, so it show a very good photopraph.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:35:53','2023-06-26 16:35:53'),(379,'judge-event-evaluation-632-1687761546',632,8,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7079,6328,7032,2,'Open','7',100,80.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph show a good lighting and exposure balance. It also shows a good focus in this result.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:39:06','2023-06-26 16:39:06'),(380,'judge-event-evaluation-1011-1687761671',1011,28,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7278,5806,7032,2,'Open','7',100,62.00,-10,0.00,'There is no report submitted. The composition is good, but the focus of this photograph is not good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:41:11','2023-06-26 16:41:12'),(383,'judge-event-evaluation-504-1687761992',504,3,1,5,1,2023,235,'750',NULL,6963,1678,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Johns, you did really well! I loved your accuracy of notes and your even tempo. My encouragement to you would be to take careful note of the dynamics. Even though this is Bach, and traditionally he played in a way that allows for few changes in louds and softs, this piece has them very clearly notated, and you can add a lot of emotion to the piece by changing up the dynamics in this way. I felt that you set the mf too loudly, and then your ff couldn\'t contrast enough. \r\nAside from this, very well done. Keep up the good work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:46:32','2023-06-26 16:46:32'),(384,'judge-event-evaluation-867-1687761992',867,3,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,6968,1678,7032,2,'Open','7',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph is good, from the composition, colour balance, lightning and exposure. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:46:32','2023-06-26 16:46:32'),(387,'judge-event-evaluation-1072-1687762624',1072,8,1,5,1,2023,187,'468','1',0,6328,7471,16,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 16:57:04','2023-07-04 11:02:14'),(389,'judge-event-evaluation-1536-1687762954',1536,17,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7429,4200,6995,50,'Open','24',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'I think part II.H, which is outline supplied, on this judges form is forgotten. \r\nI think you need at least one more major point before coming to lastly and or conclusion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:02:34','2023-06-26 17:02:34'),(392,'judge-event-evaluation-886-1687763105',886,8,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7077,6328,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,-8.00,'I enjoyed reading your account of Don Richardson\'s life, Michael.  You described the setting well.  Remember to read the Convention guidelines to see what you should include in your report as there are a few details missing. Make sure the title of the book you read and the author is obvious.  Also stay within the word limit; you have gone way over the limit for U16, so unfortunately I had to deduct points.  Keep reading about great men of God to encourage you in your life!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:05:05','2023-06-26 17:05:05'),(393,'judge-event-evaluation-198-1687763141',198,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7183,4208,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'A good effort, Aviella.  You have portrayed the main plot well.  To improve your score for next time, remember to include your opinion of the plot of the story not just simply retell it.  It is great that you have learned how to sail, but probably not the best way to conclude your book report.  Don\'t give up, keep reading and working hard like Robinson Crusoe!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:05:41','2023-06-29 11:56:35'),(394,'judge-event-evaluation-199-1687763156',199,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7192,4208,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Francoise, you have written a lovely report about Little One, describing her characteristics and the influence she had.  To improve your score for next time, it would be good to include the Biblical principles that you personally learned from Little One\'s life, character and attitudes.  Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:05:56','2023-06-26 17:05:56'),(396,'judge-event-evaluation-1248-1687763218',1248,28,1,5,1,2023,231,'713','2',0,5806,7471,25,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done boys! You played your instruments beautifully. \r\nThere were a few hiccups with timing and tempo, but more time playing and practicing will help you to get better at this. \r\nPS - it\'s ok to smile when you come on stage and when you finish your performance. When you\'re nervous, smiling can actually help to put both you and the audience at ease :)\r\nKeep on practicing - I look forward to seeing more from you in future. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:06:58','2023-06-26 17:06:58'),(397,'judge-event-evaluation-1432-1687763545',1432,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7193,4208,6995,50,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'-',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:12:25','2023-06-26 17:12:25'),(398,'judge-event-evaluation-1434-1687763546',1434,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7187,4208,6995,50,'Open','24',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'-',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:12:26','2023-06-26 17:12:26'),(399,'judge-event-evaluation-1435-1687763551',1435,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7195,4208,6995,50,'Open','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'-',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:12:31','2023-06-26 17:12:31'),(400,'judge-event-evaluation-1436-1687763888',1436,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7194,4208,6995,50,'Open','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'-',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:18:08','2023-06-26 17:18:08'),(401,'judge-event-evaluation-1242-1687764095',1242,28,1,5,1,2023,231,'713','1',0,5806,7471,25,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Well done girls! This was a beautifully played piece with a beautiful variety of instruments. \r\nThere were just a few areas where pitch was slightly missed, but all in all, wonderfully performed. \r\nKeep practicing and playing your instruments. Look forward to seeing more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:21:35','2023-06-26 17:21:35'),(402,'judge-event-evaluation-887-1687764289',887,8,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7078,6328,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Sounds like an interesting and thought provoking book.  Well done, on trying to unravel the mystery of the labyrinth and great to see you writing your personal thoughts.  It is a pity that you didn\'t finish off the last sentence of the introduction as it was going so well.  Keep reading and learning more about the Lord and how we can glorify Him in our lives.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:24:49','2023-06-26 17:24:50'),(403,'judge-event-evaluation-911-1687765799',911,8,1,5,1,2023,319,'964',NULL,7069,6328,6995,49,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'-',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 17:49:59','2023-06-26 17:49:59'),(404,'judge-ev