61','1',0,6328,7240,34,'Open','27',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Students.\r\nYou did an awesome job\r\nKeep it up and God looking forward to do\r\nthrough all your lives. God Bless\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 18:15:41','2023-06-26 18:15:41'),(431,'judge-event-evaluation-1300-1687768411',1300,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7412,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A good choice of subject.  You have produced a sketch that is sound and solid and you can be happy with.  You mainly used line and for this subject that worked very well.  It would be nice to see you in the future include a variety of techniques e.g stippling, cross hatching etc.  Documentation in the form of your report is an essential part of this process.  It gives the judges the ability to ascertain whether you have copied legally when you acknowledge the source.  When you document the steps it informs us of each stage you went through in making your art work.  From this we can gage some of the creative processes behind your art works.  You have lost points for Creativity and incomplete documentation as we do not know if what you have done is copied or your own work or someone else\'s work that has been enhanced by you or built on  You rendered your light, mid and dark areas well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 18:33:31','2023-06-26 18:33:31'),(432,'judge-event-evaluation-1229-1687768440',1229,28,1,5,1,2023,310,'954','3',0,5806,7373,41,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'The message is clear enough to get from the play. Need more emphasize in the voice quality and movement. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 18:34:00','2023-06-26 18:34:00'),(433,'judge-event-evaluation-1484-1687768671',1484,21,1,5,1,2023,307,'951','1',0,5805,7460,39,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this awesome performance, Maimoaga and Maurea! This was a moving script, and the way you portrayed your characters was incredible. You both have done a brilliant job in choosing your script and delivering your performance. Well done!\r\n\r\nThe voice inflections were awesome! They matched with your lines and your body movement/gestures as well as your facial expressions. You also did really well in interacting with each other. It was very impressive. Your performance really brought the message across. You both have done so well! I pray you both continue to use your talents to honour God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 18:37:51','2023-06-26 18:37:51'),(436,'judge-event-evaluation-529-1687769522',529,3,1,5,1,2023,214,'650',NULL,6965,1678,7032,19,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'He perform the self accompanied really well, in a proper diction and intonation. He even play the keyboard according to the music chord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 18:52:02','2023-06-26 18:52:02'),(438,'judge-event-evaluation-1218-1687769754',1218,10,1,5,1,2023,214,'650',NULL,7279,1467,7032,19,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'She perform the self accompanied solo really well, good tone quality and balance. She also good at playing guitar with her own style.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NUL