43,'Open','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'-',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:05:11','2023-06-26 19:05:11'),(453,'judge-event-evaluation-707-1687770318',707,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7389,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'I am glad you were satisfied with your effort and that you had the opportunity to draw still life from reality rather than copying someone else\'s work from a download or a book.  Your subject is very busy and there is a lot to look out.  My eyes tended to be drawn to the wine glass first and then as I looked wider I saw many more things.  You have attempted to put in your light and shadows.  Some areas of light are correct and some are not..  More emphasis on the shadow areas could have been carried out.  Really look at where and how your subject throws shadow or picks up light. Edges of glass catching light can be created by having line that is lighter, then not at all then comes into vision again.  Don\'t forget to sign your documentation and your work if they are origianlas where the subject matter is created by you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:05:18','2023-06-26 19:05:18'),(454,'judge-event-evaluation-574-1687770384',574,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6967,1678,7032,2,'Open','9',100,74.00,-10,0.00,'The photograph is good for using the natural light. The composition is good, but it lacks of creativity in this picture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:06:24','2023-06-26 19:06:24'),(455,'judge-event-evaluation-1228-1687770396',1228,28,1,5,1,2023,310,'954','1',0,5806,7373,41,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'The message is good. Need clear emphasize of the climax. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:06:36','2023-06-26 19:06:36'),(456,'judge-event-evaluation-646-1687770510',646,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6970,1678,7032,2,'Open','9',100,61.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph is lacks of creativity and composition. The lightning is good, but the focus is not clear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:08:30','2023-06-26 19:08:30'),(457,'judge-event-evaluation-868-1687770636',868,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6968,1678,7032,2,'Open','9',100,79.00,-10,0.00,'The photograph is good in lighting and exposure, but the focus is a bit unclear. But the angle and composition is good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:10:36','2023-06-26 19:10:37'),(458,'judge-event-evaluation-703-1687770848',703,17,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,7424,4200,7032,2,'Open','9',100,74.00,-10,0.00,'This photograph is good at using the natural light with the glasses. But the focus is not really clear, but the composition is good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:14:08','2023-06-26 19:14:08'),(459,'judge-event-evaluation-1046-1687771132',1046,28,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,7273,5806,7032,2,'Open','9',100,57.00,-10,0.00,'The photograph is not clear enough, and the angle taken was not good, colour balance with the lighting is a bit bad.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:18:52','2023-06-26 19:18:52'),(460,'judge-event-evaluation-1230-1687772353',1230,28,1,5,1,2023,307,'951','1',0,5806,7460,39,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this dramatic dialogue, Jedaiah and Sonya! You both delivered such strong performances. You chose a really fun script and managed to deliver the comedic aspect of it quite brilliantly.\r\n\r\nYou both interacted with each other so well, leading to an effortless performance. For the most part, you both really matched your body movements/gestures and facial expressions with the delivery of your lines which made it feel all the more authentic (you could almost feel Peter\'s frustration). The costumes and the prop were also great choices and were effective in pulling the audience into the story.\r\n\r\nIt\'s evident that the two of you have put a lot of work into your performances. This is a job well done! I am excited for you both as you continue to honour God with the use of your talents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:39:13','2023-06-26 19:39:13'),(461,'judge-event-evaluation-991-1687772908',991,21,1,5,1,2023,178,'456',NULL,7125,5805,7459,2,'Open','11',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Charliz! Thanks so much for submitting this. It can be daunting to try something new, but I am glad that you have stepped out of your comfort zone to do this. You have used the white sheet quite effectively to create a tidy backdrop for the main subjects of your photo. One tool that you could use to further enhance your photos would be framing your objects through the use of cropping. When cropping photos, you always want to have some space around your main object but the amount of space on each side is determined by the main object - good framing would have more space above and in front of the object than it would have below and behind. Something to consider for future photos that you take. Keep up the great work! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 19:48:28','2023-06-26 19:48:28'),(462,'judge-event-evaluation-790-1687773768',790,3,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,6969,1678,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,-2.00,'I enjoyed reading your report, Pauline.  You have put some of your own thoughts into this and have related the characters and symbolism well to our Christian pilgrimage on this earth.  Remember to proof read your work and avoid using coordinating conjunctions (and, but, or) at the start of a sentence.  You also need to state the word count (points had to be deducted for this).  Otherwise, well done and I hope you continue to read Christian literature and learn more about how to live as a Christian.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:02:48','2023-06-26 20:02:48'),(463,'judge-event-evaluation-69-1687774652',69,14,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7336,4328,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Stephanie.  You have followed the guidelines well and written an interesting character analysis.  You haven\'t just retold the story, but given a good description of the main characters and their roles. Adding some of the Biblical principles that you learned from reading this book would make your report more convincing and increase your marks.  Keep reading good Christian literature as you continue on your pilgrimage on this earth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:17:32','2023-06-26 20:17:32'),(464,'judge-event-evaluation-1205-1687775344',1205,13,1,5,1,2023,178,'456',NULL,7211,4208,7459,2,'Open','11',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Jiokapeci! Thank you for your submission. There are so many vibrant colours in it!\r\nOne of the unfortunate detractions of a photo of a food platter is that with so many things in the photo, it is hard to know what the main subject of the photo is. Another thing to consider is the framing of space around your photo\'s subject. \r\nPhotography is something that requires lots of experimenting, so I would encourage you to continue trying lots of different angles, framings, subjects, etc. to see what does and does not work for you. \r\nI hope to see more photos from you in the future. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:29:04','2023-06-26 20:29:04'),(465,'judge-event-evaluation-200-1687775781',200,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7180,4208,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed reading your report and I am glad that you were able to learn how important the Biblical principle of kindness is.  It would also be good to add your opinion and personal thoughts about the book. Keep reading and learning more about living as a Christian.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:36:21','2023-06-26 20:36:21'),(466,'judge-event-evaluation-789-1687775889',789,3,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,6976,1678,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,-2.00,'I enjoyed reading your report, Lukhercia.  I liked the way you were able to identify the symbolism in the book and relate it to our lives.  Also, it was great to see you adding your own thoughts and opinions.  To improve your mark for next time, make sure you read the guidelines for what is required in a book report.  It should include the author\'s name, setting, main characters etc.  Also, I had to subtract 2 points because you did not include a word count.  Otherwise, well done and I hope you continue reading and learning about the Lord as you continue in your pilgrimage on this earth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:38:09','2023-06-26 20:38:09'),(468,'judge-event-evaluation-1223-1687775916',1223,28,1,5,1,2023,310,'954','2',0,5806,7373,41,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Great job! Really enjoy the play...',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:38:36','2023-06-26 20:38:36'),(469,'judge-event-evaluation-576-1687776808',576,20,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7169,394,6991,8,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,-2.00,'A good effort, Oliver.  You started your book report with an informative introduction.  You have described the plot well.  To improve your mark for next time, talk about the Biblical principles that you learned from reading the book.  Also remember to write down the word count (that is why I had to deduct some points).  It was good that you wrote about your personal thoughts on the book and what you thought could be improved.  Keep reading and learning all you can about Jesus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:53:28','2023-06-26 20:53:28'),(470,'judge-event-evaluation-1207-1687777158',1207,13,1,5,1,2023,178,'456',NULL,7202,4208,7459,2,'Open','11',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Yimeng! Great job on this submission. I especially like how you have your main subject in the foreground and supporting subjects in the background in a way that enhances the main subject. The only two things I see that detract from the main subject is the sudden change in the bottom corners with the edge of what I think is the baking paper. I wonder if the colouring of the photo would be more distinct if the exposure was made longer to have a slightly darker image as it has come out quite bright! This could also be achieved through using editing enhancements.\r\nGreat work on this! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 20:59:18','2023-06-26 20:59:18'),(479,'judge-event-evaluation-1003-1687779743',1003,21,1,5,1,2023,144,'360',NULL,7135,5805,6991,54,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed viewing your digital scrapbook, Litia.  The colours that you chose for the backgrounds complement your photos well.  You also chose interesting and varied fonts and animations to suit the theme for each page.  The only problem is that the video stays too long on a couple of the pages and not long enough on other pages.  You should be able to adjust this.  It is important to be able to read the pages where you have written comments so these need to be viewed for a longer time.  Otherwise, well done, and I hope you have another go at digital scrapbooking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 21:42:23','2023-06-26 21:42:23'),(480,'judge-event-evaluation-785-1687779757',785,10,1,5,1,2023,144,'360',NULL,7279,1467,6991,54,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A great way to preserve your memories, Viola.  The cover page looks effective.  A little more colour on your second and third pages would complement your photos and add more interest.  Although, you don\'t have to complete more pages, next time you could take more photos and make your scrapbook a couple of pages longer or focus on a particular aspect and put less photos on a page.  Keep up the good work and most importantly glorify God in all that you do.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 21:42:37','2023-06-26 21:42:37'),(481,'judge-event-evaluation-987-1687782712',987,21,1,5,1,2023,176,'454',NULL,7121,5805,7480,2,'Open','12',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Great photo Emma! I especially love how you\'ve not only captured a great moment, but also you managed to keep so many of the performers in focus despite their obvious movements.\r\nThe smaller photo in the top left corner was a bit confusing for me. I wasn\'t sure if I was looking at a proof photo (which should be included separately) or a TV screen showing the perfomers. If you have something like this, maybe explain to the judges. Your conversion to monochromatic went well, but it also highlighted a couple of spots of over exposure.\r\nLooking forward to your next entry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 22:31:52','2023-06-26 22:31:52'),(482,'judge-event-evaluation-601-1687783660',601,8,1,5,1,2023,176,'454',NULL,7072,6328,7480,2,'Open','12',100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Javier! I love the way you tried to use people in the audience to frame your shot. I might have to try that later.\r\nA couple of things for next time. 1. If you\'re using a camera that can take different lenses, tell us which one you were using. Different lenses have different capabilities which affects the outcome of your photo. 2. Tell us about any enhancements you made. If you chose not to use any, tell us that too. Always check the judges forms when submitting an entry. It helps you to know what to write in your report. Be careful with LED walls. The pixel size can make your background appear blurry if you are close to the screen and it has larger pixels.\r\nLooking forward to your next entry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-26 22:47:40','2023-06-26 22:47:40'),(483,'judge-event-evaluation-508-1687788431',508,3,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,6972,1678,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a beautiful and gentle voice! But pay attention to the tone and intonation, you need to sing with all your heart so that those who listening to it can feel the message as well. Keep practicing everyday. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 00:07:11','2023-06-27 00:07:11'),(484,'judge-event-evaluation-1163-1687789415',1163,46,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7445,4504,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a soft and melodious voice! I was hoping that you would provide some improvisations to the tone so it doesn\'t sound monotonous. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 00:23:35','2023-06-27 00:23:35'),(486,'judge-event-evaluation-670-1687790333',670,8,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7083,6328,7033,33,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a beautiful and melodious voice! Although in the beginning I couldn\'t be able to hear your voice clearly, but when in the chorus and so on, it sounds distinctly. You need to practice continuously so that the quality of your singing gets better in the future. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 00:38:53','2023-06-27 00:38:53'),(488,'judge-event-evaluation-1153-1687791394',1153,46,1,5,1,2023,274,'857','1',0,4504,7033,33,'Open','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Priscilla Tame and Miranda Benny Wells are registered in U/16 Female Solo, while this group is for OPEN Female Vocal Small Group. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 00:56:34','2023-06-27 00:56:34'),(489,'judge-event-evaluation-675-1687792299',675,8,1,5,1,2023,267,'850',NULL,7069,6328,7033,32,'Open','24',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a powerful voice, beautiful improvisations, and confidence. But you still need to pay attention to the tempo of the music, you might have to adjust the beat accordingly so your performance will be exquisite. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 01:11:39','2023-06-27 01:11:39'),(490,'judge-event-evaluation-494-1687792922',494,3,1,5,1,2023,267,'850',NULL,6963,1678,7033,32,'Open','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a beautiful voice, but sometimes (especially in the low tune) you might have to control the pitch to keep it steady. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 01:22:02','2023-06-27 01:22:03'),(491,'judge-event-evaluation-1273-1687793892',1273,28,1,5,1,2023,267,'850',NULL,7258,5806,7033,32,'Open','24',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a wonderful voice, confidence, and good pitch control. Keep improving your skill so you can come up with the next amazing performance! Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 01:38:12','2023-06-27 01:38:12'),(492,'judge-event-evaluation-531-1687794644',531,3,1,5,1,2023,267,'850',NULL,6965,1678,7033,32,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'You have such a wonderful voice, but the breath should be longer and you need to relax more while you\'re singing the song, and keep the tempo consistent with the music as well. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 01:50:44','2023-06-27 01:50:44'),(494,'judge-event-evaluation-492-1687796686',492,3,1,5,1,2023,257,'803','1',0,1678,7033,33,'Collection','24,23',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'You all have a good voice, but it will sound better if there are dynamic and intonation as well as the tone diversity (first, second, or third voice) and keeping the tempo consistent with the music as well. Please practice a lot so your singing skills get better in the future. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 02:24:46','2023-06-27 02:24:46'),(495,'judge-event-evaluation-474-1687796739',474,3,1,5,1,2023,257,'803','2',0,1678,7033,33,'Collection','24,23',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'You all have a good voice, but it will sound better if there are dynamic and intonation as well as the tone diversity (first, second, or third voice). Please practice a lot so your singing skills get better in the future. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 02:25:39','2023-06-27 02:25:39'),(496,'judge-event-evaluation-1003-1687819513',1003,21,1,5,1,2023,144,'360',NULL,7135,5805,7467,54,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Love the digital format. Just make sure the timing of your slides as some are fast to view and some are taking a very long time to finish.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 08:45:13','2023-06-27 08:45:13'),(497,'judge-event-evaluation-785-1687819567',785,10,1,5,1,2023,144,'360',NULL,7279,1467,7467,54,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely using your own handwriting throughout the scrapbook. Love it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 08:46:07','2023-06-27 08:46:07'),(498,'judge-event-evaluation-1001-1687821907',1001,20,1,5,1,2023,197,'509',NULL,7090,394,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'I love the mice! So creative. The colours are stunning.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 09:25:07','2023-06-27 09:25:07'),(499,'judge-event-evaluation-818-1687822085',818,25,1,5,1,2023,197,'509',NULL,7346,5804,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Nice pictures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 09:28:05','2023-06-27 09:28:05'),(500,'judge-event-evaluation-373-1687822260',373,19,1,5,1,2023,197,'509',NULL,7328,4451,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Great colour usage. Just make sure your text is readable perhaps by adding a white background in the speech bubbles.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 09:31:00','2023-06-27 09:31:00'),(502,'judge-event-evaluation-1043-1687822662',1043,28,1,5,1,2023,177,'455',NULL,7272,5806,6,2,'Open','13',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well created Macro shot. Great lighting, and use of materials. Keep up the great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 09:37:42','2023-06-27 09:37:42'),(509,'judge-event-evaluation-1225-1687826068',1225,28,1,5,1,2023,345,'1058','1',0,5806,6,51,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done well done well done Christian Outreach College. This brings back so much memories. Just a few things to help improve in the near future. Appearance, Body Language and Movements for one of your students. Other than it was well memorized, choreographed and presented. Looking forward for future awesome Group Bible Speaking entries.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 10:34:28','2023-06-27 10:34:29'),(518,'judge-event-evaluation-1255-1687827430',1255,28,1,5,1,2023,248,'774','1',0,5806,6,26,'Open','21',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Vani and Salome. Just a few things to add. Timing and Memorization of parts. Other than that, well done and I look forward for future entries. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 10:57:10','2023-06-27 10:57:10'),(523,'judge-event-evaluation-901-1687832010',901,8,1,5,1,2023,235,'750',NULL,7081,6328,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Owen,\r\nI really liked your interpretation of this piece! You added some spice and jazz to it, which isn\'t indicated in the sheet music, so I like that you have been able to perform it how you think it should sound. That shows musicianship! \r\nYou obviously have a good feel for music, so your next things to work on will be 1. POSTURE (Your chair is too high for you), 2. Finger curve, 3. Dynamics. 4. Maintaining an even tempo and flow in the music.\r\nGreat work, keep it up! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 12:13:30','2023-06-27 12:13:30'),(526,'judge-event-evaluation-752-1687833367',752,20,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7105,394,7239,6,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on a heartfelt, poem that inspires the reader in their faith walk, Kaitlyn.\r\nJust a small suggestion:\r\nI would put your name and school details in the centre of a cover page of their own and the poem on a second page or vice versa, so that we can see the poem on one page in its entirety (for aesthetic purposes).\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 12:36:07','2023-06-27 12:36:07'),(527,'judge-event-evaluation-1073-1687833563',1073,21,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7118,5805,7239,6,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Maimoaga, for your heartfelt poem. Just a couple of things to help:\r\n1. You have used punctuation in some stanzas but not in others...use of commas, semi-colons and periods would \r\n     help with the phrasing in the poem and help the reader know where to take a breath.\r\n2. When referring to God and His names, they should always be capitalized eg. Most High; His\r\n3. Always make the title of the poem stand out (underlined and in a larger font, with a space between the title and \r\n     the first line of the poem. The poem will then be centred better (comparing the space at the top of the page v. \r\n     the space at the bottom of the page...for aesthetic/lay-out purposes)\r\n\r\nKeep writing for Him...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 12:39:23','2023-06-27 12:39:23'),(529,'judge-event-evaluation-530-1687836135',530,3,1,5,1,2023,235,'750',NULL,6965,1678,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'That was lovely, Vinsent! \r\nYou submitted the music for the hymn chords, but you played what seemed like your own arrangement. That shows great skill in improvisation, memorisation, and it also displays your musical ear and creativity! That sort of skill will give you endless pleasure as you arrange any song you hear in any way you like. If you know how to write music, I recommend you submit your arrangement as a separate event next year. If you don\'t know how to write music, you can find someone to correctly notate what you play. Music arrangement is its own event, and it seems it would suit you well. \r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 13:22:15','2023-06-27 13:22:15'),(532,'judge-event-evaluation-897-1687836749',897,8,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7062,6328,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Aaron, that was lovely! \r\nBe careful of your heavy left hand, as you don\'t want it to overpower the melody in the right hand. Keep you little fingers strong and curved (not flat).\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 13:32:29','2023-06-27 13:32:29'),(540,'judge-event-evaluation-286-1687838558',286,12,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,6993,1132,7061,55,'Collection',NULL,50,44.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:02:38','2023-06-27 14:02:38'),(542,'judge-event-evaluation-1368-1687838668',1368,13,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7183,4208,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Aviella, that was lovely.\r\nYou weren\'t very happy with the ending, were you? Try not to show that when you\'re performing, finish strong!\r\nThis piece is all about the right-hand melody, so keep that left hand soft and gentle. Don\'t hold down the sustainer pedal, as this muddles the notes and sounds distracting.\r\nYou have good memory, and you play very sweetly. Keep it up! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:04:28','2023-06-27 14:04:28'),(543,'judge-event-evaluation-1145-1687838810',1145,21,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7156,5805,7239,6,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Richard for your interesting poem. Just a couple of suggestions....\r\n1. Be careful if using punctuation that it\'s correctly used. A semi-colon is an effective way of combining two \r\n     thoughts eg. in Stanza 3-Line 1 and Line 5... \'ten simple rules;\' and \'manipulate each other;\'\r\n     A period should complete a sentence....in Stanza 2-Line 6... \'our greatest downfall.\'\r\n2. Make sure that tense is consistent....in Stanza 2-Line 3...\'build\' instead of \'built\'.\r\n3. When talking about God, always use capital letters...in Stanza 4-Line 1...\'His heart\'\r\n\r\nKeep writing for him...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:06:50','2023-06-27 14:06:50'),(547,'judge-event-evaluation-267-1687839255',267,8,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,7077,6328,7061,55,'Collection',NULL,50,45.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:14:15','2023-06-27 14:14:15'),(549,'judge-event-evaluation-436-1687839536',436,13,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,7176,4208,7061,55,NULL,NULL,50,33.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:18:56','2023-06-27 14:18:56'),(550,'judge-event-evaluation-268-1687839700',268,8,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,7078,6328,7061,55,NULL,NULL,50,48.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:21:40','2023-06-27 14:21:40'),(552,'judge-event-evaluation-300-1687839939',300,25,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,7358,5804,7061,55,'Collection',NULL,50,26.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:25:39','2023-06-27 14:25:39'),(553,'judge-event-evaluation-1241-1687840052',1241,28,1,5,1,2023,282,'900','2',0,5806,7373,38,'Collection','29',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Nice puppet show. Need improvement in moving naturally and when forget the script. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 14:27:32','2023-06-27 14:27:32'),(555,'jud