60634',452,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7401,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Very good light direction and I really like the picture behind with people on a park bench.  Did you copy anything or is this all your own construction.  You have tended towards cartooning the person rather than realist art.  Often in cartoons features like eyes can be exaggerated and nose lines extended or diminished.  Some facial features may be exaggerated or removed completely. It is hard to judge your work without knowing your source.  If it was something you totally created then you would get full marks for creativity but as I can not tell I can\'t give you full marks.  You have created good movement and flow in your lines using smudging and eraser removal techniques to create your light well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 20:10:34','2023-06-27 20:10:34'),(682,'judge-event-evaluation-532-1687860806',532,3,1,5,1,2023,312,'957',NULL,6965,1678,7240,43,'Open','24',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Vinsentius\r\nJust a few tips\r\nMake sure to proof read your script\r\nfor any spelling or grammatical errors\r\nBe sure to stick to the script, not adding or missing parts\r\nUse facial expressions to help enhance your entry\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things God\r\nwill do through you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 20:13:26','2023-06-27 20:13:26'),(684,'judge-event-evaluation-1238-1687861343',1238,28,1,5,1,2023,312,'957',NULL,7258,5806,7240,43,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Jed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 20:22:23','2023-06-27 20:22:23'),(685,'judge-event-evaluation-1240-1687862457',1240,28,1,5,1,2023,282,'900','1',0,5806,7373,38,'Collection','30',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Good story and improvisation. better to use the puppet maximally like use the both hands, try to face the audience as part of arouses audience response. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 20:40:57','2023-06-27 20:40:57'),(686,'judge-event-evaluation-1549-1687862459',1549,19,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7330,4451,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for doing such a thorough report and listing your influence for your picture as a painting by Jane Seabrook.  I was able to look her up and see the picture you had followed.  You have taken her kiwi and made it your own.  Your rendition is soft which is more reflective of Jane Seabrook\'s watercolour that she painted in.  Using HB and 2 B pencil would have kept this soft toning.  I do believe though that there is room for development and using perhaps a 4B pencil to accentuate the shading under the kiwi and in the eggs and even perhaps the occasional feathers in the kiwi could enhance your sketch.  The contrast of the flat white surface against that of the fluffy kiwi figures was a nice contrast.  Your pebbles are a bit too uniform and could be developed a lot more.  You have completed the eye well. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 20:40:59','2023-06-27 20:40:59'),(687,'judge-event-evaluation-445-1687862645',445,17,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7420,4200,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'No Report Form',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU