ed a good argument for its importance. I particularly was impressed by the structure of the essay. You started broad with the opening paragraph and ended with a really strong affirmative statement using a great Bible verse. Using Solomon as an example is also a really good choice. \r\n\r\nSome points for next time. Reading your essay out loud to a friend or family member allows you to pick up if it flows smoothly and if the sentence structure makes sense. You missed including the bibliography and references, but otherwise your formatting of the essay was very good. Just listing the dictionary edition and the Bible version with references in your bibliography would have helped. \r\n\r\nYou\'ve done well and I pray that God continues to bless you with your writing. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 21:47:09','2023-06-27 21:47:09'),(701,'judge-event-evaluation-735-1687866535',735,17,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7388,4200,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 21:48:55','2023-06-27 21:48:55'),(702,'judge-event-evaluation-651-1687866762',651,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6986,1678,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 21:52:42','2023-06-27 21:52:42'),(703,'judge-event-evaluation-596-1687866896',596,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7352,5804,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 21:54:56','2023-06-27 21:54:56'),(704,'judge-event-evaluation-908-1687868995',908,8,1,5,1,2023,236,'752',NULL,7071,6328,7471,3,'Open','15',100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! You chose a lovely piece and played it beautifully. \r\nKeep practicing your craft; look forward to seeing more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 22:29:55','2023-06-27 22:29:55'),(707,'judge-event-evaluation-1494-1687870627',1494,21,1,5,1,2023,218,'654','1',0,5805,7471,21,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! Great choice of songs and beautifully arranged. I particularly liked the smooth piano transition between the medley and second song.\r\nJust a note for future reference to be mindful of the correct paperwork that should be submitted with your entry (see Combined Ensemble Guidelines point 7).\r\nAll in all, you all played very well together and make a great band. Look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 22:57:07','2023-06-27 22:57:07'),(708,'judge-event-evaluation-864-1687870837',864,10,1,5,1,2023,19,'061',NULL,7279,1467,7478,5,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,-2.00,'I\'m impressed! You followed your topic carefully, you used good examples and you tackled the topic head on. I was home schooled all the way through year 12 and went to convention nearly every year of my life. \r\n\r\nI was particularly impressed by the fact that you had done a poll of students to ask whether they preferred home schooling or formal school. It would have been really useful if you had referenced that in the bibliography. It is possible to reference your own work even if it hasn\'t been published. You could also have put those Bible verses into the bibliography. The bibliography is worth a lot of points. Some other formatting things like using 10-12 point font and double spacing would also have helped. \r\n\r\nI pray that God would bless your writing and your home schooling.  (:',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 23:00:37','2023-06-27 23:00:37'),(709,'judge-event-evaluation-1451-1687871237',1451,13,1,5,1,2023,218,'654','3',0,4208,7471,21,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Well done to you all and great choice of songs/theme. \r\nJust a note…I would encourage you to be a bit more creative and experiment with different of transitioning between songs (eg. slightly adjust the style of playing, change the tempo, add some more instrumental-led portions, adding modulation (a key change). This allows the performance to sound fresh and engaging instead of sounding the same the whole way through. Also, remember that there should be a clear leader of the group when performing a combined ensemble (see Guidelines).\r\nAll in all, well done and look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 23:07:17','2023-06-27 23:07:17'),(713,'judge-event-evaluation-190-1687872590',190,13,1,5,1,2023,19,'061',NULL,7202,4208,7478,5,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'This is a beautifully written essay. You have chosen a good topic and built a strong argument around it. You have used good examples and produced ready solutions for the issues raised. \r\n\r\nYou have read the guidelines well and followed the formatting guidelines very well. The bibliography references are great and I\'m pleased to see strong references like government websites and peer reviewed studies. A couple of the other references are a bit weaker though. Websites like Solarimpulses.com are much weaker as they do not reveal their biases. \r\n\r\nI pray that God continues to bless your writing and your passion for this topic.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 23:29:50','2023-06-27 23:29:51'),(715,'judge-event-evaluation-896-1687873006',896,8,1,5,1,2023,251,'777','1',0,6328,7471,27,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! This was a beautifully arranged and performed piece. It’s obvious you all know your instruments well. Although the piano was the main lead of this piece, it would have been nice to give some of the other instruments an opportunity to add a bit more dynamics to the piece (eg, a guitar lick, just sitting on padded key chords for a bar or two). These are just suggestions to consider for future entries. \r\nAll in all, you did a marvellous job and i look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 23:36:46','2023-06-27 23:36:46'),(718,'judge-event-evaluation-504-1687873778',504,3,1,5,1,2023,235,'750',NULL,6963,1678,7471,22,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! You chose a renowned and slightly difficult piece, and performed it beautifully. Keep practicing your craft. There were a few instances where the tempo changed slightly, but all in all…very well done! \r\nLook forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 23:49:38','2023-06-27 23:49:38'),(719,'judge-event-evaluation-901-1687873940',901,8,1,5,1,2023,235,'750',NULL,7081,6328,7471,22,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! You chose an awesome and rather difficult piece, and performed it beautifully. There were a few instances where the tempo and phrasing sounded a bit jolted, but I enjoyed watching you also enjoy yourself while playing. \r\nKeep up the great work and practice. Look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-27 23:52:20','2023-06-27 23:52:20'),(720,'judge-event-evaluation-530-1687874424',530,3,1,5,1,2023,235,'750',NULL,6965,1678,7471,22,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! This was a wonderful piece and you played it beautifully. I love the modulation (key changes) and various changes in tempo and dynamics. I’m especially impressed that you memorised the whole thing! WOW!\r\nJust a note to please submit music that is arranged the way you intend to play (See Guidelines). \r\nAll in all, great job. Keep practicing and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:00:24','2023-06-28 00:00:24'),(721,'judge-event-evaluation-495-1687875020',495,3,1,5,1,2023,210,'600',NULL,6976,1678,7471,19,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done presenting a beautiful song - you have a beautiful voice and lovely tone. \r\nJust a note to be careful with diction when singing as it was hard to make out the words that were being sung at some points.\r\nAll in all, you did a great job. Keep practicing and singing; i look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:10:20','2023-06-28 00:10:20'),(723,'judge-event-evaluation-1162-1687876110',1162,46,1,5,1,2023,210,'600',NULL,7445,4504,7471,19,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Priscilla. You played and sang beautifully. \r\nThe key was quite high, but you did well to stay on pitch and in tune. It might be helpful next time to choose a key that’s a bit more comfortable and within your normal vocal range. This will give you more control and ability to sing with more power, volume and dynamics. \r\nAll in all, you did great. Keep practicing and singing and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:28:30','2023-06-28 00:28:30'),(726,'judge-event-evaluation-255-1687876572',255,8,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,7062,6328,7061,55,'Collection',NULL,50,39.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:36:12','2023-06-28 00:36:12'),(727,'judge-event-evaluation-328-1687876594',328,3,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,6978,1678,7061,55,'Collection',NULL,50,42.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:36:34','2023-06-28 00:36:34'),(728,'judge-event-evaluation-261-1687876616',261,28,1,5,1,2023,3,'003',NULL,7255,5806,7061,55,'Collection',NULL,50,49.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:36:56','2023-06-28 00:36:56'),(729,'judge-event-evaluation-1226-1687876