and playing; I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:51:48','2023-06-28 00:51:48'),(746,'judge-event-evaluation-1250-1687877518',1250,28,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7249,5806,7471,3,'Collection','18',100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Ebenezer! You played beautifully. \r\nGreat recorder playing technique and note accuracy. \r\nDon’t forget to smile occasionally when playing :)\r\nKeep practicing and playing; look forward to seeing more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:51:58','2023-06-28 00:51:58'),(747,'judge-event-evaluation-526-1687877526',526,11,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7026,613,7471,3,'Collection','18',100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! You chose a lovely piece and presented it beautifully. You did great to carry on playing and not show it on your face if you made a mistake. \r\nKeep on practicing and playing. Look forward to hearing more from you in future :) God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:52:06','2023-06-28 00:52:06'),(748,'judge-event-evaluation-1366-1687877861',1366,13,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7178,4208,7471,3,'Collection','16',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Tian! You chose a lovely piece and performed it beautifully. \r\nKeep on playing and practicing your instrument….I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 00:57:41','2023-06-28 00:57:41'),(749,'judge-event-evaluation-668-1687878233',668,19,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7331,4451,7471,3,'Collection','16',100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Chloe! You chose a great song and played it beautifully. \r\nThere were a few instances where the pitch and intonation were missed slightly, but you did great to carry on playing confidently. \r\nJust a note to be mindful of tempo and rests; if you choose not to play certain rests and emptier sections, don’t forget to note this on your music score :)\r\nAll in all, you did great and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 01:03:53','2023-06-28 01:03:53'),(758,'judge-event-evaluation-1303-1687889885',1303,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7417,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,59.00,-10,NULL,'You have started to use a few textural effects.  Your back ground needs to be worked on more.  It is good that you have used some strong lines and some light ones on the bird.  Remember to look closely at proportions when you are drawing, especially in regard to the eye.  Also, look closely at the perspective of the bird.  Do the tail feathers line up with the head, where is the wing placed exactly?  Ensure that you have your report filled out for your next convention with your source of inspiration listed in it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 04:18:05','2023-06-28 04:18:05'),(759,'judge-event-evaluation-206-1687891037',206,21,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7124,5805,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Ruth for your report!  This was completed well, with the steps that you used easy to follow.  Just remember next year to not list Pinterest as your source, go into the Pinterest link and find the actual source or artist and copy that link.  I too have sketched roses using charcoal.  You have done really well with yours and I liked the way you darkened your background and then used a blending stick to smooth it out.  Some more textures could have ben used perhaps to highlight any blemishes on the rose or to create a hint of a leaf in the background or to texture the stalk a bit - make the drawing your own, add your own footprint, use the picture you download as a guide.  Overall a very good entry worthy of praise. If you want to get even darker, in the future, you can use a fixative and then let it dry and over-layer again.   ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 04:37:17','2023-06-28 04:37:17'),(760,'judge-event-evaluation-205-1687892062',205,21,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7119,5805,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you very much for your Report and including it in a photo of the original inspiration.  Don\'t forget to copy the link into your report as I need to be able to be able to follow the link and check that copy right has not been breeched.  You have copied the picture well.  Your darks showing the shadows could have been darker  Sometimes people use a blending stick to blend in and give the picture an even tone or to blend, spray with a fixative and then layer on more carbon to get an area darker, especially in the backgrounds or areas of shadow.  This can help create more of a deep contrast between dark and light.  I would love to see you take a picture like this and make it your own, use the picture as a guide but let your creative juices flow too.  I know you have learned a lot in doing this picture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 04:54:22','2023-06-28 04:54:22'),(761,'judge-event-evaluation-440-1687892932',440,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7405,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'You have used your line very well and have varied your line throughout the sketch.  Your light comes from the right full onto the light house creating a definite shadow on the left of the light house but you also have light coming forward over the rocks and towards the light house.  I believe your rocks could be developed more with some cross hatching.  You have a comic book style and this would also go well in a coloring in book for someone else to color or the base sketch for a water color.  For convention do explore more techniques and textural techniques for applying your pencil  as your lines are strong and show a good ability. I believe this picture could be developed a lot more.   Remember to always submit your report with your sketch.  This tells the judges what your reference is.  It has in it your link to the site you used on internet and you can include a picture that you used as your inspiration.  A judge from this can then ensure that you have not breached copy right and can see and compare how creatively you have done your wok and how accurate you are with your line.  I look forward to your including a report with your work next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 05:08:52','2023-06-28 05:08:52'),(762,'judge-event-evaluation-430-1687893523',430,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7392,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Some confusion in direction of light.  Top of tree could have more light on it a nice shadow cast on the building and good light coming from the left hand corner and casting light on the left hand side and front of the building.   Your picture shows good perspective and you have paid attention to detail.  Well done.   Don\'t forget to include your report with a link to the source of your inspiration as well as a reference picture.  This gives the judge fuller information on how creative you have been and how accurate your drawing is. It also lets us check the copyright status.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 05:18:43','2023-06-28 05:18:43'),(763,'judge-event-evaluation-686-1687894843',686,3,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,6965,1678,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for submitting your Report.  You have filled it out the most accurately of anyone!  I liked the way that you have used a pace as your source and also looked up the internet to further enhance your knowledge of the subject.  Next time also include a picture or pictures that you used as your source of inspiration.  You have a created a very stern and striking picture with a good use of light and dark.  The neckline and shoulders could be developed a bit more so that your head does not appear to float in the middle of a page perhaps increase your drawing to fill the size of the paper used.  You have caught a sadness in the eyes which goes well with the thin lip line.   A blending stick will further enhance your artwork and you can use it to blend edges into each other especially contours of the face. Direction of light definitely full on the face but some light would have fallen onto the neckline and clothing.  You have learned a lot from this, keep up you sketching.  Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 05:40:43','2023-06-28 05:40:43'),(764,'judge-event-evaluation-709-1687895763',709,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7408,4200,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This is absolutely brilliant!  You have technique beyond measure.  Keep using this gifting God has given you.  You have used great techniques, you have used strong lines and multiple textural effects very well.  I also love the movement you have created!  This is inspirational art and you have brought this still life to life!  Well done.  The only thing is that you did submit a report but it was brief and not on the paper work form.  I would love you to explore a variety of pencils and also some blending tools if you can manage to get them.  You can also make your own blending tools.  Put the source of your inspiration so that we can check on the internet for copyright and also check the accuracy of your drawing and also your creativity.  Some people use someone\'s work as a source but do their own work and so become more creative.  If you can achieve this with a 4 B pencil and line and cross hatching imagine what you can do with more pencils and with other techniques like stippling etc.  I do encourage you to do the Art PACEs if you have not done them. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 05:56:03','2023-06-28 05:56:03'),(765,'judge-event-evaluation-1486-1687900313',1486,21,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7130,5805,7466,50,'Open','25',100,49.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Vinaka Donna, thank you for your effort. Firstly, you looked very neat and proper. Well done! Secondly, you were also very sincere in your delivery. However, in everything that we do, there is always room for improvement. The areas I believe that you could improve on are as follows: your deportment, your introduction, your delivery, and your message.\r\n\r\nDeportment: I understand that it can be nerve-wrecking to be in front of a camera or an audience. However, preaching the Word of God requires you to be bold and certain. Perhaps next time, you can try to avoid making facial expressions when you make mistakes, instead, continue as normal, and maintain eye contact with the audience. \r\n\r\nIntroduction: The purpose of introductions is to give us an overview of what we are to expect. Your introduction, however, only consisted of a quote. (Note: A reference of the author of your chosen quote would have been appropriate in your outline). In future, try to make your introduction encapsulate everything you will be talking about and how it correlates with your topic, in a concise manner. \r\n\r\nDelivery: Your delivery lacked confidence, enthusiasm, and persuasiveness. You are speaking from and standing on the Truth so you need to deliver your message as such. \r\n\r\nMessage: I believe that you only scratched the surface of the Scripture verses you chose. Galatians 6:9 is a verse that speaks on not losing heart and being patient because reaping harvests does not happen immediately after sowing seeds. James 4:17 speaks on the importance of walking the talk and not only talking the talk, as it is the common thread of the book of James (“Faith without deeds is dead.” James 2:26). Not losing heart, being patient, and walking the talk can all qualify as hard work. These are some points that I would have expected you to explore so that your message was coherent and more in-depth. \r\n\r\nMy advice for you would be to reflect on your own life and lessons that God has taught you and build on that; read Scriptures as a whole before you pick out verses to use so that you avoid using it out of context; and be more confident. I look forward to seeing God work through you!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 07:11:53','2023-06-28 07:11:53'),(766,'judge-event-evaluation-1058-1687903959',1058,28,1,5,1,2023,208,'559',NULL,7272,5806,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great drawings and use of colour. Try smoothing out your flat colours a bit more. Make sure your story flows cohesively and your lettering is easy to read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 08:12:39','2023-06-28 08:12:39'),(767,'judge-event-evaluation-671-1687904621',671,3,1,5,1,2023,208,'559',NULL,6965,1678,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful drawings and very detailed. Beautiful colours and very nicely laid out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 08:23:41','2023-06-28 08:23:41'),(769,'judge-event-evaluation-704-1687908608',704,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7413,4200,5,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Stevan, \r\n\r\nThank you for your entry, we can see you are a very talented artist! Unfortunately, surrealism is not permitted in Student Convention as per guidelines. \r\n\r\nGod Bless, keep up the great work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 09:30:08','2023-06-28 09:30:17'),(771,'judge-event-evaluation-597-1687910626',597,19,1,5,1,2023,208,'559',NULL,7322,4451,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Nice drawings. Make sure you use your pictures in jpg format in ms word otherwise it does not display well, and you will have missing text and images.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:03:46','2023-06-28 10:03:46'),(772,'judge-event-evaluation-372-1687910655',372,19,1,5,1,2023,197,'509',NULL,7318,4451,7467,18,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Nice story. Good consistency in the characters. Make sure you use your pictures in jpg format in ms word otherwise it does not display well, and you will have missing text and images.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:04:15','2023-06-28 10:04:15'),(773,'judge-event-evaluation-1064-1687911128',1064,13,1,5,1,2023,209,'560',NULL,7193,4208,7467,53,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Nice colour. Make sure if you are doing even squares that they are definitely even otherwise intensionally make lines of squares more organic to form a nice negative space.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:12:08','2023-06-28 10:12:08'),(774,'judge-event-evaluation-1067-1687911205',1067,13,1,5,1,2023,209,'560',NULL,7198,4208,7467,53,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Good use of graphic line and beautiful colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:13:25','2023-06-28 10:13:25'),(775,'judge-event-evaluation-1065-1687911326',1065,13,1,5,1,2023,209,'560',NULL,7194,4208,7467,53,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Great use of negative space. In something so graphic perhaps close your black lines on your triangles to make it less distracting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:15:26','2023-06-28 10:15:26'),(776,'judge-event-evaluation-1066-1687911400',1066,13,1,5,1,2023,209,'560',NULL,7200,4208,7467,53,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great composition and use of graphic line and texture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:16:40','2023-06-28 10:16:40'),(779,'judge-event-evaluation-799-1687912410',799,3,1,5,1,2023,248,'774','1',0,1678,6,26,'Open','21',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Aiko and Praise. Just a few things that will help for future entries. There wasn’t any appearance & departure shown. Paperwork Supplied with the patterns and balance of music. You could only just hear the tambourines and in the guidelines, the accompaniment must not include applause, cheering or calling out. Other then that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 10:33:30','2023-06-28 10:33:30'),(780,'judge-event-evaluation-1494-1687917176',1494,21,1,5,1,2023,218,'654','1',0,5805,6,21,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Great songs and an amazing medley. Just a few things to help prepare for future conventions. 1. Expressions: don’t be afraid to expressive your movements, facial expressions and your love for worship. 2. Word Emphasis: some of the words weren’t clear to understand. 3. Proper Documentation: I’m Gonna Sing, Sing, Sing, Medley’s score sheet wasn’t provided. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you all. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 11:52:56','2023-06-28 11:52:56'),(781,'judge-event-evaluation-1451-1687918407',1451,13,1,5,1,2023,218,'654','3',0,4208,6,21,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Nadi. Christian. Just a few things that will help prepare for future conventions. Proper Documentation. I see the chord chart but what was needed was the score sheet. When changing songs, it would have been amazing if the song dynamic changed softer but still keeping the temp to The Blessing. Lastly Proper Dictation & Word Emphasis when saying words. Other than that, well done well done well done and I’m so looking forward for what God has in store for you all. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:13:27','2023-06-28 12:13:27'),(782,'judge-event-evaluation-188-1687918412',188,13,1,5,1,2023,19,'061',NULL,7196,4208,7481,5,NULL,NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'It is evident you are passionate about climate change which is admirable. I am not sure all the points you discussed are relevant to this topic in a biblical worldview context. At one point you stated the gospel was a major contributing factor in climate change. Later this was explained further but I would have preferred you to focus on God and creation. Some of the terminology included was confronting and I don\'t believe needed in this essay. At times the points were difficult to follow.\r\nYour bibliography and references were outstanding however it is important to use these to support your point while keeping the point of view as your own. Most of your references were not of a biblical worldview. \r\nYour essay did not include many facts, it was mainly opinion. I suggest next time to include more facts. \r\nYou have demonstrated such passion for your chosen topic but more guidance is needed for appropriate content and format. A good effort here.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:13:32','2023-06-28 12:13:32'),(783,'judge-event-evaluation-189-1687918667',189,13,1,5,1,2023,19,'061',NULL,7201,4208,7481,5,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'A very well written and referenced essay. You have clearly demonstrated a strong talent in this genre. Wonderful linking to the Word of God. There were a number of emotive phrases to capture your reader. \r\n\r\nI did struggle agreeing with the fact God will punish us if we do not tithe ten percent of our income as I have a strong belief our God is one of mercy and grace rather than punishment. This fact is supported through the content of some of your bibliography references too where they state that as a consequence of not tithing God will not punish you.  It is important to check your online research is underpinned by a biblical worldview. \r\nThis was a challenging topic to write about which you have embraced. \r\nThank you for your submission, I enjoyed reading it. Great effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:17:47','2023-06-28 12:17:47'),(785,'judge-event-evaluation-795-1687919524',795,3,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,6974,1678,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. I could see the struggle your main character had. There was a great change in attitude from wrong to doing what is right.\r\nAt times it was a little confusing who the story was about. The story skipped from William to Luis and back which made it difficult to follow and understand. With more practice I am confident your story writing talent will develop well. \r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:32:04','2023-06-28 12:32:04'),(788,'judge-event-evaluation-474-1687919927',474,3,1,5,1,2023,257,'803','2',0,1678,7240,33,'Collection','24,23',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort boys\r\nJust a few tips\r\nRemember that with vocal small groups\r\nthe majority of the entry will need to be\r\na harmonizing of different vocal parts\r\n(e.g. soprano, tenor, melody)\r\nWith the music it needs to be written in music notation showing \r\nthe different parts\r\nKeeping practicing and I know that God will continue to do \r\namazing things through each of you. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:38:47','2023-06-28 12:38:47'),(789,'judge-event-evaluation-492-1687919943',492,3,1,5,1,2023,257,'803','1',0,1678,7240,33,'Collection','24,23',100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort boys\r\nJust a few tips\r\nRemember that with vocal small groups\r\nthere will need to be a harmonizing of different vocal parts\r\n(e.g. soprano, tenor, melody)\r\nWith the music it needs to be written in music notation showing \r\nthe different parts\r\nKeeping practicing and I know that God will continue to do \r\namazing things through each of you. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:39:03','2023-06-28 12:39:03'),(790,'judge-event-evaluation-475-1687920002',475,3,1,5,1,2023,277,'860','1',0,1678,7240,33,'Open','26,23',100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort students\r\nJust a few tips\r\nRemember that with vocal small groups\r\nthe majority of the entry will need to be \r\na harmonizing of different vocal parts\r\n(e.g. soprano, tenor, alto, melody)\r\nWith the music it needs to be written in music notation showing \r\nthe different parts\r\nKeeping practicing and I know that God will continue to do \r\namazing things through each of you. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 12:40:02','20