 your story.  Love the different voice intonation for the two different characters. I really love the improvisation of the popular story of the hare and turtle.  Well done and continue to keep up the good work.  Looking forward to seeing more of you in the platform events. :)  All glory to God. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 13:19:53','2023-06-28 13:19:53'),(819,'judge-event-evaluation-1153-1687922410',1153,46,1,5,1,2023,274,'857','1',0,4504,7240,33,'Open','25,22',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good job girls\r\nJust a tip\r\nRemember to sing out, especially if you have different parts\r\nso that one voice doesn\'t over power another\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the\r\namazing things God will do through each of you\r\nGod Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 13:20:10','2023-06-28 13:20:10'),(820,'judge-event-evaluation-853-1687923946',853,3,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,6980,1678,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed your story. It had great descriptive sentences that allowed the reader to see the story. You provided good details about your main character. There was a clear plot that led to the desired outcome. Good reflection as well and linking to scripture. \r\nYou have a talent for story writing. Keep up the wonderful work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 13:45:46','2023-06-28 13:45:46'),(821,'judge-event-evaluation-412-1687924127',412,7,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7163,6785,6990,2,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Ezekiel, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour image is nice and sharp.  The colours are good.  I was interested to read your process of watching a Youtube video about how to go about it.  I suggest that next time, you make sure your whole car is included in the shot, rather than being cropped.  Alternatively, if you wanted to focus in on the figure, you could crop more of the car.  At the moment, I just get the feeling that it\'s dropping out of the field of view.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, in student convention, the Exhibit General Guidelines point 2. states \"Weapons of any kind or the depiction of them are unacceptable.\"  Therefore, your action figure with weapons disqualifies this entry.  Bear that in mind next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 13:48:47','2023-06-29 09:27:42'),(823,'judge-event-evaluation-941-1687924529',941,25,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7355,5804,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on this story. You have developed a good plot that has feeling and invites the reader to experience what is happening. \r\nAs a future suggestion I would have liked to see you link some of the learning to specific scripture. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 13:55:29','2023-06-28 13:55:29'),(824,'judge-event-evaluation-777-1687924809',777,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7045,4679,6990,2,'Collection','11',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Gloria, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nI also like this image.  The arrangement in the display cabinet is very sweet.  Unfortunately, because the light is low, it is impossible for a hand-held phone shot to be entirely in focus.  You would need to use a tripod and a counter that would put a gap between you pressing the shoot button and the photo being taken to avoid camera shake.  Also, it probably needs to be on some sort of night mode so more light gets into the camera - the image is rather dark.\r\n\r\nYou obviously have a good eye for an attractive shot.  If you work on your camera technique, you will do better next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:00:09','2023-06-28 14:00:09'),(825,'judge-event-evaluation-571-1687925178',571,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7053,4679,6990,2,'Collection','11',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Kenneth, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nThe photograph of your dessert is interesting, with the object in the foreground and an interesting background.  The focus on your dessert isn\'t quite sharp and it\'s a bit dark compared with the background, which means the viewer tends to look beyond it.  It could also be slightly better composed for the dessert to fall at a better point for it to be the centre of interest (look up Rule of thirds).\r\n\r\nKeep working on your composition and I will enjoy seeing your work next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:06:18','2023-06-28 14:06:18'),(826,'judge-event-evaluation-943-1687925362',943,25,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7351,5804,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'A well written story. I liked the way and communication used during the conversations. \r\nUnfortunately I could not give marks for two criteria points as there was no conflict or climax that resolved a conflict. \r\nThis submission would have scored extremely high had it included some form of conflict. \r\nYour talent for story writing is evident. I thoroughly enjoyed reading your story. Thank you for your effort',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:09:22','2023-06-28 14:09:22'),(827,'judge-event-evaluation-560-1687925510',560,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7040,4679,6990,2,'Collection','11',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Marvella, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nI think the way you have composed this image is quite interesting, with your plate of food in the foreground corner, with the pool behind.  It almost looks like an advertisement for \"Best Brews\".  \r\n\r\nThe focus is nicely on the food in the foreground, with good perspective (the background is not in focus).  \r\n\r\nI also like the complementary colours - the warm orange in the foreground and the cool blue in the background, with a touch of blue in the foreground to blend the two.\r\n\r\nThe only improvement I would suggest is a bit more light on the foreground food basket.\r\n\r\nWell done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:11:50','2023-06-28 14:11:50'),(828,'judge-event-evaluation-858-1687925911',858,3,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,6971,1678,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'You had a lot of characters in your story that you described very well. I was glad you tied the story to a biblical theme at the end. You provided a clear picture of the setting so readers can immerse themselves into the story. \r\nWell done, thank you for your effort. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:18:31','2023-06-28 14:18:31'),(829,'judge-event-evaluation-552-1687925960',552,15,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7041,4679,6990,2,'Collection','11',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Matthew, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nI really like your photograph.  In my experience, a phone camera handles this sort of situation with a big range between the lightest light and darkest dark better than a DSLR camera.  I am sure there are settings on a DSLR where you could achieve this effect, but you haven\'t needed to use one.\r\n\r\nYou made a nice arrangement of the coloured lights.  I like the slight curve in the layout and the order of colours.\r\n\r\nYou have managed to get the focus nice and sharp.  I would have liked to read whether you used a timer and held the phone by hand.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:19:20','2023-06-28 14:19:20'),(831,'judge-event-evaluation-1162-1687925992',1162,46,1,5,1,2023,210,'600',NULL,7445,4504,6,19,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Priscilla. Great song which was sung really well. Just a few things that will help prepare for future entries. There was one part towards the end where it looked like you forgot the chord but did really well to figure out the correction and continue with the song. The other is clarity when pronouncing the words. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:19:52','2023-06-28 14:19:52'),(832,'judge-event-evaluation-68-1687926241',68,14,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7336,4328,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'A well written and creative story which had me captivated right from the beginning. It was interesting with characters that came alive. \r\nI was glad you tied the story to a biblical theme at the end. \r\nYou have submitted an exceptional story. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 14:24:01','2023-06-28 14:24:02'),(834,'judge-event-evaluation-495-1687930667',495,3,1,5,1,2023,210,'600',NULL,6976,1678,6,19,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Lukhercia. Amazing voice. Just some key things to prepare for future conventions. As per guidelines, the score sheet should be provided. I’ve received the chord chart. Memorization and clarity of words when singing. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 15:37:47','2023-06-28 15:37:47'),(835,'judge-event-evaluation-1551-1687930870',1551,46,1,5,1,2023,210,'600',NULL,7442,4504,6,19,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Miranda. Amazing voice. Just some key things. Memorizing the chords and singing a little more louder or play the guitar a little softer. The guitar was overpowering the vocal just a little. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 15:41:10','2023-06-28 15:41:10'),(836,'judge-event-evaluation-791-1687931570',791,3,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,6981,1678,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission - it was a lovely story of disciplining. \r\nYou used good descriptive language that enabled the reader to picture what was happening. \r\nMy only suggestion is that you needed to include a reference for the quoted scripture in the conclusion. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 15:52:50','2023-06-28 15:52:50'),(839,'judge-event-evaluation-70-1687932505',70,32,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7333,5826,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed your story, it had very biblical elements and loosely followed the journey of Moses in some parts.\r\nI can see you have a talent for story writing and have a wonderful imagination. I encourage you to further explore this. Well done. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 16:08:25','2023-06-28 16:08:25'),(840,'judge-event-evaluation-944-1687932860',944,25,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7350,5804,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on this submission. \r\nI like the fact you weaved forgiveness into the story. At times I found it difficult to follow what was happening. My suggestion for your next submission is to reduce the amount of events you have in your story and provide more detail about the event you decide to focus on. \r\nIt was lovely to see you discuss gratitude and the love of God. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 16:14:20','2023-06-28 16:14:21'),(841,'judge-event-evaluation-917-1687933341',917,8,1,5,1,2023,18,'060','1',0,6328,7481,9,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'A well researched project on a sensitive and relevant topic. \r\nYou have demonstrated good research skills and analysed the information to form your opinion. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 16:22:21','2023-06-28 16:22:21'),(842,'judge-event-evaluation-834-1687933691',834,25,1,5,1,2023,169,'413',NULL,7340,5804,5,13,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,NULL,NULL,'Good job, Toroagtoka! Good quality photos chosen with clear quality. I would have loved to see some details of the business/company you are advertising for, where do I go to buy the pastries? This is important when creating graphics. \r\nPlease also check the guidelines for requirements, all graphic designs are required to have a biblical message or advertise a Christian business. This is where the business name would have helped!  \r\nWhen completing documentation, more details are required. Was the whole background copied in or did you place each item to make the background? When using other peoples photos or graphics it is also important to give credit properly. Pinterest is a collection of other websites so next time please find the details of the images used. I look forward to seeing more form you in the future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 16:28:11','2023-06-28 16:28:11'),(844,'judge-event-evaluation-846-1687933797',846,11,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7025,613,7481,7,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your submission. \r\nIt was evident the conflict your main character was experiencing and I liked the way you included her seeking support from the Pastor. This shows maturity and an understanding of where to seek help from. \r\nYou have demonstrated an ability for creative writing. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 16:29:57','2023-06-28 16:29:57'),(845,'judge-event-evaluation-636-1687935462',636,15,1,5,1,2023,252,'778','6',0,4679,7441,29,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great Job! I can see that you all spent a lot of time practicing. To increase your score, next time try a more complicated rhythm pattern and be sure your accompaniment does not contain shouting as this breaks the guidelines. Over all you did an excellent job on this. Your rhythm is amazing and you all stayed together quite nicely. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 16:57:42','2023-06-28 16:57:42'),(846,'judge-event-evaluation-625-1687935896',625,15,1,5,1,2023,224,'706',NULL,7040,4679,7441,23,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 17:04:56','2023-06-28 17:04:56'),(847,'judge-event-evaluation-222-1687936443',222,19,1,5,1,2023,200,'551',NULL,7322,4451,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Great work, your trees are quite lovely. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 17:14:03','2023-06-28 17:14:03'),(848,'judge-event-evaluation-1546-1687936703',1546,19,1,5,1,2023,200,'551',NULL,7326,4451,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Your art work is lovely. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 17:18:23','2023-06-28 17:18:23'),(849,'judge-event-evaluation-1304-1687936847',1304,17,1,5,1,2023,200,'551',NULL,7394,4200,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Your painting is beautiful! Be sure to submit your report next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,