ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 17:45:58','2023-06-28 17:45:58'),(859,'judge-event-evaluation-1186-1687938700',1186,46,1,5,1,2023,301,'925',NULL,7445,4504,6958,46,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Priscilla for the illustrative story telling.  Thank you for the courage to share the story. You have given your best.  Just try to be more expressive and change the tone of voice to make the story more interesting and fascinating. Thank you for making the effort to participate.  Looking forward to seeing more of you in the near future. Everything for the Glory of God. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 17:51:40','2023-06-28 17:51:40'),(860,'judge-event-evaluation-225-1687939096',225,19,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,7319,4451,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for submitting your painting! Continue working to develop your talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 17:58:16','2023-06-28 17:58:16'),(863,'judge-event-evaluation-1433-1687940289',1433,21,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','3',0,5805,7370,1,'Open','3',100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for participating in Science Research, Ronald. You\'re doing great! Some suggestion: It\'s better if you choose the simple title and doing the experiment by yourself, and proving the result according the experiment that you already done. But most of all, I could understand the material that you\'ve given. Its interesting also. Thank you Ronald. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:18:09','2023-06-28 18:18:09'),(864,'judge-event-evaluation-1431-1687940422',1431,21,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','2',0,5805,7370,1,'Open','3',100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for participating in Science Research. You\'re doing great! Some inputs: Yor title is interesting. I believe that you also doing the experiment by yourself, but I still didn\'t found the result of your experiment, Donna. The result should be the data of your experiment. For example: What is the color of the food solution before you add with iodine. Then, what is the color after you add with 3 drops of iodine solution. But before, you have to mention the meaning of the color change. Maybe its contain some sugar, or starch. Its important so that the readers could also understand the information. But most of all, I do appreciate of what you\'ve already done. Its still interesting. Thank you Donna. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:20:22','2023-06-28 18:20:22'),(865,'judge-event-evaluation-1430-1687940593',1430,21,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','1',0,5805,7370,1,'Open','3',100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Hallo Ruth. Thank you for participating in Science Research. You\'re doing great! Some inputs: For your interview with Mr Karunesh Rao, so that the readers can understand, you could make it into a simple Q and A with him. Q is for your question, and A is for the answer from Mr Karunesh. It can be  the data of your research. Because at the beginning you wrote that you\'ve got the data from interview, you have to show that. And also, for the Bibiography, you should put minimum 3 references.  But most of all, your topic is interesting enough. It is the picture of your region. I\'ve got some information about Fiji also. Thank you Ruth. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:23:13','2023-06-28 18:23:13'),(866,'judge-event-evaluation-916-1687940711',916,8,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','3',0,6328,7370,1,'Open','3',100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Noam, for participating in Science Research. Your topic is interesting. Some inputs: maybe its better if you also put some picture of all the equipments that you used for the experiments. And also the picture of your experiment\'s result. Its better also if you use your own language so that the readers also understand all of your materials easily.But most of all, I do appreciate of  what you\'ve already done. Good job, Noam. God bless you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:25:11','2023-06-28 18:25:11'),(867,'judge-event-evaluation-915-1687940812',915,8,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','2',0,6328,7370,1,'Open','3',100,96.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for participating in Science Research, Javier. Your topic is very interesting. Some inputs: It will be great if you also add the hamster\'s picture while they\'re running on the wheel (the controls and the experiment\'s hamsters), and also, its better if you do the trials minimum 2 or 3 times, so that the result will be more accurate, and you can make your conclusion precisely. But most of all, I do appreciate of what you\'ve already done. Good job, Javier. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:26:52','2023-06-28 18:26:53'),(868,'judge-event-evaluation-914-1687940952',914,8,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','1',0,6328,7370,1,'Open','3',100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for participating in Science Research, Benjamin. Your topic is simple but is very interesting. Some inputs: For your reference, its better to put some explanation about what Fransisco Redi did to prevent meat from rotting. And put also the source of the article. The result and data of your experiment were almost completed, its minus just because no pictures for day 6. But this experiment were applicable in our daily lives. Good job, Benjamin. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:29:12','2023-06-28 18:29:12'),(869,'judge-event-evaluation-870-1687941334',870,10,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','1',0,1467,7370,1,'Open','3',100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for participating in Science Research, Lael. Some inputs: (1) You haven\'t mention the title of your experiment. (2) You didn\'t mention also the materials needed for the experiment. (3) There are no bibliography as your refferences also. \r\nBut most of all, I really enjoy reading your file. Its very simple and interesting also. The data and analysis are very clear for the readers. Thank you, Lael. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:35:34','2023-06-28 18:35:34'),(870,'judge-event-evaluation-1208-1687942629',1208,13,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,7176,4208,6990,2,'Collection','11',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Minghao,\r\n\r\nIt\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.  \r\n\r\nIt was a good idea to enter a photograph of  your sushi into this \"general\" category.  The flowers on the side of the plate are very attractive.  I would have wiped the bit of grease off the other side of the plate as it distracts from the overall effect.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, the food and flowers are not in sharp focus and the cropping is a bit haphazard, catching most of, but not all the plate.  Using a phone camera in what might have been fairly low light is probably aggravated by a degree of handshake, which is unavoidable without using a tripod and delayed shutter.  Next time, try using a tripod, if possible, and be careful to crop so that your centre of interest falls on a good focal point position (look up the rule of thirds).\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 18:57:09','2023-06-28 18:57:09'),(871,'judge-event-evaluation-608-1687943153',608,3,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,6971,1678,6990,2,'Open','11',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Oswald, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nIt was a good idea to use the same image for your history assignment and convention entry.  The idea of photographing the large scale model ship was also a good one.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you have only taken a shot of part of the ship and the background is cluttered up with people, which is distracting.  It is possible to focus in on a part of something for your image, but it needs to stand alone, telling a story.  I think the picture you have submitted just leaves me wondering why you didn\'t photograph the whole ship.\r\n\r\nThe focus is adequate, given the large area covered.  I am guessing the light is fairly low, which doesn\'t help.  If you used a tripod for your phone and a long exposure to avoid hand shake, that would provide for a better image.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 19:05:53','2023-06-28 19:05:53'),(872,'judge-event-evaluation-661-1687943786',661,3,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,6975,1678,6990,2,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Samuel,\r\n\r\nIt\'s great that you are involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.  \r\n\r\nPhotographing your chess set was an excellent idea.  I\'m glad you enjoyed playing with your friend and that the set provides good memories, even though you lost the game.  That\'s good sportsmanship.\r\n\r\nI quite like the angle you have photographed from.  You have created a view where the back pieces seem to approach each other due to the receding perspective from the camera.  However, none of the picture is really in focus and the light reflecting off the  back wall is rather distracting.  \r\n\r\n\r\nI suggest you ask your supervisor to show you the website Unsplash and search for images of chess sets.  There are many great pictures there that might give you inspiration for another go at this same subject.  There focus sometimes covers all the pieces and sometimes it is specific, but all are options.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 19:16:26','2023-06-28 19:16:26'),(873,'judge-event-evaluation-664-1687944477',664,3,1,5,1,2023,165,'406',NULL,6973,1678,6990,2,'Collection','11',100,59.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Victor,  it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you\r\n\r\nCaves are really beautiful and I can see why you took this photograph.  However, it doesn\'t really fit the category.  \"General\" photographs should be: \"A photo of objects, food, toys, and other general goods.\"\r\n\r\nI would dispute that the cave wall patterns built up over millions of years.  The Bible teaches a six day creation and the time since then is likely not too much more than 6000 years.  Limestone has been observed to build up fairly quickly when the right chemicals are in the water.  You can read more about this on the Creation Ministries website: https://creation.com/rapid-stalactites\r\n\r\nA reasonable enhancement of this image would have been to increase the tonal contrast and also the colour saturation.  A phone photo in a dark place, such as a cave, also limits the ability to focus well or replicate the colours perceived by the eye.  This can best be achieved by putting the phone on a tripod and using a long shutter speed and remote sensor button.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 19:27:57','2023-06-28 19:27:57'),(874,'judge-event-evaluation-476-1687944678',476,3,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6983,1678,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Benaya! Thank you for your lovely rendition of this beautiful piece of music. \r\nI would have loved to hear more variation in your dynamics. You can use this to have greater intensity to have a real firm climax as you start each of the choruses. \r\nI hope to hear you singing again in the future. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 19:31:18','2023-06-28 19:31:18'),(875,'judge-event-evaluation-188-1687944985',188,13,1,5,1,2023,19,'061',NULL,7196,4208,7478,5,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,-1.00,'This was a passionate and eloquently written essay. You have a very engaging style of writing that draws the reader in and makes the reader care about the topic!\r\n\r\nYou did a lot of wide reading for this essay. Your sources show that you dug deeply into the topic. I was pleased to see reliable sources such as government websites and academic articles. Sources like media matters are less reliable as they are closer to opinion pieces. News articles are very useful for context and for information surrounding Indigenous populations, but are less useful for science topics. You did a good job of including these articles in the bibliography. Keeping track of your research is a very useful skill. \r\n\r\nEach paragraph flowed smoothly and was very persuasive.  The outline was not closely followed as it indicated four paragraphs (I, II, III, and IV), but the essay itself had eight. It seemed that there was a page missing which would have had more paragraphs. I also felt like the topic could have been change to reflect the content about the Land Protectors. Instead of saying \"Why saving the earth matters more now than ever,\" a better title may have been, \"Why saving the earth matters now and how Indigenous efforts to save the earth have been suppressed.\" You wrote a really good essay, but not every point tied in to the topic statement. \r\n\r\nI pray that God would bless you in your writing and that you would get more opportunities to share your passionate voice. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 19:36:25','2023-06-28 19:36:25'),(878,'judge-event-evaluation-189-1687945905',189,13,1,5,1,2023,19,'061',NULL,7201,4208,7478,5,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'This is an exceptionally well written essay! You have chosen a clear topic and stuck to that topic throughout. You have a clear progression of your arguments from establishing the meaning of a tithe and its importance right through to its consequences. Your examples from the Bible are very clear and well placed. \r\n\r\nYou have clearly read and followed the guidelines very closely. Your bibliography is particularly good. \r\n\r\nI do feel like your point about God punishing those who don\'t tithe is correct, but overstated. God speaks of cursing those who don\'t tithe, but to assign trouble in school or a car accident to that curse is impossible as not all bad things in life are a direct punishment from God. Instead, you could have simply discussed those verses in Malachi 3 directly without needing to bring modern day examples into it. \r\n\r\nI pray that God would continue to bless your writing and that you would continue to have great success in this space. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 19:51:45','2023-06-28 19:51:45'),(880,'judge-event-evaluation-191-1687947234',191,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7199,4208,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well written with believable characterization and a plot with a twist.  This was a story in which the conflict actually was resolved but it wasn\'t.  The outside story was one of an unsaved aunty who played a game with her nephew.  If she lost there was a chance she could be saved because she had to go to church.  The inside story was one of a Christian nephew having to keep his emotions in check when things did not go as expected and he faced losing a game and having to work hard to keep his anger subdued.  He struggled and prayed and recalled scripture.  He gracefully took the loss BUT that was not the end as God had witnessed through Ben\'s self control and his aunty examined herself and realized that Ben was an example to her of good behavior.  So in a way God provided a resolution that taught Ben and witnessed to his Aunty, and it did not require getting his Aunty into a church. \r\n Well done creating this three stranded story of how God works through us to witness to others.  \r\n\r\nMechanics:  Very few mistakes.  \r\n1.  doule-faulted-two bad serves  (take out the second hyphen)\r\n2. \"You did fine, Tristin\" Ben heaved a sigh. (missing punctuation)\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:13:54','2023-06-28 20:13:54'),(881,'judge-event-evaluation-57-1687947684',57,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7331,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful poem that conveyed a narrative and a message. You did a great job of conveying the gospel. Your writing demonstrates a fantastic grasp of scripture and the reason for which Jesus became a man and died for our sins. I\'m very impressed at how well you did with the challenge of conveying a message. \r\n\r\nYou were very clever with some of the ways that you rhymed words. It would have been better to have consistency from one paragraph to the next. The first paragraph rhymes lines 1 & 2 then lines 3 & 4. The third paragraph rhymes lines 1 & 3 then lines 2 & 4. The same rhyming style should be used throughout. The rhythm was also inconsistent as  paragraph four had 3 lines and the rhythm changed with each paragraph. \r\n\r\nYou wrote really well and showed a good grasp of the mechanics of poetry. If you are able to take those mechanics and use them consistently across the length of the poem, you will produce some masterpieces. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:21:24','2023-06-28 20:21:25'),(882,'judge-event-evaluation-1143-1687947751',1143,21,1,5,1,2023,22,'064',NULL,7161,5805,7475,8,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great job! I enjoyed reading your book report.\r\nI deducted points especially for the story summary, since it a lot of times felt like a retelling.\r\nMy advice if you do another, no need to go into so much detail, just add the information that helps bring across the main point or lesson you wish to make.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:22:31','2023-06-28 20:22:31'),(885,'judge-event-evaluation-865-1687948357',865,10,1,5,1,2023,22,'064',NULL,7281,1467,7475,8,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'I am very impressed. Eloquently written, cohesion of ideas. It was a joy to read your report. Would make anyone want to read the actual book.\r\nCouldn\'t award full marks just because I was just missing a correlation with what you had learnt from Martin Luther King Jr\'s life and that of Bible principles. You alluded to them but there wasn\'t a clear indication from my point of view. Otherwise, well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:32:37','2023-06-28 20:32:37'),(886,'judge-event-evaluation-197-1687949489',197,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7174,4208,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Great job! You wrote quite a comprehensive book report, using warm language and good use of examples and relevant Bible scriptures.\r\nCharacters and themes were presented well.\r\nKeep it up',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:51:29','2023-06-28 20:51:30'),(887,'judge-event-evaluation-1305-1687949503',1305,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7394,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Devanny, It\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you visual art report was not submitted, so you have lost all the marks for that section.\r\n\r\nYou have used a good range of different colours with evidence of the application of different drawing techniques.  It would be a good idea to smooth the sky as this should not show any texture.  You can use a \"paper stump\" or just a scrunched up piece of paper to rub over the pencil.  I also feel that the tree would be better placed off to one side a bit (look up the rule of thirds) for a more pleasing composition.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:51:43','2023-06-28 20:51:43'),(889,'judge-event-evaluation-1311-1687949916',1311,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7395,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Djovie, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you have not uploaded your visual art report, so you have lost all the marks in that section.\r\n\r\nYou have used a very vibrant laydown of colour, creating an appealing visual effect for what could be used as a poster.  \r\n\r\nIt would be good to use some different textured effects to create more visual interest.\r\n\r\nWell done, keep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 20:58:36','2023-06-28 20:58:36'),(890,'judge-event-evaluation-1551-1687950096',1551,46,1,5,1,2023,210,'600',NULL,7442,4504,7471,19,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Well done! You sang beautifully and I especially love how clearly you sang the words - great diction! Just be mindful of your expressions while singing…instead of pulling a face when you make a mistake, just keep on singing confidently as if nothing happened. Most people don’t even realise until our faces show it. All in all, keep practicing and singing. I look forward to hearing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:01:36','2023-06-28 21:01:36'),(891,'judge-event-evaluation-1306-1687950246',1306,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7396,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Eunjoo, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, your visual arts report has not been uploaded, so you have lost all the marks in that section.\r\n\r\nYou have done an excellent job of layering your strokes to demonstrate the way the fur lies on the cat.  I also appreciate that you have layered different coloured pencils to create variety.  The cropped nature of the image is pleasing and you have showed very confident drawing skills.  Unfortunately, it\'s not clear from which direction the light source is coming - this is one of the judging criteria.  \r\n\r\nKeep working at your drawing.  I look forward to seeing what you submit next year.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:04:06','2023-06-28 21:04:06'),(893,'judge-event-evaluation-979-1687950457',979,8,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7072,6328,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'You have truly done your father proud in writing this short story.  You set the scene well.  As a reader I know it started with when you were young your father was thrown into prison and the story takes you through to God working in your life.   This is like a repeat of when Paul and Silas were thrown into prison and the jailer was saved.  God used your Father mightily to save the lost.  You realistically do not gloss over the cost of mission and evangelizing and the absent father and how it impacts the family, often children are left feeling angry and neglected and deprived of what they should have had \'Protection and provision.\" Instead they often end up without these things and a tired out mother working hard to try and hold things together.  More strain is put on the family and siblings drift apart.  Rightly the resolution for the conflict can only be Christ as Christ is for the broken.  In seeking Christ healing can begin and God can help us look outward not inward.   An awesome read!  This story would be an inspiration to many.  Thank you for sharing.\r\n\r\nAs your sister edited for you I have taken some points off to allow for this.  Thank you for your honesty.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:07:37','2023-06-28 21:07:37'),(895,'judge-event-evaluation-624-1687950561',624,8,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7077,6328,7440,2,NULL,'12',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Michael, I really like your photo! I just realized that your picture is unique, cause the green color of raincoat makes my focus going to there instantly! But Its more better if you can crop the bottom picture (your car\'s window border) can makes framing photography!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:09:21','2023-06-28 21:09:21'),(896,'judge-event-evaluation-446-1687950586',446,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7397,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Fransiska, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nI am afraid your painting is in the wrong category.  You have missed uploading the visual arts report (worth 5 marks), but it appears to be done in watercolour.  Even watercolour pencils are excluded from this category.  \r\n\r\nThe tulips are well drawn and you have made a pleasing attempt to lighten the surfaces that would receive the most light as well as fading off the background leaves.\r\n\r\nCheck the guidelines next year and you will do well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:09:46','2023-06-28 21:09:46'),(897,'judge-event-evaluation-198-1687950687',198,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7183,4208,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort. Robinson Crusoe is one of my favourite stories.  My only advice is to remind that a book report, isn\'t just retelling the events of the story. Would have loved a little more on your opinions and thoughts regarding the story, especially with the 200 words you had to spare. But otherwise great effort. Keep it up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:11:27','2023-06-29 11:56:35'),(898,'judge-event-evaluation-1130-1687950696',1130,46,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7443,4504,7440,2,NULL,'12',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Stan Tiki! Its a nice capture! I see the emotion clearly and it\'s really good because the picture is unique! Its like 1 look at camera and 2 of them looking another side! Its really good! Have a nice day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:11:36','2023-06-28 21:11:36'),(899,'judge-event-evaluation-1126-1687950741',1126,46,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7442,4504,7440,2,NULL,'12',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Miranda Benny Wells! Its really a great picture! I can sense the seriousness of making the oil paint, but unfortunately when I zoom in to the face, his eyes closed. But for the lighting and overall its good! Have a nice day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:12:21','2023-06-28 21:12:21'),(900,'judge-event-evaluation-456-1687950902',456,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7398,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Gabriel, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you have not uploaded your visual arts report, which is worth 5 marks.\r\n\r\nYou have made a good effort to show the way light falls on surfaces and changing colours and level of detail to show recession in the background.  It would be good to reduce the appearance of texture in the sky and also reduce the outlining.  The latter, in particular, makes the picture look rather cartoonish.\r\n\r\nA good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:15:02','2023-06-28 21:15:02'),(901,'judge-event-evaluation-1134-1687951074',1134,46,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7444,4504,7440,2,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Bethifer Kamilus! Its really a great picture! I hope you can edit it more cause its very good afterall! Have a good day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:17:54','2023-06-28 21:17:55'),(903,'judge-event-evaluation-988-1687951272',988,21,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7121,5805,7440,2,NULL,'7',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Emma Pene! Its really great picture, but It\'s from photography or from video call? But overall I can get the portrait of your grandmother and her bright smile! Have a good day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:21:12','2023-06-28 21:21:12'),(905,'judge-event-evaluation-483-1687951404',483,3,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6974,1678,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Brayden! Thank you for sharing this recording of you singing Above All. I would have loved to hear more variation in your dynamics. You can use this to have greater intensity to have a real firm climax. Another thing for you to consider is the mood of the song you are singing and how this should influence the nature of your singing tone for each particular song. Keep up the great work. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:23:24','2023-06-28 21:23:24'),(906,'judge-event-evaluation-1105-1687951428',1105,13,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7211,4208,7440,2,NULL,'7',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hey  Jiokapeci Tuilevuka! I love your picture, but I think it would be good if you do more edit! I can feel the smile of a baby and the bright of baby! Have a good day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:23:48','2023-06-28 21:23:49'),(907,'judge-event-evaluation-1550-1687951554',1550,20,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7097,394,7471,3,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Jeffrey! You chose a great song to present and I especially loved how passionately you played the violin - it looked like you were enjoying yourself, which naturally makes the audience also feel relaxed and able to easily enjoy the performance too. \r\nJust a note to be mindful submitting the correct paperwork. The music score submitted didn\'t match what was played, so I assume you creatively added your own flavour and adjustments to the music. This is great I encourage you to do that more and more, but just remember to make sure the music score is adjusted accordingly. \r\nAnother thing to note is to be careful when modulating (doing key changes). You did this a few times in your piece, but because you jumped from one key to another key without connected or pivot notes, it didn\'t sound smooth and harmonious. Key changes are a great idea, but there is a right way to use them. \r\nAll in all, you did well and obviously enjoy playing your instrument. Keep practicing and playing. I\'m sure we\'ll see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:25:54','2023-06-28 21:25:54'),(908,'judge-event-evaluation-448-1687951578',448,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7399,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Janice,  It\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour picture of the panda is very cute and confidently drawn.  I appreciate the tonal variation on the branches, but you have not done any shading on the panda, which is disappointing.  Even though the light fur is white, it would appear greyed off (reflecting the colour of the branches) in the shadow.\r\n\r\nWell done, keep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:26:18','2023-06-28 21:26:18'),(909,'judge-event-evaluation-637-1687951606',637,3,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,6967,1678,7440,2,NULL,'7',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Nanako Naito Tarigan! Its a great picture! I think you can do more portrait your sister that shot her expression more! Have a nice day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:26:46','2023-06-28 21:26:46'),(910,'judge-event-evaluation-674-1687951647',674,8,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7063,6328,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Benjamin! Thank you for singing Worthy is the Lamb, it is such a wonderful song to hear. I would have loved to hear more variation in your dynamics. You can use this to have greater intensity to have a real firm climax. I would like to encourage you to think more about the ends of your phrases so they feel like a completion of what has just been sung. Keep developing this God given gift of singing from memory. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:27:27','2023-06-28 21:27:27'),(911,'judge-event-evaluation-1123-1687951717',1123,46,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7447,4504,7440,2,NULL,'7',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Nathan Kes! I love this picture! I can get the expression of your model! Have a good day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:28:37','2023-06-28 21:28:37'),(912,'judge-event-evaluation-1316-1687952030',1316,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7429,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Jesen, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nIt would have been great if you had uploaded your visual art report (worth 5 marks) as this would have given me more information about your process.  \r\n\r\nYour work reminds me of a book cover for a novel I read many years ago.  Your drawing is confidently done and mostly accurate.  It would have helped to have more variation in colour lightness/darkness as the sections tend to visually run in together.  More variation in the way you laid down colour would have added to the visual interest.\r\n\r\nI like the way you have overlaid colours to make for more interesting colour variation.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:33:50','2023-06-28 21:33:50'),(913,'judge-event-evaluation-632-1687952065',632,8,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7079,6328,7440,2,NULL,'7',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Nathanael Clarence Sariono! Its really good picture! But I hope for next picture you will use clear background or more bokeh cause the focus of image will be improved! Have a nice day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:34:25','2023-06-28 21:34:25'),(914,'judge-event-evaluation-1011-1687952172',1011,28,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7278,5806,7440,2,NULL,'7',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Victoria Flora Esther Lomani Taufa! Its really a great picture! Its like bright smile in siblings picture! Have a great day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:36:12','2023-06-28 21:36:12'),(915,'judge-event-evaluation-288-1687952293',288,12,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6992,1132,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Jonathan! Thank you so much for singing In Christ Alone. It is a hymn with such a powerful deep message. One thing I would like to suggest you work on is breathing from the bottom of your diaphragm when you sing. From what I can see, you are mostly breathing from your chest. However, if you breath from the bottom of your diaphragm you will be able to take a bigger breath and produce a stronger tone when singing. This will also help with increase the breadth of your dynamic range. Awesome work. I hope you continue to develop this skill. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:38:13','2023-06-28 21:38:14'),(916,'judge-event-evaluation-860-1687952324',860,10,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,7283,1467,7440,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Adinda Tirza Maharani! I really like your picture! The work of art in model, and the picture, composition, its really good! As far as I see this picture really stole my interest! But sadly I can\'t get the Christian Morale for your picture. Have a nice day',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:38:44','2023-06-28 21:38:44'),(917,'judge-event-evaluation-1233-1687952336',1233,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7266,5806,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Eliana! You chose a good story with an equally good message. \r\nYou did great to read clearly and use different intonations for the different characters. \r\nI do think that there was a lot of room in this script to really use big actions and expressions to bring the story the life and really draw the audience in. I believe you have the potential to become a moving and captivating speaker. Keep practicing; I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:38:56','2023-06-28 21:38:56'),(919,'judge-event-evaluation-867-1687952511',867,3,1,5,1,2023,172,'450',NULL,6968,1678,7440,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Yosia Natanael Yeo! Its a great picture! But I can\'t see your friend\'s expression! It would be more better if you can expose more of his expression when enjoying his drink! Have a good day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:41:51','2023-06-28 21:41:51'),(920,'judge-event-evaluation-468-1687952548',468,8,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7073,6328,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Jevonte, it\'s so great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nI am extremely glad that you included your visual arts report (many didn\'t) as it is worth 5 marks and it helps me understand your process.\r\n\r\nYou have made a good effort to show the direction of light hitting the grapes (though it is inconsistent) and have done a good job overlaying different coloured pencils to build depth in the picture.  In nature, you would see some light reflecting on nearby objects, so the stalk would have some purple in it and the grapes would have some green.  \r\n\r\nIf the grapes are cut, as you have depicted, there should be some surrounding detail about where the shadow from the grapes falls on the surface on which they are sitting.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:42:28','2023-06-28 21:42:28'),(921,'judge-event-evaluation-695-1687952604',695,28,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7258,5806,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'You have an amazing gift at writing and you have expressed yourself well.  You have taken the reader into a family that has faith to persevere and to trust in God for all things in their every day life.  A thoroughly enjoyable short read that kept me totally engaged.  \r\n\r\nMechanics:  \r\n1.  safe still away             should be: safe while still away\r\n2. later today would be great as he should probably be awake .      suggestion:  as he probably should be awake\r\n3. when they came around the door, the man was not there.     \r\n    suggestion: when they came through the doorway, they saw that the man was not there.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:43:24','2023-06-28 21:43:24'),(922,'judge-event-evaluation-1526-1687952899',1526,17,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7382,4200,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Hajean Ryu! You chose a good story with a great message. I love the variety of actions and expressions you used; it was engaging and drew the audience in. I appreciate that you took your time and didn\'t rush through the reading, but just be mindful to properly phrase sentence or groups of words as you\'re reading. \r\nAlso, we unfortunately only received the first page of your reading :/\r\nAll in all, well done! You are a natural speaker. Keep practicing and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:48:19','2023-06-28 21:48:19'),(923,'judge-event-evaluation-381-1687953201',381,21,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7154,5805,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Jovilisi, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour apple shows a great deal of effort, well done.\r\n\r\nBe careful in copying a reference that the reference itself is accurate.  The leaf should not come out of the top of the apple, but be attached to the stalk.  I can\'t really see the reference at the top of the document as it\'s too small, but I suspect that you have made a copying error.  Otherwise, the reference is to blame.\r\n\r\nI am also a bit distrustful of the highlights.  There shouldn\'t be a dark area surrounding them - the surrounding area should be light, leading to a darker area away from that.  You will rarely have such a strong white highlight in three places on an object.  \r\n\r\nYou have made a good effort, but I would seek out a better reference next time.  If you can draw from life, you will make fewer errors.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:53:21','2023-06-28 21:53:21'),(924,'judge-event-evaluation-1234-1687953364',1234,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7261,5806,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Kaloafu! You presented this reading beautifully and clearly - great diction!\r\nDon\'t be afraid to be bold and use big, open gestures and expressions. For example, when there\'s a knock at the door in the story, knock on an imaginary door and make a knocking sound. When there\'s a part of the story where a character is sad, speak in a way that sounds like some who is sad and show that same expression on your face. All these things help to bring your reading to life and draw the audience in. \r\nYou are already a very good speaker! Keep practicing and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 21:56:04','2023-06-28 21:56:04'),(926,'judge-event-evaluation-462-1687953713',462,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7416,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Kylie, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour piece is visually stunning.  I really wish you had uploaded your visual arts report (worth 5 points) so I could read about your technique.  I could make a better judgment on this if I knew how you had approached it.\r\n\r\nThe only technical suggestion I can make it that a bit less outlining (most evident in the white line around the head) would add to the sense of realism.  I can see that you are making a distinction between the lizard and the very black background.  Perhaps you could have had a more realistic background (plants, etc) and put the lizard in context of his natural environment.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 22:01:53','2023-06-28 22:01:53'),(927,'judge-event-evaluation-1185-1687953853',1185,11,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7025,613,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done Kathleen! You chose a great passage to read, spoke clearly and beautifully. \r\nI would encourage you to be bold in using big and open gestures when reading - especially with the like of the Psalms. Your voice and vocal intonations were great, but I think it would\'ve had an even better/bigger impact if you added hand and body gestures to bring it even more to life! \r\nAll in all, you did very well. Keep practicing and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 22:04:13','2023-06-28 22:04:13'),(928,'judge-event-evaluation-550-1687954376',550,19,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7323,4451,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Kayla!\r\nYou chose a great passage and read it beautifully. I especially loved your facial expressions and vocal intonations - it really helped to draw the audience in. I would encourage you to not be afraid of stepping out from behind the stand and use grand gestures from time to time; movement is another way to bring your reading to life and really captivate your audience. \r\nAll in all, you did a wonderful job and are a great speaker. Look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 22:12:56','2023-06-28 22:12:56'),(929,'judge-event-evaluation-192-1687955508',192,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7211,4208,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This could be called, \"Don\'t Judge a Book by Its Cover!\"   Such an intriguing web of human judgement, church gossip and presumptions about people by the way they look.  This woman you have portrayed obviously loved the Lord, worked hard, was not involved in gossip as she was too busy, unlike some of the church people.  She was a woman of integrity who diligently sought out material that she could give to those that needed God in their life.  She was a living example of the \'Joy of the Lord.\'  Her mission field was those she met in everyday life.  God uses what others deem as \'the simple\' or \'unlovely\' time and time again to further his kingdom message.  You have captured this amazingly well.\r\n\r\nMechanics:\r\n1.   clothes she wears that are so mismatched                       suggestion:  clothes she wears are so mismatched    take out \'that \'\r\n2.  she has all the work she can use                                            suggestion:  she has all the work she can do\r\n3.  Just before our service there that afternoon                     suggestion:  Just before our service, there, that afternoon.\r\n4.  Tonight is just to decide what we\'re going to try to give enough money to buy     Confusing\r\n     Tonight is just to decide what we\'re going to give towards the things that need to be bought.   Suggestion\r\n5.  Mr. Williams must have realized how quiet it had suddenly gotten.  suggestion:  how quiet it had suddenly become.\r\n6.  he kept hold of Mere hand     should be:  he kept hold of Mere\'s hand\r\n7.   she was always happy at her work - always singing hymns - that I asked         should be:   commas not hyphens\r\n8.  Praying that one of these days         should be:  I am praying that one of these days\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 22:31:48','2023-06-28 22:31:48'),(930,'judge-event-evaluation-1235-1687956313',1235,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7263,5806,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Luse! You chose a lovely passage and read it beautifully. You also did great to speak clearly and use proper diction. Don’t be afraid to be more expressive and use big open gestures…or even step out from behind the stand from time to time. Movement is a great way to keep your audience engaged and draw them in to your reading. \r\nAll in all, you did a great job and are a very good speaker. Keep practicing and I look forward to seeing more of you in future :) God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 22:45:13','2023-06-28 22:45:14'),(931,'judge-event-evaluation-1187-1687956788',1187,46,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7442,4504,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,-1.00,'Good Effort Miranda! An interesting story choice and well read. \r\nYou have a beautiful speaking voice…I would encourage you to slow down a bit more when reading so that the audience can clearly hear and process the story as it unfolds. \r\nAlso, don’t be afraid to experiment using different vocal intonations when referring to or speaking as different characters. And also don’t be afraid to move around a bit and use big gestures. Movement is a great way to keep your listeners engaged and captivated with your reading. Also, just a note to be mindful of the way you start and end your presentation. It also makes an impact :) Keep practicing and perfecting your reading. I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 22:53:08','2023-06-28 22:53:08'),(932,'judge-event-evaluation-503-1687957365',503,3,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,6981,1678,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,0.00,' Well done Olivia. You chose a wonderful passage for your reading and did well to include gestures from time to time. I would encourage you to practice using different vocal intonations to depict different characters in the story. And don’t be afraid to use big gestures with your hands and body, and employ facial expressions too. All things things help to really keep your audience engaged with the story or passage you are reading. \r\nKeep practicing and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 23:02:45','2023-06-28 23:02:45'),(933,'judge-event-evaluation-507-1687957886',507,3,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,6969,1678,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Pauline! You chose a great passage and read it beautifully. You also did well to speak with confidence and project your voice clearly the whole way through. \r\nI would encourage you to practice using different voice intonations to demonstrate the different characters. And also practice using big gestures, movement and emotion…all of which will help to pull your audience in and keep them captivated with the story from start to end.\r\nYou are a great speaker; keep practicing and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 23:11:26','2023-06-28 23:11:26'),(935,'judge-event-evaluation-509-1687958440',509,3,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,6972,1678,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,86.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Phebe! You chose a great passage and read it beautifully. Well done including hand gestures at some points. I would just be mindful to not overdue the same actions/gestures too many times. \r\nAlso, don’t be afraid to be creative and use different voices for different characters….it will really help to draw your audience in and keep them engaged throughout your reading. \r\nAll in all, great job. Keep practicing and I hope to see more from you in future :) God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 23:20:40','2023-06-28 23:20:40'),(936,'judge-event-evaluation-1236-1687959165',1236,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7271,5806,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Ruci! You chose a wonderful story and read it beautifully. I especially appreciate how well you expressed the characters with your face and voice.\r\nMy only suggestion would be to slow down the pace of your reading a bit and add pauses when necessary. When you read slowly, it actually causes listeners to want to listen more carefully and builds up anticipation for what’s about to take place in the story. Whereas, if you read too quickly, listeners are forced to process what they’re hearing too quickly which can cause them to tune out. \r\nAll in all, you did very well and are a natural speaker. I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 23:32:45','2023-06-28 23:32:45'),(937,'judge-event-evaluation-1443-1687960277',1443,25,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7337,5804,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done Tue! You chose a story with a brilliant message and you ready it beautifully too. \r\nYou spoke clearly and eloquently! \r\nI would encourage you to practice reading a little slower as that will help your audience to follow along and process the story better. Also, don’t be afraid to use big gestures and move around a bit…movement is another way to bring your reading to life and keep your listeners engaged from start to finish. \r\nYou are a really good speaker. Keep practicing and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-28 23:51:17','2023-06-28 23:51:17'),(938,'judge-event-evaluation-962-1687960964',962,21,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7160,5805,7471,45,'Open','25',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Alumita! You chose a great poem with an important message. \r\nYou did well to speak clearly and not get stuck when you forgot a line or phrase in the moment. \r\nI would encourage you to slow down a bit when reciting poetry, as this will helps your listeners to process each line and keep them engaged the whole way through. \r\nAlso, don’t be afraid to be even more expressive with your voice and gestures. \r\nAll in all, you did an awesome job and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 00:02:44','2023-06-29 00:02:44'),(939,'judge-event-evaluation-1077-1687961446',1077,21,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7121,5805,7471,45,'Open','25',100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Emma! You chose a wonderful poem and presented it spectacularly! \r\nI love how confident and creative you were in your use of different voice intonations, accents and gestures to depict the different characters. \r\nWell done as well not letting the little instances of mind blank freeze you in your tracks. Each time you carried on as if nothing every happened….which is exactly how it’s supposed to be! \r\nYou’re a natural on stage and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 00:10:46','2023-06-29 00:10:46'),(941,'judge-event-evaluation-484-1687963474',484,3,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,6974,1678,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Brayden, you are doing good, yet you still can improve your posture, movement and gesture in the future, you can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 00:44:34','2023-06-29 00:44:34'),(942,'judge-event-evaluation-1245-1687963983',1245,11,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7026,613,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,76.00,-10,0.00,'Peter, you deliver it well, as you also dress up well, yet most of the time you are looking down seeing you script lacking contact of the audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 00:53:03','2023-06-29 00:53:03'),(943,'judge-event-evaluation-1506-1687966585',1506,17,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','2',0,4200,7450,34,'Open','28',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Overall their appearance is in a pretty good category. I really appreciate. They have shown their best, because it is not easy to appear in front of the camera. But I have some notes to help them move forward:\r\n1. In a choir, it would be better to have expression in singing, be it facial expressions or gestures or maybe some movements so that you can sing more relaxed.\r\n2. When singing together try to balance the sound with others.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01:36:25','2023-06-29 01:36:25'),(944,'judge-event-evaluation-1505-1687966598',1505,17,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','1',0,4200,7450,34,'Open','28',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Very attractive appearance, good mix of voices and able to balance one voice with another. Harmonious music and sound. It\'s just that it would be better if it was accompanied by some movement or smiling expressions, and wearing uniform clothes would add a good visualization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01:36:38','2023-06-29 01:36:38'),(945,'judge-event-evaluation-1278-1687966617',1278,28,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','1',0,5806,7450,34,'Open','28',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'What a performance. I really enjoy the voices they sing. They have a strong and firm vocal character so that every word that is spoken is heard clearly and the tone is also right. It\'s just that it will look more attractive if each student can give a smile when singing or there are certain movements, having uniform clothes will add to the attractiveness of those who see it. But overall, this is the best performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01:36:57','2023-06-29 01:36:57'),(946,'judge-event-evaluation-1195-1687966628',1195,21,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','1',0,5805,7450,34,'Open','28',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'What a performance. They really enjoy the songs that are sung, making them able to sing emphatically and in accordance with the notes. Very harmonious sound distribution. Complement each other. Wearing the same uniform is an additional point for them too. What a beautiful sound. But it would be very good if there were expressions when singing or there were certain movements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01:37:08','2023-06-29 01:37:08'),(947,'judge-event-evaluation-1202-1687966656',1202,21,1,5,1,2023,278,'861','1',0,5805,7450,34,'Open','27',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Stunning performance, good arrangement and proper sound division. Sound and music harmony is also good. Even though their faces look nervous, they can sing very well and confidently. I really appreciate it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01:37:36','2023-06-29 01:37:37'),(948,'judge-event-evaluation-1161-1687966666',1161,46,1,5,1,2023,278,'861','1',0,4504,7450,34,'Open','27',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Having a good voice is a blessing from God, they can sing well. Follow a good tempo and tone. It\'s just that they still look tense and don\'t enjoy the song even though their voices are very good. It will be better if you can have a happy expression, be more confident, and enjoy the song. Good job for all of you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01:37:46','2023-06-29 01:37:47'),(949,'judge-event-evaluation-904-1687966702',904,8,1,5,1,2023,278,'861','1',0,6328,7450,34,'Open','27',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance, they can sing according to their respective parts even though there are still voices that dominate. Some students looked tense, while others were enjoying it and some were smiling shyly. Very interesting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 01