ped the characters in the story very well and had a well rounded ending to the story in which you left the final scene with the children missing the bus but running to make up for lost time out of the scene so to say.\r\n\r\n\"side eye\'    is this a wink or a glance?  I am not familiar with this terminology. \r\n\r\nMechanics:\r\n1.  heavy snow,”said the \r\n2.  the woman,a nagging feeling \r\n3.  woman,who \r\nAll spacing issues when typing.\r\n4.         \"Don\'t worry Ma\'am, we\'ll help out with your stuff, if you\'d like?\" he asked. \r\n             \"Yeah, let\'s get started, the sooner we start the better, right?\" she asked. \r\nBoth these statements do not quite sit right.  Try something like:\r\n\"Don\'t worry Ma\'am.  If you\'d like, we\'ll help out with your stuff.\"  he stated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 06:08:30','2023-06-29 06:08:30'),(969,'judge-event-evaluation-1143-1687990931',1143,21,1,5,1,2023,22,'064',NULL,7161,5805,7482,8,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'The introduction is perhaps shorter than it should be as the characters are not introduced there. There are some grammatical errors within the introduction such as: \'The genre of the story is in particular is historical/biblical fiction\'. It could have been \'The particular genre of the story is historical/Biblical fiction\'. \r\nThe story line of the book is well explained however the plot summary does not contain the Biblical principles or your opinion of the plot. A shorter retelling of the story would have allowed for more space to explore the characters and how their actions reflect or don\'t reflect Biblical principles.\r\nThe report is well sell out and meets the guidelines for word count and formatting. May God bless you as you continue your education.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:22:11','2023-06-29 08:22:11'),(970,'judge-event-evaluation-833-1687992018',833,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7360,5804,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:40:18','2023-06-29 08:40:18'),(972,'judge-event-evaluation-204-1687992198',204,21,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7147,5805,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:43:18','2023-06-29 08:43:18'),(973,'judge-event-evaluation-865-1687992371',865,10,1,5,1,2023,22,'064',NULL,7281,1467,7482,8,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,-2.00,'This is a well written report, however it lacks the identification and application of biblical principles that is a requirement. Marks were deducted for this.\r\nA further 2 marks were deducted for not including the word count. Overall though, the content was grammatically correct and the book was well examined.\r\nMay God bless you as you continue your education and grow in Him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:46:11','2023-06-29 08:46:11'),(974,'judge-event-evaluation-1007-1687992445',1007,28,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7268,5806,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:47:25','2023-06-29 08:47:25'),(975,'judge-event-evaluation-819-1687992562',819,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7345,5804,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:49:22','2023-06-29 08:49:22'),(976,'judge-event-evaluation-230-1687992790',230,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7327,4451,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 08:53:10','2023-06-29 08:53:10'),(977,'judge-event-evaluation-1079-1687993267',1079,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7121,5805,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'The story is well thought out and captivating to read. There are some punctuation errors and grammatical errors. This sentence, \'shouted the frail doe-eyed woman who was more than content with storytelling with five of her adored grandchildren who were spending their holidays together for the first time in five years.\', could have been broken into smaller sentences making it easier to read. The description of the grandmother as a frail, doe-eyed woman could have been included in the first mention of the woman.\r\nOverall, the story presented Biblical principles well and applied them to the characters. May God bless you as you continue your education and grow in Him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:01:07','2023-06-29 09:01:07'),(978,'judge-event-evaluation-370-1687993267',370,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7329,4451,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:01:07','2023-06-29 09:01:07'),(979,'judge-event-evaluation-591-1687993386',591,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7351,5804,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:03:06','2023-06-29 09:03:06'),(980,'judge-event-evaluation-71-1687993569',71,32,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7334,5826,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:06:09','2023-06-29 09:06:09'),(981,'judge-event-evaluation-466-1687993662',466,8,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7083,6328,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:07:42','2023-06-29 09:07:42'),(982,'judge-event-evaluation-1008-1687993916',1008,28,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7262,5806,7371,17,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:11:56','2023-06-29 09:11:56'),(983,'judge-event-evaluation-442-1687995264',442,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7403,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Monica, It\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour piece is very pretty and fresh.  Did you quite finish the centre of the bottom flower?  You haven\'t uploaded your visual art report, so I am unsure of your process.  Did you draw from your imagination or did you use a reference?\r\n\r\nYou have made a creditable effort to show how the light would fall on the curving parts of the petals.  The leaves would also have light variation.   Drawing and painting from a real object is the best way to truly observe colour shifts and light effects.  The overlaying of the parts of the plant provides a sense of perspective.  It can help to lighten objects in the background - even the parts of a plant.\r\n\r\nWell done, keep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:34:24','2023-06-29 09:34:24'),(984,'judge-event-evaluation-1462-1687995789',1462,20,1,5,1,2023,294,'914',NULL,7232,394,7452,49,'Collection','24',100,65.00,-10,0.00,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:43:09','2023-06-29 09:43:09'),(985,'judge-event-evaluation-680-1687995797',680,19,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7330,4451,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Phebe, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour ducks are drawn extremely well.  You have really captured the posture of flight in two different poses perfectly.\r\n\r\nI think your colouring-in could have shown a bit more detail, particularly in the landscape.  Using different pencil strokes, you can add texture and a sense of plants, variations in slope, and so on.  The ducks could have had more coloured detail to show where the light would fall on the upper sections.  Underneath them would be darker and reflect some of the colours that are in the ground plane.\r\n\r\nIf you take on board these suggestions, you can produce something really wonderful next year with your ability to draw.  When you can draw, you can practice to develop other skills, but drawing is always foundational and you have that sorted.\r\n\r\nWell done.  Keep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:43:17','2023-06-29 09:43:17'),(986,'judge-event-evaluation-457-1687996180',457,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7404,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Rocky, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nIt\'s pleasing to see that you have endeavoured to show the change in colour in the sky from a lighter (greenish) blue towards the horizon, changing up to a darker (more purplish) blue higher up.  I think the transition should be more gradual, however.  The change in colour in the sea water is also well perceived.\r\n\r\nYou have made a good effort to put shading under the areas of foliage on the foreground trees as you would expect if the light was coming from directly above.  I don\'t think this is handled consistently in the foreground grassy area - I am unsure about the slope of the ground given the colours you have used.\r\n\r\nTry to avoid outlining as it makes the picture seem cartoonish.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 09:49:40','2023-06-29 09:49:40'),(990,'judge-event-evaluation-1075-1687997019',1075,7,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7163,6785,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,46.00,-10,0.00,'Sorry, Ezekiel I think you show less effort in delivering your \"expressive reading\".  Next time at least you can stand straight (do not lean on the wall) to show your enthusiasm.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 10:03:39','2023-06-29 10:03:39'),(991,'judge-event-evaluation-1239-1687997523',1239,28,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7249,5806,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,73.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Ebenezer! I can see you put effort into this, yet it would be great if you show more expressions and enthusiasm in your expressive reading. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 10:12:03','2023-06-29 10:12:03'),(994,'judge-event-evaluation-979-1687998571',979,8,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7072,6328,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This is a well written and engrossing story. You have brought the emotions felt by the characters to life and shown how they applied biblical principles to the situations they were in.\r\nThe sentence structure and punctuation is correctly done, making the story flow well. We have removed some points however as you have indicated your sister assisted with editing the story. \r\nMay God continue to bless you as you learn and grow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 10:29:31','2023-06-29 10:29:31'),(996,'judge-event-evaluation-1157-1687999440',1157,21,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7141,5805,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Frederick! The message from this reading is so good, like it! I can see you had practice and prepare your self well. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 10:44:00','2023-06-29 10:44:00'),(997,'judge-event-evaluation-1098-1687999488',1098,30,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7282,769,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Fidel! I like watching your expressive reading, you deliver it so good. The message also clear. Putting more expression to your face will make it perfect!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 10:44:48','2023-06-29 10:44:48'),(998,'judge-event-evaluation-1537-1688000187',1537,17,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7385,4200,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,71.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Immanuel! You deliver your expressive reading with clear voice and good intonation. Boost up your confidence, you can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 10:56:27','2023-06-29 10:56:28'),(1000,'judge-event-evaluation-986-1688001597',986,8,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7063,6328,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Great work, Benjamin! You have a lovely gift.\r\nAs you practice and progress with piano, you will benefit from correcting your posture, finger technique, and hand position. With strong, curved fingers you will be ready for more technical pieces. The other thing to work on is dynamics. This is a very moving song, and the music provides lots of opportunities for crescendo and decrescendo, and letting the right-hand melody \"sing\" out over the top of the left-hand accompaniment. For example, the last two lines are supposed to be P (soft), so that the song can wind down gently, but you almost played it triumphantly! You can make the music show great emotion through dynamics. \r\nWell done, keep up the good work!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 11:19:57','2023-06-29 11:19:57'),(1003,'judge-event-evaluation-1252-1688002574',1252,28,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7256,5806,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work!\r\n\r\nI understand that dynamics are really hard to capture on a keyboard, but it is important to pay close attention to when the sheet music indicates louds and softs, pauses, phrasing, and even the rit at the end could be more exaggerated.\r\nI also noticed you didn\'t roll the chords as the music indicates. The squiggly line next the chord means you are the play the notes in quick succession, rather than simultaneously as a normal chord. \r\nYou have a lovely gift, keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 11:36:14','2023-06-29 11:36:14'),(1004,'judge-event-evaluation-192-1688003167',192,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7211,4208,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'While the story has a strong Biblical theme, there are some edits that were missed. Reading the story carefully again noting that characters have the correct names and that their activities are accurately described would add to the readability and understanding of the reader. \r\nExamples are paragraph 2 where the character Mere is referred to as Ester and paragraph 3 where the character is said to be \'reading\' to Kim Kardashian, when it is likely that the character is actually cleaning. The name Maylene is mentioned at least twice and it is possible this refers to Mere as there is no context to link the name to another character. There are some missing punctuation marks as well.\r\nOverall, the story has a good message but ensuring that you re-read it carefully to pick up errors will help with future writing. May God bless you as you continue your education.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 11:46:07','2023-06-29 11:46:08'),(1005,'judge-event-evaluation-198-1688003713',198,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7183,4208,5,8,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Aviella, \r\nThank you for being a part of student convention! Unfortunately, by copying and pasting text directly from other sources, this entry has been marked as a breach of guidelines. If you are using other sources to help, make sure you reference properly and provide a bibliography. It is also good to change the information into your own words, instead of using direct quotes. This shows a better understanding of the topic. \r\nGod Bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 11:55:13','2023-06-29 11:56:35'),(1006,'judge-event-evaluation-1090-1688003826',1090,20,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7089,394,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Clarissa, that was lovely! And what a blessing to have the opportunity to play on a Kawai Grand!!!\r\n\r\nMake sure you keep your wrists up and fingers curved when you play, it is better technique and give you a much lighter touch on the piano. This is a song, sung by the right hand. The left hand plays an accompaniment only, and should be very soft - it was a little overpowering and distracting. This balance between the right and left hand is a difficult skill to learn, but I\'m sure that if you are aware of it you will master it beautifully.\r\nWell done, keep up the good work.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 11:57:06','2023-06-29 11:57:07'),(1008,'judge-event-evaluation-931-1688004704',931,11,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7026,613,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Cameron, lovely work!\r\n\r\nI could see that you struggled from around bar 34 as it gets trickier. The left hand is naturally more clumsy, and requires a lot more practice for dexterity. Apart from strength and dexterity, technique plays a big part in allowing your fingers to better navigate the notes. Ask your teacher to help you with hand position and finger curve - if you play up on the tips of your fingers, you will have more movement for those fiddly bits of music.\r\n\r\nThis is a tricky piece because the melody switches from right to left, so you have done well. With some technique correction and strengthening exercises, you will do really well! \r\nGod bless, keep up the great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:11:44','2023-06-29 12:11:44'),(1010,'judge-event-evaluation-434-1688005527',434,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7406,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Samuel,\r\n\r\nIt\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour picture has good impact, given the vibrancy of the colours.  Since you didn\'t include your visual arts report, I don\'t know whether you drew this from a picture or your imagination, but I would guess the latter as it has a number of errors.  The light is very strong in the background, but your shadows are on the undersurface of the foliage, where the whole back of the objects (facing the viewer) should be in shadow.  Also, the bottom of the boat should appear to be horizontal, as the curved base would be underwater.  With such a strong orange in the sky, some of that colour would appear in the foliage in the foreground.\r\n\r\nAvoid outlining as this makes your picture look cartoonish.\r\n\r\nYou have a good sense of colour and have made a strong effort to draw something well.  Keep using your gifts for the Lord.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:25:27','2023-06-29 12:25:28'),(1011,'judge-event-evaluation-1188-1688005826',1188,21,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7153,5805,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Galilee, that was lovely! You have a gentle and skillful touch. \r\n\r\nIt\'s a shame about the slip up in the middle, but you actually recovered so well! This is just nerves from performing, and you did well to keep going and remember the rest.\r\n\r\nI would like to hear you carry the melody of the song more strongly - really let it sing out over the rest. That\'s a difficult skill to learn, but I can see you would be able to master it beautifully.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work, God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:30:26','2023-06-29 12:30:26'),(1012,'judge-event-evaluation-1298-1688005995',1298,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7409,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Shalem, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour drawing of the panda and bamboo is very cute.  I like the leaves and the sections on the bamboo as well as the panda.  Your drawing is done confidently.  You could have increased the contrast between light areas that face the sun and dark areas that face downward to create a more three dimensional effect.  Also, I\'m a bit confused about the branch of bamboo that crosses in front of the upright piece next to the panda but behind the panda\'s ear.  It seems you drew it in and then attempted to add the panda in front of it.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you have not included your visual arts report, so I\'m not sure what your process was.\r\n\r\nYou did a good job with your pencil strokes, showing the direction of the hair growth.  It would add to the sense of form/volume if you added some shading in the white areas of the panda\'s fur, such as under the nose and chin.\r\n\r\nWell done, keep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:33:15','2023-06-29 12:33:15'),(1013,'judge-event-evaluation-1299-1688006492',1299,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7431,4200,6990,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Shalom,  it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour piece is lovely, with good visual impact.  You have done a great job showing where the light would fall and guiding your pencil strokes in the direction of the feathers.  Your shading is good, and your care in that direction is evident in the way you have shaded the white flowers.  I do wonder about the black background, which might be a bit heavy for the subject, but it has it\'s own merits.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, your visual arts report has not been included, so I can\'t comment as I might have on your technique.\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing your work next year.  Keep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:41:32','2023-06-29 12:41:32'),(1015,'judge-event-evaluation-432-1688006807',432,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7407,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sheryl, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.  \r\n\r\nYour peacock drawing is extremely well done.  The colouring in could be a bit more vibrant, particularly in the \"eyes\" in the tail feathers, which would have given them more definition.  I suspect the head feathers should all come from a close area on the top of the head, rather than being spread out like you have depicted them.  \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you have not included your visual arts report, so I can\'t comment as much on your technique as I might otherwise have done.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:46:47','2023-06-29 12:46:47'),(1017,'judge-event-evaluation-199-1688007541',199,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7192,4208,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Job well done! Great job summarizing the story, explaining the character motivations and bringing across the main lessons you learnt. There was good flow to your writing and presentation of ideas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 12:59:01','2023-06-29 12:59:01'),(1018,'judge-event-evaluation-852-1688007669',852,20,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7093,394,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Stephanie,\r\n\r\nIt\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour drawing skills are very good.  There\'s a good sense of perspective.  This is an interesting variation of Michelangelo\'s painting.  It\'s interesting that you chose an Amish style, not depicting features.\r\n\r\nThank you for including your visual arts report, though it would be easy to miss as it is on the bottom of the document including your picture.\r\n\r\nDespite not depicting features, you have shown faces.  The convention guidelines clearly state: \"5. Coloured Pencils are to be consistent with a Biblical Worldview and must not portray the face of Christ.\"  Therefore, your picture is disqualified.  Try again next year with a different subject and you will do very well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:01:09','2023-07-01 14:12:53'),(1019,'judge-event-evaluation-1297-1688007779',1297,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7415,4200,6990,17,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Haru, it\'s great to see you involved in student convention.  May it be a blessing to you.\r\n\r\nYour portrait is delightful, confidently and skilfully done.  You have used a wonderful variety of textural effects, particularly evident in the top the girl is wearing.\r\n\r\nMy suggestions for improving are that you should avoid outlining (seen particularly in the ear and around the mouth, the colour of which should blend softly with the surrounding skin) and evidence of the direction of light should produce good highlights with corresponding darks in the shadows.\r\n\r\nKeep using your gifts for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:02:59','2023-06-29 13:02:59'),(1020,'judge-event-evaluation-1249-1688007842',1249,11,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7025,613,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'That was lovely, Kathleen! \r\n\r\nI immediately want to say, WELL DONE on bringing out the melody in the section starting at bar 33! That is a difficult skill, and you nailed it.\r\n\r\nThe ralls and rit needed more attention, as this really enhances the mood of your performance. Particularly, the rit at the end, pulling right back to a slow and soft pp, in contrast to the rest.\r\n\r\nYou need to work on your finger technique - strengthing and positioning them to play on the tips, rather than flat. This will completely change the tone of your music, softening it, and giving you more control over the phrasing, as well as preparing you for more technically difficult pieces.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:04:02','2023-06-29 13:04:02'),(1021,'judge-event-evaluation-808-1688007950',808,19,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7316,4451,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Holly! You have beautiful finger technique. \r\n\r\nI think you\'re sitting too close to the piano - pull your chair back, and sit on the edge. This gives your arms freer movement, and you will avoid sounding or feeling stiff when you play.\r\nThe next thing to work on will be dynamics, particuarly noticing the louds and softs, crescendos etc. This is also a swing style, so you can make the notes really sing by emphasising particular notes. Play around until you like the sound of it.\r\n\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:05:50','2023-06-29 13:05:50'),(1022,'judge-event-evaluation-919-1688008303',919,8,1,5,1,2023,294,'914',NULL,7076,6328,7452,49,'Collection','24',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'You\'re doing great Jordan. Putting more enthusiasm would make it perfect.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:11:43','2023-06-29 13:11:43'),(1024,'judge-event-evaluation-802-1688008433',802,32,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7333,5826,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Good work. The way you married your thoughts with the events happening in the plot was done quite well. Shows you\'ve taken time to really understand what you\'re reading. Pilgrim\'s Progress (original) is a personal favourite of mine. Think you did well in highlighting and explaining the main lessons from the story. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:13:53','2023-06-29 13:13:53'),(1025,'judge-event-evaluation-809-1688008460',809,19,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7317,4451,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Laura!\r\n\r\nI would like you to pull the chair out from the piano and sit on the front edge. This gives your arms freer movement, and your pedal foot can work correctly - You shouldn\'t have to lift the entire leg, just work the toe. Keep you wrists up and your fingers curved - playing on the tips, not flat. This will help you as you learn more technical pieces in the future.\r\nConsider this piece for the song that it is - you want the right hand to sing, and the left hand to quietly accompany. Getting the left hand to be gentle and not overpowering is a difficult skill, but I know you can do it! \r\nKeep up the good work, and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:14:20','2023-06-29 13:14:20'),(1026,'judge-event-evaluation-444-1688008643',444,17,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7420,4200,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Should this entry be Watercolour?\r\n*A report has not been included.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:17:23','2023-07-04 11:13:28'),(1028,'judge-event-evaluation-676-1688008770',676,19,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7328,4451,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Luke,\r\n\r\nThanks for your entry, it looks like you have enjoyed learning piano! Keep going!\r\n\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:19:30','2023-06-29 13:19:30'),(1030,'judge-event-evaluation-582-1688009304',582,15,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7040,4679,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely, Marvella.\r\n\r\nIt seems that you have arranged this yourself? That\'s wonderful if you have, and a great skill for both your pleasure and for use in a church band. The music score you supplied wasn\'t accurate, of course, so I had to deduct marks.\r\n\r\nAs this is played alone, without a band, you need to consider the dynamics carefully, to make this a solo performance. \r\nKeep up the good work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:28:24','2023-06-29 13:28:24'),(1031,'judge-event-evaluation-1517-1688009452',1517,17,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7388,4200,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Pierre! You naturally deliver your expressive reading. Overall you\'re doing good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:30:52','2023-06-29 13:30:52'),(1032,'judge-event-evaluation-290-1688009792',290,12,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6993,1132,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work, Matthew.\r\n\r\nYou play well! Dynamics add a lot of interest and beauty to your work, so that is where I see the most need for improvement. You played smoothly and comfortably, with good memory and poise. Well done.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:36:32','2023-06-29 13:36:32'),(1033,'judge-event-evaluation-900-1688010353',900,8,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7077,6328,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Michael, that was brilliant.\r\n\r\nYou showed great technique and technical ability, as well as displaying your musical ear. Well done on memorisation.\r\nBe careful to keep your tempo even, as you seemed to speed up through the more exciting parts toward the end. Your careful quiet ending was very powerful - I feel that you could bring a bit more of that intensity to the start as well.\r\nYou have an obvious natural talent, as well as what I\'m sure is many many hours of dedication and practice.\r\nKeep up the great work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:45:53','2023-06-29 13:45:53'),(1034,'judge-event-evaluation-1038-1688010466',1038,7,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7164,6785,7452,44,'Collection','24',100,58.00,-10,0.00,'Obadiah, I think you can deliver your expressive reading better if you practice more and putting more expressions as well into your work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:47:46','2023-06-29 13:47:46'),(1035,'judge-event-evaluation-875-1688010626',875,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6985,1678,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely, Naylla.\r\n\r\nIt looks like you\'re enjoying learning! Keep up the good work.\r\n\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:50:26','2023-06-29 13:50:26'),(1036,'judge-event-evaluation-505-1688011090',505,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6981,1678,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful, Olyvia!\r\n\r\nYou have great technique, and play sweetly. I would like to hear a few more dynamics in this piece, to really make the melody sing, but I did like what I heard. Perhaps the rit at the end could be more pronounced, also. \r\nThis was a lovely performance, and I hope to see more from you in the future.\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 13:58:10','2023-06-29 13:58:10'),(1037,'judge-event-evaluation-510-1688011456',510,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6979,1678,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work!\r\n\r\nNow that you can play the notes well, it\'s time to work on dynamics. This is a very beautiful and moving song, and with proper dynamics you can make the music really speak. Take note of the rit at the end, and although this music score doesn\'t include louds and softs, you need to use your own musical ability to feel where to crescendo and descrendo, and what notes to add emphasis to.\r\nKeep up the good work, you are doing well!\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:04:16','2023-06-29 14:04:16'),(1038,'judge-event-evaluation-753-1688011715',753,20,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7089,394,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasant piece of visual art.\r\n*More detail in the report would be helpful\r\n*A creative piece.\r\nThank you for sharing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:08:35','2023-06-29 14:08:35'),(1039,'judge-event-evaluation-876-1688011734',876,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6986,1678,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Rachel.\r\n\r\nI really liked how you made the melody sing out over the top of the left hand. Most students struggle to get that balance right, so you did really well! \r\nEven though the music score is simple, you can add plenty of dynamics to make the piece more interesting. \r\nKeep it up, God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:08:54','2023-06-29 14:08:54'),(1040,'judge-event-evaluation-586-1688012101',586,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7349,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Full marks for your effort, Elanie.\r\nIt is obviously your first attempt at something like this and there is opportunity for improving.\r\nThank you for sharing.\r\n.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:15:01','2023-06-29 14:15:02'),(1041,'judge-event-evaluation-1254-1688012406',1254,28,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7245,5806,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you Solomoni!\r\n\r\nI understand it is very hard to use dynamics effectively on a keyboard, but is something that you can still consider and work on, as it will add a lot of beauty to your music. The other thing to work on would be your finger position - play up on the tips, keeping a strong curve in your fingers. This will help you greatly with those quick running notes.\r\nKeep up the good work! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:20:06','2023-06-29 14:20:06'),(1042,'judge-event-evaluation-467-1688012539',467,8,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7065,6328,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Elena for this pleasant piece.\r\n*Progress your skill with curved lines to emphasise shape.\r\n*Care with the Report would be helpful.\r\nEnjoy more opportunities to share your talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 14:22:19','2023-06-29 14:22:20'),(1045,'judge-event-evaluation-1074-1688016041',1074,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7118,5805,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'While the actions of main characters, Jason and Sophie, do have a Christian tone to them, there is no mention of Biblical principles nor is there an evangelistic theme. This omission has reduced the possible marks. \r\nIn three places, there is no space after a comma so marks were reduced for punctuation. \r\nIt was not necessary to describe the bakery worker Cassy as nice as there is no context to this statement and the male worker was not described with any adjectives.\r\nThe above comments aside, the story flows well, the scene has been set, and the actions of the characters are described clearly. Keep on writing and growing in God as you continue your education.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:20:41','2023-06-29 15:20:41'),(1046,'judge-event-evaluation-451-1688016262',451,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7393,4200,7462,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing work ! I love the use of shading and textures to create the shapes and edges of the giraffe.\r\nKeep up the awesome sketch works and keep inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:24:22','2023-06-29 15:24:22'),(1047,'judge-event-evaluation-193-1688017048',193,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7198,4208,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'The message in the story is based on the Biblical principles of kindness and forgiveness. This is brought out well in the tale of the two friends. \r\nThere are a number of grammatical and punctuation errors which reduced the available marks. The word count is on the lower end of the permitted length, so the story could have been filled out with more detail and descriptions.\r\nMay God bless you as you continue to write and learn.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:37:28','2023-06-29 15:37:28'),(1048,'judge-event-evaluation-430-1688017735',430,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7392,4200,7462,17,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Seungju ! Your artwork has good perspective and use of different textures.\r\nI would recommend not using continuous straight and solid lines(e.g building outline) too often as it takes away from the art as a \"sketch\" , which is the use of varying lines and shading.\r\nKeep up the great work !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:48:55','2023-06-29 15:48:55'),(1049,'judge-event-evaluation-1309-1688017738',1309,17,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7385,4200,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'A very pleasant piece, Immanuel.\r\n*A Report was not included as required.\r\n*I am sure that you will use your God-given talent to capture more pleasant pieces that honour God\'s creation.\r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:48:58','2023-06-29 15:48:58'),(1050,'judge-event-evaluation-194-1688018007',194,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7194,4208,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'The story sets the scene of where Hakim\'s family came from and where he ended up very well. The evangelistic message is presented clearly and the plot develops clearly. Overall, a well written story. \r\nThere are some minor word misuses, such as buses zoomed pass rather than buses zoomed past. A careful re-read of the story after completion can help to pick up little errors like this.\r\nKeep on writing with passion and growing in God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:53:27','2023-06-29 15:53:27'),(1051,'judge-event-evaluation-598-1688018133',598,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7353,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jacob for your effort.\r\n*Lines and shading can be worked for a captivating drawing.\r\n*May you continue to develop your talent.\r\nA pleasing piece. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 15:55:33','2023-06-29 15:55:34'),(1052,'judge-event-evaluation-1466-1688019597',1466,11,1,5,1,2023,186,'467','1',0,613,7481,15,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!\r\nI enjoyed listening to your radio play. It had a great message that was conveyed in a fun script. \r\nThe radio play captured my attention from the begining to end and brought the characters to life. \r\nExcellent submission',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:19:57','2023-06-29 16:19:57'),(1053,'judge-event-evaluation-1450-1688019825',1450,13,1,5,1,2023,186,'467','4',0,4208,7481,15,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'I liked the team work that was evident throughout your submission. I found it difficult to follow at times and often had to re listen to sections and read the script to understand what was happening. \r\nMy suggestion would be to set the scene at the beginning of the play so listeners could follow what was happening easily. \r\nYour diction was good and your characters realistic. \r\nWell done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:23:45','2023-06-29 16:23:45'),(1055,'judge-event-evaluation-193-1688020228',193,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7198,4208,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Mechanics:\r\n1.  \" Harry, as new student\"      Should be:  Harry, as a new student.\r\n2.  beautiful sunny day: everyone had.....\r\n     After a few matches of volleyball: Mr. Hicks had to leave....\r\n3.  new players went in on the court\"       Should be:  new players went onto the court\r\n4.  Harry said: \"Serve.\"     Should be:  Harry said, \"Serve.\"\r\n5.  The game started. After 4 minutes Harry said: \"The score is 10 to 3.\" \r\n      Should be:  The game started.  After 4 minutes Harry said, \"The score is 10 to 13.\"  \r\n6.  Harry started to cry as his mum asked,    Should be:  Harry started to cry.  His mum asked,\r\n7.   and I had send him messages      Should be:  and I had sent him messages\r\n8.   It is ok my friend       Should be:  It is ok, my friend,\r\n\r\nNOTE:  Use colons to introduce quotations after an independent clause.\r\n            Use a comma when introducing quotations after a dependent clause.\r\nNOTE:  Do NOT use a semicolon between an independent and a dependent clause ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:30:28','2023-06-29 16:30:28'),(1056,'judge-event-evaluation-999-1688020653',999,21,1,5,1,2023,186,'467','1',0,5805,7481,15,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your submission. \r\nUnfortunately I had to deduct points as no script was supplied. This may have been an over sight. Your play went over by 32 seconds however I did not deduct points for this. Your choice of topic was controversial so I was impressed at how you managed this topic. Relating it to the Bible was very good. \r\nAs your radio play was in a panel/interview style it was difficult to provide high marks for criteria such as creativity, mood, sound effects and degree of difficulty.\r\nI liked the team work involved in creating this radio play. \r\n\r\n ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:37:33','2023-06-29 16:37:33'),(1057,'judge-event-evaluation-224-1688021353',224,19,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,7321,4451,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great Work! Next time be sure to include a picture of the original.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:49:13','2023-06-29 16:49:13'),(1058,'judge-event-evaluation-537-1688021494',537,3,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,6982,1678,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Your painting is lovely. Keep developing your talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:51:34','2023-06-29 16:51:34'),(1059,'judge-event-evaluation-489-1688021663',489,15,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,7049,4679,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Keep developing your talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:54:23','2023-06-29 16:54:23'),(1060,'judge-event-evaluation-220-1688021790',220,19,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,7328,4451,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'I love your painting! Keep developing your talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:56:30','2023-06-29 16:56:31'),(1061,'judge-event-evaluation-573-1688021959',573,19,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,7325,4451,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great work! Next time be sure to submit a picture of the original. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 16:59:19','2023-06-29 16:59:19'),(1062,'judge-event-evaluation-857-1688022048',857,20,1,5,1,2023,189,'501',NULL,7090,394,7441,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful picture!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 17:00:48','2023-06-29 17:00:48'),(1063,'judge-event-evaluation-194-1688022395',194,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7194,4208,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'I like your choice of setting and the way that your main character was drawn to the church and that he was willing to wait upon the Lord and let him direct his path.  You have told an excellent tale and it was most enjoyable to read.  You have used complex sentences and sentences with insertion of additional information that paint a picture for the reader more clearly.  Well done!\r\n\r\nMechanics:  There are just a few points.\r\n1.  \" ..the couple had saved the sufficient funds\"                       Take out \"the\"\r\n2.  \" Hakim, now seventeen new that....\"                                       Add a comma after 17    \r\n3.  \" ....something that seemed to caused him to forget\"        Replace \"caused\" with \"cause\"\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 17:06:35','2023-06-29 17:06:35'),(1064,'judge-event-evaluation-1144-1688025285',1144,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7156,5805,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'I like the \'Diary Timeline\" you have used to portray your story through time.  \r\n\r\nMechanics:\r\n1. \" Henry Eldon was born in a healthy family...\"        Put \"into\"  instead of in.\r\n2. \"He was spotted by the priest standing in the corner of the altar.\"  This could mean many things. \r\n Was the priest standing \"in\" the corner of the altar or near the corner of the altar?  Who was actually standing in the corner of the altar?\r\n3.  \"Everyone went silent for a moment till\"                 Take out \"till\" and add \"until\" \r\n4.  You have used some long sentences with several conjunctions to run them on this causes what you are saying to lose it\'s impact. These sentences could be broken up into some shorter sentences to create more impact.\r\n5.   Some commas missing.\r\n6.   Starting a sentence with so also causes things to run on and into each other.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 17:54:45','2023-06-29 17:54:45'),(1065,'judge-event-evaluation-195-1688026554',195,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7196,4208,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'You linked the end of the story well to the title of the story.  Having conditions where you cannot go outdoors and be like other people can be very hard to deal with day in and day out as you watch others that can do things you can\'t.  Often people feel isolated and do not know what to do or who to turn to in their sadness.  Your story provides a spiritual solution of a. turning to God in prayer and b. being thankful in whatever situation you find yourself to be in.  I like your introduction.....\"Once upon a coconut tree....\"  \r\n\r\nMechanics:\r\n1.   \"One day as Neveah was sitting in her house, when her mother came running in.\"  \r\n       Take \"when\" out as it is not needed\r\n2.   \"So many questions kept were stirring in her head.\"\r\n       Use either \"kept stirring in her head\"  or  \"were stirring in her head\"\r\n\r\n1.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 18:15:54','2023-06-29 18:15:54'),(1066,'judge-event-evaluation-544-1688027729',544,3,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,6966,1678,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'What a unique scape. It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nI like the way the main subject stands out in this photo scape. \r\nThank you for your submission.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 18:35:29','2023-06-29 18:35:29'),(1067,'judge-event-evaluation-1135-1688028443',1135,46,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7444,4504,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Your documentation did not match your scape submission. I am wondering if you were meaning to submit two different scapes? \r\nIt was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nI liked the feeling of distance you created. I could also feel the atmosphere with the cloud cover.\r\nThank you for your submission.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 18:47:23','2023-06-29 18:47:23'),(1068,'judge-event-evaluation-1509-1688028791',1509,17,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7393,4200,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Unfortunately I could not provide any marks for documentation as the report was not completed correctly. It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nI liked the reflection on the water but the lightening and exposure needed more attention. \r\nThe fact you tied the photo back to The Lord was wonderful. \r\nThank you for your submission. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 18:53:11','2023-06-29 18:53:11'),(1069,'judge-event-evaluation-1080-1688029348',1080,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7123,5805,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'I loved this story and the way in which the mother explained to her son about friendship.  She spoke the truth in love.  You have a very mature insight into the nature of people and the friendships that they form and you have used your insight well to portray the child and how he was feeling.  You made the characters real and true to life.  Thank you. \r\n\r\n Mechanics:\r\n1.  \" It was a late Sunday afternoon, little Alex tiredly..\"     It is better to use a semicolon than a comma.\r\n2.  \"door for her son’s soon arrival. \"                                      Imminent would be a better word than soon.\r\n3.  \"“what\'s got you....\"                                                                     Change lower case to an upper case W\r\n4.  \" which required for them to move\"                                      Remove \"for\"\r\n5.  \"“it’s that I’ll just miss him very dearly. \"                                It\'s just that I\'ll miss him very dearly.\r\n6.  A space should follow most punctuation.                          Some places where there was no space\r\n7.   Chin up, Darling, you\'ll make many other new friends.       Write a lower case d for darling.\r\n8.  Mary asked trying to understand her son.                         Put a comma between asked and trying.\r\n9.  who was now leaned on his elbows                                   Wrong verb form.  Use \'leaning\'\r\n10. she looks at her son with a comforting smile,                  *See comment below\r\n11.   problems it may throw at us,                           Change comma to a full-stop to shorten sentence.\r\n12.  “she says as she pauses for a moment and gazes at her son. \"   \r\n      Shorten to \"She pauses for a moment and gazes at her son.\"\r\n13. awhile                                    change to \"a while\"\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 19:02:28','2023-06-29 19:02:28'),(1070,'judge-event-evaluation-630-1688029371',630,8,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7073,6328,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines. The lighting, exposure and colour could have been a little more detailed. \r\nThe cloud cover and rain on the ground created a feeling of winter and the focus of a single tall building was clever. \r\nWell done. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 19:02:51','2023-06-29 19:02:51'),(1073,'judge-event-evaluation-869-1688030491',869,3,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,6968,1678,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nYou have captured the elements of your town very well. It demonstrates the local environment and the various constructions. \r\nWell done. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 19:21:31','2023-06-29 19:21:31'),(1074,'judge-event-evaluation-996-1688030991',996,21,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7115,5805,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Your photo evokes a feeling of calmness and has a good sense of depth. The rays of light radiating into the late afternoon sky are impressive. \r\nOverall you have submitted a vey good scape. Initially the viewers eye is on the ocean but then is drawn to the sunset. Well done.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 19:29:51','2023-06-29 19:29:52'),(1075,'judge-event-evaluation-702-1688031427',702,17,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7424,4200,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines. You have not submitted the completed the correct photography report. \r\nI do like the way you have captured the tower as a focus with the natural landscape. You have a great angle to this scape. The lighting and colour is vey good as well. \r\nIt is evident you have a wonderful eye for photography. \r\nIt is heart warming how you considered scripture when viewing this scape. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 19:37:07','2023-06-29 19:37:07'),(1077,'judge-event-evaluation-1089-1688033584',1089,20,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7091,394,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Evangelo, thank you so much for submitting this recording of this wonderful song. From the way that you sing it, I can tell that this song means a lot to you. \r\nWhen singing acapella, it can be very difficult to maintain a consistent key. So I would like to encourage you to sing with an accompaniment of some sort - piano or backing track would be great. \r\nI hope you can work with the people around you to further develop your God given gifts. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 20:13:04','2023-06-29 20:13:04'),(1078,'judge-event-evaluation-196-1688034104',196,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7201,4208,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'This really is a story of rags to riches through reliance on the Lord and integrity and honesty.  You have developed your plot well and I could imagine the main character and how he felt as he contemplated his future with the firm.  It is often when we have achieved something that we have wanted that temptation lays at the door.  This story portrays this.  I like the way you had the main character go through job rejection.  This can be a hard thing that many people go through even those with high qualifications.  It is hard to keep thinking, \"God has a reason for this.\"\r\n\r\nMechanics\r\n1.   \"James dreamt nothing more than making....\"            put \'dreamt of nothing more\r\n2.   \"...wondering if he would ever get the life he continually dreamt of but his mother was......\"\r\nThe sentence is too long and needs a full-stop after of.  Take out \'but\' and capital for \"His\"\r\n3.    Spelling:  \'diner\'         Should be \'dinner\'\r\n4.    All they needed was the votes.                                       Correct subject-verb agreement\r\n5.    Word missed:  He was going to the CEO                           He was going to \'be\' the CEO',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 20:21:44','2023-06-29 20:21:44'),(1079,'judge-event-evaluation-1116-1688035189',1116,46,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7444,4504,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'This is a duplicate entry',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 20:39:49','2023-06-29 20:39:49'),(1080,'judge-event-evaluation-1055-1688035849',1055,28,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7278,5806,7481,2,'Open','8,10',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Unfortunately I could not score full marks for your documentation or use of enhancements as the original photo was  not submitted. \r\nThis was a unique scape photo. The focus was on the sand environment instead of the ocean, this demonstrated an original idea. The only suggest I have is that if you could have captured a crab or some creature on the sand it would have added a wonderful element. I agree with you there is a warmth to the photo but would have liked to see you deepen the colour of the sand to bring more feeling into the shot. \r\nThank you for submitting this photo. You have a true talent for seeing beauty that God has created. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 20:50:49','2023-06-29 20:50:49'),(1081,'judge-event-evaluation-989-1688036113',989,21,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7113,5805,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. This is such a wonderful scape. It has feeling, movement and depth. \r\nI have no suggestions as you have submitted an excellent scape. A true talent. \r\nThis photo captures the beauty of God\'s creation of our coastal environment. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 20:55:13','2023-06-29 20:55:13'),(1082,'judge-event-evaluation-1054-1688036195',1054,28,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7258,5806,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nThis scape evokes a number of emotions. The house stands out but is also minimised by the impressive backdrop. Very clever composition. The \'mist\' surrounding the central rock formation actually draws your eye. Another creative element. \r\nYour submission has wonderful depth and feeling while being simple. Well done on an impressive submission. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 20:56:35','2023-06-29 20:56:35'),(1085,'judge-event-evaluation-1198-1688039463',1198,21,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7143,5805,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Jordan, thank you so much for singing this beautiful piece. I could really hear the musical phrasing that you were going for. However, I think you could exaggerate it even more! If you use your full diaphragm to breath in, you will be able to increase your air supply helping to further project the climaxes and the quieter parts could be even quieter with a projected soft voice. \r\nYou have a beautiful voice, and I hope that you continue to develop it because your voice is a gift that God has given to you to minister to the people around you. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 21:51:03','2023-06-29 21:51:04'),(1086,'judge-event-evaluation-824-1688040941',824,25,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7340,5804,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a fantastic piece of literature. You have done an amazing job of telling the creation story. It\'s incredibly challenging to take a passage like this and turn it into poetry. \r\n\r\nI\'d encourage you to continue working on your rhyming and getting the rhythm from one line to the next. You have the right idea and I\'m keen to see you continue to submit more work. \r\n\r\nMay God bless you as you continue with your writing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 22:15:41','2023-06-29 22:15:41'),(1087,'judge-event-evaluation-64-1688041353',64,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7320,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very clever piece of poetry. You have used rhyming and rhythm very effectively. On top of that, you have a story woven in. \r\n\r\nMy one bit of feedback would be this. Where does the story end? Did the people repent? Did God destroy them? People can look this up, but it would have helped the poem if we found out. \r\n\r\nYou have a clear talent for this. I really want to see more of your poetry. May God bless you as you develop this talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 22:22:33','2023-06-29 22:22:33'),(1088,'judge-event-evaluation-825-1688042750',825,25,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7345,5804,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Fantastic writing! You have done a good job of telling this story. You have good meter and great rhythm throughout this story. \r\n\r\nTaking a story and telling it in a poem is really hard, but you did a really good job of it. Your rhyming is also really good throughout. The few lines that don\'t rhyme still maintain the rhythm. \r\n\r\nMay God continue to bless you with your writing!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 22:45:50','2023-06-29 22:45:50'),(1089,'judge-event-evaluation-496-1688043243',496,15,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7043,4679,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,-2.00,'This is an amazing poem and I could feel the emotion and feeling jumping out at me. You have a gift for this and I want you to keep pursuing your writing. \r\n\r\nYou have such great skill that I feel like you could have written a longer poem and it could have been even better. On top of that, the poem should have been smaller font and on white paper like the guidelines require. That eye for detail would have helped pick up some easy points. \r\n\r\nI felt really blessed by reading your work. Hopefully I get to see more of it in the future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 22:54:03','2023-07-05 09:53:07'),(1090,'judge-event-evaluation-579-1688043648',579,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7169,394,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'This is a great poem and showed great talent. I\'m particularly impressed by the narrative that you have painted of the missionary life. I\'m someone who is considering a calling to mission and it struck me as very true. It was hopeful as well as being a good piece of literature. \r\n\r\nGreat work, and I hope you keep using this gift. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 23:00:48','2023-06-29 23:00:48'),(1091,'judge-event-evaluation-678-1688044574',678,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7092,394,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'I really like your poem. You have conveyed a great sense of God\'s goodness and His power in your life. You have a great testimony and I\'m so pleased that you shared it with me. \r\n\r\nYour writing skills have great potential. That third stanza was particularly good and the rhyming was very clever. A few of the other lines are close but don\'t quite work. I would encourage you to say words out loud to see if they rhyme. Some words look like they rhyme but don\'t actually sound like they rhyme. Keep working away at it. You have a natural grasp of this. God bless you and your testimony.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 23:16:14','2023-06-29 23:16:14'),(1092,'judge-event-evaluation-63-1688045065',63,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7328,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'This is a great poem. It\'s a message that we should all take to heart. Your rhyming, rhythm and meter are all really good. \r\n\r\nI did feel like your skill level would have allowed you to do an even longer and more complex poem. You have great ability, maybe you could do even more. This felt a bit easy for you. \r\n\r\nGod bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 23:24:25','2023-06-29 23:24:25'),(1093,'judge-event-evaluation-62-1688045820',62,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7317,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This was a really well done poem. You have great skills and you really produced a master piece. I can see that you aspired to producing something great, and you succeeded!\r\n\r\nYour rhyming, rhythm and meter were all used very effectively. The mechanics of this poem were very good. You also had a clear and compelling narrative of Lily\'s life. My one point of improvement would be that the reference to God at the end felt like a bit of an afterthought. If you had talked about God blessing self-control earlier in the poem it would have made it feel more natural. \r\n\r\nA really good poem and I really hope to see more of your work one day. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 23:37:00','2023-06-29 23:37:00'),(1094,'judge-event-evaluation-65-1688046541',65,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7323,4451,7478,6,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'This is an amazing poem! You\'re a true poet. That second verse particularly felt inspired. \r\n\r\nYour rhyming was very clever throughout the poem and showed fantastic skill. The rhythm was good too, but it did get a bit shaky towards the end. You put together both a great narrative and a Godly message. \r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing more of this fantastic writing in the future! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-29 23:49:01','2023-06-29 23:49:01'),(1095,'judge-event-evaluation-578-1688047363',578,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7232,394,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a really good poem with a great narrative. Your work really shows a lot of skill and creativity in your rhyming and rhythm. \r\n\r\nUsing short lines is a clever way to make the rhythm more sharp, but unfortunately it limits your ability to convey emotion. I think that you have the skill level to really challenge yourself with a more complex style. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, you only had one comma in the poem. This might have worked if you just got rid of that comma because it would just have been part of your style. But the judge\'s sheet does require proper use of punctuation so you lost some marks there. \r\n\r\nA really good poem, and I hope I get to see more of your work in the future. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:02:43','2023-06-30 00:02:43'),(1096,'judge-event-evaluation-1140-1688047704',1140,21,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7132,5805,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'This is a beautiful and powerful poem. Short, but still intensely emotional and vivid. \r\n\r\nYour rhyming was really good, and you conveyed a clear message. That isn\'t easy in such a short poem. I would have loved to see you write a longer piece with such a high level of skill. \r\n\r\nGreat Job! and God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:08:24','2023-06-30 00:08:24'),(1097,'judge-event-evaluation-61-1688048133',61,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7316,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'This is a clever and witty poem. You have a good message and a narrative throughout. \r\n\r\nYou have a great grasp of rhyme and rhythm. The last couple of lines tied the whole poem together both narrative wise and successfully provided a solution to the tension in the poem. \r\n\r\nI think this is a great stepping stone to writing a more complex poem for you next competition. I look forward to marking your poem next year and reading more of your work.\r\n\r\nGod bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:15:33','2023-06-30 00:15:33'),(1098,'judge-event-evaluation-319-1688048335',319,8,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7081,6328,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,33.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 1, 4, 6, 11, 12, 22, 24, 28, 30, 32, 33, 34, 35, 37, 39, 42, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:18:55','2023-06-30 00:18:55'),(1099,'judge-event-evaluation-424-1688048395',424,17,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7389,4200,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,29.00,NULL,NULL,'Comments:\r\n1. Answers are not written on the  A.C.E. Student Convention Spelling sheet.\r\n2. There are missing details at the top of the spelling sheet (No School name, Year, Region).\r\n\r\nWrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 4, 9, 11, 12, 13, 18, 19, 22, 24, 25, 28, 30, 31, 33, 34, 35, 37, 39, 42, 43, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:19:55','2023-06-30 00:19:55'),(1100,'judge-event-evaluation-426-1688048513',426,17,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7413,4200,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,42.00,NULL,NULL,'Comments:\r\n1. Answers are not written on the  A.C.E. Student Convention Spelling sheet.\r\n2. There are missing details at the top of the spelling sheet (No School name, Year, Region).\r\n\r\nWrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 4, 11, 22, 28, 33, 34, 38, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:21:53','2023-06-30 00:21:53'),(1101,'judge-event-evaluation-1538-1688048825',1538,17,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7382,4200,7478,6,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very well written poem. I like the Biblical message that is both inspiring and aspirational. The prayer at the end was very fitting in the context of the poem. \r\n\r\nYou did lose a couple points for not fitting the formatting requirements on the guidelines. You should have 10-12 point font and 25 mm margins. This is a pretty easy fix.\r\n\r\nYou\'re very talented and your passion came through the writing. I really look forward to seeing more of your work in the future. \r\n\r\nGod bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:27:05','2023-06-30 00:27:05'),(1102,'judge-event-evaluation-60-1688049498',60,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7318,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This is a really clever and creative poem. That last line is particularly brilliant. It is a great picture of exactly what you want to demonstrate. \r\n\r\nYou have a very good grasp of rhythm, and that is shown in this poem. Having short lines allows you to really get a great meter going, but it can limit your ability to convey emotion when the lines are short. \r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing more of your work next year. I think you\'ve got such great skill and I want to see where you go with it.\r\n\r\nGod bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:38:18','2023-06-30 00:38:18'),(1103,'judge-event-evaluation-782-1688049857',782,15,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7045,4679,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'I really enjoyed reading this and hearing your message. I am pleased to your heart for God that is demonstrated in your writing. \r\n\r\nYou had some good meter in this poem and the second verse ran nicely parallel to the first one. I feel like this is a great stepping stone to a really good poem in the future. \r\n\r\nThank you for your witness, and God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:44:17','2023-06-30 00:44:17'),(1104,'judge-event-evaluation-59-1688050297',59,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7319,4451,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I like the work that you have done here. You clearly know the subject! You had great knowledge of what life in the trenches in WW1 would have felt like. That really came through in your writing. \r\n\r\nI can see that you fitting in rhyming words wherever you could spot them. This is very clever and I think you\'re only going to get better with time. I could also see that you had managed to work some rhythm into the poetry as well.\r\n\r\nI think you\'re going to write some very inspiring poetry. \r\n\r\nWell done and God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:51:37','2023-06-30 00:51:38'),(1105,'judge-event-evaluation-655-1688050693',655,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7090,394,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'This was a beautiful poem that brought glory to our great God. I commend you for this work. \r\n\r\nYou had a fantastic rhythm and meter going in both verses that built to a climax with the last line of the verse. I enjoyed it so much I really wish it was longer. More verses would have earned you extra points as it\'s a lot easier to write two verses than five verses. You have the skill to do great things. \r\n\r\nGod bless you and keep glorifying Him with your work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 00:58:13','2023-06-30 00:58:13'),(1106,'judge-event-evaluation-318-1688050990',318,8,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7079,6328,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,39.00,NULL,NULL,'Some of the words / handwritings are difficult to read (either too small / unclear / letters are too close).\r\nWrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 4, 5, 17, 25, 27, 33, 35, 37, 42, 48, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 01:03:10','2023-06-30 01:03:10'),(1107,'judge-event-evaluation-694-1688050994',694,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7096,394,7478,6,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very beautiful and inspired work that shows talent beyond your years. Thank you for blessing us with your work. \r\n\r\nI pray that God uses your skills for great things. \r\n\r\nGod bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 01:03:14','2023-06-30 01:03:14'),(1108,'judge-event-evaluation-677-1688051318',677,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7088,394,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'This is a beautiful piece of poetry with a wonderful testimony. Thank you for sharing this with us. \r\n\r\nI really enjoyed the narrative and the picture language used in your work. I really look forward to reading more. \r\n\r\nGreat work and God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 01:08:38','2023-06-30 01:08:38'),(1109,'judge-event-evaluation-323-1688051571',323,21,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7114,5805,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,50.00,NULL,NULL,'Wow! Excellent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 01:12:51','2023-06-30 01:12:51'),(1110,'judge-event-evaluation-754-1688051678',754,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7087,394,7478,6,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'A very powerful testimony that was written in very vivid language. The words seemed to jump of the screen with emotion. Thank you for sharing this with us. \r\n\r\nMay God bless you with your future writing! I really want to see more next year. I would encourage you to experiment with some rhyming to complement your beautiful writing. I think you have incredible talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 01:14:38','2023-06-30 01:14:38'),(1112,'judge-event-evaluation-848-1688051913',848,25,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7348,5804,7478,6,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'I love ducks. I have had them as pets since I was 8 years old. Your poem was really sweet and I can see you cared about this cute, little duck. \r\n\r\nGod bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 01:18:33','2023-06-30 01:18:33'),(1113,'judge-event-evaluation-315-1688054598',315,10,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,6988,1467,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,38.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 4, 5, 9, 11, 12, 18, 23, 24, 28, 30, 42, 47',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 02:03:18','2023-06-30 02:03:18'),(1114,'judge-event-evaluation-322-1688054966',322,21,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7113,5805,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,47.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 11, 39, 41',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 02:09:26','2023-06-30 02:09:27'),(1115,'judge-event-evaluation-275-1688055418',275,10,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7281,1467,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,32.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 3, 4, 9, 11, 14, 18, 22, 24, 27, 28, 33, 35, 38, 42, 43, 45, 48, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 02:16:58','2023-06-30 02:16:58'),(1116,'judge-event-evaluation-321-1688055788',321,21,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7161,5805,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,48.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 28, 44',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 02:23:08','2023-06-30 02:23:08'),(1117,'judge-event-evaluation-317-1688056360',317,8,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7073,6328,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,30.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 3, 4, 11, 12, 16, 22, 24, 27, 28, 30, 32, 34, 35, 37, 38, 39, 41, 42, 48, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 02:32:40','2023-06-30 02:32:40'),(1118,'judge-event-evaluation-273-1688057249',273,28,1,5,1,2023,11,'053',NULL,7275,5806,7374,55,'Open',NULL,50,34.00,NULL,NULL,'Wrong spelling:\r\nNumber: 4, 5, 9, 12, 22, 23, 26, 28, 34, 35, 38, 39, 40, 46, 47, 50',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 02:47:29','2023-06-30 02:47:29'),(1119,'judge-event-evaluation-195-1688069010',195,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7196,4208,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'The story of Nevaeh accepting a different response from God than she anticipated is based on Biblical principles and the emotions that Nevaeh would have felt have been touched on. With the word count being low, some more could have been added to the story, perhaps describing a time Nevaeh was in the sun and what happened. Then the reader would understand how restricted she was in her daily life. \r\nThere are some minor grammatical errors and some punctuation errors, such as \'her and her mother would go to bed, and pray\'. This should read \'she and her mother\'. If you take out the \'and her mother\' portion and read the sentence then you will know the correct pronouns to use. It would not be \'her would go to bed\', it would be \'she would go to bed\'. \r\nOverall though, a good story. May you grow in God as you continue your education and go through life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 06:03:30','2023-06-30 06:03:30'),(1120,'judge-event-evaluation-1080-1688071143',1080,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7123,5805,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'The story is based on Biblical principles as required. There is however little detail of the setting, where the story is set and when, to give context to the conversation. The language used by Alex is not always reflective of how a young boy would express himself, when writing a story it is important to set the scene so the reader can picture it and use language that is appropriate to the age of the character. It can help to say the sentences out loud and hear how they sound spoken and picture them being spoken by someone the age of your character. \r\nThere are minor grammatical errors but overall the story is well punctuated and set out.\r\nMay you continue to grow in the knowledge of God and His ways as you continue your education.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 06:39:03','2023-06-30 06:39:03'),(1126,'judge-event-evaluation-360-1688085594',360,14,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7336,4328,6959,22,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you Stephanie. \r\nYou must be a valued pianist at church! \r\nPlaying hymns is a particular skill, as it\'s basically all chords, and you have done well to make the sound crisp and clear, without muddying the sound. \r\nFor ministry, this is an obvious tick, but for performance, unfortunately a hymn straight out of the hymn book doesn\'t make a great solo piece. There are lots of lovely piano solo arrangements of hymns where you can display dynamics and musicality more freely. \r\nGood work, God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 10:39:54','2023-06-30 10:39:54'),(1128,'judge-event-evaluation-362-1688085771',362,19,1,5,1,2023,168,'412',NULL,7316,4451,7084,12,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,NULL,NULL,'Good poster, Holly. You may mind the colour contrast between the text and background so the end result will be more impactful.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 10:42:51','2023-06-30 10:42:51'),(1131,'judge-event-evaluation-820-1688086366',820,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7347,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasing effort, Jamesa.\r\n*A carefully shaded background can enhance a drawing.\r\n*Explore the techniques of shading and the use of textures.\r\nThank you and do enjoy extending your talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 10:52:46','2023-06-30 10:52:46'),(1132,'judge-event-evaluation-829-1688086766',829,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7357,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Katarina for your effort.\r\n*The use of colour could have spread through the picture.\r\n*Explore the use of textures to enhance your drawings.\r\nBest wishes in using your skill. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 10:59:26','2023-06-30 10:59:26'),(1134,'judge-event-evaluation-479-1688087427',479,15,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7047,4679,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the pleasant illustration.\r\n*Your talent could have depicted the \"whole\" fox.\r\n*Enjoy extending this talent.\r\nBlessings that your interest will continue to be beneficial.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 11:10:27','2023-06-30 11:10:27'),(1136,'judge-event-evaluation-589-1688088151',589,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7350,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A simple and pleasant illustration.\r\n*Curved coloured lines give shape\r\n*Repeated lines stacked together is a useful technique for \"colouring-in.\"\r\n*Background colour also enhances sketches.\r\nThank you Lachlan and I  hope you extend the challenge to sketch. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 11:22:31','2023-06-30 11:22:31'),(1137,'judge-event-evaluation-1117-1688090502',1117,46,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7448,4504,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasing coloured sketch, Leny.\r\n*Lead-Pencil outlines can be can be less prominent.\r\n*Explore the use of curved lines for shape.\r\nBlessings as you explore the wider use of colours in sketching.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:01:42','2023-06-30 12:01:42'),(1140,'judge-event-evaluation-599-1688090864',599,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7354,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasing effort, Levani.\r\nExplore:\r\n*use of texture  and shading\r\n*effects of light on shadows.\r\nBlessing as you explore Sketching.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:07:44','2023-06-30 12:07:44'),(1143,'judge-event-evaluation-545-1688091586',545,8,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7078,6328,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Mischa.\r\n*A brave attempt in colouring.\r\nBlessings as you explore this talent further.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:19:46','2023-06-30 12:19:47'),(1145,'judge-event-evaluation-1104-1688091606',1104,13,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7194,4208,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nSuch a peaceful yet bright photo. You can almost hear the lapping of the water and feel the warmth of the setting sun. The blending of colours in the sky is good. \r\nYou have a talent in recognising beautiful photo opportunities\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:20:06','2023-06-30 12:20:06'),(1146,'judge-event-evaluation-1229-1688091665',1229,28,1,5,1,2023,310,'954','3',0,5806,7460,41,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this one act play, Group 3. This is an interesting and fun take on the parable of the ten virgins. Good job to all of you for selecting a great script! The costumes were awesome (!!!), as was the rest of the stagecraft - it all fit the play perfectly. There was evidently much thought put into the staging. Well done!\r\n\r\nAs for your performance, it would have been nice to see you all connect better with the story you were telling. There could have been more body movement and facial expressions to really get your audience involved in your story, and with more voice inflections and projections the script would have really come alive. Ultimately, you are telling a story, so you want to capture and maintain the attention of your audience as you deliver the message that God has purposed for you to deliver. You want to ensure that they walk away feeling inspired!\r\n\r\nGood effort, Group 3! I trust that you all did your absolute best in this play; you did an awesome job. I\'m so excited for each one of you as you continue to sharpen your skills and grow in confidence through the use of Student Convention, so that you can continue to honour and glorify God with your wonderful talents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:21:05','2023-06-30 12:21:05'),(1148,'judge-event-evaluation-822-1688093147',822,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7341,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Om.\r\nFurther explore;\r\n*The effective use of clear outlines.\r\n*Shading techniques and textures.\r\nBlessings as you explore and develop this talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:45:47','2023-06-30 12:45:47'),(1149,'judge-event-evaluation-1228-1688093807',1228,28,1,5,1,2023,310,'954','1',0,5806,7460,41,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this one act play, Group 1! This is a great script, and you all delivered an awesome performance to match it. Your costumes were VERY impressive, as were the backdrops and various other props you used. Thinking and preparing the staging part through is essential in bringing your audience into the story with you and you all did a wonderful job! \r\n\r\nEach of you performed with the kind of confidence that one has when they\'ve been working and practicing on their craft, which made the play all the more enjoyable. Your voice inflections and projections were awesome and, for the most part, your body movements and facial expressions went hand in hand with them. \r\n\r\nGreat job, Group 1! Thank you for using your talents to honour God and bless others with this platform event. I\'m excited for what is ahead of each of you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:56:47','2023-06-30 12:56:47'),(1150,'judge-event-evaluation-647-1688093956',647,3,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,6970,1678,7481,2,NULL,'10',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'It was hard to mark some criteria such as use of enhancements as the original photo was not submitted as per guidelines.\r\nHow wonderful that you can see beauty in all that God has created. It was beautiful that you chose to share this photo with us and your thoughts on God\'s beauty. \r\nIt was a little difficult to see the actual focus of this photo. My suggestion for your next photo submission is to try to have one main focus point that draws the viewers eye. \r\nWell done on your submission. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 12:59:16','2023-06-30 12:59:16'),(1152,'judge-event-evaluation-594-1688094363',594,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7352,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Ratu Laione.\r\n*Be brave and explore bigger things.\r\n*Explore the wider use of colour and textures.\r\nBlessings as you extend and develop the use of colour in art.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 13:06:03','2023-06-30 13:06:03'),(1154,'judge-event-evaluation-984-1688095081',984,21,1,5,1,2023,175,'453',NULL,7124,5805,7481,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. I like the depth to the photo and the way the elements on the sand are a focal point. My suggestion would be to use more contrast with colour, lighting and exposure. You have shown originality with the focus. \r\nWell done. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 13:18:01','2023-06-30 13:18:01'),(1157,'judge-event-evaluation-1312-1688097231',1312,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7387,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing sketch work Jiwoo ! Great technique and shading skills on display\r\nKeep up the great work !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 13:53:51','2023-06-30 13:53:51'),(1159,'judge-event-evaluation-207-1688098029',207,21,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7154,5805,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great art Jovilisi !\r\nYou\'ve done well to bring the bunny to life on paper.\r\nI would love to see you challenge yourself more in the future, and add in more variations of shading techniques and textures\r\nKeep drawing and keep inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 14:07:09','2023-06-30 14:07:09'),(1162,'judge-event-evaluation-1106-1688099357',1106,13,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7187,4208,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Kavish ! I see what you tried to sketch and you\'ve done well !\r\nThere\'s always room to improve , and I hope you continue to practice different sketching skills like shading and cross hatching to really bring out your drawings ! Understanding where your light source is coming from is also a very valuable skill to learn.\r\nKeep practicing your art ! You have massive potential as an artist !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 14:29:17','2023-06-30 14:29:17'),(1163,'judge-event-evaluation-1313-1688099417',1313,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7386,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'I love the shading technique on the hair on the mane !\r\nYou\'ve shown great ability to sketch out realistic perspective\r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 14:30:17','2023-06-30 14:30:17'),(1164,'judge-event-evaluation-1308-1688099837',1308,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7400,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing sketch ! Your use of various sketching techniques really makes your sketch stand out !\r\nGreat perspective and great shading\r\nKeep drawing and keep inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 14:37:17','2023-06-30 14:37:17'),(1169,'judge-event-evaluation-452-1688100657',452,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7401,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'You\'ve displayed great skill in your artwork! I always admire anyone who can draw faces well.\r\nTechniques are great ! Remember to be careful of abruptly ending lines and creating empty spaces in your sketches. Blending and shading can always be used to bring out the best in sketching !\r\nKeep it up, you\'re doing amazing work !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 14:50:57','2023-06-30 14:50:57'),(1171,'judge-event-evaluation-1549-1688101110',1549,19,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7330,4451,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'I love the kiwi ! You\'ve captured the fuzz and fur very well !\r\nDon\'t be afraid to add more shades and darker contrasts to really make your sketch POP !\r\nNever stop creating art , Phebe ! Keep it up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 14:58:30','2023-06-30 14:58:30'),(1173,'judge-event-evaluation-1303-1688101897',1303,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7417,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Great sketch Rafael ! \r\nYou have good vision and clear understanding of perspective , but I think keeping a cleaner background would\'ve made your bird stand out more !\r\nKeep practicing art and keep inspiring Rafael , you have a very bright future !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:11:37','2023-06-30 15:11:37'),(1176,'judge-event-evaluation-206-1688102438',206,21,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7124,5805,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'I am really in awe of your roses , Ruth !\r\nYou\'ve done amazing shading work to really lift your sketch off the page.\r\nI would\'ve loved a bit of a lighter shade for the background though, to really focus on the rose itself.\r\nKeep up the great artwork !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:20:38','2023-06-30 15:20:38'),(1178,'judge-event-evaluation-205-1688102988',205,21,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7119,5805,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'The eagle stands proud ! Love your work Ryan\r\nI would suggest making the background a little lighter in shade so as to make the eagles darker contrasts pop a bit more\r\nAlso, try to avoid too many solid lines in sketching , and try varying the structure to really make it stand out\r\nBut all in all , you\'ve done an amazing job \r\nKeep up the great work , and keep inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:29:48','2023-06-30 15:29:48'),(1179,'judge-event-evaluation-440-1688103333',440,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7405,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great lighthouse drawing\r\nYour perspective is clear and you\'ve executed it well !\r\nDon\'t be afraid to add more textures and contrasts .\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:35:33','2023-06-30 15:35:33'),(1180,'judge-event-evaluation-961-1688103373',961,21,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7157,5805,7471,45,'Open','25',100,80.00,-10,-2.00,'Well done Merewai! You chose a lovely poem and spoke clearly and articulately. Well done carrying on, even if you forgot a few words.\r\nJust a note to be mindful of the pace at which you speak. It\'s always a good idea to slow things down when you speak as this allows your listeners to hear and process the words of the poem you are reciting. \r\nAll in all, great job. Keep practicing and I\'d love to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:36:13','2023-06-30 15:36:13'),(1181,'judge-event-evaluation-862-1688103470',862,10,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,6988,1467,7471,45,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Lael! You chose a brilliant poem with a powerful message. Great job using a variety of gestures and intonations - it really made your poem captivating to listen to. My only suggestion would be to slow down the pace so that your listeners have time to process and comprehend each line, thought and accompanying imagery. Also, it would be helpful to put some time into practicing diction (the clear and correct pronunciation of words) so that words are clearly understood and not mistaken for something else.\r\nAll in all, you did a splendid job and I hope to see more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:37:50','2023-07-01 13:51:00'),(1182,'judge-event-evaluation-960-1688103480',960,21,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7135,5805,7471,45,'Open','25',100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Litia. You spoke clearly and with great diction and volume. You did really well to not get stuck when you had a slight mind blank, but kept on going - that\'s awesome!\r\nKeep practicing these types of events as you do have a lovely speaking voice. Also, don\'t be afraid to add gestures using your hands, facial expressions and vocal expressions too. All these things help to really draw your audience in bring what you are saying to life. \r\nI hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:38:00','2023-06-30 15:38:00'),(1183,'judge-event-evaluation-1076-1688103489',1076,21,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7114,5805,7471,45,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Maurea! You chose a great poem and performed it beautifully. I love how unreserved you were in showing emotion, using varied gestures and employing a variety of expressions and intonations. Just a note to be mindful of phrasing...some parts and lines were a bit hard to follow as they were broken up mid-thought or sentence. \r\nAll in all, you did very well and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:38:09','2023-06-30 15:38:10'),(1184,'judge-event-evaluation-686-1688103798',686,3,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,6965,1678,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Vinsentius !\r\nYou\'ve done a good job of bringing Frelinghausen\'s portrait to life \r\nAdding more shading and varying textures aid you well in sketching\r\nKeep up the great work !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:43:18','2023-06-30 15:43:18'),(1185,'judge-event-evaluation-1300-1688103830',1300,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7412,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Diva ! I love how you\'ve displayed a clear perspective of what you wanted to sketch, and drawn it well.\r\nRemember to keep in mind which direction your light source is coming from so you will be able to shade with ease and consistency.\r\nKeep up the great art !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:43:50','2023-06-30 15:43:50'),(1186,'judge-event-evaluation-707-1688103846',707,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7389,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,54.00,-10,NULL,'You have a great eye for art and design, and with more time and practice I know you will be a great artist !\r\nKeep drawing and never stop learning Excellent !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:44:06','2023-06-30 15:44:06'),(1187,'judge-event-evaluation-455-1688103887',455,17,1,5,1,2023,202,'553',NULL,7398,4200,7462,17,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Love the sketch of the bird Gabriel ! Confidently portrayed and used techniques nicely.\r\nI would suggest keeping the edges clean so as to make the focus of your art (bird) pop just a bit more\r\nGreat job !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:44:47','2023-06-30 15:44:47'),(1188,'judge-event-evaluation-958-1688103921',958,21,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7134,5805,7471,45,'Open','25',100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Nunia! You chose a great poem and spoke beautifully. You also have a lovely smile :)\r\nYou are a great speaker - I would encourage you to keep practicing and gaining more confidence. Don\'t be afraid to use big gestures, emotion and facial expressions when presenting poetry...it helps to draw in your listeners and keep them engaged from start to finish. \r\nAlso, practice speaking a bit slower...don\'t rush through your recitation. Speaking slower is another way to really keep your listeners glued to what you are reciting. \r\nAll in all, great job! I would love to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 15:45:21','2023-06-30 15:45:22'),(1198,'judge-event-evaluation-1015-1688108651',1015,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7131,5805,7375,45,'Open','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, prepare everything better. Keep up the good work