NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:11:54','2023-06-30 18:11:54'),(1210,'judge-event-evaluation-535-1688112828',535,3,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,6970,1678,7471,45,'Open','25',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Praise! You chose a good poem and presented it beautifully. You also spoke clearly and confidently. \r\nDon\'t be afraid to really get into the heart and message behind a poem and really use as much emotion, movements and expressions as possible to bring it to life! \r\nKeep practicing and I hope we get to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:13:48','2023-06-30 18:13:48'),(1211,'judge-event-evaluation-1529-1688113065',1529,17,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7407,4200,7471,45,'Open','25',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Sheryl. You chose a lovely poem and presented it beautifully and confidently. \r\nIf you can keep practicing, and especially work on perfecting your diction, I will be looking forward to seeing more from you in future :)\r\nGod Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:17:45','2023-06-30 18:17:45'),(1212,'judge-event-evaluation-1545-1688113570',1545,20,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7093,394,7471,45,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done Trisha. You presented a lovely poem - did you write it yourself?\r\nI could tell you were a little nervous, but you did great to carry on and present it clearly and articulately. \r\nI would encourage you to practice adding even more gestures and body movement as well as vocal and facial expressions. All this will help to bring your poem to life and keep your listeners captivated. It also would\'ve been nice to be able to see your face and expressions. \r\nAll in all, you did a great job and I look forward to seeing more form you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:26:10','2023-06-30 18:26:10'),(1213,'judge-event-evaluation-927-1688113787',927,28,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7255,5806,7375,45,'Collection','24',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Very well done. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:29:47','2023-06-30 18:29:47'),(1214,'judge-event-evaluation-514-1688113852',514,28,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7242,5806,7375,45,'Collection','24',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Very well done.\r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:30:52','2023-06-30 18:30:52'),(1216,'judge-event-evaluation-970-1688114246',970,21,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7150,5805,7375,45,'Collection','24',100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. \r\nThank you and God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:37:26','2023-06-30 18:37:26'),(1218,'judge-event-evaluation-1175-1688114520',1175,11,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7026,613,7375,45,'Collection','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:42:00','2023-06-30 18:42:00'),(1220,'judge-event-evaluation-525-1688114996',525,28,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7275,5806,7471,45,'Open','25',100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Sonya! You chose a lovely poem and presented it beautifully. Great job speaking clearly and having accompanying gestures. I would encourage you to be even more bold and creative with your expressions (verbal and facial). Practice reciting poems with your whole being - by that, I don\'t just mean add more actions, but try to really understand the heart and theme behind poem and figure out what kinds of expressions and emotions you need to use to draw your listeners in so that they can be moved by to the words and heart of the poem as well. \r\nYou have great protentional and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:49:56','2023-06-30 18:49:56'),(1221,'judge-event-evaluation-968-1688115081',968,21,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7132,5805,7375,45,'Collection','24',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. \r\nMay God bless you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:51:21','2023-06-30 18:51:21'),(1222,'judge-event-evaluation-898-1688115336',898,28,1,5,1,2023,325,'974',NULL,7278,5806,7471,45,'Open','25',100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Victoria! You chose a lovely poem and did well to present it clearly and with lively gestures. You are a natural on stage. \r\nMy only suggestion would be to keep your voice clear and steady when you say each line; there were a few instances where your voice decrease in volume as you came to the end of a line. This made it a bit hard to hear and understand the sentence or thought that was being said. \r\nAll in all, keep practicing and I hope to see more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:55:36','2023-06-30 18:55:36'),(1223,'judge-event-evaluation-516-1688115481',516,28,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7248,5806,7375,45,'Collection','24',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Very well done. \r\nI\'m so blessed when I was listening to him. \r\nMay God bless you boy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 18:58:01','2023-06-30 18:58:01'),(1224,'judge-event-evaluation-1552-1688115995',1552,20,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7089,394,7471,44,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Clarissa! You spoke clearly and read your story in a very engaging way! I hope you keep practicing and I look forward to seeing more from you in future :) God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 19:06:35','2023-06-30 19:06:36'),(1225,'judge-event-evaluation-1199-1688116966',1199,25,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7347,5804,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,51.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 19:22:46','2023-0