19:59:52','2023-06-30 19:59:52'),(1234,'judge-event-evaluation-364-1688120710',364,19,1,5,1,2023,168,'412',NULL,7327,4451,7084,12,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Good work, Savannah. You may mind the colour contrast between the text and background so the end result will be more impactful.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 20:25:10','2023-06-30 20:25:10'),(1235,'judge-event-evaluation-542-1688120945',542,25,1,5,1,2023,168,'412',NULL,7351,5804,7084,12,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done, Talitonu. In the future, you may improve the relevancy between the bible verse and your poster\'s object to make the result more impactful. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 20:29:05','2023-06-30 20:29:05'),(1238,'judge-event-evaluation-1256-1688121633',1256,28,1,5,1,2023,240,'756',NULL,7258,5806,7479,23,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for sharing this Jedaiah! :-)\r\nI really liked how you had smiled at times throughout your solo.\r\nBefore you turn the camera on to record, please check your framing to make sure that you have the correct height set - so that we do not miss seeing the tambourine when it goes above your head in places!\r\nKeep sharing your tambourine skills with others. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 20:40:33','2023-06-30 20:40:33'),(1241,'judge-event-evaluation-917-1688133198',917,8,1,5,1,2023,18,'060','1',0,6328,6958,9,'Open','3',100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Dear Owen, \r\nWell done on a very upraising and hot sensitive debatable topic in the educational arena research topic.  It is very commendable, brave and compassionate of you to volunteer in a school with special needs. The questions that you have asked are logical and progressing towards the potential problems whether autistc students should be in \'mainstream\' schools.  I have marked you down on the section II Part B because you did not give a separate report.  Very proud of you to take up such a project. My prayer is that you will continue the good work and passion and curiousity in learning more about autistic children and find creative and authentic ways to advocate for the austistic kids in your community! God bless all the works of your hands. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-06-30 23:53:18','2023-06-30 23:53:18'),(1257,'judge-event-evaluation-539-1688134625',539,25,1,5,1,2023,168,'412',NULL,7355,5804,7454,12,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 00:17:05','2023-07-01 00:17:05'),(1258,'judge-event-evaluation-363-1688134729',363,19,1,5,1,2023,168,'412',NULL,7323,4451,7454,12,NULL,NULL,100,48.00,NULL,NULL,'You can do better! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 00:18:49','2023-07-01 00:18:49'),(1259,'judge-event-evaluation-358-1688134817',358,19,1,5,1,2023,168,'412',NULL,7317,4451,7454,12,NULL,NULL,100,43.00,NULL,NULL,'You can do better than this!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 00:20:17','2023-07-01 00:20:17'