14,5805,6958,44,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Dear Maurea, \r\n\r\nDefinitely a very appealing performance. Love the way you used two different voice-tones for the older and younger apples. Love the message at the end how we need to trust the Lord to work out the purpose of our lives.  (heart symbol) Pray you will use your talents for the extension of His kingdom.  May the Lord bless the hands of all your works. Ps 37:4.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 00:43:57','2023-07-01 00:43:57'),(1283,'judge-event-evaluation-1109-1688136303',1109,21,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7121,5805,6958,44,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Emma, \r\n\r\nA very pleasing performance indeed.  Love your facial and accompanied actions. Keep up the good works indeed.  Love the message how unity is so important.   I pray that you continue to use your talents for the extension of His kingdom. Thank you for taking part in this expressive reading event. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 00:45:03','2023-07-01 00:45:03'),(1284,'judge-event-evaluation-1520-1688137345',1520,17,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7401,4200,6958,44,'Open','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you MeiLin for taking part in this expressive reading event. Appreciate the effort and time spent. Being an Asian myself, there will be certain words that will be hard to pronounce and understood because English may not be our first language.  To overcome this problem, recording and relistening would be helpful to correct any mispronounced words. Don\'t give up and keep trying.  Because in trying you keep improving. Keep striving and believing in yourself. Do your best and leave the rest to the Lord. Ps 139:14',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 01:02:25','2023-07-01 01:02:25'),(1285,'judge-event-evaluation-1057-1688171010',1057,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7174,4208,NULL,45,'Collection','25',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great try Aliyah! I can see this is probably your first time and I applaud you for trying. \r\nWork on you entry and exit; relax. For entry, work on having good eye contact with the people in front of you (or camera) when you first come on stage. Slow down when you are saying your poem. This way your words will come out clearer. When you pause in the correct places it will help you show the right emotion that goes with the words.\r\nTry to use some natural gestures next time. \r\nKeep practicing and give it another go next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 10:23:30','2023-07-01 10:23:31'),(1286,'judge-event-evaluation-1057-1688171509',1057,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7174,4208,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great try Aliyah! I can see this was your first time and I applaud you for trying. \r\nWork on entry and exit; relax and have better eye contact with those in front of you (or camera)\r\nSlow down when saying your poem. This will help the audience hear each word clearly, will help you project emotion with your voice, and will help you use your face and hands to show extra expression. \r\nKeep practicing and give this a try again next convention. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 10:31:49','2023-07-01 10:31:49'),(1287,'judge-event-evaluation-947-1688172994',947,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7139,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful try Angelina! You have a beautiful smile. \r\nYou needed to use a few longer pauses and bigger voice inflections in certain places that would have helped in recreate the mood and the emotion of the poem. \r\n\r\nApproach/Departure should have been into the camera frame then at the end walk out. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 10:56:34','2023-07-01 10:56:34'),(1288,'judge-event-evaluation-1439-1688173451',1439,13,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7196,4208,6958,44,'Open','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Samara, \r\n\r\nAbsolutely love your performance.  The expressions, tone of voice for each of the different characters were so convincing.  If I were not looking at the video, I would not know it was all performed by one person!  I pray that you would use the talents and giftings and desires and passion in you for the extension of His Kingdom. Matt 6:33  All Glory and Honour to the Lord. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 11:04:11','2023-07-01 11:04:11'),(1289,'judge-event-evaluation-1530-1688174985',1530,17,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7409,4200,6958,44,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Shalem, \r\n\r\nA very aesthetic performance.  Definitely love the lively expressions and appropriate dramatic skills displayed. May you continue to use your talents, giftings, desire and passion for the Lord. Keep up the good works.  Ps 37:4  All Glory and Honour to the Lord.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 11:29:45','2023-07-01 11:29:45'),(1292,'judge-event-evaluation-966-1688180338',966,21,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7145,5805,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 12:58:58','2023-07-01 12:58:58'),(1293,'judge-event-evaluation-1061-1688180370',1061,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7183,4208,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Aviella! I like that you used some gestures and tried to make them natural. \r\nRemember practice makes perfect. \r\nMemorizing your poem exactly word for word is important. Work on the correct places to pause (don\'t be afraid of longer pauses as this helps to recreate the mood and emotion of the poem) so that what you are saying makes sense to those listening. \r\nBlessings,\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 12:59:30','2023-07-01 12:59:30'),(1294,'judge-event-evaluation-1113-1688180984',1113,21,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7123,5805,6958,44,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you dear Susan, \r\n\r\nIt was a very enlightening performance.  Loved different voice tone for the tea cup.  Thank you for taking part in this expressive reading event. Please continue to use your talents and giftings and passion and desires for the extension of His Kingdom. Ps 37:4  All Glory and Honour to our Redeemer., Author and Finisher of our faith. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:09:44','2023-07-01 13:09:44'),(1296,'judge-event-evaluation-911-1688181179',911,8,1,5,1,2023,319,'964',NULL,7069,6328,7372,49,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Ivano. You delivered it well. Add a little more enthusiasm and facial expression in your next speech. Overall, it was awesome.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:12:59','2023-07-01 13:12:59'),(1297,'judge-event-evaluation-553-1688181281',553,15,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7041,4679,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:14:41','2023-07-01 13:14:41'),(1298,'judge-event-evaluation-955-1688181363',955,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7158,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Bethany! I enjoyed your presentation and the expression in your voice.\r\nGood use of movement and gestures; just relax into them.  \r\nBe careful not to pull a face or change facial expression when you make a mistake. \r\nApproach/Departure should have been you walking into the camera frame then out at the end. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:16:03','2023-07-01 13:16:03'),(1299,'judge-event-evaluation-1056-1688181538',1056,13,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7176,4208,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, please speak more slowly and clearly you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:18:58','2023-07-01 13:18:58'),(1300,'judge-event-evaluation-1446-1688181839',1446,25,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7352,5804,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:23:59','2023-07-01 13:24:00'),(1301,'judge-event-evaluation-910-1688181956',910,8,1,5,1,2023,319,'964',NULL,7072,6328,7372,49,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'It was great, Javier. You have a great message. For your improvement, tidy up before you show up and prepare the report better. You could also do better if you spent more effort on memorization. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:25:56','2023-07-01 13:25:56'),(1302,'judge-event-evaluation-1232-1688182262',1232,28,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7278,5806,6958,44,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Victoria for a very delightful performance.  Indeed through your performance, God\'s love is never ending and His love is amazing. Keep up the good work. May you continue to use your talents, giftings, passion and desires for extension of His Kingdom.  Ps 37:4.  All Glory and honour to the Lord, the giver of ALL good things. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:31:02','2023-07-01 13:31:02'),(1303,'judge-event-evaluation-906-1688182401',906,8,1,5,1,2023,319,'964',NULL,7079,6328,7372,49,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Nathan. It seemed you got some problem in your memorization. You also need to have more enthusiasm and some facial expression variation. Thank you for your participation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:33:21','2023-07-01 13:33:21'),(1305,'judge-event-evaluation-517-1688182833',517,28,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7244,5806,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:40:33','2023-07-01 13:40:34'),(1308,'judge-event-evaluation-1365-1688183408',1365,25,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7340,5804,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:50:08','2023-07-01 13:50:08'),(1309,'judge-event-evaluation-1462-1688183488',1462,20,1,5,1,2023,294,'914',NULL,7232,394,6,49,'Collection','24',100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jacob. Some tips that would help improve for future entries. Memorization of script. Eye contact. Facial expressions and use of gestures. Well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:51:28','2023-07-01 13:51:28'),(1310,'judge-event-evaluation-999-1688183503',999,21,1,5,1,2023,186,'467','1',0,5805,6,15,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,0.00,'Well done students. Just a few things that would help prepare for future entries. Making sure that all documents are submitted. I could not really follow the play as there wasn’t any script provided. Clear diction and pronunciation of words. Loved the sound effects and background music. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you all. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:51:43','2023-07-01 13:51:43'),(1311,'judge-event-evaluation-1450-1688183511',1450,13,1,5,1,2023,186,'467','4',0,4208,6,15,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Just a few tips that would help in the future. When reading the scripts, take the time projecting them. It felt a little rushed. Great work with the sound effects and placement of sounds in the background. Well done and I look for for future entries. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:51:51','2023-07-01 13:51:51'),(1312,'judge-event-evaluation-1466-1688183519',1466,11,1,5,1,2023,186,'467','1',0,613,6,15,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Cameron & Kathleen. Great script and characters to go with. Was very engaging and felt like I was in the play.  This reminds me of a story I use to listen to on the radio “Adventures in Odyssey. Again, well done and looking forward for what God has in store for you both. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:51:59','2023-07-01 13:51:59'),(1313,'judge-event-evaluation-965-1688183668',965,21,1,5,1,2023,290,'910',NULL,7144,5805,7375,45,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done.\r\nIn the future, you must be more prepared. \r\nAnd it must be more expressive so that listeners are more enthusiastic and excited when listening. Keep your spirits up, boy. \r\nMay God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:54:28','2023-07-01 13:54:28'),(1314,'judge-event-evaluation-376-1688183673',376,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7331,4451,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'How wonderful that you wrote your own poem Chloe! Great job and continue to build on this!\r\nSince this is an original piece, be sure that the script supplied has the same wording as what you are actually saying. \r\nYou did well in using gestures, but be a little more relaxed and use some movement.\r\nSlow down a little also when saying your poem as this will help with delivery. (creating a mood) \r\nApproach/Departure should have been to walk into the camera frame and off at the end. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 13:54:33','2023-07-01 13:54:33'),(1315,'judge-event-evaluation-919-1688184040',919,8,1,5,1,2023,294,'914',NULL,7076,6328,6,49,'Collection','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jordan. This is one of my favorite famous speeches. Just a few things that would help prepare for future entries. Well done with memorizing the script but I could see that there were a few places where you almost forgot it but managed to pick up and continue on. Using facial expressions and gestures would really help a little. Other than that, well done and I look forward to what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 14:00:40','2023-07-01 14:00:41'),(1316,'judge-event-evaluation-946-1688184628',946,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7148,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good try Courtney! It looks like your first time so I applaud you for trying!\r\nRemember practice makes perfect. Keep at this and you will gain confidence and will learn how to handle your nerves. \r\nI see your use of gestures, but try to use more movement and be a bit more relaxed so that they are natural. \r\nFor the most part, great use of pauses at the right time; this helped with your vocal delivery. \r\nTry not to pull faces when you make mistakes and keep eye contact with the audience (or camera)\r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 14:10:28','2023-07-01 14:10:28'),(1317,'judge-event-evaluation-942-1688186311',942,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7153,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Galilee! Good delivery of your poem.\r\nWonderful use of gestures and movement. \r\nSome words could be enunciated better. \r\nApproach/Departure should have been into the camera frame then off at the end. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 14:38:31','2023-07-01 14:38:31'),(1318,'judge-event-evaluation-1142-1688187500',1142,21,1,5,1,2023,283,'901','1',0,5805,7453,39,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 14:58:20','2023-07-01 14:58:20'),(1319,'judge-event-evaluation-1370-1688187612',1370,25,1,5,1,2023,283,'901','2',0,5804,7453,39,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 15:00:12','2023-07-01 15:00:12'),(1320,'judge-event-evaluation-1367-1688188547',1367,25,1,5,1,2023,283,'901','1',0,5804,7453,39,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 15:15:47','2023-07-01 15:15:47'),(1321,'judge-event-evaluation-798-1688189079',798,3,1,5,1,2023,232,'714','1',0,1678,7453,26,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 15:24:39','2023-07-01 15:24:39'),(1322,'judge-event-evaluation-631-1688189409',631,15,1,5,1,2023,232,'714','3',0,4679,7453,26,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 15:30:09','2023-07-01 15:30:09'),(1325,'judge-event-evaluation-1368-1688192126',1368,13,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7183,4208,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for the lovely introduction, Aviella! I loved how you noted the guidelines about walking on and off as though you were on the stage for a live performance - thank you!\r\n\r\nHave you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano / keyboard - which would make it easier! \r\nTry to find some more dynamic colours with you playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\nTo have more clarity, experiment with changing the sustain pedal (a quick up and down motion) only when the chords change - to release the sustained sound.\r\n\r\nKeep developing your piano playing skills. :-)\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 16:15:26','2023-07-01 16:15:26'),(1328,'judge-event-evaluation-986-1688193670',986,8,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7063,6328,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing your piano solo Benjamin - this is one of my favourite hymns!\r\nTry to find some more dynamic colours with your playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\nThe balance between accompaniment and melody could do with some attention. In places, the left hand over-powered the melody and it was hard to hear the tune. N.B. The left hand needs to be flowing - not every note is important.\r\nI think there was a bit too much pedal throughout the piece. This is a neat arrangement with some beautiful additional runs - just a little too much emphasis was given to these.\r\n\r\nYou show great potential with the piano Benjamin, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 16:41:10','2023-07-01 16:41:10'),(1329,'judge-event-evaluation-931-1688195004',931,11,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7026,613,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this, Cameron!\r\nTry to find some more dynamic colours with your playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\nThe balance between accompaniment and melody could do with some attention.\r\nI suggest to help get piece more flowing do the \'short-long\' and \'long-short\' rhythms on all the runs - this will also help your fingers to know where to go. :-)\r\n\r\nCameron, you a fantastic set-up and hand position. So keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 17:03:24','2023-07-01 17:03:24'),(1330,'judge-event-evaluation-1090-1688196191',1090,20,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7089,394,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this piece Clarissa!\r\n- To help your piece flow more please practise the transitions between the sections.\r\n- Try to find some more places you can add dynamic contrasts with your playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\n- The balance between accompaniment and melody could do with some attention - the left hand felt stilted in places (not every single note / beat is important).\r\n- Perhaps having chords for a variation will help give this piece some more interesting.\r\n\r\nClarissa, you show great potential with the piano, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 17:23:11','2023-07-01 17:23:11'),(1333,'judge-event-evaluation-1188-1688197754',1188,21,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7153,5805,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Galilee for playing this whole piece from memory what a feat!\r\nThings always happen in performances, so learn to \'go with it\' and keep thinking forwards and do not dwell on the hiccup while you continue playing.  Remember, your audience is on your side and want you to do your best.  :-)\r\n\r\nYou could spend more time over all the fermatas - enjoy the chords, this gives you space to think what comes next. ;-)\r\nGalilee, you show great potential with the piano, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 17:49:14','2023-07-01 17:49:14'),(1334,'judge-event-evaluation-1114-1688198657',1114,21,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7118,5805,7462,44,'Open','24',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Maimoaga !\r\nI love the use of different voices and gestures that you attributed to each color and character in the story!\r\nI would suggest speaking out a bit more and projecting it upward and forward\r\nYou have a gift for reading and storytelling, let everyone hear it !\r\nKeep it up my friend !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 18:04:17','2023-07-01 18:04:17'),(1335,'judge-event-evaluation-1531-1688202003',1531,17,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7393,4200,7462,44,'Open','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent presentation Handsam ! Great delivery , coupled with varying gestures and expressions , really drives the message home! The flow and fluidity between words were a bit slow at times , but your overall performance was clear and concise.\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 19:00:03','2023-07-01 19:00:03'),(1337,'judge-event-evaluation-1437-1688204537',1437,13,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7195,4208,7462,44,'Open','24',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Lachlan ! You have managed to convey the emotions in the scripture passage excellently.\r\nI understand with the passage being quite lengthy , it may have rushed you a bit in parts , but you\'ve managed to hold yourself well until the end\r\nExcellent work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 19:42:17','2023-07-01 19:42:17'),(1338,'judge-event-evaluation-1225-1688204756',1225,28,1,5,1,2023,345,'1058','1',0,5806,7060,51,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent! Just need to be careful when you squat. Make sure your uniform still consistent with the dress code when you squat. But, overall I am impressed by your presentation!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 19:45:56','2023-07-01 19:45:56'),(1344,'judge-event-evaluation-1453-1688205426',1453,13,1,5,1,2023,183,'464','1',0,4208,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'What a useful content! Time management is a common issue for ACE students. So, thank you for your effort to bring this project up. However, it would be more interesting for other students if you give time to pay more an graphic design. Make sure all words can be read by the audience or more \"eye catching\". Over all, this project is surely become a blessing for other ACE students!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 19:57:06','2023-07-01 19:57:06'),(1345,'judge-event-evaluation-956-1688205819',956,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7152,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Gianna, good try. What a beautiful smile you gave at the end of your presentation!\r\nRemember to practice in front of lots of people as this will build your confidence for the main presentation. \r\nAs you memorize your poem, take time to understand the meaning in each line then work out what hand gestures, body movement, and facial expressions will help bring the message across. Don\'t use them robotically but as naturally as possible. This plus eye contact with the audience (or camera) and your voice will recreate the mood and emotions of a poem. \r\nHope you will try poetry again next convention and see how you have grown. Blessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:03:39','2023-07-01 20:03:39'),(1346,'judge-event-evaluation-1452-1688205908',1452,13,1,5,1,2023,183,'464','2',0,4208,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent presentation! I feel like I was literally diving in the ocean when I open your presentation. I am impressive how you pay attention on the detail of the graphic design and the flow of presentation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:05:08','2023-07-01 20:05:08'),(1347,'judge-event-evaluation-1059-1688206145',1059,20,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7102,394,7462,6,'Open',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'I love the passion conveyed through your poem, Andrew\r\nI do suggest having a clear a structure to your poem so as not to take away from the message, and also keeping the grammar and English used consistent will help your message stand out clearer. (eg. when using Old English terms like \"thee\" and \"thy\" and mixing it with new English such \"Your\" and \"you)\r\nIt is entirely your creative view , and I know it could help you grow your skills.\r\nKeep on writing and inspiring my friend !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:09:05','2023-07-01 20:09:05'),(1348,'judge-event-evaluation-66-1688206489',66,19,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7322,4451,7462,6,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Simple , and yet packed full of wisdom !\r\nThank you for this great poem Braden , you have structured your poem well and clear\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:14:49','2023-07-01 20:14:50'),(1350,'judge-event-evaluation-1249-1688206677',1249,11,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7025,613,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this piece Kathleen! :-)\r\n- Try to find some more places you can add dynamic contrasts with your playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\n- The left hand accompaniment was a bit too heavy in a number of places (not every single note / beat is important).\r\n- The rhythm felt a bit unsteady from page 19. \r\nKeep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:17:57','2023-07-01 20:17:57'),(1351,'judge-event-evaluation-476-1688206743',476,3,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6983,1678,6,32,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Benaya. Thank you for your vocal solo event. Just some key things that would help prepare for future entries. Making sure that documents are submitted. I’ve got that chord chart but what was needed was a score sheet which I wasn’t able to read along with your singing. Proper Diction & Word Emphasis. When singing, making sure that the projection and pronunciation of your words are clear. And lastly, making sure that you face towards the camera/judges. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:19:03','2023-07-01 20:19:03'),(1353,'judge-event-evaluation-673-1688206843',673,3,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,6963,1678,7462,6,'Open',NULL,100,55.00,-10,NULL,'A great message on the first Psalm!\r\nDo remember to try and keep grammar consistent , or even branch out and find new words and functions to help you in writing ! You have a talent for poetry writing , keep creating and learning and never stop writing ,Johns!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:20:43','2023-07-01 20:20:43'),(1356,'judge-event-evaluation-1271-1688207135',1271,8,1,5,1,2023,170,'414','1',0,6328,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Interesting topic! But this would be more interesting if you pay attention on the graphic design. Adding more color shades and some pictures would make this presentation more eye catching for the audience. In addition of that, please give more time to final check your project before submit it. There are some repetitive slides at the bottom part. However,  I am impressive that you have confidence to bring this difficult topic up for your project. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:25:35','2023-07-01 20:25:35'),(1358,'judge-event-evaluation-380-1688207334',380,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7316,4451,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great try Holly! What a wonderful message. \r\nI see you used gestures and facial expressions! Continue to work on making your movements more natural and relax as you present. Slow down a  bit and use pauses to recreate the mood of the scene of the poem. \r\nPracticing a lot in front of family or friends helps to build your confidence for the main presentation. Do try poetry again next convention and you will see how you have grown. \r\nApproach/departure should have been walking into the camera frame and out at the end. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:28:54','2023-07-01 20:28:54'),(1360,'judge-event-evaluation-752-1688207453',752,20,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7105,394,7462,6,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'You have written a beautiful and inspiring poem, Kaitlyn.\r\nI hope you share it as much as you can with everyone around you and continue to touch hearts everywhere\r\nKeep on writing, and never stop inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:30:53','2023-07-01 20:30:53'),(1361,'judge-event-evaluation-1209-1688207640',1209,13,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7175,4208,5,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo Maraia! I encourage you to play with some editing techniques to enhance your photo even more. \r\n\r\nNext time, I\'d love more detail in your report, explain how you found the right angle or had to move for the light etc.. Make sure you complete all sections as well. \r\n\r\nGreat work! I hope to see more from you next year. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:34:00','2023-07-01 20:34:00'),(1362,'judge-event-evaluation-483-1688207659',483,3,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6974,1678,6,32,'Collection','24',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Brayden. Thank you for your vocal solo entry. Just some things that would help prepare for future entries. Making sure you memorize the lyrics, face the camera/judges, clear projection and pronunciation when singing the words, and making sure correct documentation are supplied. I have the chord chart but what was needed was the score sheet which is why I was not able to read the music and follow you. Well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:34:19','2023-07-01 20:34:20'),(1364,'judge-event-evaluation-674-1688207793',674,8,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7063,6328,6,32,'Collection','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done well done well done Benjamin. Thank you for your vocal solo. That was amazing. Keep up the great work training your vocals. I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:36:33','2023-07-01 20:36:33'),(1365,'judge-event-evaluation-1073-1688207944',1073,21,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7118,5805,7462,6,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A very expressive poem indeed !\r\nThank you for this Maimoaga\r\nOne piece of advice I would give , is to remember to stay consistent with your rhythm and meter use, so that your poem will be fluidly flowing.\r\nKeep it up my friend!\r\nI for sure gave my mother a big hug after reading this !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:39:04','2023-07-01 20:39:04'),(1368,'judge-event-evaluation-548-1688208184',548,15,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7041,4679,5,2,'Collection','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo Matthew! I love the colours and the movement captured with the bird. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:43:04','2023-07-01 20:43:04'),(1369,'judge-event-evaluation-854-1688208271',854,20,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7093,394,7462,6,'Open',NULL,100,53.00,-10,NULL,'How truly grateful we are to God !\r\nThank you Stephanie for writing a beautiful poem\r\nGrammar and rhythm can definitely be improved , but you have put in so much emotion and heart into this poem !\r\nKeep writing and learning , and never stop inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:44:31','2023-07-01 20:44:31'),(1370,'judge-event-evaluation-351-1688208357',351,12,1,5,1,2023,170,'414','1',0,1132,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent presentation! I do appreciate that you still put the Biblical context on your project. There is an input on how you credit the source.  I think you have to credit the source link of every pictures taken from google. However, it was a wonderful presentation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:45:57','2023-07-01 20:45:57'),(1372,'judge-event-evaluation-907-1688208459',907,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7260,5806,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good try Jimaima! I could see that you were nervous but it is wonderful that you tried.\r\nThank you for using hand gestures and movements to help bring your message across. \r\nContinue to work on them to make them more natural and that comes with more practice in front of the mirror or other people. \r\nWork on your facial expressions and vocal inflection; with a happy poem there were lots of places to smile and be very expressive in your voice. \r\nTry again next year and see how you have grown. \r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:47:39','2023-07-01 20:47:39'),(1373,'judge-event-evaluation-615-1688208627',615,8,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7077,6328,5,2,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Nice photo Michael! I love the colour of the bird against the dark water. Next time, try looking into object placement, the bird is not quite centered but also not using rule of thirds.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:50:27','2023-07-01 20:50:27'),(1374,'judge-event-evaluation-1013-1688208745',1013,21,1,5,1,2023,184,'465','1',0,5805,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent presentation! I am impressed that you provide a clickable table of content on your presentation. However, it would be more relatable if you can provide the Bible point of view of your topic. Over all, it is an interesting presentation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:52:25','2023-07-01 20:52:25'),(1376,'judge-event-evaluation-1021-1688208984',1021,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7267,5806,5,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo, Narieta. I love the detail in your report, well done. The way the light reflects off the water droplet is beautiful, great work capturing that. I wonder if you could have positioned yourself or cropped the photo to make that stand out even more, it is very interesting. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements. I hope to see more from you next year!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 20:56:24','2023-07-01 20:56:24'),(1377,'judge-event-evaluation-784-1688209256',784,10,1,5,1,2023,184,'465','1',0,1467,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Great presentation! Your school must be so blessed to have you as student. You are able to promote your school in a such interesting ways. Some points to improve are:\r\n* you can improve the graphic design with the latest trend of layout so your presentation can be more interesting for younger age audiences\r\n*remember to put the Bibliography. I believe the definition of ACE curriculum might come from the Procedures Manual book are ACE website.\r\nThank you for promoting one of the ACE schools in a such interesting way! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:00:56','2023-07-01 21:00:56'),(1379,'judge-event-evaluation-1023-1688209300',1023,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7251,5806,5,2,'Collection','8',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, Niuselu! The position of the trees with the blue sky in-between creates an interesting photo that makes your viewer want to stop and look into the detail more. \r\nThe low lighting is difficult to capture, it makes the photograph appear slightly blurry. Good job at getting the photo before the light disappeared. \r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:01:40','2023-07-01 21:01:40'),(1382,'judge-event-evaluation-1120-1688209537',1120,46,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7449,4504,5,2,'Collection','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo, Olisha! Great focus on the subject, the plants really stand out. Photographing in bright sunlight can be difficult.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:05:37','2023-07-01 21:05:37'),(1384,'judge-event-evaluation-1270-1688209827',1270,8,1,5,1,2023,171,'415','3',0,6328,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for taking us the wonderful journey to Switzerland! Interesting presentation! But the display of your presentation would be more interesting if you put plain color for the background. It would make your photos on each sub topic visually clear. However. I am impressed that you also put Biblical context on your presentation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:10:27','2023-07-01 21:10:27'),(1385,'judge-event-evaluation-590-1688209837',590,20,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7169,394,5,2,'Collection','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great and interesting photo, Oliver. I am not sure if the photo submitted with the report is the original photo or not. Make sure you make it clear when submitting that you have attached the original as per guidelines. I would also love to see more detail in your report. You captured a very interesting photograph but gave no details of how you achieved it. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:10:37','2023-07-01 21:10:37'),(1386,'judge-event-evaluation-912-1688209858',912,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7261,5806,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kaloafu! \r\nGood eye contact and vocal inflection!\r\nWonderful use of gestures and movement; just work on making them flow more naturally. That comes from practice and thinking through the meaning of each line then relaxing and letting it flow. \r\nThere were times in the poem that you needed to smile because they were happy moments.\r\nBlessings,',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:10:58','2023-07-01 21:10:58'),(1387,'judge-event-evaluation-1145-1688209908',1145,21,1,5,1,2023,20,'062',NULL,7156,5805,7462,6,'Open',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'\"We must not stand down-left , but up-right\"\r\nNow that\'s a bar ! Love the poem good sir !\r\nI do feel it could\'ve been structured a little better and maybe spaced out a bit to match rhythms, and meter consistency to be aware of.\r\nBut a great piece nonetheless!\r\nKeep on writing and inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:11:48','2023-07-01 21:11:49'),(1388,'judge-event-evaluation-626-1688210116',626,3,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6981,1678,5,2,'Collection','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, Olyvia! Photographing in the sun can be really difficult, look into techniques for working in full sunlight that can help to achieve crisper focus. Great composition and object placement. Well done! \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:15:16','2023-07-01 21:15:16'),(1389,'judge-event-evaluation-1268-1688210138',1268,8,1,5,1,2023,171,'415','1',0,6328,7060,4,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Great presentation! But pay attention on the theme or flow of presentation. I think you flow of presentation be not in line when you discuss about Bhineka Tunggal Ika as Indonesia philosophy. However, thank you for bringing Kebaya up on this project!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:15:38','2023-07-01 21:15:38'),(1392,'judge-event-evaluation-766-1688210395',766,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7341,5804,5,2,'Collection','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Striking photo, Om! The all green leaves at the bottom draws attention quickly away from the beautiful patterns. It might have been good to either zoom in, or crop the photo afterwards. Really great work!\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:19:55','2023-07-01 21:19:56'),(1393,'judge-event-evaluation-497-1688210594',497,15,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7043,4679,5,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo, Pretty. Lovely dog! The photo is slightly out of focus, this could be to do with the lighting. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:23:14','2023-07-01 21:23:15'),(1394,'judge-event-evaluation-1124-1688210769',1124,46,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7445,4504,5,2,'Collection','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo, Pricilla. Great focus on the flower an the colours are balanced.\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:26:09','2023-07-01 21:26:09'),(1395,'judge-event-evaluation-1024-1688211167',1024,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7271,5806,5,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, Ruci! It definitely is a photo from nature, but being a close up, I think it also would have done well in Macro Photography. \r\nWith a little bit of editing, the white would have popped even more from the background. Really striking photo! Well done.\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:32:47','2023-07-01 21:32:47'),(1396,'judge-event-evaluation-1464-1688211193',1464,25,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7357,5804,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Katarina, good job! \r\nWhat a great message you presented! Good voice projection.\r\nContinue to practice presenting poems; work on adding natural gestures and movements. When you are memorizing your poem think about the meaning of each line and what facial expressions, and changes in your voice (tone, intonation, when to pause) will recreate how the poem feels. \r\nApproach/departure should have been walking into the camera frame and out in the end. \r\nBlessings,',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:33:13','2023-07-01 21:33:13'),(1398,'judge-event-evaluation-1089-1688211308',1089,20,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7091,394,6,32,'Collection','24',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Evangelo. Thank you for your vocal solo entry. Just some things that would help prepare for future entries. Loved the gestures and hand movements when singing. Would be easier for you if you had an instrumental background piano playing that would help if you on time and in the proper key range. Well done, keep practicing and I look forward to what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:35:08','2023-07-01 21:35:08'),(1400,'judge-event-evaluation-1444-1688212179',1444,13,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7177,4208,5,2,'Collection','8',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo, Ruth. The colours are vibrant and I can see from your report the changes you made to make the flower stand out. When cropping and rotating look for the lines. The stem is leaning one way, and the fence line has another lean. You could choose either of these to straight which would balance the photograph. \r\n\r\nGreat work! I hope to see more from you next year. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:49:39','2023-07-01 21:49:39'),(1401,'judge-event-evaluation-768-1688212334',768,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7339,5804,5,2,'Collection','8',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, Rushikesh! The colours are lovely and you\'ve chosen a good angle to shoot from. I\'d love to see more detail in your report to explain how you achieved this. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:52:14','2023-07-01 21:52:15'),(1403,'judge-event-evaluation-288-1688212438',288,12,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6992,1132,6,32,'Collection','24',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jonathan. Thank you so much your vocal solo entry. Just a few things that would help prepare for future conventions. Don’t be afraid to use hand movements while singing. Practice opening your lips wider and  singing from your diaphragm. Try that and you will start to notice a difference. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:53:58','2023-07-01 21:53:58'),(1404,'judge-event-evaluation-614-1688212509',614,8,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7082,6328,5,2,'Collection','8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful photo, Ryan. The colours you have captured are lovely. Working with the sun is difficult sometimes! I think this may have contributed to a slight blur in your photo. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 21:55:09','2023-07-01 21:55:10'),(1406,'judge-event-evaluation-1198-1688213142',1198,21,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7143,5805,6,32,'Collection','24',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done well done well done Jordan. Thank you so much for your vocal solo entry. Just one thing. That the backing music doesn’t overpower your vocals. Other than that, well done. Keep up the great work and practicing. Looking forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:05:42','2023-07-01 22:05:42'),(1407,'judge-event-evaluation-378-1688213253',378,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7317,4451,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Laura, good try!\r\nGreat voice projection and diction!\r\nI do see that you use gestures but continue to work on them that they become free and natural movements. \r\nEye contact is important when presenting and should be directed to the audience (or camera). You tended to look above the camera a lot during this presentation. \r\nApproach/departure should have been walking into the camera frame and off at the end. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:07:33','2023-07-01 22:07:33'),(1408,'judge-event-evaluation-1026-1688213511',1026,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7268,5806,5,2,'Collection','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo, Salote! Good focus on the eyes, it draws you to the puppies face. Some parts of the puppies face do appear blurred, I\'d love to see the whole subject in clear focus. \r\n\r\nWell done, I hope to see more from you next year!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:11:51','2023-07-01 22:11:51'),(1409,'judge-event-evaluation-975-1688214437',975,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7348,5804,5,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, Terumah! Creative and original work. I think the only difficulty was the lighting that made it harder for oyu to find good focus and colour. You could try to use another light source to help highlight the flower and assist in getting a quality photo. \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, without the original photograph submitted with the report, I was unable to mark all criteria well. Please check the guidelines for requirements. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:27:17','2023-07-01 22:27:17'),(1410,'judge-event-evaluation-585-1688214452',585,15,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7053,4679,6,32,'Collection','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kenneth. Thank you for your vocal solo entry. Some key tips. Try a lower key. That would have helped you reach the notes. Practice opening your lips wide to pronounce the words clearly. And the score sheet that was submitted was in the key of “G” but you sang the song in the key of “C”. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:27:32','2023-07-01 22:27:32'),(1411,'judge-event-evaluation-1210-1688214737',1210,13,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7178,4208,5,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely, bright photo! It would have been great if the flowers and leaves were more in focus. I would also love more detail in the report of how you used the camera/ phone to get the photo as well as any editing. \r\n\r\nGreat work, I hope to see more from you next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:32:17','2023-07-01 22:32:17'),(1413,'judge-event-evaluation-1088-1688215257',1088,20,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7169,394,6,32,'Collection','24',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Oliver. Thank you so much for your vocal solo entry. Love this song and you sand it really well. Just a few things. Pronunciation of words could be clearer. Moving and using hand gestures would help you a little as well being comfortable while singing. Other than that, well done and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-01 22:40:57','2023-07-01 22:40:57'),(1414,'judge-event-evaluation-835-1688215280',835,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7340,5804,5,2,'Collection','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, Toroagtoka!  \r\n\r\nUnfortunately, I could not mark all criteria well because the original photo was not submitted with the report. Please check the guidelines for requirements. I would also love to see more detail in your report of how you came to this outcome. There are many steps in taken a photograph!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL