0,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'It\'s a great message. You have great potential. Keep doing your best, Ruth.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 04:43:50','2023-07-02 04:43:50'),(1462,'judge-event-evaluation-1183-1688237667',1183,46,1,5,1,2023,291,'911',NULL,7443,4504,7372,46,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for trying your best, Stan. Nice story and pictures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 04:54:27','2023-07-02 04:54:27'),(1464,'judge-event-evaluation-1552-1688264803',1552,20,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7089,394,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your expressive reading, Clarissa! The story of Moses is one of the most famous and interesting stories in the Bible, so good job on choosing a wonderful narrative to use for this event.\r\n\r\nYou spoke very clearly, and your voice inflections and projections really fit the script. You performed with a lot of poise and confidence - well done! However, it would have helped to be as equally expressive with your facial expressions as you were with your reading. It would have been really effective if you had shown emotions in your face so that your audience can feel the words of the story as they watch and listen to you read.\r\n\r\nI would also like to encourage you to pay attention to your surroundings. As you were required to film your entry for this Online Convention, it would have worked better if you had filmed where there were less distractions, i.e. the noise in the background.\r\n\r\nThis is a good effort, Clarissa! This is only the beginning, and you are already on the right track to advancing your talent in this category of the arts. With more time and experience you will only get better. I\'m excited for you as you continue to glorify God with your talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 12:26:43','2023-07-02 12:26:43'),(1465,'judge-event-evaluation-816-1688264867',816,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7347,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A good attempt at something new, Jamesa.\r\n*Explore something that fills the page that allows freedom with textures and shading.\r\n*Observe other pieces to get new ideas.\r\nBlessings as you develop this artistic expression. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 12:27:47','2023-07-02 12:27:47'),(1466,'judge-event-evaluation-604-1688266300',604,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7355,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasing first attempt, Japheth.\r\n*Grab the opportunity to explore further the art of Sketching using Pen & Ink \r\n*Shading in light/dark tones capture the direction of light.\r\nBe brave in your pursuit of excellence.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 12:51:40','2023-07-02 12:51:40'),(1467,'judge-event-evaluation-602-1688266450',602,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7354,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 12:54:10','2023-07-02 12:54:10'),(1468,'judge-event-evaluation-490-1688267164',490,15,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7049,4679,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A calm scene from nature, Thank you.\r\n*There are limitless possibilities for further exploring the use of shading and textural use.\r\nWell done for the brave attempt.\r\n(Was the correct Report submitted?)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:06:04','2023-07-02 13:06:04'),(1469,'judge-event-evaluation-453-1688267682',453,17,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7390,4200,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A full and interesting piece.\r\n*The fullness of this piece deserves a fuller space\r\nThank you and blessings as you further explore the use of Ink in Sketching.\r\n\r\n(In place of a Report your entry was submitted a second time.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:14:42','2023-07-02 13:14:42'),(1470,'judge-event-evaluation-832-1688267946',832,25,1,5,1,2023,194,'506',NULL,7360,5804,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort, Sailosi.\r\n*Explore the wider possibilities of sketching with Pen & Ink.\r\n*You are now ready for the bigger challenge.\r\nBlessings for confidence to explore.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:19:06','2023-07-02 13:19:06'),(1471,'judge-event-evaluation-700-1688269033',700,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7410,4200,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasant and creative piece.\r\n*This entry should have been more appropriately placed under OPEN - Geometric Abstract.\r\nBlessings as you explore the same techniques in a realistic piece from nature.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:37:13','2023-07-02 13:37:13'),(1472,'judge-event-evaluation-1314-1688269347',1314,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7387,4200,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasant piece depicting something from nature.\r\n*This piece is more appropriate under OPEN Geometric Abstract.\r\nBe blessed as you explore and develop this technique.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:42:27','2023-07-02 13:42:27'),(1473,'judge-event-evaluation-1315-1688269829',1315,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7386,4200,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A creative piece of art.\r\n*Angular framing around the central focus was very busy.\r\n*The lack of a Report prevented assessment of the items used.\r\nThis entry is more appropriately submitted as OPNE- Geometric Abstract.\r\nBlessings as you pursue this technique which you obviously enjoy. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:50:29','2023-07-02 13:50:29'),(1474,'judge-event-evaluation-210-1688270248',210,21,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7154,5805,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A very pleasing piece of art, Jovilisi.  I am keen to see the actual piece.\r\n*Keep the initialling of your work to the back, for less of a distraction.\r\nBe blessed as you enhance this talent in visual art.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 13:57:28','2023-07-02 13:57:28'),(1475,'judge-event-evaluation-1063-1688270615',1063,10,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7281,1467,7234,17,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasant sketch from nature.\r\n*A light pencilled-frame would enhance this piece.\r\nBe blessed as you further explore this talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:03:35','2023-07-02 14:03:35'),(1476,'judge-event-evaluation-1307-1688270978',1307,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7402,4200,7234,17,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'An interesting piece of Geometric Abstract art.\r\n*Good use of a variety of textures\r\n*This entry is more suited to OPEN Geometric Abstract\r\n\r\nBlessings as you develop your talent further.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:09:38','2023-07-02 14:09:39'),(1477,'judge-event-evaluation-441-1688271597',441,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7405,4200,7234,17,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasant piece of creative art.\r\n*This entry is more suited to OPEN Geometric Abstract.\r\n*A wide variety of textures used.\r\nBe blessed as you develop further your interest in the Pen & Ink medium.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:19:57','2023-07-02 14:19:58'),(1480,'judge-event-evaluation-1032-1688272622',1032,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7175,4208,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Maraia, good try! Love your message.\r\nYou have good voice projection and it was good to see your use of gestures and movement with your presentation.\r\nBut slow down your words. When you speak too fast, it affects your delivery (inflection, diction, enunciation) and makes it harder to recreate the feelings in the poem. Slowing down also enables your hand movements to be more natural. Remember to smile in happy poems. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:37:02','2023-07-02 14:37:02'),(1483,'judge-event-evaluation-433-1688272837',433,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7407,4200,7234,17,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasantly captured study from nature.\r\n*Without a report i could determine the source of your sketch.\r\n\r\nBlessings as you explore and develop this talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:40:37','2023-07-02 14:40:38'),(1484,'judge-event-evaluation-1107-1688273246',1107,13,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7196,4208,7234,17,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I so enjoyed the \'movement\' in this piece, captivated by the enjoyment in the facial expression of the dancer.\r\n\r\nBe blessed as you further explore and develop this talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:47:26','2023-07-02 14:47:26'),(1485,'judge-event-evaluation-809-1688273317',809,19,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7317,4451,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks, Laura, for this piano solo! \r\nYou have some nice dynamics coming through this piece. :-) I think you could still discover some softer moments particularly at the start. Also, observe the fermata moments too - these are your moments to enjoy your sound of the piano and the music you are making!\r\n\r\nI do wonder however if your solo meets Biblical Worldview. Perhaps a good way to ask this question would be, would I play this during a church service?\r\n\r\nP.S. Note to your awesome film crew: Please have your device in landscape, so that the video is the right way around and fills the full screen. ;-)\r\n\r\nLaura, you show great potential with the piano, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory and I hope to hear you play again someday!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:48:37','2023-07-02 14:48:37'),(1486,'judge-event-evaluation-808-1688273535',808,19,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7316,4451,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing your piano solo Holly! \r\n- Have you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano - which would make it easier! \r\n- Try to find some more dynamic colours with your playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\n- Continue to work on swung quavers.\r\n\r\nP.S. Note to your awesome film crew: Please have your device in landscape, so that the video is the right way around. ;-)\r\n\r\nI hope to hear you play again someday! Holly, you show great potential with the piano, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:52:15','2023-07-02 14:52:15'),(1488,'judge-event-evaluation-951-1688273627',951,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7149,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Mele! I looked like it may have been your first time presenting. Good job for trying!\r\nRemember practice make perfect. As you memorize your poem think about the message and what each line is saying then add your facial expressions, voice, gestures, movement, etc to help recreate the emotions and mood of the poem. Then practice a lot in front of people. \r\nI hope you try again next convention and see how you have grown. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:53:47','2023-07-02 14:53:47'),(1490,'judge-event-evaluation-724-1688273662',724,17,1,5,1,2023,205,'556',NULL,7408,4200,7234,17,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'An interesting and comprehensive and peaceful scene.\r\n*I was keen to read a report for more details.\r\n\r\nBlessings as you explore this talent further.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 14:54:22','2023-07-02 14:54:22'),(1491,'judge-event-evaluation-676-1688274678',676,19,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7328,4451,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,-1.00,'Thanks for sharing your piano solo Luke! \r\n- Have you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano - which would make it easier! \r\n- Try to find some dynamic colours with your playing - this will make it more interesting for you as the player and for your audience.\r\n- Be mindful to keep your rhythm consistent throughout the piece.\r\n- Unfortunately, I had to deduct some marks because your piece was under the minimum time limit of 1 minute.\r\n\r\nLuke, keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 15:11:18','2023-07-02 15:11:18'),(1492,'judge-event-evaluation-1203-1688275122',1203,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7155,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Mihaela, good job! \r\nGood voice projection and enunciation! \r\nI can see you used some gestures.  You can use more movement and relax and allow them to flow more naturally.\r\nBlessings\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 15:18:42','2023-07-02 15:18:42'),(1495,'judge-event-evaluation-582-1688275684',582,15,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7040,4679,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this piece Marvella! :-)\r\n- When you are doing your spoken introduction, please speak a bit louder. Also, add some pauses between bits of your spoken introduction. Unfortunately, it was hard to hear what you were saying.\r\n- For your next piano solo, please include the music notes for what you plan your left hand to play as the accompaniment part in your submitted score. Unfortunately, I had to deduct points as I couldn\'t see what notes your left hand was going to play and the introduction didn\'t seem to be on your sheet music.\r\n- Please wear shoes - like you would for a performance. ;-)\r\n- I liked how you had a good array of dynamic colours coming through.\r\n \r\nMarvella, you show great potential with the piano, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory and I hope to hear you play again someday!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 15:28:04','2023-07-02 15:28:04'),(1499,'judge-event-evaluation-1526-1688279668',1526,17,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7382,4200,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Hajean! What an intriguing choice of material for this event - great job on the awesome pick. \r\n\r\nYour voice inflections were very fitting with your script for the most part; however, more could have been done with your vocal projection. A little more body movement would have helped your performance as well. The way in which you deliver your reading, combined with your body movements/gestures, is exactly what pulls your audience into the story. This is what keeps your audience hooked.\r\n\r\nAll in all, you did a fantastic job! Well done, Hajean. I\'m excited for you and how you use your incredible talent to honour and glorify God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 16:34:28','2023-07-02 16:34:28'),(1500,'judge-event-evaluation-1212-1688281789',1212,10,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7281,1467,6958,44,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kerenhapukh. \r\n\r\nI love the script you have chosen. Not many would have chosen a script like that to read. You have also read it in a very expressive and presentable way. Although some parts the pronunciation can be better, but overall it was a very effective performance. May you continue to use your talents, giftings, passion and desires for the extension of His kingdom. 2 Tim 4:7.  All glory and honour to the Lord. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 17:09:49','2023-07-02 17:09:49'),(1502,'judge-event-evaluation-1233-1688282742',1233,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7266,5806,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Eliana! What a beautiful story - great job on choosing this fantastic material! Very touching, indeed!\r\n\r\nYou gave such a wonderful performance. Your voice inflections were great, although you could have projected your voice more. Your performance would have also been enhanced with the use of more body movement/gestures and facial expressions. All in all, you gave a strong delivery. Great job! I\'m so excited for what\'s ahead of you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 17:25:42','2023-07-02 17:25:42'),(1503,'judge-event-evaluation-1187-1688283129',1187,46,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7442,4504,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,50.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your expressive reading, Miranda! This was an interesting choice of material - I assume it is one of your personal reads that you\'ve come to enjoy in your own time. Personally, I am unfamiliar with this piece of literature, so I assume it is a material with moral and Scriptural value if you have decided to use it for this event.\r\n\r\nYour voice inflections were incredible; however, there\'s room to improve with your vocal projection. In this event, you really have to allow yourself to express the words you\'re reading, and you do this by the way you speak and move. I understand these platform events may make you feel intimidated, but with more time and practice I believe you\'ll only get better - you\'re on the right track!\r\n\r\nThis a good effort, Miranda! I am excited for you as you continue to honour and glorify God with your amazing talent.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 17:32:09','2023-07-02 17:32:09'),(1504,'judge-event-evaluation-550-1688284747',550,19,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7323,4451,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Kayla! This was such a beautiful story. Good job on choosing an awesome piece!\r\n\r\nYou were excellent in your performance! Both your voice inflections and vocal projection were most fitting with the script/narrative. You also did so well in maintaining the attention of your audience. However, I would like to encourage you to also use more body movements/gestures in the future. In this performance, you kept your body language to a minimum which overall worked really well, but there were points where expressing with body movement would have enhanced your delivery.\r\n\r\nOverall, you did a brilliant job. Well done, Kayla! I am so excited for what\'s ahead of you as you continue to honour God with your amazing talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 17:59:07','2023-07-02 17:59:07'),(1505,'judge-event-evaluation-1185-1688285817',1185,11,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7025,613,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Kathleen! An empowering choice of material - you can never go wrong with Scripture. Good job!\r\n\r\nYou gave a brilliant performance. The voice inflections, as well as the vocal projection, fit your reading material perfectly! In addition, your facial expressions went along with them. However, more could have been done with your body language. Body movement and gestures really have a way with enhancing a performance in expressive reading. I encourage you to factor that into your future expressive reading performances. Trying to balance reading as well as maintaining eye contact with your audience could also do a lot for your performance.\r\n\r\nOverall, you did an excellent job! Well done, Kathleen. I\'m excited for what\'s ahead of you as you continue to serve God with the use of your amazing talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 18:16:57','2023-07-02 18:16:57'),(1506,'judge-event-evaluation-1234-1688286748',1234,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7261,5806,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Kalo! What a touching piece - it brought me to tears. Well done on this great selection! It was such a blessing.\r\n\r\nThis was an outstanding performance! Your reading flowed so beautifully, and you had the body movement/gestures and facial expressions that went perfectly with it. Your voice inflections and vocal projection were most fitting! You had my attention from beginning to end. This was beautifully done! However, I noticed there were some points where you might have forgotten the pronunciation of certain words or may have missed a line, and so you looked off to the side. In moments like these, I\'d encourage you to keep going as though nothing happened. Carry on your performance all the way to the end.\r\n\r\nAll in all, you did an excellent job! I am so excited to see what\'s ahead of you as you continue serving God with your amazing talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 18:32:28','2023-07-02 18:32:28'),(1507,'judge-event-evaluation-1235-1688287607',1235,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7263,5806,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Luse! What a lovely piece to read. Good job on this wonderful selection! Thank you for blessing us with it.\r\n\r\nYou gave a really great performance, Luse! The way you read the story flowed very well. You had the voice inflections and projection, facial expressions and body movements needed to give a strong delivery. However, if there\'s anything I would encourage you to do, it is to engage with your audience through eye contact. It is tricky to balance eye contact with reading, but with more practice you\'ll will only improve more and more (you\'re already doing a great job!!!). \r\n\r\nOverall, you did a fantastic job! Well done, Luse. I am so excited for what is ahead of you as you continue to serve God through the use of your wonderful talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 18:46:47','2023-07-02 18:46:47'),(1508,'judge-event-evaluation-764-1688289451',764,20,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7102,394,6,2,'Open','8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Andrew. Great photo. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:17:31','2023-07-02 19:17:31'),(1509,'judge-event-evaluation-774-1688289548',774,15,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7039,4679,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good try Rachel! \r\nI could hear inflection in your voice and your were trying to enunciate your words, but work on it more so that your vocal expression is bigger. \r\nNext time try a longer poem and ask your parents or Supervisor for help to find one that has a Biblical Worldview.\r\n\r\nPoem is in conflict with a Biblical Worldview. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:19:08','2023-07-04 12:25:35'),(1510,'judge-event-evaluation-990-1688289898',990,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7129,5805,6,2,'Open','8',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Christian. Thank you for your nature photo entry. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Practice playing around with lighting and exposure on other camera devices. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:24:58','2023-07-02 19:24:58'),(1511,'judge-event-evaluation-503-1688289925',503,3,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,6981,1678,7460,44,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Olyvia! Your performance, as well as your choice of material, was thoroughly enjoyed. You did a good job! \r\n\r\nExpressive reading is arguably one of the most intimidating, and complex, events in the Platform category (I shied away from it until I reached high school). This is because, unlike other Platform events that require memorisation, expressive reading demands that you balance reading and engaging with your audience at the same time. With that being said, it can seem difficult at times. However, I know you put in your best effort and I\'m SO proud of you for choosing this event so early on in your Student Convention experience.\r\n\r\nYour voice inflections were good and fit the tone of your material; however, there is room for improvement in your vocal projection. Incorporating more body movement and facial expressions will also dramatically enhance your delivery. These are all things you are bound to learn with more time, practice and experience in Student Convention.\r\n\r\nGood job, Olyvia! Keep up the great work. I look forward to seeing what\'s ahead of you as you continue to use your talent to bring glory to God!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:25:25','2023-07-02 19:25:25'),(1513,'judge-event-evaluation-1232-1688290347',1232,28,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7278,5806,7462,44,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Victoria for a wonderful reading!\r\nYou have great poise and a very clear voice, which I am sure everyone loves to hear, so don\'t be afraid to speak out and really project your voice upward and outward ! Also, adding in more expressions and gestures would greatly enhance your amazing reading capability and serve to really drive home the goal of expressive reading - Speaking with more than words !\r\nKeep inspiring ! \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:32:27','2023-07-02 19:32:27'),(1514,'judge-event-evaluation-507-1688290570',507,3,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,6969,1678,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Pauline! This is a good effort on your part. I trust you did your absolute best and I applaud you for it. Your voice inflections were awesome, although there is room for improvement in your vocal projection. Showing the emotion of what you\'re reading through your body language and your facial expressions will also help you dramatically. \r\n\r\nI understand expressive reading may be a bit intimidating, but I believe that with more time and practice you will grow in confidence and deliver more in your performance - it is only a matter of time.\r\nThank you for blessing us with this entry, Pauline! I am so excited for you and look forward to what\'s ahead of you as you use your talent to serve and honour God!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:36:10','2023-07-02 19:36:10'),(1517,'judge-event-evaluation-985-1688291840',985,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7130,5805,6,2,'Open','8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Donna. Thank you for your nature photo entry. Beautiful photo. Keep up the great work. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 19:57:20','2023-07-02 19:57:20'),(1518,'judge-event-evaluation-1113-1688292329',1113,21,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7123,5805,7462,44,'Open','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Exceptional reading Susan, you managed to portray the emotion of the story beautifully and clearly!\r\nYou have a gift for storytelling , and I do hope you continue to nurture this skill!\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 20:05:29','2023-07-02 20:05:29'),(1519,'judge-event-evaluation-1028-1688292879',1028,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7254,5806,6,2,'Open','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Edward. Thank you for your nature entry. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 20:14:39','2023-07-02 20:14:39'),(1520,'judge-event-evaluation-1224-1688293078',1224,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7271,5806,7469,45,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Ruci! What an enjoyable presentation!\r\nRemember that longer pauses, or slowing down at times in a poem can also give a dramatic effect vocally. \r\nKeep using your talent to praise God.\r\nBlessings\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 20:17:58','2023-07-02 20:17:58'),(1521,'judge-event-evaluation-699-1688293166',699,17,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7410,4200,6,2,'Open','8',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Faithania. Thank you for your nature entry. Just a few things. Playing around with the exposure to get a clearer picture and also with the focus as well. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 20:19:26','2023-07-02 20:19:26'),(1522,'judge-event-evaluation-1511-1688293537',1511,17,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7393,4200,6,2,'Open','8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Handsam and thank you for the description of your report but what was also needed was the description of how you took the photo, did you use auto or manual settings and with what device. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 20:25:37','2023-07-02 20:25:37'),(1523,'judge-event-evaluation-280-1688294817',280,10,1,5,1,2023,176,'454',NULL,6988,1467,7480,2,'Open','12',100,70.00,-10,0.00,'Lovely photo Lael! Those street sellers certainly do work very hard.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. Use a high resolution image. The image you\'ve submitted seems a bit small for the camera you\'ve used. 2. Framing - think about your subject. Will people immediately see that the street seller is your subject or could they think this is a street scene? How can you frame your shot so that the subject stands out? 3. Give details on how you set up for your photo. It\'s great to be able to relate your photo to the Bible, and there\'s nothing wrong with that, but aside from the Biblical worldview it isn\'t going to help the judges score your work. We need to know how you set up your shot. Did you use special equipment? Did you use any enhancements? Did you choose not to enhance your photo? I recommend that any student reads through the judges forms for the event they are entering. It helps you to know what is important to include in your reports.\r\nLooking forward to your next entry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 20:46:57','2023-07-02 20:46:57'),(1525,'judge-event-evaluation-561-1688295678',561,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6963,1678,6,2,'Open','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Johns. Thank you for your nature entry. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:01:18','2023-07-02 21:01:18'),(1526,'judge-event-evaluation-1050-1688295799',1050,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7177,4208,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Ruth! I think you have a wonderful speaking voice. \r\nContinue to practice and you will only get better. \r\nWork on saying your words clearly(enunciation). Slow down the tempo of the delivery of your words so that you can recreate the emotions and mood of the poem. As you practice you can add movements that help enhance your piece.  \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:03:19','2023-07-02 21:03:19'),(1527,'judge-event-evaluation-1039-1688295999',1039,20,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7105,394,6,2,'Open','8',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kaitlyn for your nature entry. More information was needed for your report but what was also needed was the description of how you took the photo. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:06:39','2023-07-02 21:06:39'),(1528,'judge-event-evaluation-509-1688296448',509,3,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,6972,1678,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Phebe! The story of Ruth is a great choice for your reading material - good job on selecting a beautiful read!\r\n\r\nThis was a good effort from you, Phebe; however, there are ways in which you can improve in this event. One the most notable, and guaranteed, ways of improving is practice. From your entry, it is clear that you have a lot of potential. Your voice inflections were good, but more vocal projection would have also helped with the impact of your delivery. You used your body language a lot in your performance, but it is important that you also put thought into it so that you aren\'t just moving around unnecessarily. Finally, facial expressions is the last thing that would help maintain the attention of your audience.\r\n\r\nGood job, Phebe! I trust that you gave your best in this performance. Well done. I pray you continue to use your talent to serve and honour God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:14:08','2023-07-02 21:14:08'),(1529,'judge-event-evaluation-952-1688296753',952,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7147,5805,7469,45,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sally, Thank you for your poem. It was a message that I needed to hear today.\r\nYou have a wonderful speaking voice. Continue to use it for God\'s glory.\r\nRemember to smile during your presentation when needed. During practice you can think through movements/gestures and then allow them to come naturally as you present/practice in front of others before your main presentation. \r\n\r\nApproach/departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:19:13','2023-07-02 21:19:13'),(1530,'judge-event-evaluation-981-1688297063',981,10,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7281,1467,6,2,'Open','8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kerenhapukh for your nature entry. As per guidelines, unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:24:23','2023-07-02 21:24:23'),(1532,'judge-event-evaluation-281-1688297575',281,10,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6988,1467,6,2,'Open','8',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Lael for your nature entry. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation and description on the report wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:32:55','2023-07-02 21:32:55'),(1533,'judge-event-evaluation-923-1688297810',923,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7268,5806,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Salote! \r\nGreat eye contact. \r\nIt is good to see that you used movement and gestures but allow them to be more natural. Work on voice variations with pauses within the poem as this will help show the true feelings and mood of the poem. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:36:50','2023-07-02 21:36:51'),(1534,'judge-event-evaluation-948-1688298539',948,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7151,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Sinaoleulalei, this presentation was not easy for you, but you did not give up and you completed it. That\'s important. So well done! \r\nGive this a try again and you will only get better with practice. \r\nSpend lots of time memorizing your piece, working on natural gestures, adding movement and facial expressions  that will enhance your presentation.\r\nTry not to pull faces when you make mistakes. \r\nBlessings\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:48:59','2023-07-02 21:49:00'),(1535,'judge-event-evaluation-563-1688299036',563,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6977,1678,6,2,'Open','8',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Luis for your nature entry.  As per guidelines, unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation and description of how you took the photo wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 21:57:16','2023-07-02 21:57:16'),(1536,'judge-event-evaluation-379-1688299767',379,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7329,4451,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sofia, nice work! Some good facial expressions within your presentation. \r\nWork on the tempo/speed of your poem. You want your delivery and voice to recreate the mood and emotions of the words. \r\nRemember the guidelines say \"no singing allowed\" for poetry.\r\nApproach/departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:09:27','2023-07-02 22:09:27'),(1539,'judge-event-evaluation-585-1688300049',585,15,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7053,4679,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Kenneth, thank you for singing this very meaningful song for convention this year. I really appreciated how you changed the mood and style between the different parts of the song to really allow for there to be a proper climax while also coming away to have the more reflective parts of the song. However, I believe that you can create an even bigger variation in your level of singing by working on using your full diaphragm for breathing to allow you to fully utilise this gift God has given to you. I hope to hear you sing even more challenging music in the future. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:14:09','2023-07-02 22:14:09'),(1540,'judge-event-evaluation-1121-1688300372',1121,46,1,5,1,2023,176,'454',NULL,7447,4504,7480,2,'Open','12',100,59.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Nathan! Those kids look really excited.\r\nA few things for next time. 1. Please give details of how you got your photo in your photography report. It\'s very difficult to score your photo when we don\'t know how you got it. 2. Read the judges form for any event you enter. This gives you a better idea of the criteria you are being scored against. It also helps you to know what to write in your report. 3. With interchangeable lens cameras, please give details of the aperture range of your lens, as well as the focal length. In your report you mentioned you had a 50mm lens but not the aperture range. It can make a difference, especially in lower light photos. 4. Cropping might have really enhanced your photo. Try to eliminate distracting details if possible like the power pole on the left side of the photo. Also, your sky is really over exposed. Cropping it out would have boosted your subject. 5. Check your focus settings. I know that with a large group it is difficult to get everyone in focus but learning more about your camera can help with this. You can also use more manual settings to have the kids in the foreground in focus while the background is blurred. Experiment with techniques to see what works for you. 6. Cloudy skies are a pain for overexposure. You can try to reduce this effect by trying a different time of day, taking photos with better weather conditions, EV settings, and screw on filters (Polarising filter would probably have worked well here).\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:19:32','2023-07-02 22:19:32'),(1541,'judge-event-evaluation-953-1688300447',953,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7136,5805,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Tehillah, good try! It is very good that you completed your poem even though you struggled a bit.\r\nRemember practice makes perfect. When you have a longer poem, you need to take good time to memorize it and think through your gestures/movements. Work on your voice also to show the emotions of the piece. Then practicing in front of family and friends always helps to build confidence and memory. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:20:47','2023-07-02 22:20:47'),(1544,'judge-event-evaluation-555-1688300759',555,3,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,6983,1678,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Thanks for your entry Benaya! The lighting gives really good contrast, and there is so much texture, with those bays under the windows! It would be good to try and get the whole building in, and, maybe move around to try and remove some of the objects in front of the building.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great efforts! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:25:59','2023-07-02 22:25:59'),(1546,'judge-event-evaluation-1013-1688300842',1013,21,1,5,1,2023,184,'465','1',0,5805,5,4,'Open','20',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful presentation! Job well done! \r\nA few minor things I noted. Being non-linear, you want the audience to be able to click back and forth between the sections they are interested in. Your clickable table of contents is very clever! Once you are in the section you are reading, there is not an option to take you back to that table of contents and therefore have to scroll back to find the navigation again. \r\nWhen using images, make sure you use in-text citation. Also, bibliographies usually have more information than just the website. I\'d love to see more detail here next time. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:27:22','2023-07-02 22:27:22'),(1547,'judge-event-evaluation-784-1688300864',784,10,1,5,1,2023,184,'465','1',0,1467,5,4,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful presentation, thank you! I really enjoyed learning more about your school. I would like to show this to the office here at SCEE Australia. \r\nGreat use of navigation links, very easy to use. \r\n\r\nWith citing images, even if you use in text references, you are still required to include a bibliography at the end. Try to add this in next time. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:27:44','2023-07-02 22:27:44'),(1548,'judge-event-evaluation-1088-1688300872',1088,20,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7169,394,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Oliver! Thank for singing this for convention!\r\nHere are some thoughts for you to consider for next time you sing for others:\r\n- Remember to introduce your song before you start singing.\r\n- Find places in the song to be quieter and other places to be louder, i.e. quieter in the verses to build to a louder chorus.\r\n- Try to relax a bit more as this will make it easier for those listening to relax also. Smiling is always good!\r\n- Remember to have fun and enjoy yourself! This is one of many ways we can praise God. \r\nKeep working to develop your gifts and talents. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:27:52','2023-07-02 22:27:52'),(1549,'judge-event-evaluation-391-1688301229',391,11,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7026,613,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Cameron! night lighting is always difficult, so great work! It would be good to just shuffle angles slightly to try and remove the flares from the bulbs. Also, it would be good to warm the pic up (either a lens attachment or a post edit) to give it that really homey inviting look.\r\nPlease also remember to include a proof photo.\r\nKeep up the great efforts! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:33:49','2023-07-02 22:33:49'),(1550,'judge-event-evaluation-513-1688301288',513,3,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,6975,1678,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Samuel, thank you for singing this. I always enjoy hearing this song! \r\nWhen singing, we are sharing stories and all stories have highs and lows and a direction through them. So try to remember to tell your story through the song by including the highs and lows through dynamics and sustaining the notes to maintain a constant line through the storytelling. Although this song is quite introspective and therefore mostly soft, you can still find spots to build to a climax and other spots to fade away. \r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:34:48','2023-07-02 22:34:48'),(1551,'judge-event-evaluation-890-1688301523',890,8,1,5,1,2023,176,'454',NULL,7079,6328,7480,2,'Open','12',100,70.00,-10,0.00,'Great shot Nathanael. You\'ve eliminated distractions and framed your shot well.\r\nA few things for next time:\r\n1. Please give more details in your report. It\'s great to be able to say something about God or the Bible that relates to your photo, but that doesn\'t help us to know how you set up your shot. Also, please read through the judges form for any event you enter. It will show you the criteria you are being scored against and help you to see the information you should be including in your report.\r\n2. When giving info about an interchangeable lens camera, please include information about which lens was used, not just the camera body. The type of lens can make a big difference. A typical Canon lens, for example, would be a 18-55mm, F4.0-5.6. This tells us the zoom range and the aperture range of the lens. Aperture can make a massive difference in lower light settings.\r\n3. Given the type of camera used, and the size of the image, I\'m a bit confused as to why it appears there is ISO noise/pixellation when I look a little closer. Remember that when entering a photo, whether digital or printed, be sure to check if it is nice and clear especially when blown up slightly. Noone is going to look under a magnifying glass to see every detail, but things like this can make a difference in how your picture appears.  Something just doesn\'t quite seem to line up with the information I have about your camera settings and the type of camera. Your photo looks fantastic, but I\'m disappointed it isn\'t sharper to make your subject really stand out.\r\n4. Enhancements. If you have used any on your photo - tell us about that. If you felt you didn\'t need any - say that too. It\'s worth 10 marks in the judges report.\r\n5. Have a look at some guides on framing, rule of thirds (a method - not a rule), and guides on how to get the best from your camera. It could help you come up with some great ideas for amazing photos.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:38:43','2023-07-02 22:38:43'),(1553,'judge-event-evaluation-994-1688301546',994,21,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7153,5805,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Great photo Galilee! The Opera House is a much photographed landmark, and you have done it justice! it would be good to play with the contrast a little, just to deepen the darks, but overall, a great shot!\r\n\r\nJust some trivia - this is where my wife and I went on our first date. :)\r\n\r\nKeep up the excellent work!\r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:39:06','2023-07-02 22:39:06'),(1554,'judge-event-evaluation-997-1688301799',997,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7157,5805,6,2,'Open','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Merewai for your beautiful nature entry. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:43:19','2023-07-02 22:43:19'),(1555,'judge-event-evaluation-1159-1688302035',1159,46,1,5,1,2023,254,'800',NULL,7443,4504,7459,32,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Stan, \r\nThank you so much for singing this powerful piece of music. The story behind the writing of these lyrics by Horatio Spafford is perhaps one of the most incredible pieces of writing that exist in Christian music. Watch out for the intonation of your top notes as they sometimes sounded a little flat. (Perhaps these are at the upper edge of your vocal range at the moment!) Sometimes the accompaniment was a little bit too loud and it covered some of your singing. I hope to hear you sing again one day. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:47:15','2023-07-02 22:47:15'),(1558,'judge-event-evaluation-1270-1688302074',1270,8,1,5,1,2023,171,'415','3',0,6328,5,4,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful bright presentation, I enjoyed learning about Switzerland. I think your presentation may have been better entered into the linear PowerPoint category. Unfortunately you lost marks for not having navigation tools. The only way to view this presentation is to scroll start to finish. \r\n\r\nPlease check requirements for bibliography next time also! \r\n\r\nWell done, God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:47:54','2023-07-02 22:47:54'),(1559,'judge-event-evaluation-1078-1688302157',1078,20,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7098,394,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Joel! Great subject, and I love the second plane in the background!\r\nIt would have been good to crop the photo, so that it is landscape. Also, play with the contrast and saturation - make the blacks darker, and the colours bolder.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:49:17','2023-07-02 22:49:17'),(1561,'judge-event-evaluation-575-1688302741',575,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6967,1678,6,2,'Open','8',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Nanako for your nature entry.  Just a few things that would help in the future. Play around with the lighting, exposure and focus. It was a little bright and the exposure could have been brought down just a little. Unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:59:01','2023-07-02 22:59:01'),(1562,'judge-event-evaluation-1268-1688302745',1268,8,1,5,1,2023,171,'415','1',0,6328,5,4,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely and interesting presentation. \r\nI wonder if this would have been better suited to the linear PowerPoint category, as there are no navigation buttons. The audience must click through in order to view the presentation. \r\n\r\nI would also love to see more information in your bibliography. \r\nWell done one your research and creating an informative presentation!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 22:59:05','2023-07-02 22:59:05'),(1563,'judge-event-evaluation-570-1688302873',570,15,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7053,4679,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Great photo Kenneth! The reflection is really well captured!\r\nIt would have been good to crop it however, make the houses really the center of the photo. This will also remove some of the plants from the front.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 23:01:13','2023-07-02 23:01:13'),(1564,'judge-event-evaluation-995-1688302905',995,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7115,5805,6,2,'Open','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Lusiana for your amazing nature entry. Just a few things. The description of how you took the photo and practice playing with the exposure and focus. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 23:01:45','2023-07-02 23:01:45'),(1566,'judge-event-evaluation-1122-1688303393',1122,46,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7447,4504,6,2,'Open','8',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Nathan for your nature entry.  Just a few things. The photo was a bit blurry and unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation and the description of your end result and how the photo was taken wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 23:09:53','2023-07-02 23:09:53'),(1567,'judge-event-evaluation-1452-1688303480',1452,13,1,5,1,2023,183,'464','2',0,4208,5,4,'Open','19',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great and interesting presentation! The use of sound made the presentation even more engaging. The slide changes were just a little too quick to read all of the great text that you included. I would like more time to read and then look at the interesting pictures also. Next time, get someone to watch it first and note down how long it takes them to properly view each slide. \r\n\r\nGreat job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 23:11:20','2023-07-02 23:11:20'),(1568,'judge-event-evaluation-617-1688303867',617,8,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7079,6328,6,2,'Open','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Nathanael for your nature entry.  Amazing photo. as per guidelines, unfortunately I was not able to mark all the criteria\'s well as proper documentation and description of how the photo was taken wasn\'t provided. Other than that, keep up the great work and I look forward for what God has in store for you. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-02 23:17:47','2023-07-02 23:17:48'),(1569,'judge-event-evaluation-993-1688304148',993,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7134,5805,6,2,'Open','8',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Nunia for your nature entry. Just a few things. Practice playing around with the colour, lighting