r colourful art. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:41:23','2023-07-03 04:41:23'),(1627,'judge-event-evaluation-1009-1688323375',1009,28,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7259,5806,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasing attempt, Abigail.\r\n*Although framing was not required trimming could have eliminated the perforations at the top.\r\n*The entry was for Coloured Pencils, and should not have included Oil Pastels.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:42:55','2023-07-04 11:12:43'),(1628,'judge-event-evaluation-1010-1688323399',1010,28,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7262,5806,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort.\r\nExplore and study a real hand for its lines and marks\r\n* A trimmed edge enhances the finished work.\r\nBlessings as you develop your interest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:43:19','2023-07-03 04:43:19'),(1629,'judge-event-evaluation-279-1688323414',279,32,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7334,5826,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Tiamai, for your beach scene.\r\n*Effective use of shading/colouring.\r\nBest wishes as you further enjoy and develop you talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:43:34','2023-07-03 04:43:35'),(1630,'judge-event-evaluation-592-1688323445',592,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7351,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A pleasing piece, Talitonu.\r\nExplore and branch out to bigger things.\r\nDiscover the use of curved lines to enhance shape and shading.\r\nAll the best as you continue to enjoy and expand this talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:44:05','2023-07-03 04:44:05'),(1631,'judge-event-evaluation-654-1688323468',654,3,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,6986,1678,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Rachel.\r\nExplore and develop;\r\n* Curved outlines that give shape and real perspective\r\n*Lines that enhance texture.\r\nBlessings as you discover and develop your skills further. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:44:28','2023-07-03 04:44:29'),(1632,'judge-event-evaluation-1118-1688323503',1118,46,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7449,4504,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Olisha for the floral piece.\r\n*Spend some time exploring lines in colour.\r\n*Curved lines help give sketches shape.\r\nBlessings as you further develop this talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 04:45:03','2023-07-03 04:45:03'),(1638,'judge-event-evaluation-943-1688326914',943,25,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7351,5804,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,0.00,'Reading this story made my day. You make a great point here.\r\nReligious references, please capitalize God, Jesus, Lord, Father, Holy Spirit, Savior, Heaven, Hell, Bible and the Word (as in the Word of God) and all pronouns referring to God including Him and His.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 05:41:54','2023-07-03 05:41:54'),(1641,'judge-event-evaluation-769-1688335480',769,25,1,5,1,2023,169,'413',NULL,7339,5804,7467,13,NULL,NULL,100,57.00,NULL,NULL,'beautiful colours. If you submit work in the graphic design category make sure you have a clear purpose and that there is a message on the artwork by using fonts to state that. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 08:04:40','2023-07-03 08:04:40'),(1644,'judge-event-evaluation-613-1688336603',613,8,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7062,6328,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hi, Aaron! Great timing- it made your image to stand out just right. A little tip -try to have a clear focal point and blur out any distraction. You did a good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 08:23:23','2023-07-03 08:23:23'),(1647,'judge-event-evaluation-793-1688337676',793,3,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6984,1678,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Bella, \r\nThank you for participating. Try and work on your visual elements- like the use of colors, contrasts, textures and others that will make your image appealing. Looking forward to your submission next year, God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 08:41:16','2023-07-03 08:41:16'),(1648,'judge-event-evaluation-1016-1688338021',1016,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7270,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent job, Alina!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 08:47:01','2023-07-03 08:47:01'),(1651,'judge-event-evaluation-505-1688339634',505,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6981,1678,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for sharing your piano solo with us, Olyvia!\r\n- I liked how you introduced your piece and took a moment to acknowledge who the composer was etc.\r\nWhen you are doing your spoken introduction, please speak a bit louder - opening your mouth a bit more will help. Also, add some pauses between bits of your spoken introduction for effect. ;-) \r\n- Have you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano - which would make it easier! \r\n- I would love to see some more dynamic contrasts within this piece of music. Sometimes the left hand accompaniment parts were a little loud.\r\n- Try to add in the grace notes at Bar 20, 28.\r\nKeep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 09:13:54','2023-07-03 09:13:54'),(1652,'judge-event-evaluation-881-1688339867',881,3,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,6968,1678,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'I liked the way your story followed through and it was set at a camp where the character was sure of his way but then got lost.  This happens in life and it is good that he had the assurance of God and prayer.  Thank you for a nice piece of writing.  I look forward to reading more of your work next year.\r\n\r\nMechanics:\r\n1.  There were several commas missing between two clauses and after introductory words or phrases.\r\n2.  \'til\'  should be until \r\n3.  \'unconserved\'  is not a recognized word try neglected. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 09:17:47','2023-07-03 09:17:47'),(1657,'judge-event-evaluation-1236-1688341981',1236,28,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7271,5806,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Ruci! This was a very touching piece. Thank you for blessing us with this selection of material.\r\n\r\nYou gave a beautiful performance! Your voice inflections fit very well with your reading material, although more vocal projection and a bit more facial expressions would have also helped a lot! Your body movements/gestures were great. On top of all this, you carried yourself with a quiet confidence that really made this performance stand out.\r\n\r\nWell done, Ruci! You did an excellent job. I look forward to what\'s ahead of you as you continue to bring honour and glory to God through your wonderful talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 09:53:01','2023-07-03 09:53:01'),(1658,'judge-event-evaluation-689-1688342152',689,3,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6974,1678,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Good job, Brayden! \r\nGood composition with the background and make sure your subject stands out/on focus. Keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 09:55:52','2023-07-03 09:55:52'),(1659,'judge-event-evaluation-1017-1688342312',1017,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7266,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Eliana!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 09:58:32','2023-07-03 09:58:32'),(1660,'judge-event-evaluation-1254-1688342430',1254,28,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7245,5806,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Solomoni for sharing Clementi\'s Op. 36 no. 1.\r\n- Your right hand scales were pretty good!\r\n- I would love to see some more dynamic contrasts within this piece of music - your music has these marked, so go back and find them. ;-) \r\n- Can you get staccato on your keyboard?\r\n- Have you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano / keyboard - which would make it easier! \r\nKeep developing your piano skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:00:30','2023-07-03 10:00:30'),(1663,'judge-event-evaluation-558-1688343220',558,15,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7040,4679,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your effort Marvella! Great subject, the colours really draw your eye in. You do need work on your composition - Angles (making sure your straight lines work to please the eye), and cropping (making sure your subject is completely in the photo, and distractions are removed or limited). You also need to make sure that you complete your documentation - we need a how for the photo, not just a why.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:13:40','2023-07-03 10:13:41'),(1665,'judge-event-evaluation-739-1688343747',739,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7365,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'A balanced composition and visual impact. Well done, Gabriella.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:22:27','2023-07-03 10:22:27'),(1666,'judge-event-evaluation-1183-1688344041',1183,46,1,5,1,2023,291,'911',NULL,7443,4504,6960,46,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort Stan! Great story, and good use of the story cards! You do need to work on some expression - rises and falls in the story (speak faster and lounder when it gets tense, slow down and quiet for suspense, etc), and even try and work on some different voices for the different characters. Also, with storytelling, while it may not be completely following the script, in this case, it would be good to have the application at the end - the point of retelling accounts in the Bible is to help us draw closer to God or make a change in our lives and attitudes.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing bro! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:27:21','2023-07-03 10:27:21'),(1667,'judge-event-evaluation-1439-1688344088',1439,13,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7196,4208,7462,44,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,-1.00,'That was an amazing reading Samara ! Adding voices to each character really helped the story gain a sense of relatability and realness.. Great job!\r\nKeep it up, and keep inspiring !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:28:08','2023-07-03 10:28:08'),(1669,'judge-event-evaluation-908-1688344391',908,8,1,5,1,2023,236,'752',NULL,7071,6328,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Jason, very pleasing to listen to. I especially love the ending and the chord structures. It would be good work on some dynamics and tempo variance to add more expression in, and just enhance your performance further.\r\n\r\nOverall, great work, keep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:33:11','2023-07-03 10:33:12'),(1672,'judge-event-evaluation-758-1688345109',758,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7343,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'A good photo you have there, Zechariah. A little adjustment to your lighting also, add highlights will make your photo to stand out. Keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:45:09','2023-07-03 10:45:09'),(1673,'judge-event-evaluation-998-1688345200',998,21,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7144,5805,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work, Won Jong Choi!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:46:40','2023-07-03 10:46:40'),(1676,'judge-event-evaluation-663-1688345677',663,3,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6973,1678,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Victor,\r\nThank you for participating. A tip to help; try using leading lines and grid for better composition. Hope to see your entry again next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:54:37','2023-07-03 10:54:37'),(1677,'judge-event-evaluation-775-1688345778',775,15,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7045,4679,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful picture, Gloria!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:56:18','2023-07-03 10:56:18'),(1678,'judge-event-evaluation-1018-1688345883',1018,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7264,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Hadassah!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 10:58:03','2023-07-03 10:58:03'),(1679,'judge-event-evaluation-799-1688346105',799,3,1,5,1,2023,248,'774','1',0,1678,6960,26,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,0.00,'Great work girls, that was excellent... and I love that song! It works really well with the tambourines! Unfortunately, it does state in the guidelines that there should not be cheering and applause in the track - it is a shame as there is a studio version of the song. Please make sure that you read the guidelines very carefully before preparing. Also, your submitted paperwork needs to be a list of the patterns and movements that you are doing, not just the lyrics for the song.\r\n\r\nApart from that, it was overall an outstanding performance, keep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:01:45','2023-07-03 11:01:45'),(1680,'judge-event-evaluation-1508-1688346171',1508,17,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7382,4200,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Hajean,\r\nAlways remember to fill in and submit in your report form.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:02:51','2023-07-03 11:02:51'),(1681,'judge-event-evaluation-636-1688346493',636,15,1,5,1,2023,252,'778','6',0,4679,7479,29,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Girls, thank you for sharing this tambourine ensemble. :-)\r\n- Remember to walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events, so that you don\'t lose points. Also, it would look tidier if you all wore the same colour shoes! ;-)\r\n- See \'MI. 5 TAMBOURINE GENERAL RULES\' in the second paragraph it says the accompaniment must not include \'applause\' and \'cheering.\' Unfortunately, the start and finish of your accompanying music has \'cheering.\' \r\n- It would be helpful to have some more information on your sheet music showing what your tambourine choreography is (there are specific symbols to show the movements). An example can be found here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrLlQRehcJc\r\n- Please work on having your tambourines at the same height when you have them above your heads.  \r\n- Coordination of your bow at the end can be lead by the front tambourine players without spoken word.\r\n\r\nYou all show great potential and I hope to see another tambourine ensemble from you ladies in the future. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:08:13','2023-07-03 11:08:13'),(1682,'judge-event-evaluation-1302-1688346507',1302,17,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7419,4200,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful scenery. Well done, Hanseul Wang.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:08:27','2023-07-03 11:08:27'),(1683,'judge-event-evaluation-745-1688346698',745,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7353,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jacob,\r\nTry to blur out the ones that is not on focus, otherwise, well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:11:38','2023-07-03 11:11:38'),(1684,'judge-event-evaluation-687-1688346829',687,20,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7232,394,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent job, Jacob! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:13:49','2023-07-03 11:13:49'),(1686,'judge-event-evaluation-1019-1688347187',1019,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7250,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jeremaia,\r\nTry add some highlights and other visual elements that can contribute to your image\'s attractiveness and memorability. \r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:19:47','2023-07-03 11:19:47'),(1687,'judge-event-evaluation-1520-1688347340',1520,17,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7401,4200,7462,44,'Open','25',100,68.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you for your reading Meilin!\r\nYou are a great storyteller with a gift for bringing out the emotion of a story !\r\nWell done! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:22:20','2023-07-03 11:22:20'),(1688,'judge-event-evaluation-1530-1688347416',1530,17,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7409,4200,7462,44,'Open','25',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance Shalem ! \r\nNow , whilst a variety in your expressions , gestures and movement is great for expressive reading, excessive movement and acts can take away from your reading also . \r\nReading the story should be the utmost part of your act, enhanced by your gestures !\r\nKeep it up ! You have a gift for really showcasing that emotion in a story ! Amazing !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:23:36','2023-07-03 11:23:36'),(1689,'judge-event-evaluation-1255-1688347422',1255,28,1,5,1,2023,248,'774','1',0,5806,6960,26,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,0.00,'Great work girls, great choice of song, suits the tambourines well! a little bit of a shaky start, but you pulled it in well! It would be good to get some more builds and dynamics in there, but overall a great job.\r\n\r\nKeep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:23:42','2023-07-03 11:23:42'),(1691,'judge-event-evaluation-212-1688347606',212,12,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6992,1132,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Jonathan!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:26:46','2023-07-03 11:26:46'),(1692,'judge-event-evaluation-390-1688347730',390,11,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7025,613,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'A balanced composition and visual impact. Well done - Kathleen!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:28:50','2023-07-03 11:28:50'),(1696,'judge-event-evaluation-668-1688348410',668,19,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7331,4451,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Chloe, great choice of song! you had great expression and intensity. There were a few notes that were not quite in tune - make sure that you hold the violin approximately parallel to the ground - this will help you to hit those notes easier!\r\n\r\nOverall, great job, keep it up! God Bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL