11:43:43','2023-07-03 11:43:44'),(1702,'judge-event-evaluation-547-1688348670',547,3,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6980,1678,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Genevine,\r\nYou have good visual impact. Consider using, leading lines or other compositional techniques that will help to create a visually pleasing image. Keep it up and hope to see your entry again next year.\r\nGod bless! \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:44:30','2023-07-03 11:44:30'),(1704,'judge-event-evaluation-612-1688348753',612,8,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7074,6328,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Joaquine,\r\nTry to zoom in or move your camera closer to the focus area.\r\nKeep it up the good spirit!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:45:53','2023-07-03 11:45:53'),(1705,'judge-event-evaluation-567-1688348791',567,15,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7053,4679,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Try adding some lighting and balance exposure with details in both highlights and shadows.\r\nOtherwise, good job, Kenneth!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:46:31','2023-07-03 11:46:31'),(1706,'judge-event-evaluation-526-1688348795',526,11,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7026,613,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Cameron, very well done! Slight stumble in the middle, but you didn\'t let it faze you! It would be good to work on some dynamics - not sure if it\'s doable with you particular bell set, but I know that some sets you can \'dampen\' them so that it makes a kind of staccato clunk, or you can let them ring out, as opposed to shaking for some variance.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:46:35','2023-07-03 11:46:35'),(1707,'judge-event-evaluation-1131-1688348867',1131,46,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7448,4504,7366,2,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:47:47','2023-07-03 11:47:47'),(1708,'judge-event-evaluation-1020-1688349107',1020,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7263,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'A little contrast adjustment and color correction will help enhance the image otherwise, well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:51:47','2023-07-03 11:51:47'),(1709,'judge-event-evaluation-1209-1688349344',1209,13,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7175,4208,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Maraia,\r\nAn adjustment to the placements of elements within the frame. You could use leading lines, or rule of thirds for better composition.\r\nKeep up the great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 11:55:44','2023-07-03 11:55:44'),(1710,'judge-event-evaluation-548-1688349740',548,15,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7041,4679,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Matthew,\r\nYou demonstrated excellent timing and skills in capturing a challenging subject. Zooming in will help to capture the subject clearly, otherwise, good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:02:20','2023-07-03 12:02:20'),(1711,'judge-event-evaluation-1550-1688349754',1550,20,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7097,394,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Jeffrey, love the intensity and confidence! A few intonation issues, and the music that you supplied was different from the arrangement that you actually played - sometimes, if you can\'t find the notation, you\'ll need to write it out yourself. Also, for some added variance, perhaps look at doing some pizzicato - it would really suit a section of the song well!\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:02:34','2023-07-03 12:02:34'),(1712,'judge-event-evaluation-815-1688350107',815,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7337,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Tue Lucas,\r\nEnhancing the colors and contrast, resulting in a more visually appealing image while still maintaining a natural look.\r\nKeep up the great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:08:27','2023-07-03 12:08:27'),(1713,'judge-event-evaluation-1109-1688350225',1109,21,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7121,5805,7462,44,'Open','25',100,87.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Emma for an exceptional reading ! The emotion and gestures you displayed really drove home the message of the story. \r\nGreat use of voice inflections and the different voices for each character was a creative touch!\r\n Well done !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:10:25','2023-07-03 12:10:25'),(1714,'judge-event-evaluation-1250-1688350303',1250,28,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7249,5806,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Ebenezer, fantastic choice of song, and you performed it well! a few minor intonation issues, but overall, very good! It would be good to add in some more expression - rises and falls, dynamics, etc to give it a little more, but you are doing well so far!\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:11:43','2023-07-03 12:11:43'),(1715,'judge-event-evaluation-615-1688350470',615,8,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7077,6328,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Michael,\r\nUsing excessive sharpness, colors and lighting will make the image look unreal. \r\n Therefore, kindly adjust to enhance the colors and contrast which will result in an appealing image.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:14:30','2023-07-03 12:14:31'),(1716,'judge-event-evaluation-1021-1688350557',1021,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7267,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent Work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:15:57','2023-07-03 12:15:57'),(1717,'judge-event-evaluation-1023-1688350649',1023,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7251,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:17:29','2023-07-03 12:17:29'),(1718,'judge-event-evaluation-1212-1688350691',1212,10,1,5,1,2023,323,'972',NULL,7281,1467,7462,44,'Open','25',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance ! You have great enthusiasm which is evident in your reading !\r\nI suggest having a few lines where you are just reading so as to help your reading flow and not be stuck on gestures and movement\r\nThank you for your confidence in this event Kerenhapukh !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:18:11','2023-07-03 12:18:11'),(1719,'judge-event-evaluation-289-1688350721',289,12,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,6992,1132,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Jonathan, love your recorder! Wooden ones have such a better tone! A few things to work on - try to make sure you hit the notes in tune, overall it was pretty good, just a few notes weren\'t quite there. Also, try to work on some phrasing - don\'t separate the notes so much, unless for emphasis or expression. Especially when doing an instrumental version of a song with lyrics, try to think of how the phrasing works in the words as well.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing mate! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:18:41','2023-07-03 12:18:41'),(1720,'judge-event-evaluation-1120-1688350740',1120,46,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7449,4504,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Great work done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:19:00','2023-07-03 12:19:00'),(1721,'judge-event-evaluation-590-1688351160',590,20,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7169,394,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Oliver,\r\nA suggestion to use for your photo composition is leading lines, rule of thirds or even grids for better arrangement and placement of elements within the frame.\r\nKeep up the great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:26:00','2023-07-03 12:26:00'),(1722,'judge-event-evaluation-626-1688351227',626,3,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,6981,1678,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:27:07','2023-07-03 12:27:07'),(1723,'judge-event-evaluation-766-1688351388',766,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7341,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Om,\r\nVery creative! Just crop out the green leaf showing at the bottom. \r\nWell done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:29:48','2023-07-03 12:29:48'),(1724,'judge-event-evaluation-497-1688351587',497,15,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7043,4679,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Pretty,\r\nJust remember to be still when you\'re taking your photo and blur out or remove things that are not related to the subject.\r\nKeep it up the great effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:33:07','2023-07-03 12:33:07'),(1725,'judge-event-evaluation-512-1688351664',512,3,1,5,1,2023,240,'756',NULL,6970,1678,7479,23,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing, Praise!\r\n- See \'MI. 5 TAMBOURINE GENERAL RULES\' in the second paragraph it says the accompaniment must not include \'applause\' and \'cheering.\' Unfortunately, the start and finish of your accompanying music has \'cheering.\' \r\n- Remember to walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events, so that you can get all possible points, just like you would if it were a live performance. ;-)\r\n- It would be helpful to have information on your sheet music showing what your tambourine choreography is. (There are specific symbols to show the tambourine movements). An example can be found here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XrLlQRehcJc\r\n\r\n- I can see you have dance talent! Work on using more of the stage floor.\r\n- I would love to see you smile more - while you do your routine and some more variations with the tambourine!\r\n\r\nPraise, you show great potential and I hope to see another tambourine event from you in the future. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:34:24','2023-07-03 12:34:24'),(1726,'judge-event-evaluation-1024-1688351667',1024,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7271,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Great work, Ruci!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:34:27','2023-07-03 12:34:27'),(1727,'judge-event-evaluation-377-1688351717',377,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7320,4451,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Tiana, great job writing your own piece!\r\nI enjoyed your interpretation of your poem. \r\nWork on your inflection especially when you come to the end of your lines. \r\nApproach/Departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:35:17','2023-07-03 12:35:17'),(1728,'judge-event-evaluation-1258-1688351742',1258,28,1,5,1,2023,240,'756',NULL,7278,5806,7479,23,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this Victoria!\r\nI wish I could see the mood that the song expresses on your face - smile and show joy while you are on stage. :-) \r\nYou have potential with Tambourine and I hope you can share this with your church and community.\r\n\r\nAll the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:35:42','2023-07-03 12:35:42'),(1729,'judge-event-evaluation-1124-1688351822',1124,46,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7445,4504,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Priscilla,\r\nJust remember to be still while taking still photos.\r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:37:02','2023-07-03 12:37:02'),(1731,'judge-event-evaluation-768-1688352031',768,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7339,5804,7366,2,'Collection','8',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'HI Rushikesh,\r\nYou did great, just remember that lighting enhances the subject and contributes to the overall mood.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:40:31','2023-07-03 12:40:31'),(1732,'judge-event-evaluation-1252-1688352042',1252,28,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7256,5806,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing your piano solo Apimeleki! :-)\r\nHave you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano / keyboard - which would make it easier! \r\nTry to find some more dynamic colours with you playing. I would love to see you sit and enjoy the final bar of the piece - which is a fermata and not be in a hurry to finish the piece!\r\nKeep developing your piano playing skills. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:40:42','2023-07-03 12:40:42'),(1733,'judge-event-evaluation-1444-1688352107',1444,13,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7177,4208,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Ruth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:41:47','2023-07-03 12:41:47'),(1734,'judge-event-evaluation-614-1688352185',614,8,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7082,6328,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Great work done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:43:05','2023-07-03 12:43:06'),(1735,'judge-event-evaluation-1366-1688352234',1366,13,1,5,1,2023,220,'702',NULL,7178,4208,6960,3,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Great Effort Tian, and a great song! A few minor issues with intonation, but overall it was pretty good! Just with your intro - this song is actually not about believing and prayer - this is about the foundational belief in the fundamentals of Christianity. Maybe Ephesians 4 might be a better passage to quote! Also, just work on some phrasing a flow - try and make it a bit smoother.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:43:54','2023-07-03 12:43:54'),(1737,'judge-event-evaluation-1026-1688352287',1026,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7268,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Salote!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:44:47','2023-07-03 12:44:48'),(1741,'judge-event-evaluation-975-1688352513',975,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7348,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Terumah,\r\nConsider adding more lights because it enhances the subject and contributes to the overall mood.\r\nGood job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:48:33','2023-07-03 12:48:33'),(1742,'judge-event-evaluation-1514-1688352526',1514,17,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7389,4200,7462,44,'Open','24',100,69.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you for reading , Excellent !\r\nYou have a good, clear voice , great for reading!\r\nI would love to see you express yourself more and really bring out that emotion!\r\nKeep up the great work !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:48:46','2023-07-03 12:48:46'),(1744,'judge-event-evaluation-533-1688352554',533,3,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,6965,1678,7462,44,'Open','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing reading Vinsentius !\r\nI love the emotion and enthusiasm that you display in your reading \r\nThe message was presented loud and clear , with great enthusiasm\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:49:14','2023-07-03 12:49:14'),(1745,'judge-event-evaluation-1502-1688352578',1502,17,1,5,1,2023,313,'958',NULL,7413,4200,7462,44,'Open','24',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Stevan ! You expressed a great and worthwhile message in your reading.\r\nPlease do not be afraid to slow down a bit and really focus on each word so as to really help pronounce and convey the emotion in your reading. Take a breath and really open up and speak outward so we can hear the amazing gifts and skills God has blessed you with!\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:49:38','2023-07-03 12:49:39'),(1747,'judge-event-evaluation-1443-1688352706',1443,25,1,5,1,2023,298,'922',NULL,7337,5804,7460,44,'Collection','25',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive reading, Tue! What a wonderful message. This was a great choice of material. Thank you for blessing us with it.\r\n\r\nYou gave a good performance. Your voice inflections fit and expressed the reading well; however, more could have been done with your facial expressions and body language. Showing the emotions of your reading through your actions would have enhanced your performance even more. It might be tricky to do at first, but with more time and practice you will only get better! I would also encourage you to work on your vocal projection.\r\n\r\nOverall, you did a good job! Well done, Tue. I look forward to what\'s ahead of you as you continue to serve God and honour Him with your amazing talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:51:46','2023-07-03 12:51:46'),(1748,'judge-event-evaluation-512-1688352785',512,3,1,5,1,2023,240,'756',NULL,6970,1678,6960,23,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Praise, this is a great song for a tambourine solo! I love Planetshakers! Unfortunately, the guidelines state that the accompaniment is not allowed clapping and cheering - you need to make sure that you find a studio recording of the song. Also, your accompanying document should be a list of the movements, rather than the lyrics to the song.\r\nJust watch that you are in time and emphasizing the beats at the same time as the music.\r\n\r\nOverall, great work, and awesome energy! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:53:05','2023-07-03 12:53:05'),(1749,'judge-event-evaluation-1210-1688352860',1210,13,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7178,4208,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Tian Xie,\r\nRemember, using more color adjustment and sharpening or exposure will detract the image from its natural qualities.\r\nKeep up the great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:54:20','2023-07-03 12:54:21'),(1750,'judge-event-evaluation-835-1688352950',835,25,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7340,5804,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:55:50','2023-07-03 12:55:50'),(1751,'judge-event-evaluation-1027-1688353069',1027,28,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7252,5806,7366,2,'Collection','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 12:57:49','2023-07-03 12:57:49'),(1752,'judge-event-evaluation-977-1688353509',977,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7137,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Aloisio, good job! Thank you for continuing through and completing your poem even though you had some difficultly. \r\nContinue to work on how you present, you will only get better. Practice is important. Take lots of time to practice in front of family and friends as this builds your confidence. \r\nApproach/departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:05:09','2023-07-03 13:05:10'),(1756,'judge-event-evaluation-554-1688354475',554,19,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7322,4451,7469,45,'Open','24',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Braden! Great job on writing your own poem. Great message!\r\nIt was very good that you did not rush through your presentation. It allowed the message to be heard clearly. \r\nGood facial expressions. \r\nRemember when you are presenting to a camera you need to keep your eye contact. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:21:15','2023-07-03 13:21:16'),(1758,'judge-event-evaluation-897-1688354841',897,8,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7062,6328,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this piece Aaron! :-)\r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\n- You might find it easier to play the piano if you were seated a little higher.\r\n- Please check your page 2 rhythms for these bars:\r\n- Line 1 Bar 4 LH (and also on page 1 where it is.)\r\n- Line 3 bar 2 LH\'s minims - hold the keys down for that note length. \r\nOverall, a lovely piano solo! Keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:27:21','2023-07-03 13:27:21'),(1760,'judge-event-evaluation-290-1688354946',290,12,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6993,1132,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing this piece, Matthew! :-)\r\n- I would love to see some more dynamic contrasts within this piece of music.\r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\nYou have a good set-up at the piano.\r\n\r\nMatthew, you show great potential with the piano, so keep developing your piano skills for His glory and I hope to hear you play again someday!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:29:06','2023-07-03 13:29:06'),(1761,'judge-event-evaluation-900-1688355000',900,8,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7077,6328,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for sharing your piano solo, Michael! :-)\r\n- I loved how you had so many different contrasts with dynamics! \r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\n- I noticed between B.78 - 90 your left hand accompaniment and the ending part did not match what was on the sheet music you provided - so unfortunately, I had to take some marks off.\r\n- You have a very good set-up at the piano.\r\nKeep developing your piano skills for His glory and I hope to hear you play again someday!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:30:00','2023-07-03 13:30:00'),(1762,'judge-event-evaluation-875-1688355058',875,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6985,1678,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing your piano solo with us Naylla!\r\n- Have you tried sitting a bit higher? This would help your arms to be at a more suitable angle for you to play piano - which would make it easier! \r\n- I would love to see some more dynamic contrasts within this piece of music.\r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\n- You kept a very good steady rhythm throughout the piece - well done. :-)\r\nKeep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:30:58','2023-07-03 13:30:58'),(1763,'judge-event-evaluation-510-1688355116',510,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6979,1678,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing your piano solo \'As the Deer,\' Dominic!\r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\n- I would love to see some more dynamic contrasts within this piece of music.\r\n- It would add to your performance if you did the \'rit.\' and the \'pause\' at bar 17. \r\n- Sometimes the left-hand accompaniment parts were a little loud and could do with some phrasing - not every beat is important.\r\n- You have a very good set-up at the piano.\r\nKeep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:31:56','2023-07-03 13:31:56'),(1764,'judge-event-evaluation-360-1688355186',360,14,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,7336,4328,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you sharing your piano solo Stephanie \'Lead Me to Calvary\'! :-)\r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\n- Please annotate on the sheet music score any introduction or repeats that you intend to do.\r\n- I would love to see some more dynamic contrasts within your playing.\r\n- Your overall rhythm was good, just check over your dotted quaver rhythms.\r\nStephanie, keep developing your piano skills for His glory!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:33:06','2023-07-03 13:33:06'),(1765,'judge-event-evaluation-972-1688355311',972,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7133,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done George! What an interesting poem.\r\nGood tempo of vocal delivery and good natural gestures for the most part. \r\nRemember to relax and enjoy your presentation also. This does come with more practice. \r\nApproach/departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end. \r\nBlessings\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:35:11','2023-07-03 13:35:11'),(1768,'judge-event-evaluation-1072-1688356274',1072,8,1,5,1,2023,187,'468','1',0,6328,7460,16,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this video production, Victory Academy! The concept, storyline, and animation were most impressive. It also had moments of humour that were thoroughly enjoyable and made me chuckle here and there. Touching on the concept of \'Cancel Culture\' was an interesting choice, and one that I\'m glad you made. It\'s always empowering, seeing young people of faith address the issues of this modern society and defend their faith in Christ. \r\n\r\nAs much as I loved this piece of art, there are certain themes found in it that I personally do not see as consistent with the Biblical worldview. The first time I watched this production, I was awed! I thought it was brilliant and instantly wanted to recommend it for command performance; however, I felt convicted to go through it again and watch for minor details.\r\nIn one of the first clips of the video, there is a clip that shows a newspaper article featuring your characters in jail. Instead of actual words in this newspaper article, you chose lyrics of a secular song to fill up the wording section. I debated with myself for a while, trying to reason whether this was sufficient to constitute as an opposing theme of the Biblical worldview. Then I came across your characters\' prison numbers and researched the possible meaning(s) behind them. This may be a reach on my end, as I most gladly give you the benefit of the doubt, but nonetheless I cannot deny that this a possible violation. Finally, using a popular, secular song as background music for one of your clips was unnecessary, in my opinion. There are many generic, \'party-themed\' audios which could have been used for the \'party scene\' instead. \r\n\r\nThis evaluation may seem harsh; however, it is important that we all understand that in Student Convention there is a standard to maintain. If I were to overlook these details and downplay them, I would not be performing my duty as a judge, and it could potentially affect the integrity of these Student Conventions. Student Convention is a place where bright, talented individuals such as yourselves use what gifts God has blessed them with to bless others in turn and sharpen their skills even more. Please understand this evaluation comes from a place of love, and I look forward to how each of you will use your talents to bring God glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:51:14','2023-07-04 11:02:14'),(1769,'judge-event-evaluation-1553-1688356287',1553,17,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7382,4200,7469,45,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Hajean, well done! What an important message you share through the poem you presented.\r\nContinue to use your your talent for the Lord. \r\nGood vocal delivery and good use of gestures.\r\nApproach/departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:51:27','2023-07-03 13:51:27'),(1770,'judge-event-evaluation-876-1688356444',876,3,1,5,1,2023,219,'700',NULL,6986,1678,7479,22,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Rachel, for sharing your piano solo \'Joy to the World.\'\r\n- So that you can get all possible points, walk on and off for \'Online Convention\' events - just like in a live performance. ;-)\r\n- Do introduce your item (see \'Music Instrumental\' page 2 of the guidelines for how to do this.)\r\n- Please annotate on the music any repeats that you intend to do.\r\n- To give some variety, perhaps you could play the right hand up an octave for one verse. (You would need to make a note on your sheet music that you intend to do this.) Or for a verse you could do a different left hand accompaniment part to make it more interesting for yourself and your listeners.\r\n- If you had played an introduction - the last phrase of the piece - then you would only have needed to play through the piece twice to make minimum time of 1 minute.\r\nYou show potential with piano, so keep developing your piano skills for Him!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 13:54:04','2023-07-03 13:54:04'),(1774,'judge-event-evaluation-1256-1688357275',1256,28,1,5,1,2023,240,'756',NULL,7258,5806,6960,23,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Jedaiah, very well done! I would have given you more marks, but the system wouldn\'t let me do half marks. :P\r\nA couple of times where the timing wasn\'t as tight as it could have been, and just a bit more in the dynamics, but overall and excellent performance!\r\n\r\nKeep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 14:07:55','2023-07-03 14:07:55'),(1775,'judge-event-evaluation-464-1688358285',464,8,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7065,6328,7235,17,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Great artwork. to enhance the artwork, improvement of shading specifically for determining the direction of light can be made. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 14:24:45','2023-07-03 14:24:46'),(1776,'judge-event-evaluation-1258-1688358342',1258,28,1,5,1,2023,240,'756',NULL,7278,5806,6960,23,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Victoria, obviously well practiced, as it was well performed! I loved your energy, and so I wondered if perhaps you could pick a song with more energy in it? I feel like something a bit faster and suited to your style would give you more of a change to flourish!\r\n\r\nOverall, excellent performances, keep it up! God bless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 14:25:42','2023-07-03 14:25:42'),(1777,'judge-event-evaluation-234-1688358473',234,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7319,4451,7235,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'More shading is needed for the enhancement of the artwork. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 14:27:53','2023-07-03 14:27:53'),(1778,'judge-event-evaluation-465-1688358700',465,8,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7067,6328,7235,17,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Enlargement of the sketch to fit the centre of the page allows for more focus to be drawn to the art piece as well as more details being able to be added in. Overall, amazing work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 14:31:40','2023-07-03 14:31:40'),(1779,'judge-event-evaluation-667-1688360753',667,19,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7331,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Chloe, very well done! You absolutely did a fantastic song justice, congrats! A few times that you could tighten up on the intonation, but overall a great job!\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:05:53','2023-07-03 15:05:53'),(1781,'judge-event-evaluation-1272-1688361962',1272,28,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7266,5806,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Eleiana, you have a beautiful voice! This song has quite a large range, and you did well! A couple of spots where you needed to aim a little higher to hit the note, and some phrasing to work on (breathing in the right places, and \'breaking\' according to the lyrics), but overall, a great job!\r\n\r\nKeep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:26:02','2023-07-03 15:26:02'),(1782,'judge-event-evaluation-1009-1688362664',1009,28,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7259,5806,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Abigail! but you need more practice in the gradation of the color. So your drawing will be more real than now. Good luck! God bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:37:44','2023-07-04 11:12:43'),(1783,'judge-event-evaluation-485-1688362793',485,3,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,6980,1678,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort Genevine, a challenging song! Are few issues with intonation to work on - aiming for the note and hitting it, rather than sliding to it. Also just be careful to breathe in the right places so as to not break up the phrasing.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:39:53','2023-07-03 15:39:53'),(1786,'judge-event-evaluation-446-1688363503',446,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7397,4200,7380,17,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'You did it very well Fransiska! but actually, when I see you\'re drawing it\'s more like watercolor, especially for the result of the texture. I\'m so sorry, don\'t be sad; overall, your drawing was delightful and pretty. God bless! I wish you luck!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:51:43','2023-07-03 15:51:43'),(1787,'judge-event-evaluation-792-1688363510',792,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6984,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Bella! Thank you for your effort. Our Creator really is amazing and \"Space\" for a theme is a great reminder of that. However, instead of seeing illustrations of aliens in UFOs, I would have preferred that you included creative illustrations of the planets or the Milky Way galaxy, for example. There is so much that you could have included with this theme that I was looking forward to seeing. In future, choose themes that you are extremely passionate about because that way your creativity will come naturally and it will be evident in your work. I hope to see more of your artwork. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:51:50','2023-07-03 15:51:50'),(1788,'judge-event-evaluation-1305-1688363527',1305,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7394,4200,7380,17,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Devanny you did it very well. Appreciate your concept and also your techniques to colored. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:52:07','2023-07-03 15:52:07'),(1789,'judge-event-evaluation-546-1688363531',546,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6980,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji Genevine and thank you for your effort! I enjoyed seeing your pictures and I actually would have preferred seeing more instead of having so many quotes pasted. However, your layout was very creative and I look forward to seeing more of your work in the future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:52:11','2023-07-03 15:52:11'),(1790,'judge-event-evaluation-982-1688363544',982,21,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,7143,5805,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jordan. What an awesome trip that must have been! I thoroughly enjoyed seeing your photos and reading up on everything that you did. I must commend you on a job well done with your submission but I also have a few recommendations that you can keep in mind for future reference. Firstly, try and choose a colour scheme to work with so that it can complement your theme and photos. Secondly, your text always needs to be readable, e.g., you cannot use white coloured font on a light background as it makes it difficult to read. (Another reason why choosing a colour scheme is important.) Lastly, sometimes less is more. Instead of making a page so busy, try to add less photos with a decent amount of embellishments (stickers, gifs, etc) so that the focus is not taken away from the photos. All in all, you did great and I look forward to seeing more work from you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:52:24','2023-07-03 15:52:24'),(1792,'judge-event-evaluation-577-1688363571',577,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6985,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Naylla! Thank you for your effort. You picked a great theme and your work is beautiful. In future, try to think outside of the box and add more than just stickers. Scrapbooking is not supposed to be organised but it also needs to be well thought out. Maybe next time try to incorporate pressed or dried flowers/leaves, shells, buttons, paint, etc. The great thing about scrapbooking is that you can take anything and make it a part of your work. Good effort anyway! I look forward to seeing more of your work. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:52:51','2023-07-03 15:52:51'),(1793,'judge-event-evaluation-1306-1688363578',1306,17,1,5,1,2023,204,'555',NULL,7396,4200,7380,17,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'You did it very well Eunjoo! The color, techniques, and also direction of the light are completely perfect! God Bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:52:58','2023-07-03 15:52:58'),(1794,'judge-event-evaluation-605-1688363582',605,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6971,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Oswald. Thank you for your effort. In future, look around you and find things you can use for scrapbooking instead of just tape. With \"Daily Life\" as a theme, you could have incorporated pressed or dried flowers/leaves that you walk past daily, shells from the beach, or pieces of cloth that you could have outlined chess pieces with since that is something you enjoy, evidently. I look forward to seeing more of your work, Oswald. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:53:02','2023-07-03 15:53:02'),(1795,'judge-event-evaluation-627-1688363592',627,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6969,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Pauline! Awesome work. I am so glad that you thought outside the box by incorporating a lot of different elements to make your work stand out. I agree that finding ideas can be challenging but what an excellent theme you chose. Keep it up! I look forward to seeing more scrapbooking from you, Pauline! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:53:12','2023-07-03 15:53:12'),(1796,'judge-event-evaluation-640-1688363602',640,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6972,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Phebe and thank you for your effort. Great work on your layout! You have got the essence of scrapbooking, however, in future, check that the grammar for whatever text you will include is correct. With flowers as a theme, I thought that you would have used Matthew 6:28-29 as the verse to support your work; Matthew 6:28-29 (NIV) says, \"And why do you worry about clothes? See how the flowers of the field grow. They do not labor or spin. Yet I tell you that not even Solomon in all his splendor was dressed like one of these.\" The Bible talks about everything so it is the best source of inspiration for creativity and ideas. Good effort though, Phebe, and I look forward to seeing more of your work. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:53:22','2023-07-03 15:53:22'),(1797,'judge-event-evaluation-648-1688363630',648,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6986,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Rachel and thank you for your effort! With \"nature\" as a theme, the opportunities for creativity are endless. Great effort but you could have incorporated leaves, sand, small pebbles, and/or pressed flowers, etc to further enhance your theme. Use your imagination and think outside the box when doing scrapbooking. I look forward to seeing more work from you in the future. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:53:50','2023-07-03 15:53:50'),(1798,'judge-event-evaluation-1002-1688363650',1002,28,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,7271,5806,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Ruci! I am so impressed with your work. Great job! You made use of all sorts of materials and your submission was very well thought out. This is exactly what scrapbooking is about--it was not too busy but not too dull, it was just the right amount of creativity. Keep it up and I look forward to seeing more of your work in the future. Hint: Try using pressed/dried flowers or leaves, shells, sand, twigs, broken glass (clear or coloured), broken CDs, etc to help elevate your work. God bless you! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:54:10','2023-07-03 15:54:10'),(1799,'judge-event-evaluation-656-1688363673',656,3,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,6975,1678,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Samuel! Thank you for your effort. You chose quite a broad theme (\"Activities You Do Everyday\") and I was expecting to see more creativity with how you would show what your daily routine is. It lacked colour and fun. In future, maybe choose a character trait or a specific theme to work on, e.g., animals, flowers, your family, etc. I look forward to seeing more of your work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:54:33','2023-07-03 15:54:33'),(1800,'judge-event-evaluation-1448-1688363682',1448,25,1,5,1,2023,120,'310',NULL,7340,5804,7466,54,'Collection',NULL,100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Toroagtoko, thank you for your effort. I liked getting to know you through your scrapbooking; that was definitely a creative idea. However, in future, I hope you try to be more creative with the materials you use. You can use literally anything and everything around you to help enhance your work. As an aspiring graphic designer, you will need a lot of creativity without limits. Keep researching for ideas and keep practicing. I look forward to seeing your entry in the next convention. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 15:54:42','2023-07-03 15:54:42'),(1801,'judge-event-evaluation-361-1688364158',361,19,1,5,1,2023,181,'462',NULL,7326,4451,7466,12,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Christopher and thank you for your effort! The picture and verse you chose complement each other well. In future, try to add a bit more creativity to your poster. Keep researching ideas, keep practicing, and keep trying to improve! I look forward to seeing more of your work. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 16:02:38','2023-07-03 16:02:38'),(1802,'judge-event-evaluation-980-1688364351',980,10,1,5,1,2023,181,'462',NULL,7281,1467,7466,12,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Kerenhapukh! Awesome work. It was simple yet captivating with a very great message. Looking forward to seeing more work from you. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 16:05:51','2023-07-03 16:05:51'),(1803,'judge-event-evaluation-282-1688364665',282,10,1,5,1,2023,181,'462',NULL,6988,1467,7466,12,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,NULL,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Lael! Awesome work. Your idea was simple, yet it required a lot of thought in regard to the colour scheme, the illustrations, etc. Keep up the great job and yearn to improve yourself every year. I look forward to seeing more of your work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 16:11:05','2023-07-03 16:11:05'),(1804,'judge-event-evaluation-444-1688365889',444,17,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7420,4200,7380,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Angelina! but actually, when I see you\'re drawing it\'s more like watercolor, especially for the result of the texture. I\'m so sorry, don\'t be sad; overall, your drawing was delightful and pretty. God bless! I wish you luck!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 16:31:29','2023-07-04 11:13:28'),(1805,'judge-event-evaluation-789-1688367338',789,3,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,6976,1678,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. I really enjoyed your summary of the story, especially how you wrote in your own words. I believe you were able to capture the main lessons from the tale and convey it in a way that can be applicable in real life.\r\nGreat job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 16:55:38','2023-07-03 16:55:38'),(1807,'judge-event-evaluation-227-1688368340',227,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7318,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing piece of still life sketching. Enhancement can be made by using the different shading techniques to highlight certain details as well as the direction of light. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:12:20','2023-07-03 17:12:20'),(1808,'judge-event-evaluation-588-1688368356',588,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7365,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Great and amazing effort put into the artwork. Overall, awesome work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:12:36','2023-07-03 17:12:36'),(1809,'judge-event-evaluation-450-1688368806',450,17,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7421,4200,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'A lot of effort and hardwork was put into this piece of artwork. Amazing technique and shading as well as the placement of the main focus. Unfortunately, without a completed document to support the artwork, points were removed. Overall, excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:20:06','2023-07-03 17:20:06'),(1810,'judge-event-evaluation-484-1688368867',484,3,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,6974,1678,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'The script was well read by the student, quite expressive.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:21:07','2023-07-03 17:21:07'),(1811,'judge-event-evaluation-753-1688368897',753,20,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7089,394,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Clarissa! But It is recommended that color be built up gradually, starting with light open lines of color which are overlaid to produce the appearance of depth.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:21:37','2023-07-03 17:21:37'),(1812,'judge-event-evaluation-586-1688369074',586,25,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7349,5804,7380,17,NULL,NULL,100,42.00,-10,NULL,'1. Coloured pencils are not about drawing an outline and ‘colouring-in’ shapes or areas, rather it focuses on overlaying colors and strokes to create a visual blending of color.\r\n2. It is recommended that color be built up gradually, starting with light open lines of color which are overlaid to produce the appearance of depth.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:24:34','2023-07-03 17:24:34'),(1813,'judge-event-evaluation-229-1688369192',229,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7316,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'A great piece of work being created by Holly. A few points to mention, overshading will take away the focus of the main objects drawn. Also, to lighten the shading as to not overshadow or cover the still life pieces that have been sketched. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:26:32','2023-07-03 17:26:32'),(1815,'judge-event-evaluation-68-1688369426',68,14,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7336,4328,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,0.00,'I enjoyed reading your story. Please keep up the good work.\r\nIt would also be better to write the title of your story on top of the short story writing (not only on the Judge Form).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:30:26','2023-07-03 17:30:26'),(1817,'judge-event-evaluation-368-1688369517',368,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7321,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'This artwork had a lot f hard work and research put into it to enable similarity to the original photography. A few points to make, more shading is required to enhance the drawing of the train and to also highlight the details and direction of light. Also, i little enhancement of the size would make the focus of the sketch to stand out more. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:31:57','2023-07-03 17:31:57'),(1818,'judge-event-evaluation-827-1688369734',827,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7364,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Great work. More shading is required to enhance the details surrounding and a part of the still life. Overall, awesome job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:35:34','2023-07-03 17:35:34'),(1819,'judge-event-evaluation-200-1688369802',200,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7180,4208,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort. Good summary of the story. I feel connecting the story with the lessons you learnt could have been expanded more on. Otherwise, great job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:36:42','2023-07-03 17:36:43'),(1820,'judge-event-evaluation-606-1688370134',606,20,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7232,394,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful piece of art that really portrays hard work and research. Unfortunately points were not allocated for completed documentation as none were uploaded. Overall, excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:42:14','2023-07-03 17:42:14'),(1821,'judge-event-evaluation-603-1688370341',603,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7355,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'An amazing representation of water droplets with great shading and highlights of light reflection. Overall, excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:45:41','2023-07-03 17:45:41'),(1822,'judge-event-evaluation-1075-1688370452',1075,7,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7163,6785,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,9.00,-10,-1.00,'There was no effort in this entry of expressive reading, I wasn\'t able to understand the message being conveyed. There was an obvious lack of interest in the expressive reading, and it was read too fast. Don\'t be discouraged though, you can do better with future entries. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:47:32','2023-07-03 17:47:32'),(1823,'judge-event-evaluation-1057-1688371078',1057,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7174,4208,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Aliyah,\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Remember that the presentation of the poem needs to be\r\nat least one minute long\r\n* The poem should have a Biblical message share with other believers\r\n* You can use your hands, facial expressions and pauses to help you\r\nflow through the poem and give the presentation energy\r\n* If you ever get nervous, just remember to breathe through it\r\nKeep practicing and I know that God will do great things through you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:57:58','2023-07-03 17:57:58'),(1824,'judge-event-evaluation-201-1688371087',201,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7175,4208,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort. I believe you could structure your ideas in a way that it flows better. Many events seemed out of place, and some characters mentioned in the plot weren\'t introduced till the character part. If your main focus is the plot summary, then weave in your themes as you describe the plot. If your main focus is elsewhere, then spend less time on the summary without introducing any character you haven\'t mentioned already.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 17:58:07','2023-07-03 17:58:07'),(1826,'judge-event-evaluation-1144-1688371626',1144,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7156,5805,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'This is a different style of short story, with it being written like a biography. It is biblical in nature and leads us through Henry\'s life. Well done with your writing and may you continue to grow in God as you go through life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:07:06','2023-07-03 18:07:06'),(1828,'judge-event-evaluation-70-1688371778',70,32,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7333,5826,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,0.00,'I do love to read your short story. Maybe if you focus on one conflict and put more details regarding the incidents to build a climax that resolves the conflict, the story would be more interesting and engaging to read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:09:38','2023-07-03 18:09:38'),(1829,'judge-event-evaluation-202-1688371908',202,13,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7185,4208,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. A well written book report, I found the story quite intriguing especially with your style of summarising. I deducted some points in some punctuation errors, and a little on expanding on the lessons learnt. Otherwise, job well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:11:48','2023-07-03 18:11:48'),(1831,'judge-event-evaluation-691-1688372208',691,3,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,6965,1678,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,56.00,-10,-6.00,'The writing style does make this story difficult to read in places. While there is mention of Mary developing a trust in God, there are some concerns with the mention of ghosts and saints who have died appearing to Mary.\r\n The word count for the story was not provided; that plus the difficulty of understanding the story resulted in marks being deducted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:16:48','2023-07-03 18:16:48'),(1832,'judge-event-evaluation-196-1688372725',196,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7201,4208,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'The story has a biblical theme with James doing what was right rather than what was easy. It is a simplistic theme however, it works to get the message across that honesty can lead to success.\r\nMay you continue to grow in God as you continue your education. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:25:25','2023-07-03 18:25:25'),(1835,'judge-event-evaluation-944-1688373364',944,25,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7350,5804,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,0.00,'Nice story.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:36:04','2023-07-03 18:36:04'),(1836,'judge-event-evaluation-881-1688373370',881,3,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,6968,1678,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,-2.00,'The story has a biblical theme with the characters praying and listening to God when they or their friends were in trouble. Some of the sentences were a bit long, which does make them difficult to follow. Breaking long sentences into shorter ones does allow for easier reading. \r\nPoints were removed as the word count was not included with the story.\r\nMay you continue to grow in God as you go through your education.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:36:10','2023-07-03 18:36:10'),(1839,'judge-event-evaluation-1101-1688373716',1101,13,1,5,1,2023,159,'400',NULL,7183,4208,7459,2,'Collection','7',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Aviella! What a great capture of your baby brother! You can really see the joy in his eyes. Unfortunately the camera seemed to decide that the focus point was his right hand and shirt more than his face causing that to be more in focus than his face. (This may have been due to the phone camera picking up more movement in that area.) Great choice on where to crop the photo! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:41:56','2023-07-03 18:41:56'),(1841,'judge-event-evaluation-411-1688374242',411,7,1,5,1,2023,159,'400',NULL,7163,6785,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Ezekiel! Thank you for this photo! \r\nIt is quite a cool shot, however, I think a photo like this would be better suited to be entered into the general photograph category. A portraiture is meant to have people as the main subject but your photo has them blurred in the background. In the future, consider things like cropping to remove the slither of building on the right edge. Also please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission. I can tell that you have a great eye for photography, so I hope you continue to develop this gift. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:50:42','2023-07-03 18:50:42'),(1843,'judge-event-evaluation-1506-1688374408',1506,17,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','2',0,4200,7463,34,'Open','28',100,85.00,-10,0.00,'The choir performed at their Best in splendour of God\'s holiness! An essential thing to work on; balancing the dynamics in each part so that the vocalists blend together in harmony. \r\n\r\nLovely performance!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:53:28','2023-07-03 18:53:28'),(1846,'judge-event-evaluation-467-1688374549',467,8,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7065,6328,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Need more improvement!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:55:49','2023-07-03 18:55:49'),(1847,'judge-event-evaluation-482-1688374596',482,3,1,5,1,2023,295,'915',NULL,6983,1678,7378,50,'Collection','24',100,76.00,-10,0.00,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 18:56:36','2023-07-03 18:56:36'),(1848,'judge-event-evaluation-1309-1688374672',1309,17,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7385,4200,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Immanuel! God Bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU