3 19:14:24'),(1867,'judge-event-evaluation-545-1688375824',545,8,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7078,6328,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,46.00,-10,NULL,'Need more improvement!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:17:04','2023-07-03 19:17:04'),(1869,'judge-event-evaluation-1005-1688375871',1005,28,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7260,5806,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'\'Beauty is in its simplicity\'. Excellent sketching of a landscape with correct shading and portrayal of the direction of the light. Great work..',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:17:51','2023-07-03 19:17:51'),(1870,'judge-event-evaluation-1061-1688375882',1061,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7183,4208,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Aviella\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Remember that the poem should have a worthwhile message\r\nto share with a Christian audience (Having a Biblical Worldview)\r\n* You can use a few steps and added facial expressions to enhance\r\nthe presentation\r\nKeep it up and I know that God will continue to do great things\r\nthrough you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:18:02','2023-07-03 19:18:02'),(1871,'judge-event-evaluation-955-1688375905',955,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7158,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Betheny,\r\nJust a suggestion, when choosing a poem\r\nbe sure that the poem has a worthwhile message\r\nto share with others (e.g. instead of being surprised \r\nthat a person made it to Heaven, one that focuses\r\non the splendor of eternity with God, or how we as \r\nChristians must live a life dedicated to God)\r\nAll in all you did well\r\nKeep it up and God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:18:25','2023-07-03 19:18:25'),(1872,'judge-event-evaluation-376-1688375914',376,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7331,4451,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Chloe,\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Be sure to memorize the script, and that all pages\r\nof the script are sent with the judges form\r\n(the last stanza seemed to be missing)\r\n* Be sure to add facial expressions\r\nand have precise though not stiff movements\r\nthis will help to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep it up and looking forward to all that \r\nGod will continue to do through you\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:18:34','2023-07-03 19:18:34'),(1873,'judge-event-evaluation-1211-1688375914',1211,10,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,6988,1467,7466,50,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Lael! Great message. Jesus said in Luke 12:48, \"...For unto whom much is given, of him shall be much required.\" Indeed, as Christians, we are given a lot of responsibilities, namely, to ensure that we fully utilize all that God has blessed us with. \r\n\r\nMy feedback would be to brush up on your outline. Outlines are important because they act as maps. Your sermon and your outline were not consistent with each other. I often turned to your outline to see what part of the sermon we were up to but it was pretty jumbled up. Outlines keep you on track and avoid you from going off topic. \r\n\r\nSecondly, in your outline, always proofread for errors. You did not capitalize \'g\' for \'God\' and you also mentioned that we are similar to God. Yes, we are created in His image and made in His likeness but to say that we are similar to Him is inaccurate and saying so would mean that we can be compared to Him. Never deviate from what is written in the Bible and add your own words in it because it can be misleading. \r\n\r\nLastly, take your time. Do not rush your sermon. Give people some time to reflect on your words.\r\n\r\nHowever, you did great and I was blessed and motivated by your message. Thank you for your effort and I look forward to seeing you again in the future. God bless.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:18:34','2023-07-03 19:18:35'),(1874,'judge-event-evaluation-1301-1688376005',1301,17,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7422,4200,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Naphattakorn!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:20:05','2023-07-03 19:20:05'),(1875,'judge-event-evaluation-565-1688376033',565,3,1,5,1,2023,159,'400',NULL,6976,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Lukhercia, thank you for your entry!\r\nThis is a really nice photo depicting the closeness of your family. Unfortunately the camera did not seem to focus on the people in the photo. Normally a portraiture would show the people from the front so that the face and eyes are the real focus of the picture. Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:20:33','2023-07-03 19