irds can also apply between the left and right halves. It depends on the particular photo and what the subject of the photo is.) I can see that you have a great eye for photography. I hope to see more photos from you in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:28:03','2023-07-03 19:28:04'),(1885,'judge-event-evaluation-279-1688376505',279,32,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7334,5826,7380,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Tiamai!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:28:25','2023-07-03 19:28:25'),(1886,'judge-event-evaluation-1193-1688376542',1193,11,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7025,613,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'This piece of artwork was well thought about and is portrayed through the placement of the dog on the paper. A beautiful border will help enhance the portrait as well as some different shades of shading. Overall, amazing work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:29:02','2023-07-03 19:29:02'),(1887,'judge-event-evaluation-1010-1688376559',1010,28,1,5,1,2023,193,'505',NULL,7262,5806,7380,17,NULL,NULL,100,51.00,-10,NULL,'Need more improvement!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:29:19','2023-07-03 19:29:20'),(1888,'judge-event-evaluation-886-1688376572',886,8,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7077,6328,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,-5.00,'Good effort. You wrote a good summary of the book. There was just an issue with tenses- present and past. Also you wrote more than 1000 words. Otherwise it was a great report. The lessons and themes were well explained and related to the story, and good structuring of your ideas and thoughts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:29:32','2023-07-03 19:29:32'),(1889,'judge-event-evaluation-956-1688376737',956,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7152,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Nice effort Gianna\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* You can add small steps, hand movements, changes in vocal inflection\r\nand facial expressions to enhance the presentation\r\n* Try to keep a certain amount of eye contact with the audience (or in this case the camera)\r\n* Be sure that the poem has a worthwhile message to share with the audience\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the great things God will do through you\r\nGod Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:32:17','2023-07-03 19:32:17'),(1891,'judge-event-evaluation-232-1688376784',232,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7323,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Kayla has taken a different approach to highlighting her sketch which is to darken the background rather than the still life itself. There is room for improvement in terms of shading and outlining but overall, amazing work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:33:04','2023-07-03 19:33:04'),(1892,'judge-event-evaluation-853-1688376957',853,3,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,6980,1678,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,0.00,'It is a nice story. Yet, putting direct speech and indirect speech in the story would make the story more interesting and engaging to read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:35:57','2023-07-03 19:35:57'),(1895,'judge-event-evaluation-1347-1688377335',1347,17,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7414,4200,7469,45,'Open','24',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for the message in the poem! I needed to hear that today. \r\nThere is much to improve but I congratulate you for trying. Starting something and completing it is important. \r\nContinue to practice your vocal delivery, working on enunciation and changes in your voice (tone, intonation) Also think about what gestures or movements or facial expression that go with your poem that will help enhance your presentation. \r\nBlessings\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:42:15','2023-07-03 19:42:15'),(1896,'judge-event-evaluation-231-1688377354',231,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7317,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'An amazing landscape depicting tall mountain ranges. Some improvement can be made in terms of perspective, the birds will be smaller in the distance and larger in size up close. However, an overall excellent job well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:42:34','2023-07-03 19:42:34'),(1897,'judge-event-evaluation-477-1688377371',477,15,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7047,4679,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A very simple yet beautiful piece of artwork. The sketch is beautifully drawn with soft shading being implemented into the sketch. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:42:51','2023-07-03 19:42:51'),(1898,'judge-event-evaluation-380-1688377386',380,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7316,4451,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Holly,\r\nJust a tip\r\n* You can add small steps, hand movements, changes in vocal inflection\r\nand facial expressions to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do\r\nthrough you \r\nGod Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:43:06','2023-07-03 19:43:06'),(1899,'judge-event-evaluation-817-1688377576',817,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7346,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Some key points are to ensure proper shading, darken outlines to ensure focus and lastly to enlarge drawing to fit the paper perfectly to allow best depiction of the artwork. Overall, good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:46:16','2023-07-03 19:46:16'),(1900,'judge-event-evaluation-572-1688377984',572,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6976,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'An amazing self-portrait sketch. More shading and outlining is needed for better viewing of details in the sketch. Overall. great job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:53:04','2023-07-03 19:53:04'),(1902,'judge-event-evaluation-1098-1688378344',1098,30,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7282,769,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'very expressive! well done Fidel, thoroughly enjoyed watching and listening to your expressive reading ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 19:59:04','2023-07-03 19:59:04'),(1903,'judge-event-evaluation-1015-1688378580',1015,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7131,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good try Joon! Everyone forgets lines at times, but to hold your yourself together and come back from it, is a job well done. \r\nRemember practice makes prefect so continue to work on things to present and take time to practice in front of other people as this builds confidence. \r\nYou have good voice projection, but work your inflecting(tone, pace, intonation) as this helps to recreate the emotions and mood of the poem. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:03:00','2023-07-03 20:03:01'),(1909,'judge-event-evaluation-870-1688378974',870,10,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','1',0,1467,6995,1,'Open','3',100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Overall, it is scientifically good. \r\nWell... technically as written in the guideline regarding science exhibit \"a list must be submitted identifying work included in the display\", a student needs to (category: Research) \"prepare a display\". It is usually a display board (trifold or twofold board). All photos or printed words are pasted on it whether research or collection and whether it is online or in person. However, providing the goods or the material is also allowed.\r\nSupplying bibliography and more detail references contribute more points. It was mentioned \"people said we need to grow people without sunlight\". It would be better if it could have been detailed which people and or why they said that and also who had done this before. Mentioning only scientist from 19th century is insufficient.\r\nYou did mention photosynthesis which is good but there is a need to factor growth hormone which has been learned.\r\nIt would be better if the effect of each medium was explained as well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:09:34','2023-07-03 20:09:34'),(1910,'judge-event-evaluation-914-1688378993',914,8,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','1',0,6328,6995,1,'Open','3',100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Overall, it is scientifically good. \r\nThis is Science Exhibit. Section II.B, III and V, about exhibit or workmanship, needs to be presented Overall, it is scientifically good. \r\nWell... technically as written in the guideline regarding science exhibit \"a list must be submitted identifying work included in the display\", a student needs to (category: Research) \"prepare a display\". It is usually a display board (trifold or twofold board). All photos or printed words are pasted on it whether research or collection and whether it is online or in person. However, providing the goods or the material is also allowed.\r\nYour question said other fruits. It would be better if you had taken this out or other fruits had also been taken as samples to be presented.\r\nThe effect of removing stem which causes hole and infiltration of germs is explained well. It would be better if the effect of the container whether closed or opened had been also explained.\r\nFor neatness, there is a a gray background on the first three pages and the last paragraph which I think it must be removed. \r\nBoldness of font can be used to point out different sections. \r\nYour table is good and easily understood. \r\nPink font on the photograph is difficult to read. Was it taken under low light or maybe there is a need to put a border around the fonts or use other color?\r\nThere is a need to explain the microscopic look of the grapes by marking some parts in the pictures for example the dark spots and explain what they are or there is a need to detail it in the table.\r\nSupplying the standard science report is also needed as written in section II.B.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:09:53','2023-07-03 20:09:53'),(1911,'judge-event-evaluation-915-1688379009',915,8,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','2',0,6328,6995,1,'Open','3',100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Overall, it is scientifically good. \r\nWell... technically as written in the guideline regarding science exhibit \"a list must be submitted identifying work included in the display\", a student needs to (category: Research) \"prepare a display\". It is usually a display board (trifold or twofold board). All photos or printed words are pasted on it whether research or collection and whether it is online or in person. However, providing the goods or the material is also allowed.\r\nIt would be more complete if you stated the unit used in your table for the baseline speed and speed (e.g. minute, second). \r\nSupplying the standard science report is also needed as written in section II.B.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:10:09','2023-07-03 20:10:09'),(1912,'judge-event-evaluation-916-1688379053',916,8,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','3',0,6328,6995,1,'Open','3',100,78.00,NULL,NULL,' Overall, it is scientifically good. \r\nWell... technically as written in the guideline regarding science exhibit \"a list must be submitted identifying work included in the display\", a student needs to (category: Research) \"prepare a display\". It is usually a display board (trifold or twofold board). All photos or printed words are pasted on it whether research or collection and whether it is online or in person. However, providing the goods or the material is also allowed.\r\nSupplying the standard science report is also needed.\r\nIt would be better if you could provide the photos of before and after the treatment or photos which show the different look among the sugar-tested, salt-tasted and sand-tested.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:10:53','2023-07-03 20:10:53'),(1913,'judge-event-evaluation-1433-1688379086',1433,21,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','3',0,5805,6995,1,'Open','3',100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Overall it is good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:11:26','2023-07-03 20:11:27'),(1914,'judge-event-evaluation-1431-1688379099',1431,21,1,5,1,2023,14,'056','2',0,5805,6995,1,'Open','3',100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'It is overall good.\r\nIt would be better if the photos are in color. \r\nThere is a need to indicate what is in each tube of all the five tubes by labeling each of them of it may be labelled on your display board. It is also needed to mention what it means when the color changes. Do the changes give different colors or the same colors. Explain as well how the number 2,500 cal and 2,000 cal are obtained. It would be better if the calculation and the chart can be displayed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:11:39','2023-07-03 20:11:39'),(1915,'judge-event-evaluation-1489-1688379178',1489,17,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7401,4200,7463,33,'Open','25',100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Meilin performed with good balance of her voice dynamics in clearly bringing out the message of her song. She gave her best in worship. Wonderful performance!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:12:58','2023-07-03 20:12:58'),(1916,'judge-event-evaluation-1006-1688379216',1006,28,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7263,5806,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'A very well thought out piece of artwork. Great details portrayed in the pupil. Improvements can be made in the structure of the eyebrows and other surrounding features that will help the eye be more focused on. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:13:36','2023-07-03 20:13:36'),(1917,'judge-event-evaluation-576-1688379303',576,20,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7169,394,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Good work! Enjoyed reading your summary. Your introduction summarised what you would talk about- giving me an idea of what to expect. However I would have wanted a bit more on the lessons gleaned from the story. Your plot summary showed there were many good lessons, so I would have appreciated if these were highlighted more directly than just alluded to. Otherwise, was a great read. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:15:03','2023-07-03 20:15:03'),(1919,'judge-event-evaluation-830-1688379366',830,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7358,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Great work. improve on shading and outlining. Overall, good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:16:06','2023-07-03 20:16:06'),(1920,'judge-event-evaluation-973-1688379438',973,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7140,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Kiagi! Great message in your poem. \r\nGood inflection (intonation and tone)! There was also some good facial expressions. \r\nContinue to work on your enunciation (saying words clearly) so that your audience understands the message clearly. When practicing think about what movement/gestures you can add also. \r\nApproach/departure should have been into the camera frame and out at the end. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:17:18','2023-07-03 20:17:18'),(1921,'judge-event-evaluation-672-1688379451',672,8,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7064,6328,7463,33,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,0.00,'A performance exemplifying the love of Christ through her beautiful voice. There was a bit of a challenge in the transpose however she regained composure. Well done Charlotte!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:17:31','2023-07-03 20:17:31'),(1922,'judge-event-evaluation-1219-1688379516',1219,10,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7279,1467,7463,33,'Open','25',100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Viola chose a simple song but sang so gracefully, showing passion in glorifying God. Great dynamics and voice control. Splendid performance!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:18:36','2023-07-03 20:18:36'),(1923,'judge-event-evaluation-583-1688379586',583,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6985,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:19:46','2023-07-03 20:19:46'),(1924,'judge-event-evaluation-501-1688379810',501,3,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,6967,1678,7463,33,'Open','25',100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Nanako can pace herself with presenting her music. There can be an improvement in controlling her voice so that she is able to sing effectively. Nevertheless she was confident in giving her best solo performance in worship. Good effort!    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:23:30','2023-07-03 20:23:30'),(1925,'judge-event-evaluation-600-1688379886',600,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6981,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'A great piece of art that portrays creativity. Overall, good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:24:46','2023-07-03 20:24:46'),(1926,'judge-event-evaluation-1488-1688379961',1488,17,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7409,4200,7463,33,'Open','25',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Shalem gave her all in worship. She can work on her breathing technique and be a little more confident. She has great potential-credits for challenging herself in singing a rather difficult song. Fantastic job!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:26:01','2023-07-03 20:26:01'),(1927,'judge-event-evaluation-1215-1688379988',1215,10,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7281,1467,7463,33,'Open','25',100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Kerenhapukh sang with a heart of worship and thanksgiving. She can work on her vocal control in bringing out her voice more effectively. Great effort!!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:26:28','2023-07-03 20:26:28'),(1929,'judge-event-evaluation-821-1688380112',821,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7341,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good job. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:28:32','2023-07-03 20:28:32'),(1930,'judge-event-evaluation-1269-1688380119',1269,28,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','1',0,5806,7463,33,'Open,Collection','21,25',100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort shown by the girls especially with harmonising. Just be careful with hitting the right notes at certain parts of the song. Proper etiquette was presented by the ladies. Wonderful worship-Keep smiling!   ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:28:39','2023-07-03 20:28:39'),(1933,'judge-event-evaluation-1158-1688380343',1158,46,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','1',0,4504,7463,33,'Collection','25,22',100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Powerful message and wonderful song selection performed by the girls. A few areas to work on can be breathing at the proper time with control and feeling confident. Well done for giving your Best praise in performance!! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:32:23','2023-07-03 20:32:23'),(1934,'judge-event-evaluation-414-1688380471',414,7,1,5,1,2023,159,'400',NULL,7164,6785,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Obadiah, this is an awesome photo! I love how you have framed the person in the photo within the frame of the cylindrical object. It is very creative! One distracting element would be the car in the background, but aside from that, amazing work. Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. \r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:34:31','2023-07-03 20:34:31'),(1935,'judge-event-evaluation-506-1688380499',506,3,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','1',0,1678,7463,33,'Collection','21,25',100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Fantastic effort shown by the ladies.  Vocal balance is an essential part of singing with harmonies and volume control. Just be a little more careful with pronunciation of words when singing. There is room for improvement. Nonetheless, keep singing your hearts out!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:34:59','2023-07-03 20:34:59'),(1939,'judge-event-evaluation-880-1688380779',880,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6971,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:39:39','2023-07-03 20:39:39'),(1941,'judge-event-evaluation-486-1688380830',486,3,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','2',0,1678,7463,33,'Collection','25,23',100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort girls! Some key factors to point out when delivering a song is, sing in unison, together with harmonising as a group. Connect with the audience by looking at the camera and don\'t be shy. Vocal balance is important as well. All in all, amazing praise! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:40:30','2023-07-03 20:40:30'),(1942,'judge-event-evaluation-1278-1688380950',1278,28,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','1',0,5806,7463,34,'Open','28',100,93.00,-10,-1.00,'Great worship performed by the choir. Every vocalist was heard in performance. There can be a bit of improvement with dynamics control when singing the different parts of the arrangement. Overall, outstanding presentation!! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:42:30','2023-07-03 20:42:30'),(1943,'judge-event-evaluation-634-1688381033',634,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6969,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'A very beautiful sketch of a vase of flowers. The artwork was well displayed with proper shading placed into it. Overall, good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:43:53','2023-07-03 20:43:53'),(1944,'judge-event-evaluation-1195-1688381089',1195,21,1,5,1,2023,279,'862','1',0,5805,7463,34,'Open','28',100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Powerful message confidently performed by the choir. There was clarity in most parts of the harmonies and music arrangement. Despite choosing a difficult song, the choir sang tremendously well. Fantastic praise!!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:44:49','2023-07-03 20:44:49'),(1945,'judge-event-evaluation-1110-1688381102',1110,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7118,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Maimoaga, good job! \r\nYour use of voice projection, inflection, and diction helped in your delivery. \r\nGood use of gestures and movement.\r\nJust be careful not to pull faces when you forget your lines. Its best to stand still and breath and the memory usually returns because you have practiced. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:45:02','2023-07-03 20:45:02'),(1947,'judge-event-evaluation-790-1688381179',790,3,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,6969,1678,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'The story of Pilgrim\'s Progress personifies many abstract concepts, and you did well explaining each of these ideas and how it\'s relevant to real life. Good use of scriptures and use of examples.\r\nExceptional work.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:46:19','2023-07-03 20:46:19'),(1949,'judge-event-evaluation-1136-1688381307',1136,46,1,5,1,2023,159,'400',NULL,7449,4504,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Olisha, What a lovely photo you have taken here!\r\nNext time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any enhancements that you have made. One enhancement you could use on this entry is to crop the photo. The rule of thirds would suggest that you have the lower two-thirds of the photo have the person in it and the upper third be the background above her head. Knowing this, you could crop the photo to create those imaginary lines of thirds in the frame. (The rule of thirds can also apply between the left and right halves. It depends on the particular photo and what the subject of the photo is.) I can see that you have a great eye for photography. I hope to see more photos from you in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:48:27','2023-07-03 20:48:27'),(1950,'judge-event-evaluation-812-1688381314',812,46,1,5,1,2023,159,'400',NULL,7449,4504,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Olisha, What a lovely photo you have taken here!\r\nNext time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any enhancements that you have made. One enhancement you could use on this entry is to crop the photo. The rule of thirds would suggest that you have the lower two-thirds of the photo have the person in it and the upper third be the background above her head. Knowing this, you could crop the photo to create those imaginary lines of thirds in the frame. (The rule of thirds can also apply between the left and right halves. It depends on the particular photo and what the subject of the photo is.) I can see that you have a great eye for photography. I hope to see more photos from you in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:48:34','2023-07-03 20:48:34'),(1951,'judge-event-evaluation-831-1688381633',831,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7363,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Artwork needs to be darkened. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:53:53','2023-07-03 20:53:53'),(1952,'judge-event-evaluation-1535-1688381647',1535,17,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7411,4200,7466,50,'Open','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Floren! Thank you for blessing us with your message. Indeed, as it says in Proverbs 18:21, \"Death and life are in the power of the tongue...\" For feedback, I would advise you to keep your outline brief. Its function is to help map out your sermon and keep you on track. Secondly, try to make more eye contact with your audience to keep them engaged. A practical way that you can make that happen is by putting your script on a lectern so that you can fully express yourself. However, it was a great message and I commend you for your efforts. I look forward to more from you. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:54:07','2023-07-03 20:54:07'),(1953,'judge-event-evaluation-643-1688381814',643,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6979,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:56:54','2023-07-03 20:56:54'),(1954,'judge-event-evaluation-735-1688381993',735,17,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7388,4200,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'There were no documentation provided to support art work. Overall, excellent sketching. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 20:59:53','2023-07-03 20:59:53'),(1955,'judge-event-evaluation-651-1688382133',651,3,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,6986,1678,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing landscape sketch. The sunset detail really brings the whole sketch together. Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:02:13','2023-07-03 21:02:13'),(1956,'judge-event-evaluation-1112-1688382145',1112,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7138,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Nethaneel, what a great poem to share. Great try!\r\nYou had great voice projection but continue to work on your inflection (tone, intonation, and the tempo) \r\nSlow down in your speech - slowing down enables you to recreate the mood and emotions of the poem, allows the audience to hear each word very clearly, and gives opportunity for you to gesture and move naturally. \r\nBlessings\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:02:25','2023-07-03 21:02:25'),(1957,'judge-event-evaluation-596-1688382230',596,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7352,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'A really well done piece of art. Good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:03:50','2023-07-03 21:03:50'),(1958,'judge-event-evaluation-1542-1688382542',1542,20,1,5,1,2023,253,'779','1',0,394,6962,28,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'The angklung group\'s performance was mesmerizing. The harmony created by the bamboo instruments was captivating. The musicians showed remarkable skill and played in perfect unison. The coordination and synchronization among the group members were impeccable, showcasing their dedication and practice. Unfortunately this event was registered for a handbell which should be a hand bell instrument.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:09:02','2023-07-03 21:09:02'),(1959,'judge-event-evaluation-1216-1688382634',1216,10,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7281,1467,7466,50,'Open','25',100,52.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Kerenhapukh! Thank you for your effort. Unfortunately, I was not able to view your preaching video (hence the reason I scored you zero on your appearance and deportment) but I was only able to listen to the audio so I had to judge you accordingly. However, it was a good message. Try and work on your voice projection and your delivery so that if your video were to be inaccessible, that I would still be moved just by listening to your audio. Looking forward to hearing from you again. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:10:34','2023-07-03 21:10:34'),(1960,'judge-event-evaluation-833-1688382693',833,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7360,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Art work could be improved by shading and darkening the outline to make more visible to the eye. Overall, good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:11:33','2023-07-03 21:11:33'),(1961,'judge-event-evaluation-1513-1688382857',1513,17,1,5,1,2023,253,'779','3',0,4200,6962,28,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'The handbell group\'s performance was impressive, showcasing their skillful execution of intricate melodies and harmonies. While the technical aspects were well-executed, there is room for improvement in expressing more emotion through facial expressions. Relaxing the facial tension and allowing for more expressive faces would enhance the overall performance and create a deeper connection with the audience. Nevertheless, their precision and coordination were commendable, and the captivating sounds created by the ringing bells left a positive impact on the listeners.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:14:17','2023-07-03 21:14:17'),(1962,'judge-event-evaluation-204-1688382869',204,21,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7147,5805,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'An amazing perspective drawing. Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:14:29','2023-07-03 21:14:30'),(1963,'judge-event-evaluation-1111-1688383004',1111,21,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,7120,5805,7469,45,'Open','24',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Risabh, well done! \r\nGood interpretation vocally of the author\'s idea. \r\nInflection was great except towards the very end. \r\nDo continue to use your talent to the glory of the Lord. \r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:16:44','2023-07-03 21:16:44'),(1964,'judge-event-evaluation-1007-1688383031',1007,28,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7268,5806,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful landscape sketch. Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:17:11','2023-07-03 21:17:11'),(1965,'judge-event-evaluation-861-1688383052',861,10,1,5,1,2023,180,'461',NULL,7283,1467,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Adinda, thank you for your digital art entry.\r\nI would have loved to hear more in your report as to your sources of ideas and the different steps you took to create this. You could even write about the things that you tried that did not work out!\r\nI am not fully convinced by the \'ribbons\' across the design. The ribbon in the middle appears to be the same size as the top and bottom ribbons. It would be reasonable to assume that these ribbons are the same size, but because the middle one is behind the main subjects, it is theoretically further away which means it should visually be seen as smaller than the top and bottom ribbons to properly place the depth of the design. This idea of depth and distance can be applied to many aspects in the design process. Try to consider this when you are designing in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:17:32','2023-07-03 21:17:33'),(1968,'judge-event-evaluation-69-1688383540',69,14,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7336,4328,7475,8,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Good work. Great breakdown of characters and summarising the main points of the plot. Possibly need more emphasis on making those points relevant to real life and the themes you learnt from reading the story. But great effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:25:40','2023-07-03 21:25:41'),(1970,'judge-event-evaluation-370-1688383565',370,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7329,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This artwork has proven to be quite unique. The landscape is really detailed and perspective of the drawing is very well portrayed. Also, the details of the trees expresses the time of the year or season  in which that sketch is meant to be in. Overall, excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:26:05','2023-07-03 21:26:05'),(1971,'judge-event-evaluation-696-1688383582',696,17,1,5,1,2023,180,'461',NULL,7410,4200,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Hey Faithania! You have done some really great work here! Although you had a source idea, you have created this digital art by yourself while using the source as a reference. \r\nI especially appreciate the attention you have given to the rays of light and how they interact with the hair and the clothing of the people through the variation of colouring you have used. \r\nThank you so much for the step by step report. (Even more detail for each step would be most welcome.) It really makes it easier for us judges to understand what you have done to reach this result. Great work! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:26:22','2023-07-03 21:26:22'),(1973,'judge-event-evaluation-534-1688383634',534,3,1,5,1,2023,315,'960',NULL,6965,1678,7469,45,'Open','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Vinsentius, great try! What a powerful message in your poem. \r\nYou have good vocal projection and enunciation! \r\nJust work on the tempo of your presentation so that it your vocal delivery is more natural.  \r\nAlso remember to keep a good amount of eye contact with your audience (or the camera in online convention) as this helps draw in the audience attention.\r\nBlessings',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:27:14','2023-07-03 21:27:14'),(1974,'judge-event-evaluation-591-1688383649',591,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7351,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:27:29','2023-07-03 21:27:29'),(1975,'judge-event-evaluation-887-1688383801',887,8,1,5,1,2023,8,'014',NULL,7078,6328,7475,8,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I marked as breach since I don\'t see how the story is based on Biblical principles. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:30:01','2023-07-03 21:30:01'),(1976,'judge-event-evaluation-71-1688383905',71,32,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7334,5826,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'A very creative and unique sketch. The eye is very detailed with the tree being reflected in the eye as if it was part of it. Overall, excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:31:45','2023-07-03 21:31:45'),(1977,'judge-event-evaluation-466-1688383991',466,8,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7083,6328,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:33:11','2023-07-03 21:33:11'),(1978,'judge-event-evaluation-1008-1688384135',1008,28,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7262,5806,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'More shading is needed for further enhancement of the artwork. Overall, beautiful work. God job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:35:35','2023-07-03 21:35:35'),(1981,'judge-event-evaluation-458-1688384220',458,17,1,5,1,2023,180,'461',NULL,7411,4200,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Floren! Thanks for a great entry here!\r\nThe angle and shape of the cat\'s body and neck do not seem quite natural to me. However, I appreciate your attention to detail with the colouring that would be affected by the light coming from the right of the artwork. I am not fully convinced by the texture of the eyes in contrast to the rest of the artwork. Nonetheless, a well done piece of digital art. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:37:00','2023-07-03 21:37:00'),(1982,'judge-event-evaluation-1429-1688384230',1429,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7196,4208,7466,50,'Open','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Samara, thank you for your effort! I must commend you for choosing a controversial topic in today\'s society. As Christians, we cannot keep turning a blind eye and sweeping these issues under the carpet. However, we are still called to love them; we are to neither condone their actions nor condemn them for it. Continue to be brave in Christ. Great message and great delivery. I look forward to seeing more. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:37:10','2023-07-03 21:37:10'),(1983,'judge-event-evaluation-1425-1688384493',1425,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7211,4208,7466,50,'Open','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jiokapeci, what an encouraging message! Thank you for your effort. My feedback is in regard to your delivery. Try to be more confident, maintain eye contact with your audience, and speak like you believe what you\'re preaching. However, that was a very great message. I look forward to seeing more. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:41:33','2023-07-03 21:41:33'),(1984,'judge-event-evaluation-1427-1688384785',1427,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7198,4208,7466,50,'Open','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Murangzhuoma, thank you for this great message! I have been encouraged and deeply moved to strive for diligence in my life. My feedback would be more confident and make more eye contact with your audience. Great message! Thank you for blessing us. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:46:25','2023-07-03 21:46:25'),(1985,'judge-event-evaluation-698-1688384800',698,17,1,5,1,2023,180,'461',NULL,7428,4200,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Joy! Thank you for your digital art entry! \r\nI can see some great work has been done here. \r\nThe white outline around the figures feels slightly out of place. Perhaps this would be better changed to a glow within the darkness?\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:46:40','2023-07-03 21:46:40'),(1986,'judge-event-evaluation-1379-1688385187',1379,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7199,4208,7466,50,'Open','25',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Heilala, thank you for your effort! You gave a great message about \'Trust\'. My feedback, however, will pertain to your delivery. Try not to make facial expressions that will distract your audience from your message. You seemed uninterested at what you were doing in some instances. Try to make eye contact with your audience instead. However, it was a very great message. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:53:07','2023-07-03 21:53:07'),(1987,'judge-event-evaluation-781-1688385228',781,15,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7052,4679,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Carola! Thank you so much for your digital art! I love how you have used the different textures between the sky, grass, leaves, and water. Some thoughts to consider next time you are drawing. Land is usually not completely flat and therefore the horizon between the grass and the sky should probably have some variation in height. Also, rivers rarely flow completely straight and would usually have twisted and turns in them. I hope you consider these thoughts when you next draw. \r\nI think you have done a really good job in starting to develop this God given talent. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:53:48','2023-07-03 21:53:48'),(1988,'judge-event-evaluation-1217-1688385425',1217,10,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7279,1467,7466,50,'Open','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka from Fiji, Viola! Great message. Thank you for your effort. You were passionate, confident, and interactive. Your delivery was very well done and you captivated my attention from the beginning until the very end. Thank you for this encouraging message. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 21:57:05','2023-07-03 21:57:05'),(1989,'judge-event-evaluation-891-1688385795',891,20,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7090,394,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Hey Eliana! Thanks for this entry! \r\nI must admit that I am a little confused as to if that is meant to be the sun or the moon in the sky! The sunhat and birds make me think it is daytime, however, the stars and shadows around the boat make me think it is at night with a full moon! Also, the blur on the bottom right feels a little strange to me. \r\nKeep on developing this gift for God!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 22:03:15','2023-07-03 22:03:15'),(1990,'judge-event-evaluation-566-1688386341',566,3,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,6976,1678,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Lukhercia, I really appreciate your use of background, midground, and foreground elements. You have utilised them quite well. Please note that pintrest is not a sufficiently described image source in the same way as google images, amazon, instagram, etc. are not image sources. These websites display the images, but for your report you still need to be specific as to what your source is or what your sources are. (You can have more than one source of ideas.) Great work! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 22:12:21','2023-07-03 22:12:21'),(1991,'judge-event-evaluation-1512-1688387006',1512,17,1,5,1,2023,253,'779','2',0,4200,6962,28,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'The handbell group\'s performance was delightful to watch and listen to! The selection of melodies and harmonies was beautiful, showcasing their musicality and talent. However, there is an opportunity for improvement in expressing more emotion and adding facial expressions to create a deeper connection with the audience. Nevertheless, their dedication and hard work were evident, resulting in an enjoyable and captivating performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 22:23:26','2023-07-03 22:23:26'),(1992,'judge-event-evaluation-1248-1688387006',1248,28,1,5,1,2023,231,'713','2',0,5806,7459,25,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hi guys! Great playing here. I loved seeing your smiles at the end and wished you had smiled more while playing the music to show how much you enjoy playing together for God\'s glory. A few thoughts for you all. Keep an eye on your tempo and try to keep it consistent - don\'t suddenly speed up or down unnecessarily. Recorders, continue to develop your breath control as this will help you to widen your dynamic range which will also help you to better communicate the mood and intensity of the music you are playing. Great work team. Keep up the good work playing for the glory of God.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 22:23:26','2023-07-03 22:23:26'),(1993,'judge-event-evaluation-1364-1688387383',1364,13,1,5,1,2023,253,'779','2',0,4208,6962,28,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Despite the small size of the group, the handbell performance was able to produce a beautiful and harmonious tone. Their ability to create such a lovely sound despite limited personnel is truly impressive.  Keep up the fantastic work, as the handbell group proves that great things can be achieved even with a smaller ensemble!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 22:29:43','2023-07-03 22:29:44'),(1994,'judge-event-evaluation-581-1688387456',581,3,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,6985,1678,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Naylla! What a wonderful promise God has given the world through the story we know of Noah and the Ark.  Some aspects of your artwork seem to appear clearer than others. It is hard for me to say why this might be without having a better understanding of your process in creating this piece. (For reference - the rainbow compared to the dove.) Please note that Google is not a source of images. You can use google to find images, but you will need to specify in your report what websites that google takes you to. One thought in making this more realistic, the hull of the boat should be underwater! I hope that you continue to develop your skillset here. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 22:30:56','2023-07-03 22:30:56'),(1995,'judge-event-evaluation-1363-1688391883',1363,13,1,5,1,2023,253,'779','1',0,4208,6962,28,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Despite the small size of the group, the handbell performance was remarkable in creating a beautiful tone. Their ability to create such a captivating sound with limited personnel was truly impressive. Bravo to the small group for delivering a wonderful performance!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 23:44:43','2023-07-03 23:44:43'),(1996,'judge-event-evaluation-1138-1688392543',1138,17,1,5,1,2023,253,'779','1',0,4200,6962,28,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'The way the ringing bells blended together in perfect synchrony created a stunning musical harmony! The melodies and harmonies intertwined seamlessly. It was a delightful blend of song selection and beautiful arrangements that made the performance truly special.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-03 23:55:43','2023-07-03 23:55:43'),(1997,'judge-event-evaluation-941-1688394672',941,25,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7355,5804,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Nice story. Simple yet interesting and easy to follow. Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 00:31:12','2023-07-04 00:31:12'),(1998,'judge-event-evaluation-846-1688395279',846,11,1,5,1,2023,7,'013',NULL,7025,613,7374,7,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Interesting story. I really enjoyed reading your story. Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 00:41:19','2023-07-04 00:41:19'),(1999,'judge-event-evaluation-230-1688412513',230,19,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7327,4451,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'More shading using the different techniques to blend and so forth is needed for the enhancement of this artwork. Overall, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 05:28:33','2023-07-04 05:28:33'),(2000,'judge-event-evaluation-819-1688412560',819,25,1,5,1,2023,191,'503',NULL,7345,5804,7235,17,'Collection',NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'More shading and outline is needed for enhancement of still life drawing. Good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 05:29:20','2023-07-04 05:29:20'),(2001,'judge-event-evaluation-1436-1688416806',1436,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7194,4208,7107,50,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Needs to improve in his posture and be more expressive and persuasive. Did not include a specific life application of his theme. He displayed confidence with a clear message which was well covered and well planned. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 06:40:06','2023-07-04 06:40:06'),(2002,'judge-event-evaluation-1435-1688417110',1435,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7195,4208,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'A confident speaker with clear diction and assertion. May need to improve in his exprressive and persuasive skills. He also needs more scripture references in his outline.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 06:45:10','2023-07-04 06:45:11'),(2003,'judge-event-evaluation-1432-1688417369',1432,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7193,4208,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Had a great message that was well covered. He needs to improve in projecting his voice with exprressive and persuasive skills. His theme\'s life\'s application was not covered well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 06:49:29','2023-07-04 06:49:29'),(2004,'judge-event-evaluation-1434-1688417620',1434,13,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7187,4208,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A confident speaker with good voice projection and clear diction. Had great biblical insights into the theme of leadership. Needs to improve in his persuasive skills. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 06:53:40','2023-07-04 06:53:40'),(2005,'judge-event-evaluation-1536-1688418474',1536,17,1,5,1,2023,320,'965',NULL,7429,4200,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Confident, persuasive and expressive. A great speaker but will need to speak slowly and clearly to emphasise the main points of his presentation. A pity that there were no outline provided. Must also be careful about bible theology and principles presented to ensure they are well supported by scriptures. Example - to assume that God knew where Adam was after he sinned is debateable because Adam\'s sin made him invisible to God (Isaiah 59:2 and Habakkuk 1:13). This assumption would also render God\'s words in Genesis 3:9 as insignificant - \"Where art thou?\" ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 07:07:54','2023-07-04 07:07:54'),(2007,'judge-event-evaluation-1140-1688422749',1140,21,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7132,5805,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Immanuel. Just a couple of comments to assist you:\r\n1. Remember to underline the poem\'s title and allow a space between it and the first line, then centre the poem on \r\n       the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n2. You have well-chosen words that rhyme, except for the last line \' in every form\' which is rather ambiguous.\r\n3. When talking about God, always capitalize words that refer to Him eg. Healer\'; \'Protector\'\r\n\r\nYou have great potential in poetry-writing and I\'ll look forward to seeing your entry next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 08:19:09','2023-07-04 08:19:09'),(2008,'judge-event-evaluation-57-1688424002',57,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7331,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Chloe. Just a couple of areas to assist:\r\n1. The title of the poem \'Even Though\' doesn\'t seem to tie in with the poem\'s theme.\r\n2. Remember to capitalize the first letter of each word in the title and underline the title.\r\n3. Just a couple of punctuation changes: In Stanza 1, delete the semi-colon after \'sinned\', add a comma after \r\n      \'more\', add a semi-colon, not a colon after \'life\'. In Stanza 3, change the colon to semi-colon after \'carried\'. In \r\n      Stanza 5, change the colon to semi-colon after \'bread\'.\r\n\r\nKeep composing poems to bring glory to Him....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 08:40:02','2023-07-04 08:40:03'),(2009,'judge-event-evaluation-782-1688424902',782,15,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7045,4679,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your simple, yet heart-felt poem, Gloria. Just a couple of areas to assist you:\r\n1. Always underline the poem\'s title, then centre the poem on the page for aesthetic effect.\r\n2. Make sure there is subject-verb agreement eg. in the first line \'those\' speaks of more than one so the options \r\n      would be to write either \'Those whose hearts are pure\' or \'One whose heart is pure\'. If using the plural verb, then \r\n      towards the end of the poem, it would say, \'The Lord will lead them on in His way\' + \'They will have eternal life in \r\n      Heaven\'.\r\n3. The commas should be deleted at the end of Lines 1 and 3 as a comma is only used to take a pause and \r\n      separate ideas in a sentence.\r\n\r\nKeep writing for Him....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 08:55:02','2023-07-04 08:55:03'),(2010,'judge-event-evaluation-677-1688425711',677,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7088,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your heart-warming poem, Clara, and what we look forward to in eternity. Just a couple of areas to assist....\r\n1. When setting up the page measurements, the details at the top-left can be placed at the end of your poem in\r\n     the bottom-right corner with the lines closer together, as only the poem had to be double-spaced, then the \r\n     poem can be centred better on the page for aesthetic purposes. Always remember to underline the poem\'s \r\n     title.\r\n2. There are only a couple of punctuation marks to change: There should be a comma after \'Oh\' in Stanzas 1 and 3.\r\n3. Instead of a comma, there should be a semi-colon after \'vanished;\' in Stanza 1, after \'breathtaking;\' in Stanza 3 \r\n    and after \'joyously;\' in Stanza 4. Semi-colons are used to separate phrases.\r\n\r\nKeep writing for Him...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 09:08:31','2023-07-04 09:08:31'),(2011,'judge-event-evaluation-824-1688427170',824,25,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7340,5804,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your interesting poem outlining God\'s creation week, Toroagtoka. Just a couple of areas to assist you:\r\n1. Your poem was very neatly presented as per the guidelines and the border also was great, aesthetically.\r\n2. Remember when referring to God, His name must always be capitalized: \'His\' in Line 2 of Stanza 5; \'Us\' and \'Our\' in \r\n     Line 1 of Stanza 7.\r\n3. Be careful with the use of punctuation...a comma is only used to separate a thought; a semi-colon separates \r\n    phrases and a period ends a complete sentence eg. In Stanza 1, add a period after \'light\' in Line 3. In Stanza 2, \r\n    add a comma after \'parted\' but delete the comma after \'Heaven\'. In Stanza 3, delete the comma after \'place\', \r\n    add a period after \'grace\', add a semi-colon after \'trees\'. in Stanza 4, add a semi-colon after \'light\' and delete the \r\n    comma after \'moon\'. In Stanza 5, delete the commas after \'created\', \'world\' and \'warm\' and add a period after \r\n    \'world\'. In Stanza 6, delete the commas after \'earth\' , \'creepeth\' and \'good\' + add a period after \'creepeth\'. In \r\n    Stanza 7, add a comma after \'earth\' then delete the second \'dominion\'. In Stanza 8, delete \'And\' in line 2 and the \r\n    comma after \'good\', then instead of \'As\' in the last line, add \'And\'.\r\n\r\nI\'ll look forward to seeing you write more poems for His glory...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 09:32:50','2023-07-04 09:32:50'),(2012,'judge-event-evaluation-655-1688428374',655,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7090,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your simple, yet heart-felt poem, Eliana. Just a couple of things to help you with future poetry writing.\r\n1. Explore some more facets of God, Our father, by adding extra Stanzas to your poem. This poem is too short and \r\n    simple to be considered competitive as a Student Convention entry.\r\n2 The first three lines of Stanza 2 need more explanation for a reader if a reader is going to understand facets of \r\n    God\'s character when reading your poem.\r\n3. Add a comma after  \'Oh\' in the last line.\r\n4. When referring to God, always capitalize His names eg capitalize \'Holy\' in the last line.\r\n5. Change the \'?\' to an \'!\' in the last line.\r\n\r\nKeep asking God for ideas for your future poetry efforts...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 09:52:54','2023-07-04 09:52:54'),(2013,'judge-event-evaluation-1498-1688428851',1498,21,1,5,1,2023,329,'978',NULL,7121,5805,5,49,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Emma! \r\nRemember for in person events, to still \"approach and depart\" the stage/camera view as you would in person. \r\nA couple of brief moments where you forgot lines but recovered well. I know it is hard, but try to practice playing those moments into your presentation using gestures and facial expressions to make it less obvious. \r\nOverall, a great famous speech submission! Thank you for your efforts. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 10:00:51','2023-07-04 10:00:51'),(2014,'judge-event-evaluation-754-1688429672',754,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7087,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your efforts, Abiela. Just some areas to help you with for future poetry writing....\r\n1. For aesthetic purposes, remember to underline the poem\'s title and leave a space between the title and the first \r\n   line, then centre the poem on the page, so there are equal amounts of space on all four sides of the poem. \r\n   Remember in the Convention guidelines that it says to double-space when typing.\r\n2. As most of the lines in each Stanza are either phrases or simple sentences, it\'s better to put a semi-colon, not a \r\n     comma after \'great\' and \'spoken\' in Stanza 1, after \'depressed\' and \'people\' in Stanza 2 and after \'change\' and \r\n     \'felt\' in Stanza 4.\r\n3. Put commas after \'Oh,\' in Stanzas 3 and 4.\r\n4. In the last line, I would suggest that God is more than just the \'missing piece\'. He must be the only true source of \r\n    our joy, so I would change the last line to a declaration: \'You are the source of my joy\'.\r\n\r\nTrust this helps you with your future poetry writing for His glory...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 10:14:32','2023-07-04 10:14:32'),(2015,'judge-event-evaluation-1220-1688430131',1220,10,1,5,1,2023,329,'978',NULL,6988,1467,5,49,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Lael! \r\nRemember to still \"approach and depart\" from the camera like you would enter and exit the stage. It\'s good to read the guidelines and judges form before you begin preparation so you can see what judges will be looking for. \r\nThe script you have supplied appears to be the script that you spoke, instead of the script of the original famous speech. Compared with the original there are a number of lines that were missed throughout. \r\nKeep up the great work, keep practicing and look to the original for some ideas of pausing, emphasising and gesturing. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 10:22:11','2023-07-04 10:22:11'),(2016,'judge-event-evaluation-61-1688430763',61,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7316,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Holly. Just a couple of areas to assist you with future poetry writing....\r\n1. Remember to underline the title of the poem, then centre it on the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n2. A comma is only needed where there is a pause in a sentence, a period ends a complete sentence and a \r\n    semi-colon separates two phrases eg. In Stanza 2, after \'cat\', there should be either a period or a semi-colon. \r\n    In Stanza 3, the comma is deleted after \'house\'. In Stanza 4, after \'mad\', there should be either a period or a \r\n    semi-colon. In Stanza 5, after \'missing\', there should be either a period or a semi-colon. In Stanza 6, the last line \r\n    is not a complete sentence, but changing \'That\' to \'Now\' will make it a complete sentence.\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing more of your poetry in the future...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 10:32:43','2023-07-04 10:32:43'),(2017,'judge-event-evaluation-1453-1688431143',1453,13,1,5,1,2023,183,'464','1',0,4208,5,4,'Open','19',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your presentation! \r\nTime management is an important skill to learn. \r\nThe text was a little hard to read the yellow/blue against some backgrounds, so I would suggest choosing either a different colour or making sure you have a text box behind the text to make reading easier. Some slides appeared unfished such as slide 8. \r\nTo make the presentation more impactful, maybe next time include strategies or things people can take away and do to help them with time management.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 10:39:03','2023-07-04 10:39:03'),(2019,'judge-event-evaluation-1369-1688433352',1369,13,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7183,4208,7107,50,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Time was under 4 minutes so this event will not be placed. Aviella is a confident speaker with a clear and well presented preaching item. She however needs to be more expressive and persuasive in her presentation with a more detailed conclusion. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:15:52','2023-07-04 11:15:53'),(2021,'judge-event-evaluation-1534-1688433771',1534,17,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7384,4200,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'A great preaching item from Deborah. A pity that she lost 5 points for not submitting the outline. She also missed out on the requirement on a minimum of 3 points of discussion on the theme of her preaching item. Although she displayed confidence and was also quite persuasive, her conclusion was weak and brief. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:22:51','2023-07-04 11:22:51'),(2023,'judge-event-evaluation-60-1688433941',60,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7318,4451,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Grace. Just a couple of areas to assist you with for future poetry entries.....\r\n\r\n1. Remember to underline the title of the poem.\r\n2. Remember to use correct punctuation when connecting lines of poetry eg. add a comma to \'easy\' in Line 3 as it \r\n    connects to Line 4, but is a different thought. Delete the comma after \'shown\' in Line 5 as it connects to the next \r\n    line but is part of the same sentence thought. Delete the comma after \'help\' in Line 11 as it connects to the next \r\n    line.\r\n3. In Line 6, change \'that\' (used for objects/things) to \'who\' (refers to \'everyone\' ie. people).\r\n4. Be careful when deciding on rhyming words that they\'re not \'trite\' which means meaningless and just chosen for\r\n    the sake of rhyming eg. \'easy\'/\'breezy\'; \'hard\'/\'card\' and \'help\'/\'kelp\'. Using trite words can lessen the impact of \r\n    the poem\'s message.\r\n\r\nTrust this helps and I look forward to seeing more of your poetry in the future.....God Bless.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:25:41','2023-07-04 11:25:41'),(2024,'judge-event-evaluation-1371-1688434037',1371,13,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7184,4208,7107,50,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This event is not for placings with a time of under 4 minutes. Elena\'s preaching item was presented well with confidence but she will need to be more expressive and persuasive.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:27:17','2023-07-04 11:27:17'),(2025,'judge-event-evaluation-1372-1688434544',1372,13,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7192,4208,7107,50,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A good effort from Francoise. She needs to improve on her reading, expressive and persuasive skills. She is a good speaker but needs to build up her confidence level for good public speaking. Her sermon was well prepared and she delivered with enough sincerity and warmth but she had a weak testimony to support her theme.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:35:44','2023-07-04 11:35:44'),(2026,'judge-event-evaluation-1532-1688434848',1532,17,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7419,4200,7107,50,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A great attempt from Hanseul Wang. A pity she did not submit her sermon outline as required. She needs to improve on her voice projection, expressive and persuasive skills. Her main point was not clearly laid out in the begining and she also had a weak testimony and conclusion. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:40:48','2023-07-04 11:40:48'),(2027,'judge-event-evaluation-1373-1688435100',1373,13,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7186,4208,7107,50,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'A good attempt from Litiana! Her event was below the minimum of 4 minutes so it will not be placed. She will need to improve on her voice projection, diction, expressive and persuasive skills. Conclusion needs to be much stronger and well presented.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:45:00','2023-07-04 11:45:00'),(2028,'judge-event-evaluation-1374-1688435235',1374,13,1,5,1,2023,305,'929',NULL,7177,4208,7107,50,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A great preaching item from Ruth. Her message was well covered and expressed well with good persuasion and a great conclusion. Thank you Ruth.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 11:47:15','2023-07-04 11:47:15'),(2029,'judge-event-evaluation-482-1688436224',482,3,1,5,1,2023,295,'915',NULL,6983,1678,7107,50,'Collection','24',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A good attempt by Benaya. He is a confident speaker but will need to be more expressive and persuasive in public speaking items like preaching. He needs to speak slowly when covering important points on his theme as well as add a convincing personal testimony for additional support.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 12:03:44','2023-07-04 12:03:44'),(2031,'judge-event-evaluation-694-1688437681',694,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7096,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Corinthian. Just a couple of areas to help you with future poetry writing......\r\n\r\n1. Remember to underline the title of your poem and leave a space between the title and the first line, then centre\r\n     the poem on the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n2. When talking about God, His name must be capitalized eg. \'Who\' four times in Stanza 3.\r\n3. In Stanza 2, \'are\' should be replaced with \'is\'.\r\n4. In Stanza 3, place a dash between \'You\' and \'You\'.\r\n5. In Stanza 5, delete \'like\' in Line 1.\r\n6. In Stanza 7, the sentence \'Though it was the best of times\' is not scriptural. Change \'was\' to \'seemed\'\r\n7. In Stanza 7, change \'Forgive\' to \'Forgave\' to make the verb tense correct + delete \'for\'.\r\n8. Since the last line of the poem refers to a conversation with God in that Stanza, it\'s a disrespectful comment to \r\n     make when leaving a conversation with God. The last line of the poem could be more honoring towards God \r\n     eg. \'I choose to let Your life in me flow.\'\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing your poetry again next year....God Bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 12:28:01','2023-07-04 12:28:01'),(2032,'judge-event-evaluation-59-1688437746',59,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7319,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your effort, Felix. Just a couple of areas to assist you:\r\n1. The poem\'s title should be \"What Was it Like in WW1?\' as there is a question mark at the end (remember to \r\n      capitalize the title and underline.\r\n2. The poem should be centred on the page for more effect.\r\n3. Be careful that correct punctuation has been used (a period ends a complete sentence, a comma indicates a \r\n      pause, a semi-colon breaks two phrases) eg. Period in Stanza 1: \'to see through.\'; Delete comma in Stanza 2: \'of \r\n      the men\'; Stanza 3: add comma \'of the artillery,\' and \'the rats\'; lower-case \'a\' in \'And\' + delete comma after \'and\';\r\n      Stanza 4: put a dash between \'a day - it was mouldy\'; put period or comma after \'rats\'; put dash or semi-colon \r\n      between \'too - we got tea\'\r\n\r\nI\'ll look forward to seeing you compose another poem for next year\'s Convention...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 12:29:06','2023-07-04 12:29:06'),(2033,'judge-event-evaluation-578-1688439614',578,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7232,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Jacob. Just a couple of areas to help you with future poems...\r\n\r\n1. Remember to underline the title of your poem and centre it on the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n2. In Stanza 5, add \'the\' between \'closed\' and \'door\'.\r\n3. In Stanza 8, change \'laid\' to \'lay\' (verb tense rule) then change the second line to \'For forty nights he did stay\' \r\n    (verb tense rule).\r\n4. Make sure that the poem is Biblically accurate. Though it rained for 40 days and nights, the Ark floated for\r\n     another 150 days until the floods receded and the Ark settled on Mt Ararat (so Noah was actually in the Ark for \r\n     40 + 150 = 190 days)....you\'d need to reword the second line of Stanza 8.\r\n5. In Stanza 9, the second line doesn\'t match the poem\'s meter and rhythm, so should be shortened to \'Brought a \r\n     leaf with a scent\'.\r\n6. In Stanza 10, shorten the second line to \'That\'s how much we\'re worth\' to match the meter/rhythm.\r\n\r\nTrust this helps and I look forward to seeing new poems from you in the coming Convention years...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:00:14','2023-07-04 13:00:15'),(2034,'judge-event-evaluation-1099-1688440351',1099,30,1,5,1,2023,295,'915',NULL,7282,769,7107,50,'Collection','24',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'A clear, well prepared and presented sermon!  But there was no identified life application or testimony and his conclusion can be improved. Persuasive facial expression skills can help lift up his performance. Thank you Fidel for your sermon item! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:12:31','2023-07-04 13:12:31'),(2035,'judge-event-evaluation-1377-1688440833',1377,13,1,5,1,2023,295,'915',NULL,7181,4208,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Your time was below the minimum of 4 minutes so this event will not be placed. You have a clear voice and diction but needs to be projected outwards towards the audience. You need to be more expressive and persuasive so that your message can be effectively absorbed and retained by the listeners. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:20:33','2023-07-04 13:20:33'),(2036,'judge-event-evaluation-1376-1688441471',1376,13,1,5,1,2023,295,'915',NULL,7185,4208,7107,50,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'A very good preaching item. Melli needs to improve in his expressive and persuasive skills. He had a great message which was well planned but can be delivered better.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:31:11','2023-07-04 13:31:11'),(2037,'judge-event-evaluation-65-1688442736',65,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7323,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Kayla, for your interesting poem. I\'ve added some points to assist you with future poetry writing.....\r\n\r\n1.  If a sentence flows into the next line, you don\'t have to add a comma unless it\'s another thought and requires a \r\n    pause + if there are two distinct phrases/parts of a sentence that you want to link together, use a semi-colon \r\n    eg. In Stanza 1, delete the comma after \'best\'.\r\n2. In Stanza 2, put a semi-colon after \'well\' and delete the commas after \'came\' and \'sold\' but add a dash after\r\n    \'sold\'.\r\n3. In Stanza 3, add semi-colons after \'slave\' and \'master\'.\r\n4. In Stanza 4, change \'to the jail\' to \'in\', then put a dash after \'in\'. Add a period after \'pale\'. Also delete the first \'that\'.\r\n5. In Stanza 5, add semi-colons after \'please\' and \'dreams\'.\r\n6. In Stanza 6, delete the comma after \'master\'. \r\n7. When trying to find rhyming words, don\'t rush and choose the first one you think of. If you google \'rhyming words\r\n     with \'him\', it will show a lot of options. That last line in Stanza 6 is called \'triteness\' in poetry......an option I came up\r\n     with was \'To interpret at Pharaoh\'s whim\', then you\'d delete the comma after \'him\' on Line 3.\r\n8. In Stanza 7, the meter/rhythm of the second line is awkward....an alternative could have been \'When translated, \r\n     Pharaoh did beam\'.\r\n9. In the last line of Stanza 7, add a dash between \'example\' and \'now\'.\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing your poetry writing develop in the coming Conventions....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 13:52:16','2023-07-04 13:52:16'),(2038,'judge-event-evaluation-62-1688444331',62,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7317,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your encouraging poem, Laura. I\'d like to make some suggestions to help you with your poetry.....\r\n\r\n1. Remember to make the poem\'s title stand out in Bold Font and underlined.\r\n2. Though self-control is a character trait, remember to point people to God in the poem as the source of \r\n    self-control, so that readers don\'t get the impression it\'s all about what we (as humans) have to do. We can \r\n    only walk in true self-control when we\'re drawing from the fruit of the Spirit of God.\r\n3. Be careful of the use of commas (for a pause between thoughts in a sentence), periods (after a complete \r\n    sentence and semi-colons (to link thoughts/phrases or simple sentences together for effect). I\'ve listed some\r\n    alternatives here for your consideration...\r\n4. In Stanza 1, put a semi-colon after \'day\' and a comma after \'morning\'.\r\n5. In Stanza 2, add semi-colons after \'morn\' and \'concentrate\'. Also in Stanza 2, change \'yawned\'\' to \'did yawn\' for \r\n    rhyming purposes.\r\n6. In Stanza 3, add a semi-colon after \'me\' and delete the comma after \'feelings\'.\r\n7. In Stanza 4, add a period after \'angry\', a comma after \'happy\' and the ending quotation marks after \'day?\'.\r\n8. In Stanza 5, add a period after \'smile\' and a comma after \'wrong\'.\r\n9. In Stanza 6, change \'And\' to \'So\', then write \'Tomorrow\' and change \'I will\' to \'I\'ll\' on the last line of that Stanza.\r\n10. In Stanza 7, add a lower-case \'s\' to \'She\' in the first line, followed by a period after \'said\'., then a comma after \r\n     \'toy\'.\r\n11. In Stanza 8, add a comma after \'about\', then in the last line, add a dash instead of a comma between \r\n    \'Self-control\' and \'a\'.\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing more of your poetry talents in the coming years....God Bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 14:18:51','2023-07-04 14:18:51'),(2040,'judge-event-evaluation-475-1688451308',475,3,1,5,1,2023,277,'860','1',0,1678,6991,33,NULL,'26,23',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely hymn to sing and an enthusiastic presentation.  Remember to sing each word clearly.  The last verse is talking about Heaven - \"When we\'ve been there\", not \"When we\'ve been here ten thousand years.\"   Your music should be written with the melody and any harmonies that are sung along with the words.  Also, according to the guidelines, the performance should be predominately in 4 part harmony, but I could only hear some harmony in the last verse.  Overall, a good effort and I hope you keep singing for the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 16:15:08','2023-07-04 16:15:09'),(2041,'judge-event-evaluation-1501-1688452916',1501,21,1,5,1,2023,264,'810','1',0,5805,6991,33,'Collection','21,26',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Beautifully sung with lovely harmony.  Your voices blend well together.  Sadly, I had to mark you down on two sections: \'Performed as arranged\' and \'Correct Music and paperwork supplied\'.  You need to send in a copy of the music for the actual melody and harmony that is being sung not just the words.  I hope you continue to use your lovely voices to sing praise to the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 16:41:56','2023-07-04 16:41:56'),(2042,'judge-event-evaluation-478-1688453739',478,3,1,5,1,2023,264,'810','1',0,1678,6991,33,'Collection','26,23',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort, students!  Please remember to read the guidelines so that you send in the correct paperwork. The music needs to be written out with the melody and harmony not just the words. Remember to smile and be happy because you are singing about how great God is!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 16:55:39','2023-07-04 16:55:39'),(2043,'judge-event-evaluation-63-1688462431',63,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7328,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Luke. Just some suggestions for your next poems......\r\n\r\n1.  Remember to underline the title of the poem, then centre the poem on the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n2. Be careful when choosing a poem about character traits that you clarify that this is not something we can do in \r\n     our own strength and effort, but true character traits only come from relationship with God and are an outflow\r\n     of the fruit of the Spirit of God in our lives (ie. through the poem, we point the readers to God as the true source \r\n     of kindness).\r\n3. In choosing rhyming words for the song, don\'t rush in and think of the first word that comes to mind as it may \r\n     lessen the impact of the poem to the reader. Take the time to Google eg. \'Rhyming words for kind\' and ask God \r\n     for His ideas how to create different stanzas for the poem.\r\n4. There are only two punctuation changes to note.....delete the comma after \'So\' in Line 4 + add a semi-colon \r\n     instead of a comma after \'others\' in Line 5.\r\n\r\nI believe God will give you more ideas for poem topics and to enable you to plan out longer and more complex poems for the future....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 19:20:31','2023-07-04 19:20:31'),(2045,'judge-event-evaluation-678-1688464011',678,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7092,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your heart-felt poem, Michelle. I\'d like to make some suggestions to help you with future poems.....\r\n\r\n1. Remember to make the poem\'s title in Bold Font and underlined so that it\'s easy to identify, then centre the poem \r\n    on the page so that it looks better aesthetically.\r\n2. You maintained an AABB poetry pattern in Stanzas 1, 2, 3, 5 and 6, but Stanza 4 has the ABAB pattern, which \r\n    makes the poem awkward to read.\r\n3. A poem does not need to have punctuation, however if you choose to put a period at the end of a Stanza, then \r\n    you need to make sure you have correct punctuation, if needed, throughout the Stanza, as follows....\r\n4. In Stanza 1, delete \'s\' in \'helps\', add a period after \'stronger\' and in Line 4, change \'for\' to \'with\'.\r\n5. In Stanza 2, add a period after \'sins\' and delete the comma after \'journey\'.\r\n6. In Stanza 3, delete the comma after \'heart\', capitalize \'h\' in \'he\', add a semi-colon after \'guide\', delete the comma \r\n    after \'doubts\', add a period after \'aside\' and add a semi-colon after \'trouble\'.\r\n7. In Stanza 4, add a period after \'you\'.\r\n8. In Stanza 5, add a period after \'mind\'.\r\n9. In Stanza 6, put a dash between \'soul\' and \'sincere\' (delete the comma there), add a semi-colon after \'pure\', add \r\n    a period after \'cure\', delete \'will\' (it is not Biblically accurate that we will not have pain in our Christian walk) and \r\n    add a comma after \'gone\'.\r\n\r\nI look forward to reading more poems written by you in future Conventions...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 19:46:51','2023-07-04 19:46:51'),(2050,'judge-event-evaluation-912-1688465505',912,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7261,5806,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kaloafu,\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Adding facial expressions can help enhance the presentation\r\n* Having a louder voice projection will help you come across more clearly\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you\r\nGod Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 20:11:45','2023-07-04 20:11:45'),(2051,'judge-event-evaluation-907-1688465524',907,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7260,5806,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Jimaima,\r\nJust a tip\r\n* Adding facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 20:12:04','2023-07-04 20:12:04'),(2061,'judge-event-evaluation-1269-1688469479',1269,28,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','1',0,5806,6991,33,'Collection','21,25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed listening to your duet, girls, and also seeing your lovely smiling faces as you sang of the goodness of God.  This really added to your performance.  As you progressed through the song, your singing and intonation improved and your voices blended better together .  A great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 21:17:59','2023-07-04 21:18:00'),(2062,'judge-event-evaluation-1158-1688470271',1158,46,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','1',0,4504,6991,33,'Collection','25,22',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort, girls.  Great to see your smiles.  Try not to breath in the middle of a word.  A few notes were not sung the same as the written music so if you want to sing it slightly different remember to alter it on the music.  Keep praising the Lord.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 21:31:11','2023-07-04 21:31:12'),(2064,'judge-event-evaluation-506-1688471511',506,3,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','1',0,1678,6991,33,'Collection','21,25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Looks like you enjoyed singing this song together, girls.  Perhaps next time one of you could sing an alto part as the guidelines require that each singer sings a separate part in harmony.  I hope you keep using your lovely voices to praise the Lord\'s wonderful name .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 21:51:51','2023-07-04 21:51:51'),(2070,'judge-event-evaluation-486-1688472514',486,3,1,5,1,2023,261,'807','2',0,1678,6991,33,'Collection','25,23',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely sweet singing, girls.  The guidelines do require a four-part harmony since there are four of you so maybe you could try some simple parts next time to improve your score.  A good effort for a young group.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 22:08:34','2023-07-04 22:08:34'),(2071,'judge-event-evaluation-1043-1688475819',1043,28,1,5,1,2023,177,'455',NULL,7272,5806,7480,2,'Open','13',100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Tamalesi! Fantastic macro shot for using a phone camera.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. Any camera lens has what is called a minimum focal distance. If you find a SLR you can often see this written somewhere on the lens like this: 0.3m-infinity. In the example, any subject within 30cm of the lens will never be in focus. This is important when trying for macro shots to help get your shots. Usually isn\'t too hard to research that information. Apparently your phone can go as close as 2cm for macro shots but you have to be using the right camera. 2. Your container worked well but it created some streaks in your background. Experiment with different ways to set up your shots. 3. Let us know about any enhancements you used. If you chose not to do any, tell us that too. 4. Your report was well written with some good details. Be sure to read through the judges forms for any event you enter. That will help you to know what information the judges are looking to see. 5. Clouds and skies can be a pain for overexposure. Look into some techniques to help avoid this to help improve your work.\r\nLooking forward to seeing your next entry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-04 23:03:39','2023-07-04 23:03:39'),(2076,'judge-event-evaluation-579-1688510102',579,20,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7169,394,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Oliver. I have added some points to assist you with future poems.....\r\n\r\n1.  Your personal details don\'t need to be double-spaced and can be at the end of the poem.\r\n2. Remember to underline the title of the poem, then centre the poem on the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n3. This poem was very close to being disqualified, as your first and second lines are not Biblically accurate. God \r\n     DOES NOT follow...He leads and we follow.\r\n4. Poems don\'t have to have punctuation, but if you choose to put a period at the end of a sentence in the poem, \r\n     then you have to make sure that correct punctuation is on the other lines that need it. I have listed below the \r\n     suggested corrections.....\r\n5. On Line 1, add a comma after \'goes\'.\r\n6. On Line 3, capitalize \'h\' in \'he\' as all references to God need a capital letter.\r\n7. On Line 4, add a comma after \'him\' and capitalize the \'h\' in \'him\'.\r\n8. On Line 7, add a semi-colon after \'Word\'.\r\n9. On Line 9, add a comma after \'daily\'.\r\n10. When finding words that rhyme, it\'s good to Google \'rhyming words with ______\' to see the many options, \r\n      rather than choose the first word that comes to mind. On Line 10, \'greatly\' is an awkward choice...it can be \r\n      replaced with \'wholly\'. \r\n11. On Line 11, add a semi-colon after \'others\'.\r\n12. On Line 16, \'church\' doesn\'t rhyme well with \'charge\' on the previous line. In Googling rhyming words with \r\n     \'charge\', I found \'enlarge\' so a suggested new Line 16 could be \'God\'s Kingdom will enlarge\'.\r\n13. On Line 17, add a semi-colon after \'call\'.\r\n14. In giving the poem a more positive ending, an alternate Line 18 could be \'He obeys God all in all\'.\r\n\r\nTrust this helps and I\'ll look forward to seeing your poetry again next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 08:35:02','2023-07-05 08:35:02'),(2077,'judge-event-evaluation-496-1688512142',496,15,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7043,4679,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Pretty for your poem. The guidelines required the poem to be typed in Size 10 to 12 font, double-spaced on plain white paper (you have typed the poem in a box with a black background and a much-larger font), so unfortunately, the guidelines have been breeched. In addition, there is not title for the poem.\r\nTo help you with your future poetry writing, I have listed some changes/corrections to your poem.....\r\n\r\n1.  In Stanza 1, add a semi-colon after \'season\', capitalize the \'o\' in \'others\', add a period after \'reason\', capitalize the \r\n    \'n\' in \'no-one\', add an \'s\' to \'stay\', change the comma after \'Jesus\' to a semi-colon, capitalize the \'h\' in \'he\', delete \r\n    the final \'s\' in \'mistakes\' (verb agreement) and \'weaknesss\' (spelling error).\r\n2. In Stanza 2, add a semi-colon after \'exist\', change the comma after \'assist;\' to a period, delete the comma after \r\n    \'aware\', capitalize the \'h\' in \'him\' in the last line (refers to God so must be capitalized) and add a comma after \r\n    \'him\'.\r\n\r\nI\'ll look forward to seeing your poetry writing skills develop for next year\'s Convention....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 09:09:02','2023-07-05 09:53:07'),(2079,'judge-event-evaluation-825-1688514521',825,25,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7345,5804,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your very neatly presented poem, Saumeli. Just a reminder to choose the correct punctuation at the end of lines + a line does not need a punctuation at the end of it if it has a continuation of the sentence on the next line and not requiring a comma. Remember that a period ends a complete sentence, a comma indicates a pause or a new thought in a sentence and a semi-colon is used to separate two phrases or two separate thoughts for effect. I have listed below suggested changes to your poem...\r\n\r\n1. In Stanza 1, delete the comma after \'man\', change the semi-colon after \'true\' to a comma, change the comma\r\n    after \'disobedient\' to a semi-colon.\r\n2. In Stanza 2, delete the comma after \'Word\', change \'fleed\' to \'fled\', delete the semi-colon after \'heed\'.\r\n3. In Stanza 3, delete the comma after \'fierce\', change the colon after \'blame\' to a semi-colon, delete \'And\' \r\n    (improves the meter/rhythm to that last line).\r\n4. In Stanza 4, delete \'And\' on the third line (improves meter/rhythm), change the semi-colon after \'waves\' to a \r\n    comma, delete \'came + and\' in the last line (unnecessary extra wording).\r\n5. In Stanza 5, delete the comma after \'lay\', delete \'And\' and \'him\' in the last line (improves meter/rhythm).\r\n6. In Stanza 6, delete \'out\', change \'unto\' to \'onto\', change \'And\' to \'Then\'.\r\n\r\nYou have a talent for poetry writing, Saumeli and I\'ll look forward to seeing more of your writing next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 09:48:41','2023-07-05 09:48:41'),(2080,'judge-event-evaluation-848-1688516248',848,25,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7348,5804,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Terumah. I have made some suggestions to help you with your future poetry writing......\r\n\r\n1. Always make the title of the poem in Bold font and underlined, then leave a space to the poem\'s first line, so that\r\n    the title stands out. Remember that the guidelines say that the font should be plain, so the title should be the \r\n    same font as the remainder of your poem and not a fancy font.\r\n2. When you\'re looking for describing words, try to Google \'Synonyms for \'pretty\' and that will give you other options\r\n    or you could think of alternate words for \'pretty\', as you\'ve used \'pretty\' five times which doesn\'t enhance her \r\n    poem.\r\n3. In Line 2, add a comma after \'pretty\'.\r\n4. In Line 3, change \'pretty\' to \'rather\'.\r\n5. In Line 6, change the period to a comma.\r\n6. In Line 7, delete the commas after \'So\' and after \'and\'.\r\n7. In Line 10, change \'pretty\' to \'very\' and add a comma after \'shocked\'.\r\n8. In Line 11, delete the comma after \'So\'.\r\n9. In Line 15, add a comma after \'Reluctantly\'.\r\n10. In Line 17, change \'pretty\' to \'rescued\' and add a comma after \'rescued\'.\r\n11. In Line 18, delete \'So\' and capitalize the \'o\' in \'one\'.\r\n12. In Line 19, add a comma between \'pretty\' and \'\'small\'.\r\n\r\nKeep writing and expanding your poetry skills for future Conventions, Terumah....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 10:17:28','2023-07-05 10:17:28'),(2082,'judge-event-evaluation-64-1688518244',64,19,1,5,1,2023,6,'012',NULL,7320,4451,7239,6,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Tiana. I have made some suggestions to help you with future poetry writing....\r\n\r\n1. For the title of the poem, always underline it and it can be a slightly bigger font to make to easy to see, then \r\n    centre your poem on the page for aesthetic purposes.\r\n2. In Stanza 1, change the comma after \'man\' to a semi-colon to connect Line 2 to Line 1, add the word \'a\' between \r\n    \'had\' and \'very\' and delete the comma after \'people\'.\r\n3. In Stanza 2, change the commas after \'land\' and \'food\' to semi-colons and delete the comma after \'borrowed\'.\r\n4. In Stanza 3, add a dash between \'poorer\' and \'rich\', change the comma after \'richer\' to a semi-colon, put \r\n    quotation marks around \'God\'s angry\' and change the comma after \'city\' to a period.\r\n5. In Stanza 4, put a comma after \'said\' and put quotation marks around \'Your city will be destroyed\', change the \r\n    commas after \'him\' and \'grim\' to semi-colons.\r\n6. In Stanza 5, delete the comma after \'shepherd\'. The last two lines of the poem are quite awkward and trite \r\n    (words chosen that rhyme but which don\'t really make sense in the poem). Take the time to Google when \r\n     looking for rhyming words rather than using the first words you think of that rhyme (Googling has many \r\n     interesting words that can be used). An alternate last two lines could be:   His heart was in a very safe place\r\n                                                                                                                                               He\'d know God\'s majesty and grace\r\n\r\nI\'ll look forward to seeing more of your poetry efforts next year, Tiana...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 10:50:44','2023-07-05 10:50:44'),(2089,'judge-event-evaluation-1429-1688529982',1429,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7196,4208,7483,50,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,-1.00,'Wonderful preaching, Samara! I really enjoyed it!\r\n\r\nJust something to note:\r\nIt\'s important to state your important points while preaching so that the listeners can track along with you through the message. They won\'t remember everything you preached but if you\'ve identified key points, they\'ll remember those for a long time. This will also keep you on track in your message, rather than selecting points randomly (and then unfortunately overlapping from one point to another) for the sake of delivery of the message.\r\n\r\nSpend time listening to the different styles of preaching of great men and women of God to help you in developing your gift for preaching.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 14:06:22','2023-07-05 14:06:22'),(2090,'judge-event-evaluation-1486-1688529997',1486,21,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7130,5805,7483,50,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Donna, for the wonderful message. These are some pointers that will assist you to grow and develop in your preaching presentations:\r\n\r\n1. Pace yourself well which will avoid you almost rushing to the end (having a watch on the pulpit will help you to \r\n     time yourself).\r\n2. Adjust your vocalizations and emotion on the key points, so the listener can hear the emphasis on the important \r\n    points you want them to take away from your preaching.\r\n3. Personal experiences/testimonies are always a great tool in a message , especially in the summary and \r\n    challenge as the Holy Spirit can then draw the listener\'s heart to respond to the message and allow God to help\r\n    them in that area of their life that the message is covering.\r\n4. Practice always brings out the best, so keep practicing and you\'ll only get better each time.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 14:06:37','2023-07-05 14:06:37'),(2091,'judge-event-evaluation-1216-1688530009',1216,10,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7281,1467,7483,50,'Open','25',100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Good try, Kerenhapukh. These are some of the pointers that will assist you for your preaching presentations:\r\n\r\n1. Always check the Convention preaching guidelines before you submit your entry to make sure you\'ve covered all \r\n   areas because if some are missed, many valuable points will be lost in your overall points total.\r\n2. Make sure to have other supportive scriptures (not just your first scripture).\r\n3. Ask someone to follow your outline as you practice your message and they can then confirm if you\'re following \r\n    through in order of your outline. (This will avoid getting mixed up in the order of your points and the potential of \r\n    missing whole sections of your outline as what happened in your preaching this time).\r\n4. Don\'t be anxious about the time...the more your practice, the more relaxed you\'ll be in your presentation.\r\n5. Include personal testimonies in your message so the listener can relate to the message and this allows the Holy \r\n    Spirit to touch the listener\'s heart when they\'re hearing the message.\r\n6. Just as a pastor challenges the church with his message so the church members can respond, include a \r\n     challenge in your message so that the listener can respond.\r\n7. Before you preach, always pray over the message to allow God\'s Spirit to minister through you.\r\n\r\nGod Bless and keep refining your preaching skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 14:06:49','2023-07-05 14:06:49'),(2092,'judge-event-evaluation-1211-1688530020',1211,10,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,6988,1467,7483,50,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'This was a great message, Lael, and very inspiring. Just some notes to consider for upcoming preaching (if you watch your submitted video again, you\'ll see what I\'m talking about in the following pointers)...\r\n\r\n1. Follow through your notes as per your outline. This will avoid mixing up your message and missing some \r\n     important points from your outline.\r\n2. Where there are texts mentioned in your message, they must be listed in the right section on your outline.\r\n3. Always pray over your message to allow God to move through your message as you preach.\r\n4. Put strong emphasis on the key thoughts which you want the listener to remember from the message.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 14:07:00','2023-07-05 14:07:00'),(2093,'judge-event-evaluation-1217-1688530034',1217,10,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7279,1467,7483,50,'Open','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Praise God, Viola! \r\n\r\nYour message was very clear with good hand gestures. It was wonderful to hear good and strong emphasis on key thoughts in order to convey the message to the hearers.\r\nJust a reminder to include an introduction in your written message outline. You can also improve your diction by typing in words on the internet and listening to their correct pronunciation.\r\nPraying over the message is also very important to the one who is preaching, so set aside time for that, as it\'s God\'s message coming through you for His glory.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 14:07:14','2023-07-05 14:07:14'),(2095,'judge-event-evaluation-1237-1688534075',1237,28,1,5,1,2023,318,'963',NULL,7258,5806,6,48,'Open','24',100,97.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Jedaiah. Great expression and story to go with. Keep up the great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 15:14:35','2023-07-05 15:14:35'),(2097,'judge-event-evaluation-1245-1688537161',1245,11,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7026,613,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Great job. You treated it like it was a face to face presentation and hit most if not all of the briefs. Keep going, you did really well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 16:06:01','2023-07-05 16:06:01'),(2099,'judge-event-evaluation-1537-1688538225',1537,17,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7385,4200,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Confidence in spades. Good use of gestures, good rapport and eye contact. You look like a natural. Good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 16:23:45','2023-07-05 16:23:45'),(2100,'judge-event-evaluation-1239-1688538285',1239,28,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7249,5806,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort. Hopefully with time you gain more confidence. But you\'re on your way. Keep practicing and challenging yourself.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 16:24:45','2023-07-05 16:24:45'),(2102,'judge-event-evaluation-1038-1688539551',1038,7,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7164,6785,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,44.00,-10,-2.00,'Good effort. Need to improve on putting more feeling into your reading. More inflections in reading, pauses, expressions, gestures, and eye contact.\r\nKeep trying.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 16:45:51','2023-07-05 16:45:51'),(2103,'judge-event-evaluation-750-1688539609',750,7,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7164,6785,7475,44,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'double entry',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 16:46:49','2023-07-05 16:46:49'),(2104,'judge-event-evaluation-1517-1688540050',1517,17,1,5,1,2023,288,'908',NULL,7388,4200,7475,44,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Really impressive entry. Great confidence, use of gestures and connecting with audience. Diction and pauses, for dramatic effect were well utilised. Lost marks only for no script provided and your approach and departure. Otherwise, this is your field.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 16:54:10','2023-07-05 16:54:10'),(2106,'judge-event-evaluation-1464-1688541764',1464,25,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7357,5804,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Katarina,\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using small steps, hand movements, and facial expressions can help\r\nto enhance the presentation\r\n* Try not to speed through the presentation\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll begin to see all the amazing things \r\nGod will do through you\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 17:22:44','2023-07-05 17:22:44'),(2108,'judge-event-evaluation-378-1688542176',378,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7317,4451,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Laura,\r\nJust a tip\r\n* Using small steps, added facial expressions, and a variety of hand movements\r\ncan help to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 17:29:36','2023-07-05 17:29:36'),(2109,'judge-event-evaluation-1032-1688542486',1032,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7175,4208,7240,45,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Maraia,\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using added facial expressions can help enhance the presentation\r\n* Try not to speed through the presentation (the mini. time for poetry rec. is 1 min)\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 17:34:46','2023-07-05 17:34:46'),(2112,'judge-event-evaluation-951-1688543068',951,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7149,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Mele\r\nJust a tip\r\n* Using small steps, hand movements and added facial expressions\r\ncan help to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 17:44:28','2023-07-05 17:44:28'),(2115,'judge-event-evaluation-1203-1688543405',1203,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7155,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Mihaela\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using small steps, more precise hand movements,\r\nand added facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\n* Remember the presentation needs to be at least 1 min.\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things God will begin\r\nto do through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 17:50:05','2023-07-05 17:50:05'),(2116,'judge-event-evaluation-1224-1688543831',1224,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7271,5806,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Ruci\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 17:57:11','2023-07-05 17:57:11'),(2117,'judge-event-evaluation-644-1688544033',644,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6970,1678,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Praise! What a stunning photo. You’ve done a wonderful job here! I also love the idea you have behind the photo as well as the Scripture verse you’ve used as reference (Matthew 6:28). It’s a great reminder of God’s love and provision for us.\r\n\r\nThe natural lighting in this photo is really incredible! The way it shines directly on the flower is just so beautiful. You’ve made great use of the sunlight here. The colours in this photo is also very captivating! The composition, exposure and focus are all very agreeable and work well together.\r\n\r\nOverall, you’ve done a great job! Well done, Praise. Thank you for this beautiful artwork! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:00:33','2023-07-05 18:00:33'),(2118,'judge-event-evaluation-764-1688544050',764,20,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7102,394,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Andrew! It’s an interesting subject you’ve chosen for your entry. The idea you have conceptualised behind it is also very admirable — good job!\r\n\r\nThe colour, lighting and exposure of this photo are all very agreeable. The colour especially matches the fog in the background and the misty silhouettes of the mountains. It’s beautiful! However, with the taller pile of rocks as your subject, it would have helped to have more focus on it and less focus on the other rocks surrounding it. Ideally, you want your subject to stand out from everything else. With lack of focus, it becomes harder to distinguish what the subject of the photo truly is.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a stunning photo. Well done, Andrew! With more practice, you are sure to become a great photographer. Thank you for this beautiful piece! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:00:50','2023-07-05 18:00:50'),(2119,'judge-event-evaluation-990-1688544071',990,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7129,5805,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Christian! What a pretty picture of the sky. The idea behind this piece is also inspiring. What a great reminder to pause, reflect and thank God for the beauty of Creation that surrounds us!\r\n\r\nThe colour is what stands out the most in this picture. It’s truly captivating! The colour is evidently the product of natural light, and so I commend on you on both the colour and lighting. You did very well in these areas. However, there seems to be a lack of subject. It looks as though the trees are the primary subject, but without proper composition it doesn’t make it clear enough. Ideally, you want to point viewers to a particular subject rather than make them search for it.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a beautiful picture. Good job, Christian! You have a great eye, and with more time and practice you are sure to become a great photographer. Thank you for this piece. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:01:11','2023-07-05 18:01:11'),(2120,'judge-event-evaluation-985-1688544098',985,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7130,5805,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Donna! This is a beautiful close-up photo of a hibiscus flower. A good job for your first photography entry!\r\n\r\nThis photo is definitely eye-catching! The bright colour immediately pulls in the attention of the viewer, and the focus maintains the attention. However, the composition of this photo could have been improved. For instance, the bright natural light in the background combined with the light from the camera flash on the flower itself makes the photo seem busy and a little distracting. To help with this, you could have taken a step back to balance the photo out. More effort in composition would have made a big difference.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a wonderful photo! Well done, Donna. You clearly have a lot of potential to excel in photography. Thank you for this piece of art! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:01:38','2023-07-05 18:01:38'),(2121,'judge-event-evaluation-1028-1688544120',1028,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7254,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Edward! This is a wonderful photo you have chosen. It has a very nostalgic feel to it, which incidentally coincides with the concept you had behind it. Great job!\r\n\r\nWhat instantly drew me to this piece is the lighting. It’s very warm and delicate, which gives the photo an almost dreamlike quality — thus giving it the nostalgic feel I mentioned earlier. However, it might have worked better to have shot the photo from an angle where the flowers which the sunlight was shining directly on was the primary subject. \r\n\r\nMore on that point, there is more that could have been done in the area of composition. Perhaps taking a step back to show the bunch of flowers as a singular subject or focussing on an individual flower out of the whole bunch would have been better. This is so that the viewers could have a primary subject to focus on.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a stunning photo. Well done, Edward! Without having the same experience you’ve had with your childhood home, you’ve somehow managed to place me right there in a place of nostalgia with you. That truly is impressive. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:02:00','2023-07-05 18:02:00'),(2122,'judge-event-evaluation-699-1688544168',699,17,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7410,4200,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Faithania! This is an incredible photo. What an excellent job!\r\n\r\nEverything about this photo is just fantastic! The lighting, exposure and composition — you’ve truly done a remarkable job here. However, the quality of the photo itself does seem quite pixelated. The focus is impeccable, but the quality does become a bit of a distraction. Perhaps this is the result of zooming in with your camera, but nonetheless the photo is truly a work of art. You’ve done a beautiful job here. Keep it up!\r\n\r\nOn another note, I’d encourage you to pay attention to the documentation that you are to submit with your entries. This is very important. Once again, thank you for this piece of art! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:02:48','2023-07-05 18:02:48'),(2123,'judge-event-evaluation-1511-1688544185',1511,17,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7393,4200,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Handsam! What an adorable photo. The concept you have behind the photo matches it perfectly. Great job!\r\n\r\nThe lighting, colour and exposure are all very agreeable. The focus is also very well done. The composition is good; however, having your subject at the very centre of the photo would have made a big difference — eliminating, or rather, minimising the bigger space on the right side of the photo would have highlighted the subject even more. Nonetheless, you’ve done an excellent job!!! This is an amazing photo.\r\n\r\nOn another note, I encourage you to pay attention the documentation you are to send in with your entry. It is very important. Thank you again for this beautiful piece of art. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:03:05','2023-07-05 18:03:05'),(2124,'judge-event-evaluation-1029-1688544203',1029,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7258,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Jedaiah! What an impressive shot. The process behind this photo definitely sounds like a lot of work — you’ve done a great job in executing your vision.\r\n\r\nThe lighting in this photo makes a really big impact. The bright artificial light shining on the cat’s face contrasting with the dark night in the background is what makes this photo stand out. The exposure, colour and focus are all very agreeable. As for the composition, you’ve done a brilliant job. The angle from which this photo is taken was an interesting choice. It almost feels like we’re following this furry, little creature on an adventure. \r\n\r\nOverall, you did a great job. Well done, Jedaiah! Keep it up. Thank you for this intriguing piece of art. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:03:23','2023-07-05 18:03:23'),(2125,'judge-event-evaluation-561-1688544220',561,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6963,1678,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Johns! What a beautiful subject you’ve chosen for your photo. It really puts the concept you’ve given this photo into perspective — reflecting on the wonderful and unique Creation of God.\r\n\r\nThe colour(s) in this photo are impeccable! The contrast between the distinct colours of the flower and the green leaves work well together. The natural light you’ve utilised here further enhances the beauty of this photo. The composition of this photo is agreeable; however, it would have been nice to see the subject from a different angle to see it from a more unique perspective. The focus could have also been improved by ensuring that it was solely on the flower and not the leaves around it (the leaves at the top). \r\n\r\nOverall, this is a very pretty picture. Well done, Johns! Thank you for this beautiful piece of art. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:03:40','2023-07-05 18:03:40'),(2126,'judge-event-evaluation-1039-1688544236',1039,20,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7105,394,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Kaitlyn! Such an eye-catching piece. You’ve done a good job!\r\n\r\nThe colour in this photo is just so captivating. The contrast in colour between the jellyfish and the blue background blend very beautifully! The lighting is also very clever. It shines directly on the jellyfish, further emphasising it as the primary subject. However, there is room for improvement in the area of composition. Perhaps if you had taken the shot from a slightly different angle so as to not get the three other jellyfishes in the back or at least capture them in a less awkward state, it would have worked better. The exposure and focus are good for the most part, but you can still see the subject’s movement, although it isn’t too noticeable.\r\n\r\nOverall this is a lovely photo, Kaitlyn. Well done! Thank you for this piece of art. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:03:56','2023-07-05 18:03:56'),(2127,'judge-event-evaluation-981-1688544253',981,10,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7281,1467,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Kerenhapukh! What a stunning photo. You’ve done a great job with this shot. The idea behind this photo and how you came to select which flower to use as your subject is also really wonderful.\r\n\r\nYou’ve done a great job with the focus. Right away, your viewers would know what your primary subject is. The natural lighting you’ve utilised for this shot offers a lovely touch to the photo. The exposure and composition are also very agreeable. I could be wrong, but it seems there was some use of enhancements to help blur the background and further emphasise the subject, which is good and actually serves its purpose well, but I’d encourage you to use these enhancements sparingly so as to not take away too much from the rest of the photo.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is an excellent photo. Well done, Kerenhapukh! You’ve definitely got an artistic eye. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:04:13','2023-07-05 18:04:13'),(2128,'judge-event-evaluation-281-1688544269',281,10,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6988,1467,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Lael! What an exquisite shot. You’ve done an incredible job with this photo! The idea behind you have behind it also matches it perfectly.\r\n\r\nThe colour is this photo is really captivating! The contrast between the lighter and darker shades of green, as well as the colour of the mountain and sky, all blend beautifully with one another. The natural light coming in from the right side of the photo is a lovely touch. The focus on the scenery isn’t as sharp as it could be; however, it does its job sufficiently. \r\n\r\nThis is a magnificent photo. Excellent job, Lael! You’ve done a beautiful job. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:04:29','2023-07-05 18:04:29'),(2129,'judge-event-evaluation-563-1688544286',563,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6977,1678,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Luis! This is a stunning shot. You’ve done an excellent job with this capture.\r\n\r\nThe colour in this photo is impressive. There’s a really nice contrast between the pink colour of the flowers and the green colour of the leaves surrounding the subject. The amount of natural light works so beautifully with the rest of the photo. The composition is most ideal. This is really such a dreamy photo! I absolutely love it.\r\n\r\nWell done, Luis! Once again, thank you for this beautiful piece of art. Keep up the great work! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:04:46','2023-07-05 18:04:46'),(2130,'judge-event-evaluation-995-1688544305',995,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7115,5805,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Lusiana! What an awesome subject you’ve chosen for this shot. Good job!\r\n\r\nThis photo has a nice setting and a really cool subject; however, there is room for improvement. The main thing that could have elevated this photo is composition. Taking this shot from a different angle that focuses solely on the subject would have made a really big difference. Ideally, you want your subject to be the main event. With better composition, this photo would really stand out.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is good effort from you, Lusiana. Well done. With more time and practice, you will only get better. Once again thank you for this piece of art! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:05:05','2023-07-05 18:05:05'),(2131,'judge-event-evaluation-997-1688544327',997,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7157,5805,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Merewai! This is a lovely photo. You’ve done a great job with this shot.\r\n\r\nThe colours in this photo are beautiful — The colours of the flower and the leaves have a great contrast and blend really well. The focus on the flower, the composition of the shot, the exposure and the natural lighting are all agreeable as well. However, the use of enhancements — the blurring — is a little distracting. It sort of takes away from the subject and makes the photo feel disorienting. I’d encourage you to use enhancements sparingly when editing your photo. The blurring was a clever choice; however, it would have been better to keep it at the minimum.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a great shot. Well done, Merewai! Thank you again for this piece of art. Keep up the good work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:05:27','2023-07-05 18:05:27'),(2132,'judge-event-evaluation-575-1688544347',575,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6967,1678,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Nanako! This is an interesting shot you’ve that entered for this event.\r\n\r\nThe colours in this photo are lovely. The green hues are so calming and pleasant to look at. You’ve captured the colours beautifully with the use of natural light. However, there is room for improvement. It would have helped to have a primary subject to focus on and be the centre of the shot. As for exposure, composition and focus you’ve done fairly well. Just having a primary subject to draw viewers in would make all the difference.\r\n\r\nGood effort from you, Nanako. Well done! Thank you for this lovely piece. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:05:47','2023-07-05 18:05:47'),(2133,'judge-event-evaluation-1122-1688544366',1122,46,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7447,4504,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Nathan! What an adorable subject you’ve chosen for your entry. Too cute!\r\n\r\nThe shot itself is lovely; however, there are a number of things that could have been done to elevate it. For instance, the focus is zoned in on the ground than it is on the actual subject. This places the emphasis on the wrong place so instead of being drawn in by the puppy, viewers are only able to see the ground clearly. The composition of the shot may also have benefitted from a different angle, offering a more unique perspective.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a good effort. Well done, Nathan! With more time and practice, you are sure to improve. Thank you for this adorable shot. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:06:06','2023-07-05 18:06:06'),(2134,'judge-event-evaluation-617-1688544400',617,8,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7079,6328,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Nathanael! I am blown away — this is a stunning piece of art. You’ve done an outstanding job. Well done!!!\r\n\r\nThe lighting, composition, exposure and focus all blend perfectly together. The best part of this shot to me is really the green hues. You’ve done a phenomenal job with your camera settings and enhancements. This is the kind of picture you’d want to hang on your wall and look at everyday. It’s just so beautiful.\r\n\r\nYou’ve done a brilliant job here, Nathanael! Truly excellent work. Thank you for this piece of art! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:06:40','2023-07-05 18:06:40'),(2135,'judge-event-evaluation-993-1688544420',993,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7134,5805,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Nunia! What a brilliant choice of subject. There’s something inspiring about how you decided to use this as the main focus of your piece. Great job!\r\n\r\nThe contrasts between the colours in this photo work fairly well together. The composition, use of lighting and exposure are also good; however, there is room for improvement, particularly in the area of composition. Ideally, you want to give your viewers a primary subject to focus on. With a busy setting like this, it makes it a bit difficult to distinguish what the subject is.\r\n\r\nOverall, you’ve done a wonderful job. Well done, Nunia! You have a creative mind. With more time and practice, you are sure to improve. Thank you for this shot. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:07:00','2023-07-05 18:07:00'),(2136,'judge-event-evaluation-1050-1688545072',1050,13,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7177,4208,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Ruth\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using small steps, precise hand movements & gestures, \r\nand added facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\n* Try maintain a level of eye contact with the audience (in this case the camera)\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll begin to see all the amazing things that God will do\r\nthrough you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:17:52','2023-07-05 18:17:52'),(2137,'judge-event-evaluation-983-1688545241',983,21,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7124,5805,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Ruth! This is a lovely shot. You’ve done a great job here.\r\n\r\nThe focus on your subject is incredible. It really captures your subject well. The colours are very eye-catching! The natural sunlight is also gives a great touch. The quality of the photo isn’t as sharp as it could, but works fairly well for the most part.\r\n\r\nOverall, this is a lovely shot. Well done, Ruth! Thank you for this beautiful piece. Keep up the good work! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:20:41','2023-07-05 18:20:41'),(2138,'judge-event-evaluation-952-1688545387',952,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7147,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Sally\r\nYou have a wonderful enunciation \r\nJust a tip\r\n* Using small steps, more precise hand movements & gestures, \r\nand added facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through\r\nyou.\r\nGod bless\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:23:07','2023-07-05 18:23:07'),(2139,'judge-event-evaluation-923-1688545879',923,28,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7268,5806,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Salote\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using added facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\n* Try not to speed through the presentation, try to give it room to breathe\r\n* Practice with recordings to raise the vocal projection\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things that God will do through you\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:31:19','2023-07-05 18:31:19'),(2140,'judge-event-evaluation-1030-1688545915',1030,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7276,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Salome! This is a lovely shot. You’ve done a great job here.\r\nThe composition of this photo is awesome! You’ve focused on the bunch of flowers without going in too close or moving too far back. The colours, with their contrasts, blend really well together. The lighting is great, and the exposure and focus are also very agreeable.\r\nYou’ve done a good job here. Well done, Salome! Thank you for this beautiful shot. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:31:55','2023-07-05 18:31:55'),(2141,'judge-event-evaluation-948-1688546434',948,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7151,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Sinaoleulalei\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* When beginning a presentation try to keep the hands still by the side or behind the back\r\n* Using facial expressions, precise hand movements & gestures,\r\nand added facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\n* Be sure that the presentation is memorized\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things that God will do through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:40:34','2023-07-05 18:40:34'),(2142,'judge-event-evaluation-379-1688546860',379,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7329,4451,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Sofia\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using small steps, hand movements & gestures, and added\r\nfacial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\n* Try not to speed through the presentation, give it room to breathe\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things God will do through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:47:40','2023-07-05 18:47:40'),(2143,'judge-event-evaluation-953-1688547196',953,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7136,5805,7240,45,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Tehillah,\r\nJust a tip\r\n* Using small steps, more precise hand movements, and added facial expressions\r\ncan help to enhance the presentation\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see the amazing things that God will do through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 18:53:16','2023-07-05 18:53:16'),(2144,'judge-event-evaluation-377-1688547633',377,19,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7320,4451,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Tiana\r\nJust a few tips\r\n* Using small steps, precise hand movements & gestures,\r\nand added facial expressions can help to enhance the presentation\r\n* Try not to speed through the presentation\r\nKeep practicing and you\'ll see all the amazing things that God will \r\ndo through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 19:00:33','2023-07-05 19:00:33'),(2146,'judge-event-evaluation-947-1688547751',947,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7139,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Angelina,\r\nYou did a really good job,\r\nJust some tips to help in future presentations\r\n* You can add movement (a little bit of walking) to the poem\r\n* Be sure to enunciate words correctly\r\nAll in all keep practicing and you\'ll see all the amazing things \r\nGod will do through you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 19:02:31','2023-07-05 19:02:31'),(2147,'judge-event-evaluation-942-1688547818',942,21,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7153,5805,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Galilee,\r\nKeep it up and see the amazing things God\r\nwill continue to do through you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 19:03:38','2023-07-05 19:03:38'),(2148,'judge-event-evaluation-1553-1688547835',1553,17,1,5,1,2023,300,'924',NULL,7382,4200,7240,45,'Collection','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Hajean\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing\r\nthings God will do through you\r\nGod Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 19:03:55','2023-07-05 19:03:55'),(2150,'judge-event-evaluation-1218-1688550950',1218,10,1,5,1,2023,214,'650',NULL,7279,1467,7240,19,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Viola\r\nYou sang wonderfully\r\nWith regards to the correct music it needs to be written \r\nin music notation\r\nAll in all keep it up, and you\'ll see the amazing things God \r\nwill do through you\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 19:55:50','2023-07-05 19:55:50'),(2151,'judge-event-evaluation-529-1688550999',529,3,1,5,1,2023,214,'650',NULL,6965,1678,7240,19,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Vinsentius\r\nYou have a really good voice\r\nJust a reminder with the music\r\nany changes to the music need to be shown \r\non the music sheet\r\nKeep it up and you\'ll see the amazing things God will\r\ndo through you.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 19:56:39','2023-07-05 19:56:39'),(2152,'judge-event-evaluation-1031-1688556410',1031,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7253,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Savenaca! This is beautiful flower you’ve chosen as your subject. You’ve got a good eye! This is a good attempt; however, there seems to be a lack of focus on the primary subject. Rather than the focus being centred on the flower, the focus is emphasising the stalks instead. With the focus being misplaced, the primary subject cannot serve its purpose of drawing viewers in. I’d encourage you to ensure the camera setting is focusing on the subject next time.\r\nOverall, this is good effort. Well done, Save! Thank you for this shot. Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 21:26:50','2023-07-05 21:26:50'),(2153,'judge-event-evaluation-1033-1688556924',1033,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7275,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Sonya! I love the concept behind this photo. What a great reminder of the peace we can find in Jesus and the strong bond we share with our parents. Good job!\r\nThe dark outline of this tree makes a really interesting photo; however, it could have been improved with more light. Seeing as this was taken later on the day, I understand that there might have been enough light to work with. In that instance, perhaps capturing the shot from a different angle would have worked better. A change in composition might have made a difference. More colour would have really elevated this photo.\r\nOverall, you’ve done well. Good job, Sonya! Thank you for this photo. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 21:35:24','2023-07-05 21:35:24'),(2154,'judge-event-evaluation-731-1688557377',731,17,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7413,4200,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Stevan! What a lovely shot of the ocean. It’s a great reminder of God’s power and His creativity in designing the beautiful nature that surrounds us. Great job!\r\nThe composition of this shot is good. The lighting, colour and focus are all very agreeable and work well together, making the photo what it is.\r\nThis is a very nice photo. Well done, Stevan! Thank you for this photo. Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 21:42:57','2023-07-05 21:42:57'),(2155,'judge-event-evaluation-1034-1688558002',1034,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7272,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Tamalesi! This is a stunning subject you’ve chosen for your photo. I also love that it holds special meaning to you, as it reminds you of your roots. How beautiful!\r\nThe natural light shining on the flowers is a lovely touch; however, what would have elevated this photo is if you had captured the shot from a closer angle to focus on the sunlight directly on the flowers. This would have also helped minimise the distractions around the photo because the focus would be entirely centred on the flowers, and not the stalks and leaves around them. Apart from this, the contrast of the colours in this photo is beautiful! \r\nThis is a pretty photo. Well done, Tama! Keep up the good work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 21:53:22','2023-07-05 21:53:22'),(2156,'judge-event-evaluation-1035-1688559322',1035,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7277,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Timaima! This is such a pleasant photo of coconut trees. It looks so calming and peaceful. Great choice of subject!\r\nThe sunlight coming in from the right side of the photo and shining just on the edges of the leaves is so mesmerising! It shows a really clever use of natural light. As for composition, there is more that could have been done. It would have been nice to see more creativity in composition so that the primary subject could really stand out — perhaps a different angle or focusing on one tree rather than all three of them, etc.\r\nOverall, this is good effort from you, Tima. Well done! Thank you for this lovely photo. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 22:15:22','2023-07-05 22:15:22'),(2157,'judge-event-evaluation-1037-1688559880',1037,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7273,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Torika! This is an awesome subject you’ve got in your shot. Good job!\r\nThe subject itself is quite fascinating; however, the focus does not do it much justice. The focus seems to be sharper on the leaves than on the butterfly and the flower it is resting on. This can be a bit of a distraction as it directs the attention of the viewers to the background rather than to the primary subject. As for the colour in this photo, I think its beautiful! The exposure, lighting and composition are work really well together, too. All that is needed is the focus to be on the primary subject.\r\nOverall, you did a great job. Well done, Torika! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 22:24:40','2023-07-05 22:24:40'),(2158,'judge-event-evaluation-1040-1688560264',1040,28,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7278,5806,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Victoria! This is a stunning photo. You’ve done an awesome job!\r\nThe lighting in this shot is superb! The warm tones have such a nice effect in this photo. The subject itself is fairly emphasised — the focus and exposure are good and serve their purpose. The composition is also well done. \r\nThis truly is a lovely shot. Well done, Victoria! Keep up the good work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 22:31:04','2023-07-05 22:31:04'),(2159,'judge-event-evaluation-665-1688560827',665,3,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,6965,1678,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Vinsentius! I especially love the Scripture verse you’ve used as a reference behind this shot — Psalm 121:1.\r\nThis is a nice photo; however, it would have been nice to have more colour in it. Also, with the hills as the primary subject in this photo it is a bit distracting having the tall tree in the frame, in front of the hills. It becomes difficult to distinguish which between the two — which are both adequately in focus — is the subject. \r\nOverall, this is a good effort. Well done, Vinsentius! Thank you for this photo. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 22:40:27','2023-07-05 22:40:27'),(2160,'judge-event-evaluation-1204-1688561142',1204,13,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7202,4208,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Yimeng! This is an adorable shot. It’s very cute! You’ve done a fantastic job.\r\nThe lighting, colour and composition are all very agreeable and work really well together. The focus and exposure are also done fairly well. This is a great photo of your cat. Well done! Keep up the great work! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 22:45:42','2023-07-05 22:45:42'),(2161,'judge-event-evaluation-708-1688561672',708,17,1,5,1,2023,173,'451',NULL,7408,4200,7460,2,'Open','5,8',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this submission, Yugyeong! I like the idea you have behind this photo. Good job!\r\nThis photo has potential, and so there is a lot that could have been done to improve or elevate it. The silhouettes of the people in the water are interesting; however, it would have been nice to have some colour in there. Seeing as how you used natural light, you could have used enhancements (although sparingly) to brighten up the image and bring some colour into it. As it is, the photo looks as though it lacks a primary subject. Ideally, you want to have a subject standing out for viewers to be drawn in by.\r\nOverall, this is good effort. Well done, Yugyeong! With more time and practice, you are sure to get better and better. Thank you for sharing your photo. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 22:54:32','2023-07-05 22:54:32'),(2162,'judge-event-evaluation-555-1688565075',555,3,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,6983,1678,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Benaya! That\'s certainly an interesting building.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. Always take time to read the judges form for any category you enter. That way you can know what information needs to be included on your report for the judges. 2. Tell us about enhancements. You mentioned changing to monochromatic, so that was helpful. If you used any others please let us know, or if you chose not to use any then tell us that too. 3. Distracting elements. I understand what things are like in Indonesia, and I know it can be difficult, but try to eliminate distracting elements such as the power lines from in front of your subject where possible. This helps to highlight your subject more and improves your photo. 4. Exposure - be careful when showing so much sky. It can be easy for the photo to be overexposed. Try researching ways to limit overexposure for scenic photos.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-05 23:51:15','2023-07-05 23:51:15'),(2163,'judge-event-evaluation-1425-1688601542',1425,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7211,4208,7483,50,'Open','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'I appreciate the effort that you\'ve invested into your sermon, Jiokapeci.\r\nI would like to suggest some tips to help you develop your preaching skills:\r\n\r\n1. In your choice of topic, in this case, I would suggest instead of using \'enough\' (this word assumes a limit or cap to \r\n     growth), you could use \'special\', \'unique\', \'precious\' etc. from God\'s point of view towards us which cancels \r\n     negative thoughts that we may feel.\r\n2. Preaching is proclamation whereas teaching is explanation, so in preaching, there must be a stronger emphasis\r\n     with boldness on words and phrases.\r\n3. Praying over the message will allow you to receive clear direction for the sermon\'s content and delivery to the \r\n     listener.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 09:59:02','2023-07-06 09:59:02'),(2164,'judge-event-evaluation-1047-1688602465',1047,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7270,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Alina! This is a lovely view of the sky. The picture itself is very nice; however, there is some room for improvement. Perhaps shooting this picture from a straighter angle as opposed to a tilted one would have worked much better. It can be a little difficult having to view a picture that requires you to tilt your head. Overall, you’ve done a good job here. Well done, Alina! Thank you for this lovely picture. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 10:14:25','2023-07-06 10:14:25'),(2165,'judge-event-evaluation-1102-1688603074',1102,13,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7183,4208,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Aviella! What a splendid picture you’ve got here. The view is beautiful. Good job! The composition used to take this shot is excellent! Everything about this picture is very serene and peaceful. The blue hues working with the different colours of green, white and tan all blends so well together. The focus is also fairly well done. I recognise the effort you’ve put into making this picture as well balanced as you have. Once again, thank you for this entry. You’ve done a great job. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 10:24:34','2023-07-06 10:24:34'),(2167,'judge-event-evaluation-556-1688603659',556,3,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6983,1678,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Benaya! This is a beautiful shot. You’ve done an incredible job with this picture. The composition here is great! It’s awesome how much you got into the frame — the wing of the plane and that cloud peeking in from the left do so much for the picture. The lighting, focus and exposure are also all very agreeable. The filter you’ve laid on top of the shot is nice; however, it would have been nice to have it scaled down a little bit. Overall, you\'ve done an excellent job. Well done, Benaya! Thank you again for this great shot! Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 10:34:19','2023-07-06 10:34:19'),(2169,'judge-event-evaluation-992-1688604111',992,21,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7158,5805,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Bethany! This view in this picture looks very serene. You’ve done a good job. This shot is really nice; however, what would have made a really big difference is if there was more light. With the lack of sunlight, it would have worked better to have increased the lighting on your phone, rather than bringing the light setting down. This would have added more to your picture. Overall, you’ve done a good job here. Well done, Bethany! Thank you again for this picture. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 10:41:51','2023-07-06 10:41:51'),(2171,'judge-event-evaluation-1427-1688606196',1427,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7198,4208,7483,50,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great message, Murangzhuoma Sang. These are some keys that will improve and increase your effectiveness in preaching...\r\n\r\n1. Include all the scriptures in your outline for verifying its relevance with the topic.\r\n2. Hand gestures are very important to express key thoughts to the audience.\r\n3. Diction and Projection means to speak with clear pronunciation and strong emphasis on key words or phrases.\r\n4. Prayer prepares your heart and mind to preach with boldness and confidence.\r\n\r\nI look forward to seeing you again in next year\'s Convention.\r\n\r\nGod Bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 11:16:36','2023-07-06 11:16:36'),(2172,'judge-event-evaluation-690-1688606337',690,3,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6974,1678,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Brayden! This is an awesome view you have in this picture. Good job! The shot is really nice; however, there is some room for improvement. With better composition, the view would have really stood out! When capturing pictures, it’s important to lead with a subject — what are focusing on? What do you want to draw you viewers in with? When you have a subject, everything else falls into place. \r\nOverall, this is good effort. Well done, Brayden! Thank you again for this picture. Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 11:18:57','2023-07-06 11:18:58'),(2173,'judge-event-evaluation-1086-1688607486',1086,20,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7096,394,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Corinthian! The view in this picture is really stunning! You’ve done a great job. This shot is incredible. The primary subject is easily identifiable. The natural lighting has a great effect on the scenery! The focus and exposure are awesome. Finally, the colours in this shot really stand out. This is excellent work. Well done, Corinthian! Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 11:38:06','2023-07-06 11:38:06'),(2174,'judge-event-evaluation-628-1688608391',628,8,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7066,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Fiona! What a stunning view. It’s really impressive! You’ve done a good job. This picture truly is wonderful; however, it would have been nice to see you maximise the use of the natural light. The shot is a little dark on the bottom right corner. Taking the shot from a different angle and perhaps moving back a bit would really elevate it. A different approach in composition makes all the difference. Overall, you\'ve done a great job. Well done, Fiona! Thank you again for this awesome picture. Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 11:53:11','2023-07-06 11:53:11'),(2175,'judge-event-evaluation-1103-1688609065',1103,13,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7192,4208,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Francoise! This is a beautiful view you have here in your picture.\r\n\r\nThis is a really lovely shot. The composition is great. The natural light, colour, focus and exposure are all very agreeable, too. You’ve done a great job at capturing this beautiful view. Well done! Thank you again for this picture. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 12:04:25','2023-07-06 12:04:25'),(2176,'judge-event-evaluation-549-1688610252',549,3,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6980,1678,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Genevine! What a pleasant view you’ve captured in your shot. Great job!\r\nThis picture is really nice; however, there are some things that could have done to really make it stand out. The low lighting is great, but increasing it with the use of enhancements would’ve worked better. Straightening the angle of the photo would also help.\r\nOverall, you’ve done a good job. Well done, Genevine! Thank you again for this picture. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 12:24:12','2023-07-06 12:24:12'),(2177,'judge-event-evaluation-776-1688612606',776,15,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7045,4679,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Gloria! This is a beautiful view you’ve captured in your picture. Good job!\r\nThe picture is really nice; however, there is some room for improvement. For instance, it would’ve been really lovely to see how your unique sense of creativity can turn a view like this into something that extraordinary — maybe through a change of composition or using enhancements to bring more colour and light into the shot. With photography, you have the ability, and creative freedom, to show the things you see in this beautiful world through your own unique lens. \r\nThis is good effort. Good job, Gloria! With more time and practice, you’re sure to capture more wonderful shots. Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:03:26','2023-07-06 13:03:26'),(2178,'judge-event-evaluation-1048-1688613266',1048,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7264,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Hadassah! This is a beautiful view of the sky that you’ve captured in your shot. Good job!\r\n\r\nThis photo is very nice; however, there is some room for improvement here to make your picture really stand out. A slight change in composition, exposure and focus would help elevate this picture. The natural light used here is really good! Sunlight is most preferable when taking shots like these, so I’d encourage to make the most of it when capturing your pictures.\r\nOverall, this is good effort from you, Hadassah! With time and practice, you’ll learn to take more and more lovely photos. Keep it up. God Bess you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:14:26','2023-07-06 13:14:26'),(2179,'judge-event-evaluation-1049-1688613666',1049,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7263,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Luse! What a magnificent view. This is a great shot. You’ve done an excellent job!\r\nThe lighting in this shot is impressive! It balances the picture out perfectly. The composition is also great and the exposure and focus couldn’t be better. This picture is simple and beautiful! The idea you have behind it is also very heartwarming.\r\nWell done, Luse! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:21:06','2023-07-06 13:21:06'),(2180,'judge-event-evaluation-991-1688613740',991,21,1,5,1,2023,178,'456',NULL,7125,5805,6,2,'Open','11',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Charliz. Some feedback to help prepare for future events. You may notice a reduction in marks as documents were not supplied as per guideline requirements. Other than that, well done and I look for future entries. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:22:20','2023-07-06 13:22:20'),(2181,'judge-event-evaluation-1205-1688613748',1205,13,1,5,1,2023,178,'456',NULL,7211,4208,6,2,'Open','11',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well taken Jiokapeci. Just a few things to prepare for future entries. Take the time to fill in the report thoroughly and try different techniques with lighting, exposure and focus. Other than that, well done and we look forward for future entries. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:22:28','2023-07-06 13:22:28'),(2182,'judge-event-evaluation-1207-1688613755',1207,13,1,5,1,2023,178,'456',NULL,7202,4208,6,2,'Open','11',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done . I would love more details on how you captured the photo and why you chose this subject. Take the time to try difference techniques, lighting, exposure and focusing. Other then that, well done and we look forward for future entries. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:22:35','2023-07-06 13:22:35'),(2183,'judge-event-evaluation-559-1688615542',559,15,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7040,4679,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Marvella! This is an exquisite view you’ve captured in this shot. Good job!\r\nThis picture truly is wonderful. The cool lighting in this shot is superb! It really makes the picture stand out; however, there is still room for improvement. A slight change in composition would add even more to the shot. This is the one point I would encourage you to work on. Overall, this is a nice picture. Well done, Marvella! Thank you for this picture. Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 13:52:22','2023-07-06 13:52:22'),(2184,'judge-event-evaluation-1379-1688624443',1379,13,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7199,4208,7483,50,'Open','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Heilala...you\'ve really presented your message well.\r\nThese are some pointers that will develop the craft so that you will preach effectively to any audience.\r\n\r\n1. Voice projection/inflection helps to emphasize key thoughts rather than having a monotone voice.\r\n2. Hand gestures express what you say in describing important points.\r\n3. Make sure to include all the scriptures in your outline for the judges to follow through your message in order.\r\n4. In your introduction, there must be a key or central scripture that your message is centred on and which all \r\n    other scriptures connect to (and it also must be seen in your outline).\r\n\r\nGod Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 16:20:43','2023-07-06 16:20:43'),(2185,'judge-event-evaluation-1535-1688627403',1535,17,1,5,1,2023,330,'979',NULL,7411,4200,7483,50,'Open','25',100,66.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank-you, Floren, for your wonderful message.\r\nThese are some pointers that will develop your preaching skills and to be effective.\r\n\r\n1.  It\'s important to remember from the Convention guidelines that your outline should be double-spaced.\r\n2. There should be a key text from the beginning of the outline.\r\n3. Placing emphasis on key thoughts is very important to bring the message\'s key points to the hearers.\r\n4. Preaching is proclamation, not lecturing and it should capture the attention of people through boldness.\r\n5. Prayer helps to tune one\'s heart to what God wants in a message.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 17:10:03','2023-07-06 17:10:03'),(2186,'judge-event-evaluation-629-1688633523',629,3,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,6969,1678,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Pauline, thank you for this lovely rendition of Eve in the Garden of Eden. \r\nTo me it feels slightly incomplete because Eve has no mouth or nose drawn! \r\nPlease note that Google and Pintrest are not sources of images. You can use google to find images, but you will need to specify in your report what websites that Google or Pintrest takes you to. \r\nI hope that you continue to develop this gift because I can see that you have a real talent in this area. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 18:52:03','2023-07-06 18:52:03'),(2187,'judge-event-evaluation-391-1688633748',391,11,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7026,613,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Cameron! Night photos like this can be pretty tricky.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. No matter which event you enter, read through the judges form to give yourself an idea of what information they will be looking to see. You included a lot of the details, including how you took your shot and your enhancements, but not what the overall idea was supposed to look like. It\'s important to tell what you want it to look like, as well as how you took the photo. 2. For night shots like this, manual focus can be helpful. Try to get a light to shine at your subject, and set the focus manually. Then when you take your longer photo it won\'t jump to areas you don\'t want. 3. ISO noise can be an issue with low light photos. Essentially it makes the photo look a bit grainy. You can manually set ISO to a level that works for you. Experiment with your ISO on your camera in daylight to see where the noise starts to become more visible, then set your ISO below that. 4. Longer shutters can mean more light and more glare. There are 2 ways to combat this for your type of camera. First, using a smaller aperture in combination with the longer shutter. Second, using a Neutral Density (ND) filter to reduce the amount of light coming into the camera. These methods also work well for creating blur for things like running streams or waterfalls.\r\nLooking forward to seeing your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 18:55:48','2023-07-06 18:55:49'),(2188,'judge-event-evaluation-498-1688633826',498,15,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7043,4679,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Pretty, this really is some beautiful scenery! \r\nI appreciate the textures you have drawn on the tree. \r\nPerhaps the seat of the swing could have had slightly more complex texture on it. \r\nGreat use of variation in the colouring across the sky!\r\nKeep up the good work. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 18:57:06','2023-07-06 18:57:06'),(2190,'judge-event-evaluation-920-1688635349',920,32,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7334,5826,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Hey Tiamai! You have done some really fantastic work here! A big well done to you!\r\nI love how you have put so much effort into all the different layers and all the various details within each part of the finished design all the way down to the writing on the sign! By the way, the comments section on the Judges Form is for the judge to fill in. The comments you wrote there would be well suited to be put in the section of the report for describing your process in making the project. Amazing job! I hope that I get to see much more from you in the future. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 19:22:29','2023-07-06 19:22:29'),(2191,'judge-event-evaluation-994-1688637795',994,21,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7153,5805,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,75.00,-10,0.00,'Great photo Galilee! I\'m from NSW, and great to see a lovely photo of the Sydney Opera House.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. In any event you enter, read the judges form. It will help you to know what information the judges are looking for, and help you fill out your report. 2. Focus - I\'m not quite certain if the lack of focus is due to not being steady, or because the image was zoomed in too far. Galaxy phones do have awesome cameras, but on any camera beware of zooming further than the optical lens. Yes, nearly every camera has a digital zoom, and some work really well. The problem can be that when you digitally zoom you start losing picture quality and clarity. 3. Enhancements. If you used any enhancements for your photo, tell us. If you chose not to use enhancements, tell us about that too. 4. Phone cameras - If you are using a phone camera and want more control, most phones have a PRO mode. Your Galaxy phone should definitely have this. You can use it to adjust aperture, shutter, EV, and several other settings. Try it out and see what kind of results you can get.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 20:03:15','2023-07-06 20:03:15'),(2192,'judge-event-evaluation-1043-1688639391',1043,28,1,5,1,2023,177,'455',NULL,7272,5806,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for sharing your photo Talalesi! \r\n- So that you can get all points possible, please include your original photo with your entry. ;-)\r\n- I think your photo would be enhanced if you cropped some of the sky out, so that you have good \'Composition\' Rule of Thirds, strength of line, cropping, distracting elements etc. at the moment it feels like your photo is split in two halves.\r\nThis is a unique idea! Keep developing your skills - you show potential with photography! :-)\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 20:29:51','2023-07-06 20:29:51'),(2193,'judge-event-evaluation-836-1688641552',836,25,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7343,5804,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,NULL,NULL,'Hey Zechariah! Thank you for your entry. Giraffes are certainly one of God\'s most amazing creations!\r\nI would love to see you draw more than just the giraffe. You could add some grass under his feet.  Add some sky up above. Add some trees in the background with some leaves ready to be eaten by the giraffe. Your only limitation is your imagination, so try out all the ideas you can think of! \r\nPlease specify in your report what program you have used to create your digital art (i.e. microsoft paint, gimp, ibis paint, etc.) God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-06 21:05:52','2023-07-06 21:05:52'),(2194,'judge-event-evaluation-558-1688652806',558,15,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7040,4679,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,67.00,-10,0.00,'Lovely photo Marvella!\r\nA few things to help you for next time. 1. For any event you enter, please read the judges form. It will help you to know what details you need to include on your report. 2. Use high quality images. The photo you have uploaded seems quite a lot smaller than the resolution of the camera which took the photo. As a result, some of the lines on the building have quite a soft focus look as opposed to the sharp lines we would hope to see. I\'m not certain whether this has been the result of cropping or using digital zoom which decreases the resolution of the image. 3. Please give us details of how you set up and took your shot. It helps us to score your work. 4. Enhancements - if you have used any enhancements, tell us about those. If you chose not to enhance your photo - tell us that too.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 00:13:26','2023-07-07 00:13:26'),(2195,'judge-event-evaluation-1078-1688653581',1078,20,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7098,394,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Lovely photo Joel. I love how you have the plane taking off in the background behind your Air Asia plane.\r\nA few things to help you for next time. 1. Give more details on your report. A good way to know what to write is to read through the judges form and see what you will be marked against. This goes for any event you enter. 2. Consider your framing. While the plane has been centred very well in the frame, the long sections of tarmac and sky don\'t help your subject to stand out. \r\n3. Enhancements - let us know if you used or chose not to use any enhancements. That section is worth up to 10 points on your entry. 4. Focus/digital zoom - Some of the photo appears a little grainy. Your resolution for your photo submitted is good, but I will take a guess that you needed to use some digital zoom to get your shot. Digital zoom can be really good at getting close to your subject, but you need to remember that unlike optical zoom, you lose resolution the further you zoom in. Try taking some shots of the same object, 1 with optical and 1 with digital then examine them on a larger screen to see the difference.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 00:26:21','2023-07-07 00:26:21'),(2196,'judge-event-evaluation-570-1688654056',570,15,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7053,4679,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Great photo Kenneth! That reflection is amazing. Well done.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. Always read the judges form and see what areas you will be marked against. This will help you to know what sort of information you need to include in your report. This applies to every event, not just photography. 2. Tell us more about how you got the photo. Did you use a tripod? Did you have to wait for a certain time of day? These details help us to score your work. 3. Resolution. This is an amazing photo but unfortunately quite small given the type of camera that took it. When submitting your photo, in print or digital, use a high quality image. Due to the small resolution the picture immediately starts to look a little grainy an minimal magnification. 4. Enhancements. This section is worth 10 points. If you enhanced your photo - tell us. If you chose not to enhance - mention that too.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 00:34:16','2023-07-07 00:34:16'),(2197,'judge-event-evaluation-692-1688655054',692,20,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7169,394,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,70.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Oliver!\r\nA few things for next time. 1. Always read through the judges form when writing your report. It will help you know what details you should include. 2. Enhancements - let us know if you enhanced or chose not to enhance your photo. 3. Exposure - be careful with overexposure for your photos. If you are using a Galaxy phone, try lowering the EV settings slightly to see if this helps. Be careful though as this will also darken your photo. Don\'t go overboard. 4. Subject matter. This was a very interesting choice for this category. Keep an eye out for any fantastic buildings/vehicles and see if you can capture something that has an initial \"Wow!\" impression for your next entry.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 00:50:54','2023-07-07 00:50:54'),(2198,'judge-event-evaluation-642-1688655648',642,3,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,6979,1678,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,73.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Phua! Yes, Singapore does have some amazing buildings.\r\nA few things for next time. 1. Read the judges form for any event you enter. This will help you to know what information you should include in your report. 2. Enhancements - please tell us if you did/didn\'t enhance your photo and why. 3. Please give us more details of how you set up for your shot. It helps us to understand your overall goal for the photo. 4. Resolution - given the resolution of the camera that took the image, the photo you\'ve submitted seems quite small. This means that the photo appears a bit grainy as the quality isn\'t there to help it appear clearer. Always choose a good, high resolution photo whether you are printing or submitting digitally.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 01:00:48','2023-07-07 01:00:48'),(2199,'judge-event-evaluation-216-1688691919',216,12,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6993,1132,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Matthew! What a picturesque scene you\'ve captured here. Great job!\r\nThe composition here is really awesome — everything this so centred and well balanced. The lighting, colour, focus and exposure are all great as well. This picture is simple and exudes a sense of peace. You’ve done a really impressive job. Well done, Matthew! Keep up the excellent work. Thank you for this beautiful work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 11:05:19','2023-07-07 11:05:19'),(2200,'judge-event-evaluation-1133-1688693475',1133,46,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7446,4504,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Mecina! It’s a lovely view of the sky you’ve captured here in your shot. Good job!\r\nThis is a nice picture with great lighting, colour and focus; however, there is more that could have been done in the area of composition. Perhaps positioning the camera in a way that would get less of the ground and more of the sky would work better. It would also be preferable to focus on a particular subject with the rest of nature adding to it and supporting it. This view does have a lot of potential. I’d just encourage you to add your personal sense of creativity to draw out that potential and offer your viewers something from your unique perspective. Thank you for this lovely shot. You did a great job. Well done, Mecina! Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 11:31:15','2023-07-07 11:31:15'),(2201,'judge-event-evaluation-1127-1688696147',1127,46,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7442,4504,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Miranda! This is a really artistic shot. Wow! You’ve done a fantastic job.\r\nThe composition here is awesome! It really makes the picture stand out. When it comes to the sky in the background, the lighting is quite bright which is most probably due to the manual settings of exposure. Nonetheless, it works well for the rest of the shot. The focus is also great given that it was in automatic rather than manual.\r\nOverall, you have done a beautiful job here. Well done, Miranda! You’ve got an artistic eye. Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 12:15:47','2023-07-07 12:15:47'),(2202,'judge-event-evaluation-191-1688697990',191,13,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7199,4208,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well written story that details the choice that Ben has to make - he has to trust that God has everything in hand despite things not going the way Ben thought they should. Ben learns that sometimes God\'s ways are different than we expect.\r\nVery minor errors in the writing, such as Bias\'s instead of Bia\'s. \r\nKeep on growing in your understanding of God as you go through life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 12:46:30','2023-07-07 12:46:30'),(2203,'judge-event-evaluation-1051-1688698353',1051,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7267,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Narieta! This is a creative shot you have here. You have done a great job!\r\nI love that you kept the power lines and birds in this picture. These details really add to the shot and makes it even more interesting. The composition is great here. The lighting, focus and exposure are also very good. Well done, Narieta! Keep up the great work. God bless you!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 12:52:33','2023-07-07 12:52:33'),(2204,'judge-event-evaluation-695-1688699300',695,28,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7258,5806,7482,7,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Your story weaves the tale of young Matthew learning about God being with us through all circumstances and sending strangers to help. The story is readable and simple to understand. \r\nMay you continue to grow in God and understanding of His ways as you go through life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 13:08:20','2023-07-07 13:08:20'),(2205,'judge-event-evaluation-1052-1688707585',1052,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7251,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,8',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Niuselu! This is a beautiful view you have here in your shot. It’s really lovely!\r\nThis is a really nice picture; however, there is some room for improvement. More effort in the composition would have made a drastic change. For example, positioning the camera in such a way that would create a balance between the mountains and the sky showing in the frame would’ve elevated the shot. Ensuring that the focus was sharp and centred on the view also would have worked better. The use of enhancements to bring some colour into the shot would have been nice as well. Overall, you’ve done a good job here, and you’re right — the sunlight shining on the mountains is an incredible sight! You have an artistic eye. Keep up the good work. God bless you!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 15:26:25','2023-07-07 15:26:25'),(2206,'judge-event-evaluation-826-1688710006',826,25,1,5,1,2023,167,'411',NULL,7360,5804,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Hey Sailosi! This looks like a really cool design. As per guidelines requirements, 5. Text should not be added, unless it is part of the ‘scene’ (eg., writing on billboards or street signs, logos on\r\nclothing, etc.) This is why I think this would be better suited to be entered into the poster category. (It would have gained a better score with that judges form.) \r\nWatch out for your spelling (babblings not babbilings) and also consider if and why you should capitalise certain words in the given Scripture. I often find that the Scripture reference is better placed away from the Scripture. Usually I would try to place it centrally aligned above or below on one of the sides.  Next time I hope that you try a few options out so that you can see what you like!\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 16:06:46','2023-07-07 16:06:46'),(2207,'judge-event-evaluation-1130-1688710211',1130,46,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7443,4504,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo, Stan!\r\nSo that you can get all points possible, please include your original photo with your entry. ;-)\r\nI think your photo would be enhanced if you cropped it, so that the action of your workers is more evident.\r\nKeep developing your skills - you show potential with photography! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 16:10:11','2023-07-07 16:10:11'),(2208,'judge-event-evaluation-1130-1688710399',1130,46,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7443,4504,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo, Stan!\r\nSo that you can get all points possible, please include your original photo with your entry. ;-)\r\nI think your photo would be enhanced if you cropped it, so that the action of your workers is more evident.\r\nKeep developing your skills - you show potential with photography! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 16:13:19','2023-07-07 16:13:19'),(2211,'judge-event-evaluation-786-1688721235',786,10,1,5,1,2023,176,'454',NULL,7279,1467,7480,2,'Open','12',100,74.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Viola!\r\nA few things for next time. 1. Always read the judges forms for whatever you are competing in. It will give you an idea of what you will be scored against, and what kind of information you should include in your report. 2. Tell us more about how you set up your shot, and what your end result was supposed to look like. It will give us a better idea of your creative process. 3. Be sure to use a good, high resolution image whether submitting online or printing. Your image was significantly smaller than the camera was capable of producing. This means it doesn\'t look as sharp as the original image would have done. 4. When trying for this kind of shot, you really need the image on the device to be clear and pop. This image seems a little dark, as does the stage. 5. For interchangeable lens cameras, such as the Canon SLR you used, please also list what kind of lens you used. It helps us to understand your end result, while also knowing the limitations of the lens. For example, an F4.0-5.6 lens wouldn\'t be as likely to get a good result at an indoor concert as a F2.8 or lower lens.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 19:13:55','2023-07-07 19:13:55'),(2216,'judge-event-evaluation-691-1688730707',691,3,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,6965,1678,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,69.00,-10,-1.00,'You clearly have a gift for story writing. I like the way you have incorporated a dream.\r\nAnd the idea that God speaks through dreams.  \r\n I am not sure about your content. In some areas you have expressed yourself well, in other areas there is a confusion for the reader.  Some of your choice of words may be structurally correct but they do not always make sense in the context they are in.\r\nFor example:\r\n1.  \'One day, Matthew lost his hope. Her mother, Lucifer, couldn\'t let it happen. Lucifer asked Matthew and her children to pray by asking the Lord God to help them. \'\r\nThis sentence structure and choice of words is confusing.   \r\n2.  \'Matthew lost his hope.......Her mother, Lucifer, couldn\'t\' - Are you talking about Mathew and said her mother, instead of his mother?  \r\n3.  Is Lucifer an appropriate name for the mother when Lucifer is also another name for the devil?  \r\n3.  \'And later in the cathedral, (inspired by the Chinese Ghost Festival) the ghosts of the historical figures, whom Mary didn’t see, sat on the church seats and stood at the aisle and watched over Mary smiling at her play.\'   -   The Ghost Festival or Hungry Ghost Festival, also known as the Zhongyuan Festival in Taoism and Yulanpen Festival in Buddhism, is a traditional Taoist and Buddhist festival held in certain East Asian countries. According to the Chinese calendar, the Ghost Festival is on the 15th night of the seventh month.  I do not think this is appropriate content for a Christian Short Story.  As it is saying that the ghosts of historical figures influenced by those that celebrate ghosts of Buddhism and such like.  Which would not be putting God first and is a type of ancestor worship.\r\n\'but never accepted\'  Is this that the college never accepted or the parents never accept.   \r\nSpacing:  diary,Oswald      should be:    diary, Oswald\r\nGrammar:     do; waiting    should be:    do, waiting   street lights    \r\n                        so. you can desire to prepare - did not have comma\r\n                        made her windy      should be:     made it windy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 21:51:47','2023-07-07 21:51:47'),(2217,'judge-event-evaluation-1079-1688730830',1079,21,1,5,1,2023,21,'063',NULL,7121,5805,7314,7,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Very realistic and moving.  Well thought out.  I love that you have woven in the present time with the past and included many characters in your plot.  \r\n\r\nThere was only one area where I have some suggestions to help you for next year in the criteria of Mechanics: \r\n1.   Nanna in English is normally spelled \'Nana\'.  \r\n2.  There were about four small words missing in your sentences:  (were)still, (to) scenic, \r\n     (the) brim, and (from) his eyes.  \r\n3.   In the first paragraph you have one very long sentence which needs punctuation or breaking\r\n      into another sentence:  \"Alisi!.................five years.\"  \r\n4.   Wanna is slang for \'want to.\'  Depending on the context of the story this could be used to\r\n       emphasise a persons character or way of speaking.\r\n\r\nOverall an excellent piece of writing and your mark reflects this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-07 21:53:50','2023-07-07 21:53:50'),(2218,'judge-event-evaluation-593-1688782544',593,3,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6981,1678,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Olyvia! This is a splendid view you’ve captured here in your shot. Good job!\r\nThis is a really stunning picture. The lighting is perfect! It really makes the picture what it is. The colour is also really great! However, it would have preferable to have the focus setting sharper on the view itself rather than just the ground right in front of you. Shifting the focus would have made a huge difference to the shot in the best way. Overall, you did an awesome job. Well done, Olyvia! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 12:15:44','2023-07-08 12:15:44'),(2219,'judge-event-evaluation-641-1688785259',641,3,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6972,1678,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Phebe! This is truly a remarkable view you have this shot. Good job!\r\nThis is a nice picture with a lovely view; however, \r\nthe view isn’t quite clear enough. There isn’t enough lighting to show the view. This could have been improved with the use of enhancements. This would also bring colour into the shot. A change in the exposure settings would have helped as well.\r\nOverall, you’ve done a good job here. Well done, Phebe! Keep it up. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 13:00:59','2023-07-08 13:00:59'),(2220,'judge-event-evaluation-666-1688786880',666,15,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7039,4679,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Rachel! This is a stunning shot. The view here is incredible. You’ve done well!\r\nThe composition is fantastic — everything you’ve managed to get into frame is just beautiful. The contrast between the green and blue hues are magnificent. The natural lighting does a lot for this picture! The clouds add even more to it. \r\nOverall, I think you’ve done an excellent job. You’ve got a great eye! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 13:28:00','2023-07-08 13:28:00'),(2221,'judge-event-evaluation-660-1688795507',660,3,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,6975,1678,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Samuel! This is truly an artistic shot. Good job!\r\nThe picture is awesome. The composition is really great here. The lighting is also good — it’s a bit dark, but it suits the ‘mood’ of the picture. The quality of the picture is okay; however, it is a bit blurry. The focus here is great! I also think you’ve done well with the use of enhancements.\r\nOverall, this is good work. Well done, Samuel! Keep it up. God bless you!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 15:51:47','2023-07-08 15:51:47'),(2222,'judge-event-evaluation-765-1688796222',765,25,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7345,5804,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Saumeli! This is quite the interesting shot you have here. How creative!\r\nThis shot really does have a lot of potential; however, there is some room for improvement. For starters, there’s far less lighting than would have been preferred. Although I understand that you were relying on moonlight, it would have been nice to see this shot from a different perspective so that the natural lighting could show a little bit more. There’s also not much colour, but again this goes back to the fact that you were relying on moonlight and the time that this picture was taken is another factor to consider as to how little can be seen here.\r\nOverall, this is good effort. Good job, Saumeli! Thank you for this shot. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 16:03:42','2023-07-08 16:03:42'),(2223,'judge-event-evaluation-976-1688796688',976,25,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7348,5804,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Terumah! This is a lovely view you’ve captured in this shot. You’ve done well.\r\nThe picture is really nice, however there are some ways in which you could’ve improved this shot. The natural lighting here is awesome. The composition works fine. The focus, however, is zoned in on the railing and not on the view. This would have been preferable. The quality of the picture could’ve been better as well.\r\nOverall, you\'ve done a good job here. Well done! Keep up the good work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 16:11:28','2023-07-08 16:11:28'),(2224,'judge-event-evaluation-1053-1688797224',1053,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7252,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,10',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Tubutubu! This is a magnificent view you’ve captured here. Good job!\r\nThis picture is really lovely. The composition is good. The colour and the lighting from the sunset is really beautiful! Maybe some help with the use of enhancements to brighten the right corner of the picture would’ve helped, but overall it’s a great shot. Well done, Tubutubu! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 16:20:24','2023-07-08 16:20:24'),(2225,'judge-event-evaluation-621-1688798532',621,8,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7062,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Aaron! This picture is really creative. Wow! You’ve done an excellent job!\r\nThe composition here is great. The lighting is brilliant — it’s one of the best parts of this shot. The colours are really vibrant. The focus is just where it needs to be. \r\nI think you have done an excellent job! Well done, Aaron. Thank you for this piece. You’ve clearly got an artistic eye. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 16:42:12','2023-07-08 16:42:12'),(2226,'judge-event-evaluation-1276-1688799247',1276,8,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7067,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Gabriel! This is a great shot you’ve entered. You’ve done a good job here.\r\nThe lighting here is great — the sunlight best suits the shot. The focus is also really well done. The composition does a good job; however, had the camera been straightened and maybe even zoomed in a bit closer to the subject, it might have really elevated the shot.\r\nOverall, you’ve done an awesome job. Well done, Gabriel! Thank you for this picture. Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 16:54:07','2023-07-08 16:54:07'),(2227,'judge-event-evaluation-619-1688800238',619,8,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7074,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Joaquine! This is a really creative shot you have entered. Good job!\r\nThe picture really is artistic. The lighting in the shot is one of the best parts about the picture. It’s both warm and soft, and shines directly on the subject. The focus setting is also great, although the quality of the image is a little blurry. Nonetheless, you have done a brilliant job. Well done! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 17:10:38','2023-07-08 17:10:38'),(2228,'judge-event-evaluation-620-1688801138',620,8,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7075,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Johann! This is an awesome shot! WOW! You’ve done a great job!\r\nThe composition here is really impressive. It was such a creative choice to take the shot of the subject through the window of the miniature car. Very original! The colours in this shot are so vibrant and cool-toned. It really suits the ‘mood’ of the picture. You’ve done really well here, Johann! This is an excellent job. You’ve got an artistic eye. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 17:25:38','2023-07-08 17:25:38'),(2229,'judge-event-evaluation-213-1688801603',213,12,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,6992,1132,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Jonathan! This is an interesting subject you’ve captured. Awesome job!\r\nI really like where you were going with this picture, and I think it has a lot of potential; however, there are some things that could’ve been done to really elevate the shot. For instance, the camera setting you’ve chosen doesn’t quite do the subject justice. It’s a bit blurry so it isn’t as clear as one would like. I reckon that with a bit more use of enhancements, this picture would really stand out. Overall, you have done a great job! Well done, Jonathan. Keep it up! God bless you! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 17:33:23','2023-07-08 17:33:23'),(2230,'judge-event-evaluation-551-1688802002',551,15,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7041,4679,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Matthew! This is a really creative macro shot of a tree. Great job!\r\nThis picture is fantastic! It’s got great composition, colour and lighting. Most of all, I think you have done a brilliant job with the focus setting! It’s exactly where it needs to be and it shows all the tiny, minute details of the tree. That is the best part of this shot.\r\nWell done, Matthew! You have done a really great job. Keep it up! God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 17:40:02','2023-07-08 17:40:02'),(2231,'judge-event-evaluation-253-1688802616',253,12,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,6993,1132,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Matthew! This is a great macro shot. You’ve done an awesome job!\r\nThis picture is really nice and it’s definitely interesting to look at; however, there are some things that could have made this shot stand out even more. In my opinion, everything about this picture is great — lighting, colour, and exposure. The only thing that needs to be improved is the focus. The picture isn’t exactly as sharp as it could be. In fact, it’s a little blurry. This is probably due to some body movement while taking the shot, which is a common thing and happens to everyone. This is totally fine and as I mentioned, very normal, so nonetheless, you have done a great job. Well done, Matthew! Keep up the good work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 17:50:16','2023-07-08 17:50:16'),(2232,'judge-event-evaluation-622-1688803844',622,8,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7077,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Michael! WOW! This is truly a creative shot you have here. Such a great job!\r\nThe composition of this photo is great! I love the way you got both the miniature car and its reflection in the frame. The colours in this picture are also really nice and vibrant. Finally, the lighting is perfect for this shot. Well done, Michael! You are really artistic! Keep up the excellent work. God bless you! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 18:10:44','2023-07-08 18:10:44'),(2233,'judge-event-evaluation-1132-1688806334',1132,46,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7449,4504,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Olisha! This is a stunning picture you’ve entered here. You’ve done so well!\r\nThe composition of this photo is great! The colours are so soft and cool-toned. It’s so soothing just to look at this picture. It really exudes a type of serenity. The lighting here is perfect. Lastly, the focus being zoned in on the water droplet is fantastic. You have really done a brilliant job here! You’ve got a great eye for photography. Keep up the great work! God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 18:52:14','2023-07-08 18:52:14'),(2234,'judge-event-evaluation-1125-1688806906',1125,46,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7445,4504,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Priscilla! This is a beautiful image you have here. Wow! Such an excellent job. \r\nI really don’t have much to say — you’ve nailed this shot! The composition is really great. The colours are exquisite — the contrast between the colours of the flower and the green leaves in the background blend beautifully! Most of all, the focus being on the subject, and the subject only, is really what makes this shot stand out. \r\nYou’ve done a spectacular job here, Priscilla! Very well done. Keep up the excellent work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:01:46','2023-07-08 19:01:46'),(2235,'judge-event-evaluation-1042-1688807408',1042,28,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7271,5806,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Ruci! This is a really different and creative choice for a subject. Nice job!\r\nThis picture is great! What really makes it stand out is how detailed it is. You really got up close and personal with this shot. It’s awesome! The focus is great, and so is the lighting from the camera flash. Your camera settings as a whole are really good; however, I’d like to encourage to channel your creativity into making awesome backgrounds for your shot that will make your subject really stand out. Overall, you’ve done a great job! Keep it up, Ruci. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:10:08','2023-07-08 19:10:08'),(2236,'judge-event-evaluation-618-1688807730',618,8,1,5,1,2023,164,'405',NULL,7083,6328,7460,2,'Collection','5,13',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this entry, Valerie! This is a lovely shot of nature. You have done an incredible job here.\r\nThis picture is really great. The composition is very agreeable. The colours are lovely and blend well with one another. The focus does work for the most part. However, I wish there was more detail in this picture. I understand you might not have wanted to bother the bee by getting too close; however, securing just a bit more detail in this shot would have added to it even more.\r\nOverall, this is a really beautiful picture. Well done, Valerie! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:15:30','2023-07-08 19:15:30'),(2237,'judge-event-evaluation-543-1688807745',543,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6966,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Aiko! Thank you for your entry! This is a really cool photo of Singapore airport. I really appreciate how you have centred the main object of your photo as well as having almost perfect third divisions of the photo. It is a bit of a shame that the beam cuts the waterfall in half. Perhaps a different angle could have been better? Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:15:45','2023-07-08 19:15:45'),(2238,'judge-event-evaluation-1126-1688808581',1126,46,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7442,4504,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo, Miranda!\r\nSo that you can get all points possible, please include your original photo with your entry. ;-)\r\nIn your report, you could mention how you came across this man with the paints.\r\nI think your photo would be enhanced if you cropped it, so that the man is bigger.\r\nKeep developing your skills - you show potential with photography! :-)\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:29:41','2023-07-08 19:29:42'),(2241,'judge-event-evaluation-624-1688809354',624,8,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7077,6328,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo, Michael!\r\nSo that you can get all points possible, please include your original photo with your entry. ;-)\r\nI think your photo would be enhanced if you cropped it - hold a piece of paper up to the photo covering some of the bottom and you\'ll see what I mean.\r\nI would love to see the motorcyclist\'s eyes (they are in the shadow) - as that provides important connection with those who see your photo.\r\nKeep developing your skills - you show potential with photography! :-)\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:42:34','2023-07-08 19:42:34'),(2243,'judge-event-evaluation-1166-1688809973',1166,25,1,5,1,2023,163,'404',NULL,7338,5804,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Juzdaiiy,\r\nUnfortunately, I cannot provide you with any points for your entry this year, as there is no photo in the portal.\r\nI can see your report about your photo and think that it sounds like a very interesting photo - I would have liked to have seen it.\r\nJuzdaiiy, you have very neat hand writing, and I hope you will enter photography again.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 19:52:53','2023-07-08 19:52:53'),(2244,'judge-event-evaluation-562-1688818399',562,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6963,1678,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Johns! Thanks so much for your entry! \r\nIsn\'t it amazing what we are able to accomplish with the skills and talents that God has given us. \r\nNext time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. \r\nSometimes when capturing images of large outdoor objects, we find ourselves having to try take the photo from many different angles to find the one that will eliminate background objects the best. Sometimes we even have to go back to retake an image due to the weather of the day although this can be somewhat helped with the use of various photo enhancement tools that are available to us today. I hope to see more from you in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:13:19','2023-07-08 22:13:19'),(2245,'judge-event-evaluation-562-1688818654',562,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6963,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Johns! Thank you for your entry here! It really is amazing what we are able to accomplish when we properly develop the talents that God has given to us. Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. When photographing large outdoor objects, it can be good to try taking the photo from many different angles to see which one is the best for eliminating distracting background objects. Sometimes you will even have to return on another day to get the best possible weather for your photo, however, nowadays you can use enhancement tools to somewhat account for this. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:17:34','2023-07-08 22:17:34'),(2246,'judge-event-evaluation-564-1688818962',564,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6977,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Luis! This is a really cool building to take a photo of! Unfortunately the street pole on the left of the photo really detracts from the main subject of your photo. Also, some of the streetlights are casting the light in an unhelpful way for your photo. This could partially be solved with enhancements such as cropping, but ideally you should try to be intentional with your photo subject and try taking the picture from various angles. Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. Keep up the great work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:22:42','2023-07-08 22:22:42'),(2247,'judge-event-evaluation-574-1688819236',574,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6967,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Nanako! This is a really cool photo and a super awesome framing of the building within the trees. I wonder if you could have moved your capturing location slightly to get the full building without the tree branch obscuring anything. Also, I think it would look a little better if you could crop the bottom of the images slightly to remove the slither of the pond as it is slightly distracting. Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. Good job! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:27:16','2023-07-08 22:27:16'),(2248,'judge-event-evaluation-646-1688819563',646,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6970,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Praise! Thank you for your entry. As you mentioned in your report, home is a really important place for all of us. I think that cropping the top of the image to have less sky would make it look a bit better. Consider the rule of thirds and aim for approximately the top third of the image being sky and the rest of the image space being devoted to your main subject. Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. Keep developing your gifts. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:32:43','2023-07-08 22:32:43'),(2249,'judge-event-evaluation-703-1688819816',703,17,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,7424,4200,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Seoyon! This is a really cool image and I find myself becoming more and more intrigued with how you have captured all these reflections! \r\nNext time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show cropping or other enhancements that you have made. Also if you are going to submit a report without the form that is supplied in the guidelines, please make sure you cover all of the appropriate fields. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:36:56','2023-07-08 22:36:56'),(2250,'judge-event-evaluation-1046-1688820149',1046,28,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,7273,5806,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Torika! Thank you for your entry and thank you for your report detailing how you chose to crop your initial picture. Next time, I would love for you to be even more intentional in the photo you are trying to get. When it comes to photos of large buildings, there are many different perspectives from which you can take a photo not to mention variable distances which would all have different results. Once you have a main subject in mind, try to be intentional and find what angle will show your subject in the best way. Keep up the great work. God bless  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:42:29','2023-07-08 22:42:29'),(2251,'judge-event-evaluation-868-1688820460',868,3,1,5,1,2023,174,'452',NULL,6968,1678,7459,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Yosia! Thank you for this entry! I can see why you choose this impressive building! The one distracting element that I see in this photo is the other building in the background on the right. Perhaps this could have been removed through cropping both sides of the image? Next time, please remember to submit an original photo along with your final submission so that you can show any cropping or other enhancements that you have made. One other distraction is the people in the photo, however it is understandable that this can be beyond your control when taking photos in public. Keep up the great work. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:47:40','2023-07-08 22:47:40'),(2252,'judge-event-evaluation-672-1688820475',672,8,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7064,6328,7460,33,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this performance, Charlotte! You did a beautiful job. Your tone and intonation were really great. You were awesome in your diction and word emphasis. I really liked the arrangement of the song — it’s very simple, yet powerful (especially with that note change in the end).\r\nIf there’s anything I would encourage you to work on, it would be your vocal projection. You did an awesome job; however, I know there’s more in you that you can bring out. \r\nThank you again for your solo. This was a job well done! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-08 22:47:55','2023-07-08 22:47:55'),(2254,'judge-event-evaluation-501-1688898160',501,3,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,6967,1678,7460,33,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this awesome performance, Nanako! You have done a great job with this vocal solo.\r\nYou’ve got a strong voice, and you really showed it here. You did wonderful with your tone quality and intonation for the most part; however, there is some room for improvement. You have the capacity to hit all the notes this song required you to, but more practice will ensure that you do. You really conveyed the mood of this song well! I loved the way you sang with emotion. Great job! Keep up the good work, Nanako! Thank you for blessing us with your performance. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 20:22:40','2023-07-09 20:22:40'),(2256,'judge-event-evaluation-1489-1688899598',1489,17,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7401,4200,7460,33,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this beautiful performance, Meilin! You have a really wonderful job with this vocal solo.\r\nYour tone quality and intonation were really brilliant! You sang this song, hitting those notes beautifully. The only thing I would like to encourage you to work on is to sing with more emotion. Challenge yourself to express the words from the heart. That is truly the only point of encouragement I have for you. You are really talented! Thank you for blessing us with this performance. Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 20:46:38','2023-07-09 20:46:38'),(2257,'judge-event-evaluation-1215-1688899678',1215,10,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7281,1467,7460,33,'Open','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this performance, Kerenhapukh! You have truly done a wonderful job with this song.\r\nYou have a sweet and tender voice, and you chose a great song to showcase it. Your tone quality and intonation were great. They were very fitting with the overall mood of the song. There were a few moments where the musical notes weren’t quite reached, but they were subtle — more practice will help smooth this out very easily. I’d also encourage you to practice enunciating the words properly when you speak. Overall, this was a very touching performance. You’ve done really well! Keep up the great work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 20:47:58','2023-07-09 20:47:58'),(2258,'judge-event-evaluation-1488-1688900491',1488,17,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7409,4200,7460,33,'Open','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this great performance, Shalem! You have done a lovely job with this vocal solo.\r\nYour tone quality and intonation were awesome; however, there were some moments in this performance where the notes seemed a little of reach, more specifically the lower notes in the verses of the song. This is perfectly understandable as any female who has ever sang a song with low notes has experienced this before. However, there are two ways I would encourage you to deal with this — you could either choose a more comfortable key to sing the song or keep on practicing these lower notes. Nonetheless, you have done a wonderful job. Thank you for blessing us with this performance. Keep up the great work! God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 21:01:31','2023-07-09 21:01:31'),(2259,'judge-event-evaluation-1219-1688901180',1219,10,1,5,1,2023,271,'854',NULL,7279,1467,7460,33,'Open','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this extraordinary performance, Viola! You have done a beautiful job with this vocal solo.\r\nYour tone quality and intonation were AWESOME! What’s most spectacular is your vocal projection. In this performance, you had great control of your voice. Your diction and word emphasis were also very strong. Most of all, it was great how this performance really fit the mood of the song.\r\nThis was beautifully done, Viola! Excellent job. Thank you for blessing us with this performance. Keep up the awesome work. God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 21:13:00','2023-07-09 21:13:00');
INSERT INTO `judgeevaluations` VALUES (2260,'judge-event-evaluation-896-1688904179',896,8,1,5,1,2023,251,'777','1',0,6328,7459,27,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Hi guys! Thank you so much for this entry! Our God certainly is great and that is something you can smile about even while you are playing! Please remember to walk on and off even while in a recording situation. Also, it is best to wait for the music to fully end before acknowledging those who are listening. I would love to hear a greater range of dynamics from you all as this would also help to have a better balance between the different parts being played and allow for the melody to be heard better. I would appreciate a score showing all the parts being played - more than just the melody. \r\nYou all play together really well and I hope that you continue to develop your musical talents together. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 22:02:59','2023-07-09 22:02:59'),(2263,'judge-event-evaluation-1226-1688904253',1226,28,1,5,1,2023,251,'777','1',0,5806,7459,27,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,-2.00,'Hi team! Great work here today! I wish I could see more of you smiling! Remembering the name of this song should be enough to make you smile! A few thoughts for you all:\r\n - Dynamics: try to have some more highs and lows in the piece. This can be accomplished through having less people playing in certain parts, but it can also be done through every person playing much softer. Doing this will really add to the overall impact of your performance. \r\n - Please remember to have your score to be arranged in a way that lines up with what you will be playing. \r\n - Length of song: I had to deduct points because the song was 7:03 long which is over the 5 min time limit.\r\n - Remember to exit the stage as this is also part of the performance. \r\nNonetheless, great job to every single one of you. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 22:04:13','2023-07-09 22:04:13'),(2264,'judge-event-evaluation-697-1688904364',697,17,1,5,1,2023,180,'461',NULL,7411,4200,7459,11,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Floren! Thanks for a great entry here!\r\nThe angle and shape of the cat\'s body and neck do not seem quite natural to me. However, I appreciate your attention to detail with the colouring that would be affected by the light coming from the right of the artwork. I am not fully convinced by the texture of the eyes in contrast to the rest of the artwork. Nonetheless, a well done piece of digital art. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 22:06:04','2023-07-09 22:06:04'),(2265,'judge-event-evaluation-1044-1688910377',1044,28,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7247,5806,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,82.00,-10,0.00,'That\'s one very nice and clean looking DMax you found Rehan.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. No matter what event you enter, read through the judges forms before writing your report. This will give you an idea of what the judges are looking to score you against, and to help you know what to write. 2. Give as many details as you can about how you took your photo. I was interested to see you had to climb a ladder for this one. Nice angle. 3. Enhancements - I can see that you cropped your image to eliminate distracting elements. Well done for that. However, you haven\'t mentioned anything about that in your report. Don\'t forget to tell us if you\'ve done something to enhance your photo, or chosen not do anything because you liked it. 4. Your camera did well in auto mode, but if you want to try any manual settings for different shots Galaxy phones have a PRO mode where you can change aperture, shutter speed etc. 5. Resolution. Fortunately your photo was quite clear. Be sure to use high resolution, clear images whether submitting digitally or printing. Smaller resolution images start to look grainy on lines instead of sharp and clear.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 23:46:17','2023-07-09 23:46:17'),(2266,'judge-event-evaluation-767-1688910975',767,25,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7339,5804,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,66.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Rushikesh.\r\nA few tips for next time. 1. Exposure/Lighting. Your sky has really overexposed here, which makes it very bright and distracting from your subject. Think about the time of day you want to take your photo. How will the light hit your subject, and how will the sky look. Also, try using some manual settings. You can lower the Exposure Value (EV) on most phone cameras in the PRO mode setting. Don\'t go too low though as this will make your image darker on the whole. Sometimes lowering the EV by -0.3 to -0.7 can make a big difference. 2. Resolution. Whether you are printing or submitting your photo digitally, always use a high resolution image. Lower resolution images won\'t be as sharp, and lines and edges start to look soft and blurred. 3. Report. For any event you enter, read through the judges form first before writing your report. This will give you a better idea of what you need to tell the judges about your photo. 4. Enhancements. Please tell us if you used or chose not to use any enhancements on your photo.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-09 23:56:15','2023-07-09 23:56:15'),(2267,'judge-event-evaluation-1129-1688911674',1129,46,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7443,4504,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,73.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Stan! You\'ve done well to get rid of most of the distracting elements, and your framing is quite good.\r\nA few things for next time. 1. Report. No matter what event you enter, always read the judges form first. It will help you know what you are being scored against. It will also show you what things you need to include in your report. The more details we know about how you took the photo, the higher your score could potentially be. 2. Exposure. I\'m not certain if it was the light or the manual settings, but your roof and sky are showing a lot of glare from overexposure. There are a few things you can do to prevent this. 1. Correct shutter speed. 2. Consider the time of day and natural light. 3. In the case of your camera, use a polarising or ND filter on the lens. 4. Lower the EV value (slightly) on the camera. I find that -0.3 to -0.7 can work well, but don\'t go too strong. This setting makes your photo darker as well. 3. Enhancements. Let us know if you used any enhancements, or if you chose not to use any tell us that too. 4. Focus. On the whole, your photo is quite good. Just be sure to check your focus settings as there were some parts which are not as clear as others. This could be a setting issue. Keep experimenting with focus and then enlarge your photos to check them out afterwards. Unless you are using a deliberately soft focus, you want your lines to be sharp and clear.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 00:07:54','2023-07-10 00:07:54'),(2268,'judge-event-evaluation-974-1688912423',974,25,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7348,5804,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,68.00,-10,0.00,'Lovely photo Terumah! I like the way you\'ve tried to look through the awning into the area in the building.\r\nA few things for next time. 1. ISO. ISO is the light sensitivity of your sensor. It used to relate to the sensitivity of film in the same way. In this case, your camera has automatically used a high level ISO setting due to the lower light. Unfortunately, in every camera high ISO results in what is called \"noise\". This means that your picture has become grainy/pixellated instead of clear. You can use manual settings on most cameras (including phones with PRO modes) to limit the ISO level and prevent this. Just be aware that a lower ISO setting may result in the camera needing a longer exposure. This might mean you need to use a tripod or something to stabilise it so you don\'t get hand shake instead. 2. Report. For any event  you enter, have a read through the judges forms before submitting your report. This will help you to know what information the judges require, and help you know what to include in your report. 3. Low light photography. There are several ways to do this. Small aperture, long shutter, tripod, and ND filters are just some of the ways people get great shots in low light. Sometimes though you might need to seek out a camera with a bigger lens and sensor to get the right low light shots. Wider apertures can help with these too. Aperture numbers are written as F on the camera or the lens. The lower the number, the wider the aperture has gone and the more light it will let into the camera. 4. Image quality. For any photo you submit, whether digital or print, be sure to include a high resolution image. This will ensure your edges and lines are clear and sharp.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 00:20:23','2023-07-10 00:20:23'),(2269,'judge-event-evaluation-1045-1688913031',1045,28,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7252,5806,7480,2,'Collection','9',100,75.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Tubutubu! You\'ve done well getting a shot of the bridge without any traffic. That isn\'t always easy.\r\nA few things for next time. 1. Report. Always read through the judges form before writing your report (for any event you enter). That way you will know what information the judges are looking for to mark your entry. Tell us more about how you set up and took your photo. 2. Composition. Your subject for this photo was the bridge, but over 50% of your photo here is sky. Consider how you\'re setting up your shot, what your subject will be, and then make sure they stand out clearly as your subject.  A different angle might have made your subject more obvious.\r\n3. Enhancements. Please tell us about any enhancements you might have used for your photo. If you chose not to enhance it, tell us that too. 4. Clouds can be a pain for overexposure. Be careful when setting up your shot. Consider the light angle where possible.\r\nLooking forward to your next photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 00:30:31','2023-07-10 00:30:31'),(2270,'judge-event-evaluation-1445-1688983504',1445,25,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7357,5804,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Katarina! Great song, and well suited to your voice! A few missed notes, and it would be great to have some more expression in there (dynamics particularly), but overall great job, keep it up!\r\n\r\nGod bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 20:05:04','2023-07-10 20:05:04'),(2271,'judge-event-evaluation-1253-1688983871',1253,11,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7025,613,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Kathleen, I love the joy on your face - it is obvious that this is something that you truly believe, it\'s not just a song! \r\nIt would be great to add in some more expression; use dynamics and phrasing to add even more into the song, and just bring it to another level!\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 20:11:11','2023-07-10 20:11:11'),(2274,'judge-event-evaluation-481-1688984346',481,15,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7047,4679,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Keisha! you have a lovely voice, and it is well suited to the song. I also love your expression, you showed a lot of passion!\r\nIt would be good to organize an accompaniment - either a teacher or fellow student, or you can buy full band accompaniments online for a few dollars - this will help you with your intonation and staying in tune.\r\nKeep up the good work, God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 20:19:06','2023-07-10 20:19:06'),(2275,'judge-event-evaluation-1206-1688988168',1206,21,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7155,5805,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Mihaela, most beautiful. And what a great message! You performed well, and had great expression. I do just feel that perhaps you might be able to go up a key or two for that first bit. Not enough to make the bridge difficult tho!\r\n\r\nKeep up the excellent work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 21:22:48','2023-07-10 21:22:48'),(2276,'judge-event-evaluation-1191-1688988545',1191,46,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7442,4504,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Miranda, and great choice of song - well suited to your voice! It would be great to add in some more dynamics and tempo variance to get even more expression in - there is a lot that is possible with this song! Not sure if you have heard the recording, but when Ron Hamilton sings it, it slows down and crescendos in the last chorus, really makes an impact!\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 21:29:05','2023-07-10 21:29:05'),(2277,'judge-event-evaluation-508-1688988909',508,3,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,6972,1678,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Phebe! It\'s not a Hillsong piece i know (surprised my own self), and you did well! A few shaky notes with intonation, but nothing too major. It would be good to get more expression in, really sing and feel the words that you are sharing with us!\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 21:35:09','2023-07-10 21:35:09'),(2278,'judge-event-evaluation-1163-1688989326',1163,46,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7445,4504,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Priscilla! Great song, this is one of my favourites - I performed it as part of a trio when I competed at Convention! A couple of things to improve - try to work on where you take breaths. try to take them where a lyrical phrase ends (full stop or comma), rather than in the middle of a phrase. Also, not sure if it\'s the way that you learned it, but it should be \"You alone are my Strength my Shield\", so that it rhymes with \"yield\". :)\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 21:42:06','2023-07-10 21:42:06'),(2279,'judge-event-evaluation-670-1688989905',670,8,1,5,1,2023,258,'804',NULL,7083,6328,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Valerie, I love this song! One of my absolute favourites! A few times that your intonation could be tighter, but overall a great job. One thing to watch tho is the \'sliding\' to the notes - try to hit them true, rather than sliding up til you get there - it will have a much greater impact.\r\nKeep practicing, and keep praising! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 21:51:45','2023-07-10 21:51:45'),(2280,'judge-event-evaluation-692-1688990293',692,20,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7169,394,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,57.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your effort Oliver. A clear shot with good lighting. However, it does not really have a point of interest, no colour to pull your eye in, no cool shapes... it is a picture of some air-con units.\r\nArt needs to say something, represent something, and ultimately, point to God - in this category, highlighting our God-given creativity to build and make.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 21:58:13','2023-07-10 21:58:13'),(2281,'judge-event-evaluation-642-1688990672',642,3,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,6979,1678,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Phua, it is an intriguing building for certain! And great job capturing the shape from a moving vehicle! You could do a lot with enhancements however - a bit of contrast and colour boosting to emphasize both the buildings and lessen the \'greyness\' of the day. Also cropping and rotating - get rid of the rain drops, and make the ground horizontal, would do wonders for the photo!\r\nKeep up the good work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 22:04:32','2023-07-10 22:04:32'),(2282,'judge-event-evaluation-1044-1688991230',1044,28,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7247,5806,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Rehan! I like red vehicles myself, and the Hilux is a bit of a beast! Great subject! It would be good to play with the angles - when I am photographing cars, I like to highlight some particular feature or line, even when I am shooting the whole vehicle. Either that, or because it is a vehicle, see if you can capture some implied movement or something like that.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 22:13:50','2023-07-10 22:13:50'),(2283,'judge-event-evaluation-767-1688992256',767,25,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7339,5804,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your effort Rushikesh, some great angles and shapes in your pic! You do need to work on your angle however - look at where the lines are going. Also, it is quite washed out - a bit of contrast and colour boosting would do absolute wonders! \r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 22:30:56','2023-07-10 22:30:56'),(2284,'judge-event-evaluation-1129-1688992783',1129,46,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7443,4504,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Stan, I like the angles! You have composed well, giving something that naturally draws the eye in. It would be good to play with the contrast and exposure a bit - the sky is very bright. Also, maybe just crop some of the sky and ground out, it\'s just empty space.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 22:39:43','2023-07-10 22:39:43'),(2285,'judge-event-evaluation-974-1688993248',974,25,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7348,5804,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your efforts Terumah, there is a lot of potential here. It is difficult in low light, but you need to try and keep the camera as steady as you can so that it is nice and clear. Also, make sure that your strong lines (like the posts) work to draw the eye in, rather than distract.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 22:47:28','2023-07-10 22:47:28'),(2286,'judge-event-evaluation-1045-1688993728',1045,28,1,5,1,2023,161,'402',NULL,7252,5806,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Tubutubu, a lot of potential here! Bridges make great subjects, as they speak to creativity and strength. You do need to make sure that your subject is clear however. Try to make sure that there is not anything in the background (or foreground) that distracts from the subject.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-10 22:55:28','2023-07-10 22:55:28'),(2288,'judge-event-evaluation-529-1689062352',529,3,1,5,1,2023,214,'650',NULL,6965,1678,6,19,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Vinsentius. Just some feedback to help for future conversations. Walking on and off camera wasn’t shown as per guidelines requirements and the memorization. Other than that, keep up the great work. Well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-11 17:59:12','2023-07-11 17:59:12'),(2289,'judge-event-evaluation-1218-1689062388',1218,10,1,5,1,2023,214,'650',NULL,7279,1467,6,19,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well well well done Viola. Beautiful voice. Just two things that will help for future conventions that were on the online guideline requirements. Walking on and off camera wasn’t shown and the chord chart was submitted instead of the score sheet. Other then that, keep up the great work. Well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-11 17:59:48','2023-07-11 17:59:48'),(2290,'judge-event-evaluation-1047-1689073185',1047,28,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7270,5806,7440,2,NULL,'8,10',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Alina! Its very beautiful photo! But you can try with half with cloud and half less cloud it would be more interesting! Have a great day!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-11 20:59:45','2023-07-11 20:59:45'),(2291,'judge-event-evaluation-1102-1689073356',1102,13,1,5,1,2023,162,'403',NULL,7183,4208,7440,2,NULL,'10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Aviella Vanua! I really like your photo!  I can feel the vibes through it! Hope you enjoy your holiday!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'202