ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-12 18:00:48','2023-07-12 18:00:49'),(2321,'judge-event-evaluation-1271-1689148901',1271,8,1,5,1,2023,170,'414','1',0,6328,5,4,'Collection','19',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great presentation and topic, Michael. \r\nSometimes the transitions were just a bit too quick for me to read the information. You can always ask someone else to watch your presentation and time how long it takes them to read through and process the words. Here they can also check for spelling or grammatical errors. \r\nThe presentation has nice flow and is simple which lets the audience focus on your content. Next time stretch yourself to add more creativity to the design. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-12 18:01:41','2023-07-12 18:01:41'),(2322,'judge-event-evaluation-351-1689149221',351,12,1,5,1,2023,170,'414','1',0,1132,5,4,'Collection','19',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful presentation! I love that all of the photos are taken by yourself and your family. \r\nYou have obviously taken the time to make it engaging and with good flow. There was just one or two slides that were a little too fast to read everything and to look at the photos, but mostly this was very well timed. \r\n\r\nGreat job!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2023-07-12 18:07:01','2023-07-12 18:07:02'),(2323,'judge-event-evaluation-1508-1689149495',1508,17,1,5,1,2023,160,'401',NULL,7382,4200,5,2,'Collection','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great photograph Hajean! The eyes and face are in great focus and really stand out. It is difficult to photograph a moving object like an animal. Well done. \r\n\r\n\r\nI unfortunately could not mark all criteria because there was no original ph