 of lost coin in the Bible. Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:20:17','2024-07-04 07:20:17'),(2502,'judge-event-evaluation-3494-1720042000',3494,111,6,11,2,2024,163,'404',NULL,7718,55,7165,2,'Collection','12',100,75.00,-10,0.00,'Marisa, this is a good photo. It\'s an action photography and it would have been really great if you were in on the action alongside your brother. When it comes to photography, you need to focus on 1 subject. So in your photo, you could have blurred the background so that we would focus only on your brother & the good shot on the red(I\'m assuming) rugby ball.\r\nI look forward to more work from you, keep taking photos, you have an amazing talent.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:26:40','2024-07-04 07:26:40'),(2504,'judge-event-evaluation-2022-1720042422',2022,134,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7158,5805,7847,12,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Bethany! You have captured the beauty of God\'s creation. Keep up the creativity that you have in you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:33:42','2024-07-04 07:33:42'),(2506,'judge-event-evaluation-3505-1720042530',3505,111,6,11,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7639,55,7839,2,'Collection','5,11',100,91.00,-10,-5.00,'Wow!! This picture is vey cute indeed .You have such a neat perspective .Great work .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:35:30','2024-07-04 07:35:30'),(2512,'judge-event-evaluation-3496-1720042799',3496,111,6,11,2,2024,176,'454',NULL,7778,55,7165,2,'Open','12',100,91.50,-10,0.00,'This is an amazing photo Eunchong. Great vision, just a few pointers to help in future. Your brother\'s left foot got a little cut-off when the print came out, maybe you could have moved you camera a bit down to capture his whole frame in mid-leap! But great creativity, keep it up. You have a great eye for good shots & the vision to take awesome photographs.\r\nLove to see more of your work.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:39:59','2024-07-04 07:39:59'),(2514,'judge-event-evaluation-2020-1720043058',2020,134,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7113,5805,7847,12,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'What a wonderful scene depicting the verse you have chosen. Font and text size used is good, maybe by bringing it down a bit would have been great as it won\'t hide the bottom part of your picture/photo. Good Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:44:18','2024-07-04 07:44:18'),(2517,'judge-event-evaluation-3495-1720043086',3495,111,6,11,2,2024,176,'454',NULL,7793,55,7165,2,'Open','12',100,75.50,-10,0.00,'Great photo Junhyeok. However, there are too many subjects on your photo to focus on, maybe blur a bit of your background. The color is amazing & the backdrop is good also. I like your friend\'s focus on the ball. \r\nKeep up the good work. Continue to take photos so your can enhance your talent.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:44:46','2024-07-04 07:44:46'),(2525,'judge-event-evaluation-1850-1720043281',1850,115,6,11,2,2024,6,'12',NULL,7521,5804,7549,6,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for effort and submission. A creative poem that is enjoyable to read. for future references try to use more poetic devices. All the best and continue to pursue your poetry writing talent. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:48:01','2024-07-04 07:48:01'),(2526,'judge-event-evaluation-3497-1720043397',3497,111,6,11,2,2024,164,'405',NULL,7654,55,7168,2,'Collection',NULL,100,82.50,-10,NULL,'Thank you Chanhee Hwang! Well done. You could do better in enhancing your picture (Colour, Lighting and Exposure).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:49:57','2024-07-04 07:49:57'),(2532,'judge-event-evaluation-2051-1720043636',2051,144,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7225,1404,7847,12,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,NULL,NULL,'Simple yet effective. Well Done Melody! I love your idea and how you  chose to portray it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:53:56','2024-07-04 07:53:56'),(2533,'judge-event-evaluation-1985-1720043688',1985,134,6,11,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7154,5805,7860,17,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work Jovilisi. You have confidently constructed your subject well and you have good choice of colors.Looking forward to seeing more of your colored pencil sketches in the future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:54:48','2024-07-04 07:54:48'),(2537,'judge-event-evaluation-3792-1720043782',3792,134,6,11,2,2024,5,'009','1',0,5805,7166,9,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Sally Sauni. Yes, money is important for life but we must be wise and let God be our true wealth. Remember to include a bibliography in future projects. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:56:22','2024-07-04 07:56:22'),(2538,'judge-event-evaluation-3301-1720043841',3301,111,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7791,55,7844,2,'Open','8',100,50.00,-10,NULL,'Should have excluded the part of the airplane from photo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:57:21','2024-07-04 07:57:21'),(2539,'judge-event-evaluation-3794-1720043870',3794,134,6,11,2,2024,5,'009','3',0,5805,7166,9,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done Jordan Konrote.  Your work was neatly presented and informative.  Thank you for the timely reminder to be thrifty and not wasteful of God\'s blessings. Remember to include a bibliography in future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:57:50','2024-07-04 07:57:50'),(2540,'judge-event-evaluation-3299-1720043878',3299,111,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7690,55,7162,2,'Open','8',100,49.00,-10,-2.00,'Hi Josephine. Thank you for your entry. I felt that the sunset pic captured could have included more colour to bring out its effect at first glance.\r\n\r\nAlso check with the size. I measured a 9cm. The minimum is 10cm. There must also be an original photograph attached to the report.\r\n\r\nThank you and God bless.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:57:58','2024-07-04 07:57:58'),(2541,'judge-event-evaluation-3793-1720043882',3793,134,6,11,2,2024,5,'009','2',0,5805,7166,9,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Gianna Vunibobo. Yes, our lives must be centred on eternal values rather than temporary wealth. Well done. Please include a bibliography in future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:58:02','2024-07-04 07:58:02'),(2542,'judge-event-evaluation-3536-1720043931',3536,111,6,11,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7703,55,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Gabrielle ! You\'ve done well to translate the picture into a watercolor painting.You have a good eye for art , keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 07:58:51','2024-07-04 07:58:51'),(2545,'judge-event-evaluation-2019-1720044130',2019,134,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7125,5805,7847,12,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Good Job Charliz! Your color combination on the poster really is eye-catching. I feel that your verse  could have been brought down a wee bit as to not obstruct the picture of the beautiful orchids.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:02:10','2024-07-04 08:02:10'),(2546,'judge-event-evaluation-3515-1720044192',3515,111,6,11,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,77