L,7696,55,7162,2,'Open','8',100,48.00,-10,-2.00,'Bula Eroni,\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry. You mentioned a rainbow in your report. It would have been nice to have it included. Don\'t forget to include the original pic attached to your report. \r\n\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:20:09','2024-07-04 08:20:09'),(2580,'judge-event-evaluation-3526-1720045223',3526,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7672,55,7165,2,'Open','11',100,77.50,-10,-5.00,'Great work Jialiang. I like the subjects you\'ve chosen. Maybe asked the Coffee Hub staff if you would like to use a chair to take the photos of those items so that they are within your \'line of thirds\'. I believe you were seated and took the photo. The background is amazing as well as the lighting-I love this part of our photo, that sofa that\'s popping out at the corner should have been cropped away. Your matting should be within the guidelines. Always check that.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:20:23','2024-07-04 08:20:23'),(2581,'judge-event-evaluation-1973-1720045288',1973,134,6,11,2,2024,152,'370',NULL,7117,5805,7857,69,'Open',NULL,95,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jianing for your entry. A simple pattern with its own beauty. \r\nWell done, ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:21:28','2024-07-04 08:21:28'),(2582,'judge-event-evaluation-2054-1720045306',2054,144,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7230,1404,7847,12,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,NULL,NULL,'Very creative Taraivini. This message/verse goes well with the picture and everything else you have chosen. Great Work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:21:46','2024-07-04 08:21:46'),(2585,'judge-event-evaluation-3533-1720045667',3533,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7741,55,7165,2,'Open','11',100,79.50,-10,-3.00,'Well done Yeon-Hee. I like what you did for your photograph. You were able to line up your item against a great background. The silver flute really stands out from the pink sofa background. The distracting detail was the line on the sofa, it took focus away from the flute. Just check your photo before you submit because it is a really great photo. Also your matting cuts-off bits of your flute so pay attention to those things. Keep trying, with practice, you can enhance your talent.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:27:47','2024-07-04 08:27:47'),(2589,'judge-event-evaluation-1832-1720046000',1832,134,6,11,2,2024,6,'12',NULL,7150,5805,7549,6,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You have shown emotion and expression. Please try to be more positive in composing a poem and refer to your guideline when writing. Continue to pursue poetry writing and never give up. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:33:20','2024-07-04 08:33:20'),(2590,'judge-event-evaluation-3529-1720046319',3529,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7784,55,7165,2,'Open','11',100,74.50,-10,-3.50,'Thank you for your entry Kamatai. I\'m not so sure about your photograph! But I\'ll try and help you get better the next time you do photography! First of all, your angle should have been more vertical so that we can see this important time for you. The side images & objects distract us from your main photo or subject. Make sure you check your photo or ask your Supervisor their input so they can advise you on what to do. The colors are amazing and your exposure is good. Keep working on your talent.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:38:39','2024-07-04 08:38:39'),(2591,'judge-event-evaluation-3131-1720046385',3131,111,6,11,2,2024,8,'014',NULL,7675,55,7550,8,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,0.00,'A job well done Jiaqi! I thoroughly enjoyed reading your book report. I thought you captured the main points and the biblical principal very well. However, I thought it would have been great to add an introduction to your report as it would have given the readers some direction before jumping to the characters. I appreciate your book choice. Definitely sounds like a great read!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:39:45','2024-07-04 08:39:45'),(2592,'judge-event-evaluation-3522-1720046719',3522,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7792,55,7165,2,'Open','11',100,71.00,-10,-5.00,'Great work Adil but this photo should be under NATURE because GENERAL is for objects, food, toys & other general goods.\r\n\r\nThank you for your effort.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 08:45:19','2024-07-04 08:45:20'),(2593,'judge-event-evaluation-3295-1720047008',3295,111,6,1