he crochet stitches but nothing is mentioned in your report. \r\n\r\nWith the skills you already have, I hope you will continue to work and create some wonderful crochet pieces to bless others. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 09:41:16','2024-07-04 09:41:16'),(2684,'judge-event-evaluation-3463-1720050162',3463,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7672,55,7542,2,'Open','10',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Very impressive to see your picture, nice shot but need to improve a lot. Try different techniques for the photo to stand out. Too many distracting elements  and more things can be done to make your scape photography look better. Include your original photo.\r\n\r\nAll the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 09:42:42','2024-07-04 09:42:42'),(2686,'judge-event-evaluation-3300-1720050204',3300,111,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7717,55,7844,2,'Open','8',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 09:43:24','2024-07-04 09:43:24'),(2689,'judge-event-evaluation-1975-1720050320',1975,134,6,11,2,2024,152,'370',NULL,7159,5805,7861,69,'Open',NULL,95,88.00,-10,NULL,'Report was not completed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 09:45:20','2024-07-04 09:45:20'),(2691,'judge-event-evaluation-3524-1720050354',3524,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7685,55,7165,2,'Open','11',100,81.50,-10,-4.00,'The photo is awesome Chazaq. Great composition. However, yo