401',NULL,7703,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Gabrielle,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. It is a beautiful picture. Just some improvement that you can work on for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that your subject (flower) is focused. \r\n2. Make sure there are no distractions when the subject is centered. You can always crop them out. \r\n3. Make sure that your photo is mounted and not to be framed. \r\n4. Make sure that your photo is aligned with the board that is mounted on.\r\n\r\nOther than that, great effort Gabrielle. Much appreciated. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:28:58','2024-07-04 12:28:58'),(3065,'judge-event-evaluation-2705-1720060206',2705,111,6,11,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7674,55,7752,2,'Collection','5,7',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kohana! Just a few points to consider,\r\n- make sure that the photo is taken by you and not any other family member. Also,you are not to be in the picture\r\n- no selfies for potraiture entry since you are suppose to be taking the photo.\r\n-take note that you do not zoom in the photo too much when taking one.\r\n-there should be no distraction elements but only humans to be the center of focus in the picture. Distraction in your picture can be the hat and the background trees.\r\n-no informal hand gestures is permitted.\r\n-also remember to attach a copy of your picture with the report form in your next convention.\r\n-take note to use the correct measurements for matting as well\r\nAgain, thank you Kohana for doing your best. Much appreciated. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:30:06','2024-07-04 12:30:06'),(3066,'judge-event-evaluation-2081-1720060247',2081,134,6,11,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7143,5805,7549,6,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Very Interesting! continue moving forward with poetry writing. Keep up it!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:30:47','2024-07-04 12:30:47'),(3067,'judge-event-evaluation-3667-1720060348',3667,111,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7671,55,7550,7,'Collection',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Well Done! This is a very well written story. I think you did an exceptional job with your composition. While I do think you did an amazing job with your Biblical theme and resolving the conflict between the two friends, I can\'t help but wonder about the conflict between the two brothers. It would have been great to see them resolve their issues as well to tie in with your Bible verse. Nonetheless, well done! I look forward to reading more of your work in future Student Conventions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:32:28','2024-07-04 12:32:28'),(3068,'judge-event-evaluation-3320-1720060434',3320,111,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7652,55,7165,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,-2.00,'Great effort Dyana. But remember, in this category, you either choose VEHICLE or STRUCTURE! You should pick 1 event. The trees also obscure those beautiful buildings so maybe take the photo from a different angle.\r\n\r\nThank you, God Bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:33:54','2024-07-04 12:33:54'),(3069,'judge-event-evaluation-3457-1720060451',3457,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7685,55,7542,2,'Open','10',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Chazaq Renzo\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry.\r\nIt is a beautiful picture and try different techniques for the photo to stand out.\r\nInclude your original photo.\r\n\r\nGod Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:34:11','2024-07-04 12:34:11'),(3070,'judge-event-evaluation-3283-1720060692',3283,111,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7780,55,7844,2,'Open','8',100,51.00,-10,NULL,'Photo has been edited heavily thus losing its vibrancy.\r\nDescription must explain clearly what were .......... *the finishing touches added',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:38:12','2024-07-04 12:38:12'),(3072,'judge-event-evaluation-3543-1720060699',3543,111,6,11,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7783,55,7757,17,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Piece not submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:38:19','2024-07-04 12:38:19'),(3073,'judge-event-evaluation-3271-1720060771',3271,111,6,11,2,2024,169,'413',NULL,7737,55,7839,13,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work !! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:39:31','2024-07-04 12:39:31'),(3074,'judge-event-evaluation-3582-1720060786',3582,111,6,11,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7783,55,7757,17,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Piece not submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 12:39:46','2024-07-04