ther than that, great work Nyrav.\r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 13:57:41','2024-07-04 13:57:41'),(3234,'judge-event-evaluation-2617-1720065531',2617,149,6,11,2,2024,113,'302',NULL,7770,4678,7842,59,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Elimi. Great choice of message. The cross-hatch on the letters added a nice touch to the overall look of the item. I’d love to see what other projects you come up with in the future. Awesome job, Elimi.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 13:58:51','2024-07-04 13:58:51'),(3235,'judge-event-evaluation-3495-1720065675',3495,111,6,11,2,2024,176,'454',NULL,7793,55,7789,2,'Open','12',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Great shot ! \r\nWell taken photo with good lighting.\r\nWould be advisable to pay close attention to the composition of the photo and make sure that the main subject is the focus.Elimination of distractions i.e tower in corner , single leg caught in frame behind subject, would greatly enhance your photo..\r\nGreat effort !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 14:01:15','2024-07-04 14:01:15'),(3239,'judge-event-evaluation-2894-1720065745',2894,111,6,11,2,2024,20,'062',NULL,7690,55,7166,6,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry Josephine. Keep writing to improve your gift. Keep sharing and be a blessing through your poems.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 14:02:25','2024-07-04 14:02:25'),(3240