n\r\nOther than that, thank you again for your great effort Glorianna.\r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 14:04:34','2024-07-04 14:04:34'),(3244,'judge-event-evaluation-3588-1720065911',3588,111,6,11,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,7651,55,7234,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'You seemingly enjoy cartoon characters.\r\nUse like hatching and cross-hatching might be explored .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 14:05:11','2024-07-04 14:05:11'),(3249,'judge-event-evaluation-3581-1720065972',3581,111,6,11,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7697,55,7757,17,'Open',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort. Patience,  time and passion develop skills and talents. Explore color blending and strokes and shading techniques to create a challenging piece next time. Keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 14:06:12','2024-07-04 14:06:12'),(3250,'judge-event-evaluation-3457-1720065987',3457,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7685,55,7839,2,'Open','5,12,10',100,93.00,-10,-5.00,'I like the colors here, and the nice break that the buildings creates. Great effort .Thank you .\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 14:06:27','2024-07-04 14:06:27'),(3251,'judge-event-evaluation-3450-1720066001',3450,111,6,11,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7741,55,7165,2,'Open','9',100,74.00,-10,-2.00,'Great effort Yeon-Hee. However, make sure you are familiar with the requirements in the guideline on t