nPlease remember to read the guidelines for this event. It clearly states that projects must be kiln dried. Air dried clay is not permitted. Work must not be painted.\r\n\r\nThank you again for your effort and entry. I hope you try another piece next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 19:23:17','2024-07-04 19:23:17'),(3351,'judge-event-evaluation-2051-1720085862',2051,144,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7225,1404,7839,12,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,NULL,NULL,'Nice image and it deplicts the message that you want to share .Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 19:37:42','2024-07-04 19:37:43'),(3352,'judge-event-evaluation-1880-1720086348',1880,142,6,11,2,2024,20,'62',NULL,7567,4208,7166,6,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Well written and thought provoking.  Your efforts may inspire others to write poetry as well. Good job.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-04 19:45:48','2024-07-04 19:45:48'),(3370,'judge-event-evaluation-3271-1720120449',3271,111,6,11,2,2024,169,'413',NULL,7737,55,7168,13,'Collection',NULL,100,76.50,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Patty Prasad! Great effort, you could have stated your reference regards to your Graphic design (especially pictures of cup, etc.). Purpose and why you chose to promote Cafe Catture. Well done! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:14:09','2024-07-05 05:14:09'),(3372,'judge-event-evaluation-3670-1720120862',3670,142,6,11,2,2024,171,'415',NULL,7183,4208,7168,4,'Collection','20',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Aviella Vanua. Is it \"Prope & Quality Sleeping\" or \"Proper & Quality Sleeping\". Please no short cut abbreviation or slang. Careful, how to set your font size letter that they are not overlapping onto the next line. Overall, presentation is dictated clearly in theme and creativity but can improve more on Graphic design and degree of Difficulty.  Great Presentation Aviella! Good Job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:21:02','2024-07-05 05:21:02'),(3373,'judge-event-evaluation-2077-1720120976',2077,134,6,11,2,2024,171,'415',NULL,7143,5805,7168,4,'Collection','20',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jordan. Interesting choice of topic and quiet complex. Takes a lot of research to align with Biblical history events. Great Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:22:56','2024-07-05 05:22:56'),(3374,'judge-event-evaluation-3829-1720121847',3829,154,6,11,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7272,5806,7165,2,'Open','13',100,85.50,-10,0.00,'Great work Tamalesi. I also like the contrasting colors too. Keep working at perfecting this talent.\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best for Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:37:27','2024-07-05 05:37:27'),(3376,'judge-event-evaluation-3827-1720122116',3827,154,6,11,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7274,5806,7165,2,'Open','13',100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Awesome photo Vani. You can also go online and see how you can enhance your photo more- this will just assist you to take more beautiful photos in future. Keep working on this talent, you have the knack for it! I agree, God\'s Creation is awesome once you pay close attention to it!\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:41:56','2024-07-05 05:41:56'),(3379,'judge-event-evaluation-3828-1720122390',3828,154,6,11,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7273,5806,7165,2,'Open','13',100,95.00,-10,0.00,'This is an amazing photo so far in MACRO...thank you for choosing this category! Keep it up, this is great artwork! The praying mantis adds so much color contrast to your yellow buttercup flower...I love it!!\r\nKeep working on this talent.\r\n\r\nThank you, God Bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:46:30','2024-07-05 05:46:30'),(3382,'judge-event-evaluation-3833-1720122612',3833,154,6,11,2,2024,137,'352',NULL,7272,5806,7842,59,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Tama. Thank you for entering this event. I love the choice of your subject.. The level of detailing on your work is elite. The finishing on your project is very flawless. I’m sure your project took a lot of time and patience and by the results of your project I’m sure it was definitely worth it. Excellent job, Tama. I’d love to see what you have in store for future projects. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:50:12','2024-07-05 05:50:12'),(3383,'judge-event-evaluation-3884-1720122773',3884,142,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7183,4208,7165,2,'Collection','9',100,78.00,-10,-4.00,'Thank you for your work Aviella. However, always remember your photography guideline. You photo should be mounted on a matting board. Great effort & keep enhancing your talent. You need to include the original print of your photo too.\r\n\r\nGod bless and all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:52:53','2024-07-05 05:52:53'),(3385,'judge-event-evaluation-3885-1720123117',3885,142,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7175,4208,7165,2,'Collection','9',100,78.00,-10,-4.00,'Great effort Maraia. This is a great shot of the Windsor Castle, I would have loved if you could have included the pond as well. The way you captured the \"look out\" tower part of the castle is great! Love the small details on top of the tower!\r\nHowever, you need to know the guidelines for photography, focus on 1 subject, and to mount on a mattered board. I hope you take more photos in future.\r\n\r\nThank you, God Bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 05:58:37','2024-07-05 05:58:37'),(3386,'judge-event-evaluation-3994-1720123325',3994,144,6,11,2,2024,142,'358',NULL,7227,1404,7166,64,'Open',NULL,100,59.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Liora. A creative reminder of God\'s work on the fifth day. As I checked the guidelines for clay handbuilt, I note that all projects must kiln fired. Air dried clay is not permitted. Glazing is permitted. Thank you though for your effort and entry. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:02:05','2024-07-05 06:02:05'),(3387,'judge-event-evaluation-3806-1720123444',3806,154,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7264,5806,7165,2,'Collection','9',100,95.00,-10,0.00,'I love your photo Hadassah, it\'s so mysterious and detailed. Just a reminder, could have cropped out the Reserve Bank peeping in on the left of your photograph! I love the angle you used, it gives the cathedral that alluring yet calm & peaceful feel!\r\nKeep enhancing your talent.\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:04:04','2024-07-05 06:04:04'),(3389,'judge-event-evaluation-2659-1720125089',2659,111,6,11,2,2024,137,'352',NULL,7688,55,7842,59,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Ariana. Thank you for entering this event. Application of personalizing the text with an original song added deep meaning to your project. Great choice of color with the design on your project. Awesome job, Ariana. I would love to see what other projects you’ll come up with in the future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:31:29','2024-07-05 06:31:29'),(3392,'judge-event-evaluation-3834-1720125129',3834,154,6,11,2,2024,137,'352',NULL,7273,5806,7842,59,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Torika. Thank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject in your entry. Your project looks perfectly done. The finishing on your project is impressive. I appreciate the time and effort you put into your project. Fantastic job, Torika. I’d love to see what future projects you’ll come up with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:32:09','2024-07-05 06:32:09'),(3393,'judge-event-evaluation-2661-1720125162',2661,111,6,11,2,2024,137,'352',NULL,7695,55,7842,59,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jihun. Great subject choice. Make sure you take good care of your project and place the label card on the top left corner of your item. Keep practicing. Good effort, Jihun. I’m excited to see what you have in store with your future projects. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:32:42','2024-07-05 06:32:42'),(3394,'judge-event-evaluation-3814-1720125334',3814,154,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7264,5806,7165,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Entry submitted twice...We\'ve judged the 1st!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:35:34','2024-07-05 06:35:34'),(3395,'judge-event-evaluation-3523-1720125344',3523,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7780,55,7759,2,'Open','11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Your story does make a lot to your photo. Thank you for a job well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:35:44','2024-07-05 06:35:44'),(3396,'judge-event-evaluation-1644-1720125514',1644,115,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7525,5804,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Samuel,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. However, just a few points for you to consider for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that your subject (plant) is centered and focused.\r\n2. Make sure that you take the full picture of the plant.\r\nOther than that, thank you for your great effort Samuel.\r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:38:34','2024-07-05 06:38:34'),(3397,'judge-event-evaluation-2048-1720125649',2048,144,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7217,1404,7550,7,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'A great effort Jessie! Good job with your composition. I would like to encourage you to keep working on your writing. I appreciate how you tied in your Biblical theme. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:40:49','2024-07-05 06:40:49'),(3398,'judge-event-evaluation-4002-1720125698',4002,144,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7612,1404,7165,2,'Collection','9',100,92.00,-10,0.00,'Awesome photograph Jessica. I love the angle as well as that subtle light reflection from the lower part of the building- it\'s a magnificent structure & you just added to that allure & mysterious aura of the building. And at night, with that lighting-just amazing work!\r\nKeep taking photos to enhance your talent.\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Student Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:41:38','2024-07-05 06:41:38'),(3400,'judge-event-evaluation-3802-1720126018',3802,154,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7272,5806,7162,2,'Open','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Tamalesi\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry. It definitely is glowing. Love how it stands out in the pic amongst the green. \r\n\r\nAll the best and God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:46:58','2024-07-05 06:46:58'),(3401,'judge-event-evaluation-3402-1720126027',3402,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7639,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Hannah,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. It is indeed a one of a kind hawk. Good shot! This can be kept as a memory collection. Just some improvements you can work on for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that the subject (hawk) is centered and focused. \r\n2. Make sure there are no distractions on the subject (the distraction are the leaves that is distracting the focus on the subject)\r\n\r\nOther than that, great job Hannah. \r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:47:07','2024-07-05 06:47:07'),(3402,'judge-event-evaluation-3532-1720126121',3532,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7683,55,7759,2,'Open','11',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'This a beautiful photo especially with the different colors on the sky showing the reflection in the sea.\r\nHowever, too much of the sky is a distraction and this should be entered under \"General\"\r\nThank you for your good work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:48:41','2024-07-05 06:48:41'),(3404,'judge-event-evaluation-3798-1720126178',3798,154,6,11,2,2024,18,'060','1',0,5806,7860,9,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you ,Zerubbabel, for your excellent presentation about your Social Studies Research. You have some wonderful findings and am sure that as you continue to search more you will find that The Bible - God\'s Word is definitely true.\r\nLooking forward too see more of your findings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:49:38','2024-07-05 06:49:38'),(3408,'judge-event-evaluation-3801-1720126398',3801,154,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7267,5806,7162,2,'Open','8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Narieta.\r\n\r\nGreat pic of the moon - like a huge ball in the night sky!\r\n\r\nAll the best and God bless!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:53:18','2024-07-05 06:53:18'),(3409,'judge-event-evaluation-3971-1720126486',3971,144,6,11,2,2024,131,'323',NULL,7611,1404,7857,70,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Hannah,thank you for your entry. A handy bag for use. Here are some hints to guide you in your next venture:\r\n1. Finishing  - all loose threads should be neatly tucked into the stitches for a neat finish. \r\n2. For this bag - having two handles would give the bag balance. \r\n3. For a classy look, a button fastened at the top with a loop to hold it in place would give your work a professional finish. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:54:46','2024-07-05 06:54:46'),(3411,'judge-event-evaluation-3428-1720126585',3428,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7737,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Patty,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. Just something that you can take note of, the angle of taking the picture (The cat\'s face looks bigger than the body). Other than that, great job Patty. \r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:56:25','2024-07-05 06:56:25'),(3412,'judge-event-evaluation-2004-1720126655',2004,134,6,11,2,2024,16,'58','1',0,5805,7166,1,'Collection','4',100,79.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done Eliki Boletawa. Yes, an inspirational project on a local solar bus station. Many lives will be impacted with this type of innovative thinking. Remember to include a bibliography. \r\n\r\nGreat entry!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:57:35','2024-07-05 06:57:35'),(3414,'judge-event-evaluation-2005-1720126706',2005,134,6,11,2,2024,16,'58','2',0,5805,7166,1,'Collection','4',100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done Jordan Konrote. An informative and relevant project on a desalination plant. I would have liked to see arrows to indicate the sequence of steps on the project. Remember to include a bibliography in future. All the best at 2024 Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:58:26','2024-07-05 06:58:26'),(3416,'judge-event-evaluation-3797-1720126731',3797,154,6,11,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7272,5806,7860,17,'Open',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort shown on this art piece,  Tamalesi.\r\nYou have neatly colored your subject and I\'m sure that in the future you could use multiple textural effects on your subject. \r\nKeep practicing to enhance your colored pencil sketching skills.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:58:51','2024-07-05 06:58:51'),(3417,'judge-event-evaluation-3517-1720126740',3517,111,6,11,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7745,55,7803,2,'Collection','11',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Tane! \r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:59:00','2024-07-05 06:59:00'),(3418,'judge-event-evaluation-3334-1720126757',3334,111,6,11,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7800,55,7165,2,'Open','9',100,61.50,-10,-10.00,'Thank you for your work Daniel. Please remember the proper guidelines for photography. \r\nDO NOT enclose photographs in picture or photo frames. Photographs that are framed in glass or\r\nenclosed in frames will not be accepted at Exhibits.\r\n\r\nAll the best at Convention 2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 06:59:17','2024-07-05 06:59:17'),(3423,'judge-event-evaluation-3929-1720126891',3929,111,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7797,55,7162,2,'Open','8',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sebastian,\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry.\r\n\r\nRemember to attach your original pic with your report.\r\n\r\nAll the best and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:01:31','2024-07-05 07:01:31'),(3424,'judge-event-evaluation-3581-1720126911',3581,111,6,11,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7697,55,7860,17,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your art piece. You may improve in the future  with your choice of colors to have a balanced tone and colors  and making its perspective more convincing.\r\nMore practice will perfect your colored pencil sketching skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:01:51','2024-07-05 07:01:51'),(3425,'judge-event-evaluation-3589-1720126955',3589,111,6,11,2,2024,195,'507',NULL,7648,55,7789,56,'Collection',NULL,100,39.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for putting forth the effort Adora\r\nSadly your documentation isnt complete with the print paper that was used , and your print should not be framed as per the guidelines.\r\nIt would be great to go through the guidelines just so you\'re aware of whats needed.\r\nDon\'t stop creating ! Keep aiming higher,you have so much ability.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:02:35','2024-07-05 07:02:35'),(3426,'judge-event-evaluation-3813-1720126984',3813,154,6,11,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7275,5806,7752,2,'Open','5,9',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Sonya,\r\nThank you for the great effort in participating for this entry. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-make sure that your subject(building)is centered or focused.\r\n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear shot.\r\nThank you for your participation Sonya and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:03:04','2024-07-05 07:03:04'),(3427,'judge-event-evaluation-3723-1720127006',3723,142,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7175,4208,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Maraia Nasilasila. Please, taking quote from a Bible be specific if you are taking only partial of the quote from one verse. I John 4:8 Anyone who does not love does not know God, because God is love. Careful with colour of choice for background for your text and degree of difficulty. Great Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:03:26','2024-07-05 07:03:26'),(3428,'judge-event-evaluation-3435-1720127039',3435,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7740,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka David,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. However, there are some improvements you can work on for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that the subject is centered and focused. \r\n2. Make sure that there are no distractions. (the dog collar chain is a distraction)\r\n3. Make sure that you take the picture at an angle so the full picture of the dog is not too close.\r\n\r\nOther than that, thank you for your effort David. \r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:03:59','2024-07-05 07:03:59'),(3429,'judge-event-evaluation-3870-1720127040',3870,142,6,11,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7570,4208,7844,2,'Open','8',100,59.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:04:00','2024-07-05 07:04:00'),(3430,'judge-event-evaluation-3443-1720127070',3443,111,6,11,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7788,55,7165,2,'Open','9',100,75.50,-10,0.00,'Great picture Jonathan. However, please remember in the guidelines, you are supposed to have an original photo attached with your report. And remember to focus on 1 subject, it\'s either structure OR vehicle!\r\nKeep enhancing your talent.\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:04:30','2024-07-05 07:04:31'),(3432,'judge-event-evaluation-3877-1720127178',3877,142,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7556,4208,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'