g)is centered or focused.\r\n-make sure that your photo is not \'too zoomed in\', or not too close. You can step back a little bit more and take a clear shot of the whole building.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear shot.\r\n-always remember to attach a copy of your original picture with your report form.\r\nThank you for your participation, Danny and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:17:08','2024-07-05 07:17:08'),(3456,'judge-event-evaluation-3665-1720127846',3665,111,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7648,55,7847,7,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely story with a good story line. Well written Adora!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:17:26','2024-07-05 07:17:26'),(3458,'judge-event-evaluation-3526-1720127869',3526,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7672,55,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'This a nice photo.\r\nYou have too many things to show in this photo and I think it will be great to focus on one thing at a time. Keep trying!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:17:49','2024-07-05 07:17:49'),(3459,'judge-event-evaluation-3813-1720127910',3813,154,6,11,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7275,5806,7165,2,'Open','9',100,89.50,-10,0.00,'Great work Sonya. However, the magnificence of that building was overshadowed by the palm tree leaves & the other blue building in the background! This takes the focus out from your main subject!\r\nI hope that you will continue enhancing your talent so that you keep getting better at it!\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:18:30','2024-07-05 07:18:30'),(3460,'judge-event-evaluation-3377-1720127912',3377,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7671,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Florence,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. Just some improvements you can work for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that your subject (palm tree) is centered and focused. \r\n2. Make sure there are no distractions\r\nOther than that, great job Florence. \r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:18:32','2024-07-05 07:18:32'),(3462,'judge-event-evaluation-3990-1720127944',3990,115,6,11,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,7352,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'A brave attempt which I trust you enjoyed.\r\nTake a look into perspectives for future works.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:19:04','2024-07-05 07:19:04'),(3463,'judge-event-evaluation-3927-1720127967',3927,142,6,11,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7183,4208,7757,53,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort. Keep at developing your skills and techniques for better results. Keep up with your passion and talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:19:27','2024-07-05 07:19:27'),(3466,'judge-event-evaluation-3781-1720127993',3781,111,6,11,2,2024,