llection Henrietta Paulo. Very interesting bank notes. It would have been interesting to include the different metals and weights of each coin. Remember to include a bibliography in future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:37:20','2024-07-05 07:37:20'),(3515,'judge-event-evaluation-3528-1720129044',3528,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7690,55,7759,2,'Open','11',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'This is beautiful!\r\nThis should be entered under \'Event/Action.\"\r\nThank you for your hard work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:37:24','2024-07-05 07:37:24'),(3516,'judge-event-evaluation-3949-1720129084',3949,115,6,11,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7521,5804,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your hard work Andrea !\r\nWatercolor can be quite tricky to work with and blend because of how unpredictable it is.\r\nContinue painting and practicing your skills, and watch your artwork go to higher levels \r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 07:38:04','2024-07-05 07:38:04'),(3517,'judge-event-evaluation-3815-1720129090',3815,111,6,11,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7726,55,7857,54,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Taleah, thank you for your entry. Memories of self and family are precious. I think that a lot more can be done creatively in your scrapbook to show those memories. It is not just sticking on photos and writing a comment. Scrapbooking is much more than that. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU