n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo. For example, trees.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear shot of scenery.\r\n-a kind request also is that, reports are to be answered in detail as required per instuctions.\r\n-make sure that the photo is clear and every small details are visible.\r\n- a copy of the original photo is to be attached with the report form.\r\n-photos are to be mounted neatly with the correct required minimum or maximum measurements.\r\nThank you for your participation Adil and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:06:04','2024-07-05 08:06:04'),(3581,'judge-event-evaluation-2562-1720130809',2562,149,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7772,4678,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Abraham Saqusaqu. You could improve more on clarity and visual impact if the colour contrast/harmony balance works correctly to give more subtle view. Great job and well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:06:49','2024-07-05 08:06:49'),(3582,'judge-event-evaluation-3896-1720130812',3896,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7711,55,7860,12,NULL,NULL,100,47.00,NULL,NULL,'Not much effort is shown on this art piece and your work is a reflection of just copying and pasting, Samiu.\r\nPlease refer to the guidelines and source out more information on how to design posters.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:06:52','2024-07-05 08:06:52'),(3584,'judge-event-evaluation-3538-1720130859',3538,111,6,11,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7718,55,7757,17,'Collection',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort! Keep developing your skills and techniques for better results, especially in color mixing and consistency and strokes to shading. Background shades would have given depth and perspective to your piece. Practice makes perfect. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:07:39','2024-07-05 08:07:39'),(3585,'judge-event-evaluation-3875-1720130869',3875,142,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7558,4208,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Yuvaan. Thank you for entering this event. Great subject choice. I love the vibrant colors in the photo. Make sure to thoroughly fill in the report form. Awesome work, Yuvaan. I’m looking forward to seeing what future photo ideas you come up with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:07:49','2024-07-05 08:07:49'),(3586,'judge-event-evaluation-3920-1720130885',3920,111,6,11,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7798,55,7165,2,'Open','11',100,80.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your photo Runjie. It\'s a beautiful picture of that structure! However, remember your guideline-you need to have the original print of your photo attached to your report.\r\nAlso you need to make sure that it is only the structure you are taking the picture of-exclude the people. Maybe you should have taken this photo when the streets were empty!\r\nGood effort! God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 