,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:09:12','2024-07-05 08:09:12'),(3592,'judge-event-evaluation-3995-1720130977',3995,144,6,11,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7222,1404,7857,69,'Open',NULL,95,71.00,-10,NULL,'Esther, thank you for your entry. A fair effort to show case your skills and talent. I want to encourage you to continue with embroidery work and learn the many variety of stitches embroidery has to offer. Another important aspect of embroidery work is how to finish off your stitches neatly. \r\nAll the best in your future endeavors. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:09:37','2024-07-05 08:09:37'),(3593,'judge-event-evaluation-3262-1720130986',3262,111,6,11,2,2024,19,'061',NULL,7686,55,7551,5,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you for your participation Hyeok Jung Hook! You have written on an interesting essay topic and discussed valid points pertaining to the topic. Due to the topic being controversial try to be firm in your argument and convincing to persuade the readers to your viewpoint. Remember to include word count and try to use larger point for ease of reading. Build a conclusion with the use of descriptive words to reaffirm your thesis statement. May God bless and guide you with your writing skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:09:46','2024-07-05 08:09:46'),(3594,'judge-event-evaluation-3248-1720131024',3248,111,6,11,2,2024,14,'056','3',0,55,7166,1,'Open','3',100,58.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Eunchong Lee for your research. It was interesting. \r\n\r\nI gathered from your paper that your research was on water striders as a title was missing on the documentation. Thank you for the photographs of the process. A bibliography is needed. \r\n\r\nPlease check guidelines for any future research. All the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:10:24','2024-07-05 08:10:24'),(3595,'judge-event-evaluation-3993-1720131082',3993,115,6,11,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,7362,5804,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your art piece !\r\nAs it is pen and ink , try to avoid heavy pencil lines that cant be erased,and overuse of smudging as a shading technique.\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:11:22','2024-07-05 08:11:22'),(3596,'judge-event-evaluation-3809-1720131124',3809,154,6,11,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7269,5806,7542,2,'Collection','7',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Agape Seavula.\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry.This picture is so beautiful.  \r\nAmazing as always.\r\n\r\nThank You and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:12:04','2024-07-05 08:12:04'),(3598,'judge-event-evaluation-2697-1720131189',2697,111,6,11,2,2024,158,'376',NULL,7779,55,7844,72,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'As there was no pattern submitted, judging could not be done accurately',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:13:09','2024-07-05 14:12:27'),(3599,'judge-event-evaluation-3439-1720131267',3439,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7726,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,81.