ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:17:04','2024-07-05 08:17:04'),(3609,'judge-event-evaluation-3840-1720131446',3840,154,6,11,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,7260,5806,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Jimaima !\r\nRemember , sometimes , less is more.\r\nHeavy , dark shading looks amazing , but also having a bit of \'white space\' also helps make your pen and ink \'pop!\'\r\nYou have amazing abilities , and you can achieve so much,keep on creating !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:17:26','2024-07-05 08:17:26'),(3610,'judge-event-evaluation-3908-1720131503',3908,111,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7717,55,7839,12,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for the great effort . Great work ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:18:23','2024-07-05 08:18:23'),(3611,'judge-event-evaluation-3440-1720131522',3440,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7679,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Tiare,\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. Just some improvements you can work on for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that you have a proper lighting and color adjustments.\r\n2. Make sure that there are no distractions (houses) \r\nOther than that, great effort Tiare. \r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:18:42','2024-07-05 08:18:42'),(3612,'judge-event-evaluation-2605-1720131551',2605,149,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7774,4678,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Vincent. You could work more on degree of difficulty. Note your message is I am the true vine, yes, I can see the vine in your posters but what is it got to do with 3 men beating another person. I can\'t see the connection. Please be specific with your message and picture, align them together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:19:11','2024-07-05 08:19:11'),(3613,'judge-event-evaluation-3455-1720131596',3455,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7688,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Ariana,\r\nThank you for this beautiful scape of Malamala Beach. Good job!. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo. In your picture, it would be the green plant on the right.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear shot.\r\n-Also, don\'t forget to attach an original copy of your photo with your report form.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your great effort Ariana and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:19:56','2024-07-05 08:19:56'),(3615,'judge-event-evaluation-2049-1720131636',2049,144,6,11,2,2024,19,'061',NULL,7227,1404,7551,5,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you for your participation, Liora! Your essay contains some very interesting points to ponder on and include an interesting read. Your thesis statement would be more effective if you rephrased it and also avoid using personal pronouns. Hence, it should read something like this. This essay discusses the importance of young believers attending church hence avoiding ambiguities and run-on sentences. A firm conclusion also to clinch all your points together. Otherwise, you did great! May God bless and guide you in your writing skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:20:36','2024-07-05 08:20:37'),(3616,'judge-event-evaluation-3992-1720131671',3992,115,6,11,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,7357,5804,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,52.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for expressing yourself in your art !\r\nKeep on practicing , and learning new skills , and your art will thrive .\r\nKeep on creating !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:21:11','2024-07-05 08:21:11'),(3617,'judge-event-evaluation-3971-1720131739',3971,144,6,11,2,2024,131,'323',NULL,7611,1404,7861,70,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'beautiful piece',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:22:19','2024-07-05 08:22:19'),(3618,'judge-event-evaluation-3883-1720131812',3883,142,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7183,4208,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Aviella. Thank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject. I love the color scheme. The focus is parted to the right side of the photo. Make sure to center the subject so that it’s focus of the camera is fully on the subject. Good effort, Aviella. I’d love to see what photo ideas you have in store for future projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:23:32','2024-07-05 08:23:32'),(3619,'judge-event-evaluation-3991-1720131933',3991,115,6,11,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,7358,5804,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Misiafa !\r\nUsing consistent strokes and hatching will greatly enhance your art.\r\nSometimes even a blank white space , will aid as well \r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:25:33','2024-07-05 08:25:33'),(3620,'judge-event-evaluation-3441-1720131934',3441,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7715,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Timoci,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. Just some improvements you can work on for next year:\r\n1. Make sure that your subject (orchid) is centered and focused.\r\n2. Make sure that there are no distractions (distractions are other plants, road, houses from afar that is distracting the focus of the subject)\r\nOther than that, great effort Timoci. \r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:25:34','2024-07-05 08:25:34'),(3621,'judge-event-evaluation-3811-1720131971',3811,154,6,11,2,2024,164,'405',NULL,7270,5806,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'This is the best photo I\'ve seen so far. You did a fantastic job, Alina.\r\nA green frame would be even better for your beautiful photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:26:11','2024-07-05 08:26:11'),(3622,'judge-event-evaluation-3669-1720132031',3669,111,6,11,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7736,55,7549,6,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for submitting your poetry and taking the interest. Please continue to excel in this area. Try to use poetic devices to better your poem in the future. Overall, in up the good work. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:27:11','2024-07-05 08:27:11'),(3626,'judge-event-evaluation-1903-1720132414',1903,142,6,11,2,2024,19,'61',NULL,7567,4208,7551,5,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you for your participation, Lin. The content of your essay is interesting and convincing; however, it needs to be per in such a way that it creates a counter argument scenario. Therefore, try to rephrase your topic to a question form or in such a way a two-way opinion is presented. That will call for an interesting and challenging read. Take note of the conclusion part, it need not be too lengthy on your summarizing your viewpoint. Keep up with your writing skills and God bless! Include word count, please.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:33:34','2024-07-05 08:33:35'),(3631,'judge-event-evaluation-2893-1720133233',2893,111,6,11,2,2024,20,'062',NULL,7688,55,7551,6,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your participation, Ariana. Your poem was a delight to read. Keep up the good work! May God bless and guide you as you pursue your writing talent! Take note with your font size for ease of reading.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:47:13','2024-07-05 08:47:13'),(3632,'judge-event-evaluation-2701-1720133339',2701,111,6,11,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7667,55,7542,2,'Collection','7',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Dear Corina Pickering.\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry.\r\n\r\nVery impressive to see the picture but need to improve a lot.Try different techniques for the photo to stand out. Some distracting elements and more things can be done to make your portraiture look better.\r\n\r\nInclude your original photo.\r\n\r\nThank you and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:48:59','2024-07-05 08:48:59'),(3635,'judge-event-evaluation-1916-1720133559',1916,144,6,11,2,2024,20,'62',NULL,7224,1404,7551,6,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your participation, Bulou Vasiti. Your effort is commendable, and the poem is an enjoyable read. You may also add more poetic devices and descriptive words to create images that stirs emotions befitting the title of your poem. May God guide and bless you as you pursue your writing skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:52:39','2024-07-05 08:52:39'),(3637,'judge-event-evaluation-3902-1720133629',3902,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7736,55,7860,12,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,NULL,NULL,'Great effort shown on this art piece,Zurelle. As you continue to practice you will explore many ways of designing and perfecting your poster designing skills. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:53:49','2024-07-05 08:53:49'),(3638,'judge-event-evaluation-2669-1720133666',2669,111,6,11,2,2024,142,'358',NULL,7717,55,7166,64,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Not submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:54:26','2024-07-05 08:54:26'),(