ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:56:35','2024-07-05 08:56:35'),(3646,'judge-event-evaluation-3941-1720133798',3941,111,6,11,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7702,55,7803,2,'Collection','11',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Clement. A few things to take into consideration are the focus, lighting, the angle, exposure, these will do more justice to your photo. As you have mentioned in your report where day and night engage in their soft embrace, a little bit more focus on the skies to show this embrace and perhaps the lighting and the sensible use of enhancements will fully bring out what you are trying to portray. Clement please have a read through the guidelines on what to take picture of- either food, toys or any general goods. Thank you.\r\n\r\nThank you and God Bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:56:38','2024-07-05 08:56:38'),(3647,'judge-event-evaluation-3442-1720133800',3442,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7736,55,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Zurelle,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. It is indeed a beautiful shot. Thank you for following the guideline accordingly. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:56:40','2024-07-05 08:56:40'),(3650,'judge-event-evaluation-1831-1720133819',1831,134,6,11,2,2024,20,'62',NULL,7129,5805,7551,6,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your participation, Christian! \r\nIt is encouraging to note attempt to write a good poem. Keep up this effort. \r\nRemember, poetry involves capturing the reader\'s attention and emotions through creative language and poetic devices.\r\nMay God guide and bless you as you pursue your writing skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:56:59','2024-07-05 08:56:59'),(3651,'judge-event-evaluation-3900-1720133865',3900,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7679,55,7860,12,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,NULL,NULL,'Well presented, Tiere. Excellent choice of photo and message.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:57:45','2024-07-05 08:57:45'),(3652,'judge-event-evaluation-3942-1720133886',3942,111,6,11,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7704,55,7803,2,'Collection','11',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Great focus Glorianna! However the timing, important is the time when you take photos of flowers, in the morning, lunch or evening to really bring out the true colors of the flowers. Again Glorianna please have a read at the guidelines it will give you an idea of what to take picture of. Overall wonderful effort.\r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:58:06','2024-07-05 08:58:06'),(3653,'judge-event-evaluation-3948-1720133949',3948,111,6,11,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7705,55,7803,2,'Collection','11',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Gaius! However your focus is important if your focus is on the flower other than the whole plant itself. Again please read the guidelines so it will give you a fair idea on what to take picture of.\r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 08:59