NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 09:19:51','2024-07-05 09:19:51'),(3703,'judge-event-evaluation-2058-1720135240',2058,144,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7612,1404,7847,7,'Collection',NULL,100,65.00,-10,-10.00,'Thank you Jessica! Your story line is good and you have a good ending. Please be mindful of your punctuation marks, etc and the other requirements needed for the judges form. Good Try.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 09:20:40','2024-07-05 09:20:40'),(3704,'judge-event-evaluation-3463-1720135248',3463,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7672,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jialiang,\r\nThank you for this beautiful scape entry. Great job! Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-your photo must be clear with visibility of detail.\r\n-you can always enhance your photo by adjusting the lighting and exposure of your photo.\r\n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo. In your picture, it would be the boats.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear shot.\r\n-Also, don\'t forget to attach an original copy of your photo with your report form.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your great effort Jialiang and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 09:20:48','2024-07-05 09:20:48'),(3706,'judge-event-evaluation-3928-1720135297',3928,142,6,11,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7568,4208,7757,17,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort! Keep developing your skills and techniques for better results. Shading, toning and blending give perspective and depth so master those te