scape entry. Great effort!. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-the subject must be centered or in focus in the middle of the picture.\r\n- you can use enhancements in give the picture a brighter look.\r\n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo. In your picture, it would be the house at the back of the palm trees.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear full view shot.\r\n-Also, don\'t forget to attach an original copy of your photo with your report form.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your great effort Jonathan and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 09:39:57','2024-07-05 09:39:57'),(3760,'judge-event-evaluation-3446-1720136400',3446,111,6,11,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7783,55,7165,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'No photograph at Pre-judging',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 09:40:00','2024-07-05 09:40:00'),(3761,'judge-event-evaluation-3814-1720136415',3814,154,6,11,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7264,5806,7803,2,'Collection','9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Hadassah! \r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 09:40:15','2024-07-05 09:40:15'),(3763,'judge-event-evaluation-3882-1720136487',3882,142,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7557,4208,7863,2,'Collection','5,8',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jia Yu,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your nature entry. Your work is appreciated. Just some improvements you can work on for next