own on this art pice, Nanise.\r\nConsider experimenting with different font colors to enhance the overall impact. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 10:42:51','2024-07-05 10:42:51'),(3899,'judge-event-evaluation-3483-1720140174',3483,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7690,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Josephine,\r\nThank you for this beautiful shot of Chinatown in London. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-when taking photos, make sure that there are no distractions around the subject. In your photo, the people and the hanging craft works are a distraction to the scape view of the city.\r\n-photos are to be mounted neatly and properly.\r\n-attach a copy of your original picture with your report form.\r\n-please see that you complete all details in the report before handing it in.\r\n\r\nGood effort Josephine and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 10:42:54','2024-07-05 10:42:54'),(3900,'judge-event-evaluation-4021-1720140196',4021,111,6,11,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7653,55,7757,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.50,-10,NULL,'Great effort! Keep developing your skills and techniques for better results. Practice makes perfect. Keep it up! Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 10:43:16','2024-07-05 10:43:16'),(3901,'judge-event-evaluation-3439-1720140232',3439,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7726,55,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Taleah. Thank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject. Awesome work T