he little distracting detail in your photograph. Keep enhancing your talent.\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:23:19','2024-07-05 12:23:19'),(4076,'judge-event-evaluation-3955-1720146218',3955,115,6,11,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7362,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'ALERT!!!!! THIS ITEM WAS ACCIDENTALLY  GIVEN COMMAND PERFORMANCE.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:23:38','2024-07-05 12:23:38'),(4077,'judge-event-evaluation-2704-1720146249',2704,111,6,11,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7684,55,7542,2,'Collection','7',100,68.00,-10,-2.00,'Dear Hadassah Halofaki.\r\n\r\nThank you for your entry.\r\n\r\nNeed to improve a lot in your portraiture.Try different techniques for the photo to stand out. The cropped of your portraiture must not below minimum and not above maximum print area with a maximum matboard size of 28cm x 36cm.\r\n\r\nRemember include your original photo.\r\n\r\nThank You and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:24:09','2024-07-05 12:24:09'),(4078,'judge-event-evaluation-3457-1720146288',3457,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7685,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,77.00,-10,-5.00,'Bula vinaka Chazaq,\r\nThank you for this beautiful shot of a cityscape. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-photos should be taken with a clear focus and not blurry.\r\n-when taking photos, make sure that there are no distractions around the subject. In your photo, the tree is a distraction to the scape view of the city.\r\n-photos are to be mounted with the correct measurements given in the guidelines.\r\n-make sure to complete every required blank in the report. None should be left blank.\r\n-attach a copy of your original picture with your report form.\r\n-the photo is blurry to which this can be considered as a breach of guideline because it is not clear enough to define the tiny bit of details in the photo.\r\n\r\nGood effort Chazaq and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:24:48','2024-07-05 12:24:48'),(4079,'judge-event-evaluation-4008-1720146324',4008,144,6,11,2,2024,190,'502',NULL,7213,1404,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Emerald!\r\nLove seeing how much you\'ve grown in your art.\r\nTip, painting the sides of your canvas would really make your piece complete\r\nKeep it up !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:25:24','2024-07-05 12:25:24'),(4080,'judge-event-evaluation-3865-1720146362',3865,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7642,55,7860,12,'Collection',NULL,100,59.00,NULL,NULL,'Good try, Jason.\r\nYou have an excellent message and the correct documentation completed but you failed to laminate your final piece. Keep referring  to the guidelines to help guide you with your design. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:26:02','2024-07-05 12:26:02'),(4082,'judge-event-evaluation-3490-1720146487',3490,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7783,55,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'No submission',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL