502',NULL,7704,55,7789,17,'Collection',NULL,100,50.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort !\r\nDue to how fast acrylics dries , how you blend and mix will play a big part in how the end product turns out.\r\nKeep creating and experimenting with techniques\r\nKeep it up! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:31:39','2024-07-05 12:31:39'),(4095,'judge-event-evaluation-3956-1720146743',3956,115,6,11,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7357,5804,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Katarina for your interest.\r\nAvoid the use of straight lines for outlining. \r\nI am sure that you can pursue this art form further.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:32:23','2024-07-05 12:32:23'),(4098,'judge-event-evaluation-3865-1720146997',3865,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7642,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Jashen. Note your poster was supposed to be laminated. The picture looks blurred so careful when you focus your device when taking pictures. Thus, Great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:36:37','2024-07-05 12:36:37'),(4099,'judge-event-evaluation-1876-1720146997',1876,142,6,11,2,2024,21,'63',NULL,7567,4208,7550,7,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,-5.00,'Well done, Xuanjun! You did an excellent job capturing the attention of your reader with your choice of descriptive words. A very well written story. Please be mindful to state your word count at the end of your presentation. Keep up the great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL