 that you need to have an original print of your photography attached to your report! Also it has to be matted and not on stretched canvas!\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:54:05','2024-07-05 12:54:05'),(4149,'judge-event-evaluation-3866-1720148057',3866,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7643,55,7860,12,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Great choice of photo to convey your message, Kendra. Keeping experimenting  different fonts sizes to enhance your poster designing skills. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:54:17','2024-07-05 12:54:17'),(4150,'judge-event-evaluation-3564-1720148076',3564,111,6,11,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7740,55,7234,17,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'The blue mount detracts from the framed subject.\r\nThank you Si Hun; I am sure that you enjoyed this.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:54:36','2024-07-05 12:54:36'),(4151,'judge-event-evaluation-2700-1720148121',2700,111,6,11,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7687,55,7844,2,'Collection','7',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 12:55:21','2024-07-05 12:55:21'),(4153,'judge-event-evaluation-3907-1720148142',3907,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7675,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Jiaqi. Great photo for your poster and inspiring Bible verse, blends perfectly. Good job.',NULL,NULL,