Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Amelia.\r\nRefined cutting skills can be used to add lines to depict the pineapple, fruit and leaves.\r\nI am sure that you will pursue this art form further.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:09:35','2024-07-05 14:09:36'),(4397,'judge-event-evaluation-3983-1720152633',3983,115,6,11,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7350,5804,7166,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Not submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:10:33','2024-07-05 14:10:33'),(4401,'judge-event-evaluation-3407-1720152709',3407,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7675,55,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jiaqi. Thank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject. I’d advise you to center the subject a bit more. Decent effort, Jiaqi. I’m excited to see what future photo ideas you have in store.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:11:49','2024-07-05 14:11:49'),(4402,'judge-event-evaluation-1644-1720152729',1644,115,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7525,5804,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Samuel. Thank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject. Loved the color in the photo. You would’ve gotten a few more marks if you had a more natural background. Decent effort, Samuel. I’d like to see what future photo ideas you’ll come up with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:12:09','2024-07-05 14:12:09'),(4403,'judge-event-evaluation-3889-1720152749',3889,142,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7559,4208,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Really nice shot !\r\nLove the vibrancy and colors.\r\nWould\'ve loved another angle that eliminates those shadows, so that it\'s a consistently lit image.\r\nGreat job !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:12:29','2024-07-05 14:12:29'),(4404,'judge-event-evaluation-3475-1720152784',3475,111,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7777,55,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Wonderful photography Minsol. This is an amazing picture. The blue water and sky contrast beautifully with the louds and the sand on the beach. \r\nRemember you have to attach an original print of your photo with your report.\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best for Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:13:04','2024-07-05 14:13:04'),(4405,'judge-event-evaluation-4011-1720152808',4011,144,6,11,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7216,1404,7847,17,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you  Abigail! Very simple but effective; I hope you understand that you only need to use colored pencils and nothing else. Anyway have another read through the guidelines.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:13:28','2024-07-05 14:13:28'),(4406,'judge-event-evaluation-2051-1720152812',2051,144,6,11,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7225,1404,7162,12,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Melody.\r\n\r\nHe definitely is THE Way Maker!\r\n\r\nAll the best and God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:13:32','2024-07-05 14:13:32'),(4407,'judge-event-evaluation-3872-1720152839',3872,142,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7567,4208,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,83.00,-10,-5.00,'Bula vinaka Lin,\r\nThank you for this beautiful scape shot that you took. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo. In your picture, it would be the roof of another house right in front of the camera.\r\n-you can always change the angle from where you take the photo, as long as it is a clear shot.\r\n-just try to do your mounting properly by using a hard board attach to the back of your photo.\r\n-Also, don\'t forget to attach an original copy of your photo with your report form.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your great effort Lin and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:13:59','2024-07-05 14:13:59'),(4408,'judge-event-evaluation-3983-1720152841',3983,115,6,11,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7350,5804,7847,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Entry not submitted. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:14:01','2024-07-05 14:14:01'),(4418,'judge-event-evaluation-4040-1720153309',4040,142,6,11,2,2024,183,'464',NULL,7568,4208,7857,4,'Open','19',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'A very creative and informative production. However you have used a picture of a man that is not wearing a Tshirt or shirt. This is a bridge to convention rules. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:21:49','2024-07-05 15:25:10'),(4420,'judge-event-evaluation-4059-1720153310',4059,111,6,11,2,2024,195,'507',NULL,7667,55,7234,56,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'The PRINT is without proper mounting and sturdiness.\r\nPursue further the cutting techniques to enhance your work.\r\nThank you Corina for your interest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:21:50','2024-07-05 14:21:51'),(4421,'judge-event-evaluation-3409-1720153311',3409,111,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7698,55,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Joshua. Thank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject. I absolutely love color scheme. The photo was a bit blurry, but a great overall photo. Good effort, Joshua. I’m excited to see what future photo ideas you’ll come up with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:21:51','2024-07-05 14:21:51'),(4423,'judge-event-evaluation-3473-1720153314',3473,111,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7718,55,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Such a great photo !\r\nMaybe a little touch up with slight enhancements to raise the contrast would make the picture really stand out.\r\nNice work !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 14:21:54','2024-07-05 14:21:55'),(4426,'judge-event-evaluation-3935-1720153399',3935,142,6,11,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7567,4208,7166,17,'Open',NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Xuanjun. Coloured pastels must be built up gradually starting with light open lines of colour which are