1,'503',NULL,7259,5806,7867,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your artwork Abigail. Continue to grow your skills as an artist, and you will improve. But thank you for your effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 20:23:32','2024-07-05 20:23:32'),(4581,'judge-event-evaluation-4010-1720175109',4010,144,6,11,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7612,1404,7847,17,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job  Jessica! Even only using 3 colors makes your stand out.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 20:25:09','2024-07-05 20:25:09'),(4585,'judge-event-evaluation-1636-1720175462',1636,115,6,11,2,2024,7,'13',NULL,7352,5804,7550,7,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Ratu Laione! I thoroughly enjoyed reading your short story. You did well to capture the main conflict and as well your Biblical theme. I appreciated the way you introduced your deuteragonist. However, I thought you could have used more descriptive words to capture the emotion for Bob\'s reason for going to live with his grandfather. You have a real gift for writing. Keep it up! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 20:31:02','2024-07-05 20:31:02'),(4586,'judge-event-evaluation-3666-1720175547',3666,111,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7676,55,7550,7,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,-10,0.00,'What a beautiful story Jessira! Such a powerful testimony of God\'s redemption. I love how you brought the Biblical theme across. Please note that your entry is in correct order when submitting. Keep up the great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 20:32:27','2024-07-05 20:32:27'),(4598,'judge-event-evaluation-3555-1720178001',3555,111,6,11,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7663,55,7867,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Piece not submitted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 21:13:21','2024-07-05 21:13:21'),(4599,'judge-event-evaluation-3957-1720178017',3957,115,6,11,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7350,5804,7867,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Piece not submitted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 21:13:37','2024-07-05 21:13:37'),(4600,'judge-event-evaluation-3836-1720179691',3836,154,6,11,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7816,5806,7166,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Zerubbabel. \r\n\r\nColour is built up gradually in pastels with light open lines and overlaid to produce the effects and visual blending. You have to keep your entry \"clean\" as pastels can be easily smudged.\r\n\r\nKeep working and improving in the process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 21:41:31','2024-07-05 21:41:31'),(4601,'judge-event-evaluation-4010-1720180422',4010,144,6,11,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7612,1404,7166,17,'Collection',NULL,100,45.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jessica.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended that colour be built up gradually in pastels, starting with light open lines of colour which are overlaid to produce the colour effects and visual blending. Special attention should be given to keeping your entry \'clean\' as pastels can easily be smudged.\r\n\r\nKeep trying and learning in the process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 21:53:42','2024-07-05 21:53:42'),(4603,'judge-event-evaluation-3975-1720181174',3975,115,6,11,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7520,5804,7166,17,'Collection',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Lily.\r\n\r\nIt is recommended that colour be built up gradually starting with light open lines of colour which are overlaid to produce the colour effects and visible blending. \r\n\r\nSpecial attenton should be given to keeping the entry \'clean\' as pastels can easily be smudged.\r\n\r\nKeep trying and learning in the process.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 22:06:14','2024-07-05 22:06:14'),(4604,'judge-event-evaluation-2651-1720182627',2651,111,6,11,2,2024,111,'300',NULL,7716,55,7842,57,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'No art submitted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 22:30:27','2024-07-05 22:30:27'),(4607,'judge-event-evaluation-2662-1720182747',2662,111,6,11,2,2024,137,'352',NULL,7783,55,7842,59,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'No art submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-05 22:32:27','2024-07-05 22:32:27'),(4608,'judge-event-evaluation-2660-1720182755',2660,111,6,11,2,2024,137,'352',NULL,7797,55,7842,59,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'No art submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL