L,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 06:52:07','2024-07-06 06:52:07'),(4685,'judge-event-evaluation-3860-1720212754',3860,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7705,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,59.50,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Gaius. There is more room for improvement. Be careful when doing your laminating as it leaves gap in between. Not compressed properly. A good picture taken but please read the guidelines, no sleeveless is allowed in poster photography convention. Otherwise, Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 06:52:34','2024-07-06 06:52:34'),(4686,'judge-event-evaluation-3819-1720212840',3819,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7263,5806,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,98.00,-10,0.00,'This is amazing photography! I love the colors, how the sun is peeping from under the clouds, and the shimmering light reflections in the sea-just awesome! The jetty and rock formation does distract us a bit but I believe it just adds to the beauty hidden in the photo. God is indeed a God of diversity-coz He loves those colors!\r\nKeep enhancing your skill & talent. Thank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.\r\n ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 06:54:00','2024-07-06 06:54:00'),(4689,'judge-event-evaluation-3812-1720212948',3812,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7816,5806,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Stunning photo ! Captures the beauty of God\'s creation extremely well\r\nThe rock face overlooking the hills is amazing\r\nKeep it up !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 06:55:48','2024-07-06 06:55:48'),(4691,'judge-event-evaluation-3484-1720212987',3484,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7793,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jack,\r\nThank you for the great effort in participating for this entry. Just a few pointers to take note of;\r\n-make sure that your subject is eye-catching and is centered or focused.\r\n-make sure that there are no distractions in the way of the subject. Crop out distraction elements if they are in the photo. For example, the powerlines in your photo.\r\n-always remember to attach a copy of your original picture with your report form.\r\n\r\nThank you for your participation Jack and wishing you all the very best for convention. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 06:56:27','2024-07-06 06:56:27'),(4692,'judge-event-evaluation-3822-1720213184',3822,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7814,5806,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,78.50,-10,0.00,'Well-done David. Just a few things to remember, need to light up your photo a bit so we can clearly see the detail on that photo! I love the color contrast of the mountains, maybe that\'s a bit too much of exposure or filter used! The sky looks amazing, just need a bit of light on the grass!\r\nGood effort, thank you.\r\nGod bless & all the best at Convention 2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 06:59:44','2024-07-06 06:59:44'),(4693,'judge-event-evaluation-3818-1720213231',3818,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7813,5806,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Shalom !\r\nLove the blue of the sky matching the sea below\r\nJust a few slight distractions and inconsistencies \r\