4-07-06 07:06:57','2024-07-06 07:06:57'),(4714,'judge-event-evaluation-4046-1720213780',4046,154,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7260,5806,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jimaima. Thank you for entering this event. Great subject choice. I love the contents of the photo. There were issues with the focus and alignment of the subject. The subject should’ve been more centered, nonetheless decent Jimaima. I’m excited to see what photo ideas you have in store for future projects.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:09:40','2024-07-06 07:09:40'),(4715,'judge-event-evaluation-3485-1720213897',3485,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7784,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Kamatai,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting your piece of work. Just a few pointers of improvements for your next convention,\r\n-make sure a full detailed explanation is written for better judgement to the reader who is judging your work.\r\n-there has to be a clear focus of your subject. Do not overdo enhancements on the photo so that we can see the tiny details of the photo.\r\n-an original picture must be attached with your report form.\r\n\r\nI appreciate your great effort Kamatai. Thank you and all the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:11:37','2024-07-06 07:11:37'),(4716,'judge-event-evaluation-3858-1720214105',3858,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7671,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,61.50,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Florence. Be careful when taking pictures that the purpose and message blends in well with your poster. Eliminate doubts of other elements. Example: Dark shapes as it distracts the purpose of your poster. Creative but can do better. Otherwise, Good effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:15:05','2024-07-06 07:15:05'),(4719,'judge-event-evaluation-3823-1720214186',3823,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7270,5806,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Alina. I love the colors and how they come alive even when at the end of the day! I have just a few pointers to help you in future. Always pay attention to when you are taking your photos. The lamp posts, as well as that half visible pathway can take our attention away from that beautiful scape!\r\nOverall, well-done! Thank you, God bless & all the best for Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:16:26','2024-07-06 07:16:26'),(4720,'judge-event-evaluation-4054-1720214221',4054,154,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7259,5806,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Abigail. Thank you for entering this event. Lovely choice of subject. I love the mixtures of colors in the photo. The focus is great. I took points off the composition because of the building in the background. Fantastic work, Abigail. I’d love to see what future photo ideas you’ll come up with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:17:01','2024-07-06 07:17:01'),(4721,'judge-event-evaluation-3458-1720214230',3458,111,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7680,55,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Sadly it appears that your entry may have been water damaged before arriving for judging,so I can\'t make a fair and accurate assessment\r\nKeep on creating , and hope to see more of your work in future!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:17:10','2024-07-06 07:17:10'),(4722,'judge-event-evaluation-4048-1720214355',4048,154,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7264,5806,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Hadassah. Thank you for entering this event. Great flower choice. I love the colors on the photo. Great coloring on your item. Make sure to center the subject a bit more, nonetheless awesome effort, Hadassah. I look forward to seeing what future photo ideas you have in store.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:19:15','2024-07-06 07:19:15'),(4723,'judge-event-evaluation-3821-1720214503',3821,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7266,5806,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Awesome photo Eliana. I like the blue, and the cluster of clouds. Love the trees and the roofs of the buildings bring contrasts to the photo! Just be careful to crop away distracting details like the coconut leaf on the top right-hand corner!\r\nWell-done. Keep enhancing your skill & talent. \r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:21:43','2024-07-06 07:21:43'),(4724,'judge-event-evaluation-3856-1720214508',3856,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7669,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Eunyul. There is more room for improvement. Great picture poster with Bible verse. It matches and blends in well. Great Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL