ious. Great Effort and well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:33:31','2024-07-06 07:33:31'),(4733,'judge-event-evaluation-3487-1720216228',3487,111,6,11,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7798,55,7752,2,'Open','5,10',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Runjie,\r\n\r\nThank you for the great effort of submitting your work. Just a few reminders,\r\n- just make sure there are no distractions around the focus. The subject must be a clear shot of a scape. No cars nor persons or anything else to be obstructing the scape view.\r\n- make sure to write a detailed report of how you came to your end result.\r\n- a copy of your original picture must be attached with your report form.\r\n\r\nOverall, good job! Thank you and all the best in your preparations for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:50:28','2024-07-06 07:50:28'),(4734,'judge-event-evaluation-3821-1720216271',3821,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7266,5806,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Nicely done Eliana ! \r\nContinue to grow your skills and techniques \r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:51:11','2024-07-06 07:51:11'),(4737,'judge-event-evaluation-4056-1720216477',4056,111,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7721,55,7165,2,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you Nanise for the beautiful photo of Kadavu. There is beauty in God\'s creation so your photo just captures the essence of His creativity. Love the unique rock formations, as well at the green trees but my absolute favorite is your ability to capture the waves breaking on the beach and the greenish blue of the sea. Love the sky colors too!\r\nAlso remember to have your DESCRIPTION box filled in your report.\r\nWell-done, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:54:37','2024-07-06 07:54:37'),(4738,'judge-event-evaluation-3852-1720216511',3852,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7680,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Dong. There is more room for improvement. Message blends in with your poster picture but could work around on text orientation. Otherwise, Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:55:11','2024-07-06 07:55:11'),(4740,'judge-event-evaluation-4055-1720216699',4055,111,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7720,55,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort Melania. Your photo is beautiful but you could have zoomed just a bit(10%) to capture the essence of the Horizon. There are a lot of distracting features on your photo which can take away focus from your subject which is that beautiful horizon! Keep enhancing your skill & talent.\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best at Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 07:58:19','2024-07-06 07:58:20'),(4741,'judge-event-evaluation-3848-1720216829',3848,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7746,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Cypress. Be careful with your font colour that is should be seen clearly. Great picture and well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:00:29','2024-07-06 08:00:29'),(4742,'judge-event-evaluation-3889-1720216896',3889,142,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7559,4208,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Mosese. Keep enhancing your skill & talent. Love this shot, the nearby island gives that extra beauty to your photo! \r\nJust remember that the guidelines need to have an original print attached to your report.\r\n\r\nThank you, God bless & all the best for Convention 2024.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:01:36','2024-07-06 08:01:36'),(4743,'judge-event-evaluation-3823-1720216936',3823,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7270,5806,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Nicely done Alina!\r\nJust a light increase in the lighting and straightening of the image would\'ve set it perfectly\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:02:16','2024-07-06 08:02:16'),(4744,'judge-event-evaluation-4047-1720216944',4047,154,6,11,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7811,5806,7842,2,'Collection','8',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jack.\r\nThank you for entering this event. Great choice of subject. I love how clear the moon is shown in the photo. Awesome work, Jack. I’m excited to see what future photo ideas you’ll come up with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:02:24','2024-07-06 08:02:25'),(4745,'judge-event-evaluation-4029-1720216993',4029,111,6,11,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7700,55,7752,2,'Collection','5,7',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Hadassah,\r\nThank you for your submission and we appreciate your hardwork. Few points to consider in your next entry;\r\n-make sure that your photo must have a focus and it should be centered to which the person must be looking directly towards the camera lens and not to the opposite direction. A formal headshot or hipline length should be okay.\r\n- photo shots must be clear.\r\n-make sure to check for spelling and proper grammar when filling in your report.\r\n-attach your original copy of photo with your report form.\r\n\r\nThank you for a great effort shown. God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:03:13','2024-07-06 08:03:13'),(4746,'judge-event-evaluation-3822-1720217157',3822,154,6,11,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7814,5806,7789,2,'Collection','10',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Love the mountain range in the background!!\r\nThis is great shot \r\nWell done !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:05:57','2024-07-06 08:05:58'),(4747,'judge-event-evaluation-3847-1720217225',3847,111,6,11,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7701,55,7168,12,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Chayah. There is more room for improvement. Ensure that the printout focus in A3 size covers 90% of the poster. Otherwise, Good Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-06 08:07:05','2024-07-06 08:07:05'),(4748,'judge-event-evaluation-4065-1720217276',4065,111,6,11,2,2024,195,'507',NULL,7706,55,7789,56,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Love the butterfly !\r\nNice blend of colors that really match well.\r\nJust a few smudges around the corners.\r\nGreat job !',NULL,NUL