les carefully before you start. I was very impressed with your skill. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-09 12:34:01','2024-07-09 12:34:01'),(5021,'judge-event-evaluation-4070-1720493279',4070,142,6,11,2,2024,183,'464',NULL,7565,4208,7857,4,'Open','19',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A great  effort with a lot of information for your viewers. Some slides had too much information that could be separated into two slides. \r\nI really appreciate your creativity and production.  \r\nAll the best for future work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-09 12:47:59','2024-07-09 12:47:59'),(5022,'judge-event-evaluation-3665-1720502150',3665,111,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7648,55,7549,7,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your participation, Adora! Your story was a lesson for everyone to read. Take your time to check through the punctuation and grammar. May God continue to help you through creative ideas. Keep up the good work. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-09 15:15:50','2024-07-09 15:15:50'),(5023,'judge-event-evaluation-3668-1720502181',3668,111,6,11,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7667,55,7549,7,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you for participating, Corina. Your story was very interesting and have shown us how we can all be brave to land a helping hand. Please be mindful with your grammar in some areas. Continue to work towards your talent and keep up the good work. God bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL