icing and growing even more in confidence and using your gift. You have a beautiful heart of worship. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:05:52','2024-07-22 09:05:52'),(5108,'judge-event-evaluation-4359-1721603164',4359,154,6,11,2,2024,227,'709','1',0,5806,7863,25,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for ministering  such a lovely song. Please remember to get the music sheet and have confidence while playing the song. Other than that, great job. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:06:04','2024-07-22 09:06:04'),(5109,'judge-event-evaluation-4218-1721603202',4218,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7718,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,-1.00,'Marisa\'s expressing reading was well presented. She needs to improve on her fluency and work on her timing as she did not reach the minimum time of 4 mins. \r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:06:42','2024-07-22 09:06:42'),(5110,'judge-event-evaluation-4358-1721603258',4358,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7567,4208,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'HI Li, thanks  for taking your time to preached a  good message. These  are some of the pointers that will help you to better your preaching in the near future. Good posture and take your time and speak with confidence that will bring life to your message a more to the hearers .Make sure to tie the support scriptures to the main text that the message will flow into the very outlines on which the listener\'s will follow through the message to the end.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL