,4216,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7722,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'I really enjoyed that presentation !\r\nYou spoke confidently and with great inflection \r\nKept a good pace for the most part, although you did speed a few times which caused a few stumbles, but overall a great performance nonetheless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:19:44','2024-07-22 09:19:44'),(5116,'judge-event-evaluation-4216-1721603992',4216,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7722,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,96.50,-10,NULL,'Navyah\'s expressing reading was well presented . However, she needs to improve on her fluency and she needs to interact with her audience.\r\n\r\nVinaka .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:19:52','2024-07-22 09:19:52'),(5117,'judge-event-evaluation-2896-1721604178',2896,111,6,11,2,2024,214,'650',NULL,7688,55,7888,19,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Very nice performance\r\nyour posture and singing was very good and you have the voice of an angel it suits the song really well.\r\n\r\nGood job you did really well',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:22:58','2024-07-22 09:22:58'),(5118,'judge-event-evaluation-2896-1721604348',2896,111,6,11,2,2024,214,'650',NULL,7688,55,7471,19,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'WOW! What a beautiful and powerful performance. You have a wonderful voice and an even more wonderful spirit. Love how you maintained contact all throughout. Keep singing and practicing and growing in your gifting and anointing. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:25:48','2024-07-22 09:25:48'),(5121,'judge-event-evaluation-1627-1721604647',1627,115,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7357,5804,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you very much for a great presentation !\r\nJust be mindful of where sentences end and began , and be carefulwith how the run into each other\r\nGreat effort !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:30:47','2024-07-22 09:30:47'),(5122,'judge-event-evaluation-3646-1721604725',3646,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7788,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks  Jonathan for the powerful message that you\'ve delivered today. just some tips that  will assist you with your preaching. Speaking out with confidence that carries the  weight of the  message with conviction . You have presented very good outline that really maintains the flow of your message. Keep on pressing in to what God has for you in developing your preaching skill in a dynamic way.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:32:05','2024-07-22 09:32:05'),(5123,'judge-event-evaluation-2501-1721605082',2501,149,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7771,4678,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:52\r\nThank you for your confidence which does prove your great performance.\r\nTry something more challenging to bring out your talent and ability.\r\nGood Job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:38:02','2024-07-22 09:38:02'),(5126,'judge-event-evaluation-3618-1721605465',3618,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7687,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Amyra for putting forth a great effort\r\nJust the overall fluency may have slowed a bit at times,\r\nbut a great effort nonetheless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:44:25','2024-07-25 09:43:36'),(5127,'judge-event-evaluation-4238-1721605751',4238,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7777,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'That was a good performance. However, speaking clearly for the audience to hear your message is very important. Keep trying and you will be thebest.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:49:11','2024-07-22 09:49:11'),(5128,'judge-event-evaluation-3645-1721605966',3645,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7696,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful message Eroni ,that you\'ve preached  today . Some areas that needs to be polished are,adding your support scriptures in your outline. \r\nIt will be effective when you put a strong emphasis on key points with your gesture that will bring about those  key points to home in the  mind of the listeners in a powerful way indeed. Our prayers that you will grow in Christ in your daily walk that you\'ll become a great preacher of the Gospel.   ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:52:46','2024-07-22 09:52:47'),(5130,'judge-event-evaluation-4217-1721606180',4217,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7721,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Nicely done Nanise!\r\nWith how lengthy your story is , it can become tempting to speed up, but always be careful with your fluency and pronunciation of words\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:56:20','2024-07-22 09:56:20'),(5131,'judge-event-evaluation-4217-1721606199',4217,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7721,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Nanise\'s expressing reading was well presented.\r\nShe needs to improve fluency in reading, where she startled on a few words.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 09:56:39','2024-07-22 09:56:39'),(5133,'judge-event-evaluation-1968-1721606840',1968,134,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7147,5805,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Truly exceptional !\r\nYou commanded attention , and kept it\r\nVery good use of gestures to emphasise your points and drive the message home efficiently.\r\nWell done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:07:20','2024-07-22 10:07:20'),(5134,'judge-event-evaluation-1968-1721607002',1968,134,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7147,5805,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,99.00,-10,0.00,'I really enjoyed Sally\'s story! Wonderfully presented. She added a word that was not part of her story and startled on a word. This is where she lost a point.\r\n\r\nWell done!!\r\nVinaka .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:10:02','2024-07-22 10:10:02'),(5136,'judge-event-evaluation-4201-1721608264',4201,111,6,11,2,2024,278,'861','1',0,55,7888,34,'Open',NULL,100,81.50,-10,NULL,'Very nice song, I could hear all three of you clearly\r\n\r\nNext time I would suggest for more of you to  sing on your own, not just ariana. You all have beautiful voices and you should all be heard with even a small solo. Ariana did sing really well, just maybe let the others sing a bit more.\r\n\r\nThe harmonies were very nice.\r\n\r\nGood job guys',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:31:04','2024-07-22 10:31:04'),(5137,'judge-event-evaluation-4201-1721608325',4201,111,6,11,2,2024,278,'861','1',0,55,7471,34,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You all sang beautifully and your harmonies, arrangement and projection were amazing. The tenor was slightly off key at some points, but you did well to carry on singing regardless. Look forward to hearing more from you in future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:32:05','2024-07-22 10:32:05'),(5139,'judge-event-evaluation-4352-1721608894',4352,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7187,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'HI Kavish, it\'s a pleasure to listen to the message that you\'ve preached today. You have demonstrated a person with confidence on the  way you preached with nice loud voice that sounds clear. Just a  tip for you to work on ,in the area of your outline ,that  should have a key text and supportive scriptures to be also written or included. My prayer that you\'ll grow deeper in your walk with God;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;sc;;;;;\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nHI Kavish , thanks for the great preaching that you\'ve presented today. You have the capabilities to become an effective preacher through confidence in speaking and totally engaged with the audience. Just remember to include the key text and support scriptures in your outline as according to the requirements. Our prayers that you\'ll grow up in the knowledge of Jesus Christ that will make  you to become powerful preacher. \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:41:34','2024-07-22 10:41:34'),(5140,'judge-event-evaluation-4215-1721609165',4215,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7637,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Beautifully done !\r\nVery clear and precise and usage of appropriate gestures.\r\nExcellent work Elizabeth!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:46:05','2024-07-22 10:46:05'),(5141,'judge-event-evaluation-4215-1721609298',4215,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7637,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,99.50,-10,NULL,'Elizabeth Vodonaivalu beautifully presented her story. How she projected to her voice was excellent. Elizabeth just paused at one phrase and re-read twice.\r\n\r\nWell done Elizabeth !!\r\n\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 10:48:18','2024-07-22 10:48:18'),(5144,'judge-event-evaluation-4352-1721610211',4352,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7187,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,86.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Kavish, your scripture referencing for your message was spot on. I can see you have studied and you have shown yourself approved (2 Tim 2:15). You are very confident in your preaching and your voice rose in power and authority as you preached. Really well done. There is one thing I want to encourage you in as you preach. This is connection with your audience. Jesus was great at connecting with the people by coming down to our level and speaking with compassion. Use life examples along with scripture, try to determine why people might struggle with determination and speak to them with examples from your own life that would bring their hearts closer to your message. Overall a very strong presentation. well done. Please also add your scriptures to your outline',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:03:31','2024-07-22 11:03:31'),(5145,'judge-event-evaluation-4214-1721610685',4214,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7634,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Amelia for putting forth an effort to present your expressive reading!\r\nYou read with great fluency and diction,although I would\'ve loved to see you put a bit more life into your reading and really express to your best ability !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:11:25','2024-07-22 11:11:25'),(5146,'judge-event-evaluation-4214-1721610811',4214,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7634,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,97.50,-10,-1.00,'Amelia Naivalu: Well presented!\r\nFew things to improve on; 1- Facial expressions \r\n                                                 2- Her time did not meet the limited timing.\r\n                                                 3-Only one script was supplied to the judges .\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:13:31','2024-07-22 11:13:31'),(5147,'judge-event-evaluation-3646-1721611499',3646,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7788,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Jonathan, I really enjoyed your teaching on communion. You showed confidence and you made a lot of eye contact, which is fantastic. You taught me that only our Lord Jesus Christ is the sinless Lamb of God. Well done for using scriptures in your outline. I would like you to try more to get a response from your audience. You asked many questions but never waited for a response. Interaction from your audience when teaching helps you to know if your teaching is being recieved by your audience. Overall a very good presentation.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:24:59','2024-07-22 11:24:59'),(5148,'judge-event-evaluation-4358-1721611617',4358,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7567,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,62.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Lin, Very well written message. The writing structure is structured well. Deliverance of message was at a very low volume and I struggled to hear you Lin. It is always good to make eye contact when preaching. Try to look at the people you preach to and only look down at your preaching script occasionally. This takes practice and remembering what you have written down. Really good notes overall, and a well structured message. My payer for you is that God will give you boldness to look me in my eyes and deliver your well structured message. Well done on your understanding of honesty.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:26:57','2024-07-22 11:26:57'),(5150,'judge-event-evaluation-4304-1721612575',4304,111,6,11,2,2024,273,'856','2',0,55,7888,33,NULL,'21,25',100,75.50,-10,NULL,'Good job girls :) I loved the harmony near the end. The song ended well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:42:55','2024-07-22 11:42:55'),(5154,'judge-event-evaluation-4200-1721613223',4200,111,6,11,2,2024,274,'857','1',0,55,7888,33,'Open','25,22',100,81.50,-10,NULL,'Good trio\r\n\r\nEspecially loved the harmonies  and how you all did an equal share of singing :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:53:43','2024-07-22 11:53:43'),(5155,'judge-event-evaluation-4200-1721613296',4200,111,6,11,2,2024,274,'857','1',0,55,7471,33,'Open','25,22',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done girls! Your harmonies were beautiful and you projected so well! Love the key change too! Just a note to be mindful of your expressions when singing…sometimes we make faces that we’re not even aware of when we’re very nervous. Keep singing and growing in your giftings. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:54:56','2024-07-22 11:54:56'),(5156,'judge-event-evaluation-4237-1721613369',4237,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7744,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:39\r\nYou did and excellent job, Merelita!\r\nPlease try a more challenging piece to bring out that talent and ability you showed today.\r\nThank you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:56:09','2024-07-22 11:56:09'),(5157,'judge-event-evaluation-4228-1721613468',4228,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7684,55,7759,45,'Collection','25,24',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'She is not attending Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 11:57:48','2024-07-22 11:57:48'),(5159,'judge-event-evaluation-4230-1721613616',4230,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7782,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'That was a beautiful perfomance! You are very confident and you beautifully delivered your message. However, I would recommend a longer one that best suit your ability. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:00:16','2024-07-22 12:00:16'),(5162,'judge-event-evaluation-1631-1721614404',1631,115,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7357,5804,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:07\r\nThank you for the great effort displayed, Katarina.\r\nI like your confidence and I believe you can do better if you slow your pace a bit and clearly deliver your message to your audience. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:13:24','2024-07-22 12:13:24');
INSERT INTO `judgeevaluations` VALUES (5166,'judge-event-evaluation-4303-1721614853',4303,111,6,11,2,2024,273,'856','1',0,55,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Well done girls. You sang beautifully and you both have wonderful voices. Keep practicing and singing together and grow your gifting. I’d love to hear a piece like “The Prayer” or “You Raise Me Up” ;)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:20:53','2024-07-22 12:20:53'),(5168,'judge-event-evaluation-1628-1721615395',1628,115,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7356,5804,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Time: Less than a minute.\r\nIt takes a lot of courage to stand in front and speak.\r\nToday you showed that you are more caple to do that. May God guide you to become your best. Thank you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:29:55','2024-07-22 12:29:56'),(5169,'judge-event-evaluation-4350-1721615420',4350,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7565,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Jiajun, very good written presentation. I can see how you have thought about the scripture and applied it to your own life, and it was really good to hear your testimony. I would like to encourage you to make eye contact when delivering your message. Try to bullet point what you want to remember to say on your paper, and then quickly look at what you want to remember, and then look at your audience and speak from your heart. Overall it was a very good presentation on living in the light. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:30:20','2024-07-22 12:30:20'),(5173,'judge-event-evaluation-4350-1721615754',4350,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7565,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for the message about the The power of Living in the Light. It was a wonderful message that you have presented today. Some tips that will help you to grow the gift of preaching for you. Note that the support scriptures were not included in your outline. These are key thoughts that will keep you on  top of preaching and be sharp with your presentation . Praying for a successful future convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:35:54','2024-07-22 12:35:54'),(5174,'judge-event-evaluation-4211-1721615890',4211,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7657,55,7756,44,'Collection',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'A Command Performance Right There!! Well done Pamela Portillo!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:38:10','2024-07-22 12:38:10'),(5175,'judge-event-evaluation-2934-1721615907',2934,111,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7722,55,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'that was so good, you did so well \r\nYou reached really good notes\r\n\r\nThe one thing you can work on is being more confident even if not, to look confident.\r\n\r\nA way you could get more confident is maybe looking to the top of the back wall (choose a spot) instead of looking at  the judges, (Because it can make you lose confidence) so it looks like you are singing out. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:38:27','2024-07-22 12:38:27'),(5176,'judge-event-evaluation-2934-1721615965',2934,111,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7722,55,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You have an amazing voice and vocal range. Just be mindful of your appearance and the expressions you make as that can be distracting; you don’t want nervous expressions to distract from your singing. Keep on singing and practicing. I look forward to hearing more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:39:25','2024-07-22 12:39:25'),(5177,'judge-event-evaluation-4211-1721615994',4211,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7657,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'That was an incredible presentation Pamela!\r\nAbsolutely amazing use of inflections, and expressions that really brought the story to life!\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:39:54','2024-07-22 12:39:54'),(5178,'judge-event-evaluation-4212-1721616317',4212,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7648,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,-1.00,'Great effort Adora!\r\nJust a bit under the time minimum, but thats not your fault\r\nContinue to practice reading and bringing out more expressions each time !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:45:17','2024-07-22 12:45:17'),(5179,'judge-event-evaluation-3694-1721616415',3694,142,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7183,4208,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Really lovely strong voice it was amazing\r\n\r\nAnd i loved how you were into it, smiling and trying hard not to dance\r\n\r\nYour confidence was good, but it can be improved\r\n\r\nGood job :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:46:55','2024-07-22 12:46:55'),(5180,'judge-event-evaluation-4212-1721616485',4212,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7648,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,99.00,-10,-1.00,'Adora did very well. She lost points on her time limit as she did not meet the expected limited time which she will need to  improve on next time.\r\n\r\nWell done Adora!!\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:48:05','2024-07-22 12:48:05'),(5182,'judge-event-evaluation-3694-1721616625',3694,142,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7183,4208,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!  You sang and ministered so beautifully and I love the heart of worship you carry. Keep practicing and growing your gifting. I look forward to seeing and hearing more from you in future. You  God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:50:25','2024-07-22 12:50:25'),(5183,'judge-event-evaluation-1630-1721616651',1630,115,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7519,5804,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 2:03\r\nYou did a great a job with the choice of your poems and did your very best in delivering it. Doing something that is challenging build you up and stronger. Please keep trying and tou will be better.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:50:51','2024-07-22 12:50:51'),(5185,'judge-event-evaluation-4348-1721616894',4348,142,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7184,4208,7483,50,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Elena your preaching today was so timely,because you\'re speaking about what\'s  happening to us now.  Please take note that you need to add the supporting  scripture as layout by the guidelines. Keep up the determinations to preach wholeheartedly to your generation to on know the Saviour. Our prayers that you\'ll grow in the knowledge of His will foe you to begin to do great things ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:54:54','2024-07-22 12:54:54'),(5186,'judge-event-evaluation-3620-1721617014',3620,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7782,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,94.50,-10,NULL,'Very well read and expressed Jaylene!\r\nYou have a bright future in platform and public speaking !\r\nKeep it up !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:56:54','2024-07-22 12:56:54'),(5189,'judge-event-evaluation-3620-1721617154',3620,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7782,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,99.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Jaylene Paulo!! A well presented story. She only needs to improve on her fluency, as she missed a phrase in her story. \r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 12:59:14','2024-07-22 12:59:14'),(5191,'judge-event-evaluation-4235-1721617720',4235,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7718,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,-1.00,'Time: Less than a minute\r\nThe way you deliver your poem with confidence is amazing coupled with authority. However, memorization of the piece is a must and this is something you can work on to improve your future performance. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:08:40','2024-07-22 13:08:40'),(5192,'judge-event-evaluation-1758-1721617931',1758,115,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7357,5804,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Good job sweetheart, you did really well considering you sang arcapella',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:12:11','2024-07-22 13:12:11'),(5193,'judge-event-evaluation-1758-1721617953',1758,115,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7357,5804,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You sang beautifully, even though you didn’t have any accompanying instrument. You have a wonderful voice; i would like to see you keep practicing and building that voice so that you have more projection (volume). God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:12:33','2024-07-22 13:12:33'),(5195,'judge-event-evaluation-2607-1721618075',2607,149,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7774,4678,7871,50,'Collection','24',100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Vincent, such a great message on courage. You stepped up in courage you deliver so powerful. I love the way you read the scripture and animate the cry of peter. A really good presentation. I would like to encourage you to own the word. Use more of your examples from your own life and connect with your audience. Have you ever been afraid, have you ever had to step out in courage. Add your experience to your sermon to make it even more powerful. Overall, it was a great message with very good eye contact. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:14:35','2024-07-22 13:14:35'),(5198,'judge-event-evaluation-4223-1721618186',4223,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7667,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:23 minutes\r\nYou did recite your poem well except for that one word that your missed but you continued until you finished. Please continue to challenge yourself and believe that you got this and through practice you can perfect yourself.\r\nThanks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:16:26','2024-07-22 13:16:26'),(5199,'judge-event-evaluation-2607-1721618248',2607,149,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7774,4678,7483,50,'Collection','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Vincent for the word of God that you\'ve delivered today with confidence before the audience. Some tips that will help you to refine your preaching skills and enhance your effectiveness. Your hand gestures must correspond with your word that will brings a depth to your message to the hearers. Praying for God\'s direction to be made clear on a daily basis.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:17:28','2024-07-22 13:17:28'),(5200,'judge-event-evaluation-1967-1721618305',1967,134,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7537,5805,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Exceptional performance ! Really well expressed and spoken\r\nKeep up the great work , and I hope to see more of your performances in the future!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:18:25','2024-07-22 13:18:25'),(5201,'judge-event-evaluation-2933-1721618306',2933,111,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7676,55,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'You did really well but i could tell you were nervous.\r\n\r\nYou did a good job sweetheart and have an amazing voice',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:18:26','2024-07-22 13:18:26'),(5202,'judge-event-evaluation-1967-1721618348',1967,134,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7537,5805,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,100.00,-10,0.00,'Brilliantly displayed her story!! Fluency was perfect. Timing was perfect. How she projected her voice was awesome .\r\nWell done Juzdaiiy!! \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:19:08','2024-07-22 13:19:08'),(5203,'judge-event-evaluation-2933-1721618407',2933,111,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7676,55,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You sang beautiful and confidently and chose a good song with a great message. Keep on singing and growing your gifting. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:20:07','2024-07-22 13:20:07'),(5205,'judge-event-evaluation-4243-1721618726',4243,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7737,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:06 minutes\r\nYou did alright as you had memorized your poem but you seem to stutter due to nervousness. Thank you for the great effort in making it this far. You can be the best. So don\'t give up and keep trying.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,