2 13:53:36','2024-07-22 13:53:36'),(5214,'judge-event-evaluation-2564-1721620540',2564,149,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7772,4678,7871,50,'Collection','24',100,64.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Abraham, well done for such confidence to stand up and preach the word. It was so awesome to see a young man like yourself read the scripture with confidence. You are going to be a powerful preacher one day. I encourage you to keep studying the word of God. And as you study it think about how it relates to your own life and how it can change the life of of so many others. Use your on examples in you life to help us to understand what the word means to you. Overall a great message on the prosperous man. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 13:55:40','2024-07-22 13:55:41'),(5215,'judge-event-evaluation-3624-1721621451',3624,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7725,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for a very confident and poised performance !\r\nKeep on refining your skills and practicing your pronunciations and your skills will grow much ! Keep it up',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 14:10:51','2024-07-22 14:10:51'),(5216,'judge-event-evaluation-3624-1721621580',3624,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7725,55,7756,44,NULL,'25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Taake Kirabuke- beautifully displayed her story about Jonah. Voice projection and inflection was very good. Few things which she will need to improve on, **Diction and her pronunciation and fluency.\r\n\r\nWell done Taake!!\r\n\r\nVinaka \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NU