the cross because he has the strong love for us coming out of His heart. He saw us in the future and loved us and it was his love for us that caused him to be obedient. Keep this in mind when you think on this verse as it will cause you to preach the verse with new passion and new life. Overall a great choice of scripture and very well prepared',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 14:17:17','2024-07-22 14:17:17'),(5220,'judge-event-evaluation-2929-1721621860',2929,111,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7648,55,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Really good singing, and when I looked at you I saw you pour your whole heart out, even though you were nervous.\r\n\r\nSo a really good job on that',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 14:17:40','2024-07-22 14:17:40'),(5222,'judge-event-evaluation-1931-1721622018',1931,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7537,5805,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:34minutes\r\nYou recited your poem with much confidence but I believe you can still do better because you showed that you have the ability to do so. All the best!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 14:20:18','2024-07-22 14:20:18'),(5223,'judge-event-evaluation-2932-1721622284',2932,111,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7637,55,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You sang beautifully and have a strong voice. Be mindful of your appearance and presentation so that it doesn’t distracts from your singing. Keep practicing and growing in your giftings. I look forward to seeing you at the next Convention 