'Hi Sisilia, very good presentation on the walking on the sea. You have prepared your outline very well and ready to deliver. You read very clearly through your presentation really well. Continue to practice looking at your audience while remembering what you have written down. Making eye contact is very important. Trying to engage more with your audience by using your own life examples and thinking about how these verses impact your own life. Then make those same verses impact the life\'s of you hearers. This well make your message even more powerful. Overall a  very good message. Well done\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:00:25','2024-07-22 15:00:25'),(5246,'judge-event-evaluation-3625-1721624739',3625,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7688,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,90.50,-10,-0.50,'Thank you for a confident and amazing reading!\r\nJust a fewtiny hiccups , but otherwise , excellent !\r\nKeep it up ! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:05:39','2024-07-22 15:05:39'),(5247,'judge-event-evaluation-3625-1721624778',3625,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7688,55,7756,44,'Open','25',100,96.50,-10,-0.50,'Well done Ariana!! \r\nA few improvements which she will need to work on, **projecting her voice and fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:06:18','2024-07-22 15:06:19'),(5248,'judge-event-evaluation-4137-1721624925',4137,154,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7813,5806,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,59.00,-10,NULL,'\r\nTry not to look at the floor next time and maybe smile sometimes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:08:45','2024-07-22 15:08:45'),(5249,'judge-event-evaluation-4137-1721624959',4137,154,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7813,5806,7471,33,NULL,'25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done giving this event a go. Just need to make sure you connect with the listeners by using eye contact (don’t stare at the floor). A great way to practice this is by singing to a mirror and watching your expressions. \r\nOtherwise, well done and hope to see you back again :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:09:19','2024-07-22 15:09:20'),(5250,'judge-event-evaluation-4285-1721625178',4285,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7683,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,87.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you for your great reading! \r\nJust slightly under timebut excellent nonetheless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:12:58','2024-07-22 15:12:58'),(5252,'judge-event-evaluation-4344-1721625639',4344,142,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7174,4208,7483,50,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Wow! what a powerful message Aliyah that you preached today. I been so blessed by it. You have allowed  God to be part of your everyday life. Keep on pressing into the ways of Jesus and He will  continues to reveal Himself to you in amazing ways that will definitely impact your preaching to your generation for His glory. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:20:39','2024-07-22 15:20:39'),(5253,'judge-event-evaluation-4315-1721625915',4315,154,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7266,5806,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'love the voice it was nice and strong and I loved it :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:25:15','2024-07-22 15:25:15'),(5254,'judge-event-evaluation-4315-1721625969',4315,154,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7266,5806,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done Eliana! You sang beautifully. Keep practicing and growing in your gifting :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:26:09','2024-07-22 15:26:09'),(5255,'judge-event-evaluation-4245-1721626203',4245,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7726,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,71.50,-10,-0.50,'0:45min\r\n\r\nWell done. It was a great message but for the 2 lines you forgot. Keep practising and learning in the process. Project your voice and pronounce your words clearly. God\'s love is shared through your voice and memory. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:30:03','2024-07-22 15:30:03'),(5256,'judge-event-evaluation-4269-1721626204',4269,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7778,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,88.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you so much for a great performance!\r\nReally a great reading,full of confidence and poise\r\nJust a bit over the maximum time , hence the deduction, but a great performance nonetheless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:30:04','2024-07-22 15:30:04'),(5257,'judge-event-evaluation-4269-1721626321',4269,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7778,55,7756,44,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,-2.00,'Enchong  Lee beautifully displayed her story about Joseph the dreamer. Her fluency was good. She will need to improve on her time in the future as she exceeded her maximum time of 6 mins to 8mins 22 seconds.\r\n\r\nWell done Enchong Lee !!\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:32:01','2024-07-22 15:32:01'),(5258,'judge-event-evaluation-4133-1721626340',4133,154,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7819,5806,7471,33,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You chose a great song and presented it well. Your projection (volume) is great too, but just be mindful of your lower register so that we can hear you when you ‘re singing lower notes . Keep singing and practicing your gift. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:32:20','2024-07-22 15:32:20'),(5259,'judge-event-evaluation-4133-1721626435',4133,154,6,11,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7819,5806,7888,33,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Really good job singing, but maybe next time you could try not to show your nervousness.\r\n\r\nI loved it when it was all soft singing and then suddenly you sang with a booming voice half way through. (Both the soft and loud voice was heard and lovely, but it was sort of a shock and i liked that sudden surprise of a big note)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:33:55','2024-07-22 15:33:55'),(5262,'judge-event-evaluation-1933-1721626997',1933,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7543,5805,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Absent from Convention',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:43:17','2024-07-22 15:43:17'),(5265,'judge-event-evaluation-4206-1721627684',4206,149,6,11,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7775,4678,7888,32,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'You did really well\r\n\r\nBut next time have the words or lyrics so we can see\r\n\r\nYou stood nice and straight\r\n\r\nYou have a really good voice (I mean it, it was good)\r\nYou did well considering how nervous you looked',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 15:54:44','2024-07-22 15:54:44'),(5266,'judge-event-evaluation-4206-1721644015',4206,149,6,11,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7775,4678,7471,32,'Collection','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You have a wonderful voice. Keep practicing and growing in your gifting. I look forward to seeing more from you in the future! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 20:26:55','2024-07-22 20:26:55'),(5267,'judge-event-evaluation-4380-1721651497',4380,111,6,11,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7712,55,7471,32,'Collection','24',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You sand very well and confidently and even though you forgot some lyrics. Don’t forget to smile and open your mouth when singing. This will help your voice to ring out clearly. Keep singing and growing in your gifting. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-22 22:31:37','2024-07-22 22:31:37'),(5269,'judge-event-evaluati