00,65.00,-10,NULL,'Very nice singing\r\n\r\nI would encourage you to show a little emotion on your face (doesnt have to be a smile) you should make me feel like you really want to be here, singing.\r\n\r\nYour voices are very beautiful though',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:16:18','2024-07-23 13:16:19'),(5292,'judge-event-evaluation-4277-1721704611',4277,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7693,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,91.00,-10,-2.00,'Very well done Olisha!\r\nGreat use of tone and volume to drive home the message and emotion\r\nJust a deduction for going over time limit , but amazing job! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:16:51','2024-07-23 13:16:51'),(5294,'judge-event-evaluation-4277-1721704781',4277,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7693,55,7756,44,'Open','25',100,96.00,-10,-2.00,'Olisha shared e beautiful story. Voice projection was perfect. A few points to improve on, * Time(as she exceeded her maximum time to - 8.00mins). And Fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:19:41','2024-07-23 13:19:41'),(5296,'judge-event-evaluation-2923-1721705137',2923,111,6,11,2,2024,267,'850',NULL,7685,55,7888,32,'Open','24',100,82.50,-10,NULL,'Really good singing voice\r\nalso you had very good emotion. I can see how much you love singing! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:25:37','2024-07-23 13:25:37'),(5297,'judge-event-evaluation-3789-1721705182',3789,142,6,11,2,2024,221,'703',NULL,7178,4208,7841,3,'Collection','15',100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful playing ; keep at it',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:26:22','2024-07-23 13:26:22'),(5298,'judge-event-evaluation-3789-1721705191',3789,142,6,11,2,2024,221,'703',NULL,7178,4208,7863,3,'Collection','15',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Tian. Great performance. It is indeed  a really calming music to my ear.  You can improve on your dynamics next time. Other than that, great job Tian. Keep it up! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:26:31','2024-07-23 13:26:31'),(5300,'judge-event-evaluation-2923-1721705303',2923,111,6,11,2,2024,267,'850',NULL,7685,55,7471,32,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You have a powerful voice and great stage presence. My only encouragement would be to practice your softer tones (head voice) so as to add some dynamics to your singing. Keep practicing and growing in your gifting. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:28:23','2024-07-23 13:28:23'),(5301,'judge-event-evaluation-4355-1721705326',4355,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7201,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,61.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Xinhao, well done for your great message on diligence. As you said we can acheive so much success with diligence. Continue to be diligent in all that you do. I would like to encourage you to keep on studying the scriptures and continue to see your own life in them. And don\'t be afraid to look your audience in the eyes and tell them with confidence as you preach. This takes practice by remembering what you have written and speaking what you believe from your heart. Keep practicing to not look at your outline as much. well done and continue to be diligent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:28:46','2024-07-23 13:28:46'),(5302,'judge-event-evaluation-4271-1721705462',4271,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7692,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you for a great story , read really well\r\nJust be mindful of the time limits and not to go under or over , and always be careful to follow the script well\r\nWell done !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:31:02','2024-07-23 13:31:02'),(5304,'judge-event-evaluation-4232-1721705559',4232,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7675,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Your effort is greatly appreciated, Jennifer.\r\nYou have come this far showing that you are capable. So keep learning and trying and one day you will succeed. All the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:32:39','2024-07-23 13:32:39'),(5305,'judge-event-evaluation-4271-1721705629',4271,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7692,55,7756,44,'Open','25',100,97.50,-10,-2.50,'Francine\'s performance was beautiful. How she projected her voice and how well she displayed varieties dramatic skills. However, she did not meet the required time or the minimum time of 4 mins . Her time as exactly 2 mins.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:33:49','2024-07-23 13:33:49'),(5306,'judge-event-evaluation-4355-1721705693',4355,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7201,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,50.00,-10,NULL,'What a good message you\'ve delivered today and as you continue to work on it you\'ll become more skilful with it. Here are some of the tips to help you in refining your skill in reaching. Good voice projection and clear articulation the words that you preach that will capture the audience. Hand gesture with facial expression e so vital to create a mantel vision to the hearers. Praying that you\'ll have a deeper hunger for God. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:34:53','2024-07-23 13:34:53'),(5307,'judge-event-evaluation-2907-1721705871',2907,111,6,11,2,2024,221,'703',NULL,7660,55,7863,3,'Collection','15',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Ocean! Continue to practice string pluck so you can do better for next year. Build up the confidence. Other than that, thank you for your great effort Ocean. \r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:37:51','2024-07-23 13:37:51'),(5309,'judge-event-evaluation-4242-1721705892',4242,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7657,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 2 minutes\r\nYou perfectly delivered your message and I believe you interacted well with your audience too. Good Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:38:12','2024-07-23 13:38:12'),(5312,'judge-event-evaluation-2906-1721706004',2906,111,6,11,2,2024,221,'703',NULL,7781,55,7863,3,'Collection','15',100,8