o be careful when reading so as to not miss or add any words\r\nGreat job !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:55:04','2024-07-23 13:55:04'),(5333,'judge-event-evaluation-1950-1721706971',1950,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7530,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 48 seconds\r\nThank you for your performance. Though it is a small room, I still believe that you should project your voice and clearly deliver your message. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:56:11','2024-07-25 09:08:22'),(5334,'judge-event-evaluation-2901-1721706984',2901,111,6,11,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7782,55,7863,22,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jaylene. Great effort! Continue to practise. You have a skill of playing the piano. \r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:56:24','2024-07-23 13:56:24'),(5337,'judge-event-evaluation-4129-1721707018',4129,154,6,11,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7811,5806,7888,32,'Collection','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Good job buddy! You did so well.  I love your enthusiasm. You were so happy and cute. And you had the sweetest voice.\r\n\r\nI highly recommend you! You are an amazing singer and you presented yourself very well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 13:56:58','2024-07-23 13:56:58'),(5338,'judge-event-evaluation-4129-1721707095',4129,154,6,11,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7811,5806,7471,32,'Collection','24',100,97.0