3,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You have a pleasant voice but sang beautifully and confidently. Don’t forget to be mindful of your expression when singing (smile, eye contact). Keep practicing and growing in your gifting. God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:11:14','2024-07-23 14:11:14'),(5347,'judge-event-evaluation-1629-1721707938',1629,115,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7360,5804,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'1:00min\r\n\r\nThank you Sailosi. Great message in your poem. You have a wonderful voice and good diction. The challenge is to be louder so everyone can hear your message. Keep up the good work of memorization.  God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:12:18','2024-07-23 14:12:18'),(5348,'judge-event-evaluation-1629-1721707995',1629,115,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7360,5804,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute \r\nYou have come prepared but due to your nervousness, you forget some lines. Do not give up but keep trying. Thank you for your great performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:13:15','2024-07-23 14:13:15'),(5349,'judge-event-evaluation-4380-1721708127',4380,111,6,11,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7712,55,7888,32,'Collection','24',100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Really good job for putting yourself out there.\r\n\r\nYou seemed very scared but I want you to know that everyone at convention are your friends and we support you no matter what. You sang in tune and actually finished! Well done! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:15:27','2024-07-23 14:15:27'),(5351,'judge-event-evaluation-4363-1721708236',4363,142,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7561,4208,7871,50,'Open','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Serenity, what a powerful message and testimony. Your history is His - Story and it truly brought glory to God. You message was from the heart and that is where our messages should always come from. From a heart of compassion to help others get out of their dark places. You are already a great blessing to many people. God delivered you and now you have the glory of God to help up recieve deliverance. Please keep preaching and the next time you tell your testimony, throw your paper away, don\'t look at it and tell the testimony from the words written on your heart. So powerful, well done, may God direct your steps forever. AMEN!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:17:16','2024-07-23 14:17:16'),(5352,'judge-event-evaluation-4363-1721708323',4363,142,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7561,4208,7483,50,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Wow ! thanks very much for the heartfelt message that you preached today.\r\nYou have taken your time to articulate very well the thoughts in your message to the hearers. The testimony that you shared in relation to the message was so transparent and vulnerable but yet truth that delivers those who take it to heart. My prayers that God will use you to reach your generation with the love and power of Jesus Christ.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:18:43','2024-07-23 14:18:44'),(5353,'judge-event-evaluation-4446-1721708483',4446,142,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7196,4208,7789,44,'Open','25',100,94.50,-10,NULL,'Exceptional work Samara ! Love the voices and accents by the way\r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:21:23','2024-07-23 14:21:23'),(5354,'judge-event-evaluation-4446-1721708578',4446,142,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7196,4208,7756,44,'Open','25',100,99.00,-10,0.00,'Brilliant performance by Samara. How she projected her voice was awesome . Just a few words she missed and  added a few. \r\n\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:22:58','2024-07-23 14:22:58'),(5355,'judge-event-evaluation-4126-1721708581',4126,154,6,11,2,2024,272,'855',NULL,7274,5806,7888,33,'Open','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'I love how happy you looked and enthusiastic you looked\r\n\r\nYou did well and continued on, even when you started losing your voice and I have to commend that.\r\n\r\nGood job :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:23:01','2024-07-23 14:23:01'),(5357,'judge-event-evaluation-4233-1721709029',4233,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7674,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute\r\nYou spoke with clarity and confidence but without proper volume. Please remember your audience should hear every word you say. Keep learning and trying for better outcome.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:30:29','2024-07-23 14:30:29'),(5358,'judge-event-evaluation-4126-1721709082',4126,154,6,11,2,2024,272,'855',NULL,7274,5806,7471,33,'Open','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Vani! You did well to push through even though you were starting to lose your voice. Maybe don’t shout so much when you know you have vocal events coming up ;) Keep on practicing and growing in your gifting. God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:31:22','2024-07-23 14:31:22'),(5359,'judge-event-evaluation-4408-1721709176',4408,154,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7272,5806,7789,44,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Nicely read Tamalesi !\r\nRemember to engage the audience when you\'re presenting; use your eyes , gestures, inflections and tools to draw them in.\r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:32:56','2024-07-23 14:32:56'),(5360,'judge-event-evaluation-4408-1721709208',4408,154,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7272,5806,7756,44,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,0.00,'Tamalesi displayed her story well. Except she needs to work on her fluency .\r\n\r\nwell done!\r\n\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:33:28','2024-07-23 14:33:28'),(5361,'judge-event-evaluation-1932-1721709418',1932,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7534,5805,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute and 2 seconds\r\nThank you for your poetry recitation. You were good but at that volume, some of your audience may not hear what you need to share. Always project your voice even if the room is small. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:36:58','2024-07-23 14:36:58'),(5363,'judge-event-evaluation-3642-1721709565',3642,111,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7694,55,7871,50,'Collection','24',100,95.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Kolino, A great message on who is God. You have developed already a preaching style, with the hands moving and raising your voice at different intervals for powerful verses. Very well given with great precision. I would like to encourage you to keep on preaching, I can see you one day preaching to thousands. I would also like to encourage you, in keeping eye contact for longer periods. You were very strong with the scriptures when you were preaching and pretty much kept your eye contact throughout. But I noticed that when you gave your testimony of nearly drowning, you read it from the page. It is a strong testimony, as you share it, read it only from your heart, your already remember it, because it happened. So when you share it, don\'t read it, but share it, use your hands to paint the picture, use your body movement and let it come from you memory. It will be more powerful. Overall a very strong sermon. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:39:25','2024-07-23 14:39:25'),(5364,'judge-event-evaluation-3642-1721709569',3642,111,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7694,55,7483,50,'Collection','24',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Great message Kolinio, that you delivered to today. You have articulated well today the points in your message that ministers to the soul of spirit. Some hints that will improve your capabilities in preaching. Good hand gesture gives the audience the feel of your message. My prayer that God will use you\r\nreach  your generation through this gift .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:39:29','2024-07-23 14:39:29'),(5368,'judge-event-evaluation-1912-1721709996',1912,144,6,11,2,2024,225,'707',NULL,7216,1404,7841,3,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:46:36','2024-07-23 14:46:36'),(5369,'judge-event-evaluation-4141-1721710123',4141,154,6,11,2,2024,225,'707',NULL,7811,5806,7841,3,'Collection','18',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:48:43','2024-07-23 14:48:43'),(5370,'judge-event-evaluation-1626-1721710252',1626,115,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7359,5804,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you Harold Khan for presenting your piece !\r\nJust note the time limit for expressive reading is 4mins- 6mins, so it would benefit you to pick a suitable length of script.\r\nAlso don\'t be shy to really project your voice and really express yourself \r\nYou have the ability ! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:50:52','2024-07-23 14:50:52'),(5371,'judge-event-evaluation-2907-1721710277',2907,111,6,11,2,2024,221,'703',NULL,7660,55,7841,3,'Collection','15',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Great job; keep at it',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:51:17','2024-07-23 14:51:17'),(5372,'judge-event-evaluation-1626-1721710280',1626,115,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7359,5804,775