805,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 36 seconds\r\nThank you for your performance. I believe you can do one that best suit your ability level. Also you need to project your voice though you are performing in a small room. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:58:52','2024-07-23 14:58:52'),(5379,'judge-event-evaluation-2620-1721710743',2620,149,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7770,4678,7871,50,'Collection','24',100,63.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Elimi, well done for sharing your message on the good Shepherd. Well done for remembering parts of scripture. It was good to see you making eye contact when you were able to remember those verses. I would like to encourage you to keep studying the word so that the Spirit of God can bring them back in your memory when you need them. As you preach try also to speak boldy when reading powerful verses to help your audience capture them in their minds. And also try to include life examples to help the audience relate to your message. Overall a great sermon well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:59:03','2024-07-23 14:59:03'),(5380,'judge-event-evaluation-4116-1721710752',4116,154,6,11,2,2024,237,'753',NULL,7256,5806,7841,3,'Open','15',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing; keep at it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:59:12','2024-07-23 14:59:12'),(5381,'judge-event-evaluation-2620-1721710753',2620,149,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7770,4678,7483,50,'Collection','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Elimi for the powerful message that you have shared today. We are blessed to understand the importance of the Good Shepherd in our lives.\r\nHere are some tips that will help you to grow in your preaching skill. Good projection of voice with clear articulation will capture the audience. Hand gesture with facial expression will bring life to the message. I pray that you\'ll continue to each to your generation  effectively',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 14:59:13','2024-07-23 14:59:13'),(5382,'judge-event-evaluation-2915-1721710865',2915,111,6,11,2,2024,237,'753',NULL,7798,55,7841,3,'Open','15',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:01:05','2024-07-23 15:01:05'),(5383,'judge-event-evaluation-2916-1721710970',2916,111,6,11,2,2024,237,'753',NULL,7790,55,7841,3,'Open','15',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'I was amazed by your performance!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:02:50','2024-07-23 15:02:50'),(5384,'judge-event-evaluation-4410-1721711012',4410,154,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7274,5806,7789,44,'Open','25',100,85.50,-10,NULL,'Thank you Joie for your presentation!\r\nRemember to include the audience in your presentation;Looking up and expressing certain parts would do very well\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:03:32','2024-07-23 15:03:32'),(5385,'judge-event-evaluation-4410-1721711012',4410,154,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7274,5806,7756,44,'Open','25',100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Vani!! Just a