NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:26:34','2024-07-23 15:26:35'),(5425,'judge-event-evaluation-4362-1721712410',4362,142,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7196,4208,7483,50,'Open','25',100,92.50,-10,-4.50,'What an awesome message that you\'ve preached today. You have grown in your preaching since the last time I heard you. It is to the prove that your walk with God has been stronger and deeper. Your testimony really minister to the audience ,because it was so genuine and truthful tat those who take it to heart will definitely brings deliverance to them by Gods power. I pray that you\'ll impact your generation in a powerful way through preaching. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:26:50','2024-07-23 15:26:50'),(5427,'judge-event-evaluation-4210-1721712528',4210,149,6,11,2,2024,220,'702',NULL,7771,4678,7863,3,'Collection','14',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jokaveti. Great Job! Please be mindful of notes when to go on high note. Keep your balance and please be confident while playing. Other than that, great effort! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:28:48','2024-07-23 15:28:48'),(5428,'judge-event-evaluation-4362-1721712531',4362,142,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7196,4208,7871,50,'Open','25',100,95.50,-10,-4.50,'Hi Samara, well that was an amazing message. I had already heard about you so I knew you could preach. But you blew me away. Seriously though, that was a really strong message. One that is really needed in the world. I am so sorry that I had to mark you down for being 4.5 mins over time. But that doesn\'t matter, every great preacher runs over time. I want to encourage you on one thing. Being able to move away from the pulpit, away from your notes and preach. It is hard to do but I believe this is your next level. As you do your outline, try to bullet point things that will make you remember what you need to talk about. Then take a quick look at your bullet point and allow God to bring to you mind what you need to preach. This takes practice, but preaching like this allows you to keep more eye contact, engage more with your audience and more importantly, allows God to bring thing to your memory that you can\'t always plan for. The Holy Spirit knows how to bring the word out of your heart and to your audience. God is also able to drop things in to your spirit in the last minute which is really powerful, especially when you had know idea you was going to speak it. Trust in the Holy Spirit and let Him lead you. Overall wow. What a message.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:28:51','2024-07-23 15:28:51'),(5429,'judge-event-evaluation-4207-1721712531',4207,149,6,11,2,2024,264,'810','2',0,4678,7888,33,'Collection','21,26',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Really beautiful singing I loved the harmonies just try to bring the lyrics next time :) ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:28:51','2024-07-23 15:28:51'),(5432,'judge-event-evaluation-4115-1721712566',4115,154,6,11,2,2024,220,'702',NULL,7249,5806,7841,3,'Collection','14',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:29:26','2024-07-23 15:29:26'),(5433,'judge-event-evaluation-42