,'Open','25',100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Ateca, A very strong message on faith. Everything that you said was on point and well written. I want to encourage you to have even move faith and confidence in what you are preaching. Make eye contact with your audience, don\'t doubt what you have to say. Everything you read was really great I just need you now to make eye contact and speak directly to the audience. One of the easiest places to start is your testimony, as you always remember because it has happened to you. Don\'t be afraid to not look at what you have written, look directly at you audience and share your life experience, especially about your siblings eating all the food. Overall it was a strong message on faith. Please also remember to add more contents and scriptures to your outline.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:49:02','2024-07-23 15:49:02'),(5453,'judge-event-evaluation-2915-1721713753',2915,111,6,11,2,2024,237,'753',NULL,7798,55,7863,3,'Open','15',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Runjie. Great performance. Try to make a blend sound and dynamics. Continue practising. Other than that, great effort.\r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-23 15:49:13','2024-07-23 15:49:13'),(5454,'judge-event-evaluation-3652-1721713883',3652,111,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7780,55,7483,50,'Open','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'  Thanks Ateca, for the wonderful message about faith. You really comes across very clear to the audience. Some tips to help you in your preaching \r\nsuch as to add the extra support scripture to the outline. Continue to develop the preaching for the future so that you can each your generation for Christ. \r\n\r\n\r\n  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N