L,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 00:47:23','2024-07-24 00:47:23'),(5482,'judge-event-evaluation-4406-1721746402',4406,154,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7813,5806,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for a great effort Shalom !\r\nKeep on reading and practicing and you will see immense growth in your abilities\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 00:53:22','2024-07-24 00:53:22'),(5483,'judge-event-evaluation-4400-1721746886',4400,154,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7266,5806,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Really great job Eliana !\r\nJust a bit more volume on your projectio would have greatly enhanced.\r\nGreat job with the expression ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 01:01:26','2024-07-24 01:01:26'),(5485,'judge-event-evaluation-4405-1721747311',4405,154,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7263,5806,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,84.50,-10,-0.50,'A very powerful and commanding voice \r\nThe length of the script did cause a few mishaps and errors since you sped up a bit\r\nYou have a great future ahead of you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 01:08:31','2024-07-24 01:08:31'),(5486,'judge-event-evaluation-4361-1721768366',4361,142,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7211,4208,7871,50,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Jiokapeci, What a great message on God\'s unfailing love. Gods love is so amazing and you were on point that Gods love never fails. I noticed that when you were preaching mid way through your hands began to move and your passion started to come through. The woman at the well was so convinced in Jesus that I can imagine her hands expressing this Jesus that she met. Her eyes fixed on the people she was speaking to an telling them with passion. When you preach don\'t be afraid to look me in the eyes, take your eyes off you writings and let your hearts passion speak. It was Jesus\'s passion and compassion that made all the difference in His message. Overall a great message, keep on preaching and continue to tell of God\'s unfailing love.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 06:59:26','2024-07-24 06:59:26'),(5487,'judge-event-evaluation-4420-1721769302',4420,154,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7266,5806,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1minute 18 seconds\r\nThank you for your effort.\r\nProjecting your voice and engaging the audience while presenting helps you get the message across. \r\nYou can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:15:02','2024-07-24 07:15:02'),(5488,'judge-event-evaluation-2502-1721769761',2502,149,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7771,4678,7871,50,'Collection','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Jokaveti, that was a powerful and very original message. Really well constructed, a great build up and straight to the heart. You brought a story to life and delivered it with precision. Well done. I want to encourage you to own your message. Speak with authority, make more eye contact, speak from your heart and not on the words you have on paper. This is a story that I know is embedded into your heart, when you preach it, put bullet points on your page and preach it like you know it. Your passion will come forth even more and your heart will speak out and your audience won\'t know what hit them. Allow the Spirit of God to bring back what you have written down in your memory and practice to preach what you know from the pages in your heart. Overall that was an amazing message. Well done for seeing into the life of Thomas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:22:41','2024-07-24 07:22:41'),(5489,'judge-event-evaluation-4344-1721769817',4344,142,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7174,4208,7871,50,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Aliya, you just delivered a great message on forgiveness. You used a powerful scripture and referenced an even more powerful scripture. Your message was on point, you kept eye contact and used your eyes and a head nod to command attention to your words. Very powerful. I want to encourage you to be even more bolder, speak louder, show no fear speak with authority. You are going to be an amazing preacher one day. Always preach what you have experienced and own the scriptures. Remember our history is His-Story. May God be glorified in you always. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:23:37','2024-07-24 07:23:37'),(5490,'judge-event-evaluation-4349-1721769882',4349,142,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7184,4208,7871,50,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Elena, What a wonderful sermon. Straight to the point on feeding your soul. You used so many examples including your own life which made me relate to what you was saying.\r\n\r\nI would like to see, when you preach, for you to make more eye contact with your audience. I know it is very hard to look up when you have to read, but I don\'t think you needed what was in front of you. You speak with life experience, and I know you would remember every word you said without looking down. Catch the eye of your audience and speak to them with your love and compassion and your message will persuade anyone to feed their soul. Well done, great message',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:24:42','2024-07-24 07:24:42'),(5491,'judge-event-evaluation-4457-1721769969',4457,111,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7637,55,7871,50,'Collection','25',100,97.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Elizabeth, what a strong and bold message. I am so glad you made yourself available to bring this message. You delivered your message with precision and used great scriptures. I heard the power in your voice and you made great eye contact. I would like to encourage you to keep on preaching and as you preach press in to you audience even more with questions with a pause. Eg Have you made yourself available (then give a pause and make eye contact to get that person to think about what you have asked). Remember the word of God is the power of God to salvation. The moment you speak it, let it soak into the hearer by getting them to think about what you said. Overall a fantastic message. well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:26:09','2024-07-24 07:26:10'),(5492,'judge-event-evaluation-1613-1721770123',1613,115,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7358,5804,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'1:01min\r\n\r\nThank you Misiafe. Well done. You are good at  memorization and sharing the message through your poem. Challenge yourself with a longer poem. Keep sharing God\'s love. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:28:43','2024-07-24 07:28:43'),(5493,'judge-event-evaluation-1613-1721770142',1613,115,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7358,5804,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute  1 second\r\nYou did your piece well, child of God!\r\nHowever, more actions and varying of your voice help perfecting your performance as this will help engage your audience well.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:29:02','2024-07-24 07:29:02'),(5495,'judge-event-evaluation-3645-1721770377',3645,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7696,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Eroni, I loved your message, and your understanding of the word. You showed confidence and boldness in the way you presented your message and a great reflection and testimony of your own life. One thing I would like to see is a stronger flow of your message. Imagine you are talking to me as a friend, and you want to convince me of your understanding of the word. You would read the scripture and then speak to me directly from the heart. Although you have what you want to say written down, try not to have to read it, but let it flow from your compassion of wanting to convince me of your word. You will never beable to write down everything. sometimes we just have to let it flow from our hearts, lead by the Holy Spirit. Please remember to add more content to your outline including scripture references.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:32:57','2024-07-24 07:32:57'),(5499,'judge-event-evaluation-4170-1721770494',4170,111,6,11,2,2024,345,'1058','1',0,55,7872,51,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Group performed well. Cohesive, coherent and well coordinated. Good characterisation of biblical characters and stories. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:34:54','2024-07-24 07:34:54'),(5500,'judge-event-evaluation-4411-1721770507',4411,154,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7814,5806,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'1:06min\r\n\r\nThank you David. That was well done. You shared a great message through your recitation. Your next challenge is to try a longer poem to share with others. You can do it. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:35:07','2024-07-24 07:35:07'),(5501,'judge-event-evaluation-4411-1721770707',4411,154,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7814,5806,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,89.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 6 seconds\r\nThank you for making it this far.\r\nI think you need to  be more relax when presenting. Remember God is with  you so do not fear and be yourself. Get your message through with much enthusiasm. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:38:27','2024-07-24 07:38:28'),(5502,'judge-event-evaluation-3613-1721771061',3613,111,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7747,55,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'0:36min\r\n\r\nThank you Liam. Well done on the your recitation. Your next challenge is to practise all the skills you learnt in this here for a longer piece. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:44:21','2024-07-24 07:44:21'),(5503,'judge-event-evaluation-3613-1721771288',3613,111,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7747,55,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 36 seconds\r\nThank you for the manner you delivered your poem, Liam.  With different audience that you may have, interacting and engaging them is very important since you have something to get across to them. \r\nBe more enthusiastic and Ibelieve you can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:48:08','2024-07-24 07:48:08'),(5506,'judge-event-evaluation-3778-1721771471',3778,142,6,11,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7176,4208,7863,22,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Minghao. Great performance.  Next time, please do play slowly with the given tempo and the notes. Other than that, thank you for your effort. \r\nBlessings~',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:51:11','2024-07-24 07:51:11'),(5508,'judge-event-evaluation-2903-1721771594',2903,111,6,11,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7725,55,7863,22,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Taake. Great performance! First timers, not so bad. Thank you for diligently practising. Continue, don\'t give up.\r\nBlessings~ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 07:53:14','2024-07-24 07:53:14'),(5509,'judge-event-evaluation-4171-1721771636',4171,111,6,11,2,2024,345,'1058','2',0,55,7841,51,'Open',NULL,100,49.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you; just needs a little more practice ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N