\r\nThough you did not really project your voice, uo engage everyone in the room with your lively presentation.\r\nWell dane!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:23:05','2024-07-24 08:23:05'),(5519,'judge-event-evaluation-2904-1721773417',2904,111,6,11,2,2024,235,'750',NULL,7692,55,7863,22,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,-0.50,'Breach of Guideline. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:23:37','2024-07-25 09:39:51'),(5520,'judge-event-evaluation-4141-1721773628',4141,154,6,11,2,2024,225,'707',NULL,7811,5806,7863,3,'Collection','18',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Jack! Great performance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:27:08','2024-07-24 08:27:08'),(5521,'judge-event-evaluation-1971-1721773661',1971,134,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7150,5805,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent reading Eliki !\r\nGreat use of different voices to portray different emotions\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:27:41','2024-07-24 08:27:41'),(5522,'judge-event-evaluation-1971-1721773742',1971,134,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7150,5805,7756,44,'Collection','24',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'wonderful performance by Eliki. He needs to improve on fluency (he missed and added few phrases that were not on his scripts).\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:29:02','2024-07-24 08:29:02'),(5523,'judge-event-evaluation-1949-1721773778',1949,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7531,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'1:02min\r\n\r\nThank you Kris. You memorized well except for a two missing words. The challenge is to speak loud and strong and to feel the message in the poem. When you feel the message, you will have actions to match the words. Thank you for your effort. Keep working and sharing. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:29:38','2024-07-24 08:29:38'),(5524,'judge-event-evaluation-1949-1721773792',1949,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7531,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,73.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 2 seconds\r\nThank you,  Kris.\r\nYou have come this far and I believe you can do better.  Your message must be heard and understood  well. Work on that and get assistance from your Supervisor to perfect you. You can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:29:52','2024-07-24 08:29:52'),(5525,'judge-event-evaluation-2910-1721773833',2910,111,6,11,2,2024,231,'713','1',0,55,7863,25,'Collection','23',100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you gentlemen. Work on your entrance (introduction) and how you are performing the song. Do it with confidence. Other than that, thank you for your effort. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:30:33','2024-07-24 08:30:33'),(5526,'judge-event-evaluation-4345-1721773910',4345,142,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7183,4208,7483,50,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Aviella,  for such  profound message that you have preached today. You have really lay it out o clearly through those points in your message with confidence with good illustrations. These are some tips for improvement such as including support scriptures for confirmation. Keep up the desire to reach your generation with your preaching God\'s word.        ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:31:50','2024-07-24 08:31:50'),(5527,'judge-event-evaluation-4345-1721773922',4345,142,6,11,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7183,4208,7871,50,'Collection','25',100,97.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Aviella, OK I am amazed that you are under 16 and you are already a preacher and teacher. That was a brilliant message on putting God first. The way you used your hands to display your message and eye contact all the way through was perfect. Keep on preaching and also teaching. Their was such a great element of teaching in your message that I believe you are going to be a great teacher and preacher. Please continue to study the word, this is where the Spirit of God will bring the words back to your memory in the times that you need them. And I pray that God will give you great revelation to teach and preach to many people. Remember, God said my people perish for lack of knowledge. You are going to teach many people throughout your life. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:32:02','2024-07-24 08:32:02'),(5528,'judge-event-evaluation-1955-1721774160',1955,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7532,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,89.50,-10,-0.50,'0:51min\r\n\r\nThank you Fatukalaa. Your poem reminds me of the wise servant who invested his 5 talents and received more. Your pace was good. Your voice was a bit hoarse from sport but the message was heard. Your next challenge is recite a longer poem with a great message. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:36:00','2024-07-24 08:36:00'),(5529,'judge-event-evaluation-1955-1721774214',1955,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7532,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,97.50,-10,-1.00,'Time: 51 seconds\r\nYou did a marvelous job. However, your time is below 1 minute  which is the minimum required time. Try something that will bring out that beautiful talent in you.\r\nThanks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:36:54','2024-07-24 08:36:54'),(5530,'judge-event-evaluation-1964-1721774217',1964,134,6,11,2,2024,307,'951','1',0,5805,7872,39,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Had to deduct points for not having to ask for lines a few times, but always remembered after a few words were provided. Under time limit - guideline breach. Good performance and good message, just some nerves getting in the way. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:36:57','2024-07-25 09:11:39'),(5531,'judge-event-evaluation-4445-1721774252',4445,142,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7211,4208,7789,44,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Well done ! You read with alot of confidence and it showed in your projection and volume \r\njust a few pronunciation errors , but overall well done\r\n Keep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:37:32','2024-07-24 08:37:32'),(5532,'judge-event-evaluation-4445-1721774336',4445,142,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7211,4208,7756,44,'Open','25',100,98.50,-10,-0.50,'Jiokapeci\'s presentation was beautiful. She needs to improve two things. Her time, as she did not reach the minimum time. Her time was 3mins- 24 secs. And her fluency- she missed few phrases in her story.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:38:56','2024-07-24 08:38:56'),(5533,'judge-event-evaluation-1964-1721774363',1964,134,6,11,2,2024,307,'951','1',0,5805,7841,39,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance ; just needs more practice ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:39:23','2024-07-25 09:11:39'),(5534,'judge-event-evaluation-1948-1721774634',1948,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7540,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'1:12min\r\n\r\nThank you Japheth. Proverbs tells us it is better to go a house of mourning than a party. Your recitation reminds us that your attitude in life matters. Your next challenge is to recite a longer piece and with more passion and action. Thank you for trying. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:43:54','2024-07-24 08:43:54'),(5535,'judge-event-evaluation-3609-1721774677',3609,111,6,11,2,2024,307,'951','1',0,55,7872,39,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good script, very good message. Dramatic techniques displayed effectively and cohesively. Breached guidelines as it was 1 minute 51 seconds. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU