orough. Excellent memory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:53:30','2024-07-24 08:53:30'),(5545,'judge-event-evaluation-1965-1721775348',1965,134,6,11,2,2024,307,'951','2',0,5805,7841,39,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:55:48','2024-07-24 08:55:49'),(5547,'judge-event-evaluation-2955-1721775418',2955,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7800,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,76.50,-10,NULL,'Thank you Daniel for putting forth a great effort !\r\nContinue practicing and trying out new ways of expressing , and using gestures to really enhance your reading skills\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:56:58','2024-07-24 08:56:58'),(5548,'judge-event-evaluation-2955-1721775507',2955,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7800,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Daniel displayed his story well. However, he has a few points to work on. \r\n1.Fluency\r\n2.Poise\r\n3.introduction\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 08:58:27','2024-07-24 08:58:27'),(5549,'judge-event-evaluation-4354-1721775738',4354,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7195,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,93.50,-10,-1.50,'Lachlan , you have preached a powerful message indeed to the audience today with confidence . Your personal testimony was so profound and genuine as you connect your life experience with message that definitely brings hope to those who hears it. Take note that supporting scriptures  must be included because it is vita in connecting the key factors throughout the message. Keep up the good work tat you\'ll become great a great preacher for your generation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:02:18','2024-07-24 09:02:18'),(5550,'judge-event-evaluation-1951-1721775764',1951,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7533,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,76.50,-10,-0.50,'0:57min\r\n\r\nThank you Zechariah for your time and effort in memorization. That was a big step towards longer recitation. Your challenge is to speak louder and with passion so your message is enjoyed by the audience. Keep working. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:02:44','2024-07-24 09:02:44'),(5551,'judge-event-evaluation-1951-1721775815',1951,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7533,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 57 seconds\r\nThank you. You delivered your message  and though the audience could hear you , I believe it is important that is well received. Keep practising and you will get there.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:03:35','2024-07-24 09:03:35'),(5552,'judge-event-evaluation-4394-1721776040',4394,154,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7242,5806,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,80.00,-10,-1.00,'Very good projection Benjamin ! Your voice is nice and loud.\r\nJust remember to look up once in awhile and engage with your audience ,and dont be afraid to use gestures and movements to enhance your story!\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NU