2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7535,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,82.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 30 seconds\r\nYou came this far and I believe there is more.  \r\nYou have a message to put across  so be creative and ensure that is heard and well received.\r\nAll the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:10:32','2024-07-24 09:10:32'),(5558,'judge-event-evaluation-1966-1721776688',1966,134,6,11,2,2024,307,'951','3',0,5805,7841,39,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome performance…just need to look for not using certain phrases in a performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:18:08','2024-07-25 09:15:33'),(5560,'judge-event-evaluation-2953-1721776786',2953,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7655,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Bryan !\r\nYou\'ve done well in your presentation\r\nWould\'ve loved to hear more projection from you as I know you can ,but I understand you had lost your voice , so it\'s fine\r\nDon\'t be shy to use more expressions and gestures to flavor your story \r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:19:46','2024-07-24 09:19:46'),(5561,'judge-event-evaluation-2953-1721776818',2953,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7655,55,7756,44,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Brian Fisher did a great performance. However, few points to improve on.\r\n1. Fluency- he missed a few phrases in history.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:20:18','2024-07-24 09:20:18'),(5562,'judge-event-evaluation-4449-1721776838',4449,142,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7176,4208,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,70.50,-10,-0.50,'0:40min\r\n\r\nThank you Minghao. Great effort on memorization. The challenge is to speak slowly and louder so your message can be enjoyed. Thank you for the wonderful message though. God bless as keep memorizing and reciting. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:20:38','2024-07-24 09:20:38'),(5563,'judge-event-evaluation-4449-1721776892',4449,142,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7176,4208,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,77.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 40 seconds\r\nYou did a good job, Minghao. \r\nYour message has to be heard by your audience so you need to speak louder and with clarity.\r\nAll the best in the  next Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:21:32','2024-07-24 09:21:32'),(5564,'judge-event-evaluation-4343-1721776991',4343,142,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7181,4208,7871,50,'Collection','24',100,69.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Josaia, Well done for you teaching on honesty. You used some good verses to support your message and read them very well. I would like to encourage you keep studying the word.  Keep allowing the word to speak to your heart and preach it out to others. I want to encourage you to share more about your personally experience with the word. Tell more about what the word means to you and speak boldy about how honesty will change our life\'s. A great message overall. well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:23:11','2024-07-24 09:23:11'),(5565,'judge-event-evaluation-1957-1721777186',1957,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7529,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'1:20min\r\n\r\nThank you Rushikesh. That was well paced and clear. The challenge was to speak louder so the audience can enjoy the message. Keep memorizing and reciting. The next poem should be longer and better. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:26:26','2024-07-24 09:26:26'),(5566,'judge-event-evaluation-2958-1721777333',2958,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7695,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,98.95,-10,-0.05,'Jihun displayed his story so well. A beautiful story indeed.\r\nHowever, he lost points on his time- as he did not meet the minimum required time. His time was 3mins -27secs.\r\n\r\nThank You Jihun.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:28:53','2024-07-24 09:28:53'),(5567,'judge-event-evaluation-1957-1721777337',1957,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7529,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,91.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 20 seconds\r\nThank you, Rushikesh.\r\nThough the room is small, you still need to project your voice and make sure that everyone hears your message.  Be the one in control and try to engage your audience during your presentation.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:28:57','2024-07-24 09:28:57'),(5568,'judge-event-evaluation-2958-1721777351',2958,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7695,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,84.00,-10,-0.50,'Well done Jihun!\r\nYou have done well in expressing such a deep and profound story\r\nKeep on learning and continue to push yourself to new levels with your reading skills, and you will become the best you can be !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:29:11','2024-07-24 09:29:11'),(5569,'judge-event-evaluation-4343-1721777657',4343,142,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7181,4208,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Josaia ,for the message that you preached today. You\'ve demonstrated confidence throughout the delivery of your message. Some of the key points to take note is to use hand gesture and facial expression to bring about the both the meaning and emotion in the message. Keep up the good work and may the Lord continue to enlarge you through preaching the Word to your generation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:34:17','2024-07-24 09:34:17'),(5570,'judge-event-evaluation-1953-1721777757',1953,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7210,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,76.50,-10,-0.50,'0.40min\r\n\r\nThank you William. Great effort at memorizing and reciting at Convention. Keep sharing and you will learn more skills. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:35:57','2024-07-24 09:35:57'),(5571,'judge-event-evaluation-2954-1721777786',2954,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7685,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,76.50,-10,-0.50,'Thank you Chazag for a great effort ! \r\nContinue to grow your skills and learning by enjoying reading \r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:36:26','2024-07-24 09:36:26'),(5572,'judge-event-evaluation-1953-1721777810',1953,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7210,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 40 minutes\r\nYou have come this far and I believe this more. Please choose a poem that suit you well and remember you have message to put across to the audience. Be yourself and do your best.\r\nThanks. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:36:50','2024-07-24 09:36:50'),(5573,'judge-event-evaluation-2954-1721777895',2954,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7685,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,91.50,-10,-0.50,'Chazag read a beautiful story. However, he needs to improve on a few things.\r\n\r\n1. timing \r\n2. fluency\r\n3. diction\r\n4. he needs to connect with his audience .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:38:15','2024-07-24 09:38:15'),(5574,'judge-event-evaluation-1633-1721778128',1633,115,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7525,5804,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'1:09min\r\n\r\nThank you Samuel. Great message for everyone. Keep practising with longer poems for next time. Project your voice and add some actions. All the best. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:42:08','2024-07-24 09:42:08'),(5575,'judge-event-evaluation-1633-1721778213',1633,115,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7525,5804,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 9 seconds\r\nThank you, Samuel.\r\nI believe you can do a better job, right? Just be yourself and remember there is a message  for your audience. It should be heard and received well. \r\nYou can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:43:33','2024-07-24 09:43:33'),(5576,'judge-event-evaluation-1952-1721778572',1952,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7143,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jordan. That was a great message. Well paced and with the gestures. The next challenge is to recite a longer poem and with passion to stir the audience. Thank you for your effort. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:49:32','2024-07-24 09:49:32'),(5578,'judge-event-evaluation-1952-1721778726',1952,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7143,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,99.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1minute 14 seconds\r\nI love listening to you as you delivered your message and you did with much simplicity  and clarity. I want more! You did an excellent job!\r\nPlease choose something more challenging and let us enjoy more of your excellent presentation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:52:06','2024-07-24 09:52:06'),(5579,'judge-event-evaluation-2952-1721778727',2952,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7792,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,98.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done Adil!! Voice projection and inflection was well displayed.\r\n\r\nWe exceeded our time to 7 mins 20 secs. He needs to familiarize more with his story to help him with fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:52:07','2024-07-24 09:52:07'),(5580,'judge-event-evaluation-3647-1721778743',3647,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7793,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Junhyeok, you have a smile that radiates love and joy. There is something very infectious about you. I loved the way you moved around the room while you read your message. This is a strong attribute when preaching. I want to encourage you on 2 things\r\n1. engage with the audience. You have to make more eye contact for longer. Your head was looking down at your paper most of the time. It is hard to do and it takes practice and remembering what you want to say. Use bullet points to remind you and just speak the love from your heart. Trust in the Holy Spirit as He will bring back to your memory the words you need.\r\n2. Use life stories, real testimonies to help us connect with your message. \r\nOverall that was beautiful message on love, the verses you used were spot on. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:52:23','2024-07-24 09:52:23'),(5581,'judge-event-evaluation-3647-1721778915',3647,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7793,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Junhyek, for the wonderful message about \" Love\". You have the natural way to present the message. These a some tips to help you to better your preaching skill. Preaching is declaring and not teaching. Key thoughts must be supported with scriptures that interpret the idea correctly. Right scriptural context is so vital to keep the message in the right direction .\r\nMay the Lord use you to reach your generation through preaching.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:55:15','2024-07-24 09:55:15'),(5582,'judge-event-evaluation-3612-1721779018',3612,111,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7670,55,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'1min\r\n\r\nThank you Fereti. That was a good challenge for you but you did it. Your next challenge is to use this experience for a longer recitation and bless others. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:56:58','2024-07-24 09:56:58'),(5583,'judge-event-evaluation-3612-1721779125',3612,111,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7670,55,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,93.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute\r\nYou did well, Fereti.\r\nLet your audience enjoy your performance as you deliver  your message in a relaxed manner and mean what you say.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 09:58:45','2024-07-24 09:58:45'),(5584,'judge-event-evaluation-1972-1721779396',1972,134,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7133,5805,7789,44,'Open','24',100,91.00,-10,-1.00,'Excellent reading George !\r\nGreat use of voices and expressions to create an atmosphere \r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:03:16','2024-07-24 10:03:16'),(5585,'judge-event-evaluation-1954-1721779460',1954,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7145,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,91.50,-10,-0.50,'0:48min\r\n\r\nThank you Kaleb. That was an interesting poem. It was too short though. Your next challenge is to recite a longer poem and to use all the dramatic skills learnt here for that recitation. Keep reciting to sharpen the skills and more importantly to learn life lessons. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:04:20','2024-07-24 10:04:20'),(5586,'judge-event-evaluation-1954-1721779585',1954,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7145,5805,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,98.50,-10,-1.00,'Time: 48mintes\r\nI like the way you presented your poem and I believe you can make a good speaker. However, as an audience, I need more to it. Something that engage and stay on it to the end.  Be more enthusiastic about it and be the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:06:25','2024-07-24 10:06:26'),(5587,'judge-event-evaluation-3608-1721779813',3608,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7735,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,78.50,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Tyrone for presenting!\r\nWould\'ve liked to see you put a bit more life into the story and really bring it out\r\nYou have the ability !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:10:13','2024-07-24 10:10:13'),(5589,'judge-event-evaluation-4597-1721780062',4597,154,6,11,2,2024,310,'954','1',0,5806,7872,41,'Open',NULL,100,79.50,-10,-2.50,'Use of props, lighting and sound clearly indicates the scenes and narration techniques. Very well done, thought through and performed well. A little bit of work on memory would be good, but very well done nonetheless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:14:22','2024-07-24 10:14:22'),(5590,'judge-event-evaluation-1942-1721780272',1942,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7125,5805,7166,45,'Open','25',100,80.50,-10,-0.50,'0:49min\r\n\r\nThank you Charlize. The message was clear and interesting to listen to. The challenge is to speak slower and louder. Next poem should be longer and better as you have gained some skills in this poem. Keep reciting and sharing with friends and family. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:17:52','2024-07-24 10:17:52'),(5591,'judge-event-evaluation-4597-1721780297',4597,154,6,11,2,2024,310,'954','1',0,5806,7841,41,'Open',NULL,100,48.50,-10,-2.50,'Thank you; just needs more practice ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:18:17','2024-07-24 10:18:17'),(5592,'judge-event-evaluation-1942-1721780310',1942,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7125,5805,7759,45,'Open','25',100,95.00,-10,-1.00,'Time: 49 minutes\r\nThank you.\r\nAim to meet the expectation of your audience as you put across your message. Be yourself and try your best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:18:30','2024-07-24 10:18:30'),(5593,'judge-event-evaluation-3649-1721780447',3649,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7795,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,64.00,-10,-1.00,'Hi Mesulame, Very good and interesting message on swearing. One of the most original messages I heard throughout. Well done for studying the scriptures and applying them to your life and sharing you experience. I want to encourage you to focus in on the main points of the scriptures you used for you message. you read alot of the word, which caused you to go over time. Try to use only the verses that are relevant to your message, this will help you drive your message through to your hearers without them being distracted on other words. Overall well done for your original message, really good to hear.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:20:47','2024-07-24 10:20:47'),(5594,'judge-event-evaluation-4716-1721780466',4716,142,6,11,2,2024,345,'1058','1',0,4208,7872,51,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Group movement was consistent. Well done performance ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:21:06','2024-07-24 10:21:06'),(5595,'judge-event-evaluation-4716-1721780486',4716,142,6,11,2,2024,345,'1058','1',0,4208,7841,51,'Open',NULL,100,48.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:21:26','2024-07-24 10:21:26'),(5596,'judge-event-evaluation-1941-1721780692',1941,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7158,5805,7166,45,'Open','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'1:41min\r\n\r\nThank you Bethany. That was done well. I\'m sure the audience enjoyed your recitation and skills. The next challenge is to recite a longer poem and with better skills. Keep sharing God\'s love. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:24:52','2024-07-24 10:24:52'),(5597,'judge-event-evaluation-4354-1721780721',4354,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7195,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,89.50,-10,-1.50,'Hi Lachlan, there is something very special about you that came across ass you preached. You have alot of knowledge, through the scriptures, and much understanding. The used so many scriptures to bring forth your message and they were really good. I want to encourage to slow down. There is so much in you, so much to share and we only give you 8 mins. Definitely not long enough. But you have to be wise with how much you put into your message, and which scriptures will speak more to the person to the people you are preaching to. Focus in on certain scriptures, and allow even that 1 verse to do the most. Remember, the word of God is the power of God to salvation. It\'s not about how much we can get in but more so which word will touch the hearts of your hearer. I also wanted to encourage you to make more eye contact. When you spoke your testimony you kept eye contact and you even quoted scriptures from your heart, which I know the Spirit of ago brought back to your memory. Rely on the Holy Spirit, not on what you have written, as the Spirit of God will bring the word of God back to your memory in the time you need it. Remember its not about what we can do, but what the Spirit of God brings out of us. Overall your message was a very strong message.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:25:21','2024-07-24 10:25:21'),(5598,'judge-event-evaluation-1941-1721780774',1941,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7158,5805,7759,45,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 41 seconds\r\nYou took the poem and delivered it as your own. You engage your audience and  I believe they like it. However, memorizing your poem seem to lack a bit and it does affect your presentation. \r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:26:14','2024-07-24 10:26:14'),(5599,'judge-event-evaluation-4393-1721780903',4393,154,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7255,5806,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,-1.00,'Excellent work Alexander !\r\nQuite a lengthy story , so there was a small deduction, but you did a great job in bringing out the different emotions.\r\nJust a tip , would be to look up every so often and include the audience in your presentation\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:28:23','2024-07-24 10:28:23'),(5600,'judge-event-evaluation-4393-1721780906',4393,154,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7255,5806,7756,44,'Collection','24',100,97.00,-10,-1.00,'Beautiful  story displayed by Alexander . However, we exceeded our time to 7mins, and he needs to work fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:28:26','2024-07-24 10:28:26'),(5602,'judge-event-evaluation-1944-1721781255',1944,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7136,5805,7759,45,'Open','25',100,90.50,-10,-1.00,'Time: 40 seconds\r\nThat was a great poem. However, it is not suitable or may be too easy for you. Please try to work on a more challenging piece that will better showcase your ability.  Engage all your audience and peak to them with much enthusiasm.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:34:15','2024-07-24 10:34:15'),(5603,'judge-event-evaluation-4397-1721781712',4397,154,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7246,5806,7756,44,'Collection','24',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Congratulations!!\r\nWell done Sisa.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:41:52','2024-07-24 10:41:52'),(5604,'judge-event-evaluation-4397-1721781872',4397,154,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7246,5806,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Very well done Sisa !\r\nGreat use of different expressions and emotions displayed\r\nJust be careful with shifting around too much',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:44:32','2024-07-24 10:44:32'),(5605,'judge-event-evaluation-3649-1721782202',3649,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7795,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good preaching Mesulame. You have the confidence  your presentation today. Some tips to help you such as explaining well the key thought, because thee are words that has more than one meaning. Right interpretation leads to the right direction in a message. Personal testimony should carry a challenge to the  hearers. I pray that God will continue to work in your life in marvelous ways so that you\'ll minister to your generation.    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:50:02','2024-07-24 10:50:02'),(5606,'judge-event-evaluation-1970-1721782338',1970,134,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7532,5805,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for a job well done !\r\nTry not to rush when reading so your words are clear and precise .\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 10:52:18','2024-07-24 10:52:18'),(5607,'judge-event-evaluation-1970-1721782381',1970,134,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7532,5805,7756,44,'Collection','24',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful story displayed by Fatukaala.\r\n\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NUL