tory by Jack Valetine. However , he needs to improve on his fluency and time.\r\n\r\nVinaka ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:10:38','2024-07-24 11:10:38'),(5613,'judge-event-evaluation-4395-1721783517',4395,154,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7811,5806,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,91.50,-10,-0.50,'Well done Jack!\r\nPlease remember to slow down and try to speak clearly so as to not stumble over your words.\r\nGood use of expressions and gestures !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:11:57','2024-07-24 11:11:57'),(5614,'judge-event-evaluation-4717-1721783633',4717,142,6,11,2,2024,345,'1058','2',0,4208,7872,51,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well performed. Good memory and recitation of difficult passages. 30 seconds under minimum time, guidelines breached. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:13:53','2024-07-25 10:00:04'),(5615,'judge-event-evaluation-4399-1721783809',4399,154,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7270,5806,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Very fluently expressed Alina!\r\nRemember to not rush through too quickly , so as to be able to fully express yourself through each word.\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:16:49','2024-07-24 11:16:49'),(5616,'judge-event-evaluation-4717-1721783898',4717,142,6,11,2,2024,345,'1058','2',0,4208,7841,51,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Nice performance; just need to be over the time',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:18:18','2024-07-25 10:00:04'),(5617,'judge-event-evaluation-4402-1721783977',4402,154,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7264,5806,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,82.50,-10,-0.50,'Great effort Hadassah !\r\nSlightly under the time minimum\r\nWhen performing , always be sure to project your voice loudly and confidently- Don\'t be shy !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:19:37','2024-07-24 11:19:37'),(5618,'judge-event-evaluation-4398-1721784284',4398,154,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7259,5806,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,87.50,-10,-0.50,'Well done Abigail !\r\nJust remember to look up every so often and interact with the crowd\r\nYou sped up at times,causing you to go under the minimum\r\nKeep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:24:44','2024-07-24 11:24:44'),(5619,'judge-event-evaluation-4438-1721784694',4438,142,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7565,4208,7789,44,'Open','24',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Jiajun!\r\nKeep on reading and refining your skills !\r\nPracticing will really improve your abilities !\r\n Keep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:31:34','2024-07-24 11:31:34'),(5620,'judge-event-evaluation-4434-1721784927',4434,144,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7612,1404,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,83.50,-10,-1.00,'Excellent effort Jessica !\r\nYou have done well to portray emotions and meaning to your story.\r\nDon\'t be shy to really open up and let the expressions flow confidently \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:35:27','2024-07-24 11:35:27'),(5621,'judge-event-evaluation-4598-1721785300',4598,154,6,11,2,2024,310,'954','4',0,5806,7872,41,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Took a while to set up the stage. Very well done, with a good message about the Christmas. Memory was a little off, but with practice that could easily be remembered. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:41:40','2024-07-24 11:41:40'),(5622,'judge-event-evaluation-4598-1721785422',4598,154,6,11,2,2024,310,'954','4',0,5806,7841,41,'Open',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Great job ; please run through lines',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 11:43:42','2024-07-24 11:43:42'),(5624,'judge-event-evaluation-3651-1721785924',3651,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7685,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Chazag, for what you\'ve preached today in the area of God\'s ability to change lives. These are some of the key factors that will help you to become effective preacher. Always write in the support scripture in our outline. Hand gesture will give the audience a sense of engagement with you. Facial expression create the emotional feel  for the audience.  Keep on study God\'s word that will fill you with knowledge for what you can preach.                                                                                      ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL