. Your challenge is memorization which affected your confidence a bit. Also remember you have an audience to share the message with so look towards them too. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:00:14','2024-07-24 12:00:14'),(5631,'judge-event-evaluation-3651-1721786435',3651,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7685,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Chazaag, it was great to hear a message on God\'s ability to change life\'s. Your testimony is really good on how God changed your life. A very well read message. Well done. I would like to encourage you to continue to study the scriptures. Think about how they fit in with what you are preaching and focusing in on the points that are most in line with your topic. Heb 13:8 is great verse that talks about how Jesus is the same, yesterday, today, and forever more. Emphasise more on the fact that God has not changed. Ask the question, does God still heal, focus more into how our life\'s change from the results of what God has done. Try to keep in line with your title. Please also remember to add more contents into your outline. Overall a great message, well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:00:35','2024-07-24 12:00:36'),(5636,'judge-event-evaluation-3636-1721786884',3636,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7798,55,7888,45,'Open','24',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Really good job, I loved how well you memorised it.\r\n\r\nMaybe next time you can work on your diction/enunciation so the words all sound proper English.\r\n\r\nI also loved your tone and  and how it flowed beautifully.\r\n\r\nThanks so much for joining in :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:08:04','2024-07-24 12:08:04'),(5637,'judge-event-evaluation-2080-1721786919',2080,134,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7128,5805,7871,50,'Open','24',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Ronald, I loved your message on hope. The scripture references were on point, you had so many references of people in the bible that had hope. Very well preached well done. I would like to encourage you to also use examples from your own life. Personal testimony to help people connect and draw closer to your passion on hope. Also utilise questions to you audience with a moment of pause to give time for reflection on the questions or statements made. Overall a brilliant message on hope. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:08:39','2024-07-24 12:08:39'),(5640,'judge-event-evaluation-2080-1721787291',2080,134,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7128,5805,7483,50,'Open','24',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Ronald ,for the wonderful message that you\'ve preached today. You have demonstrated  confidence in your presentation . Some hints to improve your preaching skill such as using hand gesture to is express what your thoughts and facial expression connect you to with audience emotionally. Keep up the good work and may the Lord increase your capacity through His word  so that you can reach your generation through preaching.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:14:51','2024-07-24 12:14:51'),(5641,'judge-event-evaluation-4599-1721787357',4599,154,6,11,2,2024,310,'954','3',0,5806,7872,41,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Sound effects volume made it difficult to hear, but a good message, well written and well performed. Well put together with costume changes and fast pace. Only 6 seconds overtime. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:15:57','2024-07-24 12:15:57'),(5642,'judge-event-evaluation-4435-1721787424',4435,144,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7610,1404,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,87.50,-10,NULL,'1:52min\r\n\r\nThank you Matthew. That was a great recitation. Your challenge is to speak slower so the message is clearer. Memorize and recite a longer poem next time. You can do it. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:17:04','2024-07-24 12:17:04'),(5643,'judge-event-evaluation-1960-1721787601',1960,134,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7120,5805,7888,45,'Open','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Very lovely go.\r\n\r\nI loved how you looked confident, had amazing actions and your whole body was full of emotion.\r\n\r\nYou memorised it really well too\r\n\r\nOne thing you could work on is your diction. The majority of the words were good, but there were maybe one or two which were bad.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:20:01','2024-07-24 12:20:01'),(5644,'judge-event-evaluation-4435-1721787617',4435,144,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7610,1404,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 52 seconds\r\nYou delivered your poem with confidence but I need you to take note with the following points:\r\n1. Make your message clearly heard and understood.\r\n2. Know your audience well and engage them while presenting.\r\n3. Be yourself and take ownership of your poem.\r\nYou can do It!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N