 effort Su Ning Liu\r\nKeep up your reading and continue to practice consistently and you\'ll see your skills grow !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:29:23','2024-07-24 12:29:23'),(5651,'judge-event-evaluation-4143-1721788214',4143,111,6,11,2,2024,282,'900','1',0,55,7757,38,NULL,'30',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Withdraw due to bereavement absence of a team member.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:30:14','2024-07-24 12:30:14'),(5652,'judge-event-evaluation-3607-1721788244',3607,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7729,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,95.50,-10,-0.50,'Great performance by Sung Liu. He needs to improve on his time,fluency and gestures.\r\n\r\nVinaka .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:30:44','2024-07-24 12:30:44'),(5654,'judge-event-evaluation-2606-1721788376',2606,149,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7774,4678,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 2 minutes 11seconds\r\nYou have good memory. This is one of the longest poem I have seen and you had no problem in remembering all your lines. An advise to you would be to take it as your own and deliver it keeping in mind of your audience and the message they need to hear.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:32:56','2024-07-24 12:32:57'),(5655,'judge-event-evaluation-4290-1721788383',4290,134,6,11,2,2024,353,'870','1',0,5805,7471,34,'Open','27',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for a beautiful performance :) A bit more gusto (projection):would have really taken it to the next level, but it was a wonderfully sung performance nonetheless. No music Score unfortunately lost you a few points',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:33:03','2024-07-24 12:33:03'),(5656,'judge-event-evaluation-4726-1721788458',4726,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7796,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Shrenik, for wonderful message you\'ve preached today with confidence . Some tips that will help you to better your preaching such as using gesture to make the points clear and facial expression to connect with the  audience emotionally for them to feel the message.  Make you continue to pursue God and He will make you to be effectively preach to your generation for His glory. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:34:18','2024-07-24 12:34:18'),(5657,'judge-event-evaluation-4726-1721788467',4726,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7796,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Shrenik, your study on wisdom is fantastic. The bible says \"Study to shew thyself approved unto God, a workman that needeth not to be ashamed, rightly dividing the word of truth (2 Tim 2:15). Well done as your understanding came out in your word and I loved the example of swimming/ drowning. These are the kind of examples that cause people to remember your message for a life time. I want to encourage you to connect with your audience. Your written message is powerful and I want you to practice remembering your word and preach it with passion from the heart. The moment you gave your testimony, you took your eyes completely away from the page, and connected your eyes with your audience. At that moment you drew me in. Eye contact is very important when preaching. Use bullet points to remember part of you message and them preach from you heart. The Holy Spirit will bring back into your memory all the things you need to say. Overall a awesome message on wisdom. Well done ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:34:27','2024-07-24 12:34:27'),(5658,'judge-event-evaluation-1950-1721788512',1950,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7530,5805,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,0.00,-10,-0.50,'0:48min\r\n\r\nThank you Om. I like your poem and your presentation. It would have been better if it was slower and louder. Keep practising. You are ready for a longer challenge/poem now. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:35:12','2024-07-25 09:08:22'),(5659,'judge-event-evaluation-1959-1721788526',1959,134,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7122,5805,7888,45,'Open','24',100,58.00,-10,-1.00,'You had a really nice appearance, and was very neat.\r\n\r\nYou looked really confident until you forgot the words\r\n\r\nBut a really good job for trying.\r\n\r\nMaybe next time spend a bit more time memorising and making actions for the words.\r\n\r\nWe look forward to see the results  and hope you keep trying harder, so that next year you will do amazing at it.\r\n\r\nThanks so much for your time\r\n\r\n:)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:35:26','2024-07-24 12:35:26'),(5662,'judge-event-evaluation-4308-1721788667',4308,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7652,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,-0.50,'Great effort Dhyana !\r\nDont be shy to really put your voice out there , and get creative with your expressions!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:37:47','2024-07-24 12:37:47'),(5663,'judge-event-evaluation-4308-1721788698',4308,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7652,55,7756,44,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,-1.00,'Diyana expressing reading was beautiful. She needs to work on her time and she also needs to be connecting with her audience.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:38:18','2024-07-24 12:38:18'),(5664,'judge-event-evaluation-4417-1721788782',4417,154,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7269,5806,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 28 seconds\r\nThank you for your effort. \r\nPlease continue be encouraged as you make the poem your own to deliver the message to your audience in a humble and loving way getting the message through to them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:39:42','2024-07-24 12:39:42'),(5667,'judge-event-evaluation-4413-1721789138',4413,154,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7811,5806,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'1:30min\r\n\r\nThank you Jack. That was a great message through recitation. Keep up the good work of sharing God\'s love. Your next challenge is a longer recitation. You can use all the skills you\'ve learnt from this recitation. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:45:38','2024-07-24 12:45:38'),(