 and try to slow down and take each word at a time\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:55:32','2024-07-24 12:55:32'),(5674,'judge-event-evaluation-3653-1721789960',3653,111,6,11,2,2024,330,'979',NULL,7787,55,7483,50,'Open','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Salaseini, for the powerful message you\'ve preached today and you have demonstrated self confidence. Note that the judges can only judge fairly if you provide for them your sermon outline. Hand gesture when use properly is a good way of expressing a thought to the audience. Keep up the good work that the Lord continue to do marvelous things so that you can preach to your generation.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:59:20','2024-07-24 12:59:20'),(5675,'judge-event-evaluation-4415-1721789975',4415,154,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7248,5806,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Reece. That was great recitation. Keep up the good work of sharing God\'s love. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 12:59:35','2024-07-24 12:59:35'),(5678,'judge-event-evaluation-4413-1721790245',4413,154,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7811,5806,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,96.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 30 seconds\r\nYou did a great job, Jack.\r\nYou have a long poem and you memorized 99% of it. I want to see you more enthusiastic about it and engage your audience well.\r\nThank you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:04:05','2024-07-24 13:04:05'),(5679,'judge-event-evaluation-4415-1721790303',4415,154,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7248,5806,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,98.50,-10,NULL,'Time:3minutes 28 seconds\r\nWow, That was beautiful, Joseph. You have the longest poem so far and you did well. If you make it more realistic especially with your expression, it will definitely be awesome. \r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:05:03','2024-07-24 13:05:03'),(5680,'judge-event-evaluation-3603-1721790312',3603,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7795,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work Mesulame , nice and loud and clear !\r\nJust be careful that your actions dont take away too much from your reading, keep it simple and flowing\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:05:12','2024-07-24 13:05:12'),(5683,'judge-event-evaluation-3603-1721790464',3603,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7795,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Mesulame displayed an interesting story on Jonah!! He connected with his Audience well where he made everyone laughed including the judges. What a performance!! However Mesulame needs to improve on fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:07:44','2024-07-24 13:07:44'),(5685,'judge-event-evaluation-4302-1721790893',4302,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7686,55,7888,45,'Open','24',100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Really good job, you looked confident , but maybe next time you could add some more movements when you speak, not just reuse the same ones more than twice.\r\n\r\nAlso maybe spend more time on memorising it.\r\n\r\nOther than those you did well, you entered and left really well, never broke character and had nice facial expressions.\r\n\r\nIm looking forwards to see what you have placed. Good luck :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:14:53','2024-07-24 13:14:53'),(5686,'judge-event-evaluation-3601-1721790958',3601,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7791,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,90.50,-10,NULL,'Very clear and precise reading ! Great projection\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:15:58','2024-07-24 13:15:58'),(5688,'judge-event-evaluation-3601-1721791016',3601,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7791,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Judah! \r\n\r\nJudah delivered his expressing reading well. Voice projection was very good.\r\nWe just need to work on our fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:16:56','2024-07-24 13:16:56'),(5689,'judge-event-evaluation-4447-1721791199',4447,142,6,11,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7178,4208,7871,50,'Collection','24',100,95.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Tian, very well structured message on patience. You used alot of scripture references and different people in the bible to bring your message to life. I love the way you used your hands and looked at your audience to bring across your message. I would like to encourage you to keep on preaching like this, using hand gestures and looking more into the eyes of the audience. Use questions that will challenge the thinking of your audience, and allow scriptures a little time to soak into the their hearts, before giving another. Dramtic pauses work really well. Overall a great message on patience. well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:19:59','2024-07-24 13:19:59'),(5690,'judge-event-evaluation-4450-1721791320',4450,142,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7178,4208,7166,45,'Collection','24',100,72.50,-10,-0.50,'0:49min\r\n\r\nThank you Tian for your recitation.  WIth more recitation, your skills will improve. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:22:00','2024-07-24 13:22:00'),(5691,'judge-event-evaluation-4450-1721791330',4450,142,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7178,4208,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,86.00,-10,-1.00,'Time: 49 minutes \r\nYou presented your poem well.\r\nHowever, make it more interesting and worth listening to with more expressions.\r\nAll the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:22:10','2024-07-24 13:22:10'),(5692,'judge-event-evaluation-3605-1721791461',3605,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7796,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,84.50,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Shrenik for a clear reading !\r\nwould love to see more expressions and gestures !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:24:21','2024-07-24 13:24:21'),(5693,'judge-event-evaluation-1915-1721791783',1915,144,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7224,1404,7166,45,'Open','25',100,88.50,-10,-0.50,'0:51min\r\n\r\nThank you 