,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Absent from Convention',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:43:20','2024-07-24 13:43:20'),(5703,'judge-event-evaluation-4351-1721792775',4351,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7566,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'THank Youg for preaching  a good message today yet you manage to stay on track with your sermon. Hand gesture and facial expression are two  important component that connects your message emotionally with clear illustration  to the audience.  I prayer that you\'ll develop in Christ a passion for preach to your generation in powerful ways. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:46:15','2024-07-24 13:46:15'),(5704,'judge-event-evaluation-4351-1721792787',4351,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7566,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,68.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Dawang, really good to hear your message on prayer. You structured your message really well and you used alot of supporting scriptures on prayer. keep on studying the word and letting the words speak to your heart. Continue to pray and allow God to show you His mighty hand because you prayed. I want to encourage you to try to make more eye contact. Your testimony was more powerful because you made more eye contact and spoke to you audience. Overall a very well structured message well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 13:46:27','2024-07-24 13:46:27'),(5707,'judge-event-evaluation-4600-1721793128',4600,154,6,11,2,2024,306,'950','2',0,5806,7872,38,'Open','29',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Guideline breach - 4 minutes 