NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:01:17','2024-07-25 09:40:31'),(5713,'judge-event-evaluation-1956-1721793734',1956,134,6,11,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7144,5805,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,87.50,-10,-1.00,'Time: 0.37 minutes\r\nThank you for your presentation.\r\nThe minimum time for poetry recitation is 1minute. Therefore you need to choose a piece that is 1 minute and above. With what I have seen, I believe you can do it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:02:14','2024-07-24 14:02:14'),(5714,'judge-event-evaluation-4259-1721793890',4259,111,6,11,2,2024,283,'901','1',0,55,7757,39,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the great and funny performance. Natural interaction and charisma. Memorization is also important to convey and boost delivery of your message. Thank you, both! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:04:50','2024-07-25 09:40:31'),(5715,'judge-event-evaluation-4353-1721793905',4353,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7563,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,72.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Kunda, a very good message on compassion. I love your understanding on compassion and your testimony that really made a connection with me. Well done for your study and referencing of other scriptures on the topic of compassion. I would like to encourage you to make more of a connection with you audience. Try to talk directly to them by looking at them and preaching directly from your heart. Your testimony is an easy way to look someone in the eye and share, because you remember it. Don\'t be afraid to took up and just say what in your heart. Overall a well written message on being kind and compassionate. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:05:05','2024-07-24 14:05:05'),(5716,'judge-event-evaluation-3634-1721794038',3634,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7696,55,7888,45,'Open','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Very nice job\r\n\r\nBut please, please, please memorise the whole thing.\r\n\r\nYou looked really confident, except when you forgot what to say.\r\n\r\nTo be fair it was an extremely long poem.\r\n\r\nYou had nice facial expressions, and you projected loudly and clearly and your diction was magnificent\r\n\r\nThe only thing is to memorise and you would have done so well.\r\n\r\nGood job, we are looking to see what you have placed.\r\n\r\nThank you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:07:18','2024-07-24 14:07:18'),(5717,'judge-event-evaluation-4418-1721794067',4418,154,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7270,5806,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,-1.00,'Time: Less than a minute\r\nThank you for the effort. \r\nI hope to see you work on a piece suitable to your ability. The minimum time is 1 minute.\r\nYou can do it!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:07:47','2024-07-24 14:07:47'),(5718,'judge-event-evaluation-4353-1721794177',4353,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7563,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Cen, for the message of \" Kind and Compassionate\" at you have preached today. Some tips of help in preaching ;such as articulation which give very clear pronunciation of word.  Hand gesture to point to important things in a topic with facial expression connect the message emotionally to the audience. May you increase in understanding God\'s word so that you can preach effectively to your  generation.                                                                                    ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:09:37','2024-07-24 14:09:38'),(5722,'judge-event-evaluation-1933-1721794492',1933,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7543,5805,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Did not attend Convention',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:14:52','2024-07-24 14:14:52'),(5723,'judge-event-evaluation-3637-1721794523',3637,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7796,55,7888,45,'Open','24',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Really good job, thank you for trying so hard.\r\n\r\nJust next time try to memorise it, and maybe add some facial expressions.\r\n\r\nYour actions were good, but when someone looks at you, they look at their face to see if they look happy, confident, and have good facial expressions.\r\n\r\nBut you entered and left the stage really well and you made it flow well (except for when you forgot the words)\r\n\r\nIm looking forward to seeing your score, thank you for doing poetry this year :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:15:23','2024-07-24 14:15:23'),(5725,'judge-event-evaluation-4432-1721794966',4432,144,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7612,1404,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 21 seconds\r\nYou did a good job with your presentation.\r\nHowever, I believe your piece was a bit too easy and hope to see you working on a piece that is more challenging to bring out the talent in you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:22:46','2024-07-24 14:22:46'),(5726,'judge-event-evaluation-4357-1721795531',4357,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7564,4208,7871,50,'Open','24',100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Xinyu, Thank you for your wonderful message on friendliness. Your message is structured very well and it shows us how people have different personality\'s but they still require love. Well done for standing up and preaching your message. It is never easy to stand in front of people and speak what God has given you. Continue to grow in confidence and boldness as you preach your message. Try to look at your audience abit more and tell them what God has laid on your heart. Overall a very good reading on friendliness. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:32:11','2024-07-24 14:32:11'),(5728,'judge-event-evaluation-4177-1721795770',4177,134,6,11,2,2024,366,'656','1',0,5805,7471,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'91 Well done! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:36:10','2024-07-24 14:36:10'),(5729,'judge-event-evaluation-4357-1721795819',4357,142,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7564,4208,7483,50,'Open','24',100,66.50,-10,-2.50,'Thanks Gao, for the word you preached day with confidence. Some hints to assist you in improving your presentation. Good projection with clear articulation of what you preach will bring the attention of the hearers. When a company\'s with hand gesture and facial expression will connect the message emotionally the audience and keep them engage with your message.  Keep on pressing on the high calling of God in your life.  \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:36:59','2024-07-24 14:36:59'),(5730,'judge-event-evaluation-4594-1721795853',4594,154,6,11,2,2024,366,'656','1',0,5806,7471,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done pushing through even though some mistakes were made. Try again next year and don\'t be afraid to be really lively',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:37:33','2024-07-24 14:37:33'),(5731,'judge-event-evaluation-4688-1721795945',4688,154,6,11,2,2024,283,'901','1',0,5806,7872,39,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Amusing, good use of dramatic skills. Well planned out and practiced. Good pace and pose. Very engaging. Only issue is guideline breach - 3 minutes 58 seconds. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:39:05','2024-07-25 10:00:55'),(5732,'judge-event-evaluation-4688-1721796015',4688,154,6,11,2,2024,283,'901','1',0,5806,7841,39,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome!….just need to be over the time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:40:15','2024-07-25 10:00:55'),(5733,'judge-event-evaluation-4743-1721796051',4743,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7669,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,72.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you for putting forth a great effort !\r\nKeep on reading and practicing your pronunciations and you will continue to grow !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:40:51','2024-07-24 14:40:51'),(5734,'judge-event-evaluation-4688-1721796111',4688,154,6,11,2,2024,283,'901','1',0,5806,7757,39,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent performance, girls! Keep up the great work. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:41:51','2024-07-25 10:00:55'),(5735,'judge-event-evaluation-4291-1721796147',4291,154,6,11,2,2024,353,'870','1',0,5806,7471,34,'Open','27',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:42:27','2024-07-24 14:42:27'),(5737,'judge-event-evaluation-3648-1721797110',3648,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7790,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Shuangbo, Well done for your message on belief and salvation. You went all out and preached your message boldly with confidence. Well done. You allowed your hands to paint the picture, you moved around and you used lots of eye contact. Everything a great preacher has. Well done. I would like to encourage you in your message structure. Question and challenge your audience. Ask questions with a pause or make a bold statement with a pause. Allow your words to sink into the hearts in these pausing moments while looking into the eyes of your audience. With a message on salvation there should always be a question of \"Have you recieved this salvation\". There are many people who will hear a message on salvation and be waiting for an invitation to recieve it. Overall a well presented message through mouth, eyes and body language. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 14:58:30','2024-07-24 14:58:30'),(5738,'judge-event-evaluation-4430-1721797320',4430,154,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7268,5806,7759,45,'Open','25',100,92.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 24 seconds\r\nYou come prepared and you delivered it well. As an open grade presenter, I hope to see more. For instance, you can be more creative with the way you present it to leave a lingering expression on your audience. Make it yours and deliver it to persuade, impress and impact your audience.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:02:00','2024-07-24 15:02:00'),(5739,'judge-event-evaluation-4602-1721797321',4602,154,6,11,2,2024,352,'871','1',0,5806,7471,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'93.5 Well done. Beautiful harmonies \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:02:01','2024-07-24 15:02:01'),(5740,'judge-event-evaluation-3648-1721797394',3648,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7790,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Shuangbo , for the powerful message of salvation on which you preach boldly with confidence. Some hints to help you prepare your outline such as; Include the extra support scriptures and also include sub headings under the main headings. This will show the judge the direction  of the message that you have intended to go. Keep on desiring for God then He will definitely empower you preach to your generation.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:03:14','2024-07-24 15:03:14'),(5741,'judge-event-evaluation-4234-1721797483',4234,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7644,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance, Lavenia.\r\nRelax and know that God is with you and be the best that He wants you to be.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:04:43','2024-07-24 15:04:43'),(5744,'judge-event-evaluation-4448-1721797831',4448,142,6,11,2,2024,352,'871','1',0,4208,7471,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'71.5 well done. Great song choice and arrangement,  but you Unfortunately lost points for exceeding the time limit and using 2 live instruments (see guidelines).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:10:31','2024-07-24 15:10:31'),(5745,'judge-event-evaluation-3386-1721797910',3386,154,6,11,2,2024,308,'952',NULL,7275,5806,7872,40,'Open','31',106,95.50,-10,-0.50,'Very entertaining and engaging. Set up well with very clear biblical principles displayed. Well done. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:11:50','2024-07-24 15:11:50'),(5746,'judge-event-evaluation-3386-1721797954',3386,154,6,11,2,2024,308,'952',NULL,7275,5806,7841,40,'Open','31',106,90.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing performance!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:12:34','2024-07-24 15:12:34'),(5747,'judge-event-evaluation-4234-1721797976',4234,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7644,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'1:46min\r\n\r\nThank you Lavenia. It was a pleasure to listen to your recitation. Your new challenge is to recite a longer poem to bless others. Build on your current skills and be a blessing to others. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:12:56','2024-07-24 15:12:56'),(5748,'judge-event-evaluation-4231-1721798037',4231,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7676,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,87.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 5 seconds\r\nThank you, Jessira.\r\nRemember you have a message to put across and how you present it determines the effectiveness of the message. Leaving a good impression on your audience is one way of achieving that.\r\nKeep trying for better achievement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:13:57','2024-07-24 15:13:57'),(5749,'judge-event-evaluation-3386-1721798077',3386,154,6,11,2,2024,308,'952',NULL,7275,5806,7757,40,'Open','31',106,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great expression of script as mime is quite tricky. Keep up the great work. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:14:37','2024-07-24 15:14:37'),(5750,'judge-event-evaluation-2733-1721798081',2733,134,6,11,2,2024,352,'871','1',0,5805,7471,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'94 Beautiful singing and arrangement. Don\'t forget to introduce your event next time',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:14:41','2024-07-24 15:14:41'),(5751,'judge-event-evaluation-2945-1721798120',2945,111,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7694,55,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,89.00,-10,-1.00,'Vinaka Kolino for a very clear and precise reading !\r\nYou were very patient in reading and took your time to enunciate each word\r\nWell done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:15:20','2024-07-24 15:15:20'),(5753,'judge-event-evaluation-4422-1721798328',4422,154,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7819,5806,7759,45,'Collection','24',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'What an awesome performance!\r\nKeep up the beautiful work and hope to see you bless and uplift many with your God-given talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:18:48','2024-07-24 15:18:48'),(5754,'judge-event-evaluation-2945-1721798347',2945,111,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7694,55,7756,44,'Collection','24',100,96.00,-10,-1.00,'Kolinio did well with his presentation. A few points he needs to improve on are; his time (as he exceeded his required time) - Time 7mins-13secs,and his fluency.\r\n\r\nVinaka.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:19:07','2024-07-24 15:19:07'),(5755,'judge-event-evaluation-4236-1721798352',4236,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7720,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Absent from Convention',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:19:12','2024-07-24 15:19:12'),(5756,'judge-event-evaluation-3650-1721798598',3650,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7798,55,7871,50,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Runjie, You are a very interesting young man. Today you did something that no one else has done. You got up, left your notes behind and spoke your message from your heart. You spoke on a very strong topic on praise and spoke of your experience in going to different churches and seeing that praise is missing. What you did, showed your faith in God who works through you. Well done. I want to encourage you to study the word of God. As you study it, the Holy Spirit will bring words to you rememberance that support what you are preaching. And as you study more, you won\'t even need your notes, the Spirit of God will speak directly through you. Continue to trust in what God can do through you. Well done. Great message',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:23:18','2024-07-24 15:23:18'),(5758,'judge-event-evaluation-4437-1721798662',4437,142,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7175,4208,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Time: less than a minute\r\nYour choice of poem is alright but you need to work on your pace as present your poem. Take note of the most important part of your presentation which is the message to share with your audience. \r\nAll the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:24:22','2024-07-24 15:24:22'),(5759,'judge-event-evaluation-3650-1721798725',3650,111,6,11,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7798,55,7483,50,'Open','24',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Runjie, for message of Praise that you delivered today with preciseness. here are some hints to note that will improve your preaching. \r\nArticulation of words will draw the hearers attention to the message. \r\nIt\'s  important to include support scripture for the main text to prevent the message be presented out of context. I pray that God will work powerfully in your life so that you can preach to ur generation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:25:25','2024-07-24 15:25:25'),(5760,'judge-event-evaluation-4236-1721798726',4236,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7720,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Did not attend Convention',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:25:26','2024-07-24 15:25:26'),(5761,'judge-event-evaluation-3635-1721798890',3635,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7793,55,7888,45,'Open','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good job :)\r\n\r\nThe one thing that you struggled with was memorisation. And because you didn\'t know it properly, you seemed embarrassed and lost the self-confidence.\r\n\r\nYou entered and exited very nicely, and you projected nice and loudly. You were very neatly dressed, and had amazing facial reactions to the words.\r\n\r\n(BTW I love the poem)\r\n\r\nYour diction was okay and I could understand, but maybe work on the sounds of things a bit more and try to say them more sharply.\r\n\r\nThankyou for your go, we cant wait to see what place you get.\r\n\r\nThanks',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:28:10','2024-07-24 15:28:10'),(5762,'judge-event-evaluation-4376-1721799036',4376,111,6,11,2,2024,352,'871','1',0,55,7471,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'80 ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-24 15:30:36','2024-07-24 15:30:36'),(5764,'judge-event-evaluation-4317-1721799185',4317,111,6,11,2,2024,352,'871