LL,'It\'s a blessing to see young boys performing tambourine solo events with confidence. It might be your first time and do keep in mind to relax and to know that what matters to God is your heart. Keep practicing to perfect your tambourine skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 05:31:31','2024-07-25 05:31:31'),(5818,'judge-event-evaluation-3424-1721849559',3424,154,6,11,2,2024,240,'756',NULL,7274,5806,7860,23,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great Presentation, Vani. In the midst of your glorifying God with tambourine instruments, do not make it obvious when you do some some wrong actions. What matters to God is your heart. Keep practicing to perfect your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 05:32:39','2024-07-25 05:32:39'),(5819,'judge-event-evaluation-4287-1721855402',4287,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7695,55,7888,45,'Open','24',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.\r\n\r\nTo improve Id probably say to actually memorise the whole thing.\r\n\r\nAnd also you could add some more facial expressions and actions.\r\n\r\nYou projected nice and loudly and approached/left really well.\r\n\r\nAlso might want to work on your diction.\r\n\r\nGood job\r\n\r\nCant wait to see what you place.\r\n\r\nThank you for trying hard. (You did memorise quite a lot of it)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:10:02','2024-07-25 07:10:02'),(5820,'judge-event-evaluation-4287-1721855659',4287,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7695,55,7752,45,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Ji Hun!. I know that it was your first time,but your efforts are very much appreciated. Please take note of these points;\r\n- you can always add more facial expressions and gestures to liven your presentation.\r\n-just learn to memorize your lines well\r\n- you can always change your tone in emphasizing an important stanza in your recitation..\r\nGood job and keep striving. Thank you Daniel. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:14:19','2024-07-25 07:14:19'),(5821,'judge-event-evaluation-1961-1721855980',1961,134,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7161,5805,7888,45,'Open','24',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Really good job, Jeremiah\r\n\r\nYou memorised it very well and it  flowed nicely.\r\n\r\nI think some stuff you can work on is having facial expressions, some actions and to project a bit louder.\r\n\r\nOther than those little errors I think you will do wonderful next time.\r\n\r\nCan\'t wait to see what you place!\r\n\r\nThank you for putting yourself out there and having a go\r\n\r\n-Vanaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:19:40','2024-07-25 07:19:40'),(5822,'judge-event-evaluation-4220-1721856021',4220,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7689,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Withdraw today. 24/7/2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:20:21','2024-07-25 07:20:21'),(5823,'judge-event-evaluation-4436-1721856039',4436,142,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7174,4208,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 2 minutes and 16 seconds\r\nYou delivered your message very well with proper pace and clarity. However, I believe that you need to increase your volume and speak with authority to engage your audience well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:20:39','2024-07-25 07:20:39'),(5824,'judge-event-evaluation-4221-1721856065',4221,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7634,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute\r\nYou did well  and I believe you can do even better with more practice.\r\nDon\'t give up and keep trying for the better.\r\nThank you, Amelia.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:21:05','2024-07-25 07:21:05'),(5825,'judge-event-evaluation-3606-1721856083',3606,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7790,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,94.50,-10,NULL,'Very well expressed Shuangbo !\r\nGreat use of skills, voice inflections , pauses, etc\r\nYou have a gifting in public speaking , keep on nurturing it !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:21:23','2024-07-25 07:21:23'),(5826,'judge-event-evaluation-3606-1721856093',3606,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7790,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,99.00,-10,0.00,'Shuangbo Fu displayed his expressing reading very well. She shared the story about Jonah.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:21:33','2024-07-25 07:21:33'),(5827,'judge-event-evaluation-1849-1721856108',1849,115,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7521,5804,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Time: Less than a minute.\r\nYou did well and choosing a poem that challenges you with your ability is great.\r\nKeep practising and keep learning to be the best one day.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:21:48','2024-07-25 07:21:48'),(5828,'judge-event-evaluation-1935-1721856140',1935,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7139,5805,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 38 seconds\r\nThank you, Angelina. \r\nYour poem is good but I believe it does not suit your ability level. I hope that you will try something that best suit your ability level that will bring out the talent you have in you on this area. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:22:20','2024-07-25 07:22:20'),(5829,'judge-event-evaluation-1961-1721856569',1961,134,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7161,5805,7752,45,'Open','24',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jeremiah for the great effort. Much is appreciated on your confidence in terms of your presentation. Few points to take note;\r\n-you can add more gestures and facial expressions to your recitation.\r\n- just learn to pronounce the words properly.\r\n-do not be shy to move around and use hand gestures.\r\n-just work on your approach and make sure you are not wearing any jacket when you are about to perform.\r\nOtherwise, thank you for the great effort today.  God bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:29:29','2024-07-25 07:29:29'),(5830,'judge-event-evaluation-1959-1721856816',1959,134,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7122,5805,7752,45,'Open','24',100,83.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Isaiah for your recitation today. Your efforts in your preparation is much appreciated. Few points to consider;\r\n- practice more on your introduction so that you do not make a mistake. \r\n- make sure to memorize  your lines in poetry very well.\r\n- see that you keep the momentum of your recitation all the way to the end of it.\r\n-you can always add more gestures and facial expressions to your recitation.\r\n- just make sure to make it to the 1minute and not less.\r\n\r\nVinaka Isaiah. Great effort being made today.\r\n- ass',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:33:36','2024-07-25 07:33:36'),(5831,'judge-event-evaluation-4268-1721856847',4268,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7785,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,83.00,-10,-0.50,'Great job Eileen !\r\nTry to flo your sentences into each other so as not to create too many empty pauses\r\nGreat volume and projection !\r\nKeep it up ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:34:07','2024-07-25 07:34:07'),(5832,'judge-event-evaluation-4268-1721856893',4268,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7785,55,7756,44,'Open','25',100,98.50,-10,-0.50,'Eileen did well. But she needs to work on fluency, and she needs to familiarize herself more with the story.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 07:34:53','2024-07-25 07:34:53'),(5833,'judge-event-evaluation-1945-1721856922',1945,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7541,5805,7166,45,'Open','25',100,71.50,-10,-0.50,'0:44min\r\n\r\nThank you Alisi. Thank you for your effort. Your skills will continue to grow as you recite more poems. Well done. Remember you have a message to share so speak up, strong and look at the audi