od understanding of the guidelines will definitely navigate your way into showcasing your God-given talents. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:30:17','2024-07-25 08:30:17'),(5868,'judge-event-evaluation-3616-1721860364',3616,111,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7653,55,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,79.50,-10,NULL,'You have a great reading ability and expressing, don\'t be shy to bring it out!\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:32:44','2024-07-25 08:32:44'),(5869,'judge-event-evaluation-3616-1721860412',3616,111,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7653,55,7756,44,'Collection','24',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Gideon Yuen. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:33:32','2024-07-25 08:33:32'),(5870,'judge-event-evaluation-2947-1721860523',2947,111,6,11,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7649,55,7789,44,'Collection','24',100,68.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Mackay for making an effort!\r\nKeep on putting your best foot forward , and I hope to see more of you !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:35:23','2024-07-25 08:35:23'),(5871,'judge-event-evaluation-3627-1721860777',3627,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7780,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,99.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 2 minutes 35 seconds\r\nWhat a blessing to hear, understand and be able to internalize the shared message! I believe this is the most important thing to achieve when delivering a message. You did it and I am sure the audience would agree.\r\nA huge thanks to you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:39:37','2024-07-25 08:39:37'),(5872,'judge-event-evaluation-3627-1721860822',3627,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7780,55,7166,45,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'2:35min\r\n\r\nThank you Ateca.  Well done on the basics such as memorization and  recitation. The challenge is to use dramatic skills to punctuate the passion in the author\'s ideas. Keep working on your skills. Every recitation has a message for the audience. God bless you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:40:22','2024-07-25 08:40:22'),(5873,'judge-event-evaluation-3604-1721860918',3604,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7797,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Sebastian for presenting your piece!\r\nDon\'t be shy to fully express yourself and display your ability !\r\n Keep it up',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:41:58','2024-07-25 08:41:58'),(5874,'judge-event-evaluation-3604-1721861028',3604,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7797,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Sebastian displayed his story well. His time was 4mins-21sec. A few points to improve on;\r\n1. fluency\r\n2. voice projection\r\n3. He needed to connect with his audience.\r\n\r\nThanks',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:43:48','2024-07-25 08:43:48'),(5875,'judge-event-evaluation-3631-1721861303',3631,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7784,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,96.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 47 seconds\r\nYou spoke with much clarity and I like that. \r\nI hope to see you try something that is more challenging to bring out that talent in you. Thank you for the great effort that you put in.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:48:23','2024-07-25 08:48:23'),(5876,'judge-event-evaluation-3631-1721861340',3631,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7784,55,7166,45,'Open','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'1:47min\r\n\r\nThank you Kamatai. Thank you for your effort. It\'s not easy to memorizeand recite poem in front of strangers but you were brave. You can do the basics well. Now develope the dramatic skills such as pauses, gestures and facial expressions. Remember to connect with your audience. Every recitation has a message. God bless. you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:49:00','2024-07-25 08:49:00'),(5877,'judge-event-evaluation-2956-1721861778',2956,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7696,55,7789,44,'Open','24',100,95.50,-10,-0.50,'Absolutely amazing reading Eroni!\r\nClear , projected loudly, and with great diction\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:56:18','2024-07-25 08:56:18'),(5878,'judge-event-evaluation-2956-1721861780',2956,111,6,11,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7696,55,7756,44,'Open','24',100,98.50,-10,-0.50,'Eroni Donu beautifully displayed his story this morning. Voice projection was perfect. He used the stage well. However, he exceeded his maximum  time to 6 mins- 30 sec.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:56:20','2024-07-25 08:56:20'),(5879,'judge-event-evaluation-4263-1721861817',4263,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7776,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,90.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 1 minute 26 seconds\r\nYou presented your poem with confidence all the way to the end. Thank you for that. I believe you are good at this and a more challenging piece will bring out the talent in you. Hope to see more next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:56:57','2024-07-25 08:56:57'),(5880,'judge-event-evaluation-4263-1721861819',4263,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7776,55,7166,45,'Open','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'1:26min\r\n\r\nThank you Joana. Your basic skills such memorization and recitation flowed well. Now your challenge is to build your dramatic skills so the message is memorable for the audience. Pause where needed, inflect your voice and add passion. God bless your skills. Every recitation has a message. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 08:56:59','2024-07-25 08:56:59'),(5881,'judge-event-evaluation-4276-1721862256',4276,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7845,55,7789,44,'Open','25',100,74.50,-10,-1.50,'Thank you Kaiyi !\r\nI hope to see you challenge yourself more in the future and use many skills you will learn\r\nKeep it up !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:04:16','2024-07-25 09:04:16'),(5882,'judge-event-evaluation-3629-1721862282',3629,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7785,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Time:  1 minute 20 seconds\r\nThank you for that great presentation, Eileen.\r\nThe only advice I can give you is that you try and do a challenging or longer poem to bring out your God-given talent.\r\nYou can do it so go for it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:04:42','2024-07-25 09:04:42'),(5883,'judge-event-evaluation-3629-1721862301',3629,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7785,55,7166,45,'Open','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'1:20min\r\n\r\nThank you Eileen. Well done on memorization and recitation. Your challenge is to develop more dramatic skills such as pauses and voice inflection. The message will be remembered longer when you use good dramatic skills. Keep up the good work. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:05:01','2024-07-25 09:05:01'),(5884,'judge-event-evaluation-4276-1721862371',4276,111,6,11,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7845,55,7756,44,'Open','25',100,88.50,-10,-1.50,'Well done Kaiye Chen. A few points to improve on;\r\n1. Voice projection\r\n2. fluency\r\n3. Time\r\n4.Posture, movement and gestures',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:06:11','2024-07-25 09:06:11'),(5885,'judge-event-evaluation-4213-1721862774',4213,111,6,11,2,2024,298,'922',NULL,7726,55,7789,44,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you Taleah!\r\nPlease don\'t be shy to express yourself, take it slow and enjoy what you\'re reading\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,