! \r\nEnjoyed this beautiful performance by this gentle boy Abraham.\r\nA COMMAND PERFORMANCE RIGHT THERE!! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:24:37','2024-07-25 09:24:37'),(5890,'judge-event-evaluation-2563-1721863515',2563,149,6,11,2,2024,287,'907',NULL,7772,4678,7789,43,'Collection','24',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing job Abraham ! Really well done and presented \r\nYou have an awesome skill in public speaking, keep nurturing it and grow in the Lords strength\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:25:15','2024-07-25 09:25:15'),(5892,'judge-event-evaluation-3633-1721863910',3633,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7779,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,86.50,-10,NULL,'Time: \r\nThank you, Rejieli.\r\nIt is indeed difficult to stand in front of an audience but remember you are not alone. The judges and audience are here to support you. So a lot of practice can help you excel in your performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:31:50','2024-07-25 09:31:50'),(5894,'judge-event-evaluation-2619-1721864170',2619,149,6,11,2,2024,287,'907',NULL,7770,4678,7789,43,'Collection','24',100,78.00,-10,-1.50,'Wananavu Elimi !\r\nThank you for putting forth a great effort , and memorizing your script well!\r\nI pray you grow in confidence and continue to bless others with your ability !\r\nKeep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:36:10','2024-07-25 09:36:10'),(5895,'judge-event-evaluation-4456-1721864210',4456,154,6,11,2,2024,287,'907',NULL,7817,5806,7789,43,'Collection','24',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Student has dropped event',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:36:50','2024-07-25 09:36:50'),(5896,'judge-event-evaluation-1958-1721864262',1958,134,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7129,5805,7752,45,'Open','24',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Job well done Christian!\r\n\r\n-A well presented yet interesting recitation. This one I would recommend for command performance.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:37:42','2024-07-25 09:37:42'),(5897,'judge-event-evaluation-3634-1721864604',3634,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7696,55,7752,45,'Open','24',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the great effort being made today. Few points to take note of;\r\n- make to choose a shorter poem for next year.\r\n- memorize and add gestures to your recitation.\r\nYour preparations and hard work is highly appreciated in the Lord.\r\nSee you next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:43:24','2024-07-25 09:43:24'),(5898,'judge-event-evaluation-4262-1721864708',4262,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7682,55,7166,45,'Open','25',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'3:27min\r\n\r\nThank you Gabriella. Well done on memorization as it was a long poem. Your challenge is to use dramatic skills so the message is remembered well. Keep learning and sharing as that\'s how you grow. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:45:08','2024-07-25 09:45:08'),(5902,'judge-event-evaluation-4222-1721865187',4222,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7700,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'1:10min\r\n\r\nThank you Arielle. Good voice projection. You can be a blessing through your poetry recitation. Keep practising and growing through the process. Focus on the dramatic skills. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:53:07','2024-07-25 09:53:07'),(5903,'judge-event-evaluation-4302-1721865203',4302,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7686,55,7752,45,'Open','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for an awesome presentation Joon. \r\n- Remember to keep memorizing and practicing your lines before you present it.\r\n- try and add more hand gestures to liven up our recitation.\r\n- project your voice more as well so that you can be easily understood\r\n- you can always use different tone variations as well.\r\nGood Job and see you next year!.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:53:23','2024-07-25 09:53:23'),(5904,'judge-event-evaluation-4223-1721865233',4223,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7667,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'1:23min\r\nThank you Corina. Well done on your recitation. Well paced. Your memorization was a bit weak which affected your confidence. Keep smiling. Keep sharing God\'s peace through your voice and expressions. Focus on the dramatic skills. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:53:53','2024-07-25 09:53:53'),(5906,'judge-event-evalu