itation. Challenge yourself with a longer poem. Focus on areas that were awarded low points. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 09:59:27','2024-07-25 09:59:27'),(5911,'judge-event-evaluation-1937-1721865657',1937,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7152,5805,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,79.50,-10,-0.50,'0:36min\r\n\r\nThank you Gianna. Good pace and message. The message was clear. The challenge is to memorize a longer poem to recite to others. Keep up the good work. Work on the areas that need more points. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 10:00:57','2024-07-25 10:00:57'),(5912,'judge-event-evaluation-3635-1721865731',3635,111,6,11,2,2024,315,'960',NULL,7793,55,7752,45,'Open','24',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jack for your performance Few points to take note\r\n- Make sure to memorize your script properly. You can spend more time on that.\r\n- add more gestures and facial expression to make it an interesting one ofr your audience.\r\n- make sure your uniform presentation is neat required that you are wearing the correct uniform.\r\nOtherwise, thank you again for the great effort today Jack. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 10:02:11','2024-07-25 10:02:11'),(5913,'judge-event-evaluation-4226-1721865775',4226,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7704,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1.50 min\r\n\r\nThank you Glorianna. Great message and well presented. Keep up the good work in sharing God\'s love for sinners. Focus on a longer recitation to showcase your skills. Remember a message is effective when the audience enjoys it and remembers your presentation.  God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 10:02:55','2024-07-25 10:02:55'),(5914,'judge-event-evaluation-4244-1721865796',4244,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7725,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,84.50,-10,NULL,'Time: 50 seconds\r\nYou did your best and I appreciate that. \r\nYou speak very clearly  and I believe the audience heard. However, try to memorize your piece well and engage your audience as you make your presentation. Let them hear, understand and relate to it.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 10:03:16','2024-07-25 10:03:16'),(5915,'judge-event-evaluation-4224-1721865822',4224,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7637,55,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Time: 1:30minutes\r\nThat was a beautiful performance, Elizabeth!\r\nYou managed to overcome your nervousness and went through with your poetry recitation. Keep trying and you will definitely make it to be the best.\r\n Thank you for your boldness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 10:03:42','2024-07-25 10:03:42'),(5916,'judge-event-evaluation-4431-1721865855',4431,144,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7213,1404,7759,45,'Collection','25',100,96.50,-10,-1.00,'Time: Less than a minute\r\nYou took this poem and present it as your own leaving great and beautiful impressions on your audience. I love your performance!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,