s. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 11:54:25','2024-07-25 11:54:25'),(6040,'judge-event-evaluation-4232-1721872565',4232,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7675,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,73.50,-10,-0.50,'0:58min\r\n\r\nThank you Ling. Good memorization. Good pace. Try a longer recitation because you are more than capable. Well done. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 11:56:05','2024-07-25 11:56:05'),(6042,'judge-event-evaluation-2501-1721872692',2501,149,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7771,4678,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'1:52min\r\n\r\nGreat message in your poetry recitation. Good voice projection. I liked your pace as well. You need to challenge yourself with a longer poem. Develop more dramatic skills. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 11:58:12','2024-07-25 11:58:12'),(6043,'judge-event-evaluation-1931-1721872780',1931,134,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7537,5805,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'1:34min\r\nThank you for your effort. Good message. With practise you will know learn how to use your voice with different words. Focus on a longer recitation because your basic memorization and recitation are good. Develop dramatic skills. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 11:59:40','2024-07-25 11:59:40'),(6045,'judge-event-evaluation-4261-1721873388',4261,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7787,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Withdrew today 25/07/2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:09:48','2024-07-25 12:09:48'),(6046,'judge-event-evaluation-1631-1721873414',1631,115,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7357,5804,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'1:07\r\nThank you Katarina. I like your confidence. Just a bit too fast. Take a slower pace so your message can be enjoyed properly by your audience. Focus on your dramatic skills. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:10:14','2024-07-25 12:10:14'),(6047,'judge-event-evaluation-4267-1721873456',4267,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7681,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Withdrew today 25/07/2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:10:56','2024-07-25 12:10:56'),(6048,'judge-event-evaluation-4233-1721873474',4233,111,6,11,2,2024,300,'924',NULL,7674,55,7166,45,'Collection','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'1:02min\r\n\r\nThank you Kohana. Good pace. Good message. Your challenge is to speak up so the listeners can hear your message. You have good memorization skills. Keep up the good work and keep sharing God\'s love. Focus on a longer recitation next Convention. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:11:14','2024-07-25 12:11:14'),(6049,'judge-event-evaluation-4265-1721873497',4265,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7783,55,7759,45,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Withdrew today 25/07/2024',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:11:37','2024-07-25 12:11:37'),(6050,'judge-event-evaluation-1943-1721874009',1943,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7134,5805,7166,45,'Open','25',100,80.50,-10,-0.50,'0:40min\r\n\r\nThank you Nunia. Clear and well paced recitation. You need a longer recitation because you have mastered memorization. Focus on dramatic skills so your message is memorable for the audience. Keep working so your skills develop. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:20:09','2024-07-25 12:20:09'),(6051,'judge-event-evaluation-1943-1721874109',1943,134,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7134,5805,7759,45,'Open','25',100,94.50,-10,-1.00,'Time: 40 seconds\r\nYou did so well, Nunia.\r\nI only wish your piece was long enough to bring out that God-given talent in you. So work on that and please do believe that you can do much more than that.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 12:21:49','2024-07-25 12:21:49'),(6052,'judge-event-evaluation-3632-1721874489',3632,111,6,11,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7683,55,7166,45,'Open','25',100,76.50,-10,-0.50,'0:34min\r\n\r\nThank you Vatiseva. While your recitation was short, it showcased your skills. You are ready for a longer recitation. Remember every recitation has a message. Develop your dramatic skills so the message is memorable and clear. Keep learning and sharing. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NUL