77.00,-10,NULL,'A good first-time effort, Jack. Remember to keep your arms straight to get the most movement in your actions. Always remember that practice makes perfect and I\'ll look forward to seeing a great presentation next year....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:08:36','2024-07-25 15:08:36'),(6165,'judge-event-evaluation-3390-1721884223',3390,154,6,11,2,2024,326,'975',NULL,7273,5806,7789,46,'Open','25',100,82.50,-10,NULL,'Vinaka Torika for your determination to perform your piece to completion.\r\nIt can be challenging at times, with memorising and practices , but its all apart of the learning experience.\r\nI hope you will continue to use your talents to glorify God in whatever you do\r\nStay blessed !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:10:23','2024-07-25 15:10:23'),(6166,'judge-event-evaluation-4930-1721884450',4930,144,6,11,2,2024,324,'973',NULL,7227,1404,7789,37,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Incorrect registration',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:14:10','2024-07-25 15:14:10'),(6167,'judge-event-evaluation-3421-1721884594',3421,154,6,11,2,2024,224,'706',NULL,7245,5806,7239,23,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'A good first-time effort, Solomoni, which was enjoyable to watch. Remember to straighten your arms more so you can get full movement in your actions. Smile, too, to show your enjoyment of presenting your item. Keep practicing for Him...God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:16:34','2024-07-25 15:16:34'),(6168,'judge-event-evaluation-3424-1721885126',3424,154,6,11,2,2024,240,'756',NULL,7274,5806,7239,23,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'That was a presentation which started out very well, Vani, but remember that confidence comes when we constantly practice and know our movements off by heart. When on the stage, looking for help off the stage will be obvious to those watching and stilts your performance, so remember that practice makes perfect and He will remind you through your presentation. We look forward to seeing you again next year....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:25:26','2024-07-25 15:25:26'),(6169,'judge-event-evaluation-4968-1721886104',4968,154,6,11,2,2024,230,'712','1',0,5806,7239,26,'Collection','22',100,60.00,-10,NULL,'It was a reasonable first effort, girls, but there\'s lots of room for improvement. Practice makes perfect. Remember also to smile to match the joyful music in your presentation. We look forward to seeing you again next year....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:41:44','2024-07-25 15:41:44'),(6170,'judge-event-evaluation-4260-1721886766',4260,111,6,11,2,2024,326,'975',NULL,7697,55,7756,46,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'CANCELLED XXX\r\nStudent dropped event.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-07-25 15:52:46','2024-07-25 15:52:46'),(6171,'judge-event-evaluation-3390-1721886873',3390,154,6,11,2,2024,326,'975',NULL,7273,5806,7756,46,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,0.00,'