8,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7331,4451,7888,7,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Really nice story, but I would suggest next time not to put in an intro which explains her 6 year old self, and then when she becomes her 16 year old self, not even having a single thing to do with the 6 year old intro. Normally with scenes like \"10 years later\" happens, It has something really important that effects her future life. EG. loses her parents at six, going through trauma at 16 still grieving.\r\n\r\nOther than the intro it was well written, and it was definitely Godly and really nice story about God stopping suicide and helping her family. Format/spelling was good. \r\nIt was slow at the beginning, but it got faster towards the end so good job :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-19 22:34:19','2024-08-19 22:34:19'),(6247,'judge-event-evaluation-4736-1724071299',4736,137,12,14,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7331,4451,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Really lovely poetry, it rhymed, mentioned God, it flowed nicely and I could see what your poem was about.\r\n\r\nGood job :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-19 22:41:39','2024-08-19 22:41:39'),(6248,'judge-event-evaluation-5007-1724071353',5007,175,12,14,2,2024,20,'062',NULL,7898,6097,7888,6,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Very nice poem I think its really beautiful. It was well written, your formats and grammar were good, but maybe next time you could work more on writing the difficulty of it. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-19 22:42:33','202