hile still able to hear the individual parts.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 07:49:45','2024-08-27 07:49:45'),(6264,'judge-event-evaluation-11059-1724709001',11059,137,12,14,2,2024,260,'806','1',0,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Good presentation in tune and time  could be more eye contact with each other and audience and more smiling\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 07:50:01','2024-08-27 07:50:01'),(6265,'judge-event-evaluation-11058-1724709371',11058,175,12,14,2,2024,309,'953','3',0,6097,8328,40,NULL,NULL,106,92.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent movement and gestures, great music selection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 07:56:11','2024-08-27 07:56:11'),(6266,'judge-event-evaluation-11058-1724709462',11058,175,12,14,2,2024,309,'953','3',0,6097,6,40,'Open','32',106,92.00,-10,NULL,'That was awesome. Well done students. A suggestion for improvement for future entries, facial expressions and movements. That would capture the audience. Other than that, I look forward to seeing future entries. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 07:57:42','2024-08-27 07:57:42'),(6270,'judge-event-evaluation-5027-1724709794',5027,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7331,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance well rehearsed good timing and tonality , could possibly improve dynamics but very 