 future entries. God Bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:20:10','2024-08-27 08:20:10'),(6278,'judge-event-evaluation-11060-1724711158',11060,137,12,14,2,2024,215,'651','1',0,4451,8324,20,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance member dynamics and timing but well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:25:58','2024-08-27 08:25:58'),(6279,'judge-event-evaluation-11060-1724711237',11060,137,12,14,2,2024,215,'651','1',0,4451,6960,20,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort girls, thank you. good choice of song for your voices! It would be good to hear more harmonization - this song lends itself well to it. Also, try to work on your instrumental phrasing - upstrums on the guitar, and softer chords and transitional notes in the piano so that it \'flows\', rather than \'plonks\'. \r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:27:17','2024-08-27 08:27:17'),(6280,'judge-event-evaluation-5875-1724711855',5875,137,12,14,2,2024,131,'323',NULL,7328,4451,7455,70,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'I love that you have chosen a particular breed of dog to make as a stuffed toy.\r\nPlease make sure that your report is a bit more descriptive. For example you must have used a needle and thread and stuffing. Tell a story of how you completed your project. What did you change?\r\nIt is important, especially when doing any project that has white fabric or yarn, to keep your hands clean and the work clean.\r\nWell done on the lovely stitched nose and happy facial expression!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:37:35','2024-08-27 08:37:35'),(6281,'judge-event-evaluation-11069-1724712130',11069,137,12,14,2,2024,261,'807','1',0,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort girls, thank you! Some challenging harmonies in there, and you did really well. You do need to work on some intonation - hitting your notes, especially when other are hitting accidentals and whatnot. \r\nOverall, great work, keep it up! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:42:10','2024-08-27 08:42:10'),(6283,'judge-event-evaluation-11069-1724712162',11069,137,12,14,2,2024,261,'807','1',0,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Well done  good dynamics some Harmonies slightly off but good performance',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:42:42','2024-08-27 08:42:43'),(6284,'judge-event-evaluation-11076-1724712177',11076,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','1',0,4451,8328,40,'Collection','32',106,76.00,-10,NULL,'Great first meme boys, you all have a lot of potential.\r\nI don\'t think the gloves added to outfit, but appreciate the effort to wear gloves :)\r\nRemember to introduce yourselves next time.\r\nGod bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:42:57','2024-08-27 08:42:57'),(6285,'judge-event-evaluation-11076-1724712211',11076,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','1',0,4451,6,40,'Collection','32',106,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students on your first mime event. Some suggestions for improvement on future entries. Facial expression help capture the audience, movements help tell and express the story and character, and placement of characters for example, facing your back towards the audience. A suggestion would be to angel yourself slightly that way the audience can see what your doing. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:43:31','2024-08-27 08:43:32'),(6286,'judge-event-evaluation-11057-1724712774',11057,137,12,14,2,2024,273,'856','1',0,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great work girls, thank you! Such a great song, and great harmonies! Just be careful not to drown out the melody - this is the part that we need to hear the most. Also, just make sure that you are hitting the notes true, a few in there that you slid around not quite finding them.\r\n\r\nApart from that, great job, keep it up! God Bless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:52:54','2024-08-27 08:52:54'),(6287,'judge-event-evaluation-11057-1724712836',11057,137,12,14,2,2024,273,'856','1',0,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance and harmony could possibly add some more dynamics but overall well done ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 08:53:56','2024-08-27 08:53:56'),(6289,'judge-event-evaluation-11063-1724713714',11063,137,12,14,2,2024,211,'601','1',0,4451,6960,20,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Great work girls, well-done! The original as a lot of passion and expression, and you did well to try and capture that! It would be good to work on some vocal harmonies to add a bit more to it, and you also want to work on your phrasing and flow - try to have the piano flow, rather than be overly accented on the chords.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:08:34','2024-08-27 09:08:35'),(6291,'judge-event-evaluation-11063-1724713737',11063,137,12,14,2,2024,211,'601','1',0,4451,8324,20,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'excellent performance great dynamics and phrasing well done good energy',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:08:57','2024-08-27 09:08:57'),(6293,'judge-event-evaluation-5109-1724714228',5109,137,12,14,2,2024,235,'750',NULL,7733,4451,8324,22,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done great performance try to work on timing and dynamics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:17:08','2024-08-27 09:17:08'),(6294,'judge-event-evaluation-5109-1724714252',5109,137,12,14,2,2024,235,'750',NULL,7733,4451,6960,22,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Timothy, nicely done. You played with confidence and passion! It would be good to work on some extra phrasing and add in some difficulty - to build up to something more in the left hand, the piece lends itself to it well. This will help the flow and the variance in the song, rather than being the same all the way through.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:17:32','2024-08-27 09:17:32'),(6295,'judge-event-evaluation-5850-1724714818',5850,137,12,14,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7323,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,80.50,-10,NULL,'I love the vibrant colours that you have chosen for this project!\r\nPlease make sure that you read the guidelines carefully. The back of the work must be accessable for judging. The picture that you submitted was good, but please note that the pattern also needs to be submitted.\r\nDo be careful with your French knots - the twist should be visible on the top of your work, but the thread end should not be visible.\r\nYour satin stitch was nice and even. When mounting your work use the lacing technique to get it tightly stretched over a backing frame. Here is a link for an excellent description of this method:\r\nhttps://www.thread-bare.com/blog/how-to-frame-your-own-cross-stitch-using-the-lacing-method\r\nGreat work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:26:58','2024-08-27 09:26:58'),(6297,'judge-event-evaluation-11068-1724715348',11068,137,12,14,2,2024,226,'708','1',0,4451,8324,24,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Well done excellent partnership could have more dynamics',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:35:48','2024-08-27 09:35:48'),(6298,'judge-event-evaluation-11068-1724715364',11068,137,12,14,2,2024,226,'708','1',0,4451,6960,24,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Great job girls, beautiful piece! Beautiful flow! It would be good to work on some dynamics and tempo variance, to enhance the mood, and take the listener on a journey. Rises and falls, louds and softs, all sing the song, without lyrics.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:36:04','2024-08-27 09:36:05'),(6300,'judge-event-evaluation-5910-1724715394',5910,137,12,14,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7330,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,74.00,-10,NULL,'I love your creativity and you appropriate use of colours.\r\nYou were obviously not following a pattern, but it would have been good to see the sketching and decision process that led you to this finished work.\r\nPlease be careful to finish your ends neatly. Also your work would have been much smoother if you had  blocked your work to stretch it and get it smoother.\r\nI think that the different reflections in the eyes unrealistic. When you look at eyes the reflections will be of the same thing.\r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:36:34','2024-08-27 09:36:34'),(6304,'judge-event-evaluation-5018-1724716512',5018,137,12,14,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7580,4451,6960,22,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Great work, that was awesome! Something really different, and you nailed the style! A couple of minor stumbles, and it would be good to make sure you really attack all the staccato notes, but apart from that, excellent work!\r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:55:12','2024-08-27 09:55:12'),(6306,'judge-event-evaluation-6331-1724716604',6331,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7922,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'You have chosen a good theme for your nature photos.\r\nI would have liked to see some journalling - this could be your own words, or poems, or Bible verses.\r\nDo be careful to only include photos that are in focus.\r\nWeel done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:56:44','2024-08-27 09:56:44'),(6307,'judge-event-evaluation-11056-1724716654',11056,137,12,14,2,2024,310,'954','1',0,4451,6,41,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done student. Some suggestions on improvement for future entries. Use the Evaluation Form found on the guidelines which will help with your event, Such as Line memorisation, Voice quality, and Characterization. Working on these three areas will improve future entries. Well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:57:34','2024-08-27 09:57:34'),(6308,'judge-event-evaluation-5018-1724716654',5018,137,12,14,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7580,4451,8324,22,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Difficult piece to perform but you managed to keep good time and dynamics with only minor mistakes',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:57:34','2024-08-27 09:57:34'),(6309,'judge-event-evaluation-11056-1724716690',11056,137,12,14,2,2024,310,'954','1',0,4451,8328,41,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, great effort.  Some more rehearsing and it would have been a super performance.  It was very clear who your characters were.  God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 09:58:10','2024-08-27 09:58:10'),(6311,'judge-event-evaluation-5057-1724717194',5057,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7578,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Vanessa, really well done! Hit every note true, great expression! It would be good to work on your projection, just get a bit more power, so that your quiets are still heard, and your louds are really strong.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:06:34','2024-08-27 10:06:34'),(6313,'judge-event-evaluation-5027-1724717212',5027,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7331,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Chloe! A challenging piece, some of those jumps that are almost octaves with the accidentals must have taken a bunch of practice! Good stuff! It would be good to work on some projection and power - some dynamic variance - this would take your performance to the next level! But overall, great work, keep it up!\r\n\r\nGod Bless!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:06:52','2024-08-27 10:06:52'),(6314,'judge-event-evaluation-5057-1724717215',5057,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7578,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done great tonality and pitch only one small timing error in the middle',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:06:55','2024-08-27 10:06:55'),(6315,'judge-event-evaluation-6257-1724717369',6257,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7902,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'What a lovely record of a fantastic holiday! It makes me want to visit Windsor Bay.\r\nI enjoyed your journalling - including details such as the weight of your amazing snapper.\r\nGood choice of embellishments. I did find that some of the leaves on the green pages tended to distract from the photos - perhaps just a few less leaves, or placing them further off the edge of the photos would have been less distracting.\r\nLove your last comment - I can\'t wait to see next year\'s scrapbook!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:09:29','2024-08-27 10:09:29'),(6316,'judge-event-evaluation-11077-1724717433',11077,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','4',0,4451,6,40,'Collection','32',106,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. That was a great entry and an amazing message. Just one suggestion for improvement for future entries. Facial expressions help telling the story. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:10:33','2024-08-27 10:10:33'),(6317,'judge-event-evaluation-11077-1724717439',11077,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','4',0,4451,8328,40,'Collection','32',106,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done girls, super performance.  Clearly interpreted and easy to follow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:10:39','2024-08-27 10:10:39'),(6320,'judge-event-evaluation-11073-1724718101',11073,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','2',0,4451,8328,40,'Collection','32',106,98.00,-10,NULL,'I liked the nice clear message that you brought to us, it was easy to follow. Great facial expressions and movement.  Good choice of music.  Some proper white gloves would have helped with the overall visual appearance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:21:41','2024-08-27 10:21:41'),(6321,'judge-event-evaluation-11073-1724718130',11073,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','2',0,4451,6,40,'Collection','32',106,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Keep up the great work. A suggestion for future entries that would help with preparation. Using the Evaluation Form found in the guidelines will help will facial expressions, characterization, movement & gestures. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:22:10','2024-08-27 10:22:10'),(6322,'judge-event-evaluation-11062-1724718167',11062,175,12,14,2,2024,274,'857','1',0,6097,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance good phrasing and timing would be nice to hear some harmonies',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:22:47','2024-08-27 10:22:47'),(6323,'judge-event-evaluation-11062-1724718176',11062,175,12,14,2,2024,274,'857','1',0,6097,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good efforts girls, great choice of song for your voices! Just remember that for a trio, we need to have to harmonization. Also, remember to include dynamic variance to add interest and expression.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:22:56','2024-08-27 10:22:57'),(6325,'judge-event-evaluation-6221-1724718345',6221,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7901,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'I love that you have attempted to capture moments of friendship and I\'m sure that you will treasure these memories.\r\nPlease include in you report (or better still, in the scrapbook) use of abbreviations. What did \"GP\" on the cover mean?\r\nIt is very important, when choosing photos, that they all are in focus. Unfortunately only two of your photos were in focus. In future, please don\'t choose distorted photos for submission in your convention events. \r\nI liked your butterfly embellishments on the front cover.\r\nKeep scrapbooking!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:25:45','2024-08-27 10:25:45'),(6326,'judge-event-evaluation-11075-1724718680',11075,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','3',0,4451,6,40,'Collection','32',106,98.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Great choice of script and presentation. Looking forward for future entries. God Bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:31:20','2024-08-27 10:31:20'),(6327,'judge-event-evaluation-11075-1724718775',11075,137,12,14,2,2024,285,'903','3',0,4451,8328,40,'Collection','32',106,98.00,-10,NULL,'Very well performed, good message very relevant to today\'s day and age.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:32:55','2024-08-27 10:32:55'),(6328,'judge-event-evaluation-13133-1724718917',13133,175,12,14,2,2024,272,'855',NULL,7898,6097,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well done difficult song bit pitchy in places but good timing and tone',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:35:17','2024-08-27 10:35:18'),(6329,'judge-event-evaluation-13133-1724718937',13133,175,12,14,2,2024,272,'855',NULL,7898,6097,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Heidi, thanks! A challenging song for sure! Just try to really listen to the backing for your pitch, try and hit those notes true, especially the held one!\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 10:35:37','2024-08-27 10:35:37'),(6332,'judge-event-evaluation-4737-1724736740',4737,137,12,14,2,2024,8,'014',NULL,7316,4451,7479,8,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks, Holly, for sharing your book report. :-)\r\nMake sure you read through your book report to check for any spelling mistakes and any missed punctuation. Short sentences can be good for dramaticness and help keep your reader engaged. \r\nI would have liked to have had a conclusion paragraph from you, which included some Biblical applications and scriptural references. For example these might be appropriate Matthew 25:35-40  / Philippians 2:4.\r\nKeep developing your skills in this area! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 15:32:20','2024-08-27 15:32:20'),(6333,'judge-event-evaluation-6369-1724751698',6369,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7898,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'What lovely family memories! I particularly liked the blue page - it was well laid out, not too fussy, and the sparkles made it come alive!\r\nGood journalling. Do make sure to only use photos that are in focus.\r\nI know that I am a bit of a grammar enthusiast, and the title should have been \"My Family and Me.\"\r\nWhen you have a very patterned background it is often more effective to use a small plain border aroung the photo.\r\nThese are great memories to treasure!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 19:41:38','2024-08-27 19:41:38'),(6335,'judge-event-evaluation-6335-1724752395',6335,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7922,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Thanks Adena, good effort! Great colours, and great textures in the background. The word \"wrath\" however is somewhat lost. Also, I\'m not sure how the verse connects - I feel that Isaiah 40:8 might have been a more fitting verse (The grass withers and the flowers fall, but the word of our God endures forever.)\r\nKeep practicing, and keep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 19:53:15','2024-08-27 19:53:15'),(6336,'judge-event-evaluation-5701-1724752406',5701,137,12,14,2,2024,207,'558',NULL,7322,4451,7314,52,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'You have used really good strong vibrant colours and your black flame compliments the colours in the art work. \r\n Small verses would have been better typed or written in calligraphy.  Lettering painted around edges is not even.  Use tape to stop to stop edge bleed.  On a wall or hung this piece loses its perspective.  You have defined your direction of light across from the left hand corner well, ranging from yellow to orange to red.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 19:53:26','2024-08-27 19:53:26'),(6337,'judge-event-evaluation-5853-1724752445',5853,137,12,14,2,2024,207,'558',NULL,7323,4451,7314,52,'Open',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'You have written an exemplary report, well done! You have integrated your media very well and your subject stands out against the background.  A bit of the main had lifted. You have defined light in the background in the bottom corner.  The Zebra just stands out so much!  Close up I can see some pencil lines underneath ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 19:54:05','2024-08-27 19:54:05'),(6338,'judge-event-evaluation-5732-1724752462',5732,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7324,4451,6,58,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Charlie. Just one thing I noticed is that the front legs were seated pointing on the tip instead of the base of the front foot. Well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 19:54:22','2024-08-27 19:54:22'),(6340,'judge-event-evaluation-6305-1724753126',6305,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7897,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Good effort Zach, thanks! Great message, and I like the idea of overcoming evil with good sometimes feeling like a mountain, but we still gotta do it!\r\nIt would be good to do a bit more with the poster - it doesn\'t really have much that grabs the eye and draws it in, apart from the contrasted text.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:05:26','2024-08-27 20:05:26'),(6341,'judge-event-evaluation-6011-1724753128',6011,137,12,14,2,2024,207,'558',NULL,7733,4451,7314,52,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,' The frame enhances the picture and picks up on the blue that you have used when applying your water colour, and your collage.   You have used a variety of line and cross hatching in your sketching and smudged your pencil well.  In the report you did not really talk about how you applied your water colour this could have been elaborated on a little bit more.  A very thought provoking creation I loved the use of the cogs and wheels and the words \'Reality Check\', almost visionary.  The eye on the left of the face is well shaped.  The right eye ball falls a little below the bottom rim of the eye.  Overall a very striking piece of multi - media that resonates of a story behind it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:05:28','2024-08-27 20:05:28'),(6343,'judge-event-evaluation-5713-1724753180',5713,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7580,4451,7314,53,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'You have used a mixture of warm tones and cold tones some of these contrast well in your picture. Think about balance of these tones and contrast against the skylines.  When you put the warm coloured yellow and orange  house against the sky background in blues it stood out well.  The roof on the redhouse gets lost in the picture.  You have used the colour pencil well to cover the area of the paper.  Have you thought about bringing light contrast into the picture and blending and overlaying colours with your coloured pencil?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:06:20','2024-08-27 20:06:20'),(6344,'judge-event-evaluation-5792-1724753195',5792,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7318,4451,7314,53,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Lots of complex shapes and polygons. You have covered the area of your lizard well and the placement of the artwork from corner to corner is a good choice of placement.   Make sure you are precise especially the feet probably should have been a half circle as they are irregular.  I like the way you alternated your colours to provide a contrast.  Geometric art suits this type of creature. The paper used tends to lend itself to camouflage rather than standing out strikingly in contrast to the paper, I am not sure if this was your intention.  When applying coloured pencil it would be very good for you to explore layering your pencil work and creating contrasts of light and dark.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:06:35','2024-08-27 20:06:35'),(6345,'judge-event-evaluation-12310-1724753214',12310,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7885,4451,7314,53,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'The framing really goes well with the fish and makes it stand out. I like the way you have contrasted your purple red and pinks on your fish. also using larger and smaller triangular shapes worked well.  The rectangles in the eyes worked very well.  Be careful to fully fill in your step by step procedure in greater detail when you complete your project and make sure all the details are correct.  You used your felts with consistency and directionality..  Be careful of going over edges and make sure you remove all blemishes from your paper. You contrasted your lights and darks well and they were balanced.\r\nConsider exploring different textures in your next entry.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:06:54','2024-08-27 20:06:54'),(6346,'judge-event-evaluation-4737-1724753225',4737,137,12,14,2,2024,8,'014',NULL,7316,4451,6959,8,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Holly, isn\'t it great when you find a book series you love? :)\r\nYou highlighted that the theme of the book was about Maggie trying to fit in with her friends, and I can see that you have intended for your report to be a \"theme analysis.\" That being the case, you should be clear about that from the start, and keep your description of characters to the main ones that relate to the theme. \r\nDon\'t forget to include the author of the book!\r\nKeep reading and writing, and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:07:05','2024-08-27 20:07:05'),(6347,'judge-event-evaluation-5864-1724753234',5864,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7317,4451,7314,53,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Wow this rabbit stands out against the pink background!  You have contrasted your directionality of pencil strokes and created an area of light on the right hand side of the page. The diamond shape of the eye stands out. \r\nThe feet at the bottom, one foot stands out but the other does not, how could you make it stand out like the other foot?   When using colour pencil you can also blend your colours to create more contrasts.  Overall a very aesthetically pleasing piece of work. Your frame compliments your art work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:07:14','2024-08-27 20:07:14'),(6348,'judge-event-evaluation-5941-1724753250',5941,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7329,4451,7314,53,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'I love the leading lines that you have and the way you have portrayed the light in this picture.  You have contrasted your colours well and used the highlights of the sun really well in the foreground to create a path of light.  This was difficult to do because to the amount of different lines you had and using paint as your media.  Use fine brushes to define your lines clearly.  In your explanation next time include some insight into why you chose the colours you did. Ensure that you do not get paint splashed on areas of the work that it should not be on.  Using tape is a good idea to created your lines. You have included your web adress and pic you used for the inspiration in the back of your report, next time write the web address \r\n\'www.vectorstock.com\' on your report rather than just \'Vector Stock\'.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:07:30','2024-08-27 20:07:30'),(6349,'judge-event-evaluation-5953-1724753264',5953,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7573,4451,7314,53,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A great choice of framing for your artwork.  The picture really stands out especially at the top where you have defined the lines, this contrasts with the bottom 3 lines of your picture.  You have used repetitive pattern on four different levels so it is a very busy picture.  It looks like you had lots of fun exploring.  Try using some textural effects and blending next time. Your colour and lines are balanced in each line and there is balance of your yellow top and bottom. Some of your other colours are not balanced top and bottom.  Where did your photo come from?  If it came off of the internet you need to make sure you have a web address or was it non specific and just a collection of ideas you viewed?. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:07:44','2024-08-27 20:07:44'),(6350,'judge-event-evaluation-6471-1724753570',6471,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7895,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your efforts Hezekiah, I like your font setup. It does draw the focus to the word \'wicked\', not sure if that was intended. I\'m also not sure that the picture and the text match. This looks more like Jesus as \'welcomer\' or \'healer\' than laughing at the wicked. Also, you need to attribute your photos - Google Images is not a source, it is a search engine. \r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:12:50','2024-08-27 20:12:50'),(6352,'judge-event-evaluation-5849-1724753900',5849,137,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7323,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'I love that you have taken an event that most people disliked and complained about, and you have found the positive aspects to scrapbook. Excellent use of journalling - It was an interesting read.\r\nMost of the photos on the front page were out of focus or pixilated - Do be careful to only choose photos that are in focus.\r\nThe last page appears to have been rushed and lacks the polish and flair of the other pages.\r\nWell done on this excellent project!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:18:20','2024-08-27 20:18:20'),(6353,'judge-event-evaluation-5739-1724754057',5739,137,12,14,2,2024,196,'508',NULL,7324,4451,7314,52,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'You have a very well written report, one in which you have clearly stated what you have done, the media you have used and the technique you have used.  I like the way that you have used colage and created light in your picture.  The depiction of a person walking up the stairs also shows that being called is a journey one in which we climb but as we climb we are drawn closer to God.  The way you have done your crowd shows a contrast.  Technically you could try sketching people in various positions and study proportions.  This will give you an accuracy and an eye for detail when portraying figures and people.  You have 3 different aspects going on and the I am called is the one that brings the other two together. The colour in the stairs works well and it stands out',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:20:57','2024-08-27 20:20:57'),(6354,'judge-event-evaluation-5722-1724754080',5722,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7577,4451,6,58,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Callum. A suggestion for future entries. Please provide a detailed step by step description which is preparation for finish and application of appropriate finish. There wasn\'t enough information provided. One last for future entries and that the front two leg are seated on the tip of the leg instead of the base. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:21:20','2024-08-27 20:21:20'),(6355,'judge-event-evaluation-5639-1724754100',5639,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7806,4451,6,58,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Brooklyn. A suggestion for future entries. Please provide more detail in your report as I think steps were missing. Detailed planned is key part in any construction. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:21:40','2024-08-27 20:21:40'),(6356,'judge-event-evaluation-5784-1724754130',5784,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7318,4451,6,58,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Grace. Just would thing to note. The front two legs were sitting on the tip instead of a flat base and you mentioned that you added another brace at the bottom on the leg which wasn\'t it the plan. Please note to add all work done into the plan. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:22:10','2024-08-27 20:22:10'),(6357,'judge-event-evaluation-6372-1724754473',6372,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7898,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work Heidi, you have obviously put some effort into this! I like the quote too, very thought provoking. However, you should attribute it on the poster. Also, you don\'t need the word \'Life\' in the middle, it actually confuses the quote.\r\nOverall, keep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:27:53','2024-08-27 20:27:53'),(6358,'judge-event-evaluation-14193-1724754526',14193,137,12,14,2,2024,14,'056','1',0,4451,5,1,'Open','3',100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'I really enjoyed reading your project. I love the biblical principles and purpose of your experiment! You did a great job of making it fun to read and learn, which meets your purpose well. The guidelines state that each statement or conclusion must be backed by evidence. This is where you could input some references. Even if you know something to be true from experience, in science we  connect our findings/statements to other research to build credibility. \r\nAwesome job, I look forward to seeing future findings from as you explore God\'s creation, if not at convention, in a journal or article somehere! Keep making science fun, and about God\'s own creativity. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:28:46','2024-08-27 20:28:46'),(6359,'judge-event-evaluation-5929-1724754613',5929,137,12,14,2,2024,196,'508',NULL,7327,4451,7314,52,'Collection',NULL,100,52.00,-10,NULL,'The writing stands our very clearly.  There are some splodges in your paint and you have tended to use brush strokes that are not consistent especially when you painted the sky around the flowers.  Laying down a background first is always the better option. Try introducing some light and tone into your multi media and more textures.  Study some 3 dimensional circles, squares and triangles.  Practice drawing these so that you can apply it in your drawing and painting.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:30:13','2024-08-27 20:30:13'),(6360,'judge-event-evaluation-5760-1724754718',5760,137,12,14,2,2024,136,'351',NULL,7326,4451,6,58,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Christopher. Just a few things for improvement. Making sure that the joinery is accurate will lead to the two front legs not sitting on the tip but would sit on the base of the legs. Other than that, well done and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:31:58','2024-08-27 20:31:58'),(6361,'judge-event-evaluation-4735-1724754834',4735,137,12,14,2,2024,19,'061',NULL,7331,4451,6959,5,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Chloe. \r\nI am definitely persuaded that you are passionate about God, and that\'s the most important thing :)\r\nOverall, you wrote well. However, I think that I only understood your point because I\'m already in agreement with you. For someone who\'s not sure about your argument (your target audience, those you want to persuade), I think this argument was very vague and somewhat confusing. What I believe you were saying was that people are equally VALUABLE, no matter who we are. The tricky thing is, the current woke agenda would probably claim the same thing, so they wouldn\'t understand your point. And how can \"equality go too far\"? Shouldn\'t we want equality, based on your argument? Like I said, I know what you mean. But I\'m not sure your audience will. I know you can tweak it a bit and be a very persuasive writer, so keep fine-tuning until you nail it! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:33:54','2024-08-27 20:33:54'),(6362,'judge-event-evaluation-6204-1724755123',6204,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7900,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'It is lovely that you chose to make the focus of your scrapbook project friendship. The little pearl embellishments help to from the journalling well.\r\nPlease make sure that you only use photos that are in focus. For future scrapbooking for Convention please refrain from using distorted images',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:38:43','2024-08-27 20:38:43'),(6363,'judge-event-evaluation-5815-1724755256',5815,137,12,14,2,2024,196,'508',NULL,7316,4451,7314,52,'Collection',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Your heading is always effective.  and the sky behind it is awesome.  Especially the way you used the pastel to enhance the sky.  The collage on the roof of your house brings texture to you picture.  The Mercy ship is drawn flat and needs to have more of a three dimensional shape.  Study how to draw three dimensional shapes and practice these ready for next convention.  They ability to this will improve your drawing skills immensely.  When writing by hand it needs to be even and clear.  In Multi media sometimes printed text is best.  You really have started to blend some of your ocean well on the left hand side but this has not been balanced out on the right hand side.  There is definite directionality of light shown. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:40:56','2024-08-27 20:40:56'),(6364,'judge-event-evaluation-6256-1724755396',6256,175,12,14,2,2024,136,'351',NULL,7902,6097,6,58,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Elijah. This is incredible. God is going to use you in places with this gift He has blessed you with. Well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:43:16','2024-08-27 20:43:16'),(6365,'judge-event-evaluation-6260-1724755410',6260,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7902,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work Elijah, good choice of pic, and good verse to go with it! The blue text works on the white path, but does get lost in the darker parts of the path. Also, be careful when using multiple fonts, too many will actually distract from the message and make it hard to read. And, remember to get someone to check your spelling. :P\r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:43:30','2024-08-27 20:43:30'),(6366,'judge-event-evaluation-4727-1724755602',4727,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7580,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Brooke! I can tell you like to read. \r\nIt was an interesting choice to write it in the present tense...that felt strange to me, I think it would have read better in the past. I love the emotion that you brought to life. I would like to see the scenery come to life more...what can he see, smell, hear.\r\n\r\nKeep writing, great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:46:42','2024-08-27 20:46:42'),(6367,'judge-event-evaluation-6285-1724755729',6285,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7896,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your efforts Kyle. I like the opacity of the font, it gels it together. However, there is not much to draw the eye in, apart from the text, which this font makes it a little hard to read. You want something that draws the eye in, \"Romans 8:18\" can do this (as it does in this case), but only if you want to read the verse. What if we don\'t want to read the verse? Or don\'t know what it is and don\'t care?\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:48:49','2024-08-27 20:48:49'),(6368,'judge-event-evaluation-6302-1724755794',6302,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7897,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'You have used some lovely photos and the verse was very appropriate.\r\nI would have liked to see some more journalling. Where were the photos taken? Your scrapbook should record some more detail.\r\nTry putting the double-sided tape closer to the edge of the photos to avoid the buckling. Circles are difficult to cut. You could try borrowing a circle cutter to get these really neat.\r\nWell done on your project!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 20:49:54','2024-08-27 20:49:54'),(6369,'judge-event-evaluation-4728-1724757618',4728,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7331,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Chloe. \r\nYour story deserves a title :)\r\nI think you should stick to calling the dad Richard, because you\'re writing in the third person. You switched to calling him Dad, as if it was written from May\'s point of view. Consistency is important in a story. Along the lines of consistency, you said at the end that May had been on her way to \"end it all\", but when she left for her walk it sounded like she was just out for a nice walk to clear her head..so that\'s confusing. \r\nOverall, well done. Keep it up.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 21:20:18','2024-08-27 21:20:18'),(6370,'judge-event-evaluation-4729-1724758095',4729,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7318,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Grace.\r\nYou have chosen to write this in the first person. That\'s fine, but in the first sentence you called yourself Rahab, which is third person. It\'s important to be consistent.\r\n\r\nKeep writing! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 21:28:15','2024-08-27 21:28:15'),(6371,'judge-event-evaluation-4734-1724758839',4734,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7576,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Good work, Jacob.\r\n\r\nWatch out for any inconsistencies in your story, such as switching from present to past tense, and be mindful of correct punctuation.\r\n\r\nKeep reading lots and getting more ideas for your next story :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 21:40:39','2024-08-27 21:40:39'),(6372,'judge-event-evaluation-4730-1724760047',4730,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7317,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Laura, this is really good! Somehow you compacted a lengthy drama into a short story, impressive!\r\nI think I\'d like to read more of the lead-up to Ada\'s heart change...was there a struggle in her mind? Did she get inspired by her friend, or was she merely curious enough to listen to the sermon? \r\n\r\nKeep up the good work. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 22:00:47','2024-08-27 22:00:47'),(6373,'judge-event-evaluation-4741-1724760585',4741,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7575,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Paige. \r\nThis isn\'t how I imagine the sisters are when I read the scripture passage, but we all might imagine it quite differently, and you\'ve presented it in an interesting way.\r\nKeep writing! God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 22:09:45','2024-08-27 22:09:45'),(6374,'judge-event-evaluation-4731-1724760931',4731,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7327,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Savannah.\r\nIt would be nice to see some dialogue and expression when the family is reunited. And some emotion from Lola....is she worried about Cookie?\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 22:15:31','2024-08-27 22:15:31'),(6375,'judge-event-evaluation-4733-1724761619',4733,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7329,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sofia.\r\n\r\nInteresting story! I can almost hear Esme\'s annoying voice! I\'m glad she learned some manners. \r\nThere were definitely some plot holes and it wasn\'t very believable, but overall, I could still picture the scenes that you wrote, and that\'s good. \r\nKeep up the writing!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 22:26:59','2024-08-27 22:26:59'),(6376,'judge-event-evaluation-4732-1724762157',4732,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7573,4451,6959,7,NULL,NULL,100,48.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Sophie,\r\n\r\nI\'m not sure what happened at the end of your story...did you upload the right file? It seems unfinished...\r\nIt started well.\r\n\r\nHope to read more next year!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-27 22:35:57','2024-08-27 22:35:57'),(6377,'judge-event-evaluation-11082-1724793267',11082,175,12,14,2,2024,353,'870','2',0,6097,6960,34,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Totara, nicely blended, and great sound overall! It would be good to work on projections - specially with the ladies - we want to be able to hear their parts, especially when they are singing on their own. The guys didn\'t overpower, so that is great, but that balance Is necessary. Great choice of song, especially for this week!\r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:14:27','2024-08-28 07:14:27'),(6378,'judge-event-evaluation-11082-1724793283',11082,175,12,14,2,2024,353,'870','2',0,6097,8324,34,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Nice performance levels were good would have been nice to have different parts and harmonies',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:14:43','2024-08-28 07:14:43'),(6379,'judge-event-evaluation-7925-1724793794',7925,137,12,14,2,2024,353,'870','1',0,4451,8324,34,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Well done nice parts and harmonies',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:23:14','2024-08-28 07:23:14'),(6380,'judge-event-evaluation-7925-1724793931',7925,137,12,14,2,2024,353,'870','1',0,4451,6960,34,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work, now I want to go and re-watch the movie! You absolutely nailed the entries, especially with the staggered lines. And that accidental to change from minor to major in the harmonies! *Chef\'s kiss*\r\nA couple of things to work on with the triplet parts, but it didn\'t affect the sound at all!\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:25:31','2024-08-28 07:25:31'),(6381,'judge-event-evaluation-6286-1724794413',6286,175,12,14,2,2024,235,'750',NULL,7896,6097,8324,22,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Well done kyle good timing and tonality dynamics were good only one little pause early on ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:33:33','2024-08-28 07:33:33'),(6382,'judge-event-evaluation-5785-1724794448',5785,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7318,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,97.50,-10,NULL,'You have demonstrated mastery of scrapbooking techniques and your embellishments and decoration work well on each page.\r\nI feel that the photo that has been cut in half takes the focus off the wonderful smile on Nasah\'s face. Other than that your chosen photos, and placement and cutting of them is excellent.\r\nI would like to see a little more journalling.\r\nWhat a beautiful record of a joyful family!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:34:08','2024-08-28 07:34:08'),(6383,'judge-event-evaluation-6286-1724794451',6286,175,12,14,2,2024,235,'750',NULL,7896,6097,6960,22,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Kyle, confident and passionate! It would be good to have the arrangement that you actually played - it is not a problem to have a simpler version, but it\'s hard for us to judge your accuracy. Otherwise, great work.\r\n\r\nKeep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:34:11','2024-08-28 07:34:11'),(6385,'judge-event-evaluation-5838-1724794815',5838,137,12,14,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7576,4451,8321,44,'Collection','24',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. A worthwhile choice of script and nice message to portray. I felt this particular piece resonated with you. I felt that you would of connected with the script more if more expression and emotion was used to portray your connection.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:40:15','2024-08-28 07:40:15'),(6386,'judge-event-evaluation-5048-1724794851',5048,137,12,14,2,2024,210,'600',NULL,7575,4451,6960,19,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work Paige, you did awesome! Timing, pitch, phrasing - well done! What would be good to work on is to stand - this will help you to get a bit more power in your singing (and make it easier to breathe), but it makes the guitar playing and reaching the chords easier when you start to add in more complex chords.\r\nKeep practicing, I can\'t wait to see where God uses your talents in the future. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:40:51','2024-08-28 07:40:52'),(6387,'judge-event-evaluation-5048-1724794919',5048,137,12,14,2,2024,210,'600',NULL,7575,4451,8324,19,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Nice song page remember to use dynamics pitch was good try to dampen strings that aren\'t in the chords but over all well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:41:59','2024-08-28 07:41:59'),(6389,'judge-event-evaluation-6290-1724795632',6290,175,12,14,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7896,6097,8321,44,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, a worthwhile reading. Lovely choice of script and I felt your connection to the script was great. Adding in more expression and perhaps action to bring even more connection would help to connect the audience to your message. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:53:52','2024-08-28 07:53:52'),(6391,'judge-event-evaluation-5024-1724795688',5024,137,12,14,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7577,4451,8324,32,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done callub good pitch and dynamics ,shame you forget couple lyrics but overall pretty good',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:54:48','2024-08-28 07:54:48'),(6392,'judge-event-evaluation-5808-1724795724',5808,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7316,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'What a good record of your happy early childhood days!\r\nGood choice of photos. Look at cropping photos - for example the bottom photo on the \"cuddles\" page could have been cropped to get more focus on the people in the photo rather than the cushion.\r\nThere is always a fine line between enough embellishment and too much! I would have liked to see a little more on some pages to really make the page \'pop\'.\r\nKeep up the scrapbooking, experimenting with new techniques and ideas. This is an excellent start!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:55:24','2024-08-28 07:55:24'),(6393,'judge-event-evaluation-5711-1724795833',5711,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7580,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Brooke you have done an awesome job trying to portray the foaming of the waves.  This is a difficult thing to achieve and you have started to blend for textural effect.  Well done.  You have used a variety of textural effects - bubbles blending  and on the nose scratching back the pastel.  On the top of your shark a blending off of the blue into the black would have enhanced your work more.  Also you have on the nose area applied blue pastel between the white area and blue area.  More blending is needed her.  You have laid down your water well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 07:57:13','2024-08-28 07:57:13'),(6394,'judge-event-evaluation-5033-1724796226',5033,137,12,14,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7576,4451,6960,32,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Jacob, I thoroughly enjoyed that! Awesome power, and when you went up high, you got it, in spite of being nervous! A few timing issues and a missed entry, but overall, great work! Love the vibrato, really took the song next level!\r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:03:46','2024-08-28 08:03:46'),(6395,'judge-event-evaluation-5024-1724796236',5024,137,12,14,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7577,4451,6960,32,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Callum, especially with the glitches in the backing - you just kept going, well done! Great accuracy as well! Just need to work on some power and projection - this will help you to have some dynamic variance as well and be able to have more expression.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:03:56','2024-08-28 08:03:56'),(6397,'judge-event-evaluation-5033-1724796264',5033,137,12,14,2,2024,254,'800',NULL,7576,4451,8324,32,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jacob good pitch and dynamics try to keep your head up and eyes to the front',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:04:24','2024-08-28 08:04:24'),(6400,'judge-event-evaluation-5738-1724796468',5738,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7324,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome blending on the background, you dragged one colour into the other well.  Scratching out the feathers to create texture also has worked well.  You have particularly done the beak and the eye well.  A little more definition in the tail feathers, feet and branch would further enhance this picture.  Where is the light hitting your branch, could you make the branch appear rounded rather than flat?  Overall a picture with visual impact. Keep up the good work you have a real talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:07:48','2024-08-28 08:07:48'),(6401,'judge-event-evaluation-6498-1724796636',6498,175,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7894,6097,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,83.50,-10,NULL,'What a lovely record of your pets, which you obviously love very much!\r\nYour journalling is very informative and helps to show what you love about these pets, and shows something of the character of your pets. Please get someone to check your journalling before sticking it into your scrapbook. This may pick up several punctuation and capitalization errors.\r\nSome of the photos may have been better to have had a plain border around them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:10:36','2024-08-28 08:10:36'),(6402,'judge-event-evaluation-5041-1724796792',5041,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7317,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Laura, beautiful song. And you did really well! A few wobbly notes, probably a bit of nerves, so some confidence to work on. This will also help you to project, and you\'ll be able to work more with the dynamics (some there, but would be good to have more).\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:13:12','2024-08-28 08:13:12'),(6403,'judge-event-evaluation-5041-1724796801',5041,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7317,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent performance well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:13:21','2024-08-28 08:13:21'),(6406,'judge-event-evaluation-5790-1724797122',5790,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7318,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Grace you have done well to create texture with the spots on the octupus and the suckers on the legs you have started to develop.  There is some blending but the pastel needs more blending so that the paper does not show through as much.  Your frame captures the eyes of the octopus.  Remember to be exact with recording where something is from e. g Creation magazine volume 6.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:18:42','2024-08-28 08:18:42'),(6408,'judge-event-evaluation-5099-1724797626',5099,137,12,14,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7887,4451,8324,22,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Issac might need bit more practice in future keep it up',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:27:06','2024-08-28 08:27:06'),(6409,'judge-event-evaluation-5099-1724797679',5099,137,12,14,2,2024,219,'700',NULL,7887,4451,6960,22,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Isaac, I\'m glad you persevered. It\'s a great piece to start with, and this I a great arrangement. Some timing issues to work on, and definitely work on your confidence - you obviously can play! :)\r\n\r\nKeep practicing mate, that\'s how you learn to play. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:27:59','2024-08-28 08:27:59'),(6412,'judge-event-evaluation-5814-1724798464',5814,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7316,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Not an easy subject but you have managed to make it look like a water environment by using the lines across your page. I like the way your seal really looks like it is suspended and floating above the ocean floor.  You have started to experiment with making rocks, and scratching back your pastel as well.  A blending stick would really help you enhance your work.  For next time try and incorporate more blending of a variety of colours.  There is some blending work that you have started to do well on the ocean floor.  You have some overlaying of colour but not quite enough.  You have shown some direction of light.  Keep persevering in this media, once mastered you will be amazing.  Remember when using a magazine put the issue number and date.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:41:04','2024-08-28 08:41:04'),(6413,'judge-event-evaluation-11122-1724798624',11122,175,12,14,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7895,6097,8321,44,'Open','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Hezekiah. Lovely story reading with a nice message. Some good use of voice inflation and eye contact to draw the listeners into your message. Perhaps more use of dramatic infliction and volume changes and some facial expressions would bring more interest to any future readings. Overall a nice presentation!Thank you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:43:44','2024-08-28 08:43:45'),(6415,'judge-event-evaluation-5046-1724798629',5046,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7575,4451,6960,33,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Paige, despite a shaky start! Well done for persevering - it\'s hard enough with a false start, let alone trying to sing with a different backing! Glad we managed to eventually get it happening! Just need to work on hitting the notes true - it was good for the most part, but a couple of shaky notes.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:43:49','2024-08-28 08:43:50'),(6416,'judge-event-evaluation-5046-1724798642',5046,137,12,14,2,2024,259,'805',NULL,7575,4451,8324,33,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Well done good pitch and dynamics glad we had a chance to do it again',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 08:44:02','2024-08-28 08:44:03'),(6424,'judge-event-evaluation-5863-1724800647',5863,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7317,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Laura, you have definitely a subject that shows perspective against the background.  It is eye catching and you have a good foundation.  More blending could be done from the horizon line and up into the sky, darker on the top and perhaps a touch of yellow in the horizon would enhance this picture more.  Good textural effects on the bush below the branch and textural effect on the branch.  Where your light is coming from shows well on the bushes and also the branch. Round the claws of the feet more to fit around the log and work more on blending skies.  You have started to put texture into the tail feathers.  How could you put more texture onto the bird to show more detail on the wings and the body of the bird?  When using a book as your reference remember to copy the name of the book and author down.  Overall a very good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:17:27','2024-08-28 09:17:27'),(6425,'judge-event-evaluation-6310-1724801078',6310,175,12,14,2,2024,316,'961',NULL,7897,6097,8321,46,'Open','24',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your presentation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:24:38','2024-08-28 09:24:38'),(6427,'judge-event-evaluation-5877-1724801701',5877,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7328,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,53.00,-10,NULL,'Your perspective is convincing but you could enhance what you have done by rounding the limbs of the frog and create more of a 3 dimensional look from an aerial perspective?\r\nYou have done some blending in your water and a little bit around your rock, well done!  Blending sticks will further enhance your work. Be careful not to have the line of the surrounds of a subject to not follow your subject line.  Which direction is the light coming from?  Could you show this on the frog and on the rock? Keep developing your talent in this subject area.  Remember to always put the name of the book and the author when referring to a book.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:35:01','2024-08-28 09:35:01'),(6431,'judge-event-evaluation-5858-1724802268',5858,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7317,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'What a splendid scrapbook project!\r\nYou have demonstarted mastery in cutting and arranging. It was clear and uncluttered, but not boring!\r\nThe only comment that I can make for improvement would be that the blue border on the \"Forever\" page blends into the brown background. Maybe a slightly brighter blue would have been more effective.\r\nKeep up the excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:44:28','2024-08-28 09:44:28'),(6432,'judge-event-evaluation-6232-1724802350',6232,175,12,14,2,2024,328,'977',NULL,7901,6097,8321,48,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your presentation. I can see the message of gluttony you were trying  to portray. Your energy was good. Unforcantely some of your presentation seemed to be missed, which meant a timing breach. Total time 2 mins 5 sec',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:45:50','2024-08-29 23:52:04'),(6433,'judge-event-evaluation-5900-1724802354',5900,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7575,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Paige you have really started to explore your blending and it is very effective.   Boulder blending on your fish would have enhanced this a little bit more.  Good blending in the back ground and creating a sense of different depths in your picture, especially around the weeds on the left hand side.  The light hitting the fish and reeds on the left hand side and the rock formation could be further enhanced.  This would accentuate the cave a little more.  Remember when using a magazine to put down the issue and the date of issue.  Your step by step procedure needs to be elaborated on incorporating what colours you blended and how you applied them and even why you applied them that way.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:45:54','2024-08-28 09:45:54'),(6437,'judge-event-evaluation-5894-1724803079',5894,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7575,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'What an awesome scrapbook!\r\nIt was clear, well colour coordinated and very neatly put together.\r\nI am unable to fault your work.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 09:57:59','2024-08-28 09:57:59'),(6438,'judge-event-evaluation-6381-1724803342',6381,175,12,14,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7898,6097,8328,45,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:02:22','2024-08-28 10:02:23'),(6439,'judge-event-evaluation-5995-1724803811',5995,137,12,14,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7579,4451,8321,45,'Collection','24',100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Great Job! A great effort recalling your lines. Some use of infliction to add some interest. Nice eye contact too! Perhaps some more practice under pressure would help next year. Overall,great effort',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:10:11','2024-08-28 10:10:12'),(6440,'judge-event-evaluation-5995-1724803819',5995,137,12,14,2,2024,290,'910',NULL,7579,4451,8328,45,'Collection','24',100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Xavier for not giving up, was very proud of you.\r\nJust some more practice and you will do super next year.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:10:19','2024-08-28 10:10:19'),(6444,'judge-event-evaluation-11098-1724805528',11098,175,12,14,2,2024,307,'951','2',0,6097,8321,39,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Good job. Well memoried with good use of inflection and volume to bring through the scripts message. Well interacting characters, and natural flow to the act.\r\nThe message was a little hard to grasp, perhaps a clearer message would be better received in future acts ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:38:48','2024-08-28 10:38:48'),(6447,'judge-event-evaluation-14437-1724806200',14437,137,12,14,2,2024,307,'951','1',0,4451,8321,39,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. A great job considering the fill in for Felix and also your injury, Vanessa. Some great use of inflection and dramatic voice to add depth and connect the audience with the message. Use of costume and props would have been a nice addition.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:50:00','2024-08-28 10:50:00'),(6448,'judge-event-evaluation-6341-1724806368',6341,175,12,14,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7922,6097,8321,43,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well spoken, some prompting neede. However breached due to under time of 3 mins 44 secs',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:52:48','2024-08-29 23:53:16'),(6450,'judge-event-evaluation-6342-1724806461',6342,175,12,14,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7922,6097,8321,44,'Open','25',100,92.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done, a great performance. I loved how you used voice changes, infliction, intentional pauses, lowering and raising of your voice to bring the main character to life and bring connection to the message. Lovely use of facial expression and eye contact. Perhaps more use of some hand/body gestures would add more depth to your performance for next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:54:21','2024-08-28 10:54:21'),(6451,'judge-event-evaluation-6380-1724806503',6380,175,12,14,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7898,6097,8321,44,'Open','25',100,70.50,-10,-0.50,'Well done Heidi, a great reading. Some great use of infliction, softening/strengthening of voice and pauses to bring interest to the piece. A times, there was good use of emotion to bring connection for the audience to your characters. More eye contact and facial expression would be great additions to future performances. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:55:03','2024-08-28 10:55:03'),(6452,'judge-event-evaluation-6213-1724806547',6213,175,12,14,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7900,6097,8321,44,'Open','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Payton. \r\nGreat use of infliction at times to express emotion and portray your personal connection with the message. Use of gestures and action would of brought even more connection but you gave a lovely performance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:55:47','2024-08-28 10:55:47'),(6453,'judge-event-evaluation-6310-1724806578',6310,175,12,14,2,2024,316,'961',NULL,7897,6097,8328,46,'Open','24',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Zachariah, great story which I\'m sure young boys would love. \r\nJust a note for next time it does need to be told by memory. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:56:18','2024-08-28 10:56:18'),(6454,'judge-event-evaluation-13159-1724806662',13159,175,12,14,2,2024,328,'977',NULL,7898,6097,8321,48,'Open','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Heidi for your funny presentation. I loved how your clown painfully cleaned every coin, this was a funny touch. The script flowed in a natural way. I think bringing through a stronger Bilical principle/moral could be beneficial to any future act.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 10:57:42','2024-08-28 10:57:42'),(6455,'judge-event-evaluation-6501-1724806887',6501,175,12,14,2,2024,287,'907',NULL,7894,6097,8321,43,'Collection','24',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance. I can see a lot of thought a creativity has been put into your script and has been written from a thought provoking perspective. Your ability to paint clear visual picture through verbal description is excellent. Challenging message too. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:01:27','2024-08-28 11:01:27'),(6456,'judge-event-evaluation-6309-1724806997',6309,175,12,14,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7897,6097,8321,44,'Open','24',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'What a great performance. A excellent choice of script for you, I felt as though you fitted the character very well and I felt immersed in your story. Great use of infliction and facial expression to connect us with your message of faith. Overall, a very moving performance. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:03:17','2024-08-28 11:03:17'),(6458,'judge-event-evaluation-5111-1724809232',5111,137,12,14,2,2024,308,'952',NULL,7886,4451,6,40,'Open','31',106,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Faith. A suggestion for future entries. Take the time to memorize the script and don\'t worry about who\'s in the audience. You did really well. More practice and you\'ll do extremally well next convention. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:40:32','2024-08-29 00:28:07'),(6459,'judge-event-evaluation-5111-1724809282',5111,137,12,14,2,2024,308,'952',NULL,7886,4451,5,40,'Open',NULL,106,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well done for giving the event a go! To improve the impact of your presentation, you can practice with real props to understand the way you would use them in a mime setting. Have more confidence, exaggerate your movements and I think you could do great! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:41:22','2024-08-29 00:28:07'),(6460,'judge-event-evaluation-5702-1724809311',5702,137,12,14,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7322,4451,6960,50,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Braden, great inclusion of a personal testimony! I also liked that you looked into the context of one of your passages - not only is this a good practice, but it gave extra weight to your point.\r\nThere are a few things that you could expound more on -you have plenty of time. Furthermore, it is a good idea to have a central passage that you come back to, and use the others to support it. Also, it would be good to end in prayer.\r\nOtherwise, great job. Keep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:41:51','2024-08-28 11:41:51'),(6463,'judge-event-evaluation-11079-1724809875',11079,137,12,14,2,2024,309,'953','2',0,4451,6,40,'Open','32',106,75.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Some suggestions for improvement for future entries. Take the time to memorize the script which will help with your item. Other tan that well done and I look forward to seeing you all again. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:51:15','2024-08-28 11:51:15'),(6464,'judge-event-evaluation-6311-1724809944',6311,175,12,14,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7897,6097,6960,50,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Zachariah! Good message, and one that we need to constantly be reminded of, as we always forget - no matter how long we have been a Christian! It would be good to have some personal examples in - you had some good anecdotes, but something personal helps you connect with your congregation. Also, it is better to have a central verse that you come back to.\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 11:52:24','2024-08-28 11:52:24'),(6468,'judge-event-evaluation-6311-1724810417',6311,175,12,14,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7897,6097,8321,50,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Great job! An excellent message on a usually difficult subject to concisely preach on. Your message flowed well and naturally moved into your next points. Great use of eye contact, appropriate pauses etc. \r\nHearing  personal experience with faith may have added a more personal /relatable element. However, overall a well written word delivered humbly',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:00:17','2024-08-28 12:00:17'),(6469,'judge-event-evaluation-5702-1724810621',5702,137,12,14,2,2024,320,'965',NULL,7322,4451,8321,50,'Open','24',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Great job. This is clearly a biblical principle close to your heart and something you have personally learned and walked through with Christ. \r\nI felt you clearly communicated your thoughts around this subject. I liked how you humbly challenged yourself the end and also left us with a challenge to',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:03:41','2024-08-28 12:03:41'),(6471,'judge-event-evaluation-11081-1724811349',11081,137,12,14,2,2024,345,'1058','1',0,4451,5,51,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, thank you for showing up and giving your best. With more memory work, you could all create something really impactful. The actions and movement was interesting to watch and kept my attention.  \r\nI hope to see you back next year, with a little more practice. \r\nUnfortunately, you were under time and unable to place. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:15:49','2024-08-28 12:15:49'),(6474,'judge-event-evaluation-5922-1724811505',5922,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7327,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'This is a lovely record of baptisms in your church! I notice that you still have blank pages at the end - plenty of room to enter more baptisms!\r\nOn the pages of Mark\'s baptism the photos would have been enhanced by adding a plain border around the photos.\r\nTo make your scrapbook really tell a story some more journalling would be helpful.\r\nNice work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:18:25','2024-08-28 12:18:25'),(6475,'judge-event-evaluation-11081-1724811928',11081,137,12,14,2,2024,345,'1058','1',0,4451,6,51,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Suggestions for future entries. Please take the time to memorize the scripture as a group. Another suggestion would be to use the guidelines which you can find on the student convention website. This will help with preparing for the event and also help with arrangements, technical delivery and Mechanics.\r\n\r\nI marked it as Breach because it didn\'t reach the require minimum time but you can do the same scripture again next year.\r\n\r\nOther than that, well done and I look forward to seeing your entry again next year. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:25:28','2024-08-28 12:25:28'),(6476,'judge-event-evaluation-11051-1724811932',11051,175,12,14,2,2024,363,'761','1',0,6097,8321,25,'Open','22',100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Great try with a nice piece. Unfortunately timing was an issue and a rhythm was hard to find. Keep working at it, I can see you all have great potential. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:25:32','2024-08-28 12:25:32'),(6477,'judge-event-evaluation-11051-1724812155',11051,175,12,14,2,2024,363,'761','1',0,6097,6960,25,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort boys. It is a shame that your track didn\'t pan out - it really threw you, and you obviously know what you are doing! Keep practicing, and we will see what you can do next year! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:29:15','2024-08-28 12:29:15'),(6481,'judge-event-evaluation-5839-1724813646',5839,137,12,14,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7576,4451,8321,50,'Collection','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great job! I can really see that you have had personal experience with the issue of fear and this came through in your message. I loved how you used a personal testimony and to see how this has encouraged you moving forward to tackle things head on with Gods help and strength. \r\nI think with more practice and exposure to your topic, you could really deliver a powerful sermon. However, overall you did brought forward a excellent message today. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:54:06','2024-08-28 12:54:06'),(6482,'judge-event-evaluation-5839-1724813665',5839,137,12,14,2,2024,295,'915',NULL,7576,4451,6960,50,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Jacob, great message! And one we constantly need to hear! Just need to work on some confidence, and fleshing it out a little. Aim for about half way (6 minutes)... Also, just make sure you have a heme passage that you come back to.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing, looking forward to what you bring next year! God Bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:54:25','2024-08-28 12:54:25'),(6485,'judge-event-evaluation-11051-1724813872',11051,175,12,14,2,2024,363,'761','1',0,6097,7479,25,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for sharing your instrumental trio with us. :-)\r\nBe careful to watch your timing and rhythm.\r\nRemember you are still being judged when you enter and exit the stage - these are easy points is to gain, so don\'t loose them! ;-)\r\nI would have loved to have heard a live singer with your group, that would have made it even more special!\r\nKeep developing your gifts for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 12:57:52','2024-08-28 12:57:52'),(6487,'judge-event-evaluation-13159-1724814524',13159,175,12,14,2,2024,328,'977',NULL,7898,6097,8328,48,'Open','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'You looked great, your costume and make up was really good.  Your message was positive and fun.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:08:44','2024-08-28 13:08:44'),(6488,'judge-event-evaluation-6232-1724814592',6232,175,12,14,2,2024,328,'977',NULL,7901,6097,8328,48,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Very cute performance I was impressed by the amount of props you pulled out of your pocket. You looked great. \r\nI\'m sorry you didn\'t feel comfortable to finish.  Try again next year, you will be amazing.\r\nP.S. thanks for the chocolates, just what I needed :)\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:09:52','2024-08-29 23:52:04'),(6489,'judge-event-evaluation-5947-1724814824',5947,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7573,4451,7455,54,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'This is a lovely record of your family trip!\r\nI loved that you have chosen different shapes for your photos that make the pages both interesting and aesthetically pleasing. Your title page could have used a little bit of colour, either with border or embellishment.\r\nDo remember to get someone to look over your report so that you can correct spelling errors befor submitting it.\r\nExcellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:13:44','2024-08-28 13:13:44'),(6490,'judge-event-evaluation-14437-1724815363',14437,137,12,14,2,2024,307,'951','1',0,4451,8328,39,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, some great memorising shown. \r\nGreat that you showed resilience in getting the performance done with one person standing in and Vanessa with a broken wrist and arm in a cast. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:22:43','2024-08-28 13:22:43'),(6491,'judge-event-evaluation-11055-1724815388',11055,175,12,14,2,2024,307,'951','1',0,6097,8328,39,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Kyle and Kyan\r\nVery well performed, great costumes and well memorized.\r\nCould tell you have put a lot of effort into your performance.\r\nThank you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:23:08','2024-08-28 13:23:08'),(6492,'judge-event-evaluation-5928-1724815437',5928,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7327,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'You have worked hard to create different light in your background breaking through.  There is light also on the log that the parrot is sitting on. Where the bird is sitting, if the light is coming from behind, there would be a shadow on the log.  Don\'t forget to acknowledge the issue of your magazine and the date of the magazine you are taking your inspiration from.  Also in your reports write how you have applied your pastels. Sometimes it is best not to have black spots unless they are blended into the surrounding background. I am not sure what the marks on the right hand. You can also create light on the parrot wings and use scratch back techniques to define your feathers.  Nice bold colours are used that stand out!  The bird is really quirky and has character. Well done!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:23:57','2024-08-28 13:23:57'),(6493,'judge-event-evaluation-11098-1724815446',11098,175,12,14,2,2024,307,'951','2',0,6097,8328,39,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Grace and Adena \r\nWell memorised, just a few small errors, but recovered well.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:24:06','2024-08-28 13:24:06'),(6495,'judge-event-evaluation-6341-1724815898',6341,175,12,14,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7922,6097,8328,43,'Open','25',100,0.00,-10,-0.50,'Great persevering Adana when you lost your way. \r\nMore time practising will make a huge difference.\r\nIt did come under the allocated time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:31:38','2024-08-29 23:53:16'),(6496,'judge-event-evaluation-6501-1724815997',6501,175,12,14,2,2024,287,'907',NULL,7894,6097,8328,43,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome performance Kyan, very dramatic and original.\r\nSome of the performance didn\'t match the script, but overall very well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:33:17','2024-08-28 13:33:17'),(6498,'judge-event-evaluation-6342-1724816061',6342,175,12,14,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7922,6097,8328,44,'Open','25',100,89.00,-10,-1.00,'Well done Adena your expressive reading was really well portrayed. It was great that you used different voice tones, pauses and gestures.\r\nUnfortunately it did go over time by 54 seconds and could have been speed up a bit in some areas, but overall very well performed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:34:21','2024-08-28 13:34:22'),(6499,'judge-event-evaluation-6380-1724816152',6380,175,12,14,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7898,6097,8328,44,'Open','25',100,72.50,-10,-0.50,'Well done Heidi, great powerful story.\r\nSome use of different voice tones, pauses, gestures and movement would help get some higher marks for next time.  You did use some facial expressions which was great to see.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:35:52','2024-08-28 13:35:53'),(6500,'judge-event-evaluation-6213-1724816185',6213,175,12,14,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,7900,6097,8328,44,'Open','25',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Peyton that was a lovely message. You have a lovely soft voice which suited the story you told\r\nWould be great to see some more expression such as hand gestures or facial expressions. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:36:25','2024-08-28 13:36:25'),(6501,'judge-event-evaluation-11122-1724816279',11122,175,12,14,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7895,6097,8328,44,'Open','24',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Hezekiah, great choice of story with a very worthwhile message.\r\nSome different voice tones will help get some higher marks, along with pauses, gestures and movement. Overall nicely presented.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:37:59','2024-08-28 13:37:59'),(6502,'judge-event-evaluation-6309-1724816309',6309,175,12,14,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7897,6097,8328,44,'Open','24',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Zachariah, great story choice, I enjoyed that the story had a dramatic factor.  Great clear voice and expression.\r\nYou could include some more change of voice tones, gestures and movement.\r\nOverall very well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:38:29','2024-08-28 13:38:30'),(6503,'judge-event-evaluation-6290-1724816328',6290,175,12,14,2,2024,313,'958',NULL,7896,6097,8328,44,'Open','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kyle very well presented, nice clear message. \r\nSome more voice expression and hand movements or gestures would have helped get higher marks, but overall very good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:38:48','2024-08-28 13:38:49'),(6504,'judge-event-evaluation-5838-1724816367',5838,137,12,14,2,2024,288,'908',NULL,7576,4451,8328,44,'Collection','24',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jacob, great story and message told. \r\nIt would have been great to see some expression used gestures and movement and more expression in voice.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:39:27','2024-08-28 13:39:27'),(6505,'judge-event-evaluation-11079-1724816721',11079,137,12,14,2,2024,309,'953','2',0,4451,8328,40,'Open','32',106,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done boys for doing your mime. \r\nSome really good clear actions and movement and was easy to follow.\r\nJust need more practice and work on appearance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:45:21','2024-08-28 13:45:21'),(6506,'judge-event-evaluation-5940-1724817418',5940,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7329,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Absolutely loved the way you applied and overlayered your pastels in the body of the Chameleon. Also the changes in the head and the stippling of pastel as well as circles on the body creates some great contrast.   Perhaps the limbs could have been more developed, really study your subject at the drawing phase and look at proportions.  In your report remember to describe all your procedures including what techniques you used with your pastels. Also practice drawing 3D cylinders which will help with making tree limbs appear round and legs appear round.  Good job!  Keep up the great work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 13:56:58','2024-08-28 13:56:59'),(6507,'judge-event-evaluation-5983-1724817855',5983,137,12,14,2,2024,208,'559',NULL,7325,4451,8328,18,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Vinni, fun engaging comic.  \r\nReally consistent artwork and very important message.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:04:15','2024-08-28 14:04:15'),(6508,'judge-event-evaluation-5753-1724817885',5753,137,12,14,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7331,4451,6960,50,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Chloe! Very good job, and you go through a lot of content in just a few minutes! Something to remember tho, it might be better to trim some points down a little, and expound on others more. And, have a central theme passage that you come back to. You did kind of do this, but its good to emphasize this theme constantly.\r\nKeep up the excellent work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:04:45','2024-08-28 14:04:45'),(6509,'judge-event-evaluation-5753-1724817951',5753,137,12,14,2,2024,305,'929',NULL,7331,4451,8321,50,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Chloe! You show great wisdom and insight for someone of your age. I can really sense that you have personally wrestled with some of the points your raised in your message and this is such a good basis for any powerful sermon. You added in humor at appropriate times and conveyed your points in a humble and approachable manner. Purity is such a important principle that this generation overlook, so good job for raising and bringing a challenge on this. Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:05:51','2024-08-28 14:05:52'),(6510,'judge-event-evaluation-5645-1724818703',5645,137,12,14,2,2024,197,'509',NULL,7806,4451,8328,18,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Brooklyn, very unique street scene and neat looking characters.\r\nThe message is great, but could flow a bit better with more speech bubbles added.  The words in the 4th top square could be reworded to flow better. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:18:23','2024-08-28 14:18:23'),(6511,'judge-event-evaluation-5633-1724819134',5633,137,12,14,2,2024,197,'509',NULL,7580,4451,8328,18,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Brooke, very cool idea of the Olympics to present your message of determination in the comic.  I like how you have done the audience.  I think it would have helped to have the speech bubbles consistent (either square shape or bubbles), but overall very good. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:25:34','2024-08-28 14:25:34'),(6515,'judge-event-evaluation-5749-1724820177',5749,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7331,4451,8328,2,'Collection','7',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo Chloe, really nice lighting and you have done a great job with your editing.  I like that it is a bit different. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:42:57','2024-08-28 14:42:57'),(6517,'judge-event-evaluation-5708-1724820324',5708,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7580,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,58.00,-10,NULL,'This is a pretty embroidery.\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted marks could not be awarded in these areas.\r\nPlease be careful to keep the back of your work neat also - this means long threads need to be stitched under other threads rather than sitting loose on the top. There are also a couple of random bits of fabric on the back.\r\nGood colour choice for your matt and frame.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:45:24','2024-08-28 14:45:24'),(6518,'judge-event-evaluation-5833-1724820748',5833,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7576,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Jacob for your cross stitch. :-)\r\nUnfortunately, you lost marks for not including a pattern. I suggest that if you did not have a pattern, to get some maths paper and sketch out your pattern there, that means that you will not have to use a pencil on the cross stitch canvas. Also, try and make the back of your canvas as tidy as possible - it is possible to have this look like the front! I hope you will give cross stitch another go. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:52:28','2024-08-28 14:52:28'),(6519,'judge-event-evaluation-5786-1724820806',5786,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7318,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,62.00,-10,NULL,'What lovely stitching!\r\nIt is a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted many marks could not be awarded in these areas. \r\nPlease be careful to keep the back of your work neat also - this means long threads need to be stitched under other threads rather than sitting loose on the top. Ends should be securely and neatly finished off.\r\nYour choice of teal for the matt compliments the butterfly well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 14:53:26','2024-08-28 14:53:26'),(6522,'judge-event-evaluation-5734-1724821345',5734,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7324,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Charlie for your Cross Stitch. :-)\r\nNext time please submit your cross stitch pattern with your entry - so you do not loose points.\r\nI recommend to improve your cross stitch to add a black outline - so that it is easier to decipher your image. You have a very nice backing to your cross stitch. :-)\r\nI hope that you will continue to develop your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:02:25','2024-08-28 15:02:25'),(6523,'judge-event-evaluation-5896-1724821412',5896,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7575,4451,8328,2,'Collection','7',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a gorgeous portrait of your great-grandmother Paige. It will be treasured for many years to come.  The colour could perhaps be a little sharper, but overall its a very nice portrait\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:03:32','2024-08-28 15:03:32'),(6524,'judge-event-evaluation-5658-1724821447',5658,137,12,14,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7886,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'You have used a lot of textural effects really well and your shoe appears well worn and detailed.  On your sketching, in the lace that is up the top, that forms a circle, your shadow underneath the lace has incorrect line. \r\nYou have used your tools well, stippling, cross hatching line, use of electrical eraser etc.  You have done an excellent work.\r\n\r\nReport:  Include a copy of the picture you have copied. You have put in you source details as pin.it .  When you go to this web address you need to make sure that you look up the web page specific for your drawing.  You have made a good list of the tools you used.  You have done a very brief description of the steps you have taken.  A much fuller report needs to be written that includes what techniques and details you used e.g I created the lace by shading it in and then using an electric rubber in a cross hatch to remove pencil and leave dots.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:04:07','2024-08-28 15:04:07'),(6526,'judge-event-evaluation-5809-1724821679',5809,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7316,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,61.00,-10,NULL,'Good on you for not using the punch needle. Please note that \"Punch and Sew\" embroidery is not acceptable for convention, but your long stitch is!\r\nWhen using a kit, you still need to submit any pictures or instructions that came with the kit - even if this is a picture on the front of the packet. Some marks could not be awarded due to this.\r\nPlease be careful to finish off your threads correctly.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:07:59','2024-08-28 15:07:59'),(6527,'judge-event-evaluation-12345-1724822064',12345,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7806,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Brooklyn for your cross stitch - I love the sushi idea! :-)\r\nDon\'t forget to include your sketched pattern of your project, so that you do not loose points.\r\nYou could improve your cross stitch by doing an outline around the sushis.\r\nI hope that you will continue to develop your cross stitch skills. :-)\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:14:24','2024-08-28 15:14:24'),(6528,'judge-event-evaluation-5835-1724822093',5835,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7576,4451,8328,2,'Collection',NULL,100,55.00,-10,NULL,'The use of better lighting (or positioning of lighting) would of helped with the dark shadowing. The photo is  not crisp and clear. \r\nNice positioning though and it does stand out. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:14:53','2024-08-28 15:14:53'),(6529,'judge-event-evaluation-5787-1724822353',5787,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7318,4451,8328,2,'Collection','7',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'The photo definitely catches your eye with the bright crisp colours. \r\nThe red is a bit over powering and may have looked better cropped a bit higher. Would have also been nice to see the side of the photographers face. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:19:13','2024-08-28 15:19:13'),(6530,'judge-event-evaluation-5834-1724822371',5834,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7576,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,52.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your embroidery!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted marks could not be awarded in these areas.\r\nPlease be careful to keep the back of your work neat also. Threads need to be finished securely and neatly.\r\nYour report does not seem accurate. This fabric is not aida, and there is no verse on the embroidery.\r\nThe nice bright matt compliments the colours of your butterfly well.\r\nGood work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:19:31','2024-08-28 15:19:31'),(6532,'judge-event-evaluation-6009-1724822525',6009,137,12,14,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7733,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Eyes can be difficult to do.  The left eye you have made an excellent job of it.  The right eye is perhaps a little too wide in both the length across of the iris. Your sketching is of a high standard and you have an eye for detail.  Your use of line for the hair and beard are appropriate and I can see you have layered the hair from light, to medium to and then you have put in darker highlights.  All facial features are placed well although your shading between the nose and the lips could have a few more highlights.  You have a definite direction of light and placement on the face well done.  All in all a very good work. Keep on sketching! A fuller report could be written that details how you used your pencils to shade and what techniques you used.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:22:05','2024-08-28 15:22:05'),(6533,'judge-event-evaluation-5859-1724822990',5859,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7317,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,64.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted marks could not be awarded in these areas.\r\nIf possible, try and use matt board or thick card for your matt. I feel that the corrugated card, although it is a good colour match, distracts from the beauty of the butterfly.\r\nYour stitching is nice and even.\r\nWell done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:29:50','2024-08-28 15:29:50'),(6535,'judge-event-evaluation-5007-1724823313',5007,175,12,14,2,2024,20,'062',NULL,7898,6097,7471,6,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,0.00,'You wrote a wonderful poem Heidi. I particularly love the way your poem expressed various attributes of the Lord and the different ways you see and recognize Him. There were, unfortunately, a few grammatical errors (eg. the lines that end with \'immortal\' and \'pray\'), and don\'t forget to always capitalize ALL the nouns and pronouns that refer to God (He, His, Him etc). Keep writing, you have a wonderful gift :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:35:13','2024-08-28 15:35:13'),(6537,'judge-event-evaluation-4736-1724823876',4736,137,12,14,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7331,4451,7471,6,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Chloe! A lovely, poetic retelling of Proverbs 31. Keep writing for Jesus :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:44:36','2024-08-28 15:44:36'),(6538,'judge-event-evaluation-4739-1724824516',4739,137,12,14,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7576,4451,7471,6,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Jacob. You have a unique and interesting perspective that is evidenced in your writing and poetry style. I would love to see more from you and encourage you to continue exploring written expression. Perhaps next time you could try expanding each line so that you can add more about the story/theme. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 15:55:16','2024-08-28 15:55:16'),(6539,'judge-event-evaluation-4738-1724824962',4738,137,12,14,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7317,4451,7471,6,'Collection',NULL,100,100.00,-10,0.00,'Wow! What a beautiful and very well-written poem, Laura! The imagery and symbolism used to bring home the story/lesson was used so well. Keep writing! You are very talented and I\'d love to see more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 16:02:42','2024-08-28 16:02:42'),(6540,'judge-event-evaluation-4754-1724825355',4754,137,12,14,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7578,4451,7471,6,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your heartfelt poem, Vanessa. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 16:09:15','2024-08-28 16:09:15'),(6541,'judge-event-evaluation-5137-1724825584',5137,137,12,14,2,2024,6,'012',NULL,7579,4451,7471,6,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for a very unique and uplifting poem, Xavier. You were very creative in your use of words and poetic metre, but just be mindful to use proper grammar as well. Keep writing; God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 16:13:04','2024-08-28 16:13:04'),(6544,'judge-event-evaluation-4735-1724832039',4735,137,12,14,2,2024,19,'061',NULL,7331,4451,7471,5,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you Chloe. You chose an interesting and challenging topic for your essay and did well to explore and present arguments against and for it. There were a number of grammatical and formatting errors that unfortunately lost you a few points, and all in all, you did well. God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 18:00:39','2024-08-28 18:00:39'),(6546,'judge-event-evaluation-4737-1724833033',4737,137,12,14,2,2024,8,'014',NULL,7316,4451,7471,8,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for a lovely Book Report. I can tell that you really loved this book as you have recalled and presented details about scenes and characters with great detail. However, I would\'ve like to see you elaborate more about the lessons or Biblical principals shown in the story and/or characters. Also don\'t forget to always check spelling and grammar. Keep reading, writing and practicing this special gift :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 18:17:13','2024-08-28 18:17:13'),(6549,'judge-event-evaluation-4972-1724835491',4972,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','1',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,78.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you Hudson and Brooklyn for your PowerPoint. Your slides were presented and laid out well, but I think you could have gone much further and done a lot more with this topic. I encourage you to give it another go and try to expand on your chosen topic next time. God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 18:58:11','2024-08-28 18:58:11'),(6550,'judge-event-evaluation-14545-1724835498',14545,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','2',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your lovely PowerPoint presentation, Luke and Oliver. You chose a great topic and presented the truths to be learned from it well. I love your creativity and use of animations to tell the parable. It would\'ve been nice to see the same creative effort put into the Parable\'s Definition. Well done nonetheless. Keep practicing and perfecting your talents :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 18:58:18','2024-08-28 18:58:18'),(6551,'judge-event-evaluation-14541-1724837325',14541,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','3',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your PowerPoint presentation, Callum. You chose a great topic and did well to expand on each of the Commandments. However, some of these points could have been presented or worded better. Some of the graphics used were also a bit pixelated. Asking a parent, supervisor or fellow students to check your work and provide feedback is always a good idea. Otherwise, you did a great job and I would like to see more from you in future. God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:28:45','2024-08-28 19:28:45'),(6552,'judge-event-evaluation-14543-1724837770',14543,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','4',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Oliver! This was a well thought out and engaging Presentation. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:36:10','2024-08-28 19:36:10'),(6553,'judge-event-evaluation-14542-1724838145',14542,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','5',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,85.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Hoani! A well-planned PowerPoint presenting lots of interesting truths and facts. However, some of the slides were a bit too quick and more graphics and images would\'ve made it even more engaging. Please give this another go next time; I\'d love to see more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:42:25','2024-08-28 19:42:25'),(6555,'judge-event-evaluation-14544-1724838621',14544,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','7',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,82.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your Presentation with a very unique topic. You presented some great biblical references and facts about donkeys, but I think they could\'ve have been laid out in better order. For example, start with some facts about donkeys, then go into biblical references, then end with lessons or principals to be learned these observations. I hope you give it another try next time and don\'t forget to have your name, age, school and country/state in the first slide (as stated in the guidelines). God Bless :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:50:21','2024-08-28 19:50:21'),(6556,'judge-event-evaluation-11050-1724838942',11050,175,12,14,2,2024,180,'461',NULL,7922,6097,6960,11,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your efforts Adena. Very noble, and great perspective. It is very dark (colour wise), it would be nice for the subject to stand out more. Also, with your report, it would be good to describe the actual process... What did you actually do in the program to draw this picture or create the shapes and textures?\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:55:42','2024-08-28 19:55:42'),(6557,'judge-event-evaluation-5895-1724838965',5895,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7575,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,66.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted marks could not be awarded in these areas.\r\nPlease be careful to secure your threadssecurely and neatly.\r\nGood mastery of a variety of stiches. \r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:56:05','2024-08-28 19:56:05'),(6558,'judge-event-evaluation-14546-1724838973',14546,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','8',0,4451,7471,4,'Collection','19',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Good job creating a very well thought-out and planned presentation, Xavier! I hope to see more interesting and educational presentations from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 19:56:13','2024-08-28 19:56:13'),(6559,'judge-event-evaluation-6335-1724839278',6335,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7922,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'The white and red colours work well together on this poster Adena and you have put thought into the positioning of your text.  I understand why you have changed the word \"wrath\" into a black font although this has made it a little difficult to see.\r\nI found it a little confusing to link your picture with the message that you stated you are trying to portray on your Design Report.\r\nOverall a pleasing look and a great idea to use your own photo in this manner.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:01:18','2024-08-28 20:01:18'),(6560,'judge-event-evaluation-12338-1724839356',12338,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7572,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,61.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Hoani for sharing your cross stitch! :-)\r\nI am a little confused by why you have not completed all the crosses. Sadly, you lost points because there was no pattern submitted with your report. :-(\r\nTry and make sure that the back is as tidy as possible - so that it looks more closely like the front.\r\nKeep developing your skills! \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:02:36','2024-08-28 20:02:36'),(6561,'judge-event-evaluation-5924-1724839536',5924,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7327,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,71.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted marks could not be awarded in these areas.\r\nPlease be careful to keep the back of your work neat also - this means long threads need to be stitched under other threads rather than sitting loose on the top. When doing your satin stitch that is not going to be bordered by chain or backstitch make sure that you totally cover the marked pattern on the fabric.\r\nYou have accomplished lovely neat French knots. Well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:05:36','2024-08-28 20:05:36'),(6562,'judge-event-evaluation-5060-1724839838',5060,137,12,14,2,2024,167,'411',NULL,7578,4451,6960,11,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your efforts Vanessa - well balanced. Please make sure that you check the guidelines before you start your event however. Digital Art is not a variant of posters where you place objects, rather, Digital Art is where you create an image (like a painting) but digitally. You must create every part of the artwork.\r\nPlease keep practicing however - with some message, this might have been more suited to Posters',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:10:38','2024-08-29 13:20:36'),(6563,'judge-event-evaluation-5916-1724840133',5916,137,12,14,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7330,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful lights in the mane of your horse.  The eyes are very expressive.  To help you drawing develop study your subject especially paying attention to proportion and dimensions, this is especially important when drawing animals and humans.  These subjects can be more challenging and can often require measured proportional drawing. You actually have an amazing gift for drawing eyes. You have used a variety of pencil strokes and smudging techniques well done. With the nose you have used a little bit of stippling which is effective.  Keep exploring your talent and you will do great things.  I like the way that you have contrasted the wavy hair with the straight hair.  Very rustic frame.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:15:33','2024-08-28 20:15:33'),(6565,'judge-event-evaluation-5948-1724840195',5948,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7573,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,60.00,-10,NULL,'What lovely vibvrant colours you have chosen!\r\nPlease make sure that you complete your report.\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because these were not submitted marks could not be awarded in these areas.\r\nPlease be careful to keep the back of your work neat. Also remember to wash your hands before working on your stitching as this will help to keep it clean. It appears that something has been spilt on your fabric just above the butterfly. Some backstitching would have given the flowers a neat edge.\r\nGood work!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:16:35','2024-08-28 20:16:35'),(6566,'judge-event-evaluation-5824-1724840425',5824,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7321,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Hudson for your cross stitch! :-)\r\nYou have some nice even stitching and it is great that your \'x\'s are all consistently going in the right way. :-)\r\nPlease don\'t use knots to cast off - as this makes your back untidy, rather you can \"cast off\" by moving your thread straight underneath the other stitchings. So that you can get the most points, please  remember to submit your pattern with your entry.\r\nI hope you will expand and explore doing more cross stitches with more colour variations. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:20:25','2024-08-28 20:20:25'),(6567,'judge-event-evaluation-5851-1724840748',5851,137,12,14,2,2024,155,'373',NULL,7323,4451,8425,70,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Kayla.  Love the choice of colours and I think the change of colour has added a bit of a rustic country look to him.  Stitches are very even and well tensioned.  It doesn\'t have alot of different kinds of stitches so I had to mark that down.  Other than that the only area for improvement I could comment on is getting your stitching of the pieces together a little tidier, that is hard to get seamless & invisible and really just comes with practice.   I look forward to seeing the next project.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:25:48','2024-08-28 20:25:48'),(6568,'judge-event-evaluation-5100-1724840756',5100,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7322,4451,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'I like the fact that you have linked your font colour to your message relating to the golden rule.  Your three different font styles harmonize well together too.\r\nPossibly in future you could try to experiment with different images to create further levels of difficulty.  I would have also liked to hear how you created the gold dots at either corner of your poster and the golden leaves.\r\nGenerally this is well though out with a pleasing message to boot.\r\nWell done Braden!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:25:56','2024-08-28 20:25:56'),(6569,'judge-event-evaluation-5935-1724840769',5935,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7329,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,75.00,-10,NULL,'Your work on this is beautiful!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the instructions and picture that would have been in the kit. Because of this, only one mark could be awarded based on your report that states that you made an alteration.\r\nPlease be careful to keep the back of your work neat. Your French knots are very well done.\r\nThe thing that stands out for me is the purple line that you have done on the frame - it makes this embroidery come alive!\r\nStunning work!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:26:09','2024-08-28 20:26:09'),(6570,'judge-event-evaluation-15020-1724841089',15020,137,12,14,2,2024,18,'060','1',0,4451,5,9,'Collection','3',100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Great job,  very interesting to read.  It would be a great idea to ask someone to proof read for you to avoid spelling mistakes. This would make it smoother for your reader. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:31:29','2024-08-28 20:31:29'),(6572,'judge-event-evaluation-5082-1724841199',5082,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7576,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thanks for your efforts Jacob, good message! And the text stands out well! Please remember that you need to attribute your images (list the actual source that it comes from). This is a good practice generally when using other\'s work within yours. Unless you took the picture yourself, but then you need to list that. Also, it would be good to see some more elements in the image, rather than just some text on an image.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:33:19','2024-08-28 20:33:19'),(6573,'judge-event-evaluation-5874-1724841287',5874,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7328,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Luke for your cross stitch! :-)\r\nYou show great potential with your cross stitch. Make sure your work is centred in the frame. Please submit a print of your pattern, so that you can gain all the points possible.\r\nThe lower part has a lot of long brown stitches - it would be tidier if you went underneath the green thread.\r\nKeep developing your skills! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:34:47','2024-08-28 20:34:47'),(6576,'judge-event-evaluation-5043-1724841421',5043,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7317,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thanks for your efforts Laura, great verse. One of my favourites, and a great picture to represent it. Please remember that you need to attribute your images (list the actual source that it comes from). This is a good practice generally when using other\'s work within yours. Unless you took the picture yourself, but then you need to list that. Also, it would be good to see some more elements in the image, rather than just some text on an image.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:37:01','2024-08-28 20:37:01'),(6577,'judge-event-evaluation-5875-1724841500',5875,137,12,14,2,2024,131,'323',NULL,7328,4451,8425,70,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Luke.  Your change to the muzzle and adding a collar,  adds your own piece of creative flare to the project.   I had to mark you down a little on the variety of stitches, most stitches are the same.  Your tension  & uniformity with the basic stitches is great.  I encourage you to stretch yourself in the next project and learn a few different stitches.  You\'ve done a good job of stitching the pieces together.  My only comment on the finishing would be, be careful you don\'t overstuff it.  The head at the back is a little stretched and you can see the stuffing showing through.  I took a few points off for overall beauty because I feel his front legs are a little small in proportion to the rest of his body (but that\'s just my opinion).  Hope you\'re keen to do some more crochet, I think you\'d be good at it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:38:20','2024-08-28 20:38:20'),(6579,'judge-event-evaluation-5643-1724841611',5643,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7806,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,56.00,-10,NULL,'You have added some nice texture to your wharf and your sand, also you have started to show pockets of different types of vegetation on the far hills.  Aerial perspective moving into distance can be tricky and I believe that you have started to get a bit of that perspective.  You started building your light on the water from the sun.  Some smudging on your place appears to overlap the fuselage of the plane.  I can see you have attempted to use shadow in your hills to depict the lights and darks.  Overall our light direction is confused and seems to be coming from several different places.  In your source of information you could have put more than just from my head e.g.  I thought about what to do and thought I would like to draw a plane going over water and hills with the sun rising and reflecting on the water to a beach.  If you referred to a plane to get your proportions and dimensions correct then you needed to put the source in.  Also in your write up you need to write the steps and what pencils you used and how you applied them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:40:11','2024-08-28 20:40:11'),(6580,'judge-event-evaluation-6300-1724842167',6300,175,12,14,2,2024,135,'350',NULL,7897,6097,6,57,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Zachariah. Keep up the great craftwork. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:49:27','2024-08-28 20:49:27'),(6581,'judge-event-evaluation-5686-1724842446',5686,137,12,14,2,2024,190,'502',NULL,7887,4451,8425,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Isaac.  Your dog is very friendly and happy looking.  I encourage you to check out some acrylic painting tutorials online to help you learn some new techniques to bring out the finer details in the dog and to give some shadowing and highs and lows to make him more 3 dimensional.  Would have been good to put another layer on the grass area to make sure you can\'t see the white canvas through the paint.  Maybe add a few more shades or colours to make the grass more detailed and life like.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:54:06','2024-08-28 20:54:06'),(6583,'judge-event-evaluation-12345-1724842617',12345,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7806,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,54.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely colours!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include your initial drawings or a photo of the sushi that you were attempting to represent in your cross-stitch. Because these were not submitted, marks could not be awarded for planning or following a pattern.\r\nPlease be careful to only work with clean hands, and keep your work in a bag when not working on it. When completed, your work needs to be washed before framing.\r\nRemember when doing cross-stitch that each stitch must be completed in the same direction. Backstitching would help to enhance your design.\r\nThere should be no knots on the back of your work. Ends should be threaded under the back of several stitches, then a small back stitch completed invisibly on the back of the work.\r\nI look forward to seeing another cross-stitch from you next year!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:56:57','2024-08-28 20:56:57'),(6585,'judge-event-evaluation-5070-1724842737',5070,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7326,4451,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'I like the way you have linked your Bible verse with the background picture you have chosen.  It is certainly a spectacular picture of the parting sea!  Unfortunately this picture is pixelated which, if you check your guidelines for posters, is not acceptable. \r\nIn future you may want to create some more layers of difficulty by using different fonts, sizes and colours.  The particular colour, size and style that you have chosen doesn\'t stand out.\r\nI particularly like this verse from Psalms, Chris.  We have an amazing God, don\'t we! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 20:58:57','2024-08-29 10:03:42'),(6586,'judge-event-evaluation-5991-1724842820',5991,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7579,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,95,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Xavier for your entry. :-)\r\n Unfortunately, there is very little cross stitch in your entry. :-( Also, for cross stitch you are not allowed to use a printed print on the canvas. (See MA.19. of the guidelines.) For the \'x\' you do have try and aim for them to be as even as possible.\r\nTry and make your back as tidy as possible, so that it looks as closely as possible to the front.\r\nPerhaps explore doing a \'Needle Point / Long Stitch\' entry as well next year. Keep developing your skills in this area. ;-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:00:20','2024-08-29 23:54:21'),(6587,'judge-event-evaluation-5805-1724843031',5805,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7572,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,44.00,-10,NULL,'Hoani, It is good to see you have an interest and like to draw about it.  I like the way you have created a stand for your shoe and you have just about achieved a 3 D block structure. You have attempted to do shading.  You have tried some different patterns on your glove.  It would be great to see you explore how you could create more textures and shading in your art work to make your subject pop out. n Your documentation is too brief.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:03:51','2024-08-28 21:03:51'),(6588,'judge-event-evaluation-5734-1724843493',5734,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7324,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,74.00,-10,NULL,'Good choice of colours for the stitching!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include the pattern so that your changes could be seen. Because this was not submitted, marks could not be awarded for planning or following a pattern.\r\nPlease be careful to only work with clean hands, and keep your work in a bag when not working on it. When completed, your work needs to be washed before framing.\r\nRemember when doing cross-stitch that each stitch must be completed in the same direction.\r\nBackstitching would help to enhance your design.\r\nIf you use a firmer card for your matt it would be less likely to buckle.\r\nWell done for your very neat back - you have finished your ends correctly.\r\nGood work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:11:33','2024-08-28 21:11:33'),(6590,'judge-event-evaluation-5081-1724843715',5081,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7321,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'Thanks for your efforts Hudson, I like the extra elements, but it would be good to see more, rather than text on an image and done. Also, have a think about how the picture connects with the verse - this is ok, but maybe there is something that represents the verse better?\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:15:15','2024-08-28 21:15:15'),(6591,'judge-event-evaluation-5055-1724844259',5055,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7329,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your efforts Sofia. Good verse, and I like the picture. However, it is a lot of text, and does not have something that pulls you in. Perhaps you could have made \"The LORD is His name\" bgger, bolder, and made the rest of the text more subtle - you want people to at a glance want to come closer and see more. At the moment, a big chunk of text is not going to grab them.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:24:19','2024-08-28 21:24:19'),(6592,'judge-event-evaluation-6497-1724845563',6497,175,12,14,2,2024,116,'306',NULL,7894,6097,6,62,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kyan. A suggestion for future entries. Please refer to the guidelines if you\'re unsure about documents that are required with the entry. Other than that, well done, keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:46:03','2024-08-28 21:46:03'),(6593,'judge-event-evaluation-5698-1724846231',5698,137,12,14,2,2024,139,'354',NULL,7322,4451,6,61,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Braden. Keep up the great work. A suggestion for future entries. Shaping the frame from the beginning would show the overall look of the craft after wrapping in wire. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 21:57:11','2024-08-28 21:57:11'),(6594,'judge-event-evaluation-5978-1724847539',5978,137,12,14,2,2024,141,'357',NULL,7325,4451,6,63,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Vinni. Just a suggestion, the ends of the handle were sharp which could end up being a safety hazard. Suggestion would be to fold side ends which would be flushed with the handle. Well done, keep the great work, and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 22:18:59','2024-08-28 22:18:59'),(6601,'judge-event-evaluation-5733-1724850301',5733,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7324,4451,6,63,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Charlie. Just a couple of things. The end sides of the handle wasn\'t bent which could be a safety hazard for example, if the tool box tilted on an angle, it could slide and injured the person holding the tool box. Suggestion would be to smooth the edges along with the outside corners which was quite sharp. Using the guidelines would help for future entries. Other than that, well done, keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 23:05:01','2024-08-28 23:05:01'),(6604,'judge-event-evaluation-5989-1724850847',5989,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7579,4451,6,63,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Xavier. Just a couple of things. For future entries, please provide the Plan for your Sheet Metalwork. The corners were quite sharp and needed to be smoothed out. Well done with keeping the handle flushed smooth all the way to the edges. Using the guidelines would help for future entries. Other than that, well done, keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 23:14:07','2024-08-28 23:14:07'),(6605,'judge-event-evaluation-5822-1724850880',5822,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7321,4451,6,63,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Hudson. Just a couple of things. Three of the corners were quite sharp and needed to be smoothed. Using the guidelines would help for future entries. Other than that, well done, keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 23:14:40','2024-08-28 23:14:40'),(6606,'judge-event-evaluation-5723-1724850942',5723,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7577,4451,6,63,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Callum. Just a couple of things. The were little gaps on the outside corner which probably needed to be flush and smoothed out as it was quite sharp. Using the guidelines would help for future entries. Other than that, well done, keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-28 23:15:42','2024-08-28 23:15:42'),(6607,'judge-event-evaluation-6260-1724873705',6260,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7902,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'This is a great photo that you have chosen, Elijah, and good that you were able to find it within your own stock of photos.  A mountain path is very relevant to the verse that you have chosen here.  The arrow that you have used has added a degree of difficulty.  The fact that you have varied your font, type, size, and colour, has also added interest to your poster.\r\nI wondered whether the words could have lead up the mountain rather than down although I understand that this could possibly have made it difficult to fit them on the path.  Your darker font at the bottom has made it a little more difficult to read.  You need to be more careful with your proof reading as \"Psalm\" is missing an \"a\" at the bottom.\r\nOver all an effective poster with a poignant message.  Well done Elijah.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 05:35:05','2024-08-29 05:35:05'),(6611,'judge-event-evaluation-5700-1724880655',5700,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7322,4451,8425,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Braden.  Love the colours of the butterfly.  The bush is not clearly defined as separate to the background.  Maybe using a few different colours and some more shading to help highlight the bush.  Have a look at a bush, they are not all green, you\'ll see a lot of browns, blacks, yellows & whites even .  Adding some of these colours will give a more 3 dimensional look.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:30:55','2024-08-29 07:30:55'),(6612,'judge-event-evaluation-6488-1724880882',6488,175,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7894,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Kyan, great verse! And it\'s great you took your own photo, shows some effort taken! Just make sure that you print it high enough quality - this has lost uite a bit of definition. Also, you need to have one things that grabs the viewer - this has a few that are slightly confusing as it is not consistent parts of the verse that have the font change.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:34:42','2024-08-29 07:34:42'),(6613,'judge-event-evaluation-6224-1724880890',6224,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7901,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'You have chosen an excellent verse here, Grace.  Your colour and contrast work nicely together also.\r\nIn future it would be great to see you choose a piece of art work or photo for your background to increase the difficulty and to make it a little more interesting.  It would have been good to hear how you linked the hands to the verse you have chosen as well.\r\nOverall a pleasing result that stands out.  Well done Grace.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:34:50','2024-08-29 07:34:50'),(6615,'judge-event-evaluation-5765-1724881186',5765,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7326,4451,8425,17,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful squid, Chris.  I love the eye especially.  The highlights and shading make it feel like you are being watched.  Excellent effort.   My only comment is you could have developed the background a bit.  Rather than just a plain black you could have added something to make it feel like it is in the water.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:39:46','2024-08-29 07:39:46'),(6616,'judge-event-evaluation-5670-1724881297',5670,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7885,4451,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'This is a great start to sketching and stepping point to many other areas of visual art.  You have created movement in the tail end by the directionality you have used your pencil.  There is some light coming through and the whale appears to be swimming up to the light. You have created some textural effects, there are many other textural effects.  Look up textural effects online and practice these as they will be a way you can take your drawing to higher levels.  Watch for finger prints on your pencil work.  What grade pencil did you use?  Experiment with a variety of pencils.  Keep up the sketching, I look forward to seeing your work next year!   The blue surround of your frame gives it more of an ocean look.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:41:37','2024-08-29 07:41:37'),(6619,'judge-event-evaluation-5852-1724881661',5852,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7323,4451,8425,17,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'A nice piece Kayla.  You\'ve used light and colour well.  Your eye is really drawn to the sunset.  Love the colours you\'ve used. Nice technique getting the flowers to fade into the background.  Frame really compliments the picture.  Only improvement I could suggest is building a bit more depth into your grass, but that might just be my opinion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:47:41','2024-08-29 07:47:41'),(6620,'judge-event-evaluation-5687-1724881717',5687,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7887,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'This is a really cute pencil sketch.  I love the smiling face of the dog.  He looks very happy.  The ears appear different in shape and could be worked on.  You could create more textural effects. This would enhance your work. a lot more. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:48:37','2024-08-29 07:48:37'),(6624,'judge-event-evaluation-14542-1724881991',14542,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','5',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Hoani, What a cool look into the life of John the Baptist! \r\nSome comments on Graphic Design - Try to make sure that your text does not get obscured by your background. You can do this through a variety of methods; place the text on a clear part of the background. Add a fill to the text box but with an amount of transparency. Also try not to have a single word left on its own line of text i.e. \"decrease\" on slide four. either extend the textbox, or shrink it so the lines are more similar lengths. \r\nAlso, next time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nNice work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:53:11','2024-08-29 07:53:11'),(6625,'judge-event-evaluation-14543-1724882009',14543,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','4',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Charlie, Thanks for a great look into what a chameleon is. \r\nI really liked the flow of your presentation. The animation of the single letter text could have been a little faster for easier reading, but overall the timing of the transitions was great. \r\nOne small thing, try to keep your line spacing consistent especially within a single slide. (see slide 6 where the top text box had different formatting to the lower text box.)\r\nAlso, next time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nGreat work. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:53:29','2024-08-29 07:53:29'),(6626,'judge-event-evaluation-14544-1724882032',14544,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','7',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Hey Sophie, thanks for this lovely presentation on donkeys. You have a great eye for designing and arranging what you needed on each slide. \r\nSometimes the slides transitioned too quickly for a first time reader to read it all before it disappeared. A good guide for this is to allow enough time for someone who is familiar with the text (such as yourself, the author) to read each bit of content twice before moving on. \r\nWatch out for capitalisation and spelling errors. \r\nAlso, next time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nGreat work. I hope to see more from you in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:53:52','2024-08-29 07:53:52'),(6627,'judge-event-evaluation-14546-1724882047',14546,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','8',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Xavier, thanks for such an informative powerpoint about lions. I honestly did not know that there were over 150 mentions of lions in the Bible! A few thoughts:\r\nSometimes the colour of your text started to get a bit close to the colour of the background. Although I was able to read everything, it might become difficult for someone to read those spots if they have colourblindness or some other visual difficulty. It is always good to do your best and make things as accessible to anyone who might be reading your work. \r\nBe aware of the spacing around the sides of the text. It is usually good practice to have a relatively consistent visual border around the edges of each slide. \r\nAlso, next time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nGreat work. God bless ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:54:07','2024-08-29 07:54:07'),(6628,'judge-event-evaluation-5752-1724882050',5752,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7331,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'A lot of thought and effort has gone into this drawing.  The atmosphere you have created with the weeping willow and the posture of the girl and the birds flying into the light speaks volumes.  The tree should get darker on the right side of the frame.  Keep working on your technique. You have written an excellent report.  Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:54:10','2024-08-29 07:54:10'),(6630,'judge-event-evaluation-12302-1724882288',12302,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7325,4451,8425,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Nice piece Vinni.  You\'ve done a great job of getting the feathers to look 3 dimensional.  I love the grass effect especially in the area just behind the legs.  If you use a pencil to outline the picture make sure you do it very lightly.  Your lines were a bit dark and show through the pastel when you hold the picture on certain angles. You could also work on getting your eye looking more realistic.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 07:58:08','2024-08-29 07:58:08'),(6631,'judge-event-evaluation-14541-1724882415',14541,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','3',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Callum, This is a really cool idea to break down the ten commandments. \r\nI would have loved to see more bullet points for each of the commandments to show how much you know about all of them. (BTW You only had nine slides for individual commandments, so you seem to have missed one of the ten...) Try to not place text in a place that it is obscured by the background graphic. The animations were well thought out.\r\nAlso, next time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nGreat work and God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:00:15','2024-08-29 08:00:15'),(6632,'judge-event-evaluation-5056-1724882607',5056,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7573,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for wanting to enter posters Sophie. Unfortunately, you must submit your own work - deleting the background from someone else\'s poster and putting it on a new background is not enough*. In the professional space, this would potentially be a breach of copyright. It is a useful skill to learn to remove backgrounds, but it does take attention to detail, see the white inside of the loops.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!\r\n\r\n*https://shorturl.at/ZfVDz - link to a version of the original artwork from a quick search.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:03:27','2024-08-29 10:03:32'),(6633,'judge-event-evaluation-5939-1724882647',5939,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7329,4451,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Your daffodils stand out and catch the eye of the viewer, well done.  Try and fill your report out fully.  You did not list the source of your ideas.  Also in your step by step procedure be a little fuller in your description stating which pencil you used for each area of your work and how you applied your pencil e.g cross hatching, short lines, long lines, stippling etc.  The lines you have used in your daffodils work really well.  I am not completely convinced of where the light comes from and where the shadows fall.  This is an area you can work on.   Keep up your sketching as you definitely have an eye for proportion.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:04:07','2024-08-29 08:04:07'),(6634,'judge-event-evaluation-14545-1724882751',14545,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','2',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Luke and Oliver, Fantastic work on this powerpoint presentation. I really liked the animations you made with the farmer. I would have liked to have seen a snapshot back to the animations when you were explaining the parable at the end. This could have been broken up into a few slides with a side-by-side comparison of the parable to the explanation. \r\nNext time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nGreat work. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:05:51','2024-08-29 08:05:51'),(6635,'judge-event-evaluation-5051-1724882999',5051,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7575,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Paige! A great verse, and a nice simple message!\r\nPlease remember that a poster needs to grab the viewer instantly and make them want to stop and read the whole poster. With yours, it is good fonts, but the bit that \'grabs\' you most is the reference - not the instant message or grabbing point that you want to make.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:09:59','2024-08-29 08:09:59'),(6636,'judge-event-evaluation-5713-1724883076',5713,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7580,4451,8321,53,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'What an interesting and colourful piece of artwork! You have done a lovely job and I can see a lot of thought and effort has been put into your piece. I love that there a multiple directions the art draws the eye, and it does create a confusion affect, as your description suggests.  Unfortunately, the car and roof of one of the house gets lost in the background. Perhaps using brighter colours in these areas would have changed this. Overall, you have done a great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:11:16','2024-08-29 08:11:16'),(6637,'judge-event-evaluation-4972-1724883085',4972,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','1',0,4451,7459,4,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hudson and Brooklyn, \r\nThanks for this powerpoint presentation. I would have loved to see some more context around Samson - how did he get his strength from God? Why do you think he kept the truth from Delilah? What did the Philistines have to gain from exploiting Delilah to get to Samson?\r\nNext time please remember to export your powerpoint to a slide show presentation file to make it easier for the judges to access it.\r\nOverall this is a great start of a presentation and I hope to see you develop and expand your abilities in this area in the future. God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:11:25','2024-08-29 08:11:25'),(6638,'judge-event-evaluation-5792-1724883103',5792,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7318,4451,8321,53,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I love George the Lizard, he is very sweet. He has nice complementary colours and a friendly look to him. He does seem to get a bit lost amongst the backing paper of green... Maybe he is supposed to be a bit camouflaged? If so, good job. If not, you may need to think a bit carefully about the colour of the background next time. Overall, nice work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:11:43','2024-08-29 08:11:43'),(6639,'judge-event-evaluation-5711-1724883146',5711,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7580,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Nice effort Brooke.  Unusual choice of subject but I love it.  You\'ve done a great job of the white.  The bubbles and mouth area are realistic.  Your foreground water is too smooth.  The background has a wavey look but would have been nice to see a bit more splash or ripple in the foreground too.  A fish that big would cause some movement.  The dark of the sharks head could have been contrasted a little more to make it stand out from the water.  Overall a nice piece.  Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:12:26','2024-08-29 08:12:26'),(6641,'judge-event-evaluation-5864-1724883367',5864,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7317,4451,8321,53,'Collection',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'What a lovely bunny! Your use of browns to bring depth and greys/whites to bring structure to the picture were great choices. The subtle metallic silver you used brings some life to the artwork, and complements the use of the pink tones to bring some realism and softness to your art. \r\nThe decision to place the bunny to the side and off centre, gives him a cuter, more vulnerable edge, and I like him more because of it. The choice of a muted pink backing is also helping to highlight some of the rabbits softer features. Some triangles looked slightly out of place and the outline of pencil too harsh in some areas, however with the level of difficulty of this artwork you have done an excellent job. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:16:07','2024-08-29 08:16:07'),(6642,'judge-event-evaluation-5941-1724883407',5941,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7329,4451,8321,53,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'What a beautiful scene you have painted. I can see the vision you had for this piece and you have made a great effort in execution of it. I love the realistic mix of colours you have used and the use of a central circle to draw the eye into focus whilst also bringing a whole lot of interest with different layers of shapes etc. \r\nSome bleeding of paint into areas and smudging however paint can be difficult to work with. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:16:47','2024-08-29 08:16:47'),(6643,'judge-event-evaluation-5953-1724883443',5953,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7573,4451,8321,53,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'What a beautiful geometric piece of artwork you have created! I love the use of multiple colours to bring a cheerful feel. It reminds me of a circus. Bright and a fun place to be. \r\nYou have done well keeping your colours uniform and in their place. \r\nNext time, I would love to see you branching out into something more realistic or something that can tell more of a story that the observer can relate to. Excellent work and great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:17:23','2024-08-29 08:17:23'),(6644,'judge-event-evaluation-5700-1724883505',5700,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7322,4451,8321,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'You have created a lovely setting with appropriate use of beautiful, complementary colours and balanced proportions. \r\nSome smudging, however use of laying in some areas has provided great depth. Source of light being the top right hand corner wasn\'t distinguishable and lack of shadow in the right areas meant there wasn\'t a real anchor point in the picture. Overall though, a really great effort and a good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:18:25','2024-08-29 08:18:25'),(6646,'judge-event-evaluation-5765-1724883583',5765,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7326,4451,8321,17,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'I love the inky dark setting you have created for your subject, the squid. Very appropriate for a subject such as the one you have used. Although there did not appear to be a distinguishable source of light ( I have marked you down for this), however, it is also appropriate for there to not be a source of light, since squids dwell in dark sea depths.  He is a very interesting squid to look at... a great use of colours, technique and application has been used to create texture and interest to your squid. Overall, I enjoyed your piece and feel you have done a great job!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:19:43','2024-08-29 08:19:43'),(6647,'judge-event-evaluation-5025-1724883600',5025,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7577,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Callum. Great combination - I like the contrast of God made light vs. man made light (not sure if you saw that). I like what you were trying to do with the Cross, but I\'m not sure if is clear enough. I think the brain reads it OK, but it doesn\'t quite look right - maybe it is the orientation or position.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:20:00','2024-08-29 08:20:00'),(6649,'judge-event-evaluation-4972-1724883670',4972,137,12,14,2,2024,170,'414','1',0,4451,7479,4,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:21:10','2024-08-29 08:21:10'),(6653,'judge-event-evaluation-15329-1724883887',15329,175,12,14,2,2024,344,'1057','2',0,6097,6,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'5.5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:24:47','2024-08-29 08:24:47'),(6654,'judge-event-evaluation-12586-1724883897',12586,137,12,14,2,2024,344,'1057','1',0,4451,6,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'8.5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:24:57','2024-08-29 08:24:57'),(6656,'judge-event-evaluation-15328-1724883963',15328,175,12,14,2,2024,344,'1057','3',0,6097,6,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'5',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:26:03','2024-08-29 08:26:03'),(6657,'judge-event-evaluation-5790-1724883996',5790,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7318,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Love the head area where you\'ve put the pink circles to create that 3-dimensional look.  I feel you needed to carry that on more, especially to the tentacles.  They are a bit flat compared to the head.  Eyes are good but could be made more realistic with some highlights.  Creating a background that gives some context to his habitat rather than just plain black would also bring the picture alive more.  Good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:26:36','2024-08-29 08:26:36'),(6659,'judge-event-evaluation-5026-1724884094',5026,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7324,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Great job Charlie, love it. Excellent choice of picture and supporting elements. I am not sure that the verse entirely matches the picture (maybe one about God being like a lion - Hosea 11:10 perhaps). However, it blends well, draws the eye in, and the font choice works. Exactly what we are looking for in a poster!\r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:28:14','2024-08-29 08:28:14'),(6661,'judge-event-evaluation-5640-1724884276',5640,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7806,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Brooklyn for your Nature photo! :-) \r\nIt is good to see that you have cropped your final image. For your next photo, try and get your main subject bigger, as a lot of the photo is of a tree and we want to have good composition - rules of thirds.\r\nAlso, make sure your label is in the top left corner, as this shows us which way the photo is supposed to be too. ;-)\r\nKeep developing your photography skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:31:16','2024-08-29 08:31:16'),(6662,'judge-event-evaluation-5814-1724884410',5814,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7316,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Love the colours Holly.  I am a little confused whether the dark blue is sky or water.  Your light blue seems like water with rocks which almost makes the seal look like he is jumping but seals don\'t jump.  A nice use of light on his neck area and on the rocks to give 3 dimensional look.  Maybe check out a few you-tube tutorials on how to get a more realistic look on the body.  Great effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:33:30','2024-08-29 08:33:30'),(6663,'judge-event-evaluation-12338-1724884478',12338,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7572,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,41.00,-10,NULL,'You have chosen good colours for your rose!\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include your initial drawings or a photo of the image that you found online. Because these were not submitted, marks could not be awarded for planning or following a pattern.\r\nWhen completed, your work needs to be washed before framing. This would also help erase the pencil marks which should not be visible on your finished work.\r\nRemember when doing cross-stitch that each stitch must be completed in the same direction. A significant amount of this work was not cross-stitch. \r\nBackstitching would help to enhance your design.\r\nThere should be no knots on the back of your work. Ends should be threaded under the back of several stitches, then a small back stitch completed invisibly on the back of the work.\r\nA good first attempt at cross-stitch! Keep stitching!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:34:38','2024-08-29 08:34:38'),(6665,'judge-event-evaluation-15019-1724884637',15019,137,12,14,2,2024,18,'060','2',0,4451,5,9,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done, thank you for your entry. For social studies I would love to see more about the people of Australia, who they are and what they do. This was a great overview of the geography of Australia. \r\nIt\'s always a good idea to have someone proof read for you to avoid spelling mistakes. Also make sure you include references for your information, I unfortunately couldn\'t give any marks for that. \r\n\r\nI hope to see more from you in the future! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:37:17','2024-08-29 08:37:17'),(6666,'judge-event-evaluation-5724-1724884710',5724,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7577,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Callum for your Nature photo! :-)\r\nTry and make your main overall subject clearer as to what it is.\r\nKeep developing your photography skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:38:30','2024-08-29 08:38:30'),(6669,'judge-event-evaluation-5863-1724884985',5863,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7317,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Love the birds eye; you\'ve got it looking quite real.  I encourage you to check out some you-tube art tutorials on how to get things looking more 3D and life-like.  You\'ve done blue sky, green trees and a brown branch but if you really look at nature you\'ll find there are a lot more colours involved in the sky, trees & branches etc.  A good rule of thumb, if you\'re copying off a photo or picture \"draw what you actually see, not what you think you see\"  ie where are the lights and darks, what colours are they actually etc.  I\'ve also had to mark you down on the pencil highlighting, you should be using pastels to create that contrast.  Overall a very happy picture to look at.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:43:05','2024-08-29 08:43:05'),(6670,'judge-event-evaluation-5852-1724884997',5852,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7323,4451,8321,17,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'What a lovely scene you have created! Your use of calm, complementary colour and blended textures has resulted in a picture that relaxes and draws the observer in. I love the rustic feel the frame adds and the sense of nostalgia the art evokes. You have done a great job with the lighting and shadow on the horizon to add depth.  I think I would of liked to have seen a more detailed foreground  e.g crisper flowers, clearer texture of the grass and more strategic placement of shadow before blending towards the horizon. Perhaps using lighter pencil outline next time, so it doesnt show through could be something to try. \r\nOverall, I love it & think you have done an awesome job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:43:17','2024-08-29 08:43:17'),(6671,'judge-event-evaluation-5735-1724885177',5735,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7324,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Charlie for your Nature photo! \r\nI loved reading your detailed report on how you captured this photo! :-)\r\nFor your next photo work on your rules of thirds (Composition) as there is a lot of wasted space on the bottom left corner of the print. Also, work on getting good focus on your main flower.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:46:17','2024-08-29 08:46:17'),(6672,'judge-event-evaluation-5750-1724885516',5750,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7331,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Chloe for your photo! \r\nI liked how you really described how you captured your photo in the report - well done!\r\nAs you are taking the photo, make sure that the centre of the flower is in focus.\r\nKeep developing your skills. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:51:56','2024-08-29 08:51:56'),(6673,'judge-event-evaluation-5877-1724885517',5877,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7328,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Love the bright yellow and black.  A good choice of subject.  You need to work on making it look more realistic.  You-Tube tutorials are a great way to pick up tips for free. Is the black dot on the head an eye.  Adding a bit of white to create light reflection would make it more realistic.  Love the different colours you\'ve used on the rock.  A few more dark colours to add shadowing would make the rock more realistic and round looking.  Try and develop the background areas to give context to where the frog is rather than just colouring green.  A good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:51:57','2024-08-29 08:51:57'),(6675,'judge-event-evaluation-6225-1724885642',6225,175,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7901,6097,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,50.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Grace, great to see you starting to experiment with water colour!  I can see that you have explored the colours and started to look at some blending.  One technique that is used in water colour is to leave white spaces where you apply no paint.  In the sky also if you want to create cloud forms you can leave white spaces.  Make sure your horizon line is crisp by using a ruler and fine paint brush. In the ocean your horizon line will be darker.  I encourage you to look you tube videos on painting oceans and skies in watercolour. Remember to take the glass out of your frame as this is a safety hazard.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:54:02','2024-08-29 08:54:02'),(6676,'judge-event-evaluation-6373-1724885668',6373,175,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7898,6097,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Heidi, I like the way you have shown your light to dark in your watercolour and that you have some waves coming into the fore shore. The perspective appears to be looking along the bay from the foreshore.  I am not sure if you were actually creating a wave form in the darker area.  Look up creating waves in water colour on a you tube video and it may give you some good ideas and direction as to how you can form waves.  I like the way you have played with your water colours. The red frame you chose brings out the colours in the sky. and you have definite potential as a water colour artist.  Name the water brush sizes you used in your report.  I can not see the volley ball and the sun umbrella that was mentioned in your report but the finished picture would have been awesome to see. Remember to take the glass out of your frame as this is a safety hazard.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:54:28','2024-08-29 08:54:28'),(6677,'judge-event-evaluation-6208-1724885691',6208,175,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7900,6097,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Peyton, looks like you had a lot of fun with your water colour.  I like the way you have blended your green and blue in the ocean.  Make sure your horizon line is crisp by using a fine brush. State the brushes you use and the size of them.  Your skyline shows movement in it and I can see you have attempted to leave a few lighter spaces.\r\nWater colour is not an easy media and can take a bit to master so keep on practicing and look up you tube tutorials you will learn a lot.  I look forward to seeing what you do next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:54:51','2024-08-29 08:54:51'),(6678,'judge-event-evaluation-12302-1724885777',12302,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7325,4451,8321,17,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'What a handsome looking Ostrich you have created! He has a lovely amount of texture to him and realistic colour tones, which help to bring him to life. You have layered your pastels well to bring depth and interest to your piece. \r\nThe source of light is hard to distinguish, however I feel there is possibly a source coming from the top right and the head is highlighted. In future,  adding a light source and using lighter colour and shadow to show this, would make a huge difference to your artwork. Overall, you have put in a great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 08:56:17','2024-08-29 08:56:17'),(6679,'judge-event-evaluation-5900-1724886023',5900,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7575,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Paige.  You have used every area of the picture to develop a full scene that gives context to your fish.  With the background you\'ve used colour to create some dimension and perspective.  This could be developed a lot more with the use of lights especially, but also dark highlights to really give the realistic 3D look.  Would have been nice to see some scales and texture on your fish and a use of highlights to create a realistic eye.  There\'s some great tutorials of  \'how to draw\' on You-Tube if you\'d like to develop your art more.  From this picture I think you have the potential to be a great artist.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:00:23','2024-08-29 09:00:23'),(6680,'judge-event-evaluation-5788-1724886034',5788,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7318,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Grace for your photo!\r\nI think you could have cropped your photo more - so that your main subject is bigger.\r\nThanks for your step-by-step process on what you did to create this photo.\r\nKeep developing your skills. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:00:34','2024-08-29 09:00:34'),(6681,'judge-event-evaluation-15331-1724886236',15331,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7885,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Indy. Great verse, but not sure that it really relates to the picture well. You want something that grabs the viewer instantly, and makes them want to come and look more into it. You can also do this by emphasising particular words in the verse.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:03:56','2024-08-29 09:03:56'),(6682,'judge-event-evaluation-5803-1724886323',5803,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7572,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Hoani for your your photo!\r\nIt is good to see that you cropped the photo - thanks for providing the proof print.\r\nMake sure your subject is in focus and check the rules of thirds (composition). \r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:05:23','2024-08-29 09:05:23'),(6683,'judge-event-evaluation-5928-1724886484',5928,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7327,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'The highlight of this picture, for me, is the branch.  Great job with getting it looking very rounded.  Love the background.  It\'s muted and not obvious but it does give the impression of leaves and forestry and I love the way you\'ve used different colours not just green.  The bird has good shape and outlines, love the bright colours but you need to work on creating some texture and highlights etc.  The wings blend into the body and are not obvious.  You\'ve got a little bit of texture coming out in one of the orange patches on the belly but nothing that really looks like feathers.  To get the feather effect on black you need to do it with lighter colours.  Have a look online how to get a realistic feather effect and do an eye that\'s realistic too, to bring your picture to life more.  Overall a nice effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:08:04','2024-08-29 09:08:04'),(6684,'judge-event-evaluation-5086-1724886529',5086,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7328,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Good effort James, thank you! Great verse, and the heart really stands out! I\'m not sure your colour palate works, but that may be because the text runs onto the blue swirlies. Maybe try and have the text solely on the heart, and see how that goes.\r\n\r\nKeep up the great work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:08:49','2024-08-29 09:08:49'),(6685,'judge-event-evaluation-5810-1724886598',5810,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7316,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Holly for your photo! :-)\r\nI am glad to see that you noticed the distracting elements and cropped these out.\r\nI would have loved the photo to be showing maybe only a couple of the oranges - that would make it super clear which were your main subject.\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:09:58','2024-08-29 09:09:58'),(6686,'judge-event-evaluation-5699-1724886690',5699,137,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7322,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Wow!  What an awesome effort Braden!  There is definitely an oriental feel to this water colour. I like the way that you have done a wet on wet technique for your art work.  This technique is often unpredictable but you can get some interesting results.  Keep practicing this technique until you have mastered it.  There is some light on your building and shadow but the directionality of light in the sky is not as obvious.  Have a distinct line where the water meets the sky for your horizon line.  Keep playing with your cloud formations you are starting to get some good effects.  There are different textures displayed.  How could you show more light in your trees where the light is hitting.  Be bolder in your lighter strokes you use across to define the water.  It is good to see that your reflection is darker than the top where there is more light.  Stirlling job!!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:11:30','2024-08-29 09:11:30'),(6687,'judge-event-evaluation-5825-1724886928',5825,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7321,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Hudson for your entry.\r\nSadly, I could not award any points as your photo is out of focused. :-(\r\n\r\nI really hope that you will give this category another go and develop your skills from here. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:15:28','2024-08-29 23:54:32'),(6688,'judge-event-evaluation-5096-1724886967',5096,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7579,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for our effort Xavier (cool name BTW). I like that you have chosen the different elements here. It would be good to have the tet stand out a bit more, and I am not sre that the picture conveys the same message as the verse.\r\nKeep practicing mate, you\'re on your way! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:16:07','2024-08-29 09:16:07'),(6689,'judge-event-evaluation-5940-1724887098',5940,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7329,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Love the body, you\'ve developed some good light & texture there.  Make sure you carry it on into the legs and head as well.  My eye is drawn to the top and back of its body and the head somehow gets a bit lost.  The head needs a bit more highlighting.  The mouth is a bit of a black hole, don\'t forget to put something in the mouth.  Your tree branch and plain black background could also be developed a lot more to add to the realness of the picture.  You-Tube tutorials are a great place to pick up a few tips for free.  If you were open to doing a bit more work on the picture I think you could take it from a nice picture to a very realistic picture.  Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:18:18','2024-08-29 09:18:18'),(6691,'judge-event-evaluation-5824-1724887143',5824,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7321,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,55.00,-10,NULL,'Well done for choosing something simple to start with.\r\nI realise that you did not use a pattern, but a screeshot of the image that you got your idea from or a sketched design would have counted as a pattern. Because these were not submitted, marks could not be awarded for planning or following a pattern, however some marks could be awarded for creativity.\r\nWhen completed, your work needs to be washed before framing.\r\nRemember when doing cross-stitch that each stitch must be completed in the same direction.\r\nThere should be no knots on the back of your work. Ends should be threaded under the back of several stitches, then a small back stitch completed invisibly on the back of the work. Your end finishing was mostly done correctly, but there were a few knots. I suspect that you started stitching with the black and as you progressed down the flag your work got neater.\r\nI look forward to seeing more stitching from you next Convention!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:19:03','2024-08-29 09:19:03'),(6692,'judge-event-evaluation-5738-1724887167',5738,137,12,14,2,2024,192,'504',NULL,7324,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'You\'ve done a great job of getting the eye and beak very realistic.  Love the texture and technique in the head area, would have been good to carry that on down into the body and especially the tail.  I feel the tail is a bit plain and flat compared to the head.  Overall a nice piece.  Love the bright colours.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:19:27','2024-08-29 09:19:27'),(6693,'judge-event-evaluation-5914-1724887203',5914,137,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7330,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Such a fun piece of art work.  I can see that you actually had a lot of fun and have explored a wet on dry technique.  You have used the colour well and have really made a great job of the eyes, the expression in the eyes and the mouth are really welcoming.  In fact many people would probably want to purchase it for their baby nursery.   There is little I can add apart from maybe too work on more defined and balanced nose areas in animals and defining mouth areas with crisper lines.  Otherwise an awesome piece of work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:20:03','2024-08-29 09:20:03'),(6695,'judge-event-evaluation-6370-1724887226',6370,175,12,14,2,2024,172,'450',NULL,7898,6097,5,2,'Open','7',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful photo! You used really great enhancements that draw you to your image. Well done. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:20:26','2024-08-29 09:20:26'),(6696,'judge-event-evaluation-5078-1724887348',5078,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7572,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Hoani, great verse. I actually think that it fits the picture, however, the colour isn\'t working for you. Sometimes a clshing or contrasting colour might work, but in this case, it ends up looking out of place, and doesn\'t inspire someone to come and look closer to your poster.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:22:28','2024-08-29 09:22:28'),(6699,'judge-event-evaluation-5668-1724887606',5668,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7885,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,53.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Indy for your photo.\r\nUnfortunately, I think your photo might fit better under \'Scape.\' I would have liked there to have been a clearer main subject.\r\nAll the best as you develop your photo skills further. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:26:46','2024-08-29 09:26:46'),(6700,'judge-event-evaluation-5067-1724887798',5067,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7887,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for youe effort Isaac, it is a very eye-catching submission! However, you need to make sure that the picture and the verse connect in some way - perhaps 1 Corinthians 9:24 would work better. Also, it would be helpful for the judges if you include more details of what you actully did/customized on the design, so that we can assess the work itself.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:29:58','2024-08-29 09:29:58'),(6702,'judge-event-evaluation-6008-1724887964',6008,137,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7733,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'I love the way you have depicted city living and nature.  Your nature picture has provided a lot more textures in contrast to the city scene.  The red in both images and blues you have used provide a unity between the two pictures.  Both show very definite perspective.   You have flooded your canvas well when using wet on dry technique and left good margins around your picture.  Buildings could be more defined, by using a very fine paint brush or sharp water colour pencils.  I like the way you have included your 3D plan of what you are doing.  Don\'t forget to add to your report what textures you applied and how you applied them.   I almost feel that your report may be focused more on the city scene. As it is an art work of contrasts it is really good to talk about how you did each contrast.  Over all an excellent effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:32:44','2024-08-29 09:32:44'),(6704,'judge-event-evaluation-5643-1724888179',5643,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7806,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'You have the beginnings of a good creative idea.  The sketch is very light and it\'s not immediately obvious what the picture is.  You need to now darken up areas and use light and dark and different shading techniques to really make the different areas of your picture stand out.  Make sure you are using a nice soft art pencil so you can smudge and blend for affect in different areas.  Looking at a few pencil drawing tutorials on You-Tube might give you some good tips on how-to.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:36:19','2024-08-29 09:36:19'),(6705,'judge-event-evaluation-5683-1724888215',5683,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7887,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Isaac for your photo!\r\nI am glad to see that you cropped the photo of distracting elements. :-)\r\nRemember to attach your name to the photo entry, so that we know it\'s yours!\r\nAlso, please stick your proof print on the back of the report.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:36:55','2024-08-29 09:36:55'),(6706,'judge-event-evaluation-5092-1724888348',5092,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7327,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Savannah, thank you for your poster! You have obviously put a lot of effort into this, however, posters are supposed to be designed digitally. It would be fine to mock up on paper, and then recreate digitally (you should even be able to get crayon/pencil effects), however, what we are assessing is your design skills and ability to manipulate the software.\r\nThis might fit better in Mixed Media (before being printed).\r\nKeep practicing! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:39:08','2024-08-29 10:02:52'),(6708,'judge-event-evaluation-5911-1724888619',5911,137,12,14,2,2024,172,'450',NULL,7330,4451,5,2,'Open','7',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo! Your original photo needs to be pre editing, so that we can see the difference your editing has made (criteria II.F). \r\nI love the creativity and removing the background colours to make your subject pop. Make sure not to over edit to remove the clarity of your subject. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:43:39','2024-08-29 09:43:39'),(6710,'judge-event-evaluation-5833-1724888750',5833,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7576,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,53.00,-10,NULL,'This verse is a good one to stitch and hang on your wall!\r\nIt would have been good to draw it out on grid paper first. You would then have had a pattern to submit, and you could have corrected some of the ineven spacing between letter ans lines. \r\nPlease be careful to only work with clean hands, and keep your work in a bag when not working on it. When completed, your work needs to be washed before framing. Washing would also remove the pencil marks that should not be visible.\r\nRemember when doing cross-stitch that each stitch must be completed in the same direction.\r\nEnds should be threaded under the back of several stitches, then a small back stitch completed invisibly on the back of the work. The ends then need to be neatly cut off.\r\nGood work!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:45:50','2024-08-29 09:45:50'),(6711,'judge-event-evaluation-5752-1724888795',5752,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7331,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Love the way you\'ve developed the idea into lots of different areas.  For me the highlight is the rocks and path. You\'ve done a great job of the shading and perspective with this, to get a more realistic look.  Try and avoid the use of heavy black lines, they give it a \'colouring book\' look.  You should be able to get the definition of different parts in a more subtle way using shading and more subtle lines to give a more realistic picture.  You Tube tutorials are great for free drawing tips.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:46:35','2024-08-29 09:46:35'),(6713,'judge-event-evaluation-5899-1724889160',5899,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7575,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'When writing a report state what colours you used and where.  What were the size of the water colour brushes you used in each part of the picture.  When putting water lines on your picture there are two ways to do it.  You can over paint or you can leave white canvas areas.  Explore these techniques on you tube.  Be sure you keep your lines crisp and straight.  I love the textural effect of spraying your paint brush on the upper corners.  Your light is definite.  Merge more of the cream into the blue water on the lake.  I like the way that the foreground is silhouetted.  Be careful of dropping water on your canvas as I can see your intitial cloud formation was beautiful.  Keep working in this media.  For someone so young you definitely have a load of talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:52:40','2024-08-29 09:52:40'),(6717,'judge-event-evaluation-5805-1724889395',5805,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7572,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Good outline Hoani.  You\'ve put lots of effort into adding detail to your drawing.  To develop your sketching to the next level start working on the different shading techniques and move away from drawing lines to creating shaded areas and subtle lines that create a realistic 3D image.  There\'s some great You-Tube tutorials available to help you.  Nice effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 09:56:35','2024-08-29 09:56:35'),(6720,'judge-event-evaluation-5737-1724889703',5737,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7324,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'The colours of orange, blues and the browns you have chosen in this water colour pop out to the viewer.  You have used excellent stippling on the water on the tree and done the reflection well.  Your perspective is good.  You have blended well and done your reflections well.  Your horizon line is well defined.  Very little I can add except be carefull of splashing extra colour on your sky and also look up you tube for building tree foliage up. You have done an exceptional job of painting this iconic site.  Your report is good but you can enhance your report writing abilities by recording the size of the brushes and which ones you used where in your report for a fuller report.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:01:43','2024-08-29 10:01:43'),(6721,'judge-event-evaluation-5670-1724889926',5670,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7885,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Nice picture Indy.  Some good use of shading which I think you can develop with practice.  Try and avoid obvious pencil lines (like on the edge of the sharks) try and use depth of colour and shading instead.  The background could have been developed a bit to create a water look and bring the picture to life more.  Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:05:26','2024-08-29 10:05:26'),(6726,'judge-event-evaluation-5045-1724890196',5045,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7574,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Oliver, great to see some creativity! Just remember that you need to blend it well - sometimes it is ok to have pictures pasted on with hard edges, but it is good to experiment with feathering or corner shapes. Also, you need to make sure that your message is clear, and that it is something people will read or benefit from. This is a great verse, but it doesn\'t really \'say\' antything to the viewer.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:09:56','2024-08-29 10:09:56'),(6729,'judge-event-evaluation-5874-1724890417',5874,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7328,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,75.00,-10,NULL,'Your cross stiches are amazing! Well done for keeping them all going in the same direction. Also your ends have all been finished off correctly and neatly.\r\nWhat a pity that you did not include your initial drawings or a screenshot of thethumbnail you were attempting to represent in your cross-stitch. Because these were not submitted, marks could not be awarded for planning or following a pattern. Some marks have been awarded for creativity since you mentioned this in your report.\r\nWhen completed, your work needs to be washed before framing. This will also remove the pencil marks which should not be visible.\r\nPlease make sure that you complete your report, listing all materials used -this includes fabric, needle, etc\r\nSome backstitching may have helped to enhance your design.\r\nI look forward to seeing more cross-stitch from you! Another next year maybe?\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:13:37','2024-08-29 10:13:37'),(6730,'judge-event-evaluation-5687-1724890421',5687,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7887,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Isaac.  You\'ve ended up with a very realistic, happy looking dog.  Great technique used.  Only improvement I could suggest is defining the bottom left side of the face & the back more to create a little more distinction between the dog and the background.\r\nAnother little hint, instead of using your finger to smudge & blend, use a little bit of cloth or old t-shirt.  Your skin has oils in it. If the oil gets on the paper it will prevent the pencil smudging evenly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:13:41','2024-08-29 10:13:41'),(6732,'judge-event-evaluation-5019-1724890634',5019,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7580,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Brooke, great to see you create your poster from scratch! And good message. However, to someone who doesn\'t know the storyof Jonah, they will have no context whatsoever, so you need to keep that in mind. Also, make sure that your colours don\'t clash - contrast is good, and clashes can work, but it\'s not easy to get it right.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:17:14','2024-08-29 10:17:14'),(6735,'judge-event-evaluation-6372-1724890684',6372,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7898,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'I can tell that you have put effort into creating the look that you intended here, Hedi. You have an interesting message that is inspiring for the future.\r\nIn future you may like to consider a little less \"busyness\" in your poster.  There\'s a lot going on which could detract from your message.  I would have liked to have heard about how the tree growing out of the book, relates to your message also.\r\nA great effort, well done, Heidi.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:18:04','2024-08-29 10:18:04'),(6736,'judge-event-evaluation-5939-1724890849',5939,137,12,14,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7329,4451,8425,17,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely piece Sofia, well done.  The daffodils are very clearly defined.  You\'ve done some lovely shading and added some nice detail to really add some depth.  Possibly a few more light highlights, achieved using a rubber and taking off some pencil could add to it, but overall a great picture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:20:49','2024-08-29 10:20:49'),(6737,'judge-event-evaluation-5991-1724890905',5991,137,12,14,2,2024,128,'320',NULL,7579,4451,7455,69,NULL,NULL,95,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for submitting your first attempt at cross-stitch.\r\nPlease note that your work contains half stitches only - at least some of these need to be crossed for this to be classed as cross-stitch.\r\nBe careful to read the guidelines before starting your work. You will notice that the guidelines for cross-stitch state \"No stamped cross stitch accepted.\" Your fabric was clearly pre-stamped so it breaches the guidelines.\r\nApart from this, your work is good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:21:45','2024-08-29 23:54:21'),(6738,'judge-event-evaluation-6338-1724890939',6338,175,12,14,2,2024,209,'560',NULL,7922,6097,8321,53,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'You have created a very original piece, well done! It is a very bold piece, with a number of techniques used which is nice to see. It is definitely abstract, however I felt there wasn\'t a strong geometric focus and I wasn\'t able to figure out the focus or purpose/inspiration of the art.\r\nPerhaps a bit more information as to what inspired you to created such a piece? I can see you have named it \' Spacial Anomaly\'. Your piece defies geometric balance and law, quite well fitted to its name. Very clever and good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:22:19','2024-08-29 10:22:19'),(6739,'judge-event-evaluation-12315-1724890954',12315,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7329,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Sofia you have explored a simple technique on dry on wet  and you have very effectively created and aesthetically pleasing piece of work.   Watering down your orange into the sky and blue as you merge them wold be effective and would not create such a line.  Neat defining edges and no over run.  Well done Sofia you definitely have ability with water colour.  Look at you tube videos as to how you will explore this next year.  Pay special attention to new techniques you can learn.  Fill out a filler report stating what brushes you used and how you used them in your reports.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:22:34','2024-08-29 10:22:34'),(6740,'judge-event-evaluation-5854-1724891047',5854,137,12,14,2,2024,209,'560',NULL,7323,4451,8321,53,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done creating a interesting and original piece of art! \r\nYour use of a darker outline on the shapes brings some depth to the piece and all the colours lend themselves well to each other. \r\nI would have liked to have seen the outlines more pronounced to bring more focus to the shapes, however your use of shading and texture has helped to do this.\r\nI can see a lot of effort has gone into each square and together they come together well to create a vibrant, fun artwork piece!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:24:07','2024-08-29 10:24:07'),(6741,'judge-event-evaluation-5980-1724891076',5980,137,12,14,2,2024,172,'450',NULL,7325,4451,5,2,'Open','7',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. I love the way the light is on the side of your subjects face. Your report was well written.  Be careful over over editing and changing the colours of your subject, unless it is intentional. \r\n\r\nGreat job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:24:36','2024-08-29 10:24:36'),(6743,'judge-event-evaluation-5063-1724891371',5063,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7886,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Faith, I really like the font! It does need something blod to draw the eye in, make a passer-by stop and look at it! also, not sure how the picture and the verse connect. Overall, good work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:29:31','2024-08-29 10:29:31'),(6751,'judge-event-evaluation-6499-1724891601',6499,175,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7894,6097,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kyan for your photo! It looks very mysterious!\r\nBe sure to check that your photo is in focus. I think your photo would be enhanced by some cropping - to get the rules of thirds (composition).\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:33:21','2024-08-29 10:33:21'),(6752,'judge-event-evaluation-5063-1724891765',5063,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7886,4451,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,NULL,NULL,'You\'ve created a visually pleasing poster, Faith, and your verse is very relevant for today\'s society.\r\nIn future you may consider using a background picture that you either took yourself or found on the internet that connects with the theme of ants or laziness, etc.\r\nYou could also consider varying your font using size, colour or type.  These steps would add a layer of complexity that would improve your mark.\r\nOverall a pleasing poster with a great message.  Well done, Faith!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:36:05','2024-08-29 10:36:05'),(6754,'judge-event-evaluation-5965-1724891792',5965,137,12,14,2,2024,87,'238',NULL,7578,4451,6,NULL,'Collection',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'15.90 meters',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:36:32','2024-08-29 10:36:32'),(6755,'judge-event-evaluation-5755-1724891822',5755,137,12,14,2,2024,57,'168',NULL,7326,4451,6,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'24.80',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:37:02','2024-08-29 10:37:02'),(6756,'judge-event-evaluation-5975-1724891859',5975,137,12,14,2,2024,43,'138',NULL,7325,4451,6,NULL,'Collection',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'29.10',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:37:39','2024-08-29 10:37:39'),(6757,'judge-event-evaluation-5860-1724891918',5860,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7317,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo Laura!\r\nI am glad to see that you used cropping to enhance your photo!\r\nJust try to get the bumble bee and flower in focus.\r\n\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:38:38','2024-08-29 10:38:38'),(6759,'judge-event-evaluation-12323-1724892516',12323,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7578,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Even though you have used water colour your style of painting suggests that you would be more of a oil or acrylic painter by the style you have used.  Often water colour starts off lightly with a back wash and is built up.  Having said that, the water underlay you used was good and the sky has a real satin effect. Usually in a water colour features like the moon are not painted in but the white canvas is left bare.  Make sure when you are doing lines on water that they are straight and not over done.  Your reflections need to mimic the shape of the land and be darker than the original image.  Accentuate your light more on the hills by a very light wash going into a darker wash in the shadow areas.  This will enhance your work a lot more.  In your report list the size of your water brushes and how you applied colour.  Overall a good effort though.  You have a good horizon line under neath your hilsls that is crisp byt you lost the line where the moonlight hits the water.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:48:36','2024-08-29 10:48:36'),(6760,'judge-event-evaluation-5927-1724893166',5927,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7327,4451,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'I love the textural effects in this picture.  Your paper has picked up a grain which actually adds to the flower petals.  You can enhance this picture by creating a definite source of light from one direction. Perhaps you could have tied in some pinks to the back ground as well.  Another area you could work on is water droplets.  Draw these in in your sketching phase and leave areas of light. You can also use rock salt crystals that will absorb some of the colour and create a droplet affect.  Look up You tube for any techniques you want to learn it is a great source of information but remember to record the websites you use. On your report put the number of the paint brushes you used and how and where you applied the different colours to make a fuller report.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 10:59:26','2024-08-29 10:59:26'),(6761,'judge-event-evaluation-5642-1724893652',5642,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7806,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,51.00,-10,NULL,'The sky is starting to form be aware of the lines you form in your sky as the blue distracts from the cloud in this picture.  The sheep are a lovely idea.   The hills need to be lighter on top and darker on the bottom.  Back hills are lighter.  Bushy areas can be enhanced by stippling or using a rough brush.  Use a variety of tones and colors of greens and blues to achieve the look you want. Your report is brief you could right a fuller report e.g.  I wanted to past a country side Mrs. Bell showed me some pictures of the country side painted in water colours by past students.  Avoid \'just out of my head.\'  Also list the size brushes that you used and where you used them in your painting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:07:32','2024-08-29 11:07:32'),(6762,'judge-event-evaluation-12310-1724893962',12310,137,12,14,2,2024,198,'510',NULL,7885,4451,8321,53,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,' What a glamorous fish you have created! I love that you used complimentary colours and a variety of different triangles to bring interest to your artwork. Clever use of a white square as well to bring attention to the eye, otherwise this would of been lost amongst the picture.\r\n Its super cute how the tail has been tied off like hair in a ponytail too, nice touch! Such a glamorous fish deserves a glamorous name... Trish maybe...or Patrisha...or even Pafishra! \r\nSome areas to work on for next time.. In areas some pencil markings can be seen, perhaps try a lighter pencil outline, so this wont show once rubbed out and try to prevent pen bleed over the outline. Overall, great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:12:42','2024-08-29 11:12:42'),(6764,'judge-event-evaluation-5951-1724894286',5951,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7573,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'You have set your picture out well and it shows good perspective. You have a lot going on in your picture.  You and you have two focal points which can cause confusion for the viewer.  One focal point follows the path out to the boat and the other goes up to the light house.  You have used some different textures in your water colour.  It looks like you have applied wet and dry which is a safe technique your sky shows cloud formation by ommision of paint so well done.  Your light house has a rounded appearance.  To enhance your picture you could ensure that you use several overlayers and build up your grass areas.  On the hill near the light hous the paper has picked up well on the green and looks like little bits of grass.  In the fore ground however you have painted dry on dry and it has not worked so well.  The flowers are lost a little.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:18:06','2024-08-29 11:18:06'),(6766,'judge-event-evaluation-5813-1724894752',5813,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7316,4451,7314,17,'Collection',NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Holly, you have made a real effort with this picture.  Well done!  Your cloud has some lovely effects going on and I can see you have worked hard on the rest of your sky and your ocean.  Trying to balance colours that you have used.  Really concentrate on your brush strokes and leave lines on water smaller and thinner to improve what you are doing.  Water colour uses a wash first and then layers colour so look at some videos to see how you can learn some new techniques.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:25:52','2024-08-29 11:25:52'),(6770,'judge-event-evaluation-5890-1724895796',5890,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7574,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Oliver for your photo! :-)\r\nUnfortunately, I had to take marks off your photo due to there only being a small proportion of the photo in focus. Yes, sometimes you do want to have the outer background out of focus - to make the main subject (of the photo) pop.\r\nI am glad to see that you cropped your photo - this definitely enhanced it. Keep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:43:16','2024-08-29 11:43:16'),(6771,'judge-event-evaluation-6471-1724895811',6471,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7895,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'You have chosen a very famous statue for your subject, and it\'s a nice clear image, Hezekiah.  You have used black and white which is quite effective in this instance.\r\nFor future posters you might consider finding a more appropriate verse to go with your picture.  The implication here is that Jesus is laughing as He\'s considers the eventual fate of the wicked.  I\'m sure that\'s not what you were intending, however.\r\nOverall, there\'s a pleasing look to your poster; well done, Hezekiah',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:43:31','2024-08-29 11:43:31'),(6772,'judge-event-evaluation-5848-1724895900',5848,137,12,14,2,2024,142,'358',NULL,7323,4451,8425,64,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A nice piece Kayla.  Not totally symmetrical but for a hand coiled pot you\'ve done a great job at smoothing off the outside surface & getting it an even thickness.  A tiny area inside is missing glaze (something to watch in the future) You lost a few points in the difficulty area (no handles, or intricate design).  Overall a very classy piece.  I love it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:45:00','2024-08-29 11:45:00'),(6773,'judge-event-evaluation-4727-1724896012',4727,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7580,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Brooke! That was quite a gripping and compelling story. A few minor grammar errors, but all in all, a well thought out story. It would be nice if you also added some descriptions about the setting/scenes, for example, the house and the barn. What did it look, feel or even smell like?  The woods where the boys looked for eggs...what kind of trees and plants were in the woods? Was it dark and shady woods, or was it bright with sunlight streaming through the trees? These kinds of details help to draw the reader into your story and really make it come alive. Keep writing! You are great at it :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:46:52','2024-08-29 11:46:52'),(6775,'judge-event-evaluation-5897-1724896188',5897,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7575,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Paige for your photo entry!\r\nThis is a very interesting concept of a photo. I\'m not convinced that your centre part of the flax is in focus. I love the idea though.\r\nI think your chosen matboard colour works well.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:49:48','2024-08-29 11:49:48'),(6777,'judge-event-evaluation-5909-1724896359',5909,137,12,14,2,2024,142,'358',NULL,7330,4451,8425,64,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A nice vase Phebe.  In regard to fit for purpose, if it\'s going to hold water might have been better to glaze the inside too.  Unglazed pottery can be porous and absorb or seep water.  Lovely even thickness walls & reasonably symmetrical shape for a hand made item.  Love the engraving, almost gives it an antique-y look.  Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:52:39','2024-08-29 11:52:39'),(6778,'judge-event-evaluation-5925-1724896588',5925,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7327,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Savannah for your photo entry!\r\nI am glad that you cropped the photo, however I think that if you were to focus on making the flower bigger, this would create more interest. I wouldn\'t have cut the edge of the petal of the front facing flower.\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 11:56:28','2024-08-29 11:56:28'),(6779,'judge-event-evaluation-5807-1724896882',5807,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7316,4451,8425,64,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A nice little piece.  You\'ve done a great job of firmly joining on the eyes and feet.  Glaze a little thin in places around the top.  Love the extra thickness of glaze on the wings.  Fit for purpose - as a plant pot it would only hold a very small plant.  If it had been a bit bigger you would have more options on the type of plant you could put in it.  Overall very cute.  Great job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:01:22','2024-08-29 12:01:22'),(6780,'judge-event-evaluation-6285-1724896889',6285,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7896,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'You have chosen a very worthwhile subject for your poster, Kyle, and your picture definitely matches your verse.\r\nIf you are creating a poster in the future you may want to consider the following suggestions:\r\nAlthough your subject has a dark theme, ie, future suffering, your image is a little dark and hard to see.  Had this been brightened up even a little, it would have enhanced your final product.\r\nThe size of your Scripture reference has been enlarged to a giant size which gives it more importance than it would probably deserve.\r\nVarying your font type and colour would possibly give it some more interest and increase the degree of difficulty also, hence giving you more marks.\r\nOverall a great subject and a pleasing look.  Well done Kyle!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:01:29','2024-08-29 12:01:29'),(6782,'judge-event-evaluation-5684-1724896944',5684,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7887,4451,8321,2,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Initial impression is that you have been able to take a eye catching photo of a moving car. Comparing your image with the original, I can see you have made some appropriate changes to nicely enhance the photo. These enhancements make a otherwise plain photo of a car, into a eye catching one. So well done!\r\nOn closer inspection these are some focus issues, with the cars outline, particularly the right hand side of the car, which is making the image a bit distorted. \r\nI think the underlying issue was that the original photo had focusing issues and this is not able to be edited out. Next time, try to start with a clear photo before starting edits. Overall, a very good attempt!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:02:24','2024-08-29 12:02:24'),(6783,'judge-event-evaluation-5937-1724897106',5937,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7329,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Sofia! :-)\r\nYou have a nice photo here, so that you don\'t loose marks, make sure you supply all the necessary paper work - like your original proof print to your report. I would have liked the centre of the flower to have been a little more in focused.\r\nKeep developing your gifts! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:05:06','2024-08-29 12:05:07'),(6784,'judge-event-evaluation-5857-1724897341',5857,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7317,4451,8425,64,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Love the idea Laura.  You lost a few points by not having a definite purpose for your item, which in turn meant you lost a few points on \'is it fit for purpose?\' There is a still a small amount of evidence of the coils on the outside of your pot but a lot of evidence of the coils on the inside.  You could possibly have smoothed, the inside especially, a little bit more.  Love the lizards, you\'ve got a nice amount of detail on them which makes a nice contrast to the plain pot.  Was it intentional to leave the bottom of the pot unglazed?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:09:01','2024-08-29 12:09:01'),(6787,'judge-event-evaluation-5969-1724897945',5969,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7578,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Vanessa! :-)\r\nSo that you do not loose any points, don\'t forget to submit your proof print with your report.\r\nI wonder if you had a lower angle for this photo whether that would give it more of a 3D view - rather than the flatness of a 2D look.\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:19:05','2024-08-29 12:19:06'),(6788,'judge-event-evaluation-5872-1724897965',5872,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7328,4451,8425,64,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Like the idea.  Will be a nice decoration.  Hope you get to fire it, glaze it and get it finished.  Lost a few points for very brief notes (not a lot of evidence that you have a knowledge of the tools required).  A decoration is likely to be picked up and looked at closely by people, might have been nice to have some finger detail on the underside too. Another small point the lines on your piece are very straight, if you look at your actual hand I think you\'ll find they are a little more rounded.  Just a picky, small point, to maybe help it be more realistic.  Great job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:19:25','2024-08-29 12:19:25'),(6789,'judge-event-evaluation-5938-1724897992',5938,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7329,4451,8321,2,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely photo of a church. Initial thoughts is that the photo feels warm and inviting. Soft natural lighting has been used and the setting feels quite homely. \r\nThe way the photo has been taken, looking down the aisle means the eye is drawn down to the end of it. This is nice in that it gives the photo a focus.\r\nIt is a shame that the stage area is distorted/out of focus. Perhaps using a camera setting to bring this more into focus, if this was the main subject of the photo. This is possibly something that could be thought about for next time? What or who is the subject and what can you do to bring more attention/ focus to this and minimise distractions. \r\nI have reduced your score because an original photo was not provided and I couldn\'t judge creativity or enhancements made. Otherwise, good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:19:52','2024-08-29 12:19:52'),(6792,'judge-event-evaluation-5921-1724898363',5921,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7327,4451,8425,64,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Cute pot Savannah.  Like the green paint with the black contrast, its a nice alternative to glaze.  Fit for purpose - why did you make it pot shaped if it was just to look at.  Next time think carefully about how you answer that question and also fully fill out what tools etc you used to get extra points.  There\'s some evidence of the coils, but overall a great job of smoothing out the surface.  Love the eyelashes and the smile.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:26:03','2024-08-29 12:26:03'),(6793,'judge-event-evaluation-5090-1724898415',5090,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7330,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work Phebe, well done! You did well with the cross, it\'s not always easy to get the text to fit a shape like that and not look weird. In saying that, the top word is just not quite the right size, and it would have been good if the \"HARDEST DAYS\" was the same font. Lastly, if you got these words from somewhere (a song or poem), you need to attribute them also. Even if you wrote them yourself, you need to include that on your report.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:26:55','2024-08-29 12:26:55'),(6795,'judge-event-evaluation-5992-1724898518',5992,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7579,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Xavier for your photo! :-)\r\nSo that you don\'t loose points, make sure that you submit the proof print with your report. Also, don\'t forget to attach your name to the entry.\r\nI suggest that you explore taking this photo again from a lower angle - to show a more 3D look.\r\nI like how the petals give such a variety pattern. Keep developing your skills!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:28:38','2024-08-29 12:28:38'),(6797,'judge-event-evaluation-5100-1724898759',5100,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7322,4451,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work Braden, thank you! Love the gold and black, really pops! Just remember to make sure that your background art is the right proportion, so the frame is nice and even. Also, you probably don\'t need \"The Golden Rule\" twice, maybe just the bottom one, and make sure that it is centered.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:32:39','2024-08-29 12:32:39'),(6798,'judge-event-evaluation-5934-1724898813',5934,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7329,4451,8425,64,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Sofia.  A nice simple piece.  Don\'t forget to list the purpose or use of the item.  Having nothing written, lost you some points.  You mentioned smoothing off the outside.  If you want a nice smooth exterior use plenty of water on your fingers and rub around in a circular motion to blend the coil layers.  Having said that because it\'s such a simple piece the coil lines do add a bit of character to the piece.   Putting a handle on it (like in the photo you supplied) would be another option.  Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:33:33','2024-08-29 12:33:33'),(6800,'judge-event-evaluation-4728-1724898992',4728,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7331,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done writing a unique and engaging story, Chloe! There were a number of grammar errors and some scenes/paragraphs didn\'t quite flow smoothly, but all in all, a great story. Keep writing and perfecting your talent :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:36:32','2024-08-29 12:36:32'),(6801,'judge-event-evaluation-6224-1724899007',6224,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7901,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,NULL,NULL,'Good effort Grace - interesting colour choice, but it works! Great verse for a poster too. It would be good to have the picture to match however - feet or shoes would go much better than hands! Also, having the reference over the image distracts from them, which is what will pull the viewer in.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:36:47','2024-08-29 12:36:47'),(6802,'judge-event-evaluation-5949-1724899018',5949,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7573,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Sophie for your photo! :-)\r\nI like that you thought to crop the image for your finished project. I\'d have liked to have had more on the bottom and not cut the petal off the lower flower.\r\n I love how you have captured raindrops on the flower! Keep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:36:58','2024-08-29 12:36:58'),(6803,'judge-event-evaluation-5736-1724899036',5736,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7324,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'What a impressionable photo! You have done a great job in capturing a strong, stoic image, much like and representing our strong and stoic soldiers that were killed in battle, fighting for our country. The way you have taken the photo, looking respectfully up to the monument and capturing it alone, without distractions gives a nod to the important plaque visible in your image \' Lest we not forget\'. \r\nEditting the photo to black & white, captures the essence of times gone by and is very appropriate for your chosen subject. \r\nI think you have done a excellent job, well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:37:16','2024-08-29 12:37:17'),(6805,'judge-event-evaluation-6336-1724899146',6336,175,12,14,2,2024,201,'552',NULL,7922,6097,8439,17,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good use of light Adena.  You have caught the fisherman\'s expression of satisfaction very well.  A little more care with the fisherman\'s left-hand would have been worthwhile.  A lovely piece you can be proud of.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:39:06','2024-08-29 12:39:06'),(6806,'judge-event-evaluation-5990-1724899182',5990,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7579,4451,8425,64,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Love the creative expression.  You really have made a crocodile in the shape of a jug.  Nice attention to detail with the head and arms, handle and even the shaping around he rim.  Only thing I can really down grade you on is fit for purpose.  As a decoration it is fine.  As a jug to pour water there is very little room inside and also the paint finish would be damaged by liquids.  That said I love the colours you\'ve chosen, the spots on the arms, the great mouth and eye features.  Well done, you can be proud of your effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:39:42','2024-08-29 12:39:42'),(6807,'judge-event-evaluation-6207-1724899225',6207,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7900,6097,6960,12,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work Peyton, love the background colour gradient, good choice! And a fantastic verse!  probably would have flipped the fonts - make the block of text a bit easier to read. Also, the cross would stand out better if it was a different colour? At the moment it gets a bit lost.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:40:25','2024-08-29 12:40:25'),(6809,'judge-event-evaluation-5836-1724899345',5836,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7576,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jacob for your photo! :-)\r\nI would have liked to have seen a little more of the flower on the left side.\r\nIt looks like you did some colour changes to your original? If so, please make sure you reference this on your report.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:42:25','2024-08-29 12:42:25'),(6811,'judge-event-evaluation-5761-1724899668',5761,137,12,14,2,2024,145,'361',NULL,7326,4451,8425,65,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Nice effort Chris.  Unfortunately the fish fell off the piece holding them.  Maybe finding another way to tie them, rather than flax would be better.  Spraying them adds some nice colour.  Treating the flax first so it doesn\'t curl and shrink (leaving gaps) is a way you could get a nicer finish.  Hope it\'s inspired you to try some more flax work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:47:48','2024-08-29 12:47:48'),(6813,'judge-event-evaluation-5896-1724899703',5896,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7575,4451,5,2,'Collection','7',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful photo! I feel like I\'m sitting in the kitchen, have a cup of tea with her. You captured the warmth. \r\nI love your report, but would also love more information on how you captured the photo. Also be mindful of back lighting as you can lose the outline of your subject (like your subjects hair). \r\nYou colours are wonderful. Overall, well done! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:48:23','2024-08-29 12:48:23'),(6814,'judge-event-evaluation-5787-1724899750',5787,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7318,4451,5,2,'Collection','7',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Wow, striking photo! \r\nJust a few pointers, be careful with exposure and contrast as you can start to lose definition of the subject. \r\nI love the subject chosen, however, the focus of the photo seems to be the camera so may be better suited to a different category (general?)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:49:10','2024-08-29 12:49:10'),(6816,'judge-event-evaluation-5749-1724899771',5749,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7331,4451,5,2,'Collection','7',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo! I\'d love to see more information in your report about how you achieved the photo, the steps you took etc. \r\nBe careful with portaiture that the background doesn\'t take away from your subject, her hair is slightly lost in the dark background. \r\n\r\nI love the photo. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:49:31','2024-08-29 12:49:31'),(6817,'judge-event-evaluation-4729-1724899841',4729,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7318,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you Grace! I enjoyed this creative and original take on the story of Rahab. There were a couple of grammar errors, mainly in your use of commas and a few parts of the story that didn\'t quite flow well, but this was an enjoyable read nonetheless. Keep writing and developing your talent :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:50:41','2024-08-29 12:50:42'),(6818,'judge-event-evaluation-6374-1724899859',6374,175,12,14,2,2024,201,'552',NULL,7898,6097,8439,17,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'I like your inspiration and good use of tone and light.  Keep practicing your techniques for building depth and texture. I hope you have many more enjoyable hours ahead with your hobby of painting with acrylics.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:50:59','2024-08-29 12:50:59'),(6821,'judge-event-evaluation-5802-1724900018',5802,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7572,4451,8425,65,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Hoani.  The use of colour to make them more vibrant is nice.  It\'s always hard to stop the flax shrinking and separating unless you treat the flax first.  Maybe you could investigate treating and preshrinking the flax.   Your red flower especially has held together well and has nice form.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:53:38','2024-08-29 12:53:38'),(6822,'judge-event-evaluation-6500-1724900024',6500,175,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7894,6097,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Kyan, love the texture! An great creativity getting down to the water level, thats the best way to do it. It would be good to play with some enhancements, and see if you can boost the colour a little more, make that orange really pop.\r\nOverall, great job, keep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:53:44','2024-08-29 12:53:44'),(6823,'judge-event-evaluation-5835-1724900065',5835,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7576,4451,5,2,'Collection','7',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo,  I really love the way you used the lighting to create some shadows and \"mood\". \r\nThere is a lot more to photography than just picking up the camera, so next time, I\'d love to read more about the process you took to achieve the photo (placing the subject, setting up the light position etc.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:54:25','2024-08-29 12:54:25'),(6824,'judge-event-evaluation-5761-1724900086',5761,137,12,14,2,2024,145,'361',NULL,7326,4451,7455,65,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'This is a lovely mobile!\r\nDo be careful to make sure that you paint totally covers. The type of paint matters when painting flax. The blue and red paint was much better than the fluoro pink and yellow. When starting to paint try a little of the paint on a scrap first to see how it looks.\r\nYou could try boring little holes in the main bar so that the strips of fish don\'t fall off.\r\nGood work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:54:46','2024-08-29 12:54:46'),(6829,'judge-event-evaluation-5823-1724900309',5823,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7321,4451,8425,65,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Nice effort Brooklyn.  Love the blue colour and the use of different kinds of flowers in the bouquet.  You\'ve bound it together nice and tightly. Treating and preshrinking the flax is a good way to stop it shrinking and drying with big gaps.  It is a bit of a process, but maybe worth investigating if you\'re going to do more flax weaving',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 12:58:29','2024-08-29 12:58:29'),(6835,'judge-event-evaluation-5751-1724900484',5751,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7331,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Chloe, the black and white offset with the orange of the sunrise is great! I would have liked to see the building a lot more clearly - not sure if this is lighting, or if it would show up better at a different time of day. Also, it would be good to boost the colours a a bit - try to get the orange even more firey, but the snow whiter.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:01:24','2024-08-29 13:01:24'),(6836,'judge-event-evaluation-5873-1724900567',5873,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7328,4451,8425,65,'Collection',NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Luke. The fact that you boiled the flax has stopped it drying with such big gaps.  You learn the basic techniques with designs like this which will come in handy if you decide to step out into bigger projects.  Love the colour you\'ve put on the boxes. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:02:47','2024-08-29 13:02:47'),(6840,'judge-event-evaluation-5657-1724900665',5657,137,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7886,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Faith for your photo! :-)\r\nTry for a bit more focus in your future photo.\r\nI think the colour alterations that you have done, really have made a huge difference. :-)\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:04:25','2024-08-29 13:04:25'),(6845,'judge-event-evaluation-5915-1724900808',5915,137,12,14,2,2024,201,'552',NULL,7330,4451,8439,17,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I really like this piece Phebe.  Your explanation of your technique is thorough.  You have captured the use of light and reflection very well. Both the leaves and accent at the bottom are nicely textured. I believe you can hang this work with confidence.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:06:48','2024-08-29 13:06:48'),(6848,'judge-event-evaluation-5888-1724900851',5888,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7574,4451,8425,65,'Collection',NULL,100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Glad you attempted flax weaving, it can be very handy and versatile if you can get to the stage of making bigger things like kete.  Treating the flax first will stop it from shrinking and curling when it dries.  This might be something you would like to investigate.  Would have been good to have a more even coating of paint.  Great beginning effort. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:07:31','2024-08-29 13:07:32'),(6849,'judge-event-evaluation-5804-1724900923',5804,137,12,14,2,2024,163,'404',NULL,7572,4451,5,2,'Collection','7',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo! \r\nI think it may have been better suited in the \"portrait\" category.  Check the guidelines for the different category explanations. \r\nI love the movement you have captured in the photo. By cropping the photo in, you\'ve centred your subject well, but it seems to have lost quality in the process. Just be mindful of this in future. \r\n\r\nGreat work, I hope to see more in the future!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:08:43','2024-08-29 13:08:43'),(6851,'judge-event-evaluation-6223-1724900942',6223,175,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7901,6097,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Grace for your photo! :-)\r\nI suggest cropping the photo some - as there is too much sky. This is called looking at the Composition (Rule of thirds).\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:09:02','2024-08-29 13:09:02'),(6852,'judge-event-evaluation-5709-1724900978',5709,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7580,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A great attempt in a difficult setting. I can see the vision and intention you had for this image. I think your idea to get under the wharf and add something into the foreground was clever. The chosen lighting is lovely and calm, serene even and fits well with your image. However, the subject of the image, the pier, is lost in the background. Unfortunately, it is out of focus. I think you have given a good amount of thought to your intended image you have a good eye so just keep experimenting with different methods and techniques.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:09:38','2024-08-29 13:09:38'),(6853,'judge-event-evaluation-5923-1724901092',5923,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7327,4451,8425,65,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Nice bunch of flowers Savannah.  You\'ve torn the flax in nice even size strips and have done a neat job of the weaving.  You have the potential to take weaving further, maybe try a bag next time.  Adding some colour or dye might have added to the effect.   Well done for attempting weaving.  With a pair or scissors it\'s a craft you can do very easily in most NZ locations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:11:32','2024-08-29 13:11:32'),(6862,'judge-event-evaluation-5857-1724901271',5857,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7317,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'A well constructed piece of pottery that demonstrate mastery of several potters techniques: coiling, glazing and joining. The lizards are well formed and fixed to the pot perfectly.\r\nFor future reference: All entries should clearly reference our Christian world view or a verse from Scripture. This can be done with a \'title\' that references something about the object or something in or on the object itself.\r\n\r\nThis is a delightful piece of pottery. Well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:14:31','2024-08-29 13:14:31'),(6865,'judge-event-evaluation-4734-1724901382',4734,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7576,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you Jacob! This was a very full story and quite an interesting read. I love your creativity in thinking up a variety of different plots and scenarios, but I think this made the story a bit too busy and rushed. This, in turn, left a lot of questions like , \"How did Mary come to have Jack\'s number in the first place? Where did they get the funds to go to Mexico? How did just the 2 of them build a hospital and a church? Why did the mayor of the Mexican village and his family all have English names instead of Mexican names? These are just some things to think about when writing a story and creating characters and a plot and will help to fill in any gaps in the story. Also, don\'t forget to check spelling and grammar as well. Otherwise, well done and I hope you keep writing and developing your talent :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:16:22','2024-08-29 13:16:22'),(6866,'judge-event-evaluation-12302-1724901455',12302,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7325,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Wow!  such movement in this picture and what great texture.  You have tried to cover a mistake on the left hand side leg.  If this happens with black it is better to scrape the black right back and then rebuild it.  You have shown your light coming in from the left hand side but there is also light in the tail are.  Your background is blended well.  Next time use more white or yellow on this side in your background to create more light.  Use a deeper depth of green to darken the back ground on the right hand side.  Remember to be specific as to the volume and date of the magazine you used in your report.  In your report describe the pastel techniques you used and the pastel colours.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:17:35','2024-08-29 13:17:35'),(6867,'judge-event-evaluation-5765-1724901470',5765,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7326,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This looks like a formidable creature from the dark depths.  The black background and frame really makes this creature pop out.  You have used a variety of textural effects and have really overlayered your dots.  This is an amazing amount of work that would have taken you a long time.  Well done!  I like the way you have created the eye as well  Don\'t forget to put your date on your picture.  Name the colours of the pastels you used.  I am glad you followed the google image to its source, istockphoto.com.  It is good to see you using processes of smudging and stippling as well as long and short lines.  The dots underneath the squid are darker and more black and you have more yellow and white on the top.  Could you have depicted more light from the top in your background?  Well done.  Keep up your art work you have a real talent!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:17:50','2024-08-29 13:17:50'),(6868,'judge-event-evaluation-5700-1724901484',5700,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7322,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Braden good choice of colours for the butterfly and I see you have blended a few colours to achieve your objective.  Yes, there is light coming from the North East but there is also light coming from the South East.  None of the light particularly shows up on the butterfly.  The underside of the body of the butterfly if in shadow could be enhanced with a dark purple to make it look shadowed, as also with the legs.  The flowers and leaves do not really show a lot of light on them.  The picture seems a little unfinished. Your butterfly obviously was beautifully sketched and the form lends itself to beautiful colour.  Don\'t forget to put the name of the book you have used and the author.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:18:04','2024-08-29 13:18:04'),(6869,'judge-event-evaluation-5934-1724901523',5934,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7329,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'A an interesting object made from pottery. It shows an understanding of various techniques that include glazing and coiling.\r\n\r\nFor future reference: All entries should clearly reference our Christian world view or a verse from Scripture. This can be done with a \'title\' that references something about the object or something in or on the object itself.\r\n\r\nThis is a delightful piece of pottery. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:18:43','2024-08-29 13:18:43'),(6870,'judge-event-evaluation-5876-1724901543',5876,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7328,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'A good attempt at a difficult subject. Some of the enhancements you have used have improved the image by bringing some more warmth into the picture. The green of the engine has also been enhanced slightly to bring it into focus more, which was a good idea. \r\nPossibly next time, think about taking the original photo in such a way that there are minimal distractions and the only focus of the picture is your intended subject. Overall, a good effort!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:19:03','2024-08-29 13:19:03'),(6871,'judge-event-evaluation-6331-1724901639',6331,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7922,6097,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Nice choice of theme.  The photos do reflect the theme, but felt the overall presentation lacks items that grab your attention.  Maybe adding some journalling or a bit of contrasting colour would bring it to life a little.  Looks like you\'ve been some nice places and I can see you enjoy nature.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:20:39','2024-08-29 13:20:39'),(6884,'judge-event-evaluation-5970-1724902201',5970,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7578,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Vanessa, awesome colours! The still water is amazing as well! Just remember to try and keep your horizon level - you normally want it at either of the \'thirds\' lines, rather than the exact middle. Also, the tree on the the right is kind of messy, it might have just been better to have only the left tree and the fence as the foreground.\r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:30:01','2024-08-29 13:30:01'),(6885,'judge-event-evaluation-6206-1724902249',6206,175,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7900,6097,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Peyton for your photo!\r\nLast month I was in Sydney myself for work!\r\nI wonder if you\'d gone for a lower angle if you\'d have got more of the Sydney Opera House in it - without it being obscured by the tree.\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:30:49','2024-08-29 13:30:50'),(6886,'judge-event-evaluation-5852-1724902273',5852,137,12,14,2,2024,203,'554',NULL,7323,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Your chalk pastel has excellent perspective.  You have ensured that your flowers were more distinct in the front and the colours of the sunrise are portrayed in your foot hills. The colour could have spread further into the field.  It looks like someone has put a picture across you work and indented.  Our apologies.  In the forground you could have brightened the grass with some lime greens.  Don\'t forget if your work is original or taken from several photos and combined you can sign your work.  In the sky you have rounded your application around the sun.  Usually you will make sure your sun is rounded but you take your colours straight across the horizon.  Remember this next time you work with any media.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:31:13','2024-08-29 13:31:13'),(6887,'judge-event-evaluation-5710-1724902570',5710,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7580,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Brooke! The tree works great as a frame, and great composition. It would be goot to have more colour however - either boost the blues in the sky/water, wait for a red boat or something, or sunrise/sunset.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:36:10','2024-08-29 13:36:10'),(6889,'judge-event-evaluation-6303-1724902704',6303,175,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7897,6097,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Zachariah for your Photo!\r\nI wonder if you\'d taken it portrait if that would have give more of the trees.\r\nPlease also check that your photo is in focus.\r\n\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:38:24','2024-08-29 13:38:24'),(6890,'judge-event-evaluation-4730-1724902919',4730,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7317,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,99.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Laura! This was a well thought-out and beautifully written story. You are a very talented writer :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:41:59','2024-08-29 13:41:59'),(6891,'judge-event-evaluation-5915-1724903008',5915,137,12,14,2,2024,201,'552',NULL,7330,4451,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Wow this is so awesome.  You have used good technique and a variety of textures.  I love the found frame. Great subject matter as well.  I also like the way you have written a full report and included the type and size of brushes you have used and your colours you used.  Your signature is a little bit blurred but fits in with the balance of the picture.  Don\'t forget to date the work as well because it is original.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:43:28','2024-08-29 13:43:28'),(6893,'judge-event-evaluation-5802-1724903208',5802,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7572,4451,7455,65,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely flowers!\r\nPlease get someone to read over your report so that spelling errors can be corrected.\r\nIt would be a good idea to test your piant on a scrap of flax to find out what kind of paint will work best. The red paint worked better on flax than the yellow. The red rose has also been folded tighter which is very nice.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:46:48','2024-08-29 13:46:48'),(6896,'judge-event-evaluation-5823-1724903788',5823,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7321,4451,7455,65,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I like your chosen colour.\r\nThe top rose needs to have had a tighter construction. The rosebud on the right is nice and tight and this gives a good shape.\r\nI like the way that you have tied them together in a bunch!\r\nGood work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:56:28','2024-08-29 13:56:28'),(6897,'judge-event-evaluation-4741-1724903845',4741,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7575,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,96.00,-10,0.00,'Well done Paige! A very original and creative take on the story of Mary and Martha. The plot, build up to the climax and characters were written really well, but I feel you could have expanded a bit more on the resolution of the story; it felt like it ended rather abruptly. Keep writing and developing this talent of yours :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:57:25','2024-08-29 13:57:25'),(6898,'judge-event-evaluation-6374-1724903870',6374,175,12,14,2,2024,201,'552',NULL,7898,6097,7314,17,'Open',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Heidi you are really exploring how to use acrylic.  When doing stars splatter pattern is often a great technique.  Use a very fine paint brush to make sure that your lines are crisp on your horizon and around your moon.  Look on you tube for how to apply acrylic paint when doing sky and seascapes as you have rounded your paint in the ocean which would not happen in reality.  Blend in your bottom blue of your sky more into the dark blue.  Watching you tube demonstrations will improve your ability in acrylics.  I am looking forward to seeing what you do next year. In your report list what size paint brushes you used and also the colours you used in your painting.  Also mention the techniques you used e.g  Cross hatching/ stippling, short line etc.  Very creative as to how you framed your art work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:57:50','2024-08-29 13:57:50'),(6899,'judge-event-evaluation-6007-1724903924',6007,137,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7733,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Tim for your photo!\r\nI think your photo would be enhanced if you cropped the bottom - that means observing the rules of thirds (Composition).\r\nIn your report, I\'d love to see where the location is of your photo.\r\nSo that you don\'t loose any marks, don\'t forget to attach your name label to your photo. Keep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 13:58:44','2024-08-29 13:58:45'),(6900,'judge-event-evaluation-4731-1724904182',4731,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7327,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you Savannah for your story. It was a well-written, engaging and delightful read. Just a few minor grammar errors, but otherwise, well done! Keep writing and developing your talent :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:03:02','2024-08-29 14:03:02'),(6901,'judge-event-evaluation-6207-1724904292',6207,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7900,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'The fact that you have used a pale pastel background makes your message stand out, Peyton, which has produced a pleasing result.\r\nIn future you may consider looking for a background photo or image that would make your poster more interesting and possibly increase your points for difficulty.\r\nAnother way of increasing your points difficulty would be to use a greater variety of text types and then vary their size and colour.\r\nOverall a pleasing effort and a good message, tying in your image of the cross.  Well done Peyton',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:04:52','2024-08-29 14:04:52'),(6902,'judge-event-evaluation-6336-1724904560',6336,175,12,14,2,2024,201,'552',NULL,7922,6097,7314,17,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Adena,  I love the way you have used your green and applied it to create your darks and lights.  You have used an impressionist style of painting.   The warmth of the red enhances the cooler colours you have used. This is exciting!  Sign your name on your painting and put the year if it is original. Your report would be enhanced by listing the acrylic paints you used and the size of the brushes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:09:20','2024-08-29 14:09:20'),(6904,'judge-event-evaluation-12065-1724904932',12065,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7574,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'A great attempt at a image, in a difficult setting. You have added some appropriate enhancements to improve the original photo. There are a number of distractions that editing cannot improve e.g too much light in some areas and unusual shadowing in others. The photo is also distorted and out of focus in some areas. \r\nI think you have done well with what you had to work with, however next time you could put some thought into what or who is the intended subject and use techniques to make this the subject of the image. Well done for your efforts!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:15:32','2024-08-29 14:15:32'),(6905,'judge-event-evaluation-4733-1724905032',4733,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7329,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Sofia. This was a very creative and unique story to read, with a valuable lesson learned by the character. However, some areas of the plot didn\'t quite flow well. A few extra details and added descriptions in between scenes and interactions would have helped to make the story even more engaging and believable. Otherwise, you have a fun writing style. I\'d love to see more from you in future :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:17:12','2024-08-29 14:17:12'),(6906,'judge-event-evaluation-6257-1724905351',6257,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7902,6097,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Nice job Elijah.  You\'ve got some lovely photos that capture the fun you had.  Good use of colours.  Some pages catch my attention better than others, but overall a good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:22:31','2024-08-29 14:22:31'),(6907,'judge-event-evaluation-4732-1724905484',4732,137,12,14,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7573,4451,7471,7,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Hi Sophie, Thank you for your unique and creative story. However, I don\'t think you quite finished writing the story before you submitted it. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:24:44','2024-08-29 14:24:44'),(6908,'judge-event-evaluation-5873-1724905600',5873,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7328,4451,7455,65,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Your blocks are amazing!\r\nGood construction and nice painting.\r\nThe little spinner appears to be cracked and looks like it may have been done in a rush.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:26:40','2024-08-29 14:26:40'),(6909,'judge-event-evaluation-5993-1724905763',5993,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7579,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'You have presented a well though out image. I can see the vision behind your photo and its intent. You have centrally focused your subject and used the natural light from the sunset to enhance the view/ focus onto your subject, the gun shelter. \r\n\r\nSome tips or next time: There are some distractions to your subject that take away from it such as the large trees etc. I wonder if you had taken the photo from a closer standpoint it may have brought your subject into greater focus  and it wouldn\'t of gotten lost amongst the surroundings?  Overall, great job!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:29:23','2024-08-29 14:29:23'),(6910,'judge-event-evaluation-6221-1724905861',6221,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7901,6097,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Love your front page.  Shame the photos are a little blurry.  Would be nice to have a bit of journalling included.  Photo placement is all quite similar you could make some photos smaller or different shapes.  Looks like you two have a lot of fun together.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:31:01','2024-08-29 14:31:01'),(6911,'judge-event-evaluation-5710-1724905930',5710,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7580,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Nice photo Brooke! :-)\r\nI would love to know where your favourite beach is - do mention this in your report next time.\r\nPerhaps a little bit more on the left of the tree would be helpful?\r\nKeep developing your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:32:10','2024-08-29 14:32:10'),(6912,'judge-event-evaluation-5888-1724905939',5888,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7574,4451,7455,65,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Good colour choice!\r\nOne of the roses is very tightly folded and looks great! When doing a project such as this you may need to make lots of them, then choose the best three to submit.\r\nYou could work on trying to get a more even paint job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:32:19','2024-08-29 14:32:19'),(6913,'judge-event-evaluation-6369-1724906194',6369,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7898,6097,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, your photos made me smile instantly, so I guess that\'s a good thing.  Love the tutus.  Nice use of journalling.  A little bit of a dead patch in the middle of the 3rd page (top right photo could maybe have been centred more).  Overall a beautiful refection of your family.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:36:34','2024-08-29 14:36:34'),(6915,'judge-event-evaluation-5923-1724906449',5923,137,12,14,2,2024,121,'311',NULL,7327,4451,7455,65,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'You have done very well on this project. It is beautifully made and put together.\r\nI am so glad that you left it natural - I love the natural green of the flax, and this arrangement does not need colour.\r\nPlease put more detail into your report. You must have had some instruction from somewhere to learn how to make these flax flowers. Did you go out and pick the flax, did you have to prepare it ready for weaving?\r\nWell done on this lovely bouquet!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:40:49','2024-08-29 14:40:49'),(6916,'judge-event-evaluation-5726-1724906552',5726,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7577,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo Callum!\r\nI think if you could get the lighting focused on the middle section, that would be good - coz the outside trees are what\'s in focused.\r\n\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:42:32','2024-08-29 14:42:32'),(6917,'judge-event-evaluation-5849-1724906613',5849,137,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7323,4451,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Wow Kayla!  A real work of art.  I love it.  Can\'t make any improvement comments except a few of the photos on the first page are fuzzy.  Great layout.  Great use of shapes.  After looking through that I\'m wishing I was at your house for lockdown :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:43:33','2024-08-29 14:43:33'),(6918,'judge-event-evaluation-5789-1724906675',5789,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7318,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'You have presented a well taken photo. At first glance, the structure together with the grainy background gives a rustic edge, which I quite like and I feel it suits the setting. The colour enhancements/ changes seem to have toned down the red and brought the green into focus more which I feel was a good decision. As was cropping out the distractions from the original photo. \r\nIn future, yo may find it easier editing and submitting a photo that was a bit more basic with less going on around it. However, overall you have done well with the image you had to work with. Good job!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:44:35','2024-08-29 14:44:35'),(6919,'judge-event-evaluation-5751-1724906938',5751,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7331,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Chloe! :-)\r\nTo improve your photo, I would crop some of the sky out - so that you have the rules of thirds (Composition.)\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:48:58','2024-08-29 14:48:58'),(6920,'judge-event-evaluation-6204-1724906982',6204,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7900,6097,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Some very fun photos in there Peyton.  Would have liked to have seen a bit more journalling to tell a story.  Some good use of embellishments.  A couple of pages didn\'t have a focal point to catch my eye and a bit too much empty space.   Next time try and find photos that are in focus so you don\'t lose points for that.  Looks you like you have an amazing best friend.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:49:42','2024-08-29 14:49:42'),(6921,'judge-event-evaluation-5826-1724907043',5826,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7321,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Nice job capturing a wheel in motion. The enhancements you made, to brighten the green and crop off the distractions were good decisions. \r\nPerhaps experiment with longer exposure to enhance the motion of the wheel moving and making sure the light source is completely behind the subject vs beside it so it doesn\'t distract from the subject but instead helps to highlight it. Overall, good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:50:43','2024-08-29 14:50:43'),(6922,'judge-event-evaluation-5811-1724907365',5811,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7316,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'You have presented a well proportioned image with balanced natural lighting. You have chosen a good angle to take your photo. There is a nice, rustic edge to your image and with enhancements, this could have been highlighted a little it more. However, overall well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:56:05','2024-08-29 14:56:05'),(6923,'judge-event-evaluation-6302-1724907415',6302,175,12,14,2,2024,144,'360',NULL,7897,6097,8425,54,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Like your choice of colours to complement the photos.  There is no journalling  so I had to mark you down on that.  There is a lot of empty space which you could have made use of.  Putting another colour behind your \'South Island\' would have made it stand out better.  It\'s a good start, but it does feel a little unfinished.  I do like the jagged white strip on the second page.  It\'s gives the impression of mountains which ties in well with your photos.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:56:55','2024-08-29 14:56:56'),(6924,'judge-event-evaluation-5685-1724907446',5685,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7887,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Isaac! :-)\r\nI feel your photo would be more appropriate in the Structure / Vehicle category.\r\nTip - check that your main subject is in focus and to observe the rules of thirds. I think the re-colouring is not as good as the original.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:57:26','2024-08-29 14:57:26'),(6926,'judge-event-evaluation-5725-1724907513',5725,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7577,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A well taken photo. Initial impression is that your vision was to capture the vastness of the clear blue sky and the height to which the building reaches. The angle you have taken the photo, on the corner edge of the building, ensures the eye is drawn up the building and again, highlighting the sky and height of the church. \r\nThe photo is clear and crisp, with the sun (light source) highlighting the bricks texture and different colours, while the other side is cast in shadow. This shadowing brings some depth to the photo which has brought some balance. \r\nThings to work on for next time... try to limit distractions e.g trees, clouds etc which detract from your main focus. Perhaps taking the photo vertically vs horizontally would have enabled you to gain more of the buildings length/height whilst reducing distractions. Overall, great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 14:58:33','2024-08-29 14:58:33'),(6927,'judge-event-evaluation-5669-1724907630',5669,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7885,4451,8321,2,'Collection','9',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely photo of a church. First impression is that the image Is warm and inviting. \r\nThe darkened area in the foreground, leading into a brighter more expansive space toward the end of the aisle leads the eye down to the cross on the table. The use of a red border was smart in that it brings more attention to the red table in the photo, and subsequently the cross.\r\nI think there\'s a simple and humble feel to the image and you have done a nice job. Well done!\r\nFor next time, perhaps give some thought to your intended subject and find ways to bring more attention/focus to this. Also reducing distractions if possible. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:00:30','2024-08-29 15:00:30'),(6928,'judge-event-evaluation-5837-1724907868',5837,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7576,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for the photo Jacob!\r\nI think this photo could be enhanced by cropping it - see the rules of thirds.\r\nI would love to know on your report where this sunset was captured.\r\nKeep developing your skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:04:28','2024-08-29 15:04:28'),(6929,'judge-event-evaluation-5785-1724907904',5785,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7318,4451,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Very pleasant surprise.  Well set out and good use of colour.  Like the way you  cut Nasah in half and used his legs to highlight the jumping.  A bit of journalling and story telling would have been nice too.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:05:04','2024-08-29 15:05:04'),(6930,'judge-event-evaluation-6500-1724908332',6500,175,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7894,6097,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Kyan! :-)\r\nI loved reading your detailed report - sounds like it could have ended in a wet adventure!\r\nI think it could be good to crop the bottom and the top of the photo  - rule of thirds.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:12:12','2024-08-29 15:12:12'),(6932,'judge-event-evaluation-5808-1724908489',5808,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7316,4451,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Some cute photos Holly.  Love your first page.  Some pages lack a focal point that draws your eye in, the photos seem off to the side and my eye is drawn more to the black background or the words than to the photos.  Just my opinion though.  Like the way you\'ve created your own embellishments and on the last pages the use of the stripes ties in nicely with the edge of your bib and Laura\'s dress.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:14:49','2024-08-29 15:14:49'),(6933,'judge-event-evaluation-5992-1724908507',5992,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7579,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'I love the way this plant has patterns and balance, I can see why you were drawn to it.  In your report you need to write why you took the shot so close up.  Did you do any enhancements.   You have captured it well.   Did you note the broken part of the succulent when photographing.  this may take the eye away from the central focus. You ticked natural light but what type of natural light was it.  What time of the day did you take it?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:15:07','2024-08-29 15:15:07'),(6934,'judge-event-evaluation-5949-1724908536',5949,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7573,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'What a lovely choice of subject the Centre is not focused of the main flower but the droplets are and look really crisp.  You have cropped your photo but did not mention that is your report.  Personally I would have cropped a little bit further so that the flowers spanned diagonally across from one corner to another going through all three thirds on the diagonal.  Paper work is completed and I loved that you listed the changes to your lighting, contrast and saturation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:15:36','2024-08-29 15:15:36'),(6935,'judge-event-evaluation-5836-1724908560',5836,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7576,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Your frame goes nicely with your photo.  Your documentation is very brief in what you did.  I am glad you got the angle right.  It looks like you may have done a little enhancing, if so remember to record it next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:16:00','2024-08-29 15:16:00'),(6937,'judge-event-evaluation-5861-1724908708',5861,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7317,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Laura! :-)\r\nMy eye is drawn to your house area first off, which makes me wonder if your photo might do better in Structure / Vehicle. Also, I would love to see more of the house.\r\n\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:18:28','2024-08-29 15:18:28'),(6938,'judge-event-evaluation-6006-1724908715',6006,137,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7733,4451,8321,2,'Open','9',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'What a interesting & vibrant photo you have produced!\r\n I love the feeling your image evokes. The modern display of the neon light in an old world setting with the historical building and old lantern light is quite alluring. It\'s a photo that I feel invites or encouraged the observer to explore & perhaps would even inspire a visit.\r\nYou have done well to use subtle enhancements that bring more vibrancy to the colours without overdoing it and risking the image becoming realistic. \r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:18:35','2024-08-29 15:18:36'),(6939,'judge-event-evaluation-5749-1724908723',5749,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7331,4451,8439,2,'Collection','7',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Well cropped photo. You have enhanced the contrasts of light by doing so.  Having your subject looking away from the camera adds interest.  A little more information in your report would be worthwhile.  You have produced a  good portrait. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:18:43','2024-08-29 15:18:43'),(6940,'judge-event-evaluation-5090-1724908790',5090,137,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7330,4451,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'You\'ve picked a great background photo for this poster, Phebe, and the fact that you took it yourself is even better!    I\'d be interested to know if the shaft of light through the cross is computer generated or was on the original photo? Either way it\'s very effective.\r\nYour documentation doesn\'t mention the fact that you have added in a sailboat, rowboat and lighthouse.  It also doesn\'t attribute your words to a song.  These are not big problems but something to remember for next time.\r\nOverall, a very pleasing result.  Great work Phebe!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:19:50','2024-08-29 15:19:50'),(6941,'judge-event-evaluation-6333-1724908836',6333,175,12,14,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7922,6097,7455,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'You have done well to get this so nicely in focus. To have your subject sit still and not blink while you take the photo is quite a feat.\r\nTo improve the photo it would have been good to romove the little grains of mascara which are a bit distracting. Also the lighting needed to be altered to avoid the very light patch on the bottom left of the photo. An idea that might have worked for this would have been to pull the curtain or blind behind you, although in this case you may have then had to use another light source.\r\nBe detailed in your report - how many photos did you have to take to get one that you ere happy with, did you tryother positions of your subject, or alternative lighting?\r\nGreat work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:20:36','2024-08-29 15:20:36'),(6942,'judge-event-evaluation-6498-1724908851',6498,175,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7894,6097,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'The grinning dog made me smile.  The title \"Pets\" could have been made more obvious by putting a different colour card behind it.  Page 2 - bring the photos more into the middle would have created more of a focal point.  Love the journalling, it really tells a great story & introduces me to your pets.  You could make the photos stand out from the page more by creating borders behind them with a complementary colour. Overall , well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:20:51','2024-08-29 15:20:51'),(6943,'judge-event-evaluation-5969-1724908872',5969,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7578,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'My eyes are drawn to the ripples on the water and the texture and the colours of the whole picture you have taken.  Your framing suits the picture.  Your actual starfish however is not as acutely focussed as the surrounding area.   In your report you never said what you did to get to your end result and your small original is missing to compare the photo you have entered. Try and avoid having subjects in the middle third.  Did you use any enhancements?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:21:12','2024-08-29 15:21:12'),(6945,'judge-event-evaluation-6304-1724909119',6304,175,12,14,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7897,6097,7455,2,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a lovely photo.\r\nThank you for explaining in your report the steps that you had to go to to get a photo that you were happy with.\r\nDid you look at any cropping? I wonder if a little cropping on the right side my have enhanced your work.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:25:19','2024-08-29 15:25:19'),(6946,'judge-event-evaluation-5858-1724909232',5858,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7317,4451,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Nice job Laura.  Love the titles on each page.  Could have added a bit more journalling to tell the story.  Love the use of colours, that complement nicely.  Page 2 and 3 are my favourites.  May you always be great friends.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:27:12','2024-08-29 15:27:12'),(6947,'judge-event-evaluation-5787-1724909254',5787,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7318,4451,8439,2,'Collection','7',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A nice well composed photo, Grace and good detail in your report.  You have improved the lighting and contrast with your enhancements.  In portraiture, more interest can be obtained by showing facial expression.  Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:27:34','2024-08-29 15:27:34'),(6949,'judge-event-evaluation-5763-1724909318',5763,137,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7326,4451,8321,2,'Open','9',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely photo from a forgotten corner of the garden. \r\nYour photo shows off the sturdiness of the structure within a wild setting of overgrown weeds & decaying fence. \r\nSome overexposure of light in the sky and distractions of the shed corner however overall a nice shot. \r\nPerhaps for next time, experiment with some angles that reduce distractions to your subject and bring a bit more light and shadow. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:28:38','2024-08-29 15:28:38'),(6951,'judge-event-evaluation-5937-1724909415',5937,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7329,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Sofia I like  the way you have framed your subject as you have taken your photo.  I am not sure if this is the original or an edited photo as there is nothing in your documentation that would indicate what you did.  I like the composition of your picture.  Photo is mounted but would be better on two boards e.g mounting board and photo board. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:30:15','2024-08-29 15:30:15'),(6953,'judge-event-evaluation-5894-1724909534',5894,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7575,4451,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Love it Paige.  Very bold use of colours that really catch attention.  Love the titles.  Could have maybe included journalling on each page, but it\'s not a big deal.  Great presentation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:32:14','2024-08-29 15:32:14'),(6954,'judge-event-evaluation-5896-1724909723',5896,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7575,4451,8439,2,'Collection','7',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful photo of your great grandma that captures her joy wonderfully. I like that you have included her cup of tea as part of this composition. Including some details of the photographic process would be beneficial. A lovely memory to keep. Very well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:35:23','2024-08-29 15:35:23'),(6956,'judge-event-evaluation-5970-1724909764',5970,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7578,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for your photo Vanessa!\r\nI wonder if your photo could be improved by cropping the right side?\r\nThanks for saying where your photo was taken. :-)\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:36:04','2024-08-29 15:36:05'),(6957,'judge-event-evaluation-6305-1724909787',6305,175,12,14,2,2024,181,'462',NULL,7897,6097,7859,12,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'I like the way you have slanted your text at the top.  This is quite effective and gives it an artistic feel.  Your chosen picture is very apt although perhaps a little dark, however, that being said, it certainly portrays your message. \r\nfor future reference, you may like to vary your text type and colour for another layer of difficulty.\r\nOverall a very effective way of portraying your message on your poster.  Great work Zach',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:36:27','2024-08-29 15:36:27'),(6958,'judge-event-evaluation-5950-1724909811',5950,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7573,4451,7479,2,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Sophie for your photo!\r\nI wonder if this photo might be better in the Nature category?\r\nI am struggling to see the main focus area of your photo.\r\nSo that you don\'t loose marks, don\'t forget to attache your name to your entry.\r\nI hope that you will continue to develop your photo skills! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:36:51','2024-08-29 15:36:51'),(6960,'judge-event-evaluation-5835-1724910114',5835,137,12,14,2,2024,159,'400',NULL,7576,4451,8439,2,'Collection','7',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Great to see you trying to use light and shadow. Altering your exposure in your settings could improve this. The texture in the background adds interest but sharper focus is needed on the subject.  Very nicely mounted  with a good colour choice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 15:41:54','2024-08-29 15:41:54'),(6961,'judge-event-evaluation-5848-1724912453',5848,137,12,14,2,2024,142,'358',NULL,7323,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'This pottery vase is fit for purpose. The making taught the potter the skills needed to construct a functional pot which was the expressed goal. The work demonstrates mastery of specific pottery techniques, such as; coiling, smoothing, use of slip, scoring, glazing etc. \r\n\r\nSome things to think about for next time. Use of very different colours to  make the decoration stand out visually and perhaps naming your piece and showing how it connects to a Christian understanding of life. This is a well-constructed piece for someone learning the skills of a potter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:20:53','2024-08-29 16:20:53'),(6962,'judge-event-evaluation-5909-1724912532',5909,137,12,14,2,2024,142,'358',NULL,7330,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'A highly decorated pot. It is clearly fit for purpose and the scraffito design is appealing.  The decorative glaze is slightly uneven and detracts slightly from the overall affect, however the pot shows a clear understanding of different pottery techniques. \r\n\r\nSomething to think about: how could you have connect your work to a Christian understanding of life? Could you have named it, or perhaps feature some distinctly Christian symbols in the design and referenced them in your description. \r\n\r\nOverall, a competent piece of work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:22:12','2024-08-29 16:22:12'),(6964,'judge-event-evaluation-5872-1724912711',5872,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7328,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'An interesting piece that was designed for decorative purposes. It is unglazed but carefully constructed with detailing in the palms of the hands.\r\n\r\nSomething to think about for next time: how could you connect your work to a Christian understanding of life? Could you have named it, or perhaps feature some distinctly Christian symbols in the design and referenced them in your description?\r\n\r\nThis is a delightful piece of pottery. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:25:11','2024-08-29 16:25:11'),(6966,'judge-event-evaluation-5807-1724912792',5807,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7316,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'A theatrical piece of pottery that is fit for its stated purpose of plant pot. The item shows mastery of various pottery skills that include joining and glazing.\r\n\r\nSomething to think about for next time: how could you connect your work to a Christian understanding of life? Could you have named it, or perhaps feature some distinctly Christian symbols in the design and referenced them in your description?\r\n\r\nThis is a delightful piece of pottery. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:26:32','2024-08-29 16:26:32'),(6967,'judge-event-evaluation-5921-1724912823',5921,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7327,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'A colourful piece of pottery designed to catch the viewers eye. Some knowledge of specific pottery techniques are evident: joining and smoothing.\r\n\r\nSomething to think about for next time: how could you connect your work to a Christian understanding of life? Could you have named it, or perhaps feature some distinctly Christian symbols in the design and referenced them in your description?\r\n\r\nThis is a delightful piece of pottery. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:27:03','2024-08-29 16:27:03'),(6968,'judge-event-evaluation-5990-1724912873',5990,137,12,14,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,7579,4451,8348,64,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A bright and intriguing piece of pottery. It clearly shows mastery of various pottery techniques that include, sculpting and glazing.\r\n\r\nSomething to think about for next time: how could you connect your work to a Christian understanding of life? Could you have named it, or perhaps feature some distinctly Christian symbols in the design and referenced them in your description?\r\n\r\nThis is a delightful piece of pottery. Well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:27:53','2024-08-29 16:27:53'),(6969,'judge-event-evaluation-6010-1724913013',6010,137,12,14,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7733,4451,8348,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Artwork is bright, and lively. Colours seem true to life, and to the photo used as reference. Confidence use of materials and technique is apparent. Things to think about: how could I develop my shading technique? How could I show the direction and the intensity of the \'light? \r\n\r\nAlso, for next time: how could you connect your work to a Christian understanding of life? Could you have named it, or perhaps feature some distinctly Christian symbols in the design and referenced them in your description?\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:30:13','2024-08-29 16:30:13'),(6970,'judge-event-evaluation-5644-1724913172',5644,137,12,14,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7806,4451,8348,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Some pretty coloured tones used convey two candles, one of which is burning in this work. There is a clear attempt at shading and showing the direction of the light. Some things to work on for next time may be: blending of colours together, overlaying of strokes, using \'effects\' to create 3D illustration, building up of colour gradually to create depth, crosshatching, hatching etc \r\n\r\nSomething to consider for your next competition would be to try to link your work to a Christian understanding of life or Scripture, either by giving your work a title and/or describing how you tried to illustrate that view in your art.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:32:52','2024-08-29 16:32:52'),(6971,'judge-event-evaluation-5727-1724913246',5727,137,12,14,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7577,4451,8348,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A vibrant image of a bird in motion over a mountain side and waterfall. Various drawing are present: crosshatching, hatching, blending and shading. You have linked your art work to a cover of an ACE Pace. You have clearly expressed the procedures you followed to create your work. \r\n\r\nSome things to think about for next time: how will your work clear express an aspect or understanding of Christian life or Scripture? Will you give your work a title and/or a description that highlights the features of your work that show that aspect? \r\n\r\nWell done, I enjoyed viewing your piece. Particularly the colours and the abstract design of mountain and waterfall.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:34:06','2024-08-29 16:34:06'),(6973,'judge-event-evaluation-5922-1724913323',5922,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7327,4451,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Love the way you\'ve tied the colour scheme together through all the pages.  The wave edging is a nice touch, and ties in well with the water theme.  A bit more journalling would help tell the story.  Maybe including a specific date for the event if you knew it.  Overall very nicely presented.  Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:35:23','2024-08-29 16:35:23'),(6974,'judge-event-evaluation-5952-1724913345',5952,137,12,14,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7573,4451,8348,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A lively image that shows a good understanding or perspective some drawing techniques, particularly how straight lines are gradually built up to create depth. \r\nSome things to think about for next time: How does you illustration express something of the Christian life? Could you give your illustration a title and/or a description that points out what your image is expressing.  \r\n\r\nI enjoyed viewing your artwork, especially the colours and the techniques used on the wharf. Enclosing the image, you used for inspiration was helpful.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:35:45','2024-08-29 16:35:45'),(6975,'judge-event-evaluation-5633-1724913514',5633,137,12,14,2,2024,197,'509',NULL,7580,4451,8348,18,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Visually interesting comic with a consistent main character. However, perhaps the main character could have been a visually athletic person who is competing at the highest level. That would cement the idea that this is a sporting event. \r\n\r\nA lesson consistent to the Christian worldview is apparent, although could have been clearer with the main character asking God to help them at the start of the jump. The Olympics is an intriguing setting for the scene. It is not a Christian event and one that sometimes reflects the opposite of a Christian understanding of the world. It is good to know that there where Christian athletes competing!  \r\n\r\nGood choice of biblical lesson to focus on.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:38:34','2024-08-29 16:38:35'),(6976,'judge-event-evaluation-5645-1724913567',5645,137,12,14,2,2024,197,'509',NULL,7806,4451,8348,18,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Good use of solid colours in a clear visually appealing classic comic strip. The characters \'move\' from scene to scene, so a good amount of thought has been put into to each frame. The speech bubbles are relevant, tell the story, the frames clearly connect to the theme of \'loyalty\' and strongly link to our Christian worldview.\r\n\r\nWell done! \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:39:27','2024-08-29 16:39:27'),(6977,'judge-event-evaluation-5983-1724913652',5983,137,12,14,2,2024,208,'559',NULL,7325,4451,8348,18,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A clear illustration of the Christian understanding of forgiveness. \r\nA good deal of thought has been put into how the characters \'move\' from scene to scene, their arms and facial expression changing and allowing the characters to become believable.\r\n\r\nSomething to think about for next time could be : indicating what Christian life or Bible verse inspired the main idea of your work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:40:52','2024-08-29 16:40:52'),(6978,'judge-event-evaluation-5850-1724913742',5850,137,12,14,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7323,4451,8348,69,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'An eye catching, well presented piece of embroidery. Stitches are uniform and show a mastery of various techniques. Knots are tidy and unobtrusive.\r\n\r\nSomething to consider for your next competition would be to try to link your work to a Christian understanding of life or Scripture, either by giving your work a title and/or describing how you tried to illustrate that view.\r\n ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:42:22','2024-08-29 16:42:22'),(6979,'judge-event-evaluation-5947-1724913750',5947,137,12,14,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,7573,4451,8425,54,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work.  Love the rounded photos and the Sunday Sundae play on words.  You get 10 points for journalling, so try and include a bit more story as well as your verses and quotes.  Good use of colour to highlight the photos',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:42:30','2024-08-29 16:42:30'),(6980,'judge-event-evaluation-5910-1724913805',5910,137,12,14,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7330,4451,8348,69,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'An excellent example of creative embroidery! The vivid selection of colours and clever reflection of a cityscape in the Owl\'s eye are particularly compelling. The reflection of light on on the ripples of the sea show a real mastery of particular embroidery skills. \r\n\r\nSomething to think about for next time is: How can my work reflect an understanding of the Christian life or Scripture? Can I give my work a title that links to the main point or focus of my creation?  \r\n\r\nI particularly enjoyed viewing your piece. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:43:25','2024-08-29 16:43:25'),(6982,'judge-event-evaluation-12830-1724913998',12830,175,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7895,6097,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'A image that captures the viewers attention (and heart) immediately! The colours, \'sparkle\' of the water, the sun refracting through a water droplet. The contrast of the natural elements, water and autumn leaves are soothing on the eye. The focus on the splash and ripples shows a real dedication to catching this specific moment!\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for? Also: The documentation should include the type of camera/device used.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:46:38','2024-08-29 16:46:38'),(6983,'judge-event-evaluation-6284-1724914060',6284,175,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7896,6097,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A technically thoughtful image that captures the natural beauty of sunset. There is clever use of silhouette and composition.\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:47:40','2024-08-29 16:47:40'),(6984,'judge-event-evaluation-6259-1724914119',6259,175,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7902,6097,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A striking image of the natural beauty of a blossom and bud in late winter, early spring. There is effective use of natural lighting and limited enhancements that show a understanding of photographic techniques and when, and when not to use artificial enhancers. Working with natural light takes a good eye and is not easy. You have done a great job!\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:48:39','2024-08-29 16:48:39'),(6987,'judge-event-evaluation-5913-1724914226',5913,137,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7330,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'An eye catching image with stark contrasts between the orange \'living flame\' and the still darkness around it.\r\nIt shows an understanding of photographic skills, particularly the use of light and contrast.\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:50:26','2024-08-29 16:50:26'),(6988,'judge-event-evaluation-5982-1724914255',5982,137,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7325,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'An intriguing image that asks he viewer to appreciate the juxtaposition of a manmade element with nature. The colours are intense, the green, verdant. The yellow, warm. The use of technical enhancement was carefully considered.\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:50:55','2024-08-29 16:50:55'),(6989,'judge-event-evaluation-5925-1724914308',5925,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7327,4451,7314,2,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'The flowers appear to be in shadow. I like the way the flowers go into the upper third of the picture and then there is a branch on the diagonal going toward the lower right corner.  This does balance the image.  Your report is brief.  How did you come to frame the shot you did?  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:51:48','2024-08-29 16:51:48'),(6992,'judge-event-evaluation-5897-1724914579',5897,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7575,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,59.00,-10,NULL,'It is good that you adjusted the hue and the contrast as it has enhanced the colour of your photo.  However the focus of your photo is blurry.  A reasonable report was written, you could make it better by telling the reader what measure of contrast and hue changes you made.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:56:19','2024-08-29 16:56:19'),(6994,'judge-event-evaluation-15346-1724914786',15346,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7806,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'An eye catching photo! The wonderful contrast between the black and the gold are highlighted. The use of both natural and artificial light have been effectively considered.\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 16:59:46','2024-08-29 16:59:46'),(6995,'judge-event-evaluation-5812-1724914848',5812,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7316,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A good example of creativity and how everyday objects that we often ignore can speak to us of other times and moments. The terracotta colour reminds us of past times when this everyday object was used daily Seeing it on the ground, among the weeds, and by a tattered fence speaks of things we forgotten, lost in time and decaying. \r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: the \'rule of thirds\' and where the object is placed in the fame. Would bottom left or right have made more impact? How could I link my work to a Christian understanding of the world or Scripture? Could I give a title and description that focuses attention on my main idea?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:00:48','2024-08-29 17:00:48'),(6997,'judge-event-evaluation-5862-1724914975',5862,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7317,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'This is an eye catching work. It is intriguing to see all these objects together and it causes the viewer to ask \'why\'. The image is extremely sharp and well-focused.\r\nThe mounted image is a little cropped off at the top, which is slightly distracting for the viewer. I can see from smaller image contained in the report that the original photo was not cropped to such a degree.\r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect a Christian understanding of life or Scripture? Could I give a title and description that points to the main focus/idea behind my entry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:02:55','2024-08-29 17:02:55'),(6998,'judge-event-evaluation-5898-1724915068',5898,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7575,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'An intriguing image. The viewer immediately asks \"what exactly am I looking at?\", it therefore draws the viewer in for a closer look. Well done. \r\n\r\nThe focus could have been sharper, which would allow the viewer to see that you have listed in the description. \r\n\r\nThings to think about for next time: How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:04:28','2024-08-29 17:04:28'),(6999,'judge-event-evaluation-5926-1724915151',5926,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7327,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'An eye-catching image that draws the eye a center point. The beautiful amber colour of the gum is lifelike, and not been distorted in the photography process. \r\nThe clever use sunlight picks up the natural beauty of the amber gum, and its impurities - which enhances the object\'s wonder.\r\n\r\nSome things to think about for next time:  How does my entry reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could I give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:05:51','2024-08-29 17:05:51'),(7000,'judge-event-evaluation-5994-1724915179',5994,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7579,4451,8348,2,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is an eye-catching photo. The natural contrast of the blue/sky and the brown/brick work well. The image is clear and allows the viewers to see the roughness of the brick and notice the contrast between the smoothness of the lamp and cloudless blue sky. \r\n\r\nSome things to think about for next time: This image certainly could illustrate important Christian understandings of life and Scripture. For example: the rough bricks of the church reminded me that the bible tells us we are like the bricks in church walls... the smoothness of the light fixture, which will show the way in dark, reminded of Jesus and what he does for us...\r\n\r\nAlso, for next time think about how your entry can reflect our Christian worldview or Scripture? Could you give it a title or description that points to what the viewer should be looking for in regard to these truths?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:06:19','2024-08-29 17:06:19'),(7001,'judge-event-evaluation-14193-1724915263',14193,137,12,14,2,2024,14,'056','1',0,4451,8348,1,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,NULL,NULL,'A thoroughly engaging exhibit that not only presents clear information about the subject but draws the viewer/reader in to appreciate the wonder of God\'s world through Chemistry. Something that was clear aim in the report.\r\n\r\nIt is refreshing to see how you were able to take your subject and have it clearly reflect the Christian worldview and Scripture. \r\n\r\nGreat job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:07:43','2024-08-29 17:07:43'),(7002,'judge-event-evaluation-5656-1724915461',5656,137,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7886,4451,8321,2,'Open','9',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'You have done  great job capturing the image of a \' budget school van\' in a way that portrays it as a van worthy of love & respect. Clever use of angles and contrast has elevated the subject and placed it into a moody, dramatic setting. The natural morning light has been used well to soften the enhancements added. I love the balance of focus and aperture used to draw the eye to the subject. Great job!\r\nNext time, try to maintain the contrast without altering the light to much or even bringing in a false source light to enhance the natural light already there.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:11:01','2024-08-29 17:11:01'),(7003,'judge-event-evaluation-15020-1724915468',15020,137,12,14,2,2024,18,'060','1',0,4451,8348,9,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'An interesting report/study that informs about life of Christopher Columbus and his association with the fall of the Aztec empire.\r\nThe exhibit is well presented with clear headings and is carefully laid out. Facts are clearly referenced.\r\n\r\nThings to think about: During the research phase of your assignment you should have 3 - 4 open ended questions that you will want to answer. Make sure all the information you present in your report is clearly linked to the report subject/title and your research questions. Your report template says gives an indication that your subject matter has the Scriptural application, that the Aztec\'s lost because they didn\'t have faith in the true God, however your report does not mention that. Your report display does say though, at the very end, that the Spanish eventually won and that it is proof that \'through God anything is possible\'. This is true, however you need to make sure have noted this in the presentation and not just the last sentence. It is also helpful if all images are captioned and illustrate specific points in the report/presentation.\r\n\r\nA very interesting topic, with many helpful facts. It was intriguing reading!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:11:08','2024-08-29 17:11:08'),(7004,'judge-event-evaluation-15019-1724915647',15019,137,12,14,2,2024,18,'060','2',0,4451,8348,9,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,NULL,NULL,'An interesting exhibit that focuses on areas within Australia and what they are well known for.\r\n\r\nThings to think about: During the research phase of your assignment, you should have 3 - 4 open ended questions that you will want to answer. Make sure all the information you present in your report is clearly linked to the report subject/title and your research questions. Your report template gives an indication that your subject matter has a Scriptural application however, this not obvious in the display. \r\n\r\nFor future reference: It is helpful if all images are captioned and illustrate specific points in the report/presentation and each paragraph has a clear heading. So, something to consider for your next competition would be to try to link your work to a Christian understanding of life or Scripture, either by giving your work a title and/or describing how you tried to illustrate that view in your presentation.\r\n\r\nA interesting topic, with many helpful facts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:14:07','2024-08-29 17:14:07'),(7005,'judge-event-evaluation-6332-1724916354',6332,175,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7922,6097,8321,2,'Open','9',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for bringing such an interesting image. You have found something that inspired you and then figured out a way to capture it in an way that enhances the subject though clever use of angles. \r\nThe image is crisp and clear and we get a good look at the grime, moss and decay that is slowly taking over the subject. \r\nI feel the lighting focus is on the grass so this is where my eye is drawn and I wonder if more experimenting with the subject in different lights, and some clever use of aperture, would help achieve your vision?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 17:25:54','2024-08-29 17:25:54'),(7006,'judge-event-evaluation-5861-1724924481',5861,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7317,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Laura, I like the feel of it - the warm light gives it a really rustic farm look, contrasted with the silo and fuel tank. It would be good to go with a wider angle and get all of the building, but less of the sky - try and use a different ratio if you can, like a panoramic photo.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 19:41:21','2024-08-29 19:41:21'),(7007,'judge-event-evaluation-5890-1724924918',5890,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7574,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Oliver this is a very  different shot and has some nice qualities to it.   I can see that you have cropped it.  When you write your report you need to include how you edited your photo.  I can see that the colour is enhanced, how did you do this?  You need to write down every step that you do.  The initial photo was not crisp and your enhancement has  meant that the leaves of the plant stand out a lot more so well done in this improvement.  I like the inclusion of the weed as its colours are striking, that is original.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 19:48:38','2024-08-29 19:48:38'),(7008,'judge-event-evaluation-5726-1724924952',5726,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7577,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Callum, the trees as the foreground are a nice touch! Great for framing. Unfortunately, there is not really something that draws your eye in past that. There are few things that could be great (fields, buildings, beach, etc), but the combination doesn\'t really work for you. Also, you want to make sure the horizon is horizontal.\r\nKeep practicing mate! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 19:49:12','2024-08-29 19:49:12'),(7009,'judge-event-evaluation-6370-1724925102',6370,175,12,14,2,2024,172,'450',NULL,7898,6097,8439,2,'Open','7',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'You have captured beautiful expression in this portrait photo.  You have made good use of light and have drawn the eye to the subject.\r\nVery well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 19:51:42','2024-08-29 19:51:42'),(7010,'judge-event-evaluation-5837-1724925379',5837,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7576,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Jacob, I love this picture. It\'s strange, it\'s kind of a picture of nothing, yet it is so intriguing. A perfect example of when \'breaking the rules\' of photography actually works.\r\nJust remember to keep the horizon horizontal (this can be done with cropping). Also, it would be good to have some more info on the report - more about why, and what your process was, not necessarily the physical actions.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 19:56:19','2024-08-29 19:56:19'),(7011,'judge-event-evaluation-5860-1724925538',5860,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7317,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'The original photo of your flower is very clear however when it has been enlarged the enlargement has been in an area where the photo was not so much in focus and therefore it is not so crisp.  the original phto hatd some of the leaVes and the back petals that were in focus.  A great subject.  Have you ever thought of using a macro lens or setting on your camera?  Have a play with  some of the other editing tools to see if you can enhance the photos you take.  your photo is mounted well but I am wondering if the extra red draws away from the photo and a white or cream may have been a less dominating choice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 19:58:58','2024-08-29 19:58:58'),(7013,'judge-event-evaluation-5685-1724926008',5685,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7887,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Isaac, Love the title and concept, and great info on the report, that is what we like to see! It however does not really fit the \'scapes\' category, it might have fitted better in the \'general\' category. Also, it is great that you did enhance it, but just be careful not to over-saturate it - this has become quite green/yellow, which needs to come down a bit.\r\nKeep practicing mate! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:06:48','2024-08-29 20:06:48'),(7014,'judge-event-evaluation-6499-1724926097',6499,175,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7894,6097,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,43.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Kyan, it is great to see that you are experimenting with your night mode.  Fog can be quite pretty.  I am glad you told me about your reasons for your photo.  I also would like to know if you did any editing and the steps you took to edit e.g saturation +14  etc.   It looks to me that you chose not to edit though.  The focus is out on your photo and the picture is too dark so could have been lightened by increasing the brightness.   Also in the printing process their are lines through your photos.  Could this also be a scenic shot?   ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:08:17','2024-08-29 20:08:17'),(7015,'judge-event-evaluation-5762-1724926185',5762,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7326,4451,8425,2,'Open','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Nice photo Chris.  Good idea to crop out the thistle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:09:45','2024-08-29 20:09:46'),(7016,'judge-event-evaluation-5644-1724926232',5644,137,12,14,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7806,4451,7858,17,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed seeing how you blended the colours at the bottom of your picture, they were well balanced. Shading from light to dark in the candles added more depth. In the guidelines it suggested some other ways to add effect – hatching, crosshatching, and scribbling, maybe you could research how to add these into your next piece of artwork. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your coloured pencil work, Brooklyn. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:10:32','2024-08-29 20:10:32'),(7018,'judge-event-evaluation-5950-1724926365',5950,137,12,14,2,2024,162,'403',NULL,7573,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort Sophie, thank you! Some great plants with some great potential. Just remember that even with scapes, you still need to have a subject, something the eye is drawn to. Great job using the enhancements too, but it probably needs more contrast, it is still looking a little washed out, maybe pull the exposure down a bit too.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:12:45','2024-08-29 20:12:45'),(7019,'judge-event-evaluation-6258-1724926439',6258,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7902,6097,8425,2,'Open','8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Love this photo.  It\'s a very unusual angle so really catches your eye.  The cropping and enhancement really add to the photo. You\'ve done well to make the tail the main feature by softening the background.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:13:59','2024-08-29 20:14:00'),(7020,'judge-event-evaluation-5980-1724926512',5980,137,12,14,2,2024,172,'450',NULL,7325,4451,8439,2,'Open','7',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Your adjustments to the lighting has brought life to your photo however the blouse is slightly overexposed.  You have cropped out much of the background distraction which is good but choosing your background carefully is important, the building does not add to your composition.  Your portrait shows both personality and character.  Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:15:12','2024-08-29 20:15:12'),(7021,'judge-event-evaluation-5683-1724926576',5683,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7887,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Wow!  I really love this picture of the cat.  He really takes up that upper 2/3rds of the photo.  The stones around him provide a lovely texture.  You have cropped it well and appropriately. Well focused and a delight to view.  Your report however needs to be a lot more detailed.  Explain how you took the shot of the cat.  Did you squat down to ground level.  Did you make any changes to  the enhance the photo? If so you need to record these.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:16:16','2024-08-29 20:16:16'),(7022,'judge-event-evaluation-5911-1724926597',5911,137,12,14,2,2024,172,'450',NULL,7330,4451,8439,2,'Open','7',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good attempt at using light and shadow, however, the shadow on the eye is distracting. A little more care in choosing an uncluttered background would enhance your subject but well done in softening its effect.  Having the model not looking directly at the camera adds good effect. The photo submitted with your report needed to be before any alterations had been made.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:16:37','2024-08-29 20:16:37'),(7024,'judge-event-evaluation-5655-1724926742',5655,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7886,4451,8425,2,'Open','8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Nice photo Faith.  Flowers are very popular to photograph.  Your enhancements have added to the photo nicely. Muting the background more makes you focus more on the flowers more',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:19:02','2024-08-29 20:19:02'),(7025,'judge-event-evaluation-5727-1724926782',5727,137,12,14,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7577,4451,7858,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed how you used a picture from a PACE and then added in an interested background with the mountain. In the guidelines it suggested some other ways to add effect – hatching, crosshatching, shading, and scribbling, maybe you could research how to add these into your next piece of artwork. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your coloured pencil work, Callum. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:19:42','2024-08-29 20:19:42'),(7026,'judge-event-evaluation-6334-1724926894',6334,175,12,14,2,2024,179,'457',NULL,7922,6097,5,10,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Very creative entry Adena. The subjects are well placed and proportionate to each other and the background. Just some small things to tidy up like the feet placement, removing the grass appearing on the legs etc. would make it more seemless and \"real\". \r\n\r\nGreat job! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:21:34','2024-08-29 20:21:34'),(7027,'judge-event-evaluation-5854-1724926894',5854,137,12,14,2,2024,209,'560',NULL,7323,4451,6,53,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kayla. This was an amazing piece. Keep up the great work. Looking forward to seeing more entries next year. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:21:34','2024-08-29 20:21:34'),(7029,'judge-event-evaluation-6222-1724927021',6222,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7901,6097,8425,2,'Open','8',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Nice photo.  Flowers are very popular to photograph.  Like the colours.  Feel there could have been a bit more light on the photo itself.  Maybe try a few enhancements next time',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:23:41','2024-08-29 20:23:41'),(7030,'judge-event-evaluation-6332-1724927034',6332,175,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7922,6097,7859,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'I like your concept, Adena, of this old vehicle returning to nature with the lichen, etc, growing on the side.  You have certainly fulfilled this  category of a vehicle structure appropriately.\r\nJust a pointer for future reference; I\'m wondering if you could have waited until the sun was on the side of this vehicle so that it was lit up instead of the grass, that way the focal point of your photograph would be the structure rather than the grass beside it.  Just a thought.\r\nOverall this is an interesting photograph.  Well done Adena',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:23:54','2024-08-29 20:23:54'),(7031,'judge-event-evaluation-6338-1724927052',6338,175,12,14,2,2024,209,'560',NULL,7922,6097,6,53,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Adena. Keep up the great work. You may have noticed I marked 4 for documentation. More information was needed describing detailed step by step of your artwork in the report. Other than that, well done, you are indeed an artist and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:24:12','2024-08-29 20:24:12'),(7032,'judge-event-evaluation-5657-1724927104',5657,137,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7886,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Faith! Beautiful picture of God\'s creation! I love the contrast between the moving water of the waterfall and the almost frozen appearance of the river at the bottom. The only thing I can really suggest is to see if there is some aspect of the waterfall that you can capture that makes it stand out from every other waterfall, or, using camera settings, do some cool effects or something.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:25:04','2024-08-29 20:25:04'),(7033,'judge-event-evaluation-5825-1724927176',5825,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7321,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Hudson, unfortunately this photo is totally out of focus and no changes were made.  Your subject matter could have had a lot of potential.  Just do not settle for one shot.  Play around with the focus.  If shooting spider webs maybe think about using a macro setting on your camera.  I think you were trying to be creative.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:26:16','2024-08-29 23:54:32'),(7035,'judge-event-evaluation-11050-1724927407',11050,175,12,14,2,2024,180,'461',NULL,7922,6097,5,11,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Great work! \r\nI\'d love to see more detail in your report, you can use a separate peice of paper if you need more room. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:30:07','2024-08-29 20:30:07'),(7036,'judge-event-evaluation-5804-1724927517',5804,137,12,14,2,2024,163,'404',NULL,7572,4451,8439,2,'Collection','12',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'You have succeeded in catching the action of your friend jumping and you have cropped out some of the distracting features, but in enlarging your photo you have lost definition. To overcome this, stand closer to your subject and/or use a higher spec camera.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:31:57','2024-08-29 20:31:57'),(7037,'judge-event-evaluation-6206-1724927549',6206,175,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7900,6097,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Peyton, the Sydney Harbour Bridge is full of great textures and is a very interesting shape for photographing. However, I think it would have been better to take this photo in landscape (as opposed to portrait), and get more of both the bridge and the tree. Also, make sure that you keep the horizon horizontal.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:32:29','2024-08-29 20:32:29'),(7039,'judge-event-evaluation-6223-1724927767',6223,175,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7901,6097,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Grace. I like the inclusion of the ship in the foreground, that adds texture. However, it does affect the camera, as it makes it grainy - you need to play with the ISO settings. Also, please make sure that you keep the horizon horizontal.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:36:07','2024-08-29 20:36:07'),(7040,'judge-event-evaluation-5701-1724927792',5701,137,12,14,2,2024,207,'558',NULL,7322,4451,6,52,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Braden. This is an amazing artwork. Well done and keep up the great work. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:36:32','2024-08-29 20:36:32'),(7042,'judge-event-evaluation-6371-1724927812',6371,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7898,6097,8425,2,'Open','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Love the colours of the photo against the colour of the frames.  Very good choice.  Sunsets are a popular photo choice.  Good use of enhancements',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:36:52','2024-08-29 20:36:52'),(7043,'judge-event-evaluation-5668-1724927824',5668,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7885,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,48.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Indy, some very nice country side to be shooting.  Your shot into direct sunlight, so a lot of what was in your picture was in shadow.  Some nice cloud formations in the background.  Focus was a bit hazy also this picture probably belongs in the category of Scenic Photography.  I can see that you tried to frame it with the trees.  Just watch your horizon line.  Use edit to straighten if necessary.  Record what you do when you edit it.  Your colour is undersaturated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:37:04','2024-08-29 20:37:04'),(7044,'judge-event-evaluation-5763-1724927891',5763,137,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7326,4451,7859,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'You have certainly photographed a lovely old structure by capturing this baptismal bath, Chris.  It has a lot of interesting lichen, etc, on the outside.  I can understand your idea of cropping off the garage beside your structure, that would have detracted from the overall effect.\r\nIn future you may consider photographing the structure from a slightly different angle that would remove the garage without having to crop it out.  That way you would have completely removed it, and not be able to still see it at the bottom.\r\nI also wondered whether it perhaps blends into the background a little too much.\r\nOverall though, this is a pleasing photograph.  Well done Chris',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:38:11','2024-08-29 20:38:11'),(7045,'judge-event-evaluation-6010-1724927911',6010,137,12,14,2,2024,204,'555',NULL,7733,4451,7858,17,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I really enjoyed spending time looking at all the intricate details involved in your drawing. I was most impressed to read you had used an electric eraser as I had never heard of this before. I could see some areas where it had been used.  In the guidelines it suggested some other ways to add effect – hatching, and crosshatching, maybe you could research how to add these into your next piece of artwork. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your coloured pencil work, Timothy. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:38:31','2024-08-29 20:38:31'),(7046,'judge-event-evaluation-5853-1724928031',5853,137,12,14,2,2024,207,'558',NULL,7323,4451,6,52,'Open',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kayla. This is very creative and God has great plans in stored for you. He has blessed you with an incredibly creative mind. Keep up the great work and God Bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:40:31','2024-08-29 20:40:31'),(7047,'judge-event-evaluation-5699-1724928101',5699,137,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7322,4451,5,17,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful painting! I love the reflection in the water. Next time, try playing with highlights and contrasts to more clearly define the horizon and give your painting more perspective. \r\n\r\nYou put effort into your report, well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:41:41','2024-08-29 20:41:42'),(7048,'judge-event-evaluation-11117-1724928108',11117,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7895,6097,8425,2,'Open','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Love the original creative idea.. There is quite a lot of light on the photo & I feel like the top left is a little out of focus.   Maybe try using a few filters or enhancements. Overall an eye catching photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:41:48','2024-08-29 20:41:48'),(7049,'judge-event-evaluation-5978-1724928118',5978,137,12,14,2,2024,141,'357',NULL,7325,4451,7858,63,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'This toolbox will be handy for you to store your tools in and is something you can be proud of making. Most of your cuts are straight though you could have taken a bit more care with your cuts. Your rivets have joined your seams accurately. I ran my fingers over all the joins and got caught in a few, which could be cut or folded to ensure the user doesn\'t get hurt. I can see care also taken with the folding of the sheets of aluminium. A solid effort Vinni, I pray you continue to use your skills for God\'s Kingdom.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:41:58','2024-08-29 20:41:58'),(7050,'judge-event-evaluation-5723-1724928157',5723,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7577,4451,7858,63,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'This toolbox will be handy for you to store your tools in and is something you can be proud of making. Most of your cuts are straight and show care taken. Your rivets have joined your seams accurately. I ran my fingers over all the joins and only got caught in one, which could be cut or folded to ensure the user doesn\'t get hurt. I can see care also taken with the folding of the sheets of aluminium. A solid effort Callum, I pray you continue to use your skills for God\'s Kingdom.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:42:37','2024-08-29 20:42:37'),(7051,'judge-event-evaluation-5733-1724928176',5733,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7324,4451,7858,63,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'This toolbox will be handy for you to store your tools in and is something you can be proud of making. Most of your cuts are straight and show care taken. Your rivets have joined your seams accurately, though one join had 3 rivets. I ran my fingers over all the joins and only got caught in one, which could be cut or folded to ensure the user doesn\'t get hurt. I can see care also taken with the folding of the sheets of aluminium. A solid effort Charlie, I pray you continue to use your skills for God\'s Kingdom.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:42:56','2024-08-29 20:42:56'),(7052,'judge-event-evaluation-5822-1724928194',5822,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7321,4451,7858,63,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This toolbox will be handy for you to store your tools in and is something you can be proud of making. Most of your cuts are straight and show care taken. Your rivets have joined almost all your seams accurately. I ran my fingers over all the joins and only got caught in one, which could be cut or folded to ensure the user doesn\'t get hurt. I can see care also taken with the folding of the sheets of aluminium, with a couple that could be folded at the end or folded a bit more. A solid effort Hudson, I pray you continue to use your skills for God\'s Kingdom.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:43:14','2024-08-29 20:43:14'),(7053,'judge-event-evaluation-5989-1724928218',5989,137,12,14,2,2024,117,'307',NULL,7579,4451,7858,63,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'This toolbox will be handy for you to store your tools in and is something you can be proud of making. Most of your cuts are straight and show care taken. Your rivets have joined your seams though there are a few gaps that could have been joined more carefully. I can see care also taken with the folding of the sheets of aluminium. A solid effort Xavier, I pray you continue to use your skills for God\'s Kingdom.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:43:38','2024-08-29 20:43:38'),(7054,'judge-event-evaluation-5810-1724928220',5810,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7316,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Holly you have cropped well your picture and there is a clarity to your picture that makes you want to pick one of those lovely oranges off of the tree.  Your framing does not detract from the picture and is completely suitable.  I like the way you included the size of the Optical Zoom lens.  Your made a great choice in removing distracting features.  Your choice of subject was a good one.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:43:40','2024-08-29 20:43:40'),(7055,'judge-event-evaluation-5698-1724928267',5698,137,12,14,2,2024,139,'354',NULL,7322,4451,7858,61,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'I can see the rocket sitting on a bookcase in a young boys room. It would not only add to the atmosphere of his room, it could also be played with and let his imagination loose. I particularly enjoyed the use of different copper wire. The top and leg finishing wire were a brighter colour. My imagination imagined what it would be like with the bright copper colour being all on the bottom to show that is where the heat was coming from. Some of the legs could have more wire around them to fill in some noticeable gaps. A fun piece that stands well on its own. A solid effort Braden, I pray you continue to use your skills for God\'s Kingdom.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:44:27','2024-08-29 20:44:27'),(7056,'judge-event-evaluation-6303-1724928313',6303,175,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7897,6097,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Zachariah, great choice of subject, and something different. Looking at your proof tho... I actually think you should have cropped less - the longer line on the right really gives it some perspective. I understand that it might have been because of the overexposed bit, but you can fix that with editing, or using a tripod and playing with exposure.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:45:13','2024-08-29 20:45:13'),(7057,'judge-event-evaluation-5019-1724928354',5019,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7580,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'I was impressed with the effort you put in to designing your Jonah. A poster is most effective when it has a verse or saying that jumps out at the viewer. The blue background did make the words jump out, though I think the message got lost with the groupings of the words. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Brooke. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:45:54','2024-08-29 20:45:54'),(7058,'judge-event-evaluation-6225-1724928397',6225,175,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7901,6097,5,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Grace! I love the choice of colours. \r\nNext time try practicing to not overwork the paper, it\'s all just practice. \r\nIf you have used an inspiration photo, make sure you give reference to this in your report. \r\n\r\nI hope to see more from you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:46:37','2024-08-29 20:46:37'),(7060,'judge-event-evaluation-5026-1724928433',5026,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7324,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster effectively communicates the chosen verse. The font choice is clear, and the black letters ensure that the verse stands out. I wondered if the cursive capital letters would have stood out more if darker. You had put effort into creating this poster using more than just copy and paste. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Charlie. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:47:13','2024-08-29 20:47:13'),(7061,'judge-event-evaluation-5078-1724928455',5078,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7572,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Your choice of picture aligns well with your choice of verse. I wondered if you could play around more with font colour and where words were placed on the picture to make it stand out more and not cover half the image. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Hoani. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:47:35','2024-08-29 20:47:35'),(7062,'judge-event-evaluation-6283-1724928472',6283,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7896,6097,8425,2,'Open','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'I like your creative idea. The photo is nicely focused just a shame about all the white light which hides quite a lot of the detail you were trying to capture.  Try experimenting with different settings to see if you can get rid of the light.  It is hard to photograph down on water.  The red leaf is very cool.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:47:52','2024-08-29 20:47:52'),(7063,'judge-event-evaluation-5081-1724928477',5081,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7321,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Your picture was clear and the verse you choose was well place on the poster. The font choice is clear, and the use of white ensures that the verse stands out prominently. Next time consider where you put your line breaks in the verse. The flower was pretty but didn’t seem to enhance the meaning of the verse in any way, though the border around a section of the verse made it stand out. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Hudson. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:47:57','2024-08-29 20:47:57'),(7064,'judge-event-evaluation-15331-1724928499',15331,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7885,4451,7858,12,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,NULL,NULL,'Your picture was pleasant and calming and the image was clear. I think this verse suits being made into a poster. The font choice is clear, but due to the size it did not stand out clearly. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Indy. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:48:19','2024-08-29 20:48:19'),(7065,'judge-event-evaluation-5067-1724928522',5067,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7887,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'You had put together different aspects to show that your poster was not just a copy and paste which showed some technical ability. I wondered if the man running was the best picture to match the verse you choose though. I think this verse suits being made into a poster and more work on the fonts and positions could have made it easier to read. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Issac. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:48:42','2024-08-29 20:48:42'),(7066,'judge-event-evaluation-5082-1724928539',5082,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7576,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster effectively communicates the chosen verse. The man certainly looks like he is rejoicing, making your image align perfectly with the verse. The font choice is clear, and the use of white ensures that the verse stands out prominently. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster and consider where you put your line breaks in the verse. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Jacob. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:48:59','2024-08-29 20:48:59'),(7067,'judge-event-evaluation-6488-1724928556',6488,175,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7894,6097,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster effectively communicates the chosen verse. The font choice is clear, and the use of white ensures that the verse stands out prominently. I wondered if the cursive letters could have been more selective ie Heaven declare – Skies proclaim. The background image aligns well with the meaning of the verse and contributes to the overall balance of the poster. It is made even more impressive in the fact that it is your own photo. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Kyan. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:49:16','2024-08-29 20:49:16'),(7068,'judge-event-evaluation-5043-1724928576',5043,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7317,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster effectively communicates the chosen verse. The font choice is clear, and the use of white ensures that the verse stands out prominently. The background image aligns well with the meaning of the verse and contributes to the overall balance of the poster. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Laura. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:49:36','2024-08-29 20:49:36'),(7069,'judge-event-evaluation-5086-1724928593',5086,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7328,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'I was impressed with how you designed the background for your poster. It was not just a quick copy and paste. You may have been able to get more points if the words had popped out more. Sometimes it is more effect to use parts of a verse so the poster is snappy and the message is more condensed. The red heart really popped on the black background. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Luke. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:49:53','2024-08-29 20:49:53'),(7070,'judge-event-evaluation-6007-1724928595',6007,137,12,14,2,2024,175,'453',NULL,7733,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Timothy, I like it, really intriguing shapes! And the texture in the water right in the foreground is great too. However, it might have been good to take a few shots with the waves in/out, or try a few different times of the day to get the highest tide, to try and not have the sticks in there - more a glassy look to contrast the rocks. Also, it might have got a bit more light on the main rock on the right.\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:49:55','2024-08-29 20:49:55'),(7071,'judge-event-evaluation-5045-1724928610',5045,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7574,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'The green grass background was effective though I think you could have bordered your pictures or blurred the edges to have the poster look more cohesive. To make a poster ready to put on a wall, the words need to stand out strongly, so you see them immediately. I think your little lamb was cute. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Oliver. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:50:10','2024-08-29 20:50:10'),(7072,'judge-event-evaluation-5051-1724928631',5051,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7575,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Your picture nicely matched the verse you choose, I think I would like that displayed in my classroom. The font made the picture show through which added interest, but I wondered if the words covered too much of the picture. Maybe the scripture reference could have been smaller and in a bottom corner. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Paige. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:50:31','2024-08-29 20:50:31'),(7074,'judge-event-evaluation-5096-1724928654',5096,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7579,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,NULL,NULL,'Your picture was clear though very simple. I think this verse suits being made into a poster. The font choice is clear, though maybe a slightly darker colour would have made it stand out more. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Xavier. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:50:54','2024-08-29 20:50:54'),(7075,'judge-event-evaluation-5025-1724928670',5025,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7577,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster effectively communicates the chosen verse. The font choice is clear, and the use of white ensures that the verse stands out prominently. Your cross was an effective idea as the ‘t’ but sadly this ‘t’ was pixelated.  The background image aligns well with the meaning of the verse and contributes to the overall balance of the poster. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. I pray you continue to use the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:51:10','2024-08-29 20:51:10'),(7076,'judge-event-evaluation-5656-1724928709',5656,137,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7886,4451,7859,2,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'This is an interesting photo of this Nissan van.  I like what you have done with your enhancements.  You have managed to brighten up your subject and bring it to life a little more.  I actually like the moody clouds above the van too.  The fact that you have crouched down and taken the photo looking up at the van and sky has also enhanced your photo.\r\nJust a little pointer for next time, I think you could have had a little more light on your subject.  Your focal point is the van but it doesn\'t stand out as much as it could due to the poor light.\r\nOverall a pleasing effect that you can be proud of.  Well done Faith!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:51:49','2024-08-29 20:51:49'),(7077,'judge-event-evaluation-5055-1724928722',5055,137,12,14,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,7329,4451,7858,12,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster effectively communicates the chosen verse. The font choice is clear, and the use of white ensures that the verse stands out prominently. The background image aligns well with the meaning of the verse and contributes to the overall balance of the poster. I would be happy to display this poster in my classroom. To increase your marks further next year, consider incorporating some more complex elements into the poster. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your poster, Sophia. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:52:02','2024-08-29 20:52:02'),(7078,'judge-event-evaluation-5952-1724928760',5952,137,12,14,2,2024,193,'505',NULL,7573,4451,7858,17,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed how your picture drew me in towards the end of the pier, then the sun burst forth with the many colours circling around it. In the guidelines it suggested some other ways to add effect – hatching, crosshatching, and scribbling, maybe you could research how to add these into your next piece of artwork. I appreciated examining the effort you invested in your coloured pencil work, Sophie. I pray you keep using the talents God has given you for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:52:40','2024-08-29 20:52:40'),(7079,'judge-event-evaluation-5803-1724928784',5803,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7572,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Nice shot Hoani!  This flower really stands out.  You have really focused in on it.  Your cropping was good as well.  The choice of the light pink and grey really enhances your photo.    When filling out your report tell us how you achieved your shot.  Did you have to edge really close to the flowers, was it hard to focus.   Do play with some of the editing tools in the future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:53:04','2024-08-29 20:53:04'),(7080,'judge-event-evaluation-6205-1724928795',6205,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7900,6097,8425,2,'Open','8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Love the colour you\'ve chosen for the border it really complements the photo.  Nice scenic photo. It is a pretty common type of photo to see.  You could have maybe used some enhancements or colour filters etc to make it something more unusual.  Just a thought for next time.  You do get extra points for enhancing the photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:53:15','2024-08-29 20:53:15'),(7081,'judge-event-evaluation-6373-1724928844',6373,175,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7898,6097,5,17,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work Heidi. \r\nI love the way you used water to create lighter patches as the waves. \r\nI would have loved to see the objects on the beach that you mentioned, make sure your report is accurate to your painting. \r\nYou could also add some more texture to the sky to show the storminess. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:54:04','2024-08-29 20:54:04'),(7082,'judge-event-evaluation-6011-1724928863',6011,137,12,14,2,2024,207,'558',NULL,7733,4451,6,52,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Timothy. A suggestion for future entries that would help prepare is by using the guidelines. This will hep point the different areas we will be marking from. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:54:23','2024-08-29 20:54:23'),(7083,'judge-event-evaluation-5739-1724928910',5739,137,12,14,2,2024,196,'508',NULL,7324,4451,8439,52,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'You have blended your media well and your concept is good. It would be more easily perceived if the crowd was larger and perhaps a little darker rather than bright and colourful. Also the edge of the crowd is a little abrupt but overall a good portrayal of being called.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:55:10','2024-08-29 20:55:10'),(7084,'judge-event-evaluation-5912-1724928943',5912,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7330,4451,8425,2,'Open','8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:55:43','2024-08-29 20:55:43'),(7088,'judge-event-evaluation-5708-1724929044',5708,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7580,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I like the butterfly Brooke!\r\nTry and aim for the stitches to be a bit more even - so that there is no one stitch loser than the others. Don\'t forget to include your pattern with your report so that you can gain all possible points.\r\nKeep developing this skill!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:57:24','2024-08-29 20:57:24'),(7091,'judge-event-evaluation-5786-1724929080',5786,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7318,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Grace for your Embroidery! :-)\r\nDon\'t forget to include your pattern with your project so that you can gain all the points possible. That will mean we can see what was there originally and the changes you\'ve made.\r\nFor your next one, try and make your cast off threads have neater finishes - so your back looks tidier. Keep developing your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:58:00','2024-08-29 20:58:00'),(7092,'judge-event-evaluation-5809-1724929120',5809,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7316,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for sharing your \'Flamingo\', Holly!\r\nSo that you can gain all possible points, don\'t forget to include your pattern with your report.\r\nThe guidelines say to not use a punch needle, so I\'m glad you made this change. Make sure all your threads are going through to the under side, which looks pretty good! Keep developing this skill! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:58:40','2024-08-29 20:58:40'),(7093,'judge-event-evaluation-5834-1724929142',5834,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7576,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jacob on your first embroidery! :-)\r\nTry and make your stitching as even as possible, so that your project will sit flat in the end. Also, your backing could be tidier like your front.\r\nSo that you don\'t loose points, please submit your pattern with your report.\r\nKeep developing your skills in this! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:59:02','2024-08-29 20:59:02'),(7094,'judge-event-evaluation-5859-1724929193',5859,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7317,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Laura!\r\nSo that you don\'t loose any points don\'t forget to include your pattern with the report. \r\nWork on trying to keep your stitchings even, so that your fabric sits flat.\r\nKeep developing your skills in this! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 20:59:53','2024-08-29 20:59:53'),(7095,'judge-event-evaluation-5788-1724929274',5788,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7318,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Wow you did a lot to this photo!  Tell me the settings e.g exposure - 20 etc.  it is good to see you used a manual focus.  The flower is not as crisp as the leaves around it.  A lighter pink on the framing may have been more appropriate.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:01:14','2024-08-29 21:01:14'),(7096,'judge-event-evaluation-6005-1724929313',6005,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7733,4451,8425,2,'Open','8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'I like the creativity of changing the angle and the enhancing you\'ve done.  Would have been nice to get the big leaf in the foreground more in focus.  The dark trunks against the blue sky are nice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:01:53','2024-08-29 21:01:53'),(7097,'judge-event-evaluation-6208-1724929369',6208,175,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7900,6097,5,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely painting to look at. I can almost see a beautiful ocean horizon. If you put a little more detail into your report, I would be able to award more points for this. \r\n\r\nYour colour choices are lovely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:02:49','2024-08-29 21:02:49'),(7098,'judge-event-evaluation-5981-1724929584',5981,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7325,4451,8425,2,'Open','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Flowers are a very common photo choice.  To earn extra points try and think of something slightly different to do with the flowers that would create a point of difference from most flower photos.  I like the enhancements.  A good colour choice for the frame.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:06:24','2024-08-29 21:06:24'),(7099,'judge-event-evaluation-5815-1724929627',5815,137,12,14,2,2024,196,'508',NULL,7316,4451,8439,52,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Great concept with bold design. A little more attention to the ship would have added to the final impact as would consistent lettering for your Scripture reference. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:07:07','2024-08-29 21:07:07'),(7100,'judge-event-evaluation-5895-1724929654',5895,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7575,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Nice embroidery Paige! :-)\r\nSo that you do not loose points, don\'t forget to submit your pattern with your report. Try and aim for more even stitches, so that your fabric will stay flat. \r\nYour back is still quite tidy, but I think it could be more, try and hide your loose ends more.\r\nKeep developing this skill! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:07:34','2024-08-29 21:07:34'),(7101,'judge-event-evaluation-5914-1724929717',5914,137,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7330,4451,5,17,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Wow, well done! I love the joy and fun that oozes through your painting. Your use of texture and fine details is beautiful. \r\nI hope to see more from you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:08:37','2024-08-29 21:08:37'),(7102,'judge-event-evaluation-6334-1724929741',6334,175,12,14,2,2024,179,'457',NULL,7922,6097,7455,10,NULL,NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Interesting composition!\r\nWhen doing your VFX breakdown you need to take screenshots of the stages of your composition. Your breakdown said why you have chosen the element, but not how you accomplished each stage.\r\nI\'m not sure that I understand your composite photo. It appears that one boy is kicking the other? An explanation of what you were attempting to portray would also help in your VFX breakdown.\r\nI would love to see you have another attempt at a composite photo.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:09:01','2024-08-29 21:09:01'),(7103,'judge-event-evaluation-5750-1724929751',5750,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7331,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Chloe,  Some very pretty colours in your subject.  Make sure you take several photos.  Play around with position that you take the shot.  Watch where the shadows fall on your subject.  What in the photo may be distracting.  Does this need editing out or softening up.  Can I enhance the photo through the editing process.  These are questions you need to ask when you next take a photo.   If a photo is blurred in any way you need to shoot again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:09:11','2024-08-29 21:09:11'),(7104,'judge-event-evaluation-6006-1724929782',6006,137,12,14,2,2024,174,'452',NULL,7733,4451,7859,2,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'I think this is an interesting structure that you have chosen, Timothy.  Your choice of border colour has enhanced the colours in your picture, bringing out the lovely purples and pinks.  I particularly like the old streetlight in your picture.  You have used the rule of thirds to good advantage as well.  \r\nJust one small pointer for future photos, maybe you could have made the sign vertical to your border,\r\nOverall a great effort and a pleasing effect.  Well done Timothy ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:09:42','2024-08-29 21:09:42'),(7105,'judge-event-evaluation-5658-1724930031',5658,137,12,14,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7886,4451,6,17,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Faith. Note for future entries. Please provided a detailed step by step report explaining your sketching. Using the guidelines would also help prepare for future entries. Other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:13:51','2024-08-29 21:13:51'),(7106,'judge-event-evaluation-6008-1724930139',6008,137,12,14,2,2024,200,'551',NULL,7733,4451,5,17,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Truly beautiful artwork Timothy. You have done a very detailed painting, I would love to see your report reflect this. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:15:39','2024-08-29 21:15:39'),(7107,'judge-event-evaluation-5735-1724930154',5735,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7324,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Charlie,  some excellent work and you definitely have a very good eye for your subject matter. I loved the fact that in your report you have put the size of your lens.  I liked the way you kneeled down and focused on the middle taking the line of flowers.  You show a lot of thought in what you are doing.  Do in future play around with editing tools to see if you can further enhance your subject.  Record each change you make.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:15:54','2024-08-29 21:15:54'),(7108,'judge-event-evaluation-5929-1724930246',5929,137,12,14,2,2024,196,'508',NULL,7327,4451,8439,52,'Collection',NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'You have used three different media and integrated them as required but it is difficult to understand the focus of your calling. You have used bold colours and made a good start. Keep on experimenting and developing your talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:17:26','2024-08-29 21:17:26'),(7109,'judge-event-evaluation-5725-1724930248',5725,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7577,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Callum, awesome texture! It would have been good to crop some of the empty space off the right, but overall, great work! \r\n\r\nGod Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:17:28','2024-08-29 21:17:28'),(7110,'judge-event-evaluation-5924-1724930268',5924,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7327,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Savannah!\r\nSo that you do not loose any points, make sure you include your pattern with your report.\r\nYour back is very tidy - well done!\r\nTry and aim for more consistent tension - so that your fabric is flatter.\r\nKeep developing this skill! :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:17:48','2024-08-29 21:17:48'),(7111,'judge-event-evaluation-6333-1724930331',6333,175,12,14,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7922,6097,8425,2,'Open','13',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo.  Really catches attention.  The detail and clarity you\'ve captured is amazing.  Only thing I\'ve marked you down on is lighting & enhancements.  I feel there is quite a bit of white in that bottom left corner which detracts from the eye slightly.  You mention using auto focus and don\'t mention any enhancements so I took a point off there too.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:18:51','2024-08-29 21:18:51'),(7112,'judge-event-evaluation-5724-1724930541',5724,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7577,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Callum! The angle you took the photo on was very creative.  Cropping was appropriate.  Focus is reasonably goo. Love the golden colours and your frame enhances the photo.  Your photo appears lightened did you do any other editing?  If you did remember to record every editing step to gain fuller marks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:22:21','2024-08-29 21:22:21'),(7114,'judge-event-evaluation-5935-1724930583',5935,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7329,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Sofia!\r\nSo that you do not loose any points, don\'t forget to submit your pattern with your report.\r\nTry and get your stitchings more even so that your fabric will sit flat.\r\nI love the purple on the frame. ;-) Keep developing this skill.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:23:03','2024-08-29 21:23:03'),(7115,'judge-event-evaluation-5737-1724930606',5737,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7324,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Charlie. You transformed the referenced image into a stunning piece of art. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:23:26','2024-08-29 21:23:26'),(7116,'judge-event-evaluation-5826-1724930625',5826,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7321,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for youe effort Husdon, really interesting subject! Just make sure that your subject is completely in the frame. Also, try different angles to try and aoid the light bleeding in from those background sources.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:23:45','2024-08-29 21:23:45'),(7118,'judge-event-evaluation-6304-1724930663',6304,175,12,14,2,2024,177,'455',NULL,7897,6097,8425,2,'Open','13',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Very pretty photo.  You\'re right I have seen a lot of similar photos before.  Would be nice to try and add some enhancements or a feature that makes it a bit more standout-ish and different, to grab the viewers attention more.  Love the colour.  Photo isn\'t mounted in the centre of the board, not sure if that was intended or not.  Overall, a nice photo',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:24:23','2024-08-29 21:24:23'),(7120,'judge-event-evaluation-12315-1724930860',12315,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7329,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Sofia. You use of colour from top to bottom blended together to make a very pleasing effect. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:27:40','2024-08-29 21:27:40'),(7121,'judge-event-evaluation-5899-1724930873',5899,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7575,4451,7858,17,'Collection',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Paige. You transformed the referenced image into a stunning piece of art. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:27:53','2024-08-29 21:27:53'),(7122,'judge-event-evaluation-5993-1724930888',5993,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7579,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort Xavier, very cool. It would have been god to be much closer to your subject - this come across at first glance more like a scape. Also, be careful not to let it get washed out with the bright sky behind.\r\nKeep up the good work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:28:08','2024-08-29 21:28:08'),(7123,'judge-event-evaluation-5640-1724930956',5640,137,12,14,2,2024,160,'401',NULL,7806,4451,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Brooklyn it is great to see you get such an awesome shot.  This is a hard shot to get.  You can see the puffed up feathers.  I would have loved to have seen this picture cropped and edited as I think it would have come up well. \r\nRemember in future if you do edit to record all the processes you use.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:29:16','2024-08-29 21:29:16'),(7124,'judge-event-evaluation-12323-1724930983',12323,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7578,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Vanessa. You transformed the referenced image into a stunning piece of art. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:29:43','2024-08-29 21:29:43'),(7125,'judge-event-evaluation-5686-1724930989',5686,137,12,14,2,2024,190,'502',NULL,7887,4451,7455,17,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'I love the happy smile that you have created on this puppy\'s face!\r\nGood colours used. The dog looks soft and fluffy. I think that the grass needs a bit more brush definition to give the appearance of blades of grass.\r\nGood techniques used.\r\nKeep painting!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:29:49','2024-08-29 21:29:50'),(7126,'judge-event-evaluation-5948-1724931041',5948,137,12,14,2,2024,129,'321',NULL,7573,4451,7479,69,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Sophie!\r\nI think I\'d quite like your butterfly to have more of a white boarder - at the moment it is quite top right heavy.\r\nSo that you do not loose any points, don\'t forget to include your pattern with your report. And clean your fabric after you complete it. \r\nKeep developing your skills. :-)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:30:41','2024-08-29 21:30:41'),(7127,'judge-event-evaluation-5916-1724931045',5916,137,12,14,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7330,4451,6,17,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Phebe. This is an amazing sketch. Keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:30:45','2024-08-29 21:30:45'),(7128,'judge-event-evaluation-15346-1724931103',15346,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7806,4451,8425,2,'Collection','11',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Unusual subject.  The black and gold together are really nice.  I feel like a little more room either side of the machine might be nice ie a bit of background rather than it filling the whole photo.  You lost a few points for no enhancements. Overall a great effort.  Border colour choice sets photo off nicely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:31:43','2024-08-29 21:31:43'),(7129,'judge-event-evaluation-5927-1724931129',5927,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7327,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Savannah. You transformed the referenced image into a stunning piece of art. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:32:09','2024-08-29 21:32:10'),(7130,'judge-event-evaluation-5789-1724931143',5789,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7318,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort, Grace, thank you! contrast between the red and green is very striking. Just be careful with your flash, it is over exposed the wheel, and created harsh shadows behind it.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:32:23','2024-08-29 21:32:23'),(7131,'judge-event-evaluation-6259-1724931192',6259,175,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7902,6097,8439,2,'Open','11',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'A beautifil photo Elijah. You have done well with your colour wash and your frame colour. Nicely composed. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:33:12','2024-08-29 21:33:12'),(7133,'judge-event-evaluation-5951-1724931362',5951,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7573,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Sophie. Your portrayal of the lighthouse was pleasing to look at. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:36:02','2024-08-29 21:36:02'),(7134,'judge-event-evaluation-5811-1724931363',5811,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7316,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Holley. It would be good to experiment with angles, both to enhance the shape of the ramp, but also so that it doesn\'t blend in with the background (on the left) and lost definition.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:36:03','2024-08-29 21:36:03'),(7135,'judge-event-evaluation-5642-1724931381',5642,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7806,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Brooklyn. Your portrayal of the sheep in the field was pleasing to look at. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:36:21','2024-08-29 21:36:21'),(7136,'judge-event-evaluation-5813-1724931456',5813,137,12,14,2,2024,189,'501',NULL,7316,4451,7858,17,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'It was a delight to examine your watercolour, Holly. Your portrayal of the storm at sea was pleasing to look at. I pray you continue to use the artistic talents God has blessed you with.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:37:36','2024-08-29 21:37:36'),(7137,'judge-event-evaluation-5812-1724931459',5812,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7316,4451,8425,2,'Collection','11',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'I agree Holly that it looks much better portrait format.  Well done with cropping out all the extra background.   It is a different choice of subject that you don\'t see all the time so well done coming up with an original idea.  I feel like to get yourself some points for enhancement you could have maybe brightened up the colour or tried adding a filter.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:37:39','2024-08-29 21:37:39'),(7138,'judge-event-evaluation-6009-1724931691',6009,137,12,14,2,2024,202,'553',NULL,7733,4451,6,17,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Timothy. God has blessed you with an incredible artistic mind. Keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:41:31','2024-08-29 21:41:31'),(7139,'judge-event-evaluation-5876-1724931714',5876,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7328,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Luke! Interesting machine! Try to experiment with focal depth and angles to try and remove the background distractions.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:41:54','2024-08-29 21:41:54'),(7141,'judge-event-evaluation-5762-1724931787',5762,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7326,4451,7314,2,'Open','8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Chris you have taken a very in focus photo and your report you wrote covered all you needed too.  Well done.  I also liked the way you were thorough with your editing details.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:43:07','2024-08-29 21:43:07'),(7150,'judge-event-evaluation-12830-1724932390',12830,175,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7895,6097,8439,2,'Open','11',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'A great concept but difficult to execute. Your border colours enhance your photo nicely. The light prism is a significant distraction and cropping could have overcome this. You captured the splash itself well. Don\'t forget to identify your camera on the judges form. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 21:53:10','2024-08-29 21:53:10'),(7157,'judge-event-evaluation-5862-1724932833',5862,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7317,4451,8425,2,'Collection','11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'The flowers add to the photo and create some contrast to the black background.  They also balance out the white of the tambourine. Quite an eye catching photo.  Having more than one instrument in the picture holds your attention for longer while you investigate the detail.  Maybe a little too much light at the top of the photo but if doesn\'t detract from the overall affect of the photo.  I agree, portrait is better & cropping it was good choice.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:00:33','2024-08-29 22:00:33'),(7158,'judge-event-evaluation-5709-1724932833',5709,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7580,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Brooke, some great textures, and the framing is a good idea. However, you need to make sure that the wharf is the part in focus, as that is the subject, as opposed to the frame in the foreground.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:00:33','2024-08-29 22:00:33'),(7160,'judge-event-evaluation-6216-1724933138',6216,175,12,14,2,2024,100,'267',NULL,7901,6097,6,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'4.56 meters',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:05:38','2024-08-29 22:05:38'),(7161,'judge-event-evaluation-13152-1724933161',13152,175,12,14,2,2024,86,'237',NULL,7898,6097,6,NULL,'Collection',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'5.5 meters',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:06:01','2024-08-29 22:06:01'),(7162,'judge-event-evaluation-