NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:09:18','2024-08-29 22:09:18'),(7168,'judge-event-evaluation-5974-1724933380',5974,137,12,14,2,2024,42,'137',NULL,7325,4451,6,NULL,'Collection',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'7.80 meters',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:09:40','2024-08-29 22:09:40'),(7170,'judge-event-evaluation-5898-1724933582',5898,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7575,4451,8425,2,'Collection','11',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Very creative choice of subject.  It caught my attention because I was trying to decide what I was looking at.  I thought water, not sand and rocks.  It\'s a bit of a mystery photo and I like that.  There is an out of focus patch on the right, but I don\'t think it detracts from the artistic expression of the photo.  Apart from the slight bit of brown dirt it is almost a black & white photo, which is a nice change from all the coloured photos I\'ve looked at today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:13:02','2024-08-29 22:13:02'),(7173,'judge-event-evaluation-5669-1724933705',5669,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7885,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Indy, very warm! I like the perspective and orientation of the photo. However, the angles and lines are not quite right, between the end of the pews, the hanging lights, and the pulpit. When using a phone or tablet, remember that even if you are standing the middle, the lens is not.\r\nKeep practicing! God Bless!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:15:05','2024-08-29 22:15:05'),(7174,'judge-event-evaluation-6284-1724933739',6284,175,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7896,6097,8439,2,'Open','11',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'You have captured the evening light very well and your silhouettes accentuate its beauty. Your use of hard and soft lines is also effective. I would encourage you to start experimenting with different photographic effects to expand your creativity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:15:39','2024-08-29 22:15:39'),(7175,'judge-event-evaluation-6258-1724933759',6258,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7902,6097,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'A very quirky photo.  It is focused on the butt feathers of the bird and the dynamics are amazing.  it would have been good ig the tail feathers could have been a bit more in focus as well. You have cropped it well.   This is definitely a creative photo that shows originality and a certain degree of difficulty.  When doing enhancements note the degree of the enhancements e. g saturation + 5 etc.  Remember to mount on a backing board and a matt board or foam board to meet mounting criteria.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:15:59','2024-08-29 22:15:59'),(7176,'judge-event-evaluation-12065-1724933924',12065,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7574,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Oliver. Good perspective and shadows! It would be good to play with the colour settings more (like temperature and hue) to see if it can be warmed up. It is also a little over exposed.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good efforts! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:18:44','2024-08-29 22:18:44'),(7177,'judge-event-evaluation-5926-1724933991',5926,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7327,4451,8425,2,'Collection','11',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'The gold against the black is a nice combination.  It\'s an unusual subject which creates a bit of interest for the viewer while they figure out what they are looking at.  Good job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:19:51','2024-08-29 22:19:51'),(7179,'judge-event-evaluation-5655-1724934174',5655,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7886,4451,7314,2,'Open','8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Faith what an excellent job you have done of your report.  You have met all criteria for your report writing. It is good that you blurred the background.  Some of the wire coming through is distracting so I would have cropped that out.  This may have been a photo that would have benefited by being enlarged more to have more of an impact on the viewer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:22:54','2024-08-29 22:22:54'),(7180,'judge-event-evaluation-5736-1724934203',5736,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7324,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Charlie, love it! And black and white is great, makes it realy moody. Pro tip - shoot through an orange filter for black and white, it will really help the contrast, especially with the sky. Great choice of enhancements, really made a difference.\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:23:23','2024-08-29 22:23:23'),(7181,'judge-event-evaluation-5913-1724934353',5913,137,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7330,4451,8439,2,'Open','11',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A difficult subject to capture and you have done it well. The photo attached to your report appears to be the same as the final print so enhancements are not obvious and your mount doesn\'t add to your photos impact but a good shot nonetheless. The colour contrast is highly effective.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:25:53','2024-08-29 22:25:53'),(7184,'judge-event-evaluation-5994-1724934452',5994,137,12,14,2,2024,165,'406',NULL,7579,4451,8425,2,'Collection','11',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'I really like the contrast of the geometric pattern of the bricks against the more flowing shapes of the light. I feel having the lamp slightly off-centre would be more artistic.  Don\'t forget doing some enhancements will earn you some more points in that category.  Love the choice of blue for the border to match the sky.  Good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:27:32','2024-08-29 22:27:32'),(7185,'judge-event-evaluation-5938-1724934532',5938,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7329,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Sofia, great subject, and graet lines. Please remember to include your original proof, as well as docmenting your process. Also, experiment with different times of day to see what the light and shadows do.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:28:52','2024-08-29 22:28:52'),(7187,'judge-event-evaluation-6222-1724934752',6222,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7901,6097,7314,2,'Collection','8',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Nice magnolia.  I love the contrast of the Magnolia alone against the background of the buds.  The picture is soft but clear.   You have thought how to place your camera.  it would have been a great idea to perhaps crop your photo a little.  Remember to fill out your age category on your report. It is a wise decision to always take several photos.  When mountain remember to have a backing board and a mounting board.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:32:32','2024-08-29 22:32:32'),(7188,'judge-event-evaluation-5684-1724934765',5684,137,12,14,2,2024,161,'402',NULL,7887,4451,6960,2,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'I\'m so happy, I get to judge a car photo! Great work Isaac - difficult to capture a car while driving! It wolf be good to experiment with shutter speed - this will help it to be crystal clear without the grain. also, try not to make it too dark that you lose the details in the bumper and exhaust tips.\r\nKeep up the good work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:32:45','2024-08-29 22:32:45'),(7189,'judge-event-evaluation-5982-1724934924',5982,137,12,14,2,2024,178,'456',NULL,7325,4451,8439,2,'Open','11',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Your cropping has delivered a well focused piece. You have incorporated a good mix of textures. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:35:24','2024-08-29 22:35:24'),(7192,'judge-event-evaluation-6497-1724935265',6497,175,12,14,2,2024,116,'306',NULL,7894,6097,6960,62,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Kyan. I tried it on - it works, but it is a little small for me. :P\r\nIt is well made, solid, with no sharp edges, but I would love to see more from you, and more intricate work in future creations! Keep up the great work! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:41:05','2024-08-29 22:41:05'),(7194,'judge-event-evaluation-6371-1724935336',6371,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7898,6097,7314,2,'Open','8',100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Heidi,  I have a feeling this photo would have been more impressive as a larger photo.  It is nature but equally could have been added into the scenic category.  I believe the mounting though appropriate the colour choice needed to be pink and black or pink and white as there is too much pink.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:42:16','2024-08-29 22:42:16'),(7195,'judge-event-evaluation-5722-1724935564',5722,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7577,4451,8323,58,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Nice functional chair. \r\nPoints to note. \r\n1. Seat base recesses not even making seat base not flush with base sides. \r\n2. Front of one leg shows rough saw marks\r\n3. Uneven screw recesses in places. \r\n4. Additional brace not shown in plan',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:46:04','2024-08-29 22:46:04'),(7196,'judge-event-evaluation-5639-1724935658',5639,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7806,4451,8323,58,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Nice functional chair.\r\nPoints. \r\n1. Top of seat not recessed level on both sides, with one side of seat frame split.\r\n2. Inconsistent rebates for pivot points & where screws recessed into seat frame. \r\n3. Nice varnish coat for finish\r\n4. Felt like seat was tipping forward, not flat. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:47:38','2024-08-29 22:47:38'),(7198,'judge-event-evaluation-5784-1724935803',5784,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7318,4451,8323,58,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Nice Chair to sit on. \r\n1. Easy to fold into vertical storage position\r\n2. A couple of the seat screws could have been recessed deeper to prevent fouling on legs / back. \r\n3. A well presented entry',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:50:03','2024-08-29 22:50:03'),(7199,'judge-event-evaluation-5732-1724935816',5732,137,12,14,2,2024,112,'301',NULL,7324,4451,8323,58,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Nice functional chair\r\n1. Nice to sit on, felt comfortable. \r\n2. Screws holding slats to base could have been better recessed on one side. \r\n3. Easiest chair to slide to vertical storage position. \r\n4. Nicely finished and best presented entry. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:50:16','2024-08-29 22:50:16'),(7200,'judge-event-evaluation-6300-1724935822',6300,175,12,14,2,2024,135,'350',NULL,7897,6097,6960,57,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Zachariah, very well done. smooth, sturdy, i\'d display it in my home! However, if you are displaying anthing other than artifcial flowers, wood does not work great without some kind of lining, otherwise the wood will warp. it also is not a huge hole to fit a larger flower stem.\r\nBut, great job, keep it up! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:50:22','2024-08-29 22:50:22'),(7201,'judge-event-evaluation-11117-1724935845',11117,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7895,6097,7314,2,'Open','8',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Your description of how you came to your result is impressive as you actually put some thought into how you would frame a photo with the sun shining through.  The photo is slightly out of focus but it shows your creativity well.  Play around with the editing process and you may be able to enhance your photos more and crispen the images.  Always record what you do.  This was a very good subject.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:50:45','2024-08-29 22:50:45'),(7202,'judge-event-evaluation-6283-1724936181',6283,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7896,6097,7314,2,'Open','8',100,53.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Kyle, there is a lot of light getting into the image probably light reflection off of the water.  Also the focus is not so great.  Remember editing can enhance your photo so play around with these tools.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 22:56:21','2024-08-29 22:56:21'),(7203,'judge-event-evaluation-6205-1724936429',6205,175,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7900,6097,7314,2,'Open','8',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'This could have gone also in scenic.  It is showing a water feature yes and nature yes but you have not focused particularly on anything.  The foreground is more in focus.  In your report you do not tell me how you took the photo what made you choose the particular arrangement you did.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 23:00:29','2024-08-29 23:00:29'),(7204,'judge-event-evaluation-15951-1724936555',15951,175,12,14,2,2024,310,'954','2',0,6097,6,41,'Open',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. That was a great message and a needed one for\r\nthis generation. Defiantly would recommend performing this at a youth group or at a\r\nchurch service. Just a suggestion for improvement, some of Angelina\'s lines where a\r\nlittle quite which made it hard to hear. But other than that, well done and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 23:02:35','2024-08-29 23:02:35'),(7205,'judge-event-evaluation-5760-1724936561',5760,137,12,14,2,2024,136,'351',NULL,7326,4451,6960,58,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Chris, good try! There are a few things that have let you down because of lack of attention to detail (like the seat sagging at the back - which is simply a screw location), and the lack of finish.\r\nStill, it\'s a chair that works, and looks nice. Keep practicing! God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 23:02:41','2024-08-29 23:02:41'),(7206,'judge-event-evaluation-15952-1724936662',15952,175,12,14,2,2024,310,'954','3',0,6097,6,41,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done students. Just a few suggestions for future entries. Script memorization, voice projection as I was finding it just a little hard to hear some of the lines and sound effects which would add to your script. Well done and God Bless.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 23:04:22','2024-08-29 23:04:22'),(7207,'judge-event-evaluation-5912-1724936715',5912,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7330,4451,7314,2,'Open','8',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'The enhancement you have used brings a warmth to your picture. and you have recorded how you have edited in your report in detail well done.  The driveway is a man made structure and the trees really are not in focus so this may have been better categorised as a scenic shot rather than being put into the nature category.  When mounting remember you need to have a backing board and a mounting board.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 23:05:15','2024-08-29 23:05:15'),(7208,'judge-event-evaluation-6256-1724936907',6256,175,12,14,2,2024,136,'351',NULL,7902,6097,6960,58,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Elijah, very impressive... probably the most eye-catching piece in the room. A few rough patches, but real ships are like that i guess!\r\nGreat job. Keep it up!  God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-08-29 23:08:27','2024-08-29 23:08:27'),(7209,'judge-event-evaluation-6005-1724937153',6005,137,12,14,2,2024,173,'451',NULL,7733,4451,7314,2,'Open','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Timothy, you have the tree in focus.  The leaves creatively lead into and point into the tree.  But overall the tree does not stand out that well as the subject.  It is great that you have a full report and that you used your default software to enhance your photo.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N