ore creative.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:21:38','2024-09-17 21:21:38'),(7266,'judge-event-evaluation-17809-1726572311',17809,237,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,8142,5934,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Such a wonderful story.\r\nAlways check punctuation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:25:11','2024-09-17 21:25:11'),(7267,'judge-event-evaluation-5177-1726572740',5177,201,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,6969,1678,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Nice story.\r\n\r\nJust practice more. General appearance is important. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:32:20','2024-09-17 21:32:20'),(7269,'judge-event-evaluation-5171-1726573132',5171,201,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,6972,1678,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'It is really an interesting topic. \r\nHowever, your writing is more suitable for persuasive writing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:38:52','2024-09-17 21:38:52'),(7270,'judge-event-evaluation-17557-1726573568',17557,226,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8302,7991,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'There is a lot that you tried to pack into the story, which makes it underdeveloped. It would be better to really focus on building the tension and ensuring that the climax is effective. The punctuation and grammatical issues were quite evident. But good effort overall!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:46:08','2024-09-17 21:46:08'),(7271,'judge-event-evaluation-15016-1726573591',15016,237,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8149,5934,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'The idea for the story is great and overall interesting. The first half of the story was well-written, but as the story progressed, the execution could use more work, especially after revealing the twist. Some of the dialogue and drama did not feel grounded in reality. But overall, a great idea and a great story!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:46:31','2024-09-17 21:46:31'),(7272,'judge-event-evaluation-14151-1726573764',14151,119,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7585,392,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,-1.00,'Nice writing.\r\nThe storyline should not be the same as in the Bible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:49:24','2024-09-17 21:49:24'),(7273,'judge-event-evaluation-14615-1726574060',14615,119,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7884,392,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,-1.00,'What a meaningful story!\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:54:20','2024-09-17 21:54:20'),(7274,'judge-event-evaluation-17815-1726574356',17815,237,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8155,5934,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This is a great story! At first I wondered which direction you were going to take it - something like the Diary of Anne Frank or The Hiding Place? But I like how your plot diverged into something else. I wish there was more about the diary itself, but the way you incorporated the Bible was really natural and seamless. So overall - really excellent job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:59:16','2024-09-17 21:59:16'),(7275,'judge-event-evaluation-15013-1726574391',15013,237,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,8119,5934,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Nice story. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 21:59:51','2024-09-17 21:59:51'),(7276,'judge-event-evaluation-5173-1726574987',5173,201,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,7875,1678,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Such a good topic.\r\n\r\nPractice more!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:09:47','2024-09-17 22:09:47'),(7277,'judge-event-evaluation-17993-1726575585',17993,231,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,7920,1467,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,-1.00,'Wow! What a thrilling adventure you took us on in these pages! You did a great job at building tension throughout the story and the way you incorporated the Scripture was expertly done. Save from mechanical issues (punctuation, inconsistent formatting, etc), this was an excellent piece of fiction. Really, really well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:19:45','2024-09-17 22:19:45'),(7278,'judge-event-evaluation-18410-1726576068',18410,221,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,8241,1470,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,-3.00,'Nice story. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:27:48','2024-09-17 22:27:48'),(7279,'judge-event-evaluation-10522-1726576133',10522,104,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,7091,394,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,-1.00,'Focusing on the main tension distinction between the two characters would make this story much stronger. I think you could have conveyed Yabes\' flaws more efficiently, which would give you more room to develop the tension, climax, and subsequent resolution. The punctuation could be more neat. But overall, great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:28:53','2024-09-17 22:28:53'),(7280,'judge-event-evaluation-14446-1726576360',14446,119,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,7626,392,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,-1.00,'This is a great story of a journey to baptism! However, there is not a lot of progression to the plot itself. This reads more like an autobiography, rather than a short story. But you did a great job of writing the story - grammar, mechanics, etc were well done. Good effort overall!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:32:40','2024-09-17 22:32:40'),(7281,'judge-event-evaluation-15451-1726576480',15451,226,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,8221,7991,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,-2.00,'Wonderful story.\r\n\r\nPractice more, so you will improve your writing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:34:40','2024-09-17 22:34:40'),(7282,'judge-event-evaluation-15017-1726576620',15017,237,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,8147,5934,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Such a wonderful story!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:37:00','2024-09-17 22:37:00'),(7283,'judge-event-evaluation-17810-1726576743',17810,237,7,7,2,2024,7,'013',NULL,8098,5934,8289,7,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Such a wonderful journey of Salome!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:39:03','2024-09-17 22:39:03'),(7284,'judge-event-evaluation-17817-1726577157',17817,237,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8167,5934,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'This was a very enjoyable read. Although the plot is predictable, your writing keeps me going for more. You captured the adolescent experience really well - the anguish and worries. Really excellent job! I hope you keep writing :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 22:45:57','2024-09-17 22:45:57'),(7285,'judge-event-evaluation-17129-1726578054',17129,263,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8259,6328,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'You had a very exciting beginning to the story but I wish it had stayed consistent throughout. There were a lot of things happening to the protagonist and I think it would have been better if you spend more time exploring his experience in the cave - how did it transform him? How did it make it him feel? But overall, this was a great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:00:54','2024-09-17 23:00:54'),(7286,'judge-event-evaluation-18409-1726578677',18409,221,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8237,1470,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,-1.00,'A very interesting take on the story of Jephthah! The historical tone persisted throughout the story, which was a really good choice. Adding names might make this easier to follow because there was a lot of \'she\' and \'her\' throughout, which could make it hard to follow. The reveal of the twist could be smoother as well. But overall, a really great story!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:11:17','2024-09-17 23:11:17'),(7287,'judge-event-evaluation-15959-1726579201',15959,216,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,7975,2276,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,72.00,-10,-1.00,'The characters are very interesting and the plot is very sweet too - a nice tale of childhood friends. I think the tension was largely missing from the story. Showing us rather than telling us how the characters changed throughout would make this a stronger story. But good effort overall!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:20:01','2024-09-17 23:20:01'),(7290,'judge-event-evaluation-18127-1726579936',18127,263,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8260,6328,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,-1.00,'I enjoyed the characters and the straightforward way that you went about the plot. There could be more tension to reach the climax of the story, but overall - good effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:32:16','2024-09-17 23:32:16'),(7291,'judge-event-evaluation-17558-1726580228',17558,226,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8312,7991,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,-1.00,'You write so beautifully! Your prose was really something else - you captured the anguish, anxiety, frustration, and fear really well. There was some confusion - was it just Harlow taking a hike or was there a giant group? The pronoun switched from \'her\' to \'their\' at times. The evangelical, Biblical theme was not as explicit but I didn\'t mind this. But this was truly a beautifully written story on a theme that is not easy to explore. I thoroughly enjoyed this and was deeply moved by your work. Excellent job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:37:08','2024-09-17 23:37:08'),(7292,'judge-event-evaluation-17818-1726580378',17818,237,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8160,5934,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'This was a lovely story and the message was very clearly communicated. You write in a simple way that is very effective and pleasant to read. Really good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:39:38','2024-09-17 23:39:38'),(7293,'judge-event-evaluation-18298-1726580649',18298,213,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8231,3716,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,-1.00,'I was really intrigued by the idea for this - finding the best Immy is such a great way to set up the conflict for this story. But I think the story could use more development, especially in exploring the characters, how they feel, how they changed, and what they learned. More dialogue (as your teacher kindly suggested in the comments of this doc) would have helped with this. But overall, good effort! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:44:09','2024-09-17 23:44:09'),(7294,'judge-event-evaluation-17819-1726581045',17819,237,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,8161,5934,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Wow, what a story! This was really expertly done - the weaving of historical context and Biblical values. You showed (rather than tell) throughout the story and it made the story come to life. I thoroughly enjoyed this story and I hope you continue to write! Excellent job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:50:45','2024-09-17 23:50:45'),(7295,'judge-event-evaluation-10748-1726581301',10748,104,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,7501,394,8233,7,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'This was a really sweet story! And how nice that Austin got the help of the angel to ask the girl of his dreams. I enjoyed this. Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:55:01','2024-09-17 23:55:01'),(7296,'judge-event-evaluation-15955-1726581481',15955,216,7,7,2,2024,21,'063',NULL,7973,2276,8233,7,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,-1.00,'Wow, Janna went on a rollercoaster ride in this short story! I think it would have been more effective to focus more on Janna\'s point of transformation so that you can build the tension towards the climax of the story. But overall, good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-17 23:58:01','2024-09-17 23:58:01'),(7297,'judge-event-evaluation-17805-1726604096',17805,237,7,7,2,2024,20,'062',NULL,8149,5934,7888,6,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Really lovely poem',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL