LL,'There are several things you can improve in your performance. Before anything else, enthusiasm and clear diction of words are crucial to a performance, which in time you both can defintely inprove. As for paperwork, it is much preferable if you can find or create your own music sheet (with partitures, for vocal and guitar), stamped for adjudication.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:56:04','2024-09-20 17:56:04'),(7931,'judge-event-evaluation-5609-1726818993',5609,214,7,7,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,8005,5317,8520,69,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'The embroidery of the swan is beautiful and neat, however there are some loose thread ends which was not trimmed, making it look a little messy. The flowers are beautiful as well and done very neatly, with the verse below them. It is too bad that the color choice of the base cloth does not fit well with the swan image, as it makes the colors dull and look dirty. It would be better if the base color is lighter, to match the colorful threads. Overall, nice work and there is room for improvement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:56:33','2024-09-20 17:56:33'),(7933,'judge-event-evaluation-12036-1726819001',12036,221,7,7,2,2024,194,'506',NULL,8248,1470,8508,17,'Collection',NULL,100,63.00,-10,0.00,'You must be more confident with the lighting and gradation',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:56:41','2024-09-20 17:56:41'),(7934,'judge-event-evaluation-14344-1726819063',14344,257,7,7,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7386,4200,8520,69,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This is lovely artwork, which matches the Biblical view about being a new creation. The techniques used are complicated and I believe it is not easy to put them together this close. The choice of the color, however, would be nice if they choose a softer color to match the theme. Also, the edge of the frame is a bit chapped and there is no plastic as stated in the N&T Report plus there is no pattern submitted. Overall, great work and there is room for improvement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:57:43','2024-09-20 17:57:43'),(7935,'judge-event-evaluation-16709-1726819090',16709,223,7,7,2,2024,153,'371',NULL,7965,4927,8520,69,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'This is a beautiful artwork. The techniques used and the level of neat finishing are amazing! Great color choice as well. Too bad that the report did not mention any of the great techniques used here, and there are no pattern submitted. Overall, amazing work and there is room for improvement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:58:10','2024-09-20 17:58:10'),(7942,'judge-event-evaluation-7762-1726819150',7762,104,7,7,2,2024,304,'928',NULL,7501,394,7451,49,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Great delivery, however there are parts of your script that you missed. Memorize the script properly and don\'t use your own words. See you in the next student convention.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-20 17:59:10','2024-09-20 17:59:10'),(7944,'judge-event-evaluation-7762-1726819160',7762,104,7,7,2,2024,304,'928',NULL,7501,394,7373,49,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,