366,'656','1',0,7991,8283,21,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful permormance guys! You\'ve shown great fluency in your assigned roles and accompany each other with ease. There were several vocal intonations and phrasings that would\'ve performed better at certain conditions, such as the use of better dynamics and negative spaces. As for the paperwork, next time please print the notations horizontally, so you won\'t waste huge amounts of papers. Also don\'t forget stamp of adjudication!\r\n\r\nN: group 1402',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-21 17:56:54','2024-09-21 17:56:54'),(9226,'judge-event-evaluation-18159-1726905452',18159,226,7,7,2,2024,366,'656','2',0,7991,8283,21,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great job guys! The main thing you need to improve is your confidence, and everything else will stem from it. For both the vocals and instrumentation, learn how to use dynamics, variations, and balance between each other, so that it doesn\'t sound monotonous and avoiding the sounds to compete with each other. All of this will come to you in time.\r\n\r\nN: group 1401',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-21 17:57:32','2024-09-21 17:57:32'),(9227,'judge-event-evaluation-10914-1726905459',10914,213,7,7,2,2024,120,'310',NULL,8229,3716,7485,54,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Your craftwork is good and eyecatching Audrey, however please add the plastic cover next SC ya. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-21 17:57:39','2024-09-21 17:57:39'),(9228,'judge-event-evaluation-18994-1726905489',18994,119,7,7,2,2024,5,'009'