til the end of the speech. One thing to note is when you walk to the left side of the room. You don\'t have to walk that far. All the best. See you in the next student convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-21 18:17:48','2024-09-21 18:17:48'),(9286,'judge-event-evaluation-18263-1726906715',18263,226,7,7,2,2024,211,'601','1',0,7991,8283,20,'Collection','21',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great use of negative space and piano work. While it\'s simplistic in nature, you can improve in the vocal dynamics, so that it can lift the tone of the performance. And next time don\'t forget the adjudication stamps for the music sheets! Well done, girls!\r\n\r\nN: group 1402',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-21 18:18:35','2024-09-21 18:18:35'),(9289,'judge-event-evaluation-19119-1726906740',19119,216,7,7,2,2024,325,'974',NULL,7973,2276,7453,45,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-21 18:19:00','2024-09-21 18:19:00'),(9290,'judge-event-evaluation-18154-1726906749',18154,226,7,7,2,2024,211,'601','2',0,7991,8283,20,'Collection','21',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'What you both lack in technique, you excelled in bringing attention to your performance. It was an engaging performance and demonstrated proper management of energy and excitement in your performance. You can most definitely work on your techniques later on. Well done! \r\n\r\nN: group 1401',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,