9-22 14:25:50','2024-09-22 14:25:50'),(10215,'judge-event-evaluation-19092-1726979150',19092,257,7,7,2,2024,352,'871','1',0,4200,8283,34,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,-1.00,'I commend you for your presentation and composure! (especially the usage of guitar, quite uncommon!). Your cheerfulness were conveyed through your expressions. Although there were a couple notes that couldn\'t quite reach the higher register, you still did splendidly well. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 14:25:50','2024-09-22 14:25:50'),(10216,'judge-event-evaluation-16873-1726979153',16873,104,7,7,2,2024,319,'964',NULL,7098,394,8233,49,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Obama is very charismatic in his delivery so it is commendable that you chose this iconic speech to perform. You have a great handle of the text and have clearly practiced a lot. What would have really improved this speech would have been to see more of that simmering passion underneath the calm voice that we can hear in Obama\'s delivery. If you practice speaking more firmly and confidently, it will lend conviction to the performance. But truly... great job on performing this speech. You did it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 14:25:53','2024-09-22 14:25:53'),(10217,'judge-event-evaluation-16873-1726979159',16873,104,7,7,2,2024,319,'964',NULL,7098,394,7451,49,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Good delivery for the speech. Don\'t be nervous, and practice more or the body gestures, positioning, and facial expression. You maintain good eye contact with the he judges until the end.  Always practice and give your best. See you in the next student convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU