aluation-18162-1726983015',18162,226,7,7,2,2024,353,'870','1',0,7991,8283,34,'Open','27',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Great enthusiasm and energy you guys! Definitely improved a lot since I last saw your practice at school, especially in the dynamics and expression of the performance. Regrettably, a certain someone missjudged a cue during the performance :D\r\n\r\nBut don\'t worry, you all did wonderfully!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:30:15','2024-09-22 15:30:15'),(10347,'judge-event-evaluation-8362-1726983051',8362,237,7,7,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,8102,5934,7485,64,'Collection',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'You’ve done an excellent job creating balance and smoothness in this piece.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:30:51','2024-09-22 15:30:51'),(10348,'judge-event-evaluation-6969-1726983075',6969,119,7,7,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7623,392,8233,43,'Open','25',100,70.00,-10,-0.50,'The script should have been written entirely by you. But we awarded half marks for editing the script. You improvised a lot of your monologue, which was a shame. This script is unique and very fitting to someone your age. There was potential for this to be a great monologue. Try again next year and practice more!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:31:15','2024-09-22 15:31:15'),(10350,'judge-event-evaluation-6969-1726983157',6969,119,7,7,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7623,392,7451,43,'Open','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance of your dramatic monologue. Please read the guidelines. The script is based on your own creativity, thus originality is important. Maintain good eye contact as well with other judges. Always practice and give your best. See you in the next student convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:32:37','2024-09-22 15:32:37'),(10351,'judge-event-evaluation-9588-1726983200',9588,237,7,7,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,8103,5934,7485,64,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Your design feels both thoughtful and beautifully executed. Good job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:33:20','2024-09-22 15:33:20'),(10352,'judge-event-evaluation-6969-1726983244',6969,119,7,7,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7623,392,7373,43,'Open','25',100,78.00,-10,-0.50,'Agatha performed well for her monologue.\r\nHowever she needs to create her original script.\r\nWell done, Agatha!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:34:04','2024-09-22 15:34:04'),(10353,'judge-event-evaluation-7106-1726983265',7106,119,7,7,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7615,392,8233,43,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'The script should have been written entirely by you. This was a tough monologue to do with how fast Martha speaks, which is a central part of the characterisation. The broom was a great prop, however, the sound of the sweeping was too loud and made it difficult for us to hear your voice clearly. Added the fact that the words per minute pace of Martha is high, it could be difficult to follow in parts. However, you did a great job portraying the frittering nervousness of Martha. Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:34:25','2024-09-22 15:34:25'),(10354,'judge-event-evaluation-7106-1726983284',7106,119,7,7,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7615,392,7451,43,'Open','25',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great delivery for your dramatic monologue. One point to be prepared is your pace of delivery. You memorized the script nicely, however when you speak too fast, there are words can\'t be heard clearly. Great body movement and gestures, more facial expression. All the best never give up trying your best. See you in the next student convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:34:44','2024-09-22 15:34:44'),(10355,'judge-event-evaluation-7106-1726983322',7106,119,7,7,2,2024,322,'971',NULL,7615,392,7373,43,'Open','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Chelsea was good at presenting the monologue. Yet she needs to improve her articulation and the costume that she wore wasn\'t really in the theme.\r\nOverall were good. Good work, Chelsea!\r\nScript must originally create.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:35:22','2024-09-22 15:35:22'),(10356,'judge-event-evaluation-9713-1726983324',9713,237,7,7,2,2024,118,'308',NULL,8113,5934,7485,64,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Your design feels both thoughtful and hardwork.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 15:35:24','2024-09-22 15:35:24'),(10359,'judge-event-evaluation-13625-1726983406',13625,226,7,7,2,2024,323,'972',NULL,8311,7991,8499,44,'Open','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N