claim. Put more time and effort into researching evidence to support your arguments, and this essay could be really strong.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 21:17:47','2024-09-22 21:17:47'),(11073,'judge-event-evaluation-18405-1727004219',18405,221,7,7,2,2024,19,'061',NULL,8253,1470,8233,5,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'There were a lot claims made in this essay that were not supported with any evidence, which weakens the argument and makes the persuasion less effective. Add more support (statistics, data, quotes, etc) so that readers have a reason to believe the claims that you have made about Italy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 21:23:39','2024-09-22 21:23:39'),(11074,'judge-event-evaluation-13430-1727004299',13430,226,7,7,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,8303,7991,8534,12,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Keep up the good work, Audrey !! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 21:24:59','2024-09-22 21:24:59'),(11075,'judge-event-evaluation-13498-1727004429',13498,226,7,7,2,2024,168,'412',NULL,8304,7991,8534,12,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'You choose too lower opacity that make the illustration of the man praying is not clearly enough. Over all is very good.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-09-22 21:27:09','2024-09-22 21:27:09'),(11076,'judge-event-evaluation-18591-1727004709',18591,104,7,7,2,2024,191,'503',NULL,7494,394,7485,17,'Collection',NULL,100,9