28308880',18826,231,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','1',0,1467,6,4,'Open','20',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'This was an amazing presentation Joel. Learnt so much about your school and love the mission and vision for the school which I believe is very important. Your entry is well suited for Linear Power. Well done, keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-07 23:48:00','2024-10-07 23:48:00'),(12801,'judge-event-evaluation-18718-1728309037',18718,237,7,7,2,2024,183,'464','1',0,5934,5,4,'Open','19',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful presentation! Very engaging. \r\nThe only thing I would like to see is the referencing throughout, when you make a statement of fact, where are you getting the information from? Having in text references makes your information more reliable. \r\nGreat work, thank you for your submission. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-07 23:50:37','2024-10-07 23:50:37'),(12804,'judge-event-evaluation-18716-1728310061',18716,237,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','1',0,5934,6,4,'Open','20',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Darren. This was a great presentation on the Cook Inlet Belugas. Some suggestions for future entries. The main heading on some of the slides were formatted over the information which made it  a little difficult to read. Also next time, please insert intext references. Other then that, well done and I look forward to seeing future entries at the next convention. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:07:41','2024-10-08 00:07:41'),(12806,'judge-event-evaluation-14612-1728310439',14612,119,7,7,2,2024,183,'464','1',0,392,5,4,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for a great presentation! Very engaging and fun way to learn the Ten Commandments. I just needed a little more time to read the information. \r\nNext time, please include in text references and a complete bibliography. \r\nThis helps your information appear more reliable. \r\nAlso, be mindful of where you are getting your quotes from. W.C. Fields quote does not align with the Bible. \r\nGreat work! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:13:59','2024-10-08 00:13:59'),(12807,'judge-event-evaluation-18321-1728310535',18321,216,7,7,2,2024,183,'464','1',0,2276,5,4,'Open','19',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful presentation! It was lovely to learn about your school through your PowerPoint. Next time, have someone read through your presentation to make sure you have allocated enough time to read each slide. I often didn\'t finish the information before it moved on. \r\nPlease include in text references and a bibliography next time also. \r\nGreat work, well done and thank you for your submission. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:15:35','2024-10-08 00:15:35'),(12808,'judge-event-evaluation-14984-1728310758',14984,119,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','1',0,392,6,4,NULL,'20',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Agatha. Well done on your presentation. I feel your entry is well suited for Linear PowerPoint. Well done, and I look forward to seeing future entries. God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:19:18','2024-10-08 00:19:18'),(12809,'judge-event-evaluation-15497-1728310846',15497,119,7,7,2,2024,183,'464','2',0,392,5,4,'Open','19',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Very well designed presentation! Unfortunately, it has breached guidelines for depicting weapons. \r\nNext time, check the guidelines and also make sure you include in text references and a bibliography.\r\nThis was very informative and engaging. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:20:46','2024-10-08 00:20:46'),(12810,'judge-event-evaluation-14985-1728311188',14985,119,7,7,2,2024,183,'464','3',0,392,5,4,'Open','19',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for a great presentation! \r\nMake sure you allocate enough time for the audience to read all of your information. You also have some lovely images, you want to allow enough time for the audience to read and then look at your images to appreciate your hard work. \r\nAlso, please make sure you include in text references and a bibliography next time. \r\nGreat job, thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:26:28','2024-10-08 00:26:29'),(12811,'judge-event-evaluation-18720-1728311502',18720,237,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','2',0,5934,6,4,NULL,'20',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Samuel. Thank you for your research and presentation. Keep up the great work and I look forward to seeing more entries at the next convention. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:31:42','2024-10-08 00:31:42'),(12812,'judge-event-evaluation-18301-1728311641',18301,237,7,7,2,2024,183,'464','2',0,5934,5,4,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Very well done and creative presentation! \r\nUnfortunately, the weapons in the video breach the guidelines, and I think this PowerPoint is better suited to the Non-Linear category. \r\nThis was very informative and engaging. Thank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:34:01','2024-10-08 00:34:01'),(12813,'judge-event-evaluation-18322-1728312506',18322,216,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','2',0,2276,6,4,'Open','20',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry Violet and Jocelyn but I think your entry is suited for Linear PowerPoint. Keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 00:48:26','2024-10-08 00:48:27'),(12815,'judge-event-evaluation-15498-1728313454',15498,119,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','3',0,392,6,4,'Open','20',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Metra. Thank you for sharing your presentation on NAVIDA. For future entries, please provide Bibliography and Credits links included in your presentation. Keep up the great work and God Bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2024-10-08 01:04:14','2024-10-08 01:04:14'),(12816,'judge-event-evaluation-14185-1728313465',14185,119,7,7,2,2024,184,'465','2',0,392,6,4,'Open','20',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Mazmur. Thank you for your presentation on childhood education. I do believe that it is important to start from a young age but to also take the time, and let the child develop at their own pace just like the A.C.E Pace\'s. Keep up the great work and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU