499,344,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,7731,55,7759,59,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Report is neither signed nor dated and there is no physical work submitted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 08:34:02','2025-06-23 08:34:02'),(12854,'judge-event-evaluation-21273-1750631679',21273,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7700,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Arielle,\r\n\r\nA beautiful shot you took there. Thank you for your entry.  Just remember that in your next entry, there should not be any distractions around the subject. In your case, the tree on the side is a distraction to the whole scape view.Also, make sure to write down the step by step of how you came down to the final product. Again thank you Arielle!.. There is always room for improvement. All the best for convention. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 08:34:39','2025-06-23 08:34:39'),(12856,'judge-event-evaluation-21743-1750631804',21743,344,16,11,3,2025,112,'301',NULL,7707,55,7549,58,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. The idea put in place looks difficult but your effort have shown your line of interest. Please keep up the good work. Dont give up and continue to improve in your work of art. Keep it up!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 08:36:44','2025-06-23 08:36:44'),(12857,'judge-event-evaluation-21518-1750631807',21518,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7694,55,7863,2,'Open','8',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kolinio for your submission. \r\nJust few things for you to take note of: \r\n1. Initial impression- could have taken the picture abit far so the focus are on the trees.\r\n2. Originality- This picture is very common. Next time you can only focus only on the trees or the wildlife. \r\n3. Creativity- Use techniques to make the photo stand out. \r\n4. Composition- theres no rule of thirds, theres alot of distracting elements.\r\n5. Sensible use of enhancements- use the photo app software appropriately (the color was not enough) \r\n\r\nOther than that, thank you again for the effort. \r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 08:36:47','2025-06-23 08:36:47'),(12858,'judge-event-evaluation-21192-1750631845',21192,347,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,8795,5806,7755,2,'Open','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the submission.\r\nThank you so much for your lovely work! The photo is beautiful and really shows your creativity. You just need to improve only on the picture if it can be focusedOverall, the picture is truly wonderful—great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 08:37:25','2025-06-23 08:37:25'),(12862,'judge-event-evaluation-21642-1750632267',21642,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7778,55,7755,2,'Open','8',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your lovely work! \r\nThe photo is beautiful and really shows your creativity. You just need to improve only on setting your photo focused and also to avoid other distractions.. Overall, the picture is truly wonderful—great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 08:44:27','2025-06-23 08:44:27'),(12863,'judge-event-evaluation-20317-175063229