etter your entry in the future. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:03:46','2025-06-23 11:03:46'),(12992,'judge-event-evaluation-21167-1750640726',21167,347,16,11,3,2025,172,'450',NULL,7274,5806,8884,2,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:05:26','2025-06-23 11:05:26'),(12994,'judge-event-evaluation-21640-1750640802',21640,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,8865,55,7863,2,'Open','8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Collin for the submission. You took a gerat shot of the hibiscus flower. My first time to see a white hibiscus flower though. \r\nJust a few things for you to consider while taking  a picture:\r\n1. Creativity: you could use a different colour board to make the photo stand out. \r\n2. Composition: the flower is the focus so the flower has to be in the center of the picture. There were few distracting elements I could pick out (leaves, pot plants and other flowers). The distracting elements could be blurred or if that could be cropped out. \r\n\r\nOther than that, you did a great job Collin. Keep it up.\r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:06:42','2025-06-23 11:06:42'),(12995,'judge-event-evaluation-21309-1750640855',21309,344,16,11,3,2025,112,'301',NULL,7642,55,7549,58,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and effort towards your entry. Future referrence dont forget to submit your plan with the report. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,