ox. To enhance your poster, please consider adjusting the font size and placement so that the message stands out clearly without taking away from the image.\r\nGood effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:15:56','2025-06-23 11:15:56'),(13012,'judge-event-evaluation-21466-1750641385',21466,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7698,55,8703,12,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and continue with your creativity.\r\n\r\nFor future reference, refer to the guidelines and shorten your text.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:16:25','2025-06-23 11:16:25'),(13016,'judge-event-evaluation-21524-1750641442',21524,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7743,55,7755,2,'Open','8',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your lovely work! The photo is beautiful and really shows your creativity. \r\nYou just need to improve only on making sure that your picture is focused only on your important event  and photo only.\r\nAvoid all distraction of your photos apart from your main emphasis.\r\nOverall, the picture is truly wonderful—great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:17:22','2025-06-23 11:17:22'),(13017,'judge-event-evaluation-20269-1750641455',20269,346,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8709,4208,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Shekinah. Yout poster has visual balance,and the colors work really well together - good job choosing an eye catching image. One thing to think about for next time is making sure the image connects clearly with your message, so they support each other. You\'ve definitely shown great potential - keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:17:35','2025-06-23 11:17:35'),(13018,'judge-event-evaluation-21121-1750641487',21121,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8823,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,55.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Shanaya. While it\'s great to see you thinking aout how to support your message with an image, please consider using more colorful visuals to grab attention and make your poster stand out.\r\nAlso, remember to properly cite where your image comes from if it\'s taken from the web - as this is an important part of being a responsible digital creator.\r\nOther than that, good effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:18:07','2025-06-23 11:18:07'),(13019,'judge-event-evaluation-21557-1750641512',21557,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7725,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Taake. It is a visually appealing poster! The AI-generated image is beautifully done and pairs really well with the BIble Verse chosen. To make your message even more impactful, consider using a font color that stands out more clearly against the background.\r\nGood job overall!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:18:32','2025-06-23 11:18:32'),(13021,'judge-event-evaluation-21205-1750641571',21205,347,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7817,5806,8802,12,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done on your digitally created poster Taitusi! You\'ve clearly put great thought into the image and overall design - its creative and original. Excellent use of Canva to bring your ideas to life. To take it even further, please try and improve on the quality of image and artwork for a more polished finished. Good effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:19:31','2025-06-23 11:19:31'),(13022,'judge-event-evaluation-21232-1750641763',21232,347,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,7272,5806,7759,59,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'What a beautiful idea you have! I believe that there is room for you to grow in this and one day you will be the best in it. I think the bottom of the heart is a bit too sharp, and the lower  inside of the heart can still be perfected. I wish you all the best and pray that you will become the best on this one day. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:22:43','2025-06-23 11:22:43'),(13023,'judge-event-evaluation-21648-1750641777',21648,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7735,55,7863,2,'Open','8',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Tyrone for your submission. I would love to visit the waterfall someday judging from the picture you took. \r\nJust something you have to consider while taking a picture:\r\n1. Creativity: Use a different color board to help stand out the picture. \r\n2. Composition: there are a lot of distracting elements (waterfall, rocks, people, flowers and trees) What is your main focus of the picture? Is it the trees or the waterfall? What your focus is that should be the center of the picture.\r\n3. Sensible use of enhancements: there were not enough of colour that was added to the picture.\r\nOther than that, thank you for the effort Tyrone.\r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:22:57','2025-06-23 11:22:57'),(13025,'judge-event-evaluation-20281-1750641851',20281,346,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8713,4208,8703,12,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and continue with your creativity.\r\n\r\nFor future reference, refer to guideline and improve on your font size and image.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:24:11','2025-06-23 11:24:11'),(13026,'judge-event-evaluation-21610-1750641878',21610,344,16,11,3,2025,18,'060','2',0,55,7756,9,'Open','1',100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:24:38','2025-06-23 11:24:39'),(13027,'judge-event-evaluation-21185-1750641883',21185,347,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7249,5806,7755,2,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your lovely work! The photo is beautiful and really shows your creativity. \r\nYou just need to improve on making sure that your photo is focused on your main emphasis and avoid other distractions out from your pictures and final submission.\r\nOverall, the picture is truly wonderful—great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 11:24:43','2025-06-23 11:24:43'),(13030,'judge-event-evaluation-21296-1750643303',21296,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7715,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Timoci. The image of sunset is stunning and draws the viewer in with its warm 