n your documentation and lightning to make your picture bright and stand out.\r\nMatting Board and window really complements your picture so well.\r\n Overall, the picture is truly wonderful—great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:04:57','2025-06-23 12:04:57'),(13038,'judge-event-evaluation-21627-1750644340',21627,344,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,7796,55,7759,59,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'You have taken this to another level and blessed many as you grow in your God-given talent. What a Blessing! Your choice of wood is a problem since it is manufactured wood which is not allowed according to the guidelines. However, you did a great work and I am sure you have inspired many to venture into discovering their talent. Thank you for your great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:05:40','2025-06-23 12:05:40'),(13040,'judge-event-evaluation-20242-1750644439',20242,346,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7558,4208,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Yuvaan. \r\nThe image of the frangipani is visually appealing. The Bible Verse chosen is meaningful on its own, thought it doesn\'t quite relate to the image.\r\nWith a little more connection between the image and the message, this could be more impactful.\r\nStill a lovely effort - good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:07:19','2025-06-23 12:07:19'),(13041,'judge-event-evaluation-20270-1750644500',20270,346,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7204,4208,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for c