 the picture could stand out. Theres alot of brightness and contrast on the picture that didn\'t bring out the natural colour of the picture. \r\n\r\nOther than that, thank you for your great effort Joshua. \r\nKind regards .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:21:08','2025-06-23 12:21:08'),(13059,'judge-event-evaluation-21103-1750645368',21103,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,8811,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Bula David,\r\n\r\nThank you for submitting a beautiful beach scape. Few things to take note of for your next convention.\r\n1. Make sure there is no distraction in your picture.\r\n2. Make sure to write the same name in your report form as well as on your item..\r\n3. Make sure to keep the focus on your subject.\r\n\r\nVinaka David and all the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:22:48','2025-06-23 12:22:48'),(13060,'judge-event-evaluation-21243-1750645453',21243,344,16,11,3,2025,112,'301',NULL,8830,55,7549,58,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for submitting your art work. A few areas that need improvement. You can balance the sides, making sure it is sitting on a straight angle. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:24:13','2025-06-23 12:24:13'),(13061,'judge-event-evaluation-21644-1750645463',21644,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7686,55,7863,2,'Open','8',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Great shot Joon! Just something that is missing from your presentation of the picture, the color of the board could have been other color except white (to make the photo stand out). Other than that, great effort Joon. \r\nKind regards.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:24:23','2025-06-23 12:24:23'),(13062,'judge-event-evaluation-21522-1750645469',21522,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7721,55,8884,2,'Collection','8',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:24:29','2025-06-23 12:24:29'),(13063,'judge-event-evaluation-21061-1750645545',21061,344,16,11,3,2025,112,'301',NULL,8813,55,7861,58,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome work Emosi. Plan was not submitted',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 12:25:45','2025-06-23 12:25:45'),(13064,'judge-event-evaluation-21440-1750645586',21440,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7676,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission Jessira. Few things you need to take note of:\r\n1. Make sure when taking a picture,the photo has to be of a good and clear shot. It should not be blurry.\r\n2. Do not zoom in too much because it will spoil the clear outcome of the photo,causing it to blur.\r\n3. There should not be any distractions in the photo. For example,the boats.  \r\n4. Attach a soft copy of your picture for any photography event.                                                                                                         \r\nThank you again and all the best for convention. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2