an improve on this by your right choice of material which has a lot of impact on your score. Also,  taking more and enough time to work on your piece will give more chances of seeing bits that can be improved. Keep on trying and be the best! Thanks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 14:17:58','2025-06-23 14:17:58'),(13224,'judge-event-evaluation-21819-1750652296',21819,356,16,11,3,2025,159,'400',NULL,8878,4678,7843,2,NULL,'7',100,0.00,-10,0.00,'Brilliant photographic skills displayed. How it is placed and the lighting generally brings the vibrant colors of the subject out. How it matches with wall and the frame dispays understanding of color. All things considered, I do encourage you to fill in for the correct event next time. Thank you for submitting this greatness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 14:18:16','2025-06-30 20:02:44'),(13228,'judge-event-evaluation-21416-1750652389',21416,344,16,11,3,2025,159,'400',NULL,7657,55,7843,2,'Collection','7',100,95.00,-10,0.00,'The subjects eyes shows curiosity. The background blends well with the exposure and composition is well chosen here. Moreover, the focus on her face is remarkable as it bring out her eyes behind the blurred Celosia. Its framing also is well aligned.  Please make sure to fill in the correct settings for manual photography next time. Nevertheless, thank you for your efforts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-23 14:19:49','2025-06-23 14:19:49'),(13229,'judge-event-evaluation-21182-1750652405',21182,347,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7817,5806,8702,2,'