1642-1750716999',21642,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7778,55,7863,2,'Open','8',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission Eunchong. \r\nThere are few things that you have to considere while taking a photo:\r\n1. Composition: the photo looked like it was zoomed in and it made the photo looked abit blured. Next time, please take a proper close picture. \r\n2. Focus: the focus is the bird, so the rest of the distracting elements (flowers, branches, coconut trees) are to be blurred or be cropped out. \r\n3. Lighting, Colour: please use the appopriate amount.\r\n4. Creativity: you could use a different colour matting board to complement the picture. \r\nOther than that, thank you for your effort. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 08:16:39','2025-06-24 08:16:39'),(13361,'judge-event-evaluation-21093-1750717055',21093,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8816,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 08:17:35','2025-06-24 08:17:35'),(13362,'judge-event-evaluation-21348-1750717183',21348,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7661,55,8802,12,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Nivaan. Your poster shows a lovely visual balance with the beautiful photo of a bouganvillea flower.\r\nJust a note for next time - please make sure your image connects clearly with your message (or Bible Verse).\r\nYouve shown great potential - good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 08:19:43','2025-06-24 08:19:43'),(13363,'judge-event-evaluation-21402-1750717212',21402,344,16,