n as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. you must explain why you chose the subject.\r\n3. Make sure that you fill in every required blank in the report form.\r\n\r\nThank you again Marisa. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 08:34:12','2025-06-24 08:34:13'),(13389,'judge-event-evaluation-21400-1750718081',21400,344,16,11,3,2025,113,'302',NULL,7654,55,7759,59,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'You made a very good choice with starting off with a simple design and you did a good job. \r\nReminder: 1. Read your guidelines\r\n                    2. Make a clear report of your work.\r\n                     3. Make the subject clear\r\n Thank you for your work and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 08:34:41','2025-06-24 08:34:41'),(13390,'judge-event-evaluation-21636-1750718269',21636,344,16,11,3,2025,172,'450',NULL,7692,55,7843,2,'Open','7',100,100.00,-10,0.00,'A beautiful picture! You have a great eye for composition and for detail. The focus on the subject , especially on the red flower as there is alot of white, is impressive! I would suggest, however, that as you continue with photography, try to have as little to no distractions in the background to complete  the overall look which you have achieved. All in all, great work Francine!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 08:37:49','2025-06-24 08:37:49'),(13395,'judge-event-evaluation-21260-1750718384',21260,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7708,55,8884,2,'Collection','8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU