-24 09:11:48','2025-06-24 09:11:48'),(13435,'judge-event-evaluation-21046-1750720449',21046,344,16,11,3,2025,4,'005','3',0,55,8800,1,'Collection','1',100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You\'ve done an excellent job collecting and displaying a wide variety of seashells. To enhance the scientific quality of your project, consider adding short descriptions for each shell that include its name, habitat, or classification. Additionally, upon closer review, some shells were found to be labeled incorrectly, so checking the accuracy of names is important. I kindly hope that in the future, you will take these things into consideration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:14:09','2025-06-24 09:14:09'),(13436,'judge-event-evaluation-21304-1750720498',21304,344,16,11,3,2025,193,'505',NULL,8832,55,7761,17,'Collection',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'The report submitted is not accurate and lacked detailed information. The artwork is too simple and lacked depth. There was not much creativity shown. There also was no proper blending of color. The artwork must show that colors build gradually. There was no hanger inserted in the frame hence, no point was given.\r\n However, I do applaud you for your effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:14:58','2025-06-24 09:14:58'),(13437,'judge-event-evaluation-21749-1750720579',21749,344,16,11,3,2025,4,'005','5',0,55,8800,1,'Collection','1',100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. This is a neatly displayed seed collection, and it\'s great to see the inclusion of scientific names and harvest times. To improve the presentation, consider using a darker pen for labeling to make the text more readable, and work on improving handwriting for better clarity. I kindly hope that in the future, you will take these things into consideration.  Overall, a good effort with a strong foundation. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:16:19','2025-06-24 09:16:19'),(13442,'judge-event-evaluation-21425-1750720638',21425,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8850,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:17:18','2025-06-24 09:17:18'),(13443,'judge-event-evaluation-21483-1750720664',21483,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7650,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Try to avoid using rules or outline your sketching. Free hand with more details added with bring out the depth in your picture. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:17:44','2025-06-24 09:17:44'),(13447,'judge-event-evaluation-21443-1750720744',21443,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8849,55,7766,2,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'you\'re on the right track! regular practice will enhance your skills overtime.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:19:04','2025-06-24 09:19:04'),(13452,'judge-event-evaluation-21424-1750720978',21424,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7658,55,7863,2,'Open','8',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jorge for your submission. Thank you for taking the picture! You did a good job, but there\'s still room for improvement in areas like lighting, color, focus, and capturing strong first impressions. Keep practicing, and you\'ll see great progress!\r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:22:58','2025-06-24 09:22:58'),(13455,'judge-event-evaluation-21342-1750721017',21342,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7647,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Tabitha,\r\n\r\nThank you for your submission. Things to take note for in your next convention.\r\n1. a step by step procedure should be written as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. you must explain why you chose the subject.\r\n3. Make sure that there are no distractions before you take the photo.\r\n4. Every photo must have a centralize subject with a clear focus.\r\n5.Try and take photos during broad daylight because it\'s clear and will give the best lighting and exposure as well.\r\n\r\nThank you again Tabitha. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:23:37','2025-06-24 09:23:37'),(13456,'judge-event-evaluation-21141-1750721023',21141,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8821,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You have follow the guidelines really well. More practice the better. You have develop the skills and you can go beyond. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 09:23:43','2025-06-24 09:23:43'),(13457,'judge-event-evaluation-21314-1750721033',21314,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,7646,55,7861,64,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Samyra, you have pushed the boun