rded. The creativity shown in this artwork was well presented. Good Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:06:10','2025-06-24 10:06:10'),(13493,'judge-event-evaluation-20994-1750723571',20994,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,8805,55,7861,64,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:06:11','2025-06-24 10:06:11'),(13495,'judge-event-evaluation-21194-1750723711',21194,347,16,11,3,2025,172,'450',NULL,7252,5806,7843,2,'Open','7',100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Tubu! You chose well with the calm background and dark frame as it gives more focus to the subject. Overall, your potrait demonstrates a  strong sense of harmony and composition. Thank you for your efforts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:08:31','2025-06-24 10:08:31'),(13496,'judge-event-evaluation-21353-1750723805',21353,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7665,55,NULL,17,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'The sketch feels balanced with trees. Draws the viewer into the forest.\r\nSome aspect could have been drawn on the sky and show which time of day.  Good Job!\r\nKeep up the creative effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:10:05','2025-06-24 10:10:05'),(13498,'judge-event-evaluation-21457-1750723893',21457,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,8847,55,8871,2,'Collection','11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Joren Liao. The picture quality is beautiful and well focused, just improve on your mounting(ensure that measurements are accurate on all sides). ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:11:33','2025-06-24 10:11:33'),(13499,'judge-event-evaluation-21117-1750723909',21117,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8817,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Jaedon. You have put alot of creative thought and effort with the selection of images to go with your selected message (Bible Verse) - well done!\r\nOne suggestion to make it even better and to stand out is to use higher quality images, as this would really enhance the overall impace.\r\nKeep up the great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:11:49','2025-06-24 10:11:49'),(13500,'judge-event-evaluation-21421-1750723914',21421,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7675,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Her work stands out for its creativity, originality, and strong technical execution especially in composition, focus, and overall impact. The attention to detail and thoughtful presentation demonstrate both skill and dedication.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:11:54','2025-06-24 10:11:54'),(13501,'judge-event-evaluation-21139-1750724074',21139,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8817,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Remember to mat your art work before framing. ALways refer back to the convention guidelines. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:14:34','2025-06-24 10:14:34'),(13502,'judge-event-evaluation-21303-1750724083',21303,344,16,11,3,2025,193,'505',NULL,8881,55,7761,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'The artwork did not follow the guidelines. Lead pencils should have not been used. The artwork lacked creativity and texture . Not much contrast and highlights shown in the artwork. There was no hanger placed on the frame hence, no points was awarded. You have potential to do better. Great effort though.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:14:43','2025-06-30 20:46:58'),(13506,'judge-event-evaluation-21049-1750724253',21049,344,16,11,3,2025,14,'056','2',0,55,8800,1,'Collection','3',100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. The research poster demonstarated a solid understanding of the topic and was informative. However, the overall organization could have been neater to improve clarity and flow. Additionally, incorporating more pictures or visual diagrams would greatly enhance the explanation and make the information easier to grasp. Overall, it was a good effort with clear potential for improvement through better visual support and organization.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:17:33','2025-06-24 10:17:33'),(13507,'judge-event-evaluation-21045-1750724273',21045,344,16,11,3,2025,14,'056','3',0,55,8800,1,'Collection','3',100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. The poster was well-organized and informative. However, some of the words could have been written properly to avoid misinterpretation. Overall, it was a commendable effort with room for improvement in clarity and presentation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:17:53','2025-06-24 10:17:53'),(13508,'judge-event-evaluation-21659-1750724301',21659,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7787,55,7766,2,'Open','10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'the storytelling aspect of your photo is compelling!  think about more textures to add depth',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:18:21','2025-06-24 10:18:21'),(13509,'judge-event-evaluation-22111-1750724314',22111,344,16,11,3,2025,17,'059','1',0,55,8800,9,'Open','1',100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. The collection is neat and well-arranged. It was well-informative and clearly shows that you have done your research and put effort in explaining. However the background lacks creativity and could be improved to make the presentation more visually engaging. I hope that in the future, you will take these things into consideration. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:18:34','2025-06-24 10:18:34'),(13510,'judge-event-evaluation-21489-1750724352',21489,344,16,11,3,2025,5,'009','1',0,55,8800,9,'Collection','3',100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. The research was a vibrant and well-organized poster. The explanation was informative. However, the pictures were not clear enough and one of the words used was not represented in the visuals. Overall, a strong effort with room for improvement in visual clarity and consistency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:19:12','2025-06-24 10:19:12'),(13511,'judge-event-evaluation-21138-1750724400',21138,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8809,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You can work on the areas where points have been deducted. Refer back to the conventions guidelines. Always remember to have your art work ready for hanging and that it should be matted before framing. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:20:00','2025-06-24 10:20:00'),(13513,'judge-event-evaluation-20838-1750724430',20838,345,16,11,3,2025,5,'009','1',0,5804,8800,9,'Collection','1',100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. The collection was impressive and well-organized coin. However, it would have been even stronger with a bibliograpghy and references to show where your information came from. Overall, this is a good collection. With proper referencing, it would reach an excellent standard.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:20:30','2025-06-24 10:20:30'),(13515,'judge-event-evaluation-21430-1750724439',21430,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8847,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Zixin has submitted a thoughtfully curated photography collection that demonstrates emerging creativity and a solid foundational understanding of photographic principles. The work reflects a commendable level of originality and artistic intent, with particular strengths in composition and the appropriate use of digital enhancements. While there is room for technical improvement in areas such as focus, lighting, and exposure, the submission is well-aligned with the competition’s values and maintains consistency with a Biblical worldview. With continued practice and attention to detail, Zixin has strong potential for further growth in the field of visual arts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:20:39','2025-06-24 10:20:39'),(13516,'judge-event-evaluation-21288-1750724443',21288,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7706,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Jared. You have created a well-organised and visually strong poster - great effort!\r\nTo make your work even more unique, it would be lovely to include more of your original images, as this would be a wonderful way to showcase your creativity and personal touch.\r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:20:43','2025-06-24 10:20:43'),(13517,'judge-event-evaluation-20979-1750724454',20979,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8826,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:20:54','2025-06-24 10:20:54'),(13519,'judge-event-evaluation-21233-1750724462',21233,347,16,11,3,2025,145,'361',NULL,7272,5806,7861,65,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Tamalesi. Looking forward what you will create next convention using flax material.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:21:02','2025-06-24 10:21:02'),(13521,'judge-event-evaluation-20263-1750724573',20263,346,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7175,4208,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You need to go through the guidelines and work on the art. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:22:53','2025-06-24 10:22:53'),(13522,'judge-event-evaluation-21231-1750724665',21231,347,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,7270,5806,7759,59,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'To some it may look so simple but it does require a lot of work and did your best to complete it so well.\r\nThank you for your great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:24:25','2025-06-24 10:24:25'),(13523,'judge-event-evaluation-21662-1750724680',21662,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7741,55,7766,2,'Open','10',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'concept is creative, a little light could enhance your features even more',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:24:40','2025-06-24 10:24:40'),(13524,'judge-event-evaluation-21401-1750724685',21401,344,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,7655,55,7759,59,'Open',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the great effort, Brian. Though it is your first time, you managed to complete it and prove that you have the talent. Your choice of material was a problem because it is manufactured wood and I think that your completed piece would have been much better if you had used sharp tools. You did a great job and hope you try again next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:24:45','2025-06-24 10:24:45'),(13525,'judge-event-evaluation-21497-1750724707',21497,344,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,8856,55,7759,59,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'You did this for the first time but you did an excellent job to completion. Looking at the details, I advise that you use sharp tools for perfect work and hope that you will continue to work on it because you have the talent. May God bless you with many new ideas to upgrade and showcase your God given talents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:25:07','2025-06-24 10:25:07'),(13526,'judge-event-evaluation-21498-1750724726',21498,344,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,8857,55,7759,59,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'The message is very clear and done with precision. You finished it off with flowers you painted, but you did not include in your report. Your choice of wood may not be a good one too since it is not allowed by our guidelines and you may need to improve your boarder to ensure that they are proportional. However, you did a great job completing such piece. Thank you for the great effort in discovering your hidden talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:25:26','2025-06-24 10:25:26'),(13527,'judge-event-evaluation--1750724730',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:25:30','2025-06-24 10:25:30'),(13528,'judge-event-evaluation--1750724747',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,7863,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL