e bow is about to be removed also please ensure while printing to reminder them that nothing must be removed or taken away.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing—you’re doing great!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:26:45','2025-06-24 10:26:45'),(13535,'judge-event-evaluation-21500-1750724818',21500,344,16,11,3,2025,137,'352',NULL,8858,55,7759,59,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'You did well in completing this piece, Jordan. I woud advise that you use sharp tools for perfect results and always add on to it to make it attractive especially with a powerful message like you have. However, this is the beginning and it showcase your hidden talent. May you increase in your talents and ideas to make new and innovative work in the future. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:26:58','2025-06-24 10:26:58'),(13536,'judge-event-evaluation-21489-1750724819',21489,344,16,11,3,2025,5,'009','1',0,55,7756,9,'Collection','1',100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Christine selected a range of traditional clothing, but in the selection of Fijian traditional clothing, the picture shows only tapa wear and not the Fijian sulu, which is mentioned in the report. This creates a mismatch  between the visual presentation and the written content. More creativity in the presentation would enhance the overall quality of the work. For bibliography and references, only the reference was provided-no supporting scripture was included. Despite these issues, it is a good collection overall.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:26:59','2025-06-24 10:26:59'),(1