:27:22','2025-06-24 10:27:22'),(13542,'judge-event-evaluation-21350-1750724860',21350,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7639,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Hannah. Your poster has a lovely visual design and the verse you chose fits beautifully with the message - great job! One small tip to make it even better would be to use a higher-quality image, as it would really enhance the overall impact.\r\nGood effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:27:40','2025-06-24 10:27:40'),(13543,'judge-event-evaluation-21167-1750724862',21167,347,16,11,3,2025,172,'450',NULL,7274,5806,7843,2,'Open','7',100,100.00,-10,0.00,'Here is a picture thoughtfully composed. It displays a harmonious balance between subject and setting. What draws the eye is his calm smile, which you have captured beautifully. Your photo stands out for its calm composition and natural balance. Lovely picture Vani.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:27:42','2025-06-24 10:27:42'),(13544,'judge-event-evaluation-21510-1750724873',21510,344,16,11,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,8853,55,7863,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:27:53','2025-06-24 10:27:53'),(13545,'judge-event-evaluation-21282-1750724919',21282,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,8830,55,8871,2,'Collection','11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful work Julia Liao. The picture was beautiful but just work on your lighting(enough light to bring the picture to life). Again, well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,