you fill it in. You did a great job and I hope you keep trying to be the best and inspire many.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:30:19','2025-06-24 10:30:19'),(13555,'judge-event-evaluation-21814-1750725039',21814,356,16,11,3,2025,159,'400',NULL,7772,4678,7843,2,'Collection','7',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'The picture definitly captures the subjects happiness. However, there is abit of motion blur. If the lighting could be focused more at the face rather than the middle, it would change the pictures hue. Overall, the mood of happiness is felt through your fathers smile.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:30:39','2025-06-24 10:30:39'),(13556,'judge-event-evaluation-21253-1750725044',21253,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8826,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:30:44','2025-06-24 10:30:44'),(13557,'judge-event-evaluation-20992-1750725061',20992,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8804,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:31:01','2025-06-24 10:31:01'),(13558,'judge-event-evaluation-21085-1750725075',21085,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8804,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:31:15','2025-06-24 10:31:15'),(13559,'judge-event-evaluation-21344-1750725076',21344,344,16,11,3,2025,159,'400',NULL,7638,55,7843,2,'Collection','7',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'What is captured is a heart-warming moment, the focus being on the mutual greeting. The lighting and exposure is wonderful. However, there is no composition here. It usually creates a sense of balance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:31:16','2025-06-24 10:31:16'),(13560,'judge-event-evaluation-21020-1750725086',21020,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7634,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:31:26','2025-06-24 10:31:26'),(13562,'judge-event-evaluation-21661-1750725093',21661,344,16,11,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7785,55,7755,2,'Open','11',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for submitting your photos! \r\nNice work overall—creative and well thought out. \r\nJust a few things to improve:\r\nmake sure when photos are taken or printed do not crop or remove any part of the main subject.\r\n\r\nKeep practicing—you’re doing great!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:31:33','2025-06-24 10:31:33'),(13563,'judge-event-evaluation-21088-1750725096',21088,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8808,55,8884,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:31:36','2025-06-24 10:31:36'),(13564,'judge-event-eva