ara. Your poster is visually claming and beautifully captures the natural beauty of the beach and draws the viewer in wonderfully. It also pairs in well with the Bible Verse you have chosen.\r\nGreat effort overall!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:43:30','2025-06-24 10:43:30'),(13603,'judge-event-evaluation-21675-1750725831',21675,344,16,11,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,7730,55,7863,12,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Great job on your poster Taito! To improve it, try writing your Bible sentence in the middle of the poster. Also, cropping the picture a bit so the cross is higher will make your poster look even nicer. Keep up the good work and continue practicing!\r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:43:51','2025-06-24 10:43:51'),(13604,'judge-event-evaluation-20973-1750725836',20973,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8851,55,7758,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:43:56','2025-06-24 10:43:56'),(13605,'judge-event-evaluation-20979-1750725850',20979,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8826,55,7758,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:44:10','2025-06-24 10:44:10'),(13606,'judge-event-evaluation-20821-1750725910',20821,345,16,11,3,2025,193,'505',NULL,7356,5804,7761,17,'Collection',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Your depiction of the grapes is charming, but experimenting with shading could have added more dimension. Darker or lighter tones might have helped the leaves appear more three-dimensional. Your lines are clear, but practicing more on controlled strokes can help make the details even sharper. The artwork did not have any hanger hence, no points was awarded. Overall, the artwork is good, but paying more attention to the proportions and placement could enhance the balance of the artwork. Great effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:45:10','2025-06-24 10:45:10'),(13608,'judge-event-evaluation-21481-1750725978',21481,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7654,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You have followed the guidelines very well. I believe you can go beyond and develop more in this area. \r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:46:18','2025-06-24 10:46:18'),(13609,'judge-event-evaluation-21736-1750726001',21736,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8805,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your poster Alexis. You can use images from the internet (which must be properly credited), however, your entry is against Convention Guidelines.\r\nHope to see another attempt from you with more original thought and creativity next year.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:46:41','2025-07-01 20:12:46'),(13610,'judge-event-evaluation-21136-1750726038',21136,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8815,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:47:18','2025-06-24 10:47:18'),(13612,'judge-event-evaluation-21263-1750726131',21263,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8832,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Osa has submitted a strong and creative photography collection. The photos show great use of colour, lighting, and focus, with clear attention to detail in how each image was composed. The work is original and fits the chosen category well. While the documentation could be slightly improved, the overall presentation was neat and complete.This is a very good effort, and Osa is encouraged to keep exploring photography and building on these skills. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:48:51','2025-06-24 10:48:51'),(13614,'judge-event-evaluation-21677-1750726180',21677,344,16,11,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,7741,55,7863,12,'Open',NULL,100,83.00,NULL,NULL,'Good effort on your poster Yeonhee! The picture could be clearer, as it appears a bit dark. Maybe try adjusting the brightness or using a clearer image to make your poster more eye-catching. To add on, Bible verse could have been in the middle of the poster.  Keep up the good work and continue improving!\r\nKind regards .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:49:40','2025-06-24 10:49:40'),(13615,'judge-event-evaluation-21670-1750726201',21670,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,7737,55,8871,2,'Collection','11',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Patty Prasad. Looking at the original Photo, I don\'t think there were any adjustments made to the picture but you ticked manual for camera settings which was supposed to be Automatic because you used your mom\'s phone. That\'s where your points were deducted. Also, next time just improve on the focusing of the object of the picture and the mounting of the photo, but otherwise you did a great job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:50:01','2025-06-24 10:50:01'),(13616,'judge-event-evaluation-20237-1750726253',20237,346,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7559,4208,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Mosese.\r\nIt is a visually-appealing poster with a beautiful verse. Enhancing the picture quality a little more would make your work stand out even more.\r\nGreat effort overall!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:50:53','2025-06-24 10:50:53'),(13617,'judge-event-evaluation-20998-1750726278',20998,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8815,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Please refer to guidelines in regards to matting and also your art work must be ready for hanging. \r\nYou are in the right path, for future referrence make sure to check your entries before submission. God Bless! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:51:18','2025-06-24 10:51:18'),(13619,'judge-event-evaluation-21485-1750726346',21485,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8851,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:52:26','2025-06-24 10:52:26'),(13620,'judge-event-evaluation-21658-1750726410',21658,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7737,55,8702,2,'Collection','5',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Patty,\r\nGreat effort on your submission. Things to take note for in your next convention.\r\n1. a step by step procedure should be written as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. you must explain why you chose the subject.\r\n3. your print-out photo should be at least smaller than your matt board.\r\n4. Please make sure that your report is aligned with your photo. State the exact location of where you took the photo in your step by step report.\r\n\r\nThank you again Patty. All the best for convention.Good job on your entry submission. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:53:30','2025-06-24 10:53:30'),(13621,'judge-event-evaluation-21429-1750726455',21429,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8851,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Simon’s photography shows creativity but lacks a good understanding of the basics. The photos fit the category and have interesting lighting and composition. Some technical parts like focus and colour could be better, but Simon has done well. The work is presented neatly and follows the competition’s rules. Good Try!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:54:15','2025-06-24 10:54:15'),(13623,'judge-event-evaluation-21469-1750726550',21469,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8850,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Lanlyn. Your poster features a beautiful beach scene and captures the viewers attention with its natural beauty. The Bible verse chosen is meaningful on its own, though it doesn\'t quite relate to the image.\r\nWith a little more connection between the visual and the message, this could be even more impactful.\r\nStill a great effort - well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:55:50','2025-06-24 10:55:50'),(13624,'judge-event-evaluation-21338-1750726576',21338,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7638,55,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:56:16','2025-06-24 10:56:16'),(13625,'judge-event-evaluation-21666-1750726580',21666,344,16,11,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7686,55,7755,2,'Open','11',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo submissions!\r\n Just a gentle reminder to double-check that no part of the photo is cut off when taking or printing—every detail counts.\r\n Keep up the great work, and we’re excited to see your improvement next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:56:20','2025-06-24 10:56:20'),(13626,'judge-event-evaluation-21353-1750726583',21353,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7665,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Please check that your art work is placed rightly ready for hanging. Always remember to mat your art before your frame it. Other than that keep up the good work in this area and practice more to perfect your art. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:56:23','2025-06-24 10:56:23'),(13628,'judge-event-evaluation-21673-1750726664',21673,344,16,11,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,7690,55,7863,12,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Good job on your poster Josephine! Removing the building and focusing only on the coconut trees could make the design simpler and more focused. Also, if you could increase the text size of the Bible verse it might help the main message stand out even more. Keep experimenting and you\'ll keep improving!\r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:57:44','2025-06-24 10:57:44'),(13629,'judge-event-evaluation-21341-1750726679',21341,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,8841,55,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:57:59','2025-06-24 10:57:59'),(13631,'judge-event-evaluation-21449-1750726700',21449,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,7651,55,8871,2,'Collection','11',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Eshal Sen. The food looks delicious. The picture was well taken but next time ensure that the object of your picture is not cut when taken. Also, work on the lighting and the focusing of the picture(clear and no hint of blur) but otherwise well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:58:20','2025-06-24 10:58:20'),(13632,'judge-event-evaluation-21182-1750726792',21182,347,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7817,5806,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 10:59:52','2025-06-24 10:59:52'),(13633,'judge-event-evaluation-21292-1750726837',21292,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7709,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Mereoni. \r\nYour poster is visually appealing and well-designed. The Bible verse you\'ve selected is meaningful and fits perfectly with the image.\r\nWonderful effort - keep up the great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:00:37','2025-06-24 11:00:37'),(13634,'judge-event-evaluation-21414-1750726851',21414,344,16,11,3,2025,131,'323',NULL,7676,55,7759,70,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very unique piece and I like it. Thank you for sharing your creativity with us. Since I can not find the submitted pattern,  I can only judge the pattern I see on the piece. So please read the guidelines and ensure that the required report is submittted and that you are following all that is required of you.Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:00:51','2025-06-24 11:00:51'),(13635,'judge-event-evaluation-20843-1750726880',20843,345,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,8760,5804,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:01:20','2025-06-24 11:01:20'),(13636,'judge-event-evaluation-20813-1750726926',20813,345,16,11,3,2025,193,'505',NULL,7521,5804,7761,17,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'The colors create a vibrant and lively background, but working on blending it smoothly could have given a cohesive sunset effect. The cross\'s lacked symmetry. Points were deducted for using lead pencils. Overall, the artwork is interesting but experimenting with different perspectives or adding detail could have enhanced the scene. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:02:06','2025-06-24 11:02:06'),(13637,'judge-event-evaluation-21541-1750726931',21541,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7743,55,7766,2,'Open','10',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:02:11','2025-06-24 11:02:11'),(13638,'judge-event-evaluation-21319-1750726935',21319,344,16,11,3,2025,132,'324',NULL,7632,55,7861,70,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Simple pattern yet a beautiful work. Please ensure to submit your pattern',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:02:15','2025-06-24 11:02:15'),(13639,'judge-event-evaluation-21441-1750726966',21441,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7675,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jiaqi,\r\n\r\nThank you for your submission. Things to take note for in your next convention.\r\n1. a step by step procedure should be written as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. you must explain why you chose the subject.\r\n3. Make sure to state if you did any editing and enhancements to your photo.\r\n4. Also, remember to upload the soft copy of your photo.\r\n5. Make sure to use the correct measurements for photography and matting sizes.\r\n6.When mounting photos,make sure that the mattboard is clean and no stains on it.\r\n\r\nThank you again Jiaqi. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL