ng creativity and composition. The pictures are clear and well taken, but the printing made some details hard to see. Improving the printing and mounting will help show the photos better.The work fits the category and follows the competition’s values. Keep up the good work, Caja, and pay attention to how the photos are printed and presented.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:16:00','2025-06-24 11:16:00'),(13669,'judge-event-evaluation-21169-1750727785',21169,347,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7813,5806,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:16:25','2025-06-24 11:16:25'),(13670,'judge-event-evaluation-21551-1750727819',21551,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8860,55,8802,12,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for creating this poster Karalaini. Your poster shares a powerful message and the image you chose really fits the Bible verse well.\r\nWith some improvement in image quality and a font that stands out more, your message could shine even brighter.\r\nGreat effort!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:16:59','2025-06-24 11:16:59'),(13671,'judge-event-evaluation-20322-1750727835',20322,346,16,11,3,2025,193,'505',NULL,7204,4208,7761,17,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'The artwork of a hibiscus flower is done well however, the shading on the petals could be be blended more to create a smother gradient and more realistic texture which adds depth. The black outline is bold and consistent. Softening the edges in certain areas like where the petals fold could have given a more natural effect. There is potential to do better.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:17:15','2025-06-24 11:17:15'),(13672,'judge-event-evaluation-21663-1750727855',21663,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8865,55,7766,2,'Open','10',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'The lighting is enchanting here, have you considered of shooting at different times of day for varied effects?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:17:35','2025-06-24 11:17:35'),(13673,'judge-event-evaluation-21413-1750727881',21413,344,16,11,3,2025,132,'324',NULL,7671,55,7861,70,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful art work Florence. Just be mindful of your finishing touch or closing of your bunny. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:18:01','2025-06-24 11:18:01'),(13674,'judge-event-evaluation-21178-1750727902',21178,347,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7245,5806,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 11:18:22','2025-06-24 11:18:22'),(13675,'judge-event-evaluation-20321-1750727902',20321,346,16,11,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,7186,4208,7863,12,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Great job on creating the posters Litiana! You did a wonderful job incorporating the Bible verse with meaningful picture. Your effort and creativity really stand out. Keep up the fantastic work! \r\nKind regards. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,