e excited to see your improvement next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:36:44','2025-06-24 12:36:44'),(13817,'judge-event-evaluation-21088-1750732619',21088,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8808,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Ayona has shown good creativity and effort in this photography. The photos match the theme and show developing skills in focus, colour, and composition. There are some original ideas, however, some photos need better lighting and clearer exposure. The mounting and presentation could also be improved to meet the guidelines more fully. With more practice and attention to detail, she can continue to grow and improve. Keep working hard—you’re on the right track!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:36:59','2025-06-24 12:36:59'),(13819,'judge-event-evaluation-21153-1750732691',21153,347,16,11,3,2025,202,'553',NULL,7268,5806,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Please remember to mat your art work before framing. This will make your sketching stand out from the frame.\r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:38:11','2025-06-24 12:38:11'),(13820,'judge-event-evaluation-21316-1750732788',21316,344,16,11,3,2025,120,'310',NULL,7634,55,7843,54,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,-10.00,'Wonderful work displayed here, Amelia! This entry presents a dedication to show a glimpse of your life, which is beautifully arranged. The mixed media and crafts add genuine detailing and displays creativity. A great amount of thought and heart went into this. However, it surpassed the page limiit and had a few pictures which did not align with the dress code. I encourage you to read the guidelines. That said, your passion for art is evident. Keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:39:48','2025-06-30 12:56:34'),(13821,'judge-event-evaluation-21534-1750732799',21534,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,8855,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Esiteri,\r\n\r\nThank you for your submission. Things to take note for in your next convention.\r\n1. a step by step procedure should be written as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. use a high quality camera or phone that can capture the tiny details of the photo.\r\n3. Make sure that there are no distractions before you take the photo.For example:the people etc.\r\n4. Every photo must have a centralize subject with a clear focus.\r\n5.Make sure to upload a soft copy of your photo as well.\r\n6. Take photos during broad daylight because that\'s the best time to take photos.\r\n\r\nTherefore there is still room for improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you again Esiteri. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:39:59','2025-06-24 12:39:59'),(13824,'judge-event-evaluation-21439-1750732861',21439,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8848,55,NULL,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:41:01','2025-06-24 12:41:01'),(13825,'judge-event-evaluation-21535-1750732865',21535,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7669,55,8884,2,