ut to your final product. \r\n2. use a high quality camera or phone that can capture the tiny details of the photo.\r\n3. Make sure that there are no distractions before you take the photo.For example:the black floating item at sea.\r\n4. Every photo must have a centralize subject with a clear focus.\r\n5.Make sure to upload a soft copy of your photo as well.\r\n\r\nTherefore there is still room for improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you again Joape. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:44:06','2025-06-24 12:44:06'),(13836,'judge-event-evaluation-21413-1750733058',21413,344,16,11,3,2025,132,'324',NULL,7671,55,7759,70,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Though it is craft, I think it speaks volume. I applaud you for your initiative to take up challenges and though it is not perfectly completed, you did an incredible work completing it. Perhaps addition of its legs can make it more realistic and a greater finish. Well, that is your choice. Please know that your pattern is not within my reach and this does affect your overall score. Please read your guidelines to guide you with your work always.  Thanks for your great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:44:18','2025-06-24 12:44:18'),(13838,'judge-event-evaluation-21189-1750733112',21189,347,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,8768,5806,8884,2,'Collection','10',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:45:12','2025-06-24 12:45:12'),(13841,'judge-event-evaluation-21542-1750733173',21542,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7745,55,88