25-06-24 12:49:44'),(13854,'judge-event-evaluation-21163-1750733502',21163,344,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,8823,55,NULL,17,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'The reports states that a whale was drawn for this entry yet, a turtle was submitted. This artwork showcases creativity and shows a great sense of design and composition. However, the artwork seems flat due to the uniformity of line weight and patterns across all elements.\r\n Adding shading to specific areas like the underside of the turtle, behind plants would have enhanced the piece of art and give a 3D effect. The frame had no hanger hence, no points was awarded.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:51:42','2025-06-24 12:51:42'),(13855,'judge-event-evaluation-21753-1750733526',21753,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7783,55,8871,2,'Open','10',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Shivali Sharma. I love the picture quality and the idea you\'ve chosen but the exhibit does not match with the report you\'ve submitted and thats where your points were deducted, other than that you did a great job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:52:06','2025-06-24 12:52:06'),(13856,'judge-event-evaluation-21260-1750733537',21260,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7708,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Kiyana has submitted a strong and creative photography collection. The photos are well focused, with average colour, composition, and originality. The work clearly fits the category and shows a high level of effort. To improve further, make sure the main subjects in the photos are properly centered when needed, and continue refining lighting and exposure.This is a great submission—well done, Kiyana! Keep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:52:17','2025-06-24 12:52:17'),(13858,'judge-event-evaluation-22171-1750733588',22171,346,16,11,3,2025,112,'301',NULL,8718,4208,7549,58,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Please submit your plan  and work towards your finishing touch as per what is written in your report. \r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:53:08','2025-06-24 12:53:08'),(13859,'judge-event-evaluation-21277-1750733626',21277,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7708,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Kiyana,\r\n\r\nThank you for your submission. Things to take note for in your next convention.\r\n1. a step by step procedure should be written as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. use a high quality camera or phone that will capture the tiny details of the photo.\r\n3. Every photo must have a centralize subject with a clear focus.\r\n4.Make sure to upload a soft copy of your photo as well.\r\n\r\nTherefore there is still room for improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you again Kiyana. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 12:53:46','2025-06-24 12:53:46'),(13860,'judge-event-evaluation-20811-1750733640',20811,345,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,8755,5804,8703,56,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and creativity. A beautiful Print.\r\n\r\nFor future improvements, refer to guideline number 1.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU