crylics - it\'s clear that you\'ve put thought and heat into your painting!\r\nAcrylics can be a bit tricky at first, but with more practice adn exploration of different techniques like layering, and brush control, your work will get better.\r\nKeep experimenting - you\'re on the right trach and your creativity shines through! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:00:29','2025-06-24 13:00:29'),(13874,'judge-event-evaluation-21093-1750734053',21093,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8816,55,7758,2,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Hope has submitted an excellent photography collection. The images are clear, creative, and skillfully composed, with strong use of lighting, colour, and focus. The photos fit the category very well and show great originality and effort.Presentation and mounting were neat, and documentation was mostly complete. However, the written report could be a bit more detailed to better explain the ideas and process behind the work.Overall, this is a strong and impressive submission. Well done, Hope—keep up the great work and continue to grow!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:00:53','2025-06-24 13:00:53'),(13875,'judge-event-evaluation-21663-1750734117',21663,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8865,55,8871,2,'Open','10',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Collin Stuart. I love how your picture captured my attention. It is well mounted and the quality of the printing is too good. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:01:57','2025-06-24 13:01:57'),(13877,'judge-event-evaluation-21757-1750734151',2