e detail. Overall, a very nice photo with room for a slight improvement in focus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:10:55','2025-06-24 13:10:55'),(13903,'judge-event-evaluation-21199-1750734675',21199,347,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7252,5806,7863,2,'Open','9',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Tubutubu! Just few adjusments at the top that needs to be cropped out- other than that you really did gerat! \r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:11:15','2025-06-24 13:11:15'),(13904,'judge-event-evaluation-21161-1750734692',21161,344,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,8815,55,7761,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:11:32','2025-06-24 13:11:32'),(13906,'judge-event-evaluation-21340-1750734709',21340,344,16,11,3,2025,162,'403',NULL,7660,55,8702,2,'Collection','5,10',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Ocean,\r\n\r\nThank you for your submission. Things to take note for in your next convention.\r\n1. a step by step procedure should be written as to how you came about to your final product. \r\n2. use a high quality camera or phone that can capture the tiny details of the photo.\r\n3. Try and take photos during the day for better lighting and exposure.\r\n4. Print-out photos should not bigger than the mattboard. It should be smaller with equal sides in distance from the mattboard.\r\n5. Remember to upload a soft copy of your photo.\r\n\r\nTherefore there is still room for improvements.\r\n\r\n\r\nThank you again Ocean. Great effort! All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:11:49','2025-06-24 13:11:49'),(13907,'judge-event-evaluation-20839-1750734805',20839,345,16,11,3,2025,190,'502',NULL,8764,5804,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. A few marks deducted therefore you can improve in those areas to develop your skills in this areas. \r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:13:25','2025-06-30 20:37:42'),(13908,'judge-event-evaluation-21083-1750734836',21083,344,16,11,3,2025,134,'326',NULL,8809,55,7861,72,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,-5.00,'Lovely color combination Cianna. Piecing is not straight, that is why corners are not meeting or pointing. Ensure that the size in the criterea is followed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:13:56','2025-06-24 13:13:56'),(13909,'judge-event-evaluation-20287-1750734882',20287,346,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,8715,4208,8703,56,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and creativity. A beautiful Print.\r\n\r\nFor future improvements, refer to guideline 1.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:14:42','2025-06-24 13:14:42'),(13910,'judge-event-evaluation-21570-1750734901',21570,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,7721,55,7766,17,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'great effort! have you thought about creating a series of different expressions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU