 composition, with excellent use of colour and lighting. The degree of difficulty is well-handled, and the photo fits the chosen category appropriately. Focus could be a bit sharper to improve clarity. The photo is nicely mounted, and documentation is complete. Overall, a very well-executed photo with minor areas to improve',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:16:42','2025-06-24 13:16:42'),(13918,'judge-event-evaluation-21356-1750735024',21356,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,8839,55,8871,2,'Collection','11',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done O\' Connor Scotty. Please next time just make sure that the object of the picture is not cut and be specific with the Phone brand. Otherwise, well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:17:04','2025-06-24 13:17:04'),(13920,'judge-event-evaluation-21131-1750735054',21131,344,16,11,3,2025,190,'502',NULL,8807,55,8802,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Acrylic Painting entry Anika.\r\nUnfortunately, it does not meet Convention Guidelines as paintings are to be done on Canvas.\r\nThis should not however prevent you from attempting another beautiful piece of artwork next year.\r\nThank your for your time and effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:17:34','2025-06-30 20:43:19'),(13921,'judge-event-evaluation-21083-1750735098',21083,344,16,11,3,2025,134,'326',NULL,8809,55,8800,72,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,-5.00,'Thank you for your submission. The patchwork shows creativity and effort and it displayed a nice blend of colors, which added to its visual appeal. However, there was no pattern submitted, resulting in points deductions. Some stitches were loose and coming undone, affecting the overall neatness. Additionally, the size exceeeded the specified guidelines. For future entries, please follow the given instructions and pay attention to finishing details. With a bit more attention to details, your work has great potential. Nonetheless, your work is commendable and you should be proud of what you have achieved. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:18:18','2025-06-24 13:18:18'),(13922,'judge-event-evaluation-21531-1750735109',21531,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7727,55,7863,2,'Open','9',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Heyang for your submission. Just few things that you have to consider:\r\n1. Creativity- the colour of the matte board should complement the photo.\r\n2. Composition- the picture was taken from afar so it was bit blurred. \r\n3. Sensible use of enhancements-over done of the lighting and  colour. Just add a little bit of the adjuments.\r\n\r\nOther than that, thank you for your gerat effort.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:18:29','2025-06-24 13:18:29'),(13923,'judge-event-evaluation-21081-1750735115',21081,344,16,11,3,2025,134,'326',NULL,8807,55,8800,72,'Collection',NULL,100,55.00,-10,-5.00,'Thank you for your submissions. Your patchwork was creative and showed effort. However, there was no pattern submitted, resulting in points deductions. Some stitches were loose and coming undone, affecting the overall neatness. Additionally, the size exceeeded the specified guidelines. For future entries, please follow the given instructions and pay attention to finishing details. Nonetheless, your work is commendable and you should be proud of what you have achieved. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:18:35','2025-06-24 13:18:35'),(13924,'judge-event-evaluation-21732-1750735128',21732,344,16,11,3,2025,134,'326',NULL,8804,55,8800,72,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Your patchwork was shows creativity and effort. It showcased a beautiful blend of patterns that stood out. However, the pattern was not submitted, which resulted in points deductions. Additionally, some stitches were loose and coming undone, affecting the overall neatness. For future entries, I hope you will consider these things. Nonetheless, your work is commendable and you should be proud of what you have achieved. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:18:48','2025-06-24 13:18:48'),(13926,'judge-event-evaluation-21082-1750735249',21082,344,16,11,3,2025,134,'326',NULL,8808,55,8800,72,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,-8.00,'Thank you for your submission. The patchwork reflects creativity and thoughful effort. The use of two color blends added visual interest and appeal. However, there was no pattern submitted, resulting in points deductions. There were also a few loose stitches which affected the overall neatness. Additionally, the size exceeeded the specified guidelines. For future entries, please follow the given instructions and pay attention to finishing details. Nonetheless, your work is commendable and you should be proud of what you have achieved. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:20:49','2