gh level of effort. A bit more detail in the written documentation would further strengthen the overall presentation. Excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:45:19','2025-06-24 13:45:20'),(14026,'judge-event-evaluation-21747-1750736741',21747,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,8842,55,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and continue with your creativity. A beautiful Poster.\r\n\r\nFor future improvements, consider shortnening the texts and try to capture the whole picture.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:45:41','2025-06-24 13:45:41'),(14027,'judge-event-evaluation-21674-1750736767',21674,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7737,55,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and continue with your creativity.\r\n\r\nFor future improvements, consider focusing on the scripts and the image. Shorten the scripture and try to use bigger and bold fonts.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:46:07','2025-06-24 13:46:07'),(14028,'judge-event-evaluation-20356-1750736784',20356,346,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,8709,4208,7761,17,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'The drawing conveys the cuteness of a puppy however, the use of varying line weight could have been used to enhance depth and form. Adding more texture to the fur could have given the image a more realistic effect. Adding shadows under the puppy could ground it more firmly on the surface. The frame does not have a hanger attached hence, no points was awarded. It is a good drawing yet, there is room to do better. Great Effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:46:24','2025-06-24 13:46:24'),(14029,'judge-event-evaluation-21629-1750736824',21629,344,16,11,3,2025,139,'354',NULL,7780,55,7756,61,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Great work on your sculpture of Elijah and Raphael, Ateca Naburel! It’s clear that you put a lot of thought and effort into the design, and the attention to detail is impressive. The way you’ve represented these two biblical figures is both creative and meaningful. It\'s great to see how the materials you chose were used effectively to bring these themes to life.\r\n\r\nKeep up the excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:47:04','2025-06-24 13:47:04'),(14030,'judge-event-evaluation-21348-1750736847',21348,344,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7661,55,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and continue with your creativity. A beautiful poster.\r\n\r\nFor future reference, shorten your scripture.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:47:27','2025-06-24 13:47:27'),(14031,'judge-event-evaluation-20839-1750736866',20839,345,16,11,3,2025,190,'502',NULL,8764,5804,8802,17,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your effort Manshika Your artwork is lovely and its clear you put thought into your piece.\r\nHowever, this category requires the use of acrylic paint, and unfortunately colored pencils don\'t meet the guidelines.\r\nDon\'t be discouraged, your talent is evident, and I encourage you to try again using the correct medium.\r\nI\'m looking forward to seeing more of your beautiful work in the future!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:47:46','2025-06-30 20:37:42'),(14032,'judge-event-evaluation-21174-1750736877',21174,347,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7819,5806,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission of this peaceful and beautiful executed pencil sketch. This sketch is peaceful,skilfully arranged and richly detailed.\r\nIt immediately captures a sense of calm and quietness into its forest path.\r\nFew suggestion to enhance the sketch more: Adding dimmer lighter trees in the background could create a stronger sense of the atmosphere and forest layering.\r\nA faint sky tone or mist effect in the central walkway could add mood, like early morning light or fog.\r\nWell done and Keep up the Creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:47:57','2025-06-24 13:47:57'),(14033,'judge-event-evaluation-21536-1750736880',21536,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8858,55,8871,2,'Open','10',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Jordan Drodrolagi. Please, work on the colour and the exposure of the photo to make it more visible.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:00','2025-06-24 13:48:00'),(14034,'judge-event-evaluation-21485-1750736897',21485,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8851,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Sketching submission.\r\nThe sketch shows excellent technical ability , classical inspiration and well refined eye for structure and shading. This is a remarkable sketching of Augustus Caesar.\r\nThe empty background slightly flattens the visual  picture. A faint background picture could help bring out the picture. Well done and Keep up the Creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:17','2025-06-24 13:48:17'),(14035,'judge-event-evaluation-20987-1750736898',20987,344,16,11,3,2025,190,'502',NULL,8804,55,8802,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:18','2025-06-24 13:48:18'),(14037,'judge-event-evaluation-21327-1750736911',21327,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7642,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Jashen shows creativity and originality in this work. The colours and lighting are well handled, and there is thoughtful use of enhancements. However, the image focus needs improvement, and the subject should align more closely with the selected category. With better composition and clearer intent, this entry can become much stronger. Keep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:31','2025-06-24 13:48:31'),(14038,'judge-event-evaluation-21353-1750736915',21353,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7665,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'The sketch feels balanced with trees placed naturally across the scene and draws the viewer into the forest.\r\na focus on the background that is the addition of the sky might bring in more composition and tells the time of day.\r\nWith a little more background detail would bring the picture out alive. Keep up the creative Effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:35','2025-06-24 13:48:35'),(14039,'judge-event-evaluation-21652-1750736917',21652,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7780,55,7863,2,'Open','9',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Ateca for your submission. Just something that you can work on is the composition- a distracting element from the far right end, it looks like a close-up shot that’s been zoomed in, giving it a fascinatingly detailed but distorted appearance. Other than that, keep practicing and keep improving. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:37','2025-06-24 13:48:37'),(14040,'judge-event-evaluation-21136-1750736930',21136,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8815,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Student needs to be advised that it is not drawing as described in the report, but the term sketching could be used instead.\r\nShows good contrast and depth. Good attempt to creating a realistic sketch as similar to the original picture. Well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:48:50','2025-06-24 13:48:50'),(14041,'judge-event-evaluation-20819-1750736943',20819,345,16,11,3,2025,190,'502',NULL,7359,5804,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Please refer to your guidelines and work on the points that has been deducted to improve in your skills.\r\nALways remember to have your art work ready to be hung. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:49:03','2025-06-24 13:49:03'),(14042,'judge-event-evaluation-21481-1750736945',21481,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7654,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'A very simple sketch. Good transition from light to darkness in shading.\r\nA light background could make the sphere stand out more.  Good Effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:49:05','2025-06-24 13:49:05'),(14043,'judge-event-evaluation-21432-1750736959',21432,344,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7676,55,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission.The original photo is more realistic and I think the printing shop did not do a great job. Your subject is in focus but the light takes away the expected color. Keep trying, keep learning and be the best.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:49:19','2025-06-24 13:49:19'),(14044,'judge-event-evaluation-21140-1750736964',21140,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8818,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'This is a well planned, confident and expressive still life sketching.\r\nWith a bit more focus on shading, light direction and texture. You can improve by slightly darkening objects behind others and showing overlap with shadows or lighter outlines in the background',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:49:24','2025-06-24 13:49:24'),(14045,'judge-event-evaluation-21351-1750736983',21351,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7660,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a calming, well balanced and skilfully shaded sketch of the koi fish. Some background work could be added.Experiment with wave like pencil texture. Add bubbles trailing off could give a more realism to the sketch. Some of the shading could be deeper to distinguish the two fish more clearly.\r\nGreat Job Ocean! Keep up the creative work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:49:43','2025-06-24 13:49:43'),(14048,'judge-event-evaluation-21692-1750737030',21692,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7737,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Advice to the student, Sketching is not about drawing an outline or colouring in. Rather it focuses on lines, strokes and shading to form the picture. \r\nA sensitive and well observed sketch that shows strong control over line and shading. Darker shadows around the eye lid and deeper tone to the iris make the eye look more 3D and helps the whites of the eye stand out more. The pupil could be darker to intensify the gaze.\r\nGreat Effort shown. Well done.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\