L,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:50:41','2025-06-24 13:50:41'),(14050,'judge-event-evaluation-20323-1750737043',20323,346,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8712,4208,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'In sketching there is not about drawing an outline or colouring in. It focuses on lines, strokes and shading. Darken the palm tree slightly in the foreground and using lighter shadow for the background. This would push the horizon back and pull the tree forward visually. More wave like horizontal strokes or highlights on the water can give a stronger impression of the sea\'s surface and motion.\r\nThis sketch beautifully captures a peaceful tropical setting .\r\nKeep up the creative work! Well Done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:50:43','2025-06-24 13:50:43'),(14052,'judge-event-evaluation-21352-1750737057',21352,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8840,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Sketching submission. Some pointers to keep in mind.\r\n Sketching is not about drawing an outline or colouring in. Rather it focuses on lines, strokes and shading to form the picture. \r\nThis is a creative, dreamy and graceful interpretation of a butterfly. Adding patterns or details or dot patterns as commonly seen on butterfly wings could give the wings more life and identity while preserving its style. Add more tone to the flower to distinguish it from the butterfly.\r\nGood Effort and keep up the creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:50:57','2025-06-24 13:50:57'),(14053,'judge-event-evaluation-20849-1750737072',20849,345,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7360,5804,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'This is a strong observational sketching with good foundational work. Going over the lines with a slightly firmer hand could could bring out the picture more. Emphasizing the screw in the middle would enhance the realism and make it clear how the scissors function.\r\nAdding a light shadow or surface beneath the scissors would ground the object so it doesn\'t appear to float in space.\r\nWell done Effort. Keep up with creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:51:12','2025-06-24 13:51:12'),(14054,'judge-event-evaluation-21142-1750737096',21142,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8825,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Sketching submission. Sketching is not about drawing an outline or colouring in. Rather it focuses on lines, strokes and shading to form the picture. \r\nThis sketch is full of character and creatively expressed. Careful erasing could improve the natural curve of the face and reduce some rough edge marks. Could explore soft shading or line tweaks to make it match the expressive eyes or to match the grumpy puppy mood.  Add more contrast on one side of the face, emphasizing where the light is coming from.\r\nGood Job and Keep up the creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:51:36','2025-06-24 13:51:36'),(14055,'judge-event-evaluation-20270-1750737118',20270,346,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7204,4208,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and creativity.\r\n\r\nFor future imrpovements, consider working on the setting of your text and put the scripture reference after the verse.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:51:58','2025-06-24 13:51:59'),(14056,'judge-event-evaluation-21004-1750737129',21004,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8805,55,7766,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:52:09','2025-06-24 13:52:09'),(14057,'judge-event-evaluation-21734-1750737154',21734,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8804,55,7766,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:52:34','2025-06-24 13:52:34'),(14058,'judge-event-evaluation-21124-1750737161',21124,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8807,55,7766,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:52:41','2025-06-24 13:52:41'),(14060,'judge-event-evaluation-21569-1750737172',21569,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8860,55,7766,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 13:52:52','2025-06-24 13:52:52'),(14062,'judge-event-evaluation-20825-1750737202',20825,345,16,11,3,2025,168,'412',NULL,7519,5804,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and creativity. \r\n\r\nFor future improvements, refer to guidelines and detail your sources\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU