ing and refining your technique!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:11:50','2025-06-24 14:11:50'),(14113,'judge-event-evaluation-21282-1750738341',21282,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,8830,55,7755,2,'Collection','11',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo submissions! \r\nJust a gentle reminder to double-check that no part of the photo is cut off when taking or printing—every detail counts. \r\nKeep up the great work, and we’re excited to see your improvement next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:12:21','2025-06-24 14:12:21'),(14114,'judge-event-evaluation-21150-1750738385',21150,344,16,11,3,2025,192,'504',NULL,8818,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. You can improve in the colour constrast and multiple textural effect to bring out the subject.\r\nKeep up the good work. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:13:05','2025-06-24 14:13:05'),(14115,'judge-event-evaluation-21577-1750738399',21577,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7718,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for a thoughtful and well presented Sketching. This is a sensitive, well observed portrait. The profile is challenging to draw well and you handled it with skill. Few pointers to enhance the sketch: Add more shading and contour lines around the eyes, cheekbone and neck to give it a more realism. Darken the circle in the background to create contrast between the subject and the space around them.\r\nWell done and Keep up the Creative work!',NUL