,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:20:29','2025-06-24 14:20:29'),(14131,'judge-event-evaluation-21687-1750738867',21687,344,16,11,3,2025,201,'552',NULL,7776,55,8802,17,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Acrylic painting entry Joana.\r\nIt is a stunning piece of artwork. The vibrant colors and careful blending bring the frangipani flowers and leaves to life so beautifully. Your attention to detail, especially in the textures and shading, shows great skill and patience.\r\nThis piece feels both lively and calming - fantastic work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:21:07','2025-06-24 14:21:07'),(14132,'judge-event-evaluation-20240-1750738875',20240,346,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7557,4208,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Jia Yu, your work demonstrates excellent creativity, originality, and strong composition—definitely worthy of a command performance. However, due to the poor quality of photo printing, I’m unable to award that distinction at this time. Improving the print quality will better showcase your technical skill and bring your excellent photographic vision to its full potential.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:21:15','2025-06-24 14:21:15'),(14133,'judge-event-evaluation-20842-1750738886',20842,345,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,8760,5804,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jeremaiah. Light plays a crucial role in bringing out a great photo. The front of the car is a bit dark and you can improve that. You are learning and growing with this extra knowledge of taking photos. Hope that you keep trying for best results.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU