 you are taking photos please make sure that your phone is focused only on a subject and remove all distractions from your photos',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:27:18','2025-06-24 14:27:18'),(14144,'judge-event-evaluation-21686-1750739242',21686,344,16,11,3,2025,201,'552',NULL,7682,55,7549,17,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. A few points deducted in areas you can improve in. Remember to have you art work ready for hanging. \r\nAlways refer to convention guidelines. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:27:22','2025-06-24 14:27:22'),(14145,'judge-event-evaluation-21683-1750739279',21683,344,16,11,3,2025,200,'551',NULL,7799,55,7761,17,'Open',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'The artwork shows effort yet, adding shades and highlights to the drawing would have given it a more depth and texture. The painting should be built up using a series of semi-transparent washes worked from lighter washes. While the general shape of the feathers is present, adding finer details or textural elements to the feathers could improve its appearance and make it more lifelike. Overall, there is potential to do better. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:27:59','2025-06-24 14:27:59'),(14146,'judge-event-evaluation-20834-1750739286',20834,345,16,11,3,2025,129,'321',NULL,8765,5804,8800,69,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission.  Your embroidery displayed creativity and effort. The flowers and the inclusion of a Bible verse showcased your capability and th