0,99.00,-10,NULL,'Salote, your collection is outstanding! The technical skill, creativity, and originality are all exceptional. The composition, lighting, and focus demonstrate a mature understanding of photography. The presentation and documentation are perfect, reflecting great care and professionalism. A truly commendable submission—well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:38:01','2025-06-24 14:38:01'),(14170,'judge-event-evaluation-21067-1750739894',21067,344,16,11,3,2025,115,'304',NULL,8819,55,7756,61,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:38:14','2025-06-24 14:38:14'),(14171,'judge-event-evaluation-21568-1750739929',21568,344,16,11,3,2025,200,'551',NULL,8857,55,7761,17,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A creative painting however, the turtle could have been placed in the center to give a better presentation of the painting. Techniques for creating more depth in the water, such as varying shades of blue or incorporating subtle light effects could have been used. There was also no hanger attached to the back of the frame hence, no points was awarded. Great effort put in. Good Job1',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:38:49','2025-06-24 14:38:49'),(14173,'judge-event-evaluation-21064-1750739938',21064,344,16,11,3,2025,115,'304',NULL,8814,55,7861,61,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort you put into your project. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N