oughout your book and that itself is noteworthy. Outstanding work on your scrapbook Qutololove! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:40:02','2025-06-24 14:40:02'),(14179,'judge-event-evaluation-21539-1750740006',21539,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8882,55,7766,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:40:06','2025-06-24 14:40:06'),(14180,'judge-event-evaluation-21064-1750740027',21064,344,16,11,3,2025,115,'304',NULL,8814,55,7756,61,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Evan, great effort on your dragonfly sculpture! It’s clear you’ve put a lot of work into it, especially with the choice of materials like stainless steel, re-bar, and your use of cutting and welding. The design itself is visually striking and shows a lot of creativity.\r\n\r\nHowever, based on the project guidelines, it was meant to be a three-dimensional decorative piece. Your sculpture, while well-crafted, is only viewable in two dimensions, which doesn’t fully meet the project’s requirements.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:40:27','2025-06-24 14:40:27'),(14181,'judge-event-evaluation-21682-1750740047',21682,344,16,11,3,2025,200,'551',NULL,7804,55,7761,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 14:40:47','2025-06-24 14:40:47'),(14182,'judge-event-evaluation-21817-1750740052',21817,356,16,11,3,202