ive work!  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:03:22','2025-06-24 15:03:22'),(14222,'judge-event-evaluation-21447-1750741434',21447,344,16,11,3,2025,164,'405',NULL,7698,55,7756,2,'Collection','13',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Great job, Joshua! Your macro picture is of good quality. On the original picture, the close-up shot of the candle at night on the table is visually effective and captures detail. The lighting adds a calm and focused mood to the image. However, the printed photo does not show the originated quality of the picture. Well done on your effort and creativity.\r\n\r\nKeep it up!.\r\n\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:03:54','2025-06-24 15:03:54'),(14223,'judge-event-evaluation-21330-1750741510',21330,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8841,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work, Sarah! Your photograph showcases strong originality and creativity, along with excellent technical skills such as composition, lighting, and focus. The quality of submission is impressive, and the image is well presented. To reach an even higher score next time, please ensure all documentation and presentation criteria are fully met. Keep up the fantastic effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:05:10','2025-06-24 15:05:11'),(14224,'judge-event-evaluation-21433-1750741595',21433,344,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7698,55,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Joshua, for your effort. Your subject is clear but I think with proper lighting you can get better results. Being creative a