e Photoshop where the photo was printed from so that your exhibit may look as remarkable as the origiinal photo. Well done Jonathan Danford.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:10:02','2025-06-24 15:10:02'),(14228,'judge-event-evaluation-21750-1750741814',21750,344,16,11,3,2025,120,'310',NULL,8842,55,7843,54,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Your life perseveres through the pages. Your scrapbook is acknowledged for its emotional depth and originality.  It is also mindfully crafted which reflects your love for your village, Nasau.  What adds a lovelier touch is the crafts and media chosen. Thank you for what you have shared! Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:10:14','2025-06-24 15:10:14'),(14229,'judge-event-evaluation-21151-1750741936',21151,347,16,11,3,2025,177,'455',NULL,7268,5806,8871,2,'Open','13',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Salote Koto.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:12:16','2025-06-24 15:12:16'),(14230,'judge-event-evaluation-21098-1750742031',21098,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8825,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Vanessa, your photograph demonstrates strong originality and creativity, with well-thought-out composition and effective use of enhancements. The technical aspects such as focus and lighting are good, though there is room for improvement. The presentation and mounting are neat. Keep refining your skills, and you will continue to produce wonderful work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:13:51','2025-06-24 15:13:51'),(14231,'judge-event-evaluation-20296-1750742067',20296,346,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7181,4208,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'You  took a great picture but the printing shop did not do a great job. With the original, the colors are more realistic and beautiful. Please get it your photos printed on glossy paper for perfect results. Thank you for your work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:14:27','2025-06-24 15:14:27'),(14232,'judge-event-evaluation-21160-1750742137',21160,347,16,11,3,2025,177,'455',NULL,7273,5806,8871,2,'Open','13',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Perfection! Well done Torika Verevakabau.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:15:37','2025-06-24 15:15:37'),(14233,'judge-event-evaluation-21521-1750742267',21521,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7718,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Marisa, your photograph is truly impressive with excellent originality and creativity that clearly stand out. The composition, color, and lighting are skillfully handled, showcasing your strong technical ability. Focus could be slightly sharper, but overall, the photo is beautifully presented and well mounted. Keep up the great work and continue exploring your unique vision!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:17:47','2025-06-24 15:17:47'),(14234,'judge-event-evaluation-21483-1750742450',21483,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7650,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission on this architectural pencil sketch. This is a well planned, technically strong architectural sketch that show a great foundation in perspective drawing. It reflects discipline and growing skill in spatial design. some pointers for improvement: Adding shadows under the roof overhang, stairs,and the base platform would give a more realism to the sketch and indicate a light source direction. Some lines, like on the front base platform and roof edge, could be slightly adjusted to better align with the vanishing points.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:20:50','2025-06-24 15:20:50'),(14237,'judge-event-evaluation-21179-1750742512',21179,347,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7245,5806,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,83.00,-10,NULL,' Your photo demonstrates solid creativity and originality, with good composition and thoughtful use of enhancements. The degree of difficulty is commendable, reflecting your effort in tackling a challenging subject. Some technical areas like focus and initial impact could be improved to elevate the overall impression. Your photo is well mounted and documented—keep honing your skills to achieve even stronger results next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:21:52','2025-06-24 15:21:52'),(14238,'judge-event-evaluation-20288-1750742714',20288,346,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7560,4208,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Terumah, your submission shows strong originality and creativity, with excellent composition that clearly demonstrates your technical skills. The photo captures the intended category well and reflects thoughtful effort. Some minor improvements in focus, lighting, and presentation could help enhance the overall impact. Keep up the great work and continue refining your craft!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:25:14','2025-06-24 15:25:14'),(14240,'judge-event-evaluation-21425-1750742939',21425,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8850,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Lanlyn, your photograph demonstrates strong technical skills, especially in composition and creativity. The originality shines through, and the photo is well presented overall. Some slight improvements in lighting, focus, and color could elevate the image further. Keep practicing these details to enhance your storytelling through photography. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:28:59','2025-06-24 15:28:59'),(14243,'judge-event-evaluation-20356-1750743592',20356,346,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,8709,4208,8871,17,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Shekinah Stevens. Please do keep in mind that next time when you select pen and ink as your event, always remeber to put a dirextion of light by shading the shadows of the art-work to show where the light is shining from. Also, take note that every framed art-work must be ready to hang.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:39:52','2025-06-24 15:39:52'),(14244,'judge-event-evaluation-20810-1750743631',20810,345,16,11,3,2025,120,'310',NULL,8755,5804,NULL,54,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,0.00,'\'Kiwi adventure\'\'s is simple and elegant. The booklet you chose contrasts well with the colourful texts and pictures. Each page is filled with memoriable value. Thank you for submitting this entry.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:40:31','2025-06-24 15:40:31'),(14245,'judge-event-evaluation-20829-1750743916',20829,345,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,7520,5804,8871,17,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Lily-Ann-Hickes. Just work on the direction of light so that the perspective of your art-work can be more convincing. Again, well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:45:16','2025-06-24 15:45:16'),(14246,'judge-event-evaluation-21171-1750743943',21171,347,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7812,5806,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Seini, this is an excellent submission. Your image is powerful and well-composed, showing a clear understanding of lighting, exposure, and creative vision. The originality and clarity of the photograph are outstanding. Just a bit more refinement in enhancements and documentation would perfect your entry. A beautiful piece—well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:45:43','2025-06-24 15:45:43'),(14247,'judge-event-evaluation-20810-1750744007',20810,345,16,11,3,2025,120,'310',NULL,8755,5804,7843,54,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,0.00,'\'Kiwi Adventure\' graces elegance and simplicity throughout it\'s pages. The color of the booklet balances well with the fonts and lovely pictures. Graceful expression of memory and art. Beautiful work Shiloh!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:46:47','2025-06-24 15:46:47'),(14248,'judge-event-evaluation-21435-1750744108',21435,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7658,55,7863,2,'Open','9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Jorge for your submission. Just few things you have to consider:\r\n1. Composition- un even of cropping was done to the photo.\r\n2. Lighting, Colour and focus - apply the appropriate amount of each so the photo can stand out. \r\n3. Take a full picture of the helicopter from the side where the full body can be seen - not from the back and standing side ways. \r\n\r\nOther than that, thank you for your effort Jorge. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:48:28','2025-06-24 15:48:28'),(14249,'judge-event-evaluation-21745-1750744172',21745,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8842,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Senikau, your work is visually compelling and demonstrates excellent creativity and originality. The technical aspects lighting, focus, and composition are handled with skill. While the photo was beautifully presented overall, slight improvements in mounting and documentation could elevate the entry further. Great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:49:32','2025-06-24 15:49:32'),(14250,'judge-event-evaluation-21562-1750744284',21562,344,16,11,3,2025,170,'414','3',0,55,7789,4,'Collection','19',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Really great job of promoting your school !\r\nWhile enjoyable, the presentation is in a Non-Linear format (Slideshow , controllable) rather than the entered Linear format.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:51:24','2025-06-30 20:21:45'),(14251,'judge-event-evaluation-20305-1750744389',20305,346,16,11,3,2025,170,'414','2',0,4208,7789,4,'Collection','19',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Great work ! \r\nVery informative.\r\nUnfortunately it appears to be in a Non-Linear format rather than the entered Linear format.Please be sure to check the guidelines thoroughly beforehand\r\nStay blessed !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:53:09','2025-06-30 20:21:28'),(14252,'judge-event-evaluation-21138-1750744441',21138,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8809,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission on this delicate Hibiscus sketch. Sketching is not about drawing an outline or colouring in. Rather it focuses on lines, strokes and shading to form the picture. This is a graceful , skilful sketched Hibiscus flower, demonstrating strong foundational techniques and a gentle artistic sensibility. Few suggestion for improvements: Slightly darker shading under the overlapping petals around the stamen, and behind the leaves , would help each part stand out more clearly. Adding a soft circular background shading behind the flower would help it pop more from the picture.\r\nWell Done and Keep up the creative work!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:54:01','2025-06-24 15:54:01'),(14253,'judge-event-evaluation-21583-1750744493',21583,344,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,8864,55,8871,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'You did a great job Steve. Your art-work was too good but your frame caused the deduction of your points. I also believe in re-using and improvisation but presention is very important as you can see that your frame is falling apart.\r\n\r\nOtherwise, well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:54:53','2025-06-24 15:54:53'),(14254,'judge-event-evaluation-20268-1750744608',20268,346,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8709,4208,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Shekinah, your photo is outstanding visually striking and technically flawless. The composition, lighting, and post-processing are handled with a high level of expertise, and your creative vision shines through clearly. This entry demonstrates both artistic maturity and alignment with the category. Just one point shy of perfect due to poor quality of photo printing. Exceptional work—well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:56:48','2025-06-24 15:56:48'),(14255,'judge-event-evaluation-20257-1750744678',20257,346,16,11,3,2025,170,'414','1',0,4208,7789,4,'Collection','19',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for telling your story Aviella !\r\nStay blessed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 15:57:58','2025-06-24 15:57:58'),(14256,'judge-event-evaluation-21163-1750744887',21163,344,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,8823,55,8871,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Shanaya Sen. Please, next time submit your art-work than fill in your report otherwise there will be confusion. Also, remeber that all framed exhibits MUST be ready to HANG!\r\n\r\nOtherwise, well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:01:27','2025-06-24 16:01:27'),(14258,'judge-event-evaluation-21527-1750744943',21527,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,8854,55,7863,2,'Open','9',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Asher for the submission. Just few things that you have to consider:\r\n1. Initial impression- it needs to be eye catching. The photo is not taken fully. \r\n2. The focus of the picture is the car - the others are distracting elements (the human body and the banner) \r\n3. Please add appropriate of colour, lighting and sensible use of enhancements. \r\n4. Proper documentation needs to be submitted. \r\n\r\nOther than that, keep practicing and keep improving.\r\nVinaka. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:02:23','2025-06-24 16:02:23'),(14259,'judge-event-evaluation-21503-1750745206',21503,344,16,11,3,2025,150,'366',NULL,8863,55,7755,67,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:06:46','2025-06-24 16:06:46'),(14261,'judge-event-evaluation-20850-1750745292',20850,345,16,11,3,2025,194,'506',NULL,7360,5804,8871,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Sailosi Ledua. I know you have alot of potential. Just improve on your shading to bring out the direction of light. Also, do keep in mind that all framed exhibits must be read to HANG.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:08:12','2025-06-24 16:08:12'),(14262,'judge-event-evaluation-21752-1750745300',21752,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7783,55,7863,2,'Open','9',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Shivali for your submission. I would recommend if you could have a different colour matte board to complement the photo, add little bit of brightness and colour to the photo to stand out and I only wish that you could take the whole photo of it. Keep improving! \r\nVinaka. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:08:20','2025-06-24 16:08:20'),(14263,'judge-event-evaluation-21304-1750745377',21304,344,16,11,3,2025,193,'505',NULL,8832,55,7843,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,0.00,'It is a beautifully colored butterfly. I can see the details of blending perfectly. The framework gives the deliberate attention to the art, enhancing it. Lovely work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:09:37','2025-06-24 16:09:37'),(14264,'judge-event-evaluation-21632-1750745456',21632,344,16,11,3,2025,144,'360',NULL,7690,55,8800,54,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Your scrapbooking displayed creativity and effort. The use of a black background effectively made the text and your photos stand out, creating a visual contrast. However, incorporating more decorations and visual aids would have enhanced the overall appeal and brought more creativity to the presentation. Overall, a job well-done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:10:56','2025-06-24 16:10:56'),(14266,'judge-event-evaluation-21448-1750745496',21448,344,16,11,3,2025,164,'405',NULL,7657,55,NULL,2,'Collection','13',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Great job capturing this macro shot of the spiral shell! The close-up perspective draws the attention of the viewers to the beautiful natural geometry and intricate of the shell. The spiral pattern is well centered and creates a strong focal point. It naturally draws the eye inward.\r\n\r\nWell done Pamela!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:11:36','2025-06-24 16:11:36'),(14267,'judge-event-evaluation-21409-1750745518',21409,344,16,11,3,2025,150,'366',NULL,8849,55,7755,67,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your submission and the hard work you\'ve clearly put into creating this beautiful dress. The vibrant colours you chose are eye-catching and complement the design wonderfully. I also really appreciated the creativity in your pattern choice—it shows a good sense of style and originality.\r\nHowever, I had to deduct a few points as the pattern details and some related information about how you carried out the task were not submitted. Including that would have given me better insight into your process and decision-making.\r\nOverall, well done! I\'m impressed with your effort and creativity—keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:11:58','2025-06-24 16:11:58'),(14268,'judge-event-evaluation-21654-1750745596',21654,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7690,55,7863,2,'Open','9',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Josephine for your submission. I would like to recommend  if you could use a different colour matte board to complement your photo, and add appropriate of colour and lighting so the photo can stand out. Keep improving!\r\nVinaka. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:13:16','2025-06-24 16:13:16'),(14