and does not allow the flower attention. Thank you, nevertheless, for your work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:43:47','2025-06-24 16:43:47'),(14316,'judge-event-evaluation-21654-1750747579',21654,344,16,11,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7690,55,8871,2,'Open','9',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Josephine Redfern. Please make sure to fill in all the sections in the report before submitting.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:46:19','2025-06-24 16:46:19'),(14317,'judge-event-evaluation-21328-1750747612',21328,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8838,55,7758,2,'Collection','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'It shows great originality and creativity, which makes your work stand out. The composition is strong and well thought out. To improve further, focus on refining lighting and exposure to bring more impact to your images. Keep practicing your technical skills and attention to presentation details—these will enhance the overall quality of your submissions. Well done and keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:46:52','2025-06-24 16:46:52'),(14318,'judge-event-evaluation-21701-1750747633',21701,344,16,11,3,2025,205,'556',NULL,7799,55,7755,17,'Open',NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your hard work and dedication on the pen and ink project. Your careful attention to detail and commitment to craftsmanship truly stood out. The precision and effort you put into your work did not go unnoticed.\r\nMore practise and dedication i beleive you will do much more better in the future.\r\n\r\nGreat job, and keep up the excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:47:13','2025-06-24 16:47:13'),(14319,'judge-event-evaluation-21700-1750747730',21700,344,16,11,3,2025,205,'556',NULL,7776,55,7755,17,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your hard work and dedication on the pen and ink project. Your careful attention to detail and commitment to craftsmanship truly stood out. \r\nThe precision and effort you put into your work did not go unnoticed.\r\n\r\nGreat job, and keep up the excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:48:50','2025-06-24 16:48:50'),(14320,'judge-event-evaluation-20325-1750747746',20325,346,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8709,4208,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this expressive pencil sketch.  This pencil sketch demonstrates a strong effort in observational drawing and basic shading techniques. A commendable entry that shows creativity, developing skill and foundational sketching knowledge. Some pointers for improvement: Add more contrast and blend the shading smoothly to emphasize light and shadow. This would give the fruit a more rounded appearance.  Introducing vein on the leaf would add more realism and texture.\r\nGood Job and Keep up the creativity!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:49:06','2025-06-24 16:49:06'),(14321,'judge-event-evaluation-21679-1750747755',21679,344,16,11,3,2025,199,'550',NULL,7692,55,7863,17,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Great job on your work! You got almost everything correct, just a small point to remember: the painting