ee it say, \"Wow, that\'s awesome.\" Also with just the building your focus, you can eliminate most of the people. Well, I am sure you can do it so looking forward to see your talent unfold.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:50:35','2025-06-24 16:50:35'),(14326,'judge-event-evaluation-21415-1750747835',21415,344,16,11,3,2025,131,'323',NULL,7679,55,8800,70,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submissions. Your work displayed creativity and effort. However, the pattern was not submitted, resulting in points deductions. Additionally, a visible knot afftected the neatness of the work. For future entries, pay close attention to finishing techniques to help improve the overall presentations. Overall, you did a great job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:50:35','2025-06-24 16:50:35'),(14327,'judge-event-evaluation-21158-1750747969',21158,347,16,11,3,2025,205,'556',NULL,7272,5806,7755,17,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your hard work and dedication on the pen and ink project. Your careful attention to detail and commitment to craftsmanship truly stood out. The precision and effort you put into your work did not go unnoticed.\r\n\r\nGreat job, and keep up the excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 16:52:49','2025-06-24 16:52:49'),(14328,'judge-event-evaluation-21236-1750748001',21236,347,16,11,3,2025,131,'323',NULL,7819,5806,8800,70,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission. Your work displayed creativity and effort. However, the pattern was not s