he shaded areas and the highlights would help the flower stand out.  A light background or surrounding elements could enrich the setting and give more context to the flower.\r\nGood Job and Keep up the creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 17:22:03','2025-06-24 17:22:03'),(14387,'judge-event-evaluation-21422-1750749733',21422,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,7659,55,7758,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 17:22:13','2025-06-24 17:22:13'),(14388,'judge-event-evaluation-21700-1750749763',21700,344,16,11,3,2025,205,'556',NULL,7776,55,7863,17,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent work Joana!  Your skill and attention to detail are impressive. Keep up the fantastic work and continue to develop your talent!\r\nVinaka. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 17:22:43','2025-06-24 17:22:43'),(14389,'judge-event-evaluation-21097-1750749778',21097,344,16,11,3,2025,160,'401',NULL,8823,55,7758,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 17:22:58','2025-06-24 17:22:58'),(14390,'judge-event-evaluation-21699-1750749837',21699,344,16,11,3,2025,205,'556',NULL,7804,55,7863,17,'Open',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Fantastic job on your pen and ink piece Jiaxing! The craftsmanship and creativity you\'ve shown are impressive. Remember, once it\'s hung, it will be even more impactful to viewers