o detail and use of color is truly remarkable!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:43:42','2025-06-24 18:43:42'),(14464,'judge-event-evaluation-21494-1750754774',21494,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8861,55,7789,6,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well written , and conveys emotion !\r\nJust be careful with the consistency of the meter of your poem.\r\nStay blessed!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:46:14','2025-06-24 18:46:14'),(14465,'judge-event-evaluation-21580-1750754787',21580,344,16,11,3,2025,204,'555',NULL,8854,55,7756,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:46:27','2025-06-24 18:46:27'),(14466,'judge-event-evaluation-21669-1750754934',21669,344,16,11,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,8868,55,8871,2,'Open','11',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Remember its GENERAL not STRUCTURE/VEHICLES.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:48:54','2025-06-24 18:48:54'),(14467,'judge-event-evaluation-20340-1750755039',20340,346,16,11,3,2025,206,'557',NULL,7186,4208,8801,56,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Creative concept, solid technique, and confident execution. Minor improvements needed in cutting and print quality. Great overall impact!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:50:39','2025-06-24 18:50:39'),(14468,'judge-event-evaluation-21696-1750755113',21696,344,16,11,3,2025,204,'555',NULL,7804,55,7756,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful color blending in your work! The overall effect is lovely, but there’s room for more detail in the green areas and the ocean from the balcony view. Adding a bit more texture and depth to these elements will enhance the realism and make the scene even more striking.\r\n\r\nThat said, great effort and time have clearly gone into this piece. Keep up the hard work, and continue developing your technique!\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:51:53','2025-06-24 18:51:53'),(14469,'judge-event-evaluation-21547-1750755148',21547,344,16,11,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7743,55,8871,2,'Open','11',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Beautifully taken and well mounted but please avoidind the cutting of the center-piece.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:52:28','2025-06-24 18:52:28'),(14470,'judge-event-evaluation-21453-1750755341',21453,344,16,11,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,8849,55,8871,2,'Open','11',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Well done but next time avoid the center-piece from being cut.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:55:41','2025-06-24 18:55:41'),(14471,'judge-event-evaluation-20956-1750755356',20956,344,16,11,3,2025,204,'555',NULL,8854,55,7756,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:55:56','2025-06-24 18:55:56'),(14472,'judge-event-evaluation-21581-1750755365',21581,344,16,11,3,2025,204,'555',NULL,7731,55,7756,17,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:56:05','2025-06-24 18:56:05'),(14473,'judge-event-evaluation-21619-1750755367',21619,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,7741,55,7239,6,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your effort, Joy. Be careful that your tenses don\'t clash in the poem and that correct punctuation is used eg. semi-colons to link two parts of a sentence together. When finding words that rhyme, take the time to look in a thesaurus for words that sound similar which can enhance the quality of your poem. I look forward to seeing you develop in your poetry-writing skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:56:07','2025-06-30 12:51:29'),(14475,'judge-event-evaluation-21495-1750755580',21495,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8882,55,7789,6,'Open',NULL,100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for putting forth an effort !\r\nJust needs consistency in your meter and grammar\r\nAlso, the last stanza may be a bit harsh and not very Christ-like in attitude.\r\nStay blessed !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 18:59:40','2025-06-24 18:59:40'),(14476,'judge-event-evaluation-21666-1750755653',21666,344,16,11,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7686,55,8871,2,'Open','11',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:00:53','2025-06-24 19:00:53'),(14477,'judge-event-evaluation-20584-1750755754',20584,345,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,7519,5804,7240,8,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Book Report Mele. Keep it up ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:02:34','2025-06-24 19:02:34'),(14478,'judge-event-evaluation-21496-1750755773',21496,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8863,55,7789,6,'Open',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for putting forth an effort!\r\nKeep writing , and practicing different poetry forms and meters!\r\nStay blessed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:02:53','2025-06-24 19:02:53'),(14479,'judge-event-evaluation-21156-1750756382',21156,347,16,11,3,2025,207,'558',NULL,7272,5806,7756,52,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This beautiful mixed media piece, created with pen and ink, colored pencils in green and brown, and mechanical pencil, is truly striking. I deeply appreciate the concept behind your title, Jesus – Centre of My Life. The decision to depict four different tree trunks, each pointing in various directions, is a powerful visual representation of the theme. The cross at the center ties everything together so effectively, symbolizing the unchanging focal point amid life\'s many paths.\r\n\r\nGreat effort and time have clearly gone into this piece. The attention to detail and thoughtful composition make your work stand out. Keep up the fantastic effort!\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:13:02','2025-06-24 19:13:02'),(14480,'judge-event-evaluation-21615-1750756600',21615,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,7692,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Unfortunately, Francine, your poem was flagged by multiple AI detection sites as not as original piece of poetry written by you as required by Student Convention guidelines and therefore cannot place. I\'d like to encourage you to take the time to wait on God for His ideas when writing a poem. I look forward to seeing your original piece next year.\r\nBe careful also of your punctuation usage of commas, many of which should not be in this piece.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:16:40','2025-06-30 12:51:09'),(14481,'judge-event-evaluation-20236-1750757157',20236,346,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,8712,4208,7240,8,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Book Report, Qutololove. A helpful reminder, make sure to spell check your report and keep flow of points from one to the other as connective as possible without going from one topic to another and repeating some of the points already mentioned.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:25:57','2025-06-24 19:25:57'),(14482,'judge-event-evaluation-21758-1750757523',21758,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8857,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Unfortunately, Helenic, your poem was flagged by multiple AI detection sites as not as original piece of poetry written by you as required by Student Convention guidelines and therefore cannot place. I\'d like to encourage you to take the time to wait on God for His ideas when writing a poem. I look forward to seeing an original piece by you next year.\r\nBe careful also of your punctuation usage of commas, some of which are missing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:32:03','2025-06-30 12:51:31'),(14484,'judge-event-evaluation-21616-1750758634',21616,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,7776,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Joana, for your meaningful poetry entry, describing one of the Jesus\' most well-known miracles. Be careful that you don\'t miss important punctuation. If you\'ve used quotation marks to indicate spoken parts, then correct ending punctuation must complete the sentence and therefore, the whole piece must show correct punctuation, whether commas, periods or semi-colons. I look forward to seeing more of your poetry next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:50:34','2025-06-24 19:50:34'),(14485,'judge-event-evaluation-20266-1750759016',20266,346,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,8710,4208,7240,8,'Collection',NULL,100,53.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, for your Book Report, Tong Xinning. Just a helpful tip, make sure to proof read your report whether by having someone read it or when typing it up to use the spell check. Also list your points down so that you keep the flow of your report smooth, and won\'t repeat points you have already stated. All in all keep it up and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 19:56:56','2025-06-24 19:56:56'),(14486,'judge-event-evaluation-20365-1750759269',20365,347,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8795,5806,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your heart-felt poem, Jonathan. You definitely have a gift for writing poetry and the more you compose poetry, the more creative you\'ll become. Keep seeking God for His ideas and one day, I\'ll look forward to maybe seeing a book of your published poems in a Christian bookstore.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:01:09','2025-06-24 20:01:09'),(14487,'judge-event-evaluation-20943-1750759936',20943,347,16,11,3,2025,348,'768','1',0,5806,NULL,31,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Wonderful rearranging Apimeleki, that reflected your effort that you have invested in produce this two songs. I encourage you to expand your horizon to learn various types of music that you can use them as medium to communicate the message of Jesus Christ to the world. Keep the amazing work.\r\nNote: The Ocean can be effective by using the technique of “ best is less” From the beginning to create space then gradually build the intensity\'s in the bridge . ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:12:16','2025-06-24 20:12:16'),(14488,'judge-event-evaluation-21387-1750760019',21387,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8846,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Though your poem appears heart-felt, unfortunately, Jonzo, your poem was flagged by multiple AI detection sites as not an original piece of poetry written by you as required by Student Convention guidelines and therefore cannot place. I\'d like to encourage you to take the time to wait on God for His ideas when writing a poem. I look forward to seeing an original piece by you next year.\r\nBe careful also of your punctuation usage of commas, many of which should not be in this piece.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:13:39','2025-06-30 12:50:29'),(14490,'judge-event-evaluation-20943-1750760818',20943,347,16,11,3,2025,348,'768','1',0,5806,7483,31,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,NULL,NULL,'Wonderful rearrangement Apimeleki. You have displayed your commitment and effort in producing these two songs. Keep up the great work and continue to widen the scope of musical knowledge that you can use as medium to reach a generation for Jesus Christ.\r\nNote: The song “ Ocean “ can be start with very notes then gradually build the intensity to the bridge that gives the mood and feel for what is the storyline is about.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:26:58','2025-06-24 20:26:58'),(14491,'judge-event-evaluation-21493-1750761078',21493,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8858,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Jordan for your heart-felt poem.\r\nYou would have gained many more marks if you had run your poem through grammar and spell check as it would have highlighted words that needed capital letters (eg. Mount Calvary, He) as well as missing punctuation marks (eg. the question mark should be at the end of Stanza 1; missing commas, periods and semi-colons) .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:31:18','2025-06-24 20:31:18'),(14492,'judge-event-evaluation-20244-1750761277',20244,346,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,7558,4208,7240,8,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Book Report, Yuvaan Mishra. A helpful tip, try to choose one point as your main focus, eg. a Plot Summary, a Character, or a Theme analysis, instead of all three. Also have someone proof read your report as well as using the spell check feature for spelling and grammar. All in all keep it up and God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:34:37','2025-06-24 20:34:37'),(14493,'judge-event-evaluation-21394-1750761305',21394,344,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,7675,55,7240,8,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your book report Jiaqi. Keep on practicing to improve on your writing, and remember to choose carefully which topic you will be focusing on whether the plot summary, character, or theme analysis and keep it clear.\r\n(likely use of a.i.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:35:05','2025-06-30 12:52:54'),(14494,'judge-event-evaluation-21240-1750761343',21240,344,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,7708,55,7240,8,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your report Klyana. Just a little tip when focusing on the plot summary, try to keep the focus on a summary of the plot.\r\n(likely use of a.i.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:35:43','2025-06-30 12:52:52'),(14495,'judge-event-evaluation-20587-1750761368',20587,345,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,7525,5804,7240,8,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Book Report, Samuel. A helpful reminder, try to choose one point as your main focus, eg. A Plot Summary, Character, or Analysis of the Theme, rather than trying to do all three.\r\n(likely use of a.i.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:36:08','2025-06-30 12:52:51'),(14496,'judge-event-evaluation-20965-1750761537',20965,344,16,11,3,2025,22,'064',NULL,8866,55,7240,8,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,-5.00,'Thank you for your book report. The connection between the characters and the plot, as well as the theme of the Book Report, could be a bit clearer. Just be sure that this is your own work.\r\n(likely use of a.i.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:38:57','2025-06-30 12:52:04'),(14497,'judge-event-evaluation-21622-1750761585',21622,344,16,11,3,2025,22,'064',NULL,7778,55,7240,8,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,-6.00,'Thank you for your Book Report Euchong. Just a bit of advice try to keep focus on which ever point you choose eg. plot summary, character, or theme analysis clear. Also try to maintain a connective flow from each point you make to the next one.\r\n(likely use of a.i.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:39:45','2025-06-30 12:52:14'),(14498,'judge-event-evaluation-21620-1750761606',21620,344,16,11,3,2025,22,'064',NULL,7780,55,7240,8,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Book Report Ateca.\r\n(likely use of a.i.)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:40:06','2025-06-30 12:52:06'),(14500,'judge-event-evaluation-20234-1750762162',20234,346,16,11,3,2025,8,'014',NULL,7556,4208,7240,8,'Collection',NULL,100,59.00,-10,-5.00,'Thank you, for your Book Report Yahan Chen. A helpful reminder to choose one point to be the main focus eg. Plot Summary, a Character, or an Analysis of the Theme. Also have someone proof read your text, as well as use the spell check feature to check spelling and grammar. All in all keep it up and God Bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:49:22','2025-06-24 20:49:22'),(14501,'judge-event-evaluation-21617-1750762410',21617,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,7690,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Josephine, for your delightful poem. Just remember to check for punctuation errors (\'one\' should have a capital letter as it\'s talking about God) or typing errors (a missing word between we and deeply?). I\'ll look forward to seeing more of your poetry next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 20:53:30','2025-06-24 20:53:30'),(14502,'judge-event-evaluation-20943-1750762899',20943,347,16,11,3,2025,348,'768','1',0,5806,7240,31,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your Instrumental Arranging Api. Some parts could have been softer in terms of volume.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 21:01:39','2025-06-24 21:01:39'),(14503,'judge-event-evaluation-21494-1750763152',21494,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8861,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Karzai, for your poem. It has a great message, but be careful that in your desire to find rhyming words, it doesn\'t lessen the message in some of the stanzas. Having a thesaurus or searching for rhyming words on Google will help you identify words you can use without watering-down the message needlessly. \r\nAlso, be careful with correct punctuation...periods, commas or semi-colons as many marks can be deducted for incorrect or missing punctuation. I look forward to seeing more of your poetry next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 21:05:52','2025-06-24 21:05:52'),(14504,'judge-event-evaluation-21495-1750764374',21495,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8882,55,7239,6,NULL,NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your poem, Lydia, and I can see that you have a great relationship with your two dogs. Your choice of the last sentence, unfortunately, negates the positive thoughts you expressed in the poem and should have been reworded in a more positive manner.\r\nBe careful when choosing rhyming words that words are not just chosen which are trite, but rather, use words that add to the meaning of the previous line of poetry.\r\nAlways check your end-line punctuation as there may not need to be any punctuation if the sentence carries on. \r\nI look forward to seeing you compose a new poem for next year\'s Convention....God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 21:26:14','2025-06-24 21:26:14'),(14505,'judge-event-evaluation-21496-1750765091',21496,344,16,11,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8863,55,7239,6,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Myrna, for your very evangelistic poem and the the invitation it gives to those who don\'t yet know Jesus as their Lord and Savior. I would encourage you to Google about end-line punctuation in poetry. There doesn\'t always have to be something at the end of a line if the sentence carries on, but if there\'s two parts to a sentence, then a semi-colon is the best choice (eg. after \'introduce\' on the first line). I look forward to seeing more of your poetry next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-24 21:38:11','2025-06-24 21:38:11'),(14506,'judge-event-evaluation-21274-1750792628',21274,344,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,8881,55,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This is a great shot, Rulin. The subject is very clear. However, I still think that you can do better. For instance, cutting off parts of the grass in front and maybe less of the sky to bring out more of the subject. The canvas background is nice but a blue border may look even better. You have the talent and I believe with determination you can be the best at this. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 05:17:08','2025-06-25 05:17:08'),(14507,'judge-event-evaluation-21272-1750793281',21272,344,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7715,55,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'I like your idea, Timoci. The subject is clear but I still think you can do better. I think your subject is not really centered so if you remove some of the clouds, it will be  much better. Also a white background may not as good as a black  one. With your report, please read and check your spelling or you can get someone to help you out. Thank you for your great work and all the best to you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 05:28:01','2025-06-25 05:28:01'),(14508,'judge-event-evaluation-21197-1750793902',21197,347,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7247,5806,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'I like your work, Rehan and the initiative you took to take your photo. In my opinion, you can improve by applying just enough light that will bring out the reality of the subject. You mounted your work so well and this shows how much you have in you. Keep trying, keep learning and you will get there. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 05:38:22','2025-06-25 05:38:23'),(14509,'judge-event-evaluation-21529-1750794321',21529,344,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7736,55,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'I find your photo so unique and one of the best photos. However, a black border may be better than a white border. Thank you for your great work, Zurelle.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 05:45:21','2025-06-25 05:45:22'),(14513,'judge-event-evaluation-21200-1750795768',21200,347,16,11,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,8792,5806,7759,2,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'I like the idea and the excitement. I think a great photo can express that even after a period of time. In my opinion the light applied is not enough to expose more details of the subject and this  does have a lot of impact on the photo.  However, thank for sharing this with us. We appreciate your work and hope to see more as you grow in your skills. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 06:09:28','2025-06-25 06:09:28'),(14514,'judge-event-evaluation-21457-1750796095',21457,344,16,11,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,8847,55,7755,2,'Collection','11',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo submissions!\r\n Just a gentle reminder to double-check that no part of the photo is cut off when taking or printing—every detail counts.\r\n Keep up the great work, and we’re excited to see your improvement next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 06:14:55','2025-06-25 06:14:55'),(1451