e hard work!\r\nSent',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 06:32:58','2025-06-25 06:32:58'),(14528,'judge-event-evaluation-21137-1750800673',21137,344,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,8808,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission on this beautiful expressive pencil sketch of a dog.  This is a lovely, gentle and emotive pet dog that displays both artistic sensitivity and control. Suggestions for improvements: Slightly darker shading in some areas such as the underside of the ear, neck and around the eye, would add more realistic of the picture.  A soft shaded background could bring focus to the subject.\r\nGood Job and Keep up the Creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 07:31:13','2025-06-25 07:31:13'),(14529,'judge-event-evaluation-20263-1750800728',20263,346,16,11,3,2025,191,'503',NULL,7175,4208,7765,17,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,' Thank you for this graceful pencil sketch. Sketching is not about drawing an outline or colouring in. Rather it focuses on lines, strokes and shading to form the picture. This picture is delicate,flowing, and confidently drawn.\r\nSuggestions for growth:  Increasing contrast in a few areas like beneath overlapping petals or leaves could help the parts stand out.  A very light background tone might also help the flower pop from the page.\r\nWell Done and Keep up the creativity!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 07:32:08','2025-06-25 07:32:08'),(14530,'judge-event-evaluation-20909-1750801198',20909,347,16,11,3,2025,183,'464','1',0,5806,7