ULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'What a story, Jennifer. Ideas flow and are in sequential order. Good story line and, good choice of characters. Good job Jennifer!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 12:49:44','2025-06-25 12:49:44'),(14675,'judge-event-evaluation-20318-1750820180',20318,346,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,8713,4208,7765,56,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your hard work and the beautiful prints and painting you created for the event. It’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work.\r\nThe colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out. \r\nI did deduct some points because  of precise cuttings and make sure that in the future your cutting has to be align.\r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 12:56:20','2025-06-25 12:56:20'),(14676,'judge-event-evaluation-21477-1750820312',21477,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,7657,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your watercolour submission. This is a delicate and elegantly pleasing floral composition that reflects a thoughtful use of watercolour techniques.  The subtle blending and gentle  reach express a serene mood.  With further development in contrast and variation, the piece could stand out more. A commendable and well presented artwork.\r\nWell done and Keep up the creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 12:58:32','2025-06-25 12:58:32'),(14678,'judge-event-evaluation-21314-1750820599',21314,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,7646,55,7756,64,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Stunning work, Samyra Cao!\r\nYour clay work is truly impressive. The attention to detail is remarkable—your sense of symmetry, balance, and precision in trimming really stands out. Everything feels clean, even, and well-proportioned. Congratulations on an outstanding piece!\r\n\r\nHowever, your written report didn’t quite match the quality of your practical work. This is where you lost some points. There were multiple clay items presented, but the report lacked detailed explanations for each. If you had provided more insight into your process and the individual elements, your overall score would have been much stronger.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:03:19','2025-06-25 13:03:19'),(14679,'judge-event-evaluation-21488-1750820894',21488,344,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,7679,55,7765,56,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your hard work and the beautiful prints and painting you created for the event. It’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work. The colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out. \r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:08:14','2025-06-25 13:08:14'),(14680,'judge-event-evaluation-20811-1750820987',20811,345,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,8755,5804,7765,56,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your hard work and the beautiful prints and painting you created for the event. It’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work. \r\nThe colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out.\r\n I did deduct some points because you will need to challenge your self in the future for some new designs.\r\n\r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:09:47','2025-06-25 13:09:47'),(14682,'judge-event-evaluation-21476-1750821080',21476,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8843,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your water colour submission.  This art work displays bold use of colour and a confident grasp of flower symmetry.  The vibrant gradient from yellow to deep pink is particularly well done.  With a few refinements in detail and background work, this painting has strong potential. A joyful and well executed piece. Just an area to improve on: A soft background wash or light contrast might help the flower pop even more and prevent the composition from feeling too empty.\r\nWell done and Keep up the creative work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:11:20','2025-06-25 13:11:21'),(14683,'judge-event-evaluation-21487-1750821200',21487,344,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,7650,55,7765,56,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your hard work and the beautiful prints and painting you created for the event. \r\nIt’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work.\r\n The colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out.\r\n I did deduct some points because you need to challenge yourself on your prints for the future.\r\n\r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',