u created for the event. It’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work. The colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out. \r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:27:18','2025-06-25 13:27:18'),(14694,'judge-event-evaluation-20287-1750822338',20287,346,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,8715,4208,7765,56,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your hard work and the beautiful prints and painting you created for the event. It’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work. The colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out. \r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:32:18','2025-06-25 13:32:18'),(14696,'judge-event-evaluation-20310-1750822645',20310,346,16,11,3,2025,195,'507',NULL,7181,4208,7765,56,'Collection',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for your hard work and the beautiful prints and painting you created for the event.\r\nIt’s clear that you put a lot of effort and care into your work. The colors are vibrant, and the designs are very well thought out. \r\nyou only need to improve on some things such as choosing a subject that can be eye catching and making sure that you use colors that are bright and would complement each other.\r\nOverall, I am very impressed — your artwork is neatly presented and beautifully done. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:37:25','2025-06-25 13:37:25'),(14697,'judge-event-evaluation-21301-1750822691',21301,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8881,55,7765,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your water colour submission. Your art work presents a soft, peaceful floral scene using delicate brushwork and pastel tone.  It shows a gentle handling of the watercolour medium and conveys a calm mood.  With more attention to detail and layering, the flowers could become more visually engaging.  A lovely beginning that shows strong potential for growth. Suggested area for improvement: Adding another layer of colour or shadow around the flowers would bring depth and improve visual separation from the background.\r\nGood Job and Keep up the creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:38:11','2025-06-25 13:38:11'),(14698,'judge-event-evaluation-21058-1750822751',21058,344,16,11,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,8815,55,7847,7,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,-5.00,'Great story line Abena. It seems so real, just reading the story. Good Job! \r\nA reminder to check the guidelines so that you\'re not missing out on points.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:39:11','2025-06-25 13:39:11'),(14700,'judge-event-evaluation-21733-1750823728',21733,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,8804,55,7756,64,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:55:28','2025-06-25 13:55:28'),(14701,'judge-event-evaluation-21071-1750823733',21071,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,8805,55,7756,64,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:55:33','2025-06-25 13:55:33'),(14702,'judge-event-evaluation-21757-1750823843',21757,344,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8806,55,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your beautiful submission! The piece has great detail, and the watercolor technique is lovely. To enhance it further, try bringing more boldness and light to the colors for added contrast. Also, consider a more subtle frame that complements the work without overpowering it. Overall, great job—just a few tweaks and it will really shine!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:57:23','2025-06-25 13:57:23'),(14703,'judge-event-evaluation-21170-1750823994',21170,347,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,7813,5806,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your water colour submission.  This is a bold and engaging landscape piece that successful captures the beauty of a  beautiful lakeside scene. You show good control of colour blending and composition. With more refinement in natural details and water effects, this piece can elevate even further.  A commendable effort that reflects creativity and potential. An area of improvement: Compilisation of of documents should be specific and detailed on the presentation of the art. It depicts a beauty of a sunset with the colour contrast and combination presented, however a different detail is expressed in its document. Since the scene titled Lakeside, a slight reflection of tree or sky in the lake could make the water body more recognisable and dynamic.\r\nWell done Effort and Keep up the creative work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 13:59:54','2025-06-25 13:59:54'),(14704,'judge-event-evaluation-20854-1750824063',20854,345,16,11,3,2025,189,'501',NULL,8763,5804,7765,17,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your beautiful submission! The piece has great detail, and the watercolor technique is lovely. To enhance it further, try bringing more boldness and light to the colors for added contrast. Overall, great job—just a few tweaks and it will really shine!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 14:01:03','2025-06-25 14:01:03'),(14705,'judge-event-evaluation-21073-1750824115',21073,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,8822,55,7756,64,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Sainimere, I appreciate the initiative and effort you demonstrated in your clay artwork—thank you for your dedication and creativity.\r\n\r\nMoving forward, there are a few areas where you can continue to grow. Your written report would benefit from more detailed explanations.\r\nAlso, for your clay island, consider using only clay to complete the entire piece, rather than combining it with painting or other mediums. This will give a more consistent and cohesive look to your work and allow you to fully explore the possibilities of clay as a medium.\r\n\r\nKeep up the good work, and I look forward to seeing how you build on this in the future.\r\nVinaka.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 14:01:55','2025-06-25 14:01:56'),(14706,'judge-event-evaluation-21070-1750824126',21070,344,16,11,3,2025,118,'308',NULL,8815,55,7756,64,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not atten