mpared to the final matted version. For future submissions, ensure that the clarity and quality of the original image are maintained in the final presentation.\r\n\r\nKeep it up!\r\nVinaka.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 14:48:28','2025-06-25 14:48:28'),(14734,'judge-event-evaluation-20298-1750827076',20298,346,16,11,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,7175,4208,7847,7,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,-5.00,'What a great story on Friendship, Maraia. You have written a well-detailed story that utilizes a lot of imagery. A caution on the tenses, there were a few lines where you were writing in the present and then quickly switched to the past tense, but all in all, good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 14:51:16','2025-06-25 14:51:16'),(14735,'judge-event-evaluation-21239-1750827628',21239,344,16,11,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,7709,55,7847,7,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A good try, Mereoni. You started well, but then somewhere in the middle, you went off track with your storyline. Try to keep it simple and stay as close as possible to the storyline. All the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-25 15:00:28','2025-06-25 15:00:28'),(14736,'judge-event-evaluation-21439-1750827819',21439,344,16,11,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,8848,55,8871,2,'Open','10',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful picture of the sunset, Justin!\r\nYou\'ve captured a stunning moment—well done. However, as per the guideline, the framework is not correctly done. Please also work on improving the level of detail in your report to better support your visual presentation.\r\