NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:01:00','2025-06-30 09:01:00'),(14813,'judge-event-evaluation-21992-1751238187',21992,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8843,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'You did a good job in delivering your poem and you did it with much confidence. I believe you can do better with much dramatic skills and voice inflection impacting your audience. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:03:07','2025-06-30 09:03:08'),(14815,'judge-event-evaluation-20612-1751238616',20612,345,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7519,5804,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'You took the courage to stand before us and present your poem. You forget some beginnings of your line but you persevered to the end and I like that. I am sure that in the future you will become more confident and you will be at your best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:10:16','2025-06-30 09:10:16'),(14816,'judge-event-evaluation-20612-1751238639',20612,345,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7519,5804,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Mele..Well done on that long poem. Just know that you can use hand gestures and facial expressions to express yourself. You can always move around the stage too if you know that you loose confidence when you are on stage.\r\nAgain good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:10:39','2025-06-30 09:10:39'),(14819,'judge-event-evaluation-21985-1751238898',21985,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8845,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,71.00,-10,-1.50,'Thank you Eta. You have a lovely voice and way of reading. Try to project your voice so that your audience can hear the story. Good Try and hope to see you try again next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:14:58','2025-06-30 09:14:58'),(14820,'judge-event-evaluation-21889-1751238937',21889,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8809,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Cianna!.. keep practicing for next year.\r\n\r\nAgain, thank you Cianna!.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:15:37','2025-06-30 09:15:37'),(14822,'judge-event-evaluation-21838-1751238980',21838,347,16,11,3,2025,273,'856','2',0,5806,7549,33,'Open','21,25,26',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that beautiful singing. You projected your voice really well. Whenever you sing be at a relaxed mood. This will help you with your high tones and balance in your voice. Most importantly you sang with all your heart to the Lord. Keep up the good practice. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:16:20','2025-06-30 09:16:20'),(14824,'judge-event-evaluation-21889-1751239146',21889,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8809,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Cianna. This is our first time but you showed a lot of courage presenting your poem. I want to see you more relaxed and  engage us as you present. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:19:06','2025-06-30 09:19:06'),(14825,'judge-event-evaluation-21985-1751239153',21985,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8845,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,-1.50,'Good job Eta!You did a good job with the projection of your voice and trying to use intonation to show the emotions that were portrayed in the story. You were using eye contact to engage with the audience. However, your intonation was not consistent and there were times when you couldn\'t pronounce the words and the volume of your voice went down. Additionally, there was less gestures used. I hope in the future, you will take these things into consideration. Overall, good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:19:13','2025-06-30 09:19:13'),(14827,'judge-event-evaluation-21834-1751239384',21834,347,16,11,3,2025,274,'857','1',0,5806,7549,33,'Open','25,22',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. Always remember to relax and be free in your spirit to sing joyfully. It\'s OK to make mistakes, that is how you will learn and grow in your talent. Keep up the good singing and practice. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:23:04','2025-06-30 09:23:04'),(14828,'judge-event-evaluation-21834-1751239412',21834,347,16,11,3,2025,274,'857','1',0,5806,7240,33,'Open','25,22',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Time 2:48. Good job girls,keep up with your singing. Helpful tip try to find your voice so that you don\'t lo your part when harmonizing. An remember to smile.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:23:32','2025-06-30 09:23:32'),(14830,'judge-event-evaluation-21812-1751239463',21812,356,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8878,4678,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Good job SAlote!\r\nEverything was perfect today except you just to work on your movements,hand gestures and facial expressions. Keep practicing for next year.\r\nAgain,awesome job SAlote!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:24:23','2025-06-30 09:24:23'),(14831,'judge-event-evaluation-21812-1751239515',21812,356,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8878,4678,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Salote for a great job. You memorised your lines so well and I like that. I believe you can improve with gestures as you present your poem and also try to engage the judges and audience. Apart from that , you did so well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:25:15','2025-06-30 09:25:15'),(14833,'judge-event-evaluation-22122-1751239790',22122,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8855,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,64.00,-10,-0.50,'Good try. Need to speak louder, vary of tones so the reading can be interesting and message can reach the audience. Movement is distracting. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:29:50','2025-06-30 09:29:50'),(14834,'judge-event-evaluation-21985-1751239892',21985,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8845,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,73.00,-10,-1.50,'Good job. You started of well than going towards the end, you stopped with your expressions. Your departure needs to be improved. You need to practice, practice and practice reading your script',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:31:32','2025-06-30 09:31:32'),(14837,'judge-event-evaluation-21892-1751240002',21892,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8822,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Sainimere!..Few things you can work on so you can improve your performance.\r\nMake sure to be loud..project your voice.\r\n-You can use hand gestures and facial expressions .\r\n-You can always move around as well when performing.\r\n-Remember that entrance and exit is important.\r\n\r\nAgain thank you for your performance today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:33:22','2025-06-30 09:33:22'),(14838,'judge-event-evaluation-21883-1751240011',21883,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8806,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,56.00,-10,-1.00,'Good try! You tried your best in trying to pronounce the words that were difficult to you which showed your confidence. You focused on reading and pronouncing the words - which is great - but it took up most of your time. Next time, preparing in advance will help you read more smoothly and with better flow. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:33:31','2025-06-30 09:33:31'),(14839,'judge-event-evaluation-22122-1751240033',22122,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8855,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,64.00,-10,-0.50,'Good try! It was a good try and you showed some confidence in your reading. You had some movement which was good. However, your voice was not audible enough to be heard. Additionally, lack of gestures and eye contact was used. Try to use more gestures and engage with the audience with more eye contact. I hope in the future, you will take these into consideration. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:33:53','2025-06-30 09:33:53'),(14840,'judge-event-evaluation-21906-1751240044',21906,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8831,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,-0.50,'Good job. Volume was great. You need not to sway too much. Vary of tone needs to be at the right places.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:34:04','2025-06-30 09:34:04'),(14841,'judge-event-evaluation-21892-1751240222',21892,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8822,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'You did so well, Sai, projecting your voice and presenting your poem with gestures. I wish your poem was long enough to at least reach the 1 minute minimum time. You can also improve with your poise in the future. Thank you, Sai.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:37:02','2025-06-30 09:37:02'),(14844,'judge-event-evaluation-22019-1751240497',22019,344,16,11,3,2025,261,'807','1',0,55,7549,33,'Collection','25,22',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that beautiful performance. Remember to always be in a relax mood. Good control in your emotions. Your voices blended really well. Can hear the difference parts.  Future reference, if you can provide the proper music sheet where we can see the different vocal parts. Always good to smile while singing. Keep it up girls!! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:41:37','2025-06-30 09:41:37'),(14845,'judge-event-evaluation-22019-1751240559',22019,344,16,11,3,2025,261,'807','1',0,55,7240,33,'Collection','25,22',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Time 4:38. Awesome job girls, you have beautiful voices. Keep up the good work that God ha made in you. Helpful tip with regard to the sheet music, make sure to show the harmonies. And keep practicing on breathing at the right time. All in all ell done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:42:39','2025-06-30 09:42:39'),(14848,'judge-event-evaluation-22123-1751240939',22123,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7669,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good job. Your intro/departure was nicely done. Your voice volume was good. if you add pause into your reading. It plays an important role in your reading too. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:48:59','2025-06-30 09:48:59'),(14849,'judge-event-evaluation-22123-1751240966',22123,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7669,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Good try Christine. I\'m glad you were able to try that out and that you will be encouraged to try again next year. Practice , practice and practice, that will help you to be the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:49:26','2025-06-30 09:49:26'),(14852,'judge-event-evaluation-21848-1751241324',21848,347,16,11,3,2025,255,'801','1',0,5806,7240,33,'Collection','21,24',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Time 3:35. Thank you boys or that performance. Keep practicing with the gifts God has given you. Helpful tip, try to find your voice hen harmonizing o that you don\'t get confused with your partners voice. Also remember to smile and keep stay during your singing. Keep it up and hope to see you sing again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:55:24','2025-06-30 09:55:24'),(14853,'judge-event-evaluation-21848-1751241404',21848,347,16,11,3,2025,255,'801','1',0,5806,7549,33,'Collection','21,24',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. Good balance in the beginning, the chorus need a little bit of brushing up when singing parts. Keep it up! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 09:56:44','2025-06-30 09:56:44'),(14856,'judge-event-evaluation-22234-1751241823',22234,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7708,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful story. Please more facial expression and more expression in your tone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:03:43','2025-06-30 10:03:43'),(14857,'judge-event-evaluation-22234-1751241844',22234,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7708,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Well presented Kiyana. You have a great message in the script you presented and don\'t forget to raise the volume of your voice. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:04:04','2025-06-30 10:04:04'),(14858,'judge-event-evaluation-22234-1751241970',22234,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7708,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job! You did a great job in the projection of your voice. There was intonation in your voice which brought some parts of the story to life. However, you could have used more eye contact and gestures to engage more with the audience. Your posture of reading could also be improved. I hope in the future, you will take these into consideration. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:06:10','2025-06-30 10:06:10'),(14859,'judge-event-evaluation-22005-1751242141',22005,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8850,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'You were very confident presenting your poem.I wish you had adopted that poem, improve the mood and engage the audience with your presentation. Thank you, Lanlin. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:09:01','2025-06-30 10:09:01'),(14861,'judge-event-evaluation-21968-1751242388',21968,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7665,55,7756,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:13:08','2025-06-30 10:13:08'),(14862,'judge-event-evaluation-21968-1751242422',21968,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7665,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:13:42','2025-06-30 10:13:42'),(14863,'judge-event-evaluation-22005-1751242478',22005,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8850,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks Lanlyn..\r\nKeep practicing on doing hand gestures and facial expressions when performing. Don\'t need to rush when reciting your poem.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:14:38','2025-06-30 10:14:38'),(14864,'judge-event-evaluation-21989-1751242998',21989,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7657,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Pamela. You did well and I enjoyed watching your facial expressions especially the emotions you were trying to portray. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:23:18','2025-06-30 10:23:18'),(14867,'judge-event-evaluation-21989-1751243171',21989,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7657,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent Work!You did a great job in expressively reading and with the incorporation of the usage of intonation, gestures and facial expressions in trying to engage the audience. Great Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:26:11','2025-06-30 10:26:11'),(14868,'judge-event-evaluation-21989-1751243231',21989,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7657,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome presentation. Consistency is very important. Your reading flowed later as you were reading You captured the audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:27:11','2025-06-30 10:27:11'),(14870,'judge-event-evaluation-21899-1751243615',21899,344,16,11,3,2025,256,'802','1',0,55,7240,33,'Collection','24,22',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Time 3:44 Wonderfully done boys you have amazing voices, keep practicing the gift that God has given you. Helpful tip, with regards to the sheet music make sure to show the harmonies so that we as judge can follow along. Also practicing adding variety of dynamics and harmonies to your future songs. Hope to see you again. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:33:35','2025-06-30 10:33:35'),(14871,'judge-event-evaluation-21812-1751243636',21812,356,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8878,4678,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Salote, delivered an excellent performance. Her fluency was outstanding — loud, clear, and spoken with confidence. However, the absence of gestures or expressive actions slightly limited the overall impact. With those elements, it could have been a commanding performance.\r\n\r\nWell done.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:33:56','2025-06-30 10:33:56'),(14872,'judge-event-evaluation-21899-1751243757',21899,344,16,11,3,2025,256,'802','1',0,55,7549,33,'Collection','24,22',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. Great effort in singing. You have shown passion towards your performance today. Practice make perfect. You can work more on the different vocal parts. In the end you all sag on pitch and with the right tone. We would love to hear more in the future, continue to practice and bring out those beautiful voices of yours. Keep it up! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:35:57','2025-06-30 10:35:57'),(14873,'judge-event-evaluation-21906-1751243811',21906,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8831,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,77.00,-10,-0.50,'Good Job! You had a good voice projection and was easy to hear. The use of intonation made it a bit expressive and interesting. However, there was a little use of gestures and eye contact with audience was limited. In the future, try to add more hand movements and look up more often to better connect with the audience. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:36:51','2025-06-30 10:36:51'),(14874,'judge-event-evaluation-21961-1751243817',21961,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8835,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. There is always room for improvement. In your next performance,work on your projection,facial expression and hand gestures so you can deliver your message well to your audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:36:57','2025-06-30 10:36:57'),(14878,'judge-event-evaluation-21919-1751244415',21919,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8830,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'You overcame your fear as you step over to present your poem. Good Job! I know you can do it. This is a beginng, right? You may not be as perfect as others but you are unique and I believe you can do better with more practice and exposure. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:46:55','2025-06-30 10:46:55'),(14879,'judge-event-evaluation-21919-1751244438',21919,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8830,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Julia!.Great effort made today. In your next convention,-\r\n-You can always move around the stage.\r\n-Use hand gestures\r\n-Use facial expressions\r\n-Project your voice so that your audience can hear you.\r\nThanks again Julia.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:47:18','2025-06-30 10:47:18'),(14880,'judge-event-evaluation-22031-1751244487',22031,344,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8882,55,7549,33,'Open','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for singing. Always remember to singing with the tune. You are doing well. Keep practicing! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:48:07','2025-06-30 10:48:07'),(14882,'judge-event-evaluation-21924-1751244767',21924,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8832,55,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Osa Qi! Your time was 1.00.59 mins.\r\nYou delivered an excellent performance. Your fluency was outstanding — loud, clear, and spoken with confidence. Keep it up.\r\n\r\nBlessings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:52:47','2025-06-30 10:52:47'),(14883,'judge-event-evaluation-22167-1751244808',22167,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7725,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,-0.50,'A good presentation Taake. Adding facial expressions and gestures would really lift your performance. Thank You and all the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:53:28','2025-06-30 10:53:28'),(14884,'judge-event-evaluation-22167-1751244908',22167,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7725,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,-0.50,'We done! Voice projection was good. You need more expression in your reading. Your uploaded script is not completely upload. Your script is blocking your face.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:55:08','2025-06-30 10:55:08'),(14885,'judge-event-evaluation-21992-1751244966',21992,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8843,55,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance, Caja! Your time was 1.11.92 mins.\r\nYou delivered a confident performance overall. However, you missed a few lines which affected the flow. Aside from that, your expression and presence were strong.\r\n\r\nKeep it up.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:56:06','2025-06-30 10:56:06'),(14886,'judge-event-evaluation-22167-1751245009',22167,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7725,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,-0.50,'Good try! You did a good job in your voice projection and the usage of intonation in some. However, there was some parts where you did not need to stress the word. Additionally, the holding of the paper blocked some parts of your face and your facial expression was not clearly noticed. Try not to smile alot when you are performing because it distracted your performance.  I hope in the future you will take these into consideration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:56:49','2025-06-30 10:56:49'),(14887,'judge-event-evaluation-21836-1751245136',21836,347,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,7272,5806,7240,33,'Open','25',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Time 4:12 Well done Tama, keep using the amazing voice God ha given you for His glory. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 10:58:56','2025-06-30 10:58:56'),(14888,'judge-event-evaluation-21836-1751245308',21836,347,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,7272,5806,7549,33,'Open','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. Power house,beautiful tone. Try to control your singing in some areas. Keep up the practice and singing. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:01:48','2025-06-30 11:01:48'),(14891,'judge-event-evaluation-22018-1751245807',22018,344,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8849,55,7240,33,'Open','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Time 3:36 Thank you for your beautiful song Kesaia. A helpful tip, with the sheet music try to keep to the arrangement (eg. verse chorus bridge). All in all keep practicing the gifting that God has placed on your life.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:10:07','2025-06-30 11:10:07'),(14892,'judge-event-evaluation-21990-1751245830',21990,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7679,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,87.00,-10,-0.50,'Well done Tiare. Keep in mind to be consistent with your expression. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:10:30','2025-06-30 11:10:30'),(14893,'judge-event-evaluation-22018-1751245859',22018,344,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8849,55,7549,33,'Open','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for performing today. You have a beautiful voice. Keep practicing, you are on the right track. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:10:59','2025-06-30 11:10:59'),(14894,'judge-event-evaluation-21990-1751245899',21990,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7679,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you Tiare. You have presented well and did a good job. You could bring your presentation to the next level but being confident in expressing yourself freely.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:11:39','2025-06-30 11:11:39'),(14896,'judge-event-evaluation-20579-1751246811',20579,346,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7183,4208,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A Job Well Done! Thank you for the wonderful story and you really expressed yourself well. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:26:51','2025-06-30 11:26:51'),(14897,'judge-event-evaluation-20579-1751246962',20579,346,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7183,4208,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job! You did a great job in expressively reading. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:29:22','2025-06-30 11:29:22'),(14898,'judge-event-evaluation-20579-1751247086',20579,346,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7183,4208,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I was captured with your reading. Good job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:31:26','2025-06-30 11:31:26'),(14899,'judge-event-evaluation-21845-1751248573',21845,347,16,11,3,2025,260,'806','1',0,5806,7240,33,'Collection','21,25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Time 4:53, Thank you girls for your wonderful performance, keep practicing with the gifting God has given you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:56:13','2025-06-30 11:56:13'),(14900,'judge-event-evaluation-21845-1751248717',21845,347,16,11,3,2025,260,'806','1',0,5806,7549,33,'Collection','21,25',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the beautiful singing. Always remember to control your singing  especially win parts. Keep practicing to avoid the off pitch in some areas. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 11:58:37','2025-06-30 11:58:37'),(14901,'judge-event-evaluation-21946-1751248885',21946,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8841,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,-2.00,'What a powerful voice you have. A good effort you have put into this expressive reading. Do not rush as you would\'ve noticed you either missed words or changed the wording of the story.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:01:25','2025-06-30 12:01:25'),(14902,'judge-event-evaluation-21946-1751249067',21946,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8841,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,73.00,-10,-2.00,'Good Try!You showed self confidence in your performance. You had good voice projection. However, your intonation was not consistent. There were times where you a flat tone and there was no stress in the words that was supposed to be stressed. Additionally, be careful of your pronunciation. I hope in the future, you will take these into consideration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:04:27','2025-06-30 12:04:27'),(14904,'judge-event-evaluation-21946-1751249332',21946,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8841,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,-2.00,'Voice and diction was good. Avoid swaying and facial expressions when making mistakes.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:08:52','2025-06-30 12:08:52'),(14905,'judge-event-evaluation-21922-1751249357',21922,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8831,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for an awesome performance Maggie!.Performance was loud and clear. In your next convention, you can add more liveliness by using different variations of tones. You can also work on facial expressions at using different tonations to your recitation.\r\n\r\nOther than that, thank you for the performance today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:09:17','2025-06-30 12:09:17'),(14906,'judge-event-evaluation-21922-1751249428',21922,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8831,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'You started of so well and I like that. You  forget the beginning of your line  but you continued end your poem well. You are a great speaker naturally and I hope that you will continue to do more in similar platforms to make you be what God plans for you. All the best, Maggie.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:10:28','2025-06-30 12:10:28'),(14907,'judge-event-evaluation-21922-1751249482',21922,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8831,55,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Magdalena Tufue! Your time was 1.11.86 mins.\r\nYou delivered an excellent performance. Your fluency was outstanding — loud, clear, and spoken with confidence. Keep it up.\r\n\r\nBlessings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:11:22','2025-06-30 12:11:22'),(14908,'judge-event-evaluation-21929-1751249499',21929,344,16,11,3,2025,355,'811','2',0,55,7240,33,'Collection','26,22',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Time 3:32,thank you guys for your performance. A helpful tip, practice harmonies to add dynamics to your song, as well as with the sheet music, make sure to show harmonies. Hope to see you again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:11:39','2025-06-30 12:11:39'),(14912,'judge-event-evaluation-21918-1751249959',21918,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7700,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your performance today arielle.. Just a few tips to work on for your next convention\r\n- make sure to project your voice.\r\n- use hand gestures and facial expression more.\r\n- take your time and don\'t rush through your recitation.\r\n- try and communicate and have an eye-contact with your audience.\r\n\r\nThank you and see you in the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:19:19','2025-06-30 12:19:19'),(14913,'judge-event-evaluation-21938-1751250003',21938,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7632,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Well presented, however, be mindful on your pauses. Too much pause can affect the mood of the story. Also, add facial expression to your reading.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:20:03','2025-06-30 12:20:03'),(14914,'judge-event-evaluation-21918-1751250023',21918,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7700,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you so much for the effort, Arielle. I believe there is more for you to give. Unfortunately, what I see and listen to today is not exactly what I anticipated from you. I know you can do better. So learn your poem, adopt it and share it from your heart to the judges and audience. Captivate them with your gestures, etc',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:20:23','2025-06-30 12:20:23'),(14915,'judge-event-evaluation-21938-1751250074',21938,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7632,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'A good try Amelia. You are able to project your voice but will need to be more confident to expressively read as  if  you know the story by heart.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:21:14','2025-06-30 12:21:14'),(14916,'judge-event-evaluation-21938-1751250116',21938,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7632,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Good try! You showed self confidence and your voice was audible. However, there was less gestures used, no eye contact and unnecessary pauses which affected the overall performance. Additionally, most of the time, the tone was flat and there was less tone variations. I hope in the future, you will take these into consideration.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:21:56','2025-06-30 12:21:56'),(14917,'judge-event-evaluation-19938-1751250133',19938,347,16,11,3,2025,344,'1057','4',0,5806,6,55,'Open',NULL,50,14.00,NULL,NULL,'14/29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:22:13','2025-06-30 12:22:13'),(14918,'judge-event-evaluation-20405-1751250158',20405,356,16,11,3,2025,344,'1057','2',0,4678,6,55,'Open',NULL,50,4.00,NULL,NULL,'4/16',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:22:38','2025-06-30 12:22:38'),(14919,'judge-event-evaluation-22034-1751250262',22034,344,16,11,3,2025,260,'806','2',0,55,7240,33,'Collection','21,25',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Time 4:06 Thank you girls for your wonderful performance.  A few helpful tips, with the sheet music make sure to show the harmonies, not just melody, keep practicing the incredible gift God has given both of you. Hope to see you again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:24:22','2025-06-30 12:24:22'),(14921,'judge-event-evaluation-21923-1751250329',21923,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7709,55,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,92.00,-10,-5.00,'Well done, Mereoni Leweniqila! Your time was 52.49secs.\r\nYou delivered an excellent performance. Your fluency was outstanding — loud, clear, and spoken with confidence. However, you did  not exceed the required time.\r\n\r\nBlessings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:25:29','2025-06-30 12:25:29'),(14923,'judge-event-evaluation-21923-1751250349',21923,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7709,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well recited mereoni!..You did great.\r\nFew points to work on as you prepare for your next convention;\r\n- project your voice even more so that the last person in the back of the room can hear you.\r\n- use more facial expression to express the mood of your story.\r\n\r\nOther than that, good job mereoni!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:25:49','2025-06-30 12:25:49'),(14924,'judge-event-evaluation-21923-1751250395',21923,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7709,55,7759,45,NULL,'25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Mereoni. You recite your poem with clarity. Thank you for that and the effort to memorize all. I think your inflection needs some clarity and please remember this is a messge to pass on to your audience. Make it interesting to engage them as you recite. You can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:26:35','2025-06-30 12:26:35'),(14925,'judge-event-evaluation-21869-1751250572',21869,344,16,11,3,2025,310,'954','6',0,55,8802,41,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:29:32','2025-06-30 12:29:32'),(14928,'judge-event-evaluation-22230-1751251030',22230,347,16,11,3,2025,344,'1057','5',0,5806,6,55,'Open',NULL,50,15.00,NULL,NULL,'15.5/27',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:37:10','2025-06-30 12:37:10'),(14930,'judge-event-evaluation-21936-1751251182',21936,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7631,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,74.00,-10,-1.00,'Great effort, however, you need to put emotions into your tone, face and hand gestures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:39:42','2025-06-30 12:39:42'),(14936,'judge-event-evaluation-21925-1751251194',21925,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7713,55,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:39:54','2025-06-30 12:39:54'),(14937,'judge-event-evaluation-21925-1751251275',21925,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7713,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the reminder to stand in faith always. Beautifully recited Shekan.\r\nJust try to project your voice more.Try to move around the stage,use hand gestures and facial expressions as well.\r\nAdd more life into your recitation...\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:41:15','2025-06-30 12:41:15'),(14938,'judge-event-evaluation-21925-1751251304',21925,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7713,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A very powerful message you have, Shekan. I believe you can do better, Girl. I understand this is your first time but you have come to this point proving you can do it. Please project your voice, work on your inflections and deliver your message with enthusiasm. You can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:41:44','2025-06-30 12:41:44'),(14939,'judge-event-evaluation-21936-1751251329',21936,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7631,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,73.00,-10,-1.00,'A good effort put into your expressive reading. Try not to read through, but engage with the audience every once in a while.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:42:09','2025-06-30 12:42:09'),(14940,'judge-event-evaluation-21936-1751251409',21936,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7631,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,61.00,-10,-1.00,'Good Try! You had a good posture and your voice was clear and easy to hear. However, there was no gestures, facial expressions, or eye contact, which are important in expressive reading. Your voice stayed the same throughout, with little change in tone, so it sounded more like plain reading. I hope in the future, you will try to show more feeling through your face, voice and body to make the reading more expressive and engaging. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:43:29','2025-06-30 12:43:29'),(14941,'judge-event-evaluation-20409-1751251453',20409,346,16,11,3,2025,259,'805',NULL,7183,4208,7549,33,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that beautiful performance Aviella. A few points that can help in the future just be mindful of your tone and control. You doing great and continue to give God the glory in your talent God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:44:13','2025-06-30 12:44:13'),(14944,'judge-event-evaluation-21926-1751251908',21926,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8833,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'You did it, Girl. Though you had problem recalling your lines, still you did a great job by not giving up. Thank you so much. You can choose a suitable poem for you next time and make sure you have enogh time to learn it. thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:51:48','2025-06-30 12:51:48'),(14945,'judge-event-evaluation-21979-1751251918',21979,344,16,11,3,2025,310,'954','3',0,55,7789,41,NULL,NULL,100,56.00,-10,-2.00,'Valiant effort lads !\r\nChoosing to still perform even with the sudden change of plans with a missing cast member , really takes courage !\r\nAlthough it did affect your performance , be proud of yourelves for putting forth that extra effort !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:51:58','2025-06-30 12:51:58'),(14947,'judge-event-evaluation-21926-1751252031',21926,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8833,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Syasha..Good performance today. You just need more practice and spend time in memorizing. Project your voice more louder.Use different variations on tonations.Use hand gestures and facial expressions more too. \r\nAgain,thank you for your performance Syasha.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:53:51','2025-06-30 12:53:51'),(14948,'judge-event-evaluation-19937-1751252183',19937,347,16,11,3,2025,344,'1057','3',0,5806,6,55,NULL,NULL,50,20.00,NULL,NULL,'20/32',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:56:23','2025-06-30 12:56:23'),(14949,'judge-event-evaluation-22030-1751252373',22030,344,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8853,55,7240,33,'Open','25',100,86.00,-10,-0.50,'Time 5:26 Thank you Aliti Tili for your performance. Keep practicing the gifting that God has given you. A helpful tip, try to work on the tonal quality, and then add the expressive nature that you natural have.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 12:59:33','2025-06-30 12:59:33'),(14951,'judge-event-evaluation-21783-1751252428',21783,347,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7809,5806,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'We\'ll done ETA..Just need to project your voice in your next performance.\r\n\r\nExcellent performance today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 13:00:28','2025-06-30 13:00:28'),(14952,'judge-event-evaluation-21978-1751252492',21978,344,16,11,3,2025,310,'954','2',0,55,7789,41,'Open',NULL,100,64.00,-10,-3.00,'Thank you for presenting !\r\nA simple yet powerful message on honesty!\r\nDo be careful with your stage setup , make sure you\'re not facing away from the audience , so as to come across as clear , and so we can see your faces!\r\nAlso, remember the time limit , both the minimum and maximum',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 13:01:32','2025-06-30 13:01:32'),(14953,'judge-event-evaluation-21831-1751252522',21831,347,16,11,3,2025,273,'856','1',0,5806,7240,33,'Open','21,25',100,70.00,-10,-1.00,'time: 5:45. Thank you girls for your duet. A Helpful note try to find your voice so that you don\'t lose it with your partners voice. Also remember to maintain the tempo and phrasing, and hitting the notes in the right place. All in all thank you so much, and hope to see you sing again.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 13:02:02','2025-06-30 13:02:02'),(14954,'judge-event-evaluation-22030-1751252535',22030,344,16,11,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8853,55,7549,33,'Open','25',100,91.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you for that beautiful performance .I can see and hear you are so passionate about singing. For future reference, you can focus more on hitting the high range with facial expressions rather then more body movement. You are doing really well in terms of singing. Keep up the beautiful singing. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 13:02:15','2025-06-30 13:02:15'),(14956,'judge-event-evaluation-21868-1751252723',21868,344,16,11,3,2025,310,'954','4',0,55,7789,41,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 13:05:23','2025-06-30 13:05:23'),(14957,'judge-event-evaluation