-30 14:20:19','2025-06-30 14:20:19'),(15029,'judge-event-evaluation-21937-1751257432',21937,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7634,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,58.00,-10,-10.00,'A commendable effort Amelia. You were loud which is a plus but your script was too long. I can also see you have a great talent there so always check the guidelines to be on the right  track. \r\nThank you for trying.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:23:52','2025-06-30 14:23:52'),(15030,'judge-event-evaluation-22216-1751257491',22216,345,16,11,3,2025,344,'1057','6',0,5804,6,55,NULL,NULL,50,4.00,NULL,NULL,'4/15',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:24:51','2025-06-30 14:24:51'),(15032,'judge-event-evaluation-21974-1751257723',21974,344,16,11,3,2025,254,'800',NULL,8836,55,7549,32,'Collection','24',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that beautiful performance. You are doing fine and keep up the interest God Bless you always.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:28:43','2025-06-30 14:28:43'),(15033,'judge-event-evaluation-22168-1751257724',22168,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7725,55,7756,45,'Collection','25',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:28:44','2025-06-30 14:28:44'),(15034,'judge-event-evaluation-21937-1751257817',21937,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7634,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,69.00,-10,-10.00,'The fluency of ready was good. However you need to stick to the minimum and maximum time when you read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:30:17','2025-06-30 14:30:17'),(15035,'judge-event-evaluation-22168-1751257819',22168,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7725,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well recited Taake!thanks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:30:19','2025-06-30 14:30:19'),(15036,'judge-event-evaluation-22168-1751257904',22168,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7725,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Despite how nervous you were, you came and recited your poem. You did a good job except for the part of the line you forgot which does affect ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:31:44','2025-06-30 14:31:44'),(15037,'judge-event-evaluation-22125-1751257934',22125,344,16,11,3,2025,310,'954','1',0,55,8802,41,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you for your one act play performance, Karzai, Fisherman and Helenic.\r\nDespite forgetting lines, your confidence and  determination to complete the play was admirable.\r\nKeep trying and you should be able to get a command performance with more practice.\r\nGood effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:32:14','2025-06-30 14:32:14'),(15038,'judge-event-evaluation-21974-1751257942',21974,344,16,11,3,2025,254,'800',NULL,8836,55,7240,32,'Collection','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Time 3:41. Thank you Jayce for your solo, keep working on the gifting that God has given you. Helpful tip practice hitting the notes at the exact tune to get the best sound for you. Hope to see you again',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:32:22','2025-06-30 14:32:22'),(15039,'judge-event-evaluation-22125-1751257975',22125,344,16,11,3,2025,310,'954','1',0,55,7789,41,'Open',NULL,100,64.00,-10,-2.00,'Thank you for putting forth an effort , even though you may have been feeling discouraged beforehand.\r\nTaking that extra time to practice and memorize well really does help massively for events such as One Act Play !\r\nStay blessed , and keep performing !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:32:55','2025-06-30 14:32:55'),(15040,'judge-event-evaluation-21890-1751258153',21890,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8816,55,8702,45,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Hope! Keep striving to do better in your next performance.\r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:35:53','2025-06-30 14:35:53'),(15041,'judge-event-evaluation-21764-1751258296',21764,347,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7820,5806,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,-1.50,'What a pleasant tone. You need to to be enthusiastic in reading your Psalm. Face expression and hand gestures will add more flavour to your Psalm.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:38:16','2025-06-30 14:38:16'),(15042,'judge-event-evaluation-20864-1751258345',20864,346,16,11,3,2025,259,'805',NULL,8718,4208,7549,33,'Collection','25',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that beautiful singing. You have a lovely voice. Practice more to build your confidence. Keep up the good effort. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:39:05','2025-06-30 14:39:05'),(15043,'judge-event-evaluation-21764-1751258434',21764,347,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7820,5806,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,67.00,-10,-1.50,'Good Try! You had showed self confidence. However, there was no gestures used, less eye contact and no facial expressions, resulting in less engaging with the audience. Additionally, your voice was not audible at times. I hope in the future, you will work on these areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:40:34','2025-06-30 14:40:34'),(15045,'judge-event-evaluation-21764-1751258439',21764,347,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7820,5806,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,73.00,-10,-1.50,'Thank you kailani, that was a beautiful Psalm. Your diction and enunciation was very good. You will need to project your voice so that all can hear you. Good try and I would like to see you  try again next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:40:39','2025-06-30 14:40:39'),(15046,'judge-event-evaluation-21890-1751259051',21890,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8816,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'You did well as a first time Convention, Hope. I appreciate your courage. This is just the beginning for you and I hope that you will project your voice, work on your intonation and facial expression. I believe that through time you will learn more and be one of the best.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:50:51','2025-06-30 14:50:51'),(15047,'judge-event-evaluation-22231-1751259102',22231,347,16,11,3,2025,344,'1057','6',0,5806,6,55,NULL,NULL,50,22.00,NULL,NULL,'22/29',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:51:42','2025-06-30 14:51:42'),(15051,'judge-event-evaluation-21948-1751259241',21948,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7647,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,89.00,-10,-1.50,'Well presented. Your voice projection, poise and the fluency of your reading made the story exciting. Keep in mind your time limit.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:54:01','2025-06-30 14:54:02'),(15052,'judge-event-evaluation-22003-1751259245',22003,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7671,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'You present your poem with much confidence and clarity, Florence and you adopted it so well too. However, I hope to see to hear more of inflections as you recite your poem and your facial expression all the way through. You started off so well but..',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:54:05','2025-06-30 14:54:05'),(15054,'judge-event-evaluation-21948-1751259280',21948,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7647,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,-1.50,'Well read Tabitha. You were confident from the beginning and delivered it to the end. A few pointers to think about for next time: Try to maintain that confidence throughout and facial expressions is a plus.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:54:40','2025-06-30 14:54:40'),(15055,'judge-event-evaluation-21843-1751259413',21843,347,16,11,3,2025,264,'810','2',0,5806,7240,33,'Collection','21,26',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Time 4:44 Well done Sami and Shalom. You guys were awesome. Keep practicing the gifting that God has given you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:56:53','2025-06-30 14:56:53'),(15057,'judge-event-evaluation-21843-1751259511',21843,347,16,11,3,2025,264,'810','2',0,5806,7549,33,'Collection','21,26',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for beautiful performance. Keep up the practice to build your confidence. You can work on the areas where points have been deducted to better your singing for future reference. Keep it up! God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 14:58:31','2025-06-30 14:58:31'),(15059,'judge-event-evaluation-21807-1751259795',21807,347,16,11,3,2025,345,'1058','1',0,5806,8802,51,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,-1.50,'Fantastic bible group speaking performance. Apart from 2 students who seemed to have forgotten  few lines and actions, the whole group performed well. Delivery of bible passages was clear with accompanying actions.\r\nGreat effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-06-30 15:03:15','2025-06-30 15:03:15'),(15061,'judg