onnect with the audience and bring the story to life. \r\n\r\nVinaka. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:25:45','2025-07-01 13:25:45'),(15584,'judge-event-evaluation-21987-1751340370',21987,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7676,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,79.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you Jessira. You have a soft voice so you will need to speak up and project it. You did facial expressions but need to be consistent with it and the voice variation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:26:10','2025-07-01 13:26:10'),(15585,'judge-event-evaluation-20857-1751340733',20857,345,16,11,3,2025,283,'901','4',0,5804,8802,39,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your Dramatic Dialogue performance Shiloh and Mele. Keep working on your drama talents and you will be getting a command performance in no time.\r\nYou did well despite forgetting a few lines her and there. Great costumes.\r\nThank you again, good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:32:13','2025-07-01 13:32:13'),(15586,'judge-event-evaluation-21988-1751341232',21988,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7675,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Jennifer! If you are being consistent with facial expressions and voice projection, you will do well. Try to capture the audience attention with your reading.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:40:32','2025-07-01 13:40:32'),(15587,'judge-event-evaluation-21988-1751341255',21988,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7675,55,8800,44,'Collection','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Good Try! It was a good read with nice pitch control and tone variations, which made the reading more expressive. However, there were fewer gestures and limited eye control. Try to use more body language and look at the audience to make your performance more engaging.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:40:55','2025-07-01 13:40:55'),(15588,'judge-event-evaluation-21988-1751341258',21988,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,7675,55,7861,44,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'I just love your change of voice tone when characters speak. Ensure that you speak louder and you press your blouse before you do your presentation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:40:58','2025-07-01 13:40:58'),(15589,'judge-event-evaluation-20614-1751341372',20614,345,16,11,3,2025,283,'901','5',0,5804,7789,39,'Collection',NULL,100,68.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you for a solid effort boys !\r\nReally try to spend time memorising together and practicing frequently so that your performance flows smoothly !\r\nStay blessed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:42:52','2025-07-01 13:42:52'),(15591,'judge-times-event-evaluation-20625-1751341690',20625,344,16,11,3,2025,86,'237',NULL,8855,55,7240,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 13:48:10