ntation worthy of command performance in no time.\r\nGreat effort',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 14:27:21','2025-07-01 14:27:21'),(15635,'judge-event-evaluation-22025-1751344097',22025,344,16,11,3,2025,365,'759','3',0,55,7841,25,'Open','21',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing performance…keep it up',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 14:28:17','2025-07-01 14:28:17'),(15636,'judge-event-evaluation-22025-1751344103',22025,344,16,11,3,2025,365,'759','3',0,55,7863,25,'Open','21',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'I was so moved on how you played the instruments. Great job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 14:28:23','2025-07-01 14:28:23'),(15637,'judge-event-evaluation-21773-1751344119',21773,347,16,11,3,2025,283,'901','1',0,5806,7789,39,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,-1.50,'Thank you boys for putting forth a great effort!\r\nWhilst it may have gotten a bit rocky around the middle , where the memorization stuttered a bit , you managed to finish strong , and you should be proud of yourselves!\r\nKeep performing and always spend time in memorizing and practicing often\r\nStay blessed !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-01 14:28:39','2025-07-01 14:28:39'),(15639,'judge-event-evaluation-21879-1751344141',21879,344,16,11,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8805,55,7847,44,'Collection','25',100,71.00,-10,-1.00,'A good try Alexis. I\'m glad you plucked up the courage to stand in front of an audience. Pl