ng brave, though. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:18:29','2025-07-02 08:18:29'),(15830,'judge-event-evaluation-21788-1751408384',21788,347,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,7252,5806,8702,45,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Great piece about God, the Creator. Practice makes perfect, especially in memorizing and adding characterization to bring the poem to life. Keep up the good effort, Mr. Tubutubu!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:19:44','2025-07-02 08:19:44'),(15833,'judge-event-evaluation-21788-1751408511',21788,347,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,7252,5806,7756,45,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance, Tubutubu! You delivered with confidence, which was wonderful to see. Perfect timing. Just remember to incorporate more gestures to enhance your expression. Well done! \r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:21:51','2025-07-02 08:21:51'),(15834,'judge-event-evaluation-21768-1751408673',21768,347,16,11,3,2025,288,'908',NULL,7245,5806,7847,44,'Collection','24',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Solomoni, you have done well and I would like to encourage you to try again next year. So you are able to build up from here.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:24:33','2025-07-02 08:24:33'),(15835,'judge-event-evaluation-21772-1751408821',21772,347,16,11,3,2025,307,'951','1',0,5806,8802,39,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent 