group bible speaking performance Year 10.\r\nPlease note 0.5 points were deducted as your presentation was less than 4 minutes (minimum required time).\r\nDespite a few students not saying their lines or forgetting the actions, you did a good job in memorizing Psalm 148 - 150.\r\nGood effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:54:29','2025-07-02 08:54:29'),(15860,'judge-event-evaluation-20217-1751410514',20217,346,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,7187,4208,8702,45,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great message!\r\nAwesome delivery, Kavish!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:55:14','2025-07-02 08:55:14'),(15861,'judge-event-evaluation-22212-1751410581',22212,344,16,11,3,2025,345,'1058','3',0,55,7789,51,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,-0.50,'Well done !\r\nWhen having a large group , its really important to be aware of each other-\r\nMake sure movements are in sync , unity in voices, using the same hand/leg , facing directions together, moving in time so as to allow the performance to flow.Also try to keep the intensity consistent throughout..The same energy you start with , carry it through !\r\nGreat job , onwards and upwards !\r\nStay blessed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:56:21','2025-07-02 08:56:21'),(15863,'judge-event-evaluation-21998-1751410767',21998,344,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,8848,55,7756,45,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on having the courage to present — that’s an achievement in itself! With more practice, smoother delivery, clear voice, expressive gestures, and eye contact, your recitation will grow even stronger. Keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 08:59:27','2025-07-02 08:59:27'),(15866,'judge-event-evaluation-22067-1751411053',22067,344,16,11,3,2025,323,'972',NULL,7785,55,7847,44,'Open','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Eileen. Although you have a soft voice, you have beautifully pronounced the words well. Hope to see you next year. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:04:13','2025-07-02 09:04:13'),(15867,'judge-event-evaluation-21860-1751411157',21860,347,16,11,3,2025,220,'702',NULL,7246,5806,7863,3,'Collection','14',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Sisa. So beautiful. Keep practicing ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:05:57','2025-07-02 09:05:57'),(15868,'judge-event-evaluation-22067-1751411190',22067,344,16,11,3,2025,323,'972',NULL,7785,55,8800,44,'Open','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job!It was a good read, and you showed self-confidence throughout the performance. However, there were some unnecessary pauses that affected the flow. There were also fewer gestures, which could have added more expression. I hope in the future, you can practice to smooth out your delivery and use your body to help tell the story.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:06:30','2025-07-02 09:06:30'),(15869,'judge-event-evaluation-21860-1751411240',21860,347,16,11,3,2025,220,'702',NULL,7246,5806,7841,3,'Collection','14',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing Sisa….keep up playing for Jesus!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:07:20','2025-07-02 09:07:20'),(15870,'judge-event-evaluation-22226-1751411336',22226,344,16,11,3,2025,282,'900','3',0,55,8802,38,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:08:56','2025-07-02 09:08:56'),(15871,'judge-event-evaluation-22223-1751411347',22223,344,16,11,3,2025,352,'871','2',0,55,7861,34,'Open',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'You all sang with great enthusiasm and confidence. When you upload your score sheets, ensure that it is in order. Ensure also that an accompanied choir has a piano or guitar back up but not a band.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:09:07','2025-07-02 09:09:08'),(15872,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22163-1751411385',22163,344,16,11,3,2025,343,'1056','1',0,55,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,9,'2025-07-02 09:09:45',NULL),(15873,'judge-event-evaluation-22226-1751411393',22226,344,16,11,3,2025,282,'900','3',0,55,7789,38,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:09:53','2025-07-02 09:09:53'),(15874,'judge-event-evaluation-22223-1751411432',22223,344,16,11,3,2025,352,'871','2',0,55,7483,34,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful singing that has a good sense of hope. It’s very important to submit the score in the right order that the judge can follow through well. The full musical background arrangement is not required for this category as per convention guidelines. Thanks for the good work. God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:10:32','2025-07-02 09:10:32'),(15875,'judge-event-evaluation-21785-1751411436',21785,347,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,7254,5806,8702,45,'Open','24',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great message and reminder!\r\nKeep up the great work, Edward!\r\nPractice makes perfect and builds confidence especially for solo performances. \r\nVinaka, Edward!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:10:36','2025-07-02 09:10:36'),(15876,'judge-event-evaluation-21785-1751411552',21785,347,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,7254,5806,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'You did a great job with gestures and I appreciate that. I think you need to project your voice more so every one can hear your message. l also think that your poem is a bit too short for an open grade student. May  you challenge yourself  with a more suitable poem and grow in your talent to be one of the best. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:12:32','2025-07-02 09:12:32'),(15878,'judge-event-evaluation-21790-1751411666',21790,347,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,8795,5806,7756,45,'Open','24',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Outstanding performance, Jonathan Danford! Your time was perfect, 1:18.55 mins. Your confident delivery, clear voice, and expressive presence truly brought the poem to life. Congratulations on a command performance — keep up the excellent work!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:14:26','2025-07-02 09:14:27'),(15879,'judge-event-evaluation-21861-1751411705',21861,347,16,11,3,2025,236,'752',NULL,7256,5806,7863,3,'Open','14',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Really loved how you express yourself while playing the woodwind. Keep practicing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:15:05','2025-07-02 09:15:05'),(15881,'judge-event-evaluation-21861-1751411782',21861,347,16,11,3,2025,236,'752',NULL,7256,5806,7841,3,'Open','14',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Vinaka Apimeleki…keep working towards this new talent and keep playing for Jesus!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:16:22','2025-07-02 09:16:22'),(15883,'judge-event-evaluation-21761-1751411953',21761,347,16,11,3,2025,323,'972',NULL,7269,5806,7847,44,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you Agape for that reading. You articulate the words well and could do even better putting in gestures.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:19:13','2025-07-02 09:19:13'),(15884,'judge-event-evaluation-21761-1751411986',21761,347,16,11,3,2025,323,'972',NULL,7269,5806,8800,44,'Open','25',100,83.00,-10,-0.50,'Good effort! You started off well with strong intonation and good facial expressions that helped bring the reading to life. However, your voice was not always loud enough—some parts were clear, but others were hard to hear. Eye contact was also limited, especially towards the end. Try to maintain your energy throughout and work on projecting your voice and connecting more with the audience.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:19:46','2025-07-02 09:19:46'),(15885,'judge-event-evaluation-22012-1751412238',22012,344,16,11,3,2025,236,'752',NULL,8848,55,7863,3,'Open','14',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Justin. Keep practicing and you will get better.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:23:58','2025-07-02 09:23:58'),(15886,'judge-event-evaluation-22012-1751412269',22012,344,16,11,3,2025,236,'752',NULL,8848,55,7841,3,'Open','14',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Justin…keep it up…just keep practicing and believing in God to help you everyday ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:24:29','2025-07-02 09:24:29'),(15887,'judge-event-evaluation-22191-1751412640',22191,346,16,11,3,2025,353,'870','2',0,4208,7861,34,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Your tone was warm and resonant. However, some sections that needed harmony, there was unison. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 09:30:40','2025-07-02 09:30:40'),(15888,'judge-event-evaluation-21849-1751412733',21849,347,16,11,3,2025,235,'750',NULL,7256,5806,7863,22,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Your did very well. Good performance Apimeleki.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU