,290,'910',NULL,7673,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Kael. Now you know the feel of it. Please don\'t give up but keep trying, learn from others as you watch them present their poems, or your teachers can help you out and you will do better.  You can do it!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:25:29','2025-07-02 15:25:29'),(16174,'judge-event-evaluation-21952-1751433990',21952,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8837,55,7756,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:26:30','2025-07-02 15:26:30'),(16175,'judge-event-evaluation-21909-1751434014',21909,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8826,55,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on having the courage to present — that’s an achievement in itself! With more practice, smoother delivery, clear voice, expressive gestures, and eye contact, your recitation will grow even stronger. Keep it up!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:26:54','2025-07-02 15:26:54'),(16176,'judge-event-evaluation-21955-1751434337',21955,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7661,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,' You did a good job but there are areas that you can improve to perfect your presentation. \r\n1. The sound of your voice to captivate your audience\r\n2. Your gestures and facial expression\r\nThank you, Nivaan and all the best to you.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:32:17','2025-07-02 15:32:17'),(16177,'judge-event-evaluation-21238-1751434492',21238,346,16,11,3,2025,305,'929',NULL,7183,4208,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'What a profound and powerful message that you have preached today. God has His hand on your life for great thins he has in stored for you. Your testimony was the lead that  gives the  punch on the challenge towards the end. Keep the great job .GOD bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:34:52','2025-07-02 15:34:52'),(16178,'judge-event-evaluation-21238-1751434516',21238,346,16,11,3,2025,305,'929',NULL,7183,4208,7769,50,'Collection','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'That was a very Powerful personal message of \"Forgiveness\".\r\nWowww, Awesome Aviella! \r\nWell presented, articulated and with passion. Keep up with this blessed gift of preaching and changing lives for Jesus. Looking forward to next year.\r\nGod richly bless your heart, Aviella.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:35:16','2025-07-02 15:35:16'),(16179,'judge-event-evaluation-21809-1751434550',21809,356,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7772,4678,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Great performance, Abraham! Your confident delivery, clear voice, and expressive presence truly brought the poem to life. However, please practice your poem well so you can recite it smoothly. Well done.\r\n\r\nVinaka.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:35:50','2025-07-02 15:35:50'),(16180,'judge-event-evaluation-21813-1751434984',21813,356,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7774,4678,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Vincent, for our effort.\r\nConsistent practice builds confidence for an effective delivery of an important message.\r\nKeep striving for better results next year.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:43:04','2025-07-02 15:43:04'),(16183,'judge-event-evaluation-21996-1751435306',21996,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7649,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:48:26','2025-07-02 15:48:26'),(16185,'judge-event-evaluation-22142-1751435738',22142,344,16,11,3,2025,320,'965',NULL,8861,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,-2.00,'Great message with conviction and presented with confidence. Time is important factors  in a message so keep within the time frame.  Keep on the good work. Blessing to your future journey with God  for great exploits.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 15:55:38','2025-07-02 15:55:38'),(16187,'judge-event-evaluation-22053-1751436010',22053,344,16,11,3,2025,315,'960',NULL,7686,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'You recite your poem with so much ease and depth and you engage us well. I think the poem was a bit short and you could also project your voice more. You did a beautiful job, though. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 16:00:10','2025-07-02 16:00:10'),(16188,'judge-event-evaluation-21607-1751436821',21607,346,16,11,3,2025,320,'965',NULL,7187,4208,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,-1.00,'Very timely message that resonates to the now generation, where power become the very attraction to what they pursue in life. The message of being responsible is the deciding factor to life. Keep developing the skills to become a great preacher for Christ unfailing love. God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 16:13:41','2025-07-02 16:13:41'),(16189,'judge-event-evaluation-21607-1751436971',21607,346,16,11,3,2025,320,'965',NULL,7187,4208,7769,50,'Open','24',100,76.00,-10,-1.00,'Good job Kavish!\r\nThat was an awesome sermon.\r\nPlease articulate with passion and add more supportive illustrations in the end to challenge audience and nailing the main point.\r\nOtherwise, Awesome.\r\nGod bless you, Kavish.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 16:16:11','2025-07-02 16:16:11'),(16190,'judge-event-evaluation-21996-1751437291',21996,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7649,55,NULL,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 16:21:31','2025-07-02 16:21:31'),(16191,'judge-event-evaluation-21996-1751437319',21996,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7649,55,7756,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 16:21:59','2025-07-02 16:21:59'),(16193,'judge-event-evaluation-22109-1751438145',22109,344,16,11,3,2025,305,'929',NULL,8808,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome sermon, Avila.   Keep practicing more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 16:35:45','2025-07-02 16:35:45'),(16194,'judge-event-evaluation-22109-1751440384',22109,344,16,11,3,2025,305,'929',NULL,8808,55,7769,50,'Collection','25',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Ayona! Awesome message.\r\nPlease, articulate with more enthusiasm and passion. Remember to speak louder. Bear in mind to illustrate and challenge audience nailing back at your main point and introduction.\r\nKeep on practicing and look forward to hear you again next year.\r\nGod bless you Ayona.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 17:13:04','2025-07-02 17:13:04'),(16196,'judge-event-evaluation-20264-1751444586',20264,346,16,11,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,7560,4208,7888,7,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'I loved your short story. It was amazing at this moment i have no advice for you, just keep up the good work and keep shining. Its a really great story',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 18:23:06','2025-07-02 18:23:06'),(16197,'judge-event-evaluation-22219-1751447255',22219,344,16,11,3,2025,358,'780','5',0,55,8889,27,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 19:07:35','2025-07-02 19:07:35'),(16198,'judge-event-evaluation-22219-1751447286',22219,344,16,11,3,2025,358,'780','5',0,55,7841,27,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 19:08:06','2025-07-02 19:08:06'),(16199,'judge-event-evaluation-21492-1751452716',21492,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7736,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'This poem is really sweet and peaceful—it paints a clear picture of a beach using simple words that are easy to imagine, like waves dancing and seagulls flying, which makes it great for young readers. It also shares a strong message about being thankful and trusting in God\'s love, which is very positive. One thing that could be improved is the rhythm—some lines flow smoothly while others feel a little uneven, which might make the poem a bit harder to read out loud. Also, using a few more unique or surprising words could make it even more interesting. But overall, it\'s a kind and thoughtful poem with a lot of heart! Thanks so much for your submission and I hope we can see you again in 2026! God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 20:38:36','2025-07-02 20:38:36'),(16200,'judge-event-evaluation-20276-1751453347',20276,346,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,8710,4208,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,-10,-2.00,'Beautiful poem, but I did have to take away points because the paper has writing on it, so therefore its not plain white. I know you were trying to edit the poem but I do have to take a couple of points away.\r\n\r\nOne thing is some bits rhymed and others did not so sometimes it did not make sense.\r\n\r\nI loved your poem about the saying \"Home is where the heart is\" I love the history of this saying and how you incorporated it into a God-like poem. I also love how you integrated the words weave, explore, and linger. This is vocabulary that isn\'t often used and I\'m glad to see a 12 year old add them to the poem.\r\n\r\nI really hope you come back next year for the 2026 ACE convention! And may you have a good rest of the day! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 20:49:07','2025-07-02 20:49:07'),(16202,'judge-event-evaluation-20290-1751454531',20290,346,16,11,3,2025,198,'510',NULL,7183,4208,8536,53,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission, this a brilliant geometric piece of art. Unfortunately this item is not eligible to be placed due to not following our guidelines. Please refer to page (VA.2. FRAMING). \r\n\r\nFRAMING \r\nAll artwork (except Prints & Comic Strips), must be framed and ready to hang. Artwork on canvas stretched over wooden frames are acceptable and do not require traditional framing, but must still be ready to hang. Any other artwork that is NOT FRAMED will NOT BE PLACED. Matboards may be used as a border around the picture, in conjunction on with (but not in place of) a frame. The framing is not required to be done by the student, but the student is required to select the frame and colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:08:51','2025-07-02 21:08:52'),(16203,'judge-event-evaluation-20304-1751454656',20304,346,16,11,3,2025,198,'510',NULL,8715,4208,8536,53,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission, this a brilliant geometric piece of art. Unfortunately this item is not eligible to be placed due to not following our guidelines. Please refer to page (VA.2. FRAMING). \r\n\r\nFRAMING \r\nAll artwork (except Prints & Comic Strips), must be framed and ready to hang. Artwork on canvas stretched over wooden frames are acceptable and do not require traditional framing, but must still be ready to hang. Any other artwork that is NOT FRAMED will NOT BE PLACED. Matboards may be used as a border around the picture, in conjunction on with (but not in place of) a frame. The framing is not required to be done by the student, but the student is required to select the frame and colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:10:56','2025-07-02 21:10:56'),(16204,'judge-event-evaluation-20309-1751454707',20309,346,16,11,3,2025,198,'510',NULL,7181,4208,8536,53,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission, this a brilliant geometric piece of art. Unfortunately this item is not eligible to be placed due to not following our guidelines. Please refer to page (VA.2. FRAMING). \r\n\r\nFRAMING \r\nAll artwork (except Prints & Comic Strips), must be framed and ready to hang. Artwork on canvas stretched over wooden frames are acceptable and do not require traditional framing, but must still be ready to hang. Any other artwork that is NOT FRAMED will NOT BE PLACED. Matboards may be used as a border around the picture, in conjunction on with (but not in place of) a frame. The framing is not required to be done by the student, but the student is required to select the frame and colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:11:47','2025-07-02 21:11:47'),(16205,'judge-event-evaluation-21391-1751456320',21391,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7679,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'This poem does a nice job showing the different ways people believe God shows love and care, using kind and gentle words that many kids can understand. It’s full of positive feelings like peace, joy, and thankfulness, which makes it warm and comforting to read. The rhyming is mostly smooth and helps the poem sound nice when read out loud. One thing that could be better is adding more specific images or examples—right now, it talks about big ideas like love and peace, but it doesn’t give many pictures in your mind. Still, it has a strong, meaningful message and is a lovely reminder of faith. Thankyou so much for entering this year, I hope you come back next year!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:38:40','2025-07-02 21:38:40'),(16206,'judge-event-evaluation-20366-1751456753',20366,347,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7819,5806,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'This poem has a beautiful message about wanting to become pure and good, like gold refined by fire, and it’s full of strong, emotional words that show deep faith and commitment. The rhyming is mostly smooth and helps the poem flow nicely, especially in lines like “You purge ALL the dross within / Until a heart is free of sin.” That’s a strong image and easy to picture. One thing that could be improved is clarity—some lines feel a bit packed with big or old-fashioned words (like “t’was” or “inward parts”), which might confuse younger readers. Also, the poem could be a little shorter or have some extra breaks so each big idea has space to stand out. But overall, it’s a heartfelt and powerful piece that shows both struggle and hope, and it ends in a strong and uplifting way.\r\nThankyou so much for your hard work, I also love how you had more lines in general than most people. This helped me understand more about what your poem was about.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:45:53','2025-07-02 21:45:53'),(16207,'judge-event-evaluation-21390-1751457030',21390,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7650,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'This poem has a lovely, dreamy feeling and uses gentle words that paint a picture of an adventure starting at dawn, which is a great idea—it feels hopeful and full of wonder. The rhythm is soft and flows nicely, and the message about growing through challenges is strong and positive. Some lines, like “In whisper of courage a world it holds,” are beautiful but a little hard to understand, so you might try making them clearer or more direct. Also, the line “The path may twist the road may bend” could use a little punctuation to help the reader follow it more easily. Overall, it’s a thoughtful and inspiring poem with a few places that could be made simpler or clearer to make it even stronger. Great job Manav, and I hope to see you next year at another ACE convention event!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:50:30','2025-07-02 21:50:30'),(16208,'judge-event-evaluation-20286-1751457575',20286,346,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7175,4208,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'I love your poem, the only big thing that stood out to me that really needs fixing, is too many syllables/words in a line. Such as \" still, God is with you and with me\", could possibly be changed to \"still, God is with you and me\". If it makes sense with the least amount of words as possible that is great!\r\n\r\nI love how you bolded the important statements at the end. God is with YOU and GOD IS WITH ME. This really stood out to me, and made me think, \"Oh yes, this is what the poem is about!\" You did this beautifully and I love how you rhyme everything perfectly.\r\n\r\nThankyou so much for your submission, it was great and I hope maybe I will see you next year at ACE conventions!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 21:59:35','2025-07-02 21:59:36'),(16209,'judge-event-evaluation-20343-1751458948',20343,346,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7560,4208,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing poem! Thankyou so much for participating, we hope you come back next year.\r\n\r\nFirst of all I love your poem, how it was formatted it made it look very appealing. I also liked your use of words, your rhyming and how you had a constant stream of syllables, but they all stayed the same! Good job!\r\n\r\nI was so impressed that I don\'t see anything that needs improving, but maybe next time I can give you a challenge to make an even longer poem. I\'m sure it will slay, if it is as good as this! Maximum is 32 lines, so I encourage you, go the extra mile and test yourself.\r\n\r\nAnyway I hope you had a great time at this convention, and I pray that God watches over you and your family, as you go through the rest of the year!\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 22:22:28','2025-07-02 22:22:28'),(16210,'judge-event-evaluation-20583-1751460262',20583,345,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7519,5804,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful poem sweetheart! For a eleven or twelve year old this is amazing! \r\n\r\nOne thing to work on is possibly is your syllables sounding similar length from the line before. Maybe reading your poem out loud, and how those poet readers read them, and it will help you.\r\n\r\nI loved how much detail you put into the poem, and how much you care about how God loves you. This is so sweet!\r\nCongrats on a great poem, and I hope you come back next year!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 22:44:22','2025-07-02 22:44:22'),(16211,'judge-event-evaluation-21491-1751460655',21491,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7725,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'This poem has a really nice message about feeling comforted by God, and the rhymes make it easy to read. One thing you could work on is making some of the lines a little more creative or surprising, because a few of them (like \"I know he cares\" or \"I know He’s real\") are very common and might not show how you personally feel in a unique way. Maybe try adding a little more detail about what you say to God or how you feel His presence—it could help the reader connect with your experience even more. You\'re off to a great start. Thankyou so much for this masterpiece, I can\'t wait to see if you place, and what the future holds for you. I hope you return to the ACE conventions next year!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 22:50:55','2025-07-02 22:50:55'),(16212,'judge-event-evaluation-21618-1751460911',21618,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7737,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'This poem has a lovely message about love and how it comes from God, and your rhyming makes it flow really nicely. One thing you could work on is making the middle lines a little clearer—like “every inch of the mile” or “every bend”—so the reader can picture what you mean more easily. You might try adding more examples of what love looks like in everyday life, like helping a friend or being kind to your family. That would help make your message even stronger and more personal. You\'re doing a great job expressing big feelings in a beautiful way! Thanks so much for participating in poetry this year. You are God\'s masterpiece and I know he\'s looking down smiling at how well you did. I really hope you can come back next year! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 22:55:11','2025-07-02 22:55:11'),(16213,'judge-event-evaluation-20769-1751461275',20769,345,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,8755,5804,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Great poem! My main suggestion for you would be to read it aloud before you submit (I\'m not sure if you did this) But a few times the syllables change drastically between the lines. I tried to read through it twice, and the rhythm pattern didn\'t sound quite right.\r\nWhat I loved about it however, is how you integrated some older words not commonly used these days such as thee and thy. I loved how every sentence rhymed perfectly, and I loved the theme as well. Brilliant job! And I hope you can come back next year to the next ACE convention!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 23:01:15','2025-07-02 23:01:15'),(16214,'judge-event-evaluation-21384-1751461494',21384,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,7675,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'I love your poem, I especially love how you added different bible stories in the one poem, you mentioned both Pharaoh and David and it still made sense. I love your heart for God, and the ending of the poem is powerful. I also loved how you kept things rhyming and consistent! Congratulations on a good job. One bit of advice for you, is that one of your sentences, \"For He holds the world in all\" You could probably make the meaning more clear. \"One little stone and the giant was gone.\" Also has one too many syllables in the line. Other than those, great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 23:04:54','2025-07-02 23:04:54'),(16215,'judge-event-evaluation-21381-1751461536',21381,344,16,11,3,2025,6,'012',NULL,8843,55,7888,6,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Really well done Caja, you wrote this beautifully, and I loved how it told the story of Moses in a new, different way.\r\n\r\nIt was hard to find something that needs improving on this but my first suggestion would be meter consistency\r\nThe meter (rhythmic structure) shifts slightly, which can make the poem feel uneven when read aloud. For example:\r\n\r\n\"The desert wind whispers tales unfold,\"\r\n\r\nThis line feels slightly awkward rhythmically. \"Tales unfold\" reads as grammatically off — perhaps consider “tales untold” or rephrasing for smoother flow.\r\n\r\nAlso another idea would be to fix your grammar / clarity\r\n“God’s hand guides a guiding strand” is a bit redundant. “Guides a guiding” could be reworked to something more specific or poetic. Perhaps:\r\n\r\n“God’s hand weaves a sacred strand”\r\n\r\n“God’s hand threads a destined strand”\r\n\r\n“God’s hand leads with steady hand”\r\n\r\n\r\nWhat I loved about your poem were so many things but here is a few.\r\n\r\nYour poem draws on powerful biblical imagery — prophets, Exodus, the burning bush — which gives it a clear, cohesive biblical theme. That consistency makes the message feel intentional and grounded.\r\n\r\nThe AABB rhyme scheme gives the poem a musical, rhythmic quality. It adds a sense of order and tradition, which mirrors the subject matter — ancient, sacred stories passed down through generations.\r\n\r\nYour tone is gentle and reverent — it doesn’t preach, but it honors. The line “A promise whispered, forever pure” in particular carries a sense of quiet, sacred dignity.\r\n\r\n\r\nEven in just eight lines, you give a beginning, middle, and end:\r\n\r\nThe whispering wind (present-day echo),\r\nThe ancient past (prophets, Exodus),\r\nAnd the promise (ongoing guidance by God).\r\n\r\nIt reads like a miniature journey — brief but meaningful. That’s not easy to do in such a short poem.\r\n\r\nThankyou for your wonderful work of art, I appreciate your efforts, and look forward to another year, if you will join us, in accelerate conventions in 2026! Hope you have a great week!\r\n\r\nAnd if you have time check out this verse in your bible - Psalm 150:6\r\nThis is part of what I felt your poem portrayed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-02 23:05:36','2025-07-02 23:05:36'),(16216,'judge-event-evaluation-22217-1751481336',22217,344,16,11,3,2025,366,'656','2',0,55,7841,21,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that presentation…please remember to check the guidelines when preparing for the event as it is required to have a combination of at least two to three songs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 04:35:36','2025-07-03 04:35:36'),(16217,'judge-event-evaluation-22001-1751490025',22001,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7651,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:00:25','2025-07-03 07:00:25'),(16218,'judge-event-evaluation-21949-1751490035',21949,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7631,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:00:35','2025-07-03 07:00:35'),(16219,'judge-event-evaluation-22152-1751490158',22152,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,8863,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:02:38','2025-07-03 07:02:38'),(16225,'judge-event-evaluation-20616-1751491627',20616,345,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8760,5804,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jeremaih, for starting our day with your poetry. You did it but I can see that you are very nervous. Please engage your audience and a bit of gestures adds on to the meaning of your poem. This is just the beginning and I believe that you can better it next time. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:27:07','2025-07-03 07:27:07'),(16226,'judge-event-evaluation-22175-1751491641',22175,347,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7819,5806,7847,49,'Collection','25',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Mana. Your presentation was nicely done although you missed out on a few words. Hope to see you again next year in the same event.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:27:21','2025-07-03 07:27:21'),(16227,'judge-event-evaluation-20616-1751491644',20616,345,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8760,5804,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Great message that requires a great delivery too.  Memorization & recitation is only 50% of the recital, Jeremiah. Practice makes perfect and builds your confidence. Keep striving for better results next time.\r\nGood effort, Jeremiah!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:27:24','2025-07-03 07:27:24'),(16229,'judge-event-evaluation-22175-1751491730',22175,347,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7819,5806,8800,49,'Collection','25',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good job! You demonstrated confidence in your delivery, effectively using gestures, facial expressions, and vocal intonation to engage the audience. However, the overall message of the speech lacked clarity, and unfortunately, no written report was submitted as required. I hope in the future, you will take these into consideration.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:28:50','2025-07-03 07:28:50'),(16230,'judge-event-evaluation-21778-1751491783',21778,347,16,11,3,2025,282,'900','1',0,5806,8802,38,'Collection','29',100,86.00,-10,-1.50,'Thank you Samisoni, Elisabeth and Kailani for your wonderful puppet show presentation. Despite having the main character Peter not fully showing at times (his head was sometimes half visible), your message came through clearly.\r\nKeep working on your talents, you have a bright future in the creative arts.\r\nGreat effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:29:43','2025-07-03 07:29:43'),(16232,'judge-event-evaluation-21799-1751491835',21799,347,16,11,3,2025,362,'762','1',0,5806,7239,26,'Open','22',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, girls, for your ministry. Always remember that practice makes perfect. The more that you practice beforehand, any nervousness won\'t affect your performance as you\'ll know your next moves. if you do make a mistake, don\'t show it on your face and no-one will know. I can tell you enjoy using the tambourine and I look forward to seeing you again...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:30:35','2025-07-03 07:30:35'),(16233,'judge-event-evaluation-21799-1751491886',21799,347,16,11,3,2025,362,'762','1',0,5806,7549,26,'Open','22',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that beautiful performance. Try to keep it together with the actions. Good choice of song. Keep practicing to better your actions. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:31:26','2025-07-03 07:31:26'),(16234,'judge-event-evaluation-22161-1751491942',22161,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,7743,55,8702,45,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great message & great delivery, too, Saanvi!\r\nKeep up the great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:32:22','2025-07-03 07:32:22'),(16236,'judge-event-evaluation-22161-1751492151',22161,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,7743,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'I am very impressed with your poetry recitation, Saanvi. You did a beautiful job with your voice intonation that just capture everyone\'s attention. I think  you forgot the lines because of nervousness but it is an experience that can stregthen you and help you to do better next time. All the best and be the best next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:35:51','2025-07-03 07:35:51'),(16239,'judge-event-evaluation-21778-1751492346',21778,347,16,11,3,2025,282,'900','1',0,5806,7789,38,'Collection','29',100,82.00,-10,-1.50,'Thank you for a confident play !\r\nA few tips : Make sure to keep the puppets above the stage , so it is clear and visible to the audience.Also , be careful with the timing of the puppets mouth and hand movements.For eg, when silent , the puppets mouth would be closed , not moving..\r\nYou have great ability, and I do hope you continue to grow your skills to glorify God even more !\r\nStay blessed',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:39:06','2025-07-03 07:39:06'),(16240,'judge-event-evaluation-21800-1751492487',21800,347,16,11,3,2025,364,'760','1',0,5806,7239,26,'Open','21',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, girls, for your efforts. When you make a mistake, don\'t show it on your face and those watching will not know. If you both forget a a movement, just trill until you get to the line you remember then carry on. Always remember that practice makes perfect and that you\'re presenting for Jesus, so that will help you to not be nervous in your presentation as you\'re worshipping Jesus with your entry.. I look forward to seeing you again next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:41:27','2025-07-03 07:41:27'),(16241,'judge-event-evaluation-22110-1751492490',22110,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8814,55,7769,50,'Collection','24',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome message Evan! Yes, we need to fully equip ourselves with whole Armor of God.\r\nNext time, please speak with more enthusiasm and passion. Also, articulate well pausing where necessary in order to allow your audience to process your message. Practice more is the key \r\nGod bless you, Evan.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:41:30','2025-07-03 07:41:30'),(16242,'judge-event-evaluation-21800-1751492508',21800,347,16,11,3,2025,364,'760','1',0,5806,7549,26,'Open','21',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. Future reference, work on the points deducted especially with memorizing the actions and working together. Good to see the different patterns using your tambourines. Keep up the good practice. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:41:48','2025-07-03 07:41:48'),(16243,'judge-event-evaluation-21791-1751492513',21791,347,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7813,5806,8800,49,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Good Try! You made an effort to incorporate gestures and movement, which reflected a good level of self-confidence. However, your voice projection was too soft, making it difficult for the audience to hear you clearly. Additionally, the required report was not submitted. In the future, I encourage you to work on vocal clarity and ensure all submission requirements are met.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:41:53','2025-07-03 07:41:53'),(16244,'judge-event-evaluation-21791-1751492555',21791,347,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7813,5806,7847,49,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Shalom. You dressed the part and was able to deliver it. Voice projection is important so don\'t forget to get your message out to everyone.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:42:35','2025-07-03 07:42:35'),(16245,'judge-event-evaluation-22110-1751492584',22110,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8814,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful preaching Evan. Very practical and clear presentation to the audience . Keep on working on your skill of preaching and it will increase your ability to minister life to the audience.  God bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:43:04','2025-07-03 07:43:04'),(16246,'judge-event-evaluation-21779-1751492612',21779,347,16,11,3,2025,282,'900','2',0,5806,7789,38,'Collection','29',100,93.00,-10,-0.50,'Very well done !\r\nGreat job on memorizing and preparing well\r\nJust a tip : Remember to really throw your voice out there, especially since you are behind a stage ,  and the audience needs to hear your voices loud and clear.\r\nStay blessed !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:43:32','2025-07-03 07:43:32'),(16247,'judge-event-evaluation-21915-1751492637',21915,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8829,55,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Joseph, for trying! Practice makes perfect and builds up your confidence to stand before any audience.\r\nGreat messages require great delivery to be effective.\r\nKeep striving for better results next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:43:57','2025-07-03 07:43:57'),(16248,'judge-event-evaluation-21994-1751492659',21994,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7698,55,8702,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NU