LL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:48:42','2025-07-03 07:48:42'),(16257,'judge-event-evaluation-20320-1751493213',20320,346,16,11,3,2025,357,'781','3',0,4208,7549,29,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. Please keep it together for future reference. Try to add more pattern to the tambourines moves. Overall, you did well right to the end. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:53:33','2025-07-03 07:53:33'),(16259,'judge-event-evaluation-21951-1751493271',21951,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8836,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'I like that, Jayce. You finally recite your poem and you did it with much ease. You can improve using gestures and look at your audience as you recite. You can do it, Jayce!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:54:31','2025-07-03 07:54:31'),(16260,'judge-event-evaluation-21951-1751493276',21951,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8836,55,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Great job, Jayce! \r\nTake your time to speak with clarify instead of rushing through when you have a great message in your poem. \r\nPractice makes perfect and you already have the confidence. Pace your oral delivery for an effective delivery.\r\nKeep it up! \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:54:36','2025-07-03 07:54:36'),(16262,'judge-event-evaluation-20320-1751493347',20320,346,16,11,3,2025,357,'781','3',0,4208,7239,29,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'That was a delightful presentation, girls, and well done for your efforts. The joy of presenting for Jesus was showing on your faces. Don\'t show on your faces if you make a mistake...just carry on and no-one will notice. Always remember to check the judge\'s forms to make sure you won\'t lose points if you don\'t have paperwork. Paperwork uploaded should show the song lyrics with the tambourine movements written above the words. I look forward to you trying solos and duets next year as well as ensemble as you definitely have the skills and knowledge of tambourine movements to be effective presenters for Him...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:55:47','2025-07-03 07:55:47'),(16264,'judge-event-evaluation-22143-1751493392',22143,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,7694,55,7847,44,'Open','24',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Kolinio, I would like to encourage you to practice well because I see that you have a real talent for Expressive Reading.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:56:32','2025-07-03 07:56:32'),(16265,'judge-event-evaluation-22143-1751493409',22143,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,7694,55,8800,44,'Open','24',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job! It was a good read with nice use of intonation, facial expressions, and some gestures. To make the performance even more engaging, try using more gestures to support the meaning and hold the audience’s attention.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:56:49','2025-07-03 07:56:49'),(16267,'judge-event-evaluation-22106-1751493470',22106,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8817,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great message Jaedon, that is well presented. Good  projection of voice will be effective in reaching the audience with a cleanness. Keep up the good work.\r\n God bless\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:57:50','2025-07-03 07:57:50'),(16268,'judge-event-evaluation-22106-1751493511',22106,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8817,55,7769,50,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Good job, Jaedon!\r\nPlease, speak with more enthusiasm and passion . With more practice and reading your sermon over and over will help you in your presentation.\r\nOtherwise, Awesome.\r\nGod bless you, Jaedon.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 07:58:31','2025-07-03 07:58:31'),(16269,'judge-event-evaluation-21787-1751493832',21787,347,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7246,5806,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Sisa Vakalalavanua! Your time was 01:31.28 mins.\r\nYou delivered an excellent performance. Your fluency was outstanding — loud, clear, and spoken with confidence. Keep it up!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:03:52','2025-07-03 08:03:52'),(16270,'judge-event-evaluation-21787-1751493840',21787,347,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7246,5806,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome message, Sisa, & great delivery!\r\nKeep up the great work!!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:04:00','2025-07-03 08:04:00'),(16271,'judge-event-evaluation-21973-1751493850',21973,344,16,11,3,2025,356,'782','4',0,55,7841,28,'Open',NULL,100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Good work everyone…you all did great!…just need a little more practicing and teamwork and allowing God to help you play your instruments. :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:04:10','2025-07-03 08:04:10'),(16272,'judge-event-evaluation-21802-1751493924',21802,347,16,11,3,2025,228,'710','1',0,5806,7239,26,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, girls, for a lovely presentation. I really liked the smiles on your faces and the joy you showed in presenting for Jesus. Keep up the great work and now work on adding more varieties of tambourine movements when you enter again next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:05:24','2025-07-03 08:05:24'),(16273,'judge-event-evaluation-21973-1751493946',21973,344,16,11,3,2025,356,'782','4',0,55,8889,28,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Some students were standing directly behind another so could not be seen. \r\n\r\nSmile be happy, it looked a little bit like you guys were bored, smile and look confident. \r\n\r\nBeautiful job sounded great good time and climax ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:05:46','2025-07-03 08:05:46'),(16274,'judge-event-evaluation-21973-1751493947',21973,344,16,11,3,2025,356,'782','4',0,55,7861,28,'Open',NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort in performing. More rehearsal time on specific sections could help with the confidence and flow of the individual parts.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:05:47','2025-07-03 08:05:47'),(16275,'judge-event-evaluation-21802-1751493950',21802,347,16,11,3,2025,228,'710','1',0,5806,7549,26,'Collection','21',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that lovely performance. You both did very well i your expressions and showing us the different patterns in your performance. Can see you enjoyed it very much which is important in ministry. Keep up the good work! God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:05:50','2025-07-03 08:05:50'),(16277,'judge-event-evaluation-21787-1751494070',21787,347,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7246,5806,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'You recited your poem with much ease amazes your audience with gestures adding meaning to your message. Thank you so much. There were words from your lines you did not say clearly and I think it is very important. Facial expressions can also help to impact and clarify your message as you share it from within. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:07:50','2025-07-03 08:07:50'),(16279,'judge-event-evaluation-21951-1751494305',21951,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8836,55,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Jayce delivered his recitation with confidence with a ti However, the absence of gestures, his time, and a few missed lines slightly disrupted the overall flow. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:11:45','2025-07-03 08:11:45'),(16280,'judge-event-evaluation-22108-1751494332',22108,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8819,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,-2.00,'Thanks or the amazing message.  It was presented with firmness and clear points. Good facial and hand gestures will add effectiveness o the message. Go bless',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:12:12','2025-07-03 08:12:12'),(16281,'judge-event-evaluation-22108-1751494344',22108,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8819,55,7769,50,'Collection','24',100,68.00,-10,-2.00,'Good job, Leslie! That was an awesome reminder on the Fruit of the Holy Spirit.\r\nNext time, please add more points to your sermon so that you don\'t fall short of the required minimum time of 4 minutes. Speak with more passion and enthusiasm. \r\nGod bless you, Leslie and look forward to hear you again next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:12:24','2025-07-03 08:12:24'),(16282,'judge-event-evaluation-22009-1751494370',22009,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8851,55,7769,50,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:12:50','2025-07-03 08:12:50'),(16284,'judge-event-evaluation-21801-1751494476',21801,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7273,5806,7239,26,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'That was a delightful presentation, Torika, and I could see the great joy you have in worshiping Jesus with the tambourine in music. Keep it up and He will expand your knowledge of tambourine movements and different varieties of songs with which you can use your tambourine to glorify Him...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:14:36','2025-07-03 08:14:36'),(16285,'judge-event-evaluation-21801-1751494510',21801,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7273,5806,7549,26,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that lovely performance. Love your expressions, shows how you enjoyed performing today. Future reference, keep practicing so you don\'t make any mistakes. You did really well showing your performance for HIS glory. God Bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:15:10','2025-07-03 08:15:10'),(16288,'judge-event-evaluation-21827-1751494668',21827,345,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7356,5804,8800,49,'Collection','25',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good Try! You displayed confidence and maintained good eye contact with one of the judges, which was commendable. However, you used limited gestures, and your eye contact did not fully extend to the rest of the audience. For future presentations, I encourage you to engage the entire audience more evenly and incorporate appropriate gestures to enhance her delivery.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:17:48','2025-07-03 08:17:48'),(16289,'judge-event-evaluation-22082-1751494677',22082,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,8866,55,8702,45,'Open','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Gayeon! \r\nPractice makes perfect so take the time to pronounce words slowly for the ones you struggle with so the message is not lost. \r\nGreat messages require great delivery to be effective.\r\nKeep striving for better results next time!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:17:57','2025-07-03 08:17:57'),(16290,'judge-event-evaluation-21827-1751494689',21827,345,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7356,5804,7847,49,'Collection','25',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Kalani, to make your presentation even better, add in some gestures and expressions. You also have done well with memorizing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:18:09','2025-07-03 08:18:09'),(16291,'judge-event-evaluation-22082-1751494835',22082,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,8866,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Gayeon. You memorized your poem well and recited it well too. I advise you try to use different tones of your voice and your face to let your audience see part of what you want to share instead of just hearing it and  Pronounce each word clearly. I believe you can do it. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:20:35','2025-07-03 08:20:35'),(16292,'judge-event-evaluation-20616-1751494932',20616,345,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8760,5804,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,83.00,-10,-0.50,'Well done on having the courage to present — that’s an achievement in itself! However, your voice projection was quite low, which made it difficult to catch all your words. Be sure to speak up so the audience can fully appreciate your delivery. Also, consider incorporating more purposeful gestures to enhance expression and connect more with your audience. \r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:22:12','2025-07-03 08:22:12'),(16293,'judge-event-evaluation-21806-1751494961',21806,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7249,5806,7549,26,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that lovely performance. Great job! You have shown us how well you did it out of your heart. Keep it up! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:22:41','2025-07-03 08:22:41'),(16294,'judge-event-evaluation-21806-1751495036',21806,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7249,5806,7239,26,'Open',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Your presentation was so good, Ebenezer, and you are a worshipper with the tambourine. I loved the joy and adoration for Jesus that showed in your face and body, as well as the tambourine movements which all pointed us as an audience towards Jesus. God will help you by His Spirit to take you to new levels in tambourine ministry in the years to come...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:23:56','2025-07-03 08:23:56'),(16295,'judge-event-evaluation-21965-1751495116',21965,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7646,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:25:16','2025-07-03 08:25:16'),(16296,'judge-event-evaluation-21949-1751495283',21949,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,7631,55,7756,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,