ing the moves. More practice the better but overall good to see male performance doing tambourine solo. Good Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:46:18','2025-07-03 08:46:18'),(16321,'judge-times-event-evaluation-20353-1751496382',20353,346,16,11,3,2025,55,'166',NULL,7564,4208,8702,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:46:22',NULL),(16322,'judge-times-event-evaluation-20349-1751496382',20349,346,16,11,3,2025,55,'166',NULL,7563,4208,8702,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:46:22',NULL),(16323,'judge-times-event-evaluation-19924-1751496382',19924,346,16,11,3,2025,55,'166',NULL,7569,4208,8702,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:46:22',NULL),(16324,'judge-event-evaluation-22124-1751496454',22124,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,8856,55,8800,44,'Open','24',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Good performance—excellent job! You showed strong effort and delivered with confidence. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:47:34','2025-07-03 08:47:34'),(16325,'judge-event-evaluation-21804-1751496472',21804,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7256,5806,7239,26,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Api, for your presentation. When you\'re not sure of a movement or get a \'mind- blank\', try not to show it on your face or in your boy language and no-one will know you\'ve made a mistake. \'Singing\' the words with your mouth as you do the tambourine movements will help you to both overcome nervousness as well as remind yourself of tambourine movements you need to make. i look forward to seeing how you grow and develop in this ministry over the years to come...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:47:52','2025-07-03 08:47:52'),(16326,'judge-event-evaluation-21915-1751496519',21915,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8829,55,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on having the courage to present — that’s an achievement in itself! However, your voice projection was quite low, which made it difficult to catch all your words. Be sure to speak up so the audience can fully appreciate your delivery. Also, consider incorporating more purposeful gestures to enhance expression and connect more with your audience. \r\n\r\nBlessings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:48:39','2025-07-03 08:48:39'),(16327,'judge-event-evaluation-21983-1751496554',21983,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,8846,55,7847,44,'Open','24',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'A good try, Jonzo.  You did you best and showed confidence. Keep trying because you\'ll only get better at it.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:49:14','2025-07-03 08:49:14'),(16328,'judge-event-evaluation-21983-1751496556',21983,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,8846,55,8800,44,'Open','24',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Good Try!You showed great courage to stand up and read in front of others—that’s a big step! To make your reading more expressive, try using gestures and facial expressions, and speak louder so everyone can hear you clearly. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:49:16','2025-07-03 08:49:16'),(16330,'judge-event-evaluation-21911-1751496637',21911,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7705,55,7756,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:50:37','2025-07-03 08:50:37'),(16331,'judge-event-evaluation-22089-1751496672',22089,344,16,11,3,2025,330,'979',NULL,7780,55,7769,50,'Open','25',100,91.00,-10,-4.00,'Awesome, Awesome, Ateca!\r\nWell done!\r\nThank you for a well presented sermon. \r\nNext time, please don\'t exceed your maximum time of 8 minutes.\r\n Keep on building yourself up and Looking forward to hearing you again next year.\r\nGod bless you, Ateca ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:51:12','2025-07-03 08:51:12'),(16332,'judge-event-evaluation-22002-1751496734',22002,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8845,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'The mesage was very clear and it came from a talented and natural speaker. I just hope to see you engage your audience more as you recite your poem, Eta as you share it from within. Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 08:52:14','