LL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:03:59','2025-07-03 09:03:59'),(16341,'judge-event-evaluation-21966-1751497647',21966,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8841,55,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on having the courage to present — that’s an achievement in itself! However, your voice projection was quite low, which made it difficult to catch all your words. Be sure to speak up so the audience can fully appreciate your delivery. Also, consider incorporating more purposeful gestures to enhance expression and connect more with your audience. \r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:07:27','2025-07-03 09:07:27'),(16342,'judge-event-evaluation-22034-1751497670',22034,344,16,11,3,2025,260,'806','2',0,55,7549,33,'Open','21',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance . Future reference, try to practice more together blend your voice in singing parts. Keep up the good practice. God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:07:50','2025-07-03 09:07:50'),(16344,'judge-event-evaluation-21910-1751498005',21910,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8818,55,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for trying, Koresi!\r\nPractice makes perfect and also helps you build up your confidence to perform before and audience.\r\nKeep striving for better results next time.\r\nGood effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:13:25','2025-07-03 09:13:25'),(16345,'judge-event-evaluation-22054-1751498072',22054,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,7799,55,8800,44,'Open','24',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job!You showed great confidence during your reading, which was wonderful to see. To make your performance even stronger, try using more gestures, facial expressions, and eye contact to better connect with the audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:14:32','2025-07-03 09:14:32'),(16346,'judge-event-evaluation-22141-1751498143',22141,344,16,11,3,2025,300,'924',NULL,8860,55,8702,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:15:43','2025-07-03 09:15:43'),(16347,'judge-event-evaluation-20609-1751498167',20609,345,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7521,5804,7847,49,'Collection','25',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'A good effort Andrea. Your did well despite reading your script a few times. I hope you will try out again next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:16:07','2025-07-03 09:16:07'),(16348,'judge-event-evaluation-20609-1751498343',20609,345,16,11,3,2025,304,'928',NULL,7521,5804,8800,49,'Collection','25',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job! You showed courage by standing confidently and delivering your famous speech, which is truly commendable. To improve further, I encourage you to use more gestures and facial expressions to bring the speech to life and connect more effectively with the audience.\r\n\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:19:03','2025-07-03 09:19:03'),(16349,'judge-event-evaluation-22047-1751498354',22047,344,16,11,3,2025,320,'965',NULL,7696,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great preaching with intensity that capture the audience attention from the offset. You have the ability to be an effective communicator and influencer to your generation for Christ . Keep up the good work. Go bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:19:14','2025-07-03 09:19:14'),(16350,'judge-event-evaluation-22047-1751498421',22047,344,16,11,3,2025,320,'965',NULL,7696,55,7769,50,'Open','24',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome, Eroni!\r\nThank you for a well prepared sermon.\r\nPlease, speak slower and make strong emphasis on important points by pausing, allowing the audience to swallow their portion , otherwise, with more reading and practice you will be a powerful evangelistic preacher.\r\nGod bless you, Eroni.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:20:21','2025-07-03 09:20:21'),(16351,'judge-event-evaluation-21910-1751498448',21910,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8818,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'It is normal to be nervous when speaking in front of a many people and I saw that.  However, you overcame that and recite your poem as you memorized and I am thankful. The judges are here to help you discover and develop your talent. It is not that hard, right? You can do better by projecting your voice and ensure the audience hear and receive your message with understanding. All the best, Koresi. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:20:48','2025-07-03 09:20:48'),(16352,'judge-event-evaluation-21805-1751498557',21805,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7254,5806,7549,26,'Open',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for that performance. You will only grow from your mistakes. Keep practicing,you will get that. God bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:22:37','2025-07-03 09:22:37'),(16353,'judge-event-evaluation-21805-1751498658',21805,347,16,11,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,7254,5806,7239,26,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you, Edward, for your effort. Always remember that you\'re presenting for Jesus, so you have to put your full effort into practicing beforehand, so that you remember your tambourine movements. I look forward to seeing your try again next year...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:24:18','2025-07-03 09:24:19'),(16354,'judge-event-evaluation-21910-1751498902',21910,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8818,55,7756,45,'Collection','24',100,82.00,-10,-10.00,'Well done presenting Koresi! However, your time was 38.27secs. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:28:22','2025-07-03 09:28:22'),(16356,'judge-event-evaluation-22009-1751499114',22009,344,16,11,3,2025,295,'915',NULL,8851,55,7483,50,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:31:54','2025-07-03 09:31:54'),(16357,'judge-event-evaluation-20618-1751499277',20618,345,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8763,5804,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Maloney, for the wonderful message in your piece.\r\nPractice makes perfect and helps build your confidence to effectively deliver the message in the poem.\r\nKeep striving for better results next time.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:34:37','2025-07-03 09:34:37'),(16359,'judge-event-evaluation-20618-1751499461',20618,345,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8763,5804,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Maloney. You were brave to stand and recite your poem and I am thankful. You can improve onyour voice projection, gestures and movement. They are like flavours and these can help impact your audience as they receive your message. All the best in next year\'s Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:37:41','2025-07-03 09:37:41'),(16361,'judge-event-evaluation-21954-1751499638',21954,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,7664,55,7756,45,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 09:40:38','2025-07-03 09:40:38'),(16362,'judge-event-evaluation-21876-1751499785',21876,344,16,11,3,2025,290,'910',NULL,8817,55,8702,45,'Collection','24',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great message & great delivery, Jaedon!\r\nSmile & allow your face to help you deliver the message in your piece more effectively.\r\nKeep up the great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'