-event-evaluation-22044-1751517919',22044,344,16,11,3,2025,311,'956',NULL,7696,55,8800,42,'Open','24',100,95.00,-10,-1.00,'Good job! You showed great confidence along with effective tone variations and intonation, which made your speech engaging. However, try to use more gestures to emphasize your points and consider using c Good job! You showed great confidence along with effective tone variations and intonation, which made your speech engaging. However, try to use more gestures to emphasize your points and please take note that you have to use cue cards to help with your delivery and flow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:45:19','2025-07-03 14:45:19'),(16691,'judge-event-evaluation-22064-1751517993',22064,344,16,11,3,2025,321,'970',NULL,7778,55,8800,42,'Open','25',100,92.00,-10,-0.50,'“Good job! You showed great confidence along with effective tone variations and intonation, which made your speech engaging. However, try to use more gestures to emphasize your points and to help with your delivery and flow.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:46:33','2025-07-03 14:46:33'),(16692,'judge-event-evaluation-22080-1751518057',22080,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,7692,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Francine. The main thing is your poem is a bit short and  too easy for an open grade student.  Thank you for your effort. It is very much appreciated.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:47:37','2025-07-03 14:47:37'),(16693,'judge-event-evaluation-22131-1751518091',22131,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,8857,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Helenic. You need to be yourself as you recite your poem. Your voice can do a lot in making sure your audience attention is there. Use hand gestures or facial expression. Looking forward to a better recitation next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:48:11','2025-07-03 14:48:11'),(16694,'judge-event-evaluation-22046-1751518185',22046,344,16,11,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,7696,55,8800,49,'Open','24',100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Good Try!In the future, please prepare well and memorize your entire speech. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:49:45','2025-07-03 14:49:45'),(16695,'judge-event-evaluation-22084-1751518195',22084,344,16,11,3,2025,325,'974',NULL,7690,55,7759,45,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Josephine. Well, you may have memorized your poem, but because you were a bit nervous, you forgot certain words and beginings. Memorization is not that easy but I know you can do it. I appreciate your effort, though. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:49:55','2025-07-03 14:49:55'),(16696,'judge-event-evaluation-22112-1751518212',22112,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,8854,55,8800,44,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-07-03 14:50:12','2025-07-03 14:50:12'),(16697,'judge-event-evaluation-22050-1751518220',22050,344,16,11,3,2025,313,'958',NULL,7804,55,880