as been printed. It is hard to get a good focus at sunset when the lighting is not so bright.\r\nKeep developing your photography skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 08:59:23','2025-09-02 08:59:23'),(16965,'judge-event-evaluation-23322-1756767985',23322,417,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7331,4451,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very cute photograph. It certainly captures the curiosity of the cat on its adventure. The composition of the photo is pleasing and the matting and enhances the colors of the image.\r\nIt does appear, however, that the image is not in good focus. I\'m not sure if it lost some of its quality when you were editing the exposure or if it was just difficult to take a good shot because of the natural lighting. Phone cameras  struggle in dimmer lighting.\r\nYou have a good eye for photography so keep practicing and developing your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 09:06:25','2025-09-02 09:06:25'),(16966,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22506-1756768228',22506,417,19,14,3,2025,97,'264',NULL,7323,4451,6960,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:06:40.050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 09:10:28',NULL),(16967,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22419-1756768228',22419,414,19,14,3,2025,97,'264',NULL,7922,6097,6960,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:08:46.460',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 09:10:28',NULL),(16968,'judge