',NULL,8932,8346,7314,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,3.46,3.21,3.43,3.46,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 09:54:08',NULL),(16993,'judge-times-event-evaluation-23233-1756771324',23233,414,19,14,3,2025,53,'164',NULL,8920,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:02:04',NULL),(16994,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22453-1756771324',22453,414,19,14,3,2025,53,'164',NULL,7897,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:06:21.110',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:02:04',NULL),(16995,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22445-1756771324',22445,414,19,14,3,2025,53,'164',NULL,7894,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:08:41.460',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:02:04',NULL),(16996,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22434-1756771324',22434,414,19,14,3,2025,53,'164',NULL,7902,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:05:39.710',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:02:04',NULL),(16999,'judge-event-evaluation-22969-1756771961',22969,417,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7576,4451,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'These flowers look amazing.\r\n It is a challenge to get the focus right when there\'s so much detail in a picture. While the general impression of the image is clear, none of the flowers themselves are actually very clear. There\'s also a green shoot in the left hand corner that is a slightly distracting element. If you\'re just taking this photo for a memory you wouldn\'t pay much mind to something like that, but for a decorative image, one needs to try to remove distracting elements as possible.\r\nBe mindful of the thickness of your card at the base of your mounting as it might not be so durable when hung to have a thicker card in front.\r\nKeep looking out for beautiful things to capture!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:12:41','2025-09-02 10:12:41'),(17005,'judge-event-evaluation-23108-1756772351',23108,414,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7898,6097,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very peaceful scene that you have captured. The soft rays of the sun listening on the water and the pathway drawing the eye to the water make a lovely combination. \r\nI\'m not sure that the color you have chosen for your mounting compliments the image as well as it could. Overall it\'s a fairly dark image which draws attention to the light and so by having a lighter background it can detract from the light.\r\nYou have an eye for composition. Keep developing your photography skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:19:11','2025-09-02 10:19:12'),(17006,'judge-event-evaluation-23242-1756772659',23242,417,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7323,4451,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'This is a stunning photo Kayla!\r\nThe digital copy is nicer than the printed copy so I wonder if the resolution it was captured at could have been a bit low for the size that you wanted to get it printed. Thanks for sharing the story behind the photo.\r\nThe colours you have chosen for the mounting are complementary. However I wonder how stable it would be to hang with such a thin card as the base layer. \r\nKeep capturing your special moments with God in nature!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:24:19','2025-09-02 10:24:19'),(17007,'judge-event-evaluation-23054-1756772934',23054,417,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7328,4451,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'The lighting through the trees is what makes this photo. Also the angle you have taken it at means the trees create a bit of a pathway leading into the sunny patch.\r\nKeep developing your photography skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:28:54','2025-09-02 10:28:54'),(17010,'judge-event-evaluation-23265-1756773547',23265,414,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7895,6097,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'I like the moodiness of this image. The digital copy is even better than the printed copy as the sun has more shape to it, such is the challenge of printing.\r\nIt is good to see that you were intentional about how you eliminated distracting elements for this photo. Have you heard of the rule of thirds? I wonder if the sun was a little more to the right if that would have added a bit more character to this image. \r\nKeep developing your photography skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:39:07','2025-09-02 10:39:07'),(17011,'judge-event-evaluation-23140-1756773779',23140,414,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7894,6097,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very beautiful image with how the light is acting on the water. The digital photo shows that this was actually cropped a little when printed and I think the wider image actually suits it a bit better as it creates more of a sense of the wideness of the landscape. \r\nYou have an eye for photography! Keep developing your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:42:59','2025-09-02 10:42:59'),(17012,'judge-event-evaluation-23063-1756774013',23063,417,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,8941,4451,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This is a lovely photo to look at. \r\nYou\'ve found a good angle to get the eye to follow the river while also capturing some of the interest in the trees in the foreground. The sky does look a little bit washed out though but it\'s tricky to get the sunlight and the camera to cooperate.\r\nKeep developing your photography skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:46:53','2025-09-02 10:46:53'),(17013,'judge-event-evaluation-23287-1756774342',23287,419,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,8932,8346,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,100.00,-10,NULL,'This photo is stunning!\r\nYou taking it at an interesting angle so that it appears you are in the water. The duck adds life to the image, while the sun dances on the ripples of the water. You are writing that it captures the crispness and coolness of Queenstown.\r\nKeep taking stunning photos!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:52:22','2025-09-02 10:52:22'),(17014,'judge-event-evaluation-23262-1756774558',23262,414,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7902,6097,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Your perseverance paid off! This photo is incredible and really captures the beautiful details of the tui. You\'ve done well to to also have all distracting elements in the background eliminated. \r\nKeep taking amazing photos!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:55:58','2025-09-02 10:55:58'),(17015,'judge-event-evaluation-23110-1756774793',23110,414,19,14,3,2025,173,'451',NULL,7899,6097,9155,2,'Open','5,8',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'What a gorgeous cow portrait! \r\nYour patience paid off. The only thing that could maybe improve this photo is to have a bit more focus on the cows nose rather than on the hair of the cow\'s nose. I understand that would be quite difficult to achieve as the cow is busy munching away and so the camera would prefer to focus on something that\'s a bit more still.\r\nKeep snapping amazing nature photos!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 10:59:53','2025-09-02 10:59:53'),(17016,'judge-event-evaluation-23043-1756779061',23043,417,19,14,3,2025,205,'556',NULL,7733,4451,9155,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'This is a very intricate drawing! You have done well with all of the details.\r\nI like how you have used the ink wash for a softer shadow effect. \r\nI wonder if some of the shadows could be of a darker in place is just to create a little bit more contrast, which would add to the sense of death in this picture. There are several buildings in here and they all seem very close together though I would imagine that the original image would have it a little bit clearer as to the distance the buildings are apart. It seems that the pillars of the building in front or perhaps the whole building in the foreground is at a bit of a lean.\r\nOverall it is quite an amazing piece of work. Keep developing your pen and ink skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:11:01','2025-09-02 12:11:01'),(17018,'judge-event-evaluation-23160-1756779537',23160,417,19,14,3,2025,215,'651','1',0,4451,8425,20,'Open','21',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Remember eye contact and engaging your audience.\r\nNice harmonies.\r\nContrast in voice but not much in the music. Work on getting more soft loud and expressions into your music',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:18:57','2025-09-02 12:18:58'),(17019,'judge-event-evaluation-23084-1756779644',23084,414,19,14,3,2025,208,'559',NULL,7922,6097,9155,18,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'You captured a lot in only a few short pictures. I like how you have used different fonts and tech sizes to express how the voices may be used.\r\nI would be interested to know in your report how you constructed the images. Did you hand draw some of them, or computer draw, or use a combination?\r\nIt\'s nice how you have used colour for effect. \r\nI did struggle initially with the logic of the story, as I am not familiar with the original story from which it was based. I wasn\'t quite sure if he was trying to get Susan\'s attention or not by his vaping. However the message that he gets to choose for himself what is right was very clear, and that is what counts. \r\nKeep on making good wholesome comics!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:20:44','2025-09-02 12:20:44'),(17020,'judge-event-evaluation-23160-1756779811',23160,417,19,14,3,2025,215,'651','1',0,4451,8944,20,'Open','21',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Superb performance. I appreciated the ministry and the message and given that\'s the goal of your music you achieved it well! You were patient and gracious waiting so long as well :). Your voices blended well in both harmony and volume. You were each confident in your singing. A small thing is to introduce yourselves with more confidence and take the presence more confidently, but in the end you nailed it in the song itelf.\r\nGood rhythm and clarity of both of your voices. I had goosebumps when you sang the and that\'s ok line. Excellent dynamics, great tone, overall beautiful - well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:23:31','2025-09-02 12:23:31'),(17021,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22574-1756780264',22574,417,19,14,3,2025,43,'138',NULL,7576,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,16.55,0.00,12.62,16.55,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:31:04',NULL),(17022,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22307-1756780264',22307,414,19,14,3,2025,43,'138',NULL,8914,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,13.27,11.91,0.00,13.27,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:31:04',NULL),(17023,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22303-1756780265',22303,414,19,14,3,2025,43,'138',NULL,8913,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,12.35,12.35,10.44,0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:31:05',NULL),(17026,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22531-1756780427',22531,417,19,14,3,2025,57,'168',NULL,7733,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,16.16,NULL,13.54,16.16,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:33:47',NULL),(17027,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22440-1756780427',22440,414,19,14,3,2025,57,'168',NULL,8920,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,21.31,19.35,20.13,21.31,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:33:47',NULL),(17028,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22438-1756780427',22438,414,19,14,3,2025,57,'168',NULL,7895,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,14.90,14.90,NULL,12.91,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:33:47',NULL),(17030,'judge-event-evaluation-23283-1756780437',23283,414,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7897,6097,8944,19,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work. Confident playing and a good choice of song for your voice and style. Hard to pull off as a fully acoustic pice but you did well. A couple of suggestions to encourage more presence and confidence in your voice and overall performance - try standing up instead of sitting, memorise it completely and make much more eye contact to connect with the audience/congregation. I look forward to seeing more of what you can do in future because you do have good skills and a good voice to improve going forward. Keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:33:57','2025-09-02 12:33:57'),(17031,'judge-event-evaluation-22692-1756780461',22692,400,19,14,3,2025,166,'407',NULL,8930,4457,9155,10,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'The combination of the two photos was a creative idea making it appear that the harbour is just across the water from the hills in the background. It looks like a believable single photo.\r\nKeep developing your skills!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:34:21','2025-09-02 12:34:21'),(17032,'judge-event-evaluation-23283-1756780508',23283,414,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7897,6097,8425,19,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing guitar playing.  key was too low for you, your voice was struggling and it made it hard for you to put expression into your vocals.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:35:08','2025-09-02 12:35:08'),(17033,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22582-1756780623',22582,417,19,14,3,2025,87,'238',NULL,7578,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,13.83,0.00,11.33,13.83,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:37:03',NULL),(17034,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22527-1756780623',22527,417,19,14,3,2025,87,'238',NULL,7318,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,14.56,14.56,12.93,14.14,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:37:03',NULL),(17035,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22470-1756780623',22470,419,19,14,3,2025,87,'238',NULL,8934,8346,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,16.06,14.84,16.01,16.06,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'20