50',NULL,7323,4451,8944,19,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I absolutely loved this performance! It gave me chills when you sang and asked the breakthrough to happen today, so that means I connected with the message, with your intention and the ministry. You have a gift and a wonderful conenction with the audience. Can I suggest that there\'s some vocal technique training that will really help to shape even more clarity and power in your voice, to enable you to get the absolute best from it. But even so, you did really well! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:44:23','2025-09-02 12:44:23'),(17044,'judge-event-evaluation-23207-1756781194',23207,414,19,14,3,2025,310,'954','3',0,6097,8943,41,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good interaction between actors on stage. Fantastic costumes!\r\n\r\nThere was a lot of ad-libbing, not a bad thing but try to follow the script, or update as required :) Story was closely followed but check the script to make sure it lines up with what is being presented :)\r\n\r\nWell done guys, have fun acting and using your gifts for God! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:46:34','2025-09-02 12:46:34'),(17046,'judge-event-evaluation-24459-1756781468',24459,421,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,8942,3799,8425,19,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'A very engaging performance, you held my attention the whole way through.  Lots of contrast both vocals & musically.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:51:08','2025-09-02 12:51:09'),(17047,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22593-1756781477',22593,417,19,14,3,2025,100,'267',NULL,8941,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.29,5.68,6.11,6.29,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:51:17',NULL),(17049,'judge-event-evaluation-24459-1756781545',24459,421,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,8942,3799,8944,19,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! You really nailed that and I loved the light-hearted joyful way you took us through the song - Jesus really is the rock!. I loved your confidence all through the piece. You have a fabulous singing voice and you showed very good control in your volume and pitch etc. I smiled at the solo and have to admit it was a little less fluent than it could have been, but again a nice light-hearted way to take us to the calm in the middle of the storm. Nice key change and a really good finish. Keep it up!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:52:25','2025-09-02 12:52:25'),(17050,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22450-1756781553',22450,414,19,14,3,2025,100,'267',NULL,7900,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,6.80,6.47,6.80,6.80,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:52:33',NULL),(17051,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22436-1756781553',22436,414,19,14,3,2025,100,'267',NULL,7901,6097,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,5.50,5.50,4.15,5.13,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 12:52:33',NULL),(17053,'judge-event-evaluation-23276-1756782299',23276,414,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7896,6097,8425,19,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Wow you are a very talented musician. Love the piano.  When singing, focus on projecting your voice & clearly pronouncing your words. Your voice got a little lost behind the music & this section was more about the song that the accompaniment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:04:59','2025-09-02 13:04:59'),(17054,'judge-event-evaluation-23276-1756782517',23276,414,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7896,6097,8944,19,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'That was really nice. A stand-out for me is your keyboard skills (loved the instrumentals!) and your passion for the music, which really came through in your playing. I would say you are a more confident player than vocalist, but not because you have a bad voice - it\'s because you need to get some vocal training to let it out. Your vocal tone is good, and with more work you\'ll be able to blend both really well. Challenging going acoustic voice and electric piano, so I\'d also encourage a full sound check and familiarisation with the environment next time. Overall though, I think you have a fabulous musical gift and a musician\'s heart - so please be encouraged to keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:08:37','2025-09-02 13:08:37'),(17057,'judge-event-evaluation-22732-1756782915',22732,414,19,14,3,2025,310,'954','1',0,6097,7314,41,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,-1.00,'Thank you!  Your costumes were awesome!  There was a slight faulter in the introduction.  The music used for the sound was effective in heralding the rest of the play.  The sound was also appropriately levelled.  The quiet scene change was very smooth.  Some voice modulation was used although a few lines did not come across clearly. Speak to the audience not away and do not cover mouth (one angel did this).  Some great intonations from one angel and some good facial expressions.  There were more lines lost later on in the play but a good recovery. One angel I was proud of for continuing despite losing your place you recovered yourself very well.  I loved the sense of humor, \'he will go as a man a Jewish man\', Loved the baby dialogue and voice inflections used in this scene.  Having line props in a book helps but thorough memorization is the key to a top performance.   Once again Totara have delivered a good one act play. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:15:15','2025-09-02 13:15:15'),(17058,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22577-1756783017',22577,417,19,14,3,2025,79,'230',NULL,7580,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:14.270',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:16:57',NULL),(17059,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22553-1756783017',22553,417,19,14,3,2025,79,'230',NULL,7329,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:15.430',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:16:57',NULL),(17060,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22526-1756783017',22526,417,19,14,3,2025,79,'230',NULL,7318,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:15.670',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:16:57',NULL),(17061,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22519-1756783017',22519,417,19,14,3,2025,79,'230',NULL,7573,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,