ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:44:12',NULL),(17093,'judge-times-event-evaluation-23176-1756784909',23176,417,19,14,3,2025,68,'201',NULL,8909,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:48:29',NULL),(17094,'judge-event-evaluation-22765-1756785007',22765,417,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7580,4451,8944,19,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'You have a powerful, beautiful alto voice and it commands attention. Beautiful dynamics and great heart in the song. I\'d have thought it even more engaging if you had fully memorised it and really connected with us (the audience/congregation) but that aside you actually delivered that extremely well! A couple of diction and pitch issues in some phrases - but very minor. You\'ve got a real gift there - keep it up!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:50:07','2025-09-02 13:50:07'),(17095,'judge-event-evaluation-22765-1756785009',22765,417,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7580,4451,8425,19,'Open',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Great highs and lows.  Plenty of expression in voice and keys.  Dont forget youre performing for an audience.  Remember to make eye contact with your audience occassionally.  Memorizing music would help you focus more on audience',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:50:09','2025-09-02 13:50:09'),(17097,'judge-event-evaluation-22729-1756785408',22729,414,19,14,3,2025,310,'954','2',0,6097,8943,41,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,-0.50,'VERY well acted! Love the accents, and the costumes. Great job!\r\nFantastic backdrops and props.\r\n\r\nAvoid euphemisms. Words like Gee--- are not \'sound speech that cannot be condemned.\' It is a \'softer\' sounding substitute for taking the Lord\'s Name in vain, so we want to avoid anything like that. \'Avoid every appearance of evil.\' As a Christian, hold yourself to a higher standard in tongue as well as behaviour :)\r\n\r\nCostumes were fabulous! Looks like you put a lot of time and effort into making them :) The girls dresses were a little too short, understandably so as they were meant to be worldly girls but just be aware that for Convention costumes must still meet the Convention dress code :)\r\n\r\nEffective motorbike imaging and excellent sound effects!\r\n\r\nVery worthwhile message, enjoyed watching you all. Keep acting and using your gifts for God! :) God bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:56:48','2025-09-02 13:56:48'),(17099,'judge-event-evaluation-24522-1756785577',24522,417,19,14,3,2025,210,'600',NULL,7575,4451,8425,19,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Great vocals, lots of expression, great diction, plenty of highs & lows.  Felt Holy Spirit anointing on your performance.  Work on getting more expression in your guitar.  There were volume changes with the guitar but work on getting a bit more expression with different rhythms of strumming, maybe a bit of picking.  I know youre a learner guitarist so you\'re going to be a show stopper performer once you gain more skill and confidence with your instrument.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:59:37','2025-09-02 13:59:37'),(17100,'judge-event-evaluation-24522-1756785586',24522,417,19,14,3,2025,210,'600',NULL,7575,4451,8944,19,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Beautifully delivered - you have a lovely sounding voice with good projection. I liked the balance between the voice and guitar, and the simplicity of the guitar strum was complimentary to the voice. You can be more confident in your connection with your audience, because you have the skills and musicianship, that memorising it and looking up and out, making more eye contact will add a lot of value. Keep it up - very talented!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 13:59:46','2025-09-02 13:59:46'),(17101,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22578-1756785763',22578,417,19,14,3,2025,80,'231',NULL,7580,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:32.400',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:02:43',NULL),(17102,'judge-times-event-evaluation-23178-1756785833',23178,417,19,14,3,2025,94,'261',NULL,8941,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:40.180',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:03:53',NULL),(17103,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22513-1756785889',22513,417,19,14,3,2025,50,'161',NULL,7886,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:32.050',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:04:49',NULL),(17105,'judge-event-evaluation-24458-1756786172',24458,421,19,14,3,2025,365,'759','1',0,3799,8944,25,'Open','21',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Great job you two!! Absolutely brilliant. Good blend between the two of you and well done for working together to get a nice blend. I noticed 1 x scratchy moment and 1 x notation error but overall very accurate representation. Nice mood created. Good technique, lively vibrato - overall loved it. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:09:32','2025-09-02 14:09:32'),(17106,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22563-1756786203',22563,417,19,14,3,2025,36,'131',NULL,7328,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:27.470',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:10:03',NULL),(17107,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22557-1756786203',22557,417,19,14,3,2025,36,'131',NULL,7572,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:29.620',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:10:03',NULL),(17108,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22549-1756786203',22549,417,19,14,3,2025,36,'131',NULL,7885,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:10:03',NULL),(17109,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22536-1756786203',22536,417,19,14,3,2025,36,'131',NULL,7321,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'00:00:33.020',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-02 14:10:03',NULL),(17110,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22517-1756786204',22517,417,19,14,3,2025,36,'131',NULL,7324,4451,7871,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL