LL,'What a joyful photo! \r\nThe colours and the smile show the beauty of harvest. \r\nI wonder if it was taken and it\'s slightly different place if they could improve the photo so that there isn\'t the building in the background.\r\nAlso maybe cropping it slightly more at the base, and keeping a little bit more of the tree, could have the basket in the lower third of the image and make it slightly more visually appealing. \r\nKeep developing your photography skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:03:32','2025-09-04 15:03:32'),(18250,'judge-event-evaluation-23144-1756962215',23144,414,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7896,6097,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Wow this picture is startling, Kyle. It looks like it should be hanging on the wall of a travel agents. I want to go to Fiji now. The overall balance of the photo is pleasing to the eye. The reflection in the sky of the tree lights seems like  a one in a million shot. God has certainly given us a wonderful world to live in. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:03:35','2025-09-04 15:03:35'),(18251,'judge-event-evaluation-24538-1756962262',24538,417,19,14,3,2025,273,'856','2',0,4451,8349,33,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen song that fitted the event. More opportunities to perform in front of audience will help develop confidence in connecting with the audience and will help ally the nerves that prevent singing as rehearsed. An enjoyable performance however.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:04:22','2025-09-04 15:04:22'),(18252,'judge-event-evaluation-23190-1756962301',23190,417,19,14,3,2025,174,'452',NULL,7324,4451,7314,2,'Collection','9',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Note. Hi Charlie. Sorry, this was put in the wrong age group, and the computer system and time does not allow a change in category.  The photo you have taken shows the ancient city structure laid out on the hillside. what an interesting structure, I can understand why you were drawn to photograph it.  Having a great viewpoint is one thing.  The other is being able to ensure the focus is clear on the subject.  It really might have helped to use enhancements to get your picture clearer.  The city gets lost because the eye is drawn to the dominant hill.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:05:01','2025-09-04 15:05:01'),(18253,'judge-event-evaluation-24512-1756962349',24512,417,19,14,3,2025,260,'806','1',0,4451,8349,33,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen uplifting piece that enabled harmonies. There were moments where some words were not as clear as others, but more opportunities to perform before an audience will develop confidence and help to prevent nervousness. That said, if was a delightful performance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:05:49','2025-09-04 15:05:49'),(18254,'judge-event-evaluation-23182-1756962414',23182,417,19,14,3,2025,275,'858','1',0,4451,8349,33,NULL,'23',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen song that showcased their different talents.. More opportunities to perform will develop confidence in connecting with the audience and allowing your own delight in performing to shine through. A well rehearsed, delightful performance!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:06:54','2025-09-04 15:06:55'),(18255,'judge-event-evaluation-22986-1756962465',22986,417,19,14,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,7331,4451,8349,32,'Open','25',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'A great choice of song, that showcased Chloe\'s vocal range. It was a particularly moving performance that ministered to audience. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:07:45','2025-09-04 15:07:45'),(18256,'judge-event-evaluation-23090-1756962519',23090,414,19,14,3,2025,159,'400',NULL,8916,6097,9155,2,'Collection','5,7',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'You have a nice idea for your photograph.\r\nUnfortunately the photograph that is attached is not the photo that has been submitted.\r\nTo really highlight the sense of direction and distance this photo could potentially have been better as a landscape orientation with the subject towards the right hand corner and more of the beach scape taking up the rest of the image. \r\nKeep developing your photography skills.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:08:39','2025-09-04 15:08:39'),(18257,'judge-event-evaluation-24457-1756962519',24457,421,19,14,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8942,3799,8349,32,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'A strong performance that showcased Grace\'s ability to lift her voice and enjoy the vocal instrument God has given her. The performance ministered to the audience and we were carried along with message which was accurately portrayed to us. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:08:39','2025-09-04 15:08:39'),(18258,'judge-event-evaluation-23245-1756962567',23245,414,19,14,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,7899,6097,8349,32,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A wonderful performance for someone new to performing to an audience. A slight stumble but was able to recover well. Izzy has strong, melodic voice which was able to break through her nerves at times. Well done Izzy. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:09:27','2025-09-04 15:09:27'),(18259,'judge-event-evaluation-23210-1756962634',23210,414,19,14,3,2025,274,'857','1',0,6097,8349,33,NULL,'22',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen piece that suits the context of the event. Voices could be projected more as if \'singing to the back of the room\', that said it was a pleasing performance and will be a good experience to build on for next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:10:34','2025-09-04 15:10:35'),(18260,'judge-event-evaluation-23247-1756962650',23247,417,19,14,3,2025,172,'450',NULL,7323,4451,8946,2,'Open','7',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Your brother looks like he\'s having a great day at sea! I agree with you that the different blues look great together. You could try experimenting with the angle of the photo to get an even more dramatic effect. \r\nIt would be nice to remove the shadow from his face and you could utilize the natural lighting a little more to highlight his expression. \r\nOverall a great image!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:10:50','2025-09-04 15:10:50'),(18261,'judge-event-evaluation-24543-1756962671',24543,417,19,14,3,2025,274,'857','2',0,4451,8349,33,NULL,'22',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen piece that showcased the voices of the individual students. The trio could develop confidence to interact with the audience and show their own enjoyment of the piece at times. That said, it was an uplifting performance that ministered to the audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:11:11','2025-09-04 15:11:11'),(18262,'judge-event-evaluation-24458-1756962722',24458,421,19,14,3,2025,365,'759','1',0,3799,8349,25,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Joella and Grace made a wonderful duo who worked in harmony with each other. With only slight missed note they performed with confidence and demonstrated a good rapport with the audience.  A delight to have heard. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:12:02','2025-09-04 15:12:03'),(18263,'judge-event-evaluation-25090-1756962741',25090,400,19,14,3,2025,365,'759','1',0,4457,8349,25,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Joella and Grace made a wonderful duo who worked in harmony with each other. With only slight missed note they performed with confidence and demonstrated a good rapport with the audience.  A delight to have heard. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:12:21','2025-09-04 15:12:21'),(18264,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22570-1756962743',22570,417,19,14,3,2025,32,'111',NULL,7577,4451,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,10.20,10.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,