of the cool palm.  Your choice of the time of day to capture the sunset on the bottom of the palm tree is very good.  The crispness you have shown with the palm fronds being enhanced with the shading is wonderful.  I encourage you to continue to use this God-given ability to capture creation through this medium of photography.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:26:16','2025-09-04 15:26:16'),(18276,'judge-event-evaluation-22903-1756963632',22903,417,19,14,3,2025,277,'860','1',0,4451,8349,33,NULL,'21',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A fine performance, filled with ease and melody. The song was appropriate to the context and enabled each performer to showcase their ability. A very enjoyable performance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:27:12','2025-09-04 15:27:12'),(18277,'judge-event-evaluation-23249-1756963680',23249,414,19,14,3,2025,196,'508',NULL,8913,6097,8349,52,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'An eye catching work that clearly captures its theme of the \'sword of the spirit\'. There are some areas where the media is not fully integrated on the canvas. It is thought provoking work. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:28:00','2025-09-04 15:28:00'),(18278,'judge-event-evaluation-23215-1756963715',23215,414,19,14,3,2025,196,'508',NULL,8916,6097,8349,52,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'A eye catching art work that draws attention to \"pollution in the ocean\'. The green background doesn\'t suggest the ocean however and the inspiration for the artwork is given as \'MiranovaArtG\'. who specializes in seascapes.. An interesting piece.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:28:35','2025-09-04 15:28:35'),(18280,'judge-event-evaluation-23103-1756963762',23103,414,19,14,3,2025,196,'508',NULL,8918,6097,8349,52,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'An eye catching piece that was inspired by an online image of falling leaves. The background is particularly lovely, with varying blue hues, highlighted with gold strands and glitter. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:29:22','2025-09-04 15:29:22'),(18282,'judge-event-evaluation-23194-1756963834',23194,417,19,14,3,2025,196,'508',NULL,7573,4451,8349,52,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'An eye catching work that draws the viewer in for a closer look. All elements of the criteria have been meet to a good degree. The inspiration of the piece was unclear, so something to think about for next year is to add more detail and reflection on the \'why\' of your piece. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:30:34','2025-09-04 15:30:34'),(18286,'judge-event-evaluation-23243-1756963965',23243,414,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7898,6097,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely sunset at Castlepoint, it certainly is a beautiful area. Your original photo was a lot sharper than the actual printed photo, and I would have loved to see this printed out in a higher quality. I did judge more on the original as I believe this was not how you would of liked your photo developed. I really liked the way the rays of sun flowed over the pathway, with the flax being the focus in the right hand bottom corner. Hasn\'t God made a wonderful world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:32:45','2025-09-04 15:32:45'),(18288,'judge-event-evaluation-23055-1756964136',23055,417,19,14,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7328,4451,8923,2,'Open','11',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Luke, I was able to see your description of your choice in this photo straight away and my eyes were drawn to the cloud formation including the reflection in the car\'s paintwork.  The sun being captured coming over the image was caught at just the right time.  I so appreciate your ability in seeing this as well as being able to capture it through photography for others to enjoy too.  I pray that you continue to develop this God-given ability so that many people can see our God\'s creation through this talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:35:36','2025-09-04 15:35:36'),(18290,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22559-1756964164',22559,417,19,14,3,2025,46,'141',NULL,7572,4451,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:36:04',NULL),(18291,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22487-1756964164',22487,419,19,14,3,2025,46,'141',NULL,8936,8346,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,22.60,22.60,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 15:36:04',NULL),(18292,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22480-1756964164',22480,419,19,14,3,2025,46,'141',NULL,8937,8346,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,10.20,10.20,NULL,