',NULL,7733,4451,8349,22,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'NOTE: Interstellar is a Science fiction T.V.. series.\r\n\r\nA delight performance by Timothy. He was able to demonstrate he is a skillful pianist. The chosen piece was melodic and full of intensity, however it did not fit the Christian context of the competition. Despite that, it was a delightful performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:25:37','2025-09-04 16:25:37'),(18317,'judge-event-evaluation-23250-1756967235',23250,414,19,14,3,2025,219,'700',NULL,8913,6097,8349,22,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen piece for the context of the performance. There were a few hesitations and the performance didn\'t flow in some moments. Benjamin has the ability to connect to an audience and it was overall a delightful performance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:27:15','2025-09-04 16:27:15'),(18318,'judge-event-evaluation-22666-1756967288',22666,419,19,14,3,2025,219,'700',NULL,8933,8346,8349,22,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen piece that demonstrated David\'s skillful playing of this instrument. An unfortunate stumble, lowered otherwise very high scores. David recovered well, and was able to finish the piece. Overall a superb performance. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:28:08','2025-09-04 16:28:08'),(18319,'judge-event-evaluation-22964-1756967347',22964,417,19,14,3,2025,14,'056','1',0,4451,8349,1,'Open','3',100,83.00,NULL,NULL,'An easy to follow research assignment that clearly discusses the process of electroplating. There is