d',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:30:10','2025-09-04 16:30:10'),(18325,'judge-event-evaluation-22765-1756967452',22765,417,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7580,4451,8349,19,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen piece that showcased Brooke\'s skill as a singer and pianist. Brooke could afford to engage with the audience a little more and that would lift performance to an experience for the audience. Over all though Brooke\'s intensity vocally carried her through and made listening delightful.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:30:52','2025-09-04 16:30:52'),(18326,'judge-event-evaluation-24459-1756967496',24459,421,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,8942,3799,8349,19,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'A wimsical piece, well chosen and executed. Grace has a wonderful rapport with the audience and showed a clear sense of fun and enjoyment during her performance. One slight stumble on a tricky instrument note meant not quite a perfect score. A delight to have seen and heard today.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:31:36','2025-09-04 16:31:36'),(18327,'judge-event-evaluation-22960-1756967581',22960,417,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7323,4451,8349,19,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen piece. Kayla started quietly but finished strong! She had a wonderful connection with the audience. She demonstrated great accuracy and memory, performing without sheet music.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:33:01','2025-09-04 16:33:01'),(18328,'judge-event-evaluation-23276-1756967622',23276,414,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7896,6097,8349,19,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen song that ministers. Kyle\' s piano playing was a delight, particularly at the refrain. He needed to lift his voice and sing to the backrow though as he was little quiet and lyrics were sometimes muffled. Overall a delightful performance that was greatly enjoyed. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:33:42','2025-09-04 16:33:42'),(18329,'judge-event-evaluation-23283-1756967645',23283,414,19,14,3,2025,214,'650',NULL,7897,6097,8349,19,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful  choice of song. Mood and style were interpreted and communicated well. Zachariah could have sung a little louder and stronger, however overall it was a delight to listen to.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:34:05','2025-09-04 16:34:05'),(18330,'judge-event-evaluation-23282-1756967668',23282,414,19,14,3,2025,135,'350',NULL,7897,6097,9242,57,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Firstly, I acknowledge how you don\'t need a plan submitted through.\r\nSecondly...\r\nI must be honest with you, I did think that it might\'ve been upside-down, after flipping it on the wrong side I can conclude that it was in fact right side up. You stated that the purpose of this structure was to hold fruit, to me, the bowl seems a bit high to hold much fruit. So I gave you that 6 as you could\'ve made it deeper, tho it may have been hard I am confident that you\'d be able to do it easily. You have smoothed this off nicely and I want to thank you for how it isn\'t annoyingly rough. This bowl is well made and I can see it sitting on someone\'s grandmother\'s table. Could you have done better? Of course. There\'s always room for improvement and If you come back next year then take it as an opportunity to do even better. Good job Zech!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:34:28','2025-09-04 16:34:28'),(18331,'judge-event-evaluation-24522-1756967709',24522,417,19,14,3,2025,210,'600',NULL,7575,4451,8349,19,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A well chosen song that showcased Paige\'s vocal range. A little more eye contact and engagement with the audience would have lifted the performance to an \'experience\' for the audience. Over all Paige demonstrated high accuracy & memory and was a delight to have listened to.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:35:09','2025-09-04 16:35:09'),(18333,'judge-event-evaluation-22892-1756967762',22892,417,19,14,3,2025,17,'059','1',0,4451,8349,9,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'A well researched topic with clearly understood presentation of findings. The investigation had focused questions that enabled clear answers. A bibliography and references were not seen.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:36:02','2025-09-04 16:36:02'),(18334,'judge-event-evaluation-22900-1756967830',22900,417,19,14,3,2025,18,'060','1',0,4451,8349,9,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'An interesting research project that clearly achieved its intention to \"inform others of possibly the most forgotten of the major events of the modern era\".  The presentation is a little text heavy and a summary of findings and a conclusion may have made it easy for viewers to access the information in the presentation. The clear ties to the biblical truth that \'God will protect those that are faithful to him\' is the firm foundation of this project and real gem for viewers to take away.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:37:10','2025-09-04 16:37:10'),(18335,'judge-event-evaluation-23051-1756967897',23051,417,19,14,3,2025,18,'060','2',0,4451,8349,9,NULL,'3',100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'A visually interesting research project that displays information found researching the topic of the Great Depression. There was no obvious bibliography or references to be seen. The layout and creativity or the presentation made the information presented easy to follow. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:38:17','2025-09-04 16:38:17'),(18336,'judge-event-evaluation-22950-1756967959',22950,417,19,14,3,2025,353,'870','1',0,4451,8349,34,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'A wonderful piece sung with gusto! There was a real joy in the voices that lifted and soared where appropriate. A joy to have experienced. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:39:19','2025-09-04 16:39:19'),(18337,'judge-event-evaluation-23208-1756967998',23208,414,19,14,3,2025,353,'870','1',0,6097,8349,34,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Note: song not not quite for our context, however it does celebrate the biblical relationship of men and women.\r\n\r\nA well chosen piece that showcased the voices of the various members. The group worked well together, hamonizing and showing intensity where appropriate. An uplifting performance.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:39:58','2025-09-04 16:39:58'),(18338,'judge-event-evaluation-22492-1756968037',22492,414,19,14,3,2025,12,'054','1',0,6097,6960,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:40:37','2025-09-04 16:40:37'),(18339,'judge-event-evaluation-23192-1756968047',23192,417,19,14,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7733,4451,8923,2,'Open','11',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Timothy, I loved spending time looking at your photo.  The angle of the photo and the lighting captured has created depth and draws the eye into the centre.  Your choice in using the vintage camera filter has certainly made this picture sharper and has made the lighting and colouring crisper.  I pray that you continue to develop your God-given ability in capturing the world through your artistic strengths. It is an excellent photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:40:47','2025-09-04 16:40:47'),(18340,'judge-event-evaluation-23105-1756968106',23105,414,19,14,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,8918,6097,9242,2,'Collection','9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:41:46','2025-09-04 16:41:46'),(18341,'judge-event-evaluation-22873-1756968195',22873,417,19,14,3,2025,161,'402',NULL,7321,4451,9242,2,'Collection','9',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N