,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:53:46','2025-09-04 16:53:46'),(18360,'judge-event-evaluation-23038-1756968853',23038,417,19,14,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,7733,4451,8349,12,NULL,NULL,100,99.00,NULL,NULL,'An eye catching, attention keeping poster that conveys a clear message. The use of positive and negative space is skillful. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:54:13','2025-09-04 16:54:13'),(18361,'judge-event-evaluation-22706-1756968894',22706,417,19,14,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,7322,4451,8349,12,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,NULL,NULL,'A poster that conveys bible truths and provides supporting images that help deliver the main message. Well, done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:54:54','2025-09-04 16:54:54'),(18362,'judge-event-evaluation-23155-1756968932',23155,414,19,14,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,8914,6097,8349,12,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,NULL,NULL,'A colourful poster that attempts to convey the biblical truth that \'our help comes from God in times of trouble\'. Things to think about for your next entry: how could you use positive and negative space, shading and original ideas and make them work to together to create the desired effect. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:55:32','2025-09-04 16:55:32'),(18363,'judge-event-evaluation-23128-1756968952',23128,414,19,14,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,8915,6097,8349,12,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'A well thought out design, however some of the technical skill in cropping and resizing need development. A good effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:55:52','2025-09-04 16:55:53'),(18364,'judge-event-evaluation-23130-1756968981',23130,414,19,14,3,2025,181,'462',NULL,8917,6097,8349,12,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'A good attempt at poster design. For next year developing an understanding of the \'rule of thirds\', shading, and focal point will help create a poster that clearly reveals your message in connected layers that will reinforce each other.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 16:56:21','2025-09-04 16:56:21'),(18369,'judge-event-evaluation-23323-1756969504',23323,417,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7331,4451,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'I really enjoyed the size and shape you chose to print your skyscape in, Chloe. The framing made your picture pop, very artistic. Hasn\'t God given us an amazing world to live in. The silhouettes of the trees seem as if you have placed them in the perfect place. A beautiful picture. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 17:05:04','2025-09-04 17:05:04'),(18370,'judge-event-evaluation-23115-1756969536',23115,414,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7900,6097,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely sunset photo, Peyton. Your original photo was a lot sharper than the actual printed photo, and I would have loved to see this printed out in a higher quality. I did judge more on the original as I believe this was not how you would of liked your photo developed. I thought the fence at the bottom looked quite startling and I think I would have enjoyed seeing your photo in portrait, so the fence could really pop under the bright sunset.  Hasn\'t God made a wonderful world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 17:05:36','2025-09-04 17:05:36'),(18372,'judge-event-evaluation-22967-1756972767',22967,417,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7576,4451,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Now that is a view I would like to have out my window, Jacob. Isn\'t Gods world He created for us, so beautiful and amazing. You captured the scape\'s beauty and majesty along with a calm sereness. I particularly enjoyed the bright orange sun and the purple flowers popping out of the tree. I pray you keep seeing the wonder of our Lord\'s creation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 17:59:27','2025-09-04 17:59:27'),(18373,'judge-event-evaluation-23246-1756973524',23246,417,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7323,4451,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Isn\'t majesty of our Lord is clearly shown in His creation, Kayla. You have captured the rocks and sea with a pleasant balance. I like the islands seemingly floating in the background, they have shown up in a slight haze which I enjoyed. The angle you took this photo really makes it very lovely. You are about to begin the next journey of your life now, leaving school. I know that God is holding you in His hands and that He will use the giftings He has given you to please Him in the way you live. Your servant heart and willingness to help others and help them do their best is a gift God has given you and I know you will go forward with God\'s continuing blessings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 18:12:04','2025-09-04 18:12:04'),(18374,'judge-event-evaluation-23158-1756973928',23158,414,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7897,6097,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'This photo made me think of the vast expansive world God has given us to live in, Zach. I know I\'m meant to be commenting on this photo - but as I looked at this I thought of you about to head out on your next journey in life. God has you tightly in His hands and He will go before you, around you and with you as you step out into this next adventure. I pray you will know His joy and strength. Your servant heart is so evident and I pray you will know in your heart what you need to do to keep yourself strong in body, mind and spirit. Thank you for the support you have given your school mates in preparations and during convention this year. Many blessings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 18:18:48','2025-09-04 18:18:49'),(18376,'judge-event-evaluation-23041-1756974325',23041,417,19,14,3,2025,175,'453',NULL,7733,4451,7858,2,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'What an amazing picture, Timothy. The Great Wall is even more majestic than I imagined. I agree that the winding wall added interest to the photo. I wondered if you could have cropped a small amount off the sky to make the wall the main feature. What an interesting idea using the vintage filter and I did enjoy how the lightness in the distance drew you into the picture. Keep shining for Jesus and seeing the wonder in His world.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 18:25:25','2025-09-04 18:25:25'),(18380,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22454-1756981121',22454,414,19,14,3,2025,62,'173',N