,NULL,2,15,2,15,NULL,NULL,60,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:29:06',NULL),(18387,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22451-1756981746',22451,414,19,14,3,2025,106,'273',NULL,7900,6097,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,5,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,5,1,5,15,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:29:06',NULL),(18388,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22424-1756981746',22424,414,19,14,3,2025,106,'273',NULL,7901,6097,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,5,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,2,15,20,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:29:06',NULL),(18389,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22694-1756981913',22694,400,19,14,3,2025,92,'243',NULL,8930,4457,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,30,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,5,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,35,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:31:53',NULL),(18390,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22636-1756981913',22636,421,19,14,3,2025,92,'243',NULL,8942,3799,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,20,1,10,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,15,0,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,45,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:31:53',NULL),(18391,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22585-1756981913',22585,417,19,14,3,2025,92,'243',NULL,7578,4451,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,5,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,25,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,4,10,40,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:31:53',NULL),(18392,'judge-times-event-evaluation-22472-1756981913',22472,419,19,14,3,2025,92,'243',NULL,8934,8346,7827,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,20,1,10,0,NULL,0,NULL,1,15,1,25,1,5,NULL,NULL,3,20,6,30,125,NULL,0,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:31:53',NULL),(18394,'judge-event-evaluation-23051-1756983475',23051,417,19,14,3,2025,18,'060','2',0,4451,8943,9,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Wow! Vanessa and Sofia, I LOVE your display! It\'s so neat when you come across something that sparks an interest to learn more about it :) You both have put so much effort and time into this! I love the details, the pictures, the interestingly shaped information bubbles.\r\nVery effective how you\'ve organised the categories into New Deal, General, and Food. Great job!\r\n\r\nPerhaps you could add some headings to your interesting paragraphs. The paragraph about the sweet tooth could be more readable with bullet points describing each dessert :) Same for the middle speech bubble on The New Deal page. Bullet points are your friend!\r\nThe Sweet Tooth bubble is repeated on the display. Watch out for things like that :)\r\n\r\nWith your timeline, a way you could enhance your project would be to make an actual timeline, and have little speech bubbles above and below for each thing you\'re describing. The more visual tricks and techniques you can use, the more effective your communication.\r\n\r\nI LOVE that you repurposed an old box into something so useful and informative! The edges of the display could be covered with black tape for a tidier appearance.\r\n\r\nCould you include a bit more about where you got your information? Website links, book titles etc?\r\n\r\nNicely painted! And well presented. You\'ve chosen a colour scheme and been consistent with it, which really enhances the visual appeal. Great job girls, keep it up! God bless you as you learn more about His Story!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 20:57:55','2025-09-04 20:57:55'),(18395,'judge-event-evaluation-22671-1756985327',22671,414,19,14,3,2025,342,'1055',NULL,7922,6097,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 21:28:47','2025-09-04 21:28:47'),(18396,'judge-event-evaluation-22674-1756985396',22674,414,19,14,3,2025,336,'1005',NULL,8918,6097,6,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 21:29:56','2025-09-04 21:29:56'),(18397,'judge-event-evaluation-22900-1756987710',22900,417,19,14,3,2025,18,'060','1',0,4451,8943,9,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'You have written a well-researched report Hudson! :)\r\n\r\nYour presentation could be improved by more images.\r\nThe text could be a bit more succinct, and you could cut the text into separate sections of varying shapes and sizes to add interest.\r\n\r\nActually, you\'ve got a really good basis to play with. You could take the text you have, condense it, and have a play with layout and decoration :)\r\n\r\nCategories are a great way to enhance a display. For example, you could turn each heading you have in the text and have a section for that.\r\n\r\nBeware of having the title board too short. When the sides fold outward slightly, it makes it more readable and inviting :)\r\n\r\nDisplay colours are great! Your lines are very straight, well done!\r\n\r\nYou chose a great topic, and you must have learned a LOT about it. Three drafts, that is commitment! Well done! Enjoy learning more about His Story!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 22:08:30','2025-09-04 22:08:30'),(18400,'judge-event-evaluation-22623-1756989722',22623,417,19,14,3,2025,185,'466','1',0,4451,8943,14,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done for creating a website Luke! You\'ve put a lot of time and effort into it I can see. Amazing!\r\n\r\nThere\'s a few things to consider and discuss with your parents as regarding the theme of the website. Some of the Minecraft mechanics (such as enchanting) could be considered occultic, but are portrayed in a positive light in the game. The Bible warns against this sort of thing. I\'d encourage you to look into the root of the game and see if it is something that God allows or warns us away from because of His love for us :)\r\n\r\nA tip - the shorter the website link, the better. You want to make it easy for people to find your site.\r\n\r\nThe menu/site navigation could be improved by reducing the number of times you need to click on a banner before arriving at the information. Incorporating hover effects and drop down information banners would really enhance it.\r\n\r\nYou have listed your resources and permissions, that is fantastic! And you have incorporated a lot of information about the game. It fulfills the purpose :)\r\n\r\nKeep creating websites for useful purposes Luke! God bless you as you use your gifts for Him! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-04 22:42:02','2025-09-04 22:42:02'),(18401,'judge-event-evaluation-25364-1757269119',25364,425,20,23,3,2025,336,'1005',NULL,8966,866,6960,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-08 04:18:39','2025-09-08 04:18:39'),(18402,'judge-event-evaluation-23606-1757324755',23606,443,20,23,3,2025,9,'051',NULL,7939,4504,7827,NULL,'Open',NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-09-08 19:45:55','2025-09-08 19:45