her speaker starts a conversation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-11 20:55:13','2025-10-11 20:55:13'),(19729,'judge-event-evaluation-24562-1760181350',24562,430,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9020,392,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'There were some structural and punctuation errors. \r\n\r\nYou have potential, so practice more. Read a lot of English literature to improve your vocabulary and writing skills. Also, about the show-not-tell technique. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-11 21:15:50','2025-10-11 21:15:50'),(19730,'judge-event-evaluation-26145-1760181686',26145,461,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9139,7991,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'If I may give a suggestion, add more argumentative conversation between the twins, then show how they resolve the argument before finally forgiving each other. \r\nAlso, use Past tenses in the narration part. \r\n\r\nThere were some structural and punctuation errors. Also, do not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.\r\n\r\nRead more English literature to improve your vocabulary and writing skills. You have potential. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-11 21:21:26','2025-10-11 21:21:26'),(19732,'judge-event-evaluation-26012-1760182129',26012,463,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9093,5934,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'it\'s a great story and is well-written. \r\nLearn more about the show-not-tell technique to make your story more interesting. \r\n\r\nDo not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.\r\n\r\n \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-11 21:28:49','2025-10-11 21:28:49'),(19733,'judge-event-evaluation-27813-1760182562',27813,446,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,7989,2276,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'It\'s a well-written story. \r\nLearn more about the show-not-tell technique to make your story more interesting. \r\n\r\nIf I may give a suggestion, add some narration. By using the show technique, show the pain experience while he was walking to the bridge. In this part, show the anger that he had held. Then, before jumping off the bridge, he got a flashback about his past/journey. \r\n\r\nDo not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-11 21:36:02','2025-10-11 21:36:02'),(19734,'judge-event-evaluation-26043-1760183203',26043,461,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,8296,7991,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'There are too many setting changes, like in the school scene, which was just a brief conversation between Val and her friend. Just narrate it in short paragraphs.\r\nAdd explanation since when their parents had waited before suddenly entering their room while they\'re arguing. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-11 21:46:43','2025-10-11 21:46:43'),(19735,'judge-event-evaluation-27694-1760183779',27694,456,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9124,4927,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'There are too many single lines. Please combine into one paragraph, unless dialogue. \