rsation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 00:59:42','2025-10-12 00:59:42'),(19750,'judge-event-evaluation-27206-1760195296',27206,473,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,8231,3716,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Pounamu is not a familiar word; add a footnote and give a description. \r\n\r\nWas it intentionally not to describe what exactly the \'treasure\' was? You mentioned that they found it, but no description of why it was called a valuable treasure. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 01:08:16','2025-10-12 01:08:16'),(19751,'judge-event-evaluation-27660-1760199527',27660,473,21,7,3,2025,167,'411',NULL,8227,3716,8535,11,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi, Judea, the color palette you used is unique, it creates an interesting dreamlike atmosphere. However, the image overall feels a bit flat. The mountain lacks depth and variation in shading, and the sky could use more gradient or contrast. Try experimenting with lighting and layering to make your scenes feel more dimensional. Don\'t be afraid to explore with color variation and adding details, because they can make your artwork come to life and take it to the next level! This is a promising start, Judea, keep practicing and exploring, you\'ve got some potential! I hope to see you again next time with an even better artwork :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 02:18:47','2025-10-12 02:18:47'),(19752,'judge-event-evaluation-28445-1760207885',28445,435,21,7,3,2025,167,'411',NULL,8078,1763,8535,11,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Joy, ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 04:38:05','2025-10-12 04:38:05'),(19754,'judge-event-evaluation-26696-1760238450',26696,461,21,7,3,2025,167,'411',NULL,8319,7991,8535,11,'Collection',NULL,100,50.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Maxwell, you\'ve made a cheerful, bright scene. However, it looks unfinished and lacks depth: shapes and edges are uneven and lighting and shadows don\'t match. Try cleaning up your shapes and outlines, and your artworks will look a lot better! Keep practicing those basics, Maxwell',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 13:07:30','2025-10-12 13:07:30'),(19756,'judge-event-evaluation-27824-1760239184',27824,461,21,7,3,2025,167,'411',NULL,8278,7991,8535,11,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Maegan, you\'ve chosen a bold subject, and although it might have been hard, you dared to try something new, and I applaud your for that! You\'ve captured the energy and expression well.  However, the fur rendering looks rushed and uneven, especially around the mane where strokes feel flat and lack direction, and the lighting and shadows on some parts aren\'t consistent. The eyes could also use sharper detail to anchor the focus. Overall you\'ve captured the idea well, but refining the fur texture and light consistency would take it to the next level and make it much more convincing. This is a strong and promising start, keep learning more about rendering and shading to make your artworks even more impressive. Good job, Maegan :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 13:19:44','2025-10-12 13:19:44'),(19757,'judge-event-evaluation-28550-1760241304',28550,461,21,7,3,2025,167,'411',NULL,9138,7991,8535,11,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Kimberly, ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 13:55:04','2025-10-12 13:55:04'),(19758,'judge-event-evaluation-25620-1760250040',25620,446,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,9059,2276,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'If I give a suggestion, write your story like a diary. Mention the date and event that happened on that day. \r\n\r\nDo not mix the Present tense with the Past tense in the narration part of the story. \r\nThere were some structural and punctuation errors. Also, do not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 16:20:40','2025-10-12 16:20:40'),(19761,'judge-event-evaluation-25316-1760250738',25316,458,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,9234,4200,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'It\'s a unique story.\r\n\r\nIf I give a suggestion, I suggest using something that can be used as a bridge from one event to another. It can be a door, wall, or box. Add some sensory details in your narration. \r\n\r\nThere were some structural and punctuation errors. Also, do not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 16:32:18','2025-10-12 16:32:18'),(19762,'judge-event-evaluation-28492-1760250808',28492,435,21,7,3,2025,180,'461',NULL,8076,1763,8535,11,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Adolf, very interesting artwork you got here! I like your idea of an island diorama, pretty creative and it stands out. I do think you could add explore more with the lighting, whether its being more bold with the light to add more contrast or add multiple lighting setups to make your scene more interesting. You can also add more detail or textures to some parts of your scene, like the rocks or the buildings. The mountains seem to have a good amount of detail, but they don\'t show through due to a lack of light and contrast. Overall, you\'ve done a great job and I think you can push it even further with bolder lighting, more contrast, and sharper details. Keep improving and learning more, you\'re already on a promising path, Adolf :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 16:33:28','2025-10-12 16:33:28'),(19763,'judge-event-evaluation-24566-1760250925',24566,430,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,7617,392,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Since this is a short story, it primarily focuses on a single specific conflict. \r\nThere were too many conflicts being discussed in your story. \r\n\r\nWhat exactly happened in \'Point of Zero\'? \r\n\r\nThere were some structural and punctuation errors. Also, do not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 16:35:25','2025-10-12 16:35:25'),(19764,'judge-event-evaluation-28687-1760251219',28687,458,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,9235,4200,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Since this is a short story, it primarily focuses on a single specific conflict. \r\nThere were too many conflicts being discussed in your story.\r\nPlease choose either the childhood story or the youth moment. \r\n\r\nJustify your paragraph, not in the center position. \r\nThere were some structural and punctuation errors. Also, do not write some dialogue in one paragraph. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation.\r\n\r\nPractice and read more English literature to improve your vocabulary and writing skills. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 16:40:19','2025-10-15 18:19:35'),(19765,'judge-event-evaluation-24994-1760252525',24994,430,21,7,3,2025,180,'461',NULL,7604,392,8535,11,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi Iola, great job with your artwork, your proportions are good, I can see some color variation, and I especially like the grass in the foreground, they look really convincing. However, the black outlines on the horse and fence kill the realism that you would have achieved otherwise from your background and foreground. You could opt for no outline or a less prominent one instead. Additionally, the horse and fence especially could use some more detail, whether its more detailed shapes, shading, or texture, they\'ll definitely make your artwork a lot more convincing! Overall, you\'ve done a good job, I can see you followed the reference very thoroughly, keep practicing and learning about rendering to make your artworks more convincing. See you next time, Iola, keep developing your potential :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 17:02:05','2025-10-12 17:02:05'),(19767,'judge-event-evaluation-24567-1760252637',24567,430,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,7619,392,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Do not use ellipses (...) too many times. It\'s better to use narration to explain the situation or condition. \r\nThere are too many short lines. Combine in one paragraph.\r\n\r\nI wish you didn\'t rely too much on translation tools, because several word combinations can change the overall meaning.\r\nRead English literature more to improve your vocabulary and writing skills. \r\n\r\nWell done. \r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 17:03:57','2025-10-15 13:48:24'),(19768,'judge-event-evaluation-24436-1760253024',24436,447,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,7078,6328,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'It\'s a wonderful story.\r\nStarting very strongly, the conflict is clear, and then ended well. \r\n\r\nGood job. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 17:10:24','2025-10-12 17:10:24'),(19769,'judge-event-evaluation-26038-1760253828',26038,463,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,8162,5934,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 17:23:48','2025-10-12 17:23:48'),(19770,'judge-event-evaluation-25311-1760254399',25311,458,21,7,3,2025,21,'063',NULL,9236,4200,9151,7,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Even though it\'s inspired by the Prodigal Son, it\'ll be better if you change some elements, especially the ending part. \r\nDialogue or direct sentences do not need to be written in italics. Start a new paragraph when another speaker starts a conversation. Do not write some dialogues in one paragraph. \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-12 17:33:19','2025-10-12 17:33:19'),(19771,