 can be applicable in daily life. The idea of using bread to measure mold growth alongside your 5 variables (e.g., Dettol, Lifebuoy, etc) is very creative. Your purpose of investigation is very straightforward. \r\n\r\nHowever, in your report, some of your wording needs to be more formal, and some need grammatical correction. In particular, \"Our bread mold growth was delayed because of freezing the bread before using it.\" This sentence is informative but not grammatically accurate. Furthermore, some of your in-text citation needs some correction, depending on what reference format you\'re using. Lastly, if you\'re writing a hypothesis, you need to write it using \"we hypothesize or we predict that commercial soap has more antiseptic content since it has more ingredients to kill bacteria.\" You can\'t say that \"dettol might be the best because of advertisement\". But you have to say \"It is known that dettol has the best antiseptic quality as written in the dettol packaging content.\" \r\n\r\nOverall, it is a very good project. I enjoyed reading it. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-14 12:38:30','2025-10-14 12:38:30'),(20533,'judge-event-evaluation-26233-1760409514',26233,461,21,7,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,9194,7991,7057,44,'Open','25',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Implicit moral message is great ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-14 12:38:34','2025-10-14 12:38:34'),(20534,'judge-event-evaluation-26233-1760409533',26233,461,21,7,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,9194,7991,9256,44,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! Great enunciation and flow you have talent for storytelling. I would like to see a bit more expression from your face and eyes, and try not to rush through the s