464,21,7,3,2025,254,'800',NULL,8192,1009,8066,32,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you King Chen your voice so beautiful. More practice and memories lyric make your performance better. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:27:13','2025-10-16 11:27:14'),(26818,'judge-event-evaluation-27207-1760578039',27207,464,21,7,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,9171,1009,8206,49,'Open','24',100,69.00,-10,-1.50,'02:35\r\nExcellent memorization of the script, good accent, fluency, and pronunciation. Things to improve: facial expression, eye contact, and gestures. You are delivering a speech to influence people, so you should show convincing and authoritative facial expressions, eye contact and gestures. Persuade the audience by maintaining a good inflection, too. Manage your time and reach at least the minimum duration. Overall, good job! Thank you for trying. :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:27:19','2025-10-16 11:27:19'),(26819,'judge-event-evaluation-28820-1760578058',28820,430,21,7,3,2025,183,'464','3',0,392,8343,4,'Open','19',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'It\'s all good but please check and read the guidelines about Bibliography and credits included',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:27:38','2025-10-16 11:27:38'),(26820,'judge-event-evaluation-23933-1760578087',23933,447,21,7,3,2025,291,'911',NULL,8270,6328,7877,46,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:28:07','2025-10-16 11:28:07'),(26821,'judge-event-evaluation-26351-1760578109',26351,433,21,7,3,2025,349,'767','1',0,5317,9118,30,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,NULL,NULL,'Hi, this is a very uplifting music, I love the way you put together the ethnic background. However, I still feel that the pad is too loud and not hitting the right count (like a little bit delay). Since it was too loud, you can also feel the delay and setback. Great work for this composition!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:28:29','2025-10-16 11:28:29'),(26822,'judge-event-evaluation-23933-1760578179',23933,447,21,7,3,2025,291,'911',NULL,8270,6328,8196,46,'Collection','24',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Joshua has a good memory about the plot of the story. However he needs to pay attention to his enunciation, poise, facial expressions, and gestures to engage more with the audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:29:39','2025-10-16 11:29:39'),(26823,'judge-event-evaluation-27207-1760578209',27207,464,21,7,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,9171,1009,7485,49,'Collection','25',100,76.00,-10,-1.50,'Well done, Jovan. You have tried your best, and you deliver. A few points that you need to improve for the next famous speech are your eye contact and voice projection. Eye contact will affect the persuasiveness of the speech to the audience, and voice projection will support the message to be delivered. I believe that you can do better in future public speaking.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:30:09','2025-10-16 11:30:09'),(268