are fluent in reading your story. You can try to be more expressive because there are many dramatic moments in the story.\r\n\r\nFinished 5:51\'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:43:52','2025-10-16 11:43:52'),(26847,'judge-event-evaluation-28305-1760579058',28305,463,21,7,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,9112,5934,8206,49,'Collection','24',100,67.00,-10,NULL,'04:35\r\nExcellent fluency, pronunciation and accent. Things to improve: confidence, inflection (you have to practice more to make yourself sound persuasive), gestures and eye contact (make yourself look convincing in front of the judges/audience because you want to influence them). Overall, good job! :)\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:44:18','2025-10-16 11:44:18'),(26848,'judge-event-evaluation-28305-1760579085',28305,463,21,7,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,9112,5934,7485,49,'Open','24',100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Kevin, remember to always start the speech with introduction. Your confidence shows in how smooth the flow your speech goes. Just make sure to prepare everything before you start your competition so what you said it does appear in the script you distribute. Thank you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 11:44:45','2025-10-16 11:44:45'),(26850,'judge-event-evaluation-25845-1760579088',25845,464,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','12',0,1009,9021,41,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Good job for your performance.. you did it well. Keep learning',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL