165,'406',NULL,8267,6328,8069,2,'Collection','11',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Aaron. Keep up the good work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:29:27','2025-10-16 12:29:27'),(26965,'judge-event-evaluation-27384-1760581771',27384,430,21,7,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,7608,392,8206,49,'Open','24',100,84.00,-10,-1.50,'02:50\r\nConfident and fluent. Things to improve: gestures (I think it would be better if the podium-knocking is made less so that the audience is not too distracted by the noise and can focus on the content), own the stage by moving side to side and make more hand movements, eye contact (try to look at the audience\'s/judges\' eyes so that you can convince and persuade them). Overall, good job! :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:29:31','2025-10-16 12:29:31'),(26966,'judge-event-evaluation-26355-1760581786',26355,461,21,7,3,2025,165,'406',NULL,9216,7991,8069,2,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:29:46','2025-10-16 12:29:46'),(26967,'judge-event-evaluation-27384-1760581835',27384,430,21,7,3,2025,319,'964',NULL,7608,392,7485,49,'Open','24',100,84.00,-10,-1.50,'The fire of speech is deliver meaning that your memorization does help you to become confidence. Still, the fire needs oil to make it able to burn, what I mean is the voice may be loud but if it can\'t persuade the audience then the message may not deliver. I hope that you can join again this event next year. Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:30:35','2025-10-16 12:30:35'),(26971,'judge-event-evaluation-26308-1760581961',26308,461,21,7,3,2025,364,'760','3',0,7991,9008,26,'Open','21',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Great job performing! You have some great dance movements; however, you need more power, especially when this is an upbeat praise song. I love how you switch into different kinds of formations; it\'s creative of you. But again, your choice of song sometimes doesn\'t match the mood of the song itself. Keep up the good work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:32:41','2025-10-16 12:32:41'),(26972,'judge-event-evaluation-26368-1760581964',26368,461,21,7,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,9197,7991,9071,44,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'You have the talent but you are just not all out.\r\nYou can use facial expression and intonation more so that your story does sound expressive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:32:44','2025-10-16 12:32:44'),(26973,'judge-event-evaluation-28855-1760581965',28855,549,21,7,3,2025,272,'855',NULL,8248,1470,8066,32,'Open','25',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Felicia for the beautiful performance. Keep improve your vocal  and believe to your voice. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 12:32:45','2025-10-16 12:32:45'),(26974,'judge-event-evaluation-27495-1760582004',27495,430,21,7,3,2025,316,'961',NULL,9111,392,8196,46,NULL,NULL,0,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Did not attend',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL