ncing and praising the Lord Jesus with your tambourine. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:02:37','2025-10-16 14:02:37'),(27205,'judge-event-evaluation-26246-1760587366',26246,461,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','4',0,7991,9008,26,'Collection','22',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your performance! Although there\'s a bit of off-tempo and uneven beat, you still manage to carry out the dance very well. There\'s a bit lack of coordination because sometimes you and your team members can move differently or not on the same beat with each other. You need to improve your fluency and your balancing movements. \r\nBut overall, I appreciate you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:02:46','2025-10-16 14:02:47'),(27208,'judge-event-evaluation-28001-1760587416',28001,461,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','1',0,7991,9021,41,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Well done for your performance.. keep improving your creativity to make the better one for the next.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:03:36','2025-10-16 14:03:36'),(27209,'judge-event-evaluation-26246-1760587423',26246,461,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','4',0,7991,8507,26,'Collection','22',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'A lively trio group performance. with clear rhythm and teamwork. Some sections could be more aligned, but the performance remained engaging and expressive. With more precision and practice, it can be very powerful. Thank you for praising and worshipping God. Keep serving the Lord with your talents!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL