ion-28001-1760587666',28001,461,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','1',0,7991,7036,41,'Open',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed your performance. Your blocking-movements are so lively. Some of your expressions look natural.\r\n1. Make sure your blocking don\'t overblocking each others.\r\n2. Avoid low-blocking (too much lay down) the audience can\'t see your expression clearly.\r\nYou\'ve done great job. ^0^',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:07:46','2025-10-16 14:07:46'),(27218,'judge-event-evaluation-25845-1760587692',25845,464,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','12',0,1009,7036,41,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'I like your performance.  I like how you prepared your costumes.\r\nHere somethings to be notice :\r\n1. Make sure your properties don\'t overblocking each other.\r\n2. Avoid head down and 3 quarter blocking so audience can see your expression.\r\n3. Make variations of tone and speed so we can feel different emotions.\r\nYou\'ve done a great job. ^0^',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:08:12','2025-10-16 14:08:12'),(27220,'judge-event-evaluation-27060-1760587708',27060,461,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','2',0,7991,7036,41,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed your performance. I like how you prepare the property and sounds effects. I can see your action-reaction between casts in some part of your act. I can taste your imaginations in some part of your act.\r\nHere\'s a thing to be notice : Leveling blocking, so some of the cast can\'t be overblock while sitting. ^0^\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:08:28','2025-10-16 14:08:28'),(27221,'judge-event-evaluation-28897-1760587725',28897,463,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','9',0,5934,7036,41,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed your performance. I know it\'s a hard script to be excecuted, but some of your cast can delivered emotions to audience.\r\nHere somethings to be notice :\r\n1.  make sure you didn\'t overblock the bench.\r\n2. Your backsound sometimes to loud, please choose one, either your voice is louder or, the backsound music softer.\r\n3. Some lines is missing, but it\'s okay, you can overcome it.\r\nYou\'ve done your best. \\^0^/\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:08:45','2025-10-16 14:08:45'),(27225,'judge-event-evaluation-27631-1760587810',27631,429,21,7,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7092,394,9051,2,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Good job.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:10:10','2025-10-16 14:10:10'),(27231,'judge-event-evaluation-27854-1760587867',27854,463,21,7,3,2025,298,'922',NULL,8083,5934,9071,44,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'You do good. You have the confidence to express more, don\'t hold back yah :)\r\nYou may add some dramatic gestures with powerful intonation, the story will be perfect.\r\nYou are fluent.\r\n\r\nFinished in 5:02\'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:11:07','2025-10-16 14:11:07'),(27233,'judge-event-evaluation-27625-1760587891',27625,429,21,7,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,7089,394,9051,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N