44,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'You may need to practice some words in pronunciation :) You do good.\r\nYou may not need to move too much even if your story has many dialogues, maybe you can differentiate your voice on the characters. \r\n\r\nFinished in 4:30\'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:18:12','2025-10-16 14:18:12'),(27259,'judge-event-evaluation-28515-1760588301',28515,435,21,7,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,9208,1763,9051,2,NULL,NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Good job, but this photograph should go into Portrait Category, Maggi.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:18:21','2025-10-16 14:18:21'),(27261,'judge-event-evaluation-27019-1760588305',27019,430,21,7,3,2025,267,'850',NULL,7594,392,8066,32,'Open','24',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Aksel for the beautiful voice.God bless you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:18:25','2025-10-16 14:18:25'),(27266,'judge-event-evaluation-26943-1760588408',26943,429,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','6',0,394,8451,26,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Your dance performance was already good. However, you danced too close together despite having plenty of space. As a result, your movements became restricted, and your arms couldn\'t open fully. keep dancing to praise Jesus!\r\nNote:  please wear School Uniform and wear shoes.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:20:08','2025-10-16 14:20:08'),(27267,'judge-event-evaluation-28310-1760588408',28310,463,21,7,3,2025,178,'456',NULL,9112,5934,9051,2,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Good job, but this one should go into Nature Category. Come back stronger next year, Kevin.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:20:08','2025-10-16 14:20:08'),(27270,'judge-event-evaluation-27019-1760588440',27019,430,21,7,3,2025,267,'850',NULL,7594,392,9296,32,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,-0.50,'Thank you, Aksel, for singing this song so well. You have a good mastery of the song. Next, be careful with your pitch control and try to add deeper expression when you sing. Take a rest Axel and get well soon . May God bless you.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:20:40','2025-10-16 14:20:40'),(27271,'judge-event-evaluation-27624-1760588464',27624,429,21,7,3,2025,329,'978',NULL,7089,394,7878,49,'Open','24',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Well done !\r\nYou speak loud and distinctive at some part, giving a variation during performing. For adjustment, focus on maintaining a steady eye contact will improve your score.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:21:04','2025-10-16 14:21:04'),(27273,'judge-event-evaluation-26564-1760588476',26564,461,21,7,3,2025,267,'850',NULL,8310,7991,9296,32,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,-1.50,'Thank you, Jayden, for singing this song wholeheartedly and with confidence. Next, you need to be careful with the high notes and maintain your pitch control. God bless you Jayden\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:21:16','2025-10-16 14:21:16'),(27277,'judge-event-evaluation-27624-1760588563',27624,429,21,7,3,2025,329,'978',NULL,7089,394,8206,49,'Open','25',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'04:23\r\nConfident, fluent, and good pronunciation. Things to improve: facial expression and eye contact (practice more on how to present yourself to be more convincing and persuasive), own the stage by moving from side to side, inflection. Overall, good job! :)\r\n\r\n*no report was supplied',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:22:43','2025-10-16 14:22:43'),(27278,'judge-event-evaluation-26943-1760588566',26943,429,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','6',0,394,9008,26,'Collection','22',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, my tambourine team! This is your first-ever performance, and I want to appreciate all of your hard work. But yes, you need to work on your dancing technique; it has to be more tambourine, not some movements that you made for yourself. You need more power and coordination with each other. You often miss out on tempos and you need to work on that. You can learn more variety of patterns. \r\nBut overall, super proud of you. It may not be perfect, but your efforts are accounted for. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 14:22:46','2025-10-16 14:22:46'),(27280,'judge-event-evaluation-27624-1760588597',27624,429,21,7,3,2025,329,'978',NULL,7089,394,7485,49,'Open','25',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Clarissa. What I observe in your speech is mostly eye contact, which you rarely shows it during your speech. Though you perform behind the podium, you still show the best gesture to portray the words. ',NULL