ntrol and expression. The energy and joy displayed made the presentation very engaging. Well done! Keep serving the Lord and God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 19:10:26','2025-10-16 19:10:26'),(27809,'judge-event-evaluation-28064-1760605895',28064,463,21,7,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,8127,5934,9008,23,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'You\'re blessed and amazing! I love how you danced for the Lord with your freestyle and tambourine dance. That\'s an excellent combination. In addition to that, your energy and confidence make up for the performance. However, during the last one, you put down the tambourine. The main focus of the performance is the tambourine, that\'s why you can\'t put your tambourine down. \r\nGod bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 19:11:35','2025-10-16 19:11:36'),(27810,'judge-event-evaluation-28064-1760605990',28064,463,21,7,3,2025,240,'756',NULL,8127,5934,8507,23,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'A confident performance with various and combination of movements. The energy and expression displayed made the presentation very engaging. However, need to remember to prioritise tambourine movements over non-tambourine type of dance. Keep up the high spirit and serving the Lord with your talents. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 19:13:10','2025-10-16 19:13:10'),(27811,'judge-event-evaluation-25975-1760606108',25975,463,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,8090,5934,7057,7,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Perfect!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N