0,5934,7036,41,'Open',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'I enjoyed your performance. I like the properties, costumes, sounds that you prepared.\r\nHere somethings to be notice :\r\n1. Make sure to say the lines in order.\r\n2. Avoid straight line bloking for a long time.\r\n3. Need to internalized the emotion so the fluctuative of the emotion can be act natural.\r\nYou\'ve done great. ^0^',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:11:16','2025-10-16 20:11:16'),(27833,'judge-event-evaluation-28898-1760609577',28898,463,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','10',0,5934,9073,41,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,-5.00,'Good job girls! Please memorize the script next time and be more confident.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:12:57','2025-10-16 20:12:57'),(27835,'judge-event-evaluation-28898-1760609582',28898,463,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','10',0,5934,9021,41,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Good job for the pervormance.. you did it well. Keep practicing in improving your talents.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:13:02','2025-10-16 20:13:02'),(27836,'judge-event-evaluation-28898-1760609727',28898,463,21,7,3,2025,310,'954','10',0,5934,7036,41,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'I like your performance.\r\nHere some things to be notice :\r\n1. Need to explore your character more, so you can explore your gesture, expressions, and tone.\r\n2. Add more blocking.\r\nYou\'ve done great job. ^0^ ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:15:27','2025-10-16 20:15:27'),(27837,'judge-event-evaluation-25999-1760609780',25999,463,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,8089,5934,8233,7,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'This was a great story with a nice, clear message. Great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:16:20','2025-10-16 20:16:20'),(27838,'judge-event-evaluation-28409-1760609799',28409,435,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','5',0,1763,8507,26,'Collection','22',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'A good group effort and performance Some sections could be more aligned, but the performance remained pleasing. With more precision and confidence, it can be improved. Good job! Thank you for praising and worshipping God. Keep serving the Lord with your talents. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:16:39','2025-10-16 20:16:39'),(27840,'judge-event-evaluation-28409-1760609957',28409,435,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','5',0,1763,9008,26,'Collection','22',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your performance! You have done a great job despite being sick. You have demonstrated a good combination of tambourine and worship music. However, you need to practice more on coordinating with the team, and you need to balance some parts of the dance techniques. Also, I suggest you don\'t have to use a tambourine for slow worship songs, except if God tells you so. \r\nOverall, good job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:19:17','2025-10-16 20:19:17'),(27842,'judge-event-evaluation-26007-1760609991',26007,463,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9091,5934,8233,7,'Collection',NULL,100,99.00,-10,NULL,'This was an amazing story! You built the world really well and I enjoyed the historical elements. The message was woven masterfully. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:19:51','2025-10-16 20:19:51'),(27843,'judge-event-evaluation-27364-1760609993',27364,456,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','7',0,4927,9008,26,'Collection','22',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your performance! I appreciate your efforts in doing this tambourine! However, there are some things that you can work on, such as the coordination. You are often not coordinated with each team member and often miss the beat or tempo. Also, the dance is not that related to the context of the song. \r\nThank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:19:53','2025-10-16 20:19:53'),(27844,'judge-event-evaluation-25310-1760610143',25310,458,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9223,4200,8233,7,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'The message and character were relevant and felt real. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:22:23','2025-10-16 20:22:23'),(27845,'judge-event-evaluation-28409-1760610151',28409,435,21,7,3,2025,230,'712','5',0,1763,8451,26,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Your performance and ministry were already good. Pay attention to your hand positions during the praise posture. When playing as a trio, you haven’t fully become one unified team yet—there’s a lack of uniformity in executing the tambourine patterns, and your movements aren’t yet harmonious as a trio. You’ve done well already, and with more practice time, you’ll surely improve even further. keep worshiping Jesus with your tambpurine dance. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:22:31','2025-10-16 20:22:31'),(27846,'judge-event-evaluation-27438-1760610164',27438,456,21,7,3,2025,224,'706',NULL,9127,4927,9008,23,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your performance! You have done a great job. Although some improvements can be helpful for you. You need to improve your tempo because some of your dance movements are not aligned with the tempo. You also need to practice your balancing on a tambourine. Furthermore, you need to improve your dynamics so that you can be more powerful in your dance.\r\nGod bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:22:44','2025-10-16 20:22:44'),(27847,'judge-event-evaluation-28795-1760610172',28795,430,21,7,3,2025,187,'468','2',0,392,8343,16,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 20:22:52','2025-10-16 20:22:52'),(27848,'judge-event-evaluation-24798-1760610206',24798,447,21,7,3,2025,224,'706',NULL,7083,6328,9008,23,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Well done on your first performance! You are amazing! But there are some things to improve on. During Sunday service, you need more variation in your dance patterns. I noticed that you kept giving the same dance patterns multiple times. Although your balancing and fluency is pretty good, there\'s still space to grow. Lastly, if using face paced songs, you have to use fast tambourine movements to match with the vibe or beat of the song.\