ings that are completely your own in future',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 23:03:14','2025-10-17 02:38:07'),(28003,'judge-event-evaluation-24568-1760620198',24568,430,21,7,3,2025,22,'064',NULL,7617,392,7239,8,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'I appreciate your entry, Kevin, but it\'s very important that your entry is your own work and not AI-generated, as going down this \'easy\' pathway prevents Holy Spirit from helping you with your own genuine entry and worse still, opens the door to the work of the enemy in areas of integrity and honesty. Repentance and a determination to produce your own work is the way to get back on track and see the amazing things you will produce with God\'s help....be blessed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 23:09:58','2025-10-17 03:03:36'),(28004,'judge-event-evaluation-24570-1760620726',24570,430,21,7,3,2025,22,'064',NULL,7619,392,7239,8,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you for your entry, but unfortunately, entries with 85% A1-generation do not indicate your own ideas and effort, so I\'d encourage you not to be tempted to go down this easy pathway as it can affect your spiritual life in the areas of integrity and honesty.\r\nHoly Spirit is the best teacher of all and is always ready and willing to help with ideas...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-16 23:18:46','2025-10-17 03:04:03'),(28006,'judge-event-evaluation-26537-1760621148',26537,461,21,7,3,2025,20,'062',NULL,8303,7991,7239,6,'Open',NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Thank-you...I can sense your love for Jesus in your