 and grand mountain. The beautiful deep blue sky perfectly compliments the focus of the subject. However minor changes regarding technicality, such as a higher quality print and coloring could bring this piece to perfection. Unfortunately, your work better fits the criteria of another category. Nonetheless, fantastic work on your photography and continue striving in your craft. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 06:24:20','2025-10-17 06:24:20'),(28617,'judge-event-evaluation-27694-1760647638',27694,456,21,7,3,2025,7,'013',NULL,9124,4927,7240,7,'Collection',NULL,100,64.00,-10,-6.00,'Thank you for your story Raina. Remember to listen to the word count and double space. Keep it up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 06:47:18','2025-10-17 06:47:18'),(28618,'judge-event-evaluation-25954-1760647910',25954,463,21,7,3,2025,351,'717','1',0,5934,7471,30,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done Abraham! This was a beautiful, nostalgic sounding piece. Keep on creating more music :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 06:51:50','2025-10-17 06:51:50'),(28619,'judge-event-evaluation-25954-1760647912',25954,463,21,7,3,2025,351,'717','1',0,5934,6,30,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done Abraham. Love the fluent progression and style. Keep up the great work and God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2025-10-17 06:51:52','2025-10-17 06:51:52'),(28620,'jud