ent angle, without the shelter in front of it.\r\nOtherwise, well done, Grace!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 19:53:48','2026-06-11 19:53:48'),(28712,'judge-event-evaluation-30205-1781171899',30205,607,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,7639,55,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Good try, Hannah!\r\nSubject, not clearly defined.\r\nKeep practicing for improvement.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 19:58:19','2026-06-11 19:58:19'),(28713,'judge-event-evaluation-30181-1781172155',30181,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9379,5804,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'The theme and emotions of your poem are clear and heartfelt. The imagery could use more sensory detail to elevate the emotional impact. You have strong word choice that creates emotional appeal but it could be more varied for richness.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 20:02:35','2026-06-11 20:02:35'),(28714,'judge-event-evaluation-30693-1781172379',30693,607,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,9321,55,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'You\'re probably the first student with a photo of a fruit.\r\nWell done on your creativity. I would suggest that you take the picture of the whole plant, growing in the ground, close up.\r\nOtherwise, well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 20:06:19','2026-06-11 20:06:19'),(28715,'judge-event-evaluation-29828-1781172409',29828,607,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9355,55,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome poem, it conveys passion, longing, and intensity. While the imagery is powerful, it is occasionally inconsistent (e.g., \"Live to passive\" feels unclear). Your poem has a distinctive voice with raw emotional energy.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 20:06:49','2026-06-11 20:06:49'),(28716,'judge-event-evaluation-30958-1781172849',30958,623,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,7612,1404,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Jessica.\r\nYou\'ve managed to capture the details on the flower, together with the different shades of orange, which was enhanced by the natural sunlight.\r\nGood job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 20:14:09','2026-06-11 20:14:09'),(28717,'judge-event-evaluation-30156-1781173100',30156,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9376,5804,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely poem, its heartfelt and its spiritually powerful. Its strength lies in its sincerity, devotional tone, and uplifting message.\r\nPhrasing could be refined for clarity and smoother rhythm.\r\nYou could add more vivid imagery to deepen emotional impact.\r\nTry to standardize capitalization and line breaks for over all polish.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-11 20:18:20','2026-06-11 20:18:20'),(28718,'judge-event-evaluation-29324-1781201566',29324,607,24,24,7,2026,176,'454',NULL,8868,55,NULL,2,'Open','12',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'A great image that captures the event well and that shows the lively atmosphere. You can improve by trying to capture all or 