andiwork.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-13 22:23:04','2026-06-13 22:23:04'),(28802,'judge-event-evaluation-30239-1781387087',30239,607,24,24,7,2026,180,'461',NULL,7670,55,9549,11,'Open',NULL,100,69.00,NULL,NULL,'Great effort, Fereti! \r\nYour use of dark shading for depth and lighter ones for bubbles give life to your art. A darker shade for the submarine would have enhanced your work. \r\nTry to add more to your report, for example why did you choose this and link it back to what you have learned in your Science PACEs or a character trait. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 07:44:47','2026-06-14 07:44:47'),(28803,'judge-event-evaluation-30542-1781387846',30542,617,24,24,7,2026,180,'461',NULL,7272,5806,9549,11,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Beautiful artwork, Temalesi! \r\nYour use of shading with different color tones give life to your artwork which is pleasing to the sight.\r\nGreat effort & keep it up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 07:57:26','2026-06-14 07:57:26'),(28804,'judge-event-evaluation-30251-1781389213',30251,626,24,24,7,2026,167,'411',NULL,9380,5804,9549,11,NULL,NULL,100,51.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Grace, \r\nNice try!\r\nColors is a beautiful creation of God. \r\nTry to choose a specific subject next so you can explore digital art techniques available to develop your skills. \r\nRemember, practice and patience, makes perfect. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 08:20:13','2026-06-14 08:20:13'),(28805,'judge-event-evaluation-30021-1781392217',30021,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8762,5804,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,0.00,'Great job, you\'ve kept your poem centered on one theme and the poem communicates genuine devotion and gratitude. While the poem has consistent rhyme, the rhythm is uneven in a few places which affects flow. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:10:17','2026-06-14 09:10:17'),(28806,'judge-event-evaluation-31211-1781393024',31211,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7557,4208,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Beautifully written poem with strong unity, heartfelt emotion, and vivid imagery. The rhythm flows well, though a few lines could be tightened for smoother cadence.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:23:44','2026-06-14 09:23:44'),(28807,'judge-event-evaluation-30218-1781393034',30218,607,24,24,7,2026,182,'463',NULL,9366,55,9613,13,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,NULL,NULL,'Not enough colors used but good work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:23:54','2026-06-14 09:23:54'),(28808,'judge-event-evaluation-30020-1781393469',30020,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7356,5804,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Your poem conveys encouragement and faith with sincerity, using biblical references to strengthen its message. The theme is unified and uplifting, though rhythm and originality could be refined for greater poetic impact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:31:09','2026-06-14 09:31:09'),(28809,'judge-event-evaluation-31224-1781393473',31224,607,24,24,7,2026,182,'463',NULL,9435,55,9613,13,NULL,NULL,100,58.00,NULL,NULL,'Good work submitted. Should have give more details as to what subject or bible verse will be covered during bible study. Also no venue mentioned.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:31:13','2026-06-14 09:31:13'),(28810,'judge-event-evaluation-30022-1781393696',30022,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8758,5804,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Your poem is heartfelt and sincere, with a strong central theme of gratitude and trust in God. The rhyme scheme is consistent and effective, and imagery like “storm clouds gather near” adds depth. You could enrich the originality with more unique metaphors and expand the imagery to create a stronger emotional impact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:34:56','2026-06-14 09:34:56'),(28812,'judge-event-evaluation-30408-1781394466',30408,641,24,24,7,2026,22,'064',NULL,9501,5805,7165,8,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,-10,-5.00,'Word count is important in a book report. OPEN CATEGORY must be 1000-1500. Great analysis, just need to make sure that you create a flow or progression of ideas. \r\nYou are a great story teller, use that to your advantage!\r\n\r\nThank you Gabriella.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:47:46','2026-06-14 09:47:46'),(28813,'judge-event-evaluation-30203-1781394872',30203,626,24,24,7,2026,169,'413',NULL,7356,5804,9613,13,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Work does not include a Bible message or verse.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:54:32','2026-06-29 09:21:32'),(28814,'judge-event-evaluation-30406-1781395002',30406,641,24,24,7,2026,22,'064',NULL,7147,5805,7165,8,'Open',NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Great work Sally! A good report on Booker. T. Washington\'s book. Many students find this Literature book challenging but you took up the challenge to write about him and his great work!\r\n\r\nThank you Sally',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 09:56:42','2026-06-14 09:56:42'),(28815,'judge-event-evaluation-30289-1781395316',30289,626,24,24,7,2026,169,'413',NULL,7360,5804,9613,13,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Image is very dark and with no biblical verse or message submitted.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 10:01:56','2026-06-29 09:22:24'),(28816,'judge-event-evaluation-30532-1781395817',30532,617,24,24,7,2026,177,'455',NULL,7267,5806,7165,2,'Open','13',100,71.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Narieta. However, in a MACRO photography, you must remember, you are revealing tiny details that are hidden in nature. So the bubbles must be razor sharp and they must stand out- if that is your subject. Your background, try and fade it more so that what you want MUST stand out and be visible.\r\n\r\nThank you for this. Have a great Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 10:10:17','2026-06-14 10:10:17'),(28817,'judge-event-evaluation-29695-1781396149',29695,607,24,24,7,2026,177,'455',NULL,7743,55,7165,2,'Open','13',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'I definitely agree with you Saanvi...a moment so beautiful that it needed to be captured! Great work on the \"razor-sharp\" details. However, be mindful of what you need to focus on...whether the butterfly or the flower is your main subject!\r\nThe contrast between the butterfly against the background is what stood out for me in your entry.\r\n\r\nThank you for this & have a great Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 10:15:49','2026-06-14 10:15:49'),(28818,'judge-event-evaluation-30956-1781396732',30956,623,24,24,7,2026,164,'405',NULL,7612,1404,7165,2,'Collection','13',100,71.00,-10,-10.00,'Jessica, this is a great effort. However, please be mindful of the guideline for size of your photography. It should be 8 x 10...yours was 16.6 x 7.7! Remember in photography, your presentation is important!\r\nI love the colour contrast between the rocks & the spider...nearly missed the spider!! \r\nAnother point to remember, in MACRO you are revealing those tiny details so your subject must be \"razor-sharp\" in contrast to the background. Keep working on improving your skills in Photography. \r\nThank you and all the best at Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 10:25:32','2026-06-14 10:25:32'),(28819,'judge-event-evaluation-30535-1781397426',30535,617,24,24,7,2026,164,'405',NULL,7812,5806,7165,2,'Collection','13',100,80.00,-10,-4.00,'Great effort Seini. However, you must remember that presentation is important in photography-that means the size of your photograph! The requirement is 8\" x 10\"! Yours was 13\" x 10\"! I loved how creative you were in capturing the water droplets in the dalo leaves! It tells me that you were waiting for that candid moment!\r\nJust make sure to use enhancements, more colour in your photos! And maybe blur more of the background!\r\n\r\nThank you for this & enjoy Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 10:37:06','2026-06-14 10:37:06'),(28820,'judge-event-evaluation-31050-1781398803',31050,623,24,24,7,2026,164,'405',NULL,9474,1404,7165,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,-4.00,'Great work Yechezkel. A reminder that presentation is important in Photography. Your size must be correct..8\" x 10\", yours was 11.7\" x 8.2\"! It must have been a cloudy and rainy day when you took this photograph, the trick is to enhance a little bit of your colour as well as your contrast! Keep working at your skills for photography!\r\n\r\nThank you for this & enjoy Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 11:00:03','2026-06-28 16:50:44'),(28822,'judge-event-evaluation-31498-1781402284',31498,639,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,7772,4678,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Amazing photo Abraham. Yes, I agree that your brother was a great subject for your Portraiture photography! I like the natural lighting and his pink shirt stood out in the shot!\r\nBe careful with your size criteria, it must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 13.4\" x 10)!\r\nKeep working at your photography skills.\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 11:58:04','2026-06-14 11:58:04'),(28823,'judge-event-evaluation-31520-1781402900',31520,639,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,8880,4678,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Awesome photograph Esther. I think Leah is a cute & amazing subject for your Portraiture photo! She\'s a baby so it must have taken you patience and love to make sure she gave her perfect smile!\r\nYou also followed the size criteria! The only thing to remember, try and blur the background so that your subject is the focus and not the wall and the scratch mark on the wall!\r\nI believe you can become a great photographer, keep enhancing your skills.\r\n\r\nThank you Esther & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:08:20','2026-06-14 12:08:20'),(28824,'judge-event-evaluation-31379-1781403334',31379,617,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,7260,5806,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,83.00,-10,-4.00,'Great photograph Jimaima. I love the colours & also your subject. You blurred the background and so that enhanced your subject!\r\nHowever, remember in a Portraiture, your subject MUST face the camera! Also a reminder for your size criteria, it must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 9.7\" x 15.6\")!\r\nOverall a great effort, keep working on your photography skills.\r\n\r\nThank you Jimaima & enjoy Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:15:34','2026-06-14 12:15:34'),(28825,'judge-event-evaluation-30980-1781403759',30980,623,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,9467,1404,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,75.00,-10,-5.00,'Good effort Josaia. I love that you chose your Mom as your subject. \r\nJust a reminder, your size criteria must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 22.2\" x 10.2\")! And the shadow in front of Mom, maybe next time choose a well lit space so that you don\'t have the shadow of your device showing up on your final photo!\r\nKeep working on your photography skills.\r\n\r\nThank you Josaia & enjoy Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:22:39','2026-06-14 12:22:39'),(28826,'judge-event-evaluation-30220-1781404231',30220,626,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,7356,5804,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,70.00,-10,-4.00,'Great effort Kalani. I love the energy in your photo & your sister is an amazing subject for your Portraiture photography!\r\nHowever, you must remember a few things, your enhancement & contrast must not be too much, your photo will be too exposed!\r\nAlso pay attention to the size criteria, it must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 11.5\" x 7.9\")! Keep working on your skills.\r\n\r\nThank you Kalani & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:30:31','2026-06-14 12:30:31'),(28827,'judge-event-evaluation-31505-1781404729',31505,639,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,8878,4678,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,82.00,-10,-5.00,'Great effort Salote. I love that you used your Mom as your subject. Yes she is the prettiest Mom!\r\nJust a few reminders, remember your size criteria, it must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 16.6\" x 20.8\")! I love the colours but remember Mom is the subject, you needed to blur the background so that only Mom\'s smiling face shines through!\r\nOverall, good try, keep working on your photography skills!\r\n\r\nThank you Salote & enjoy Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:38:49','2026-06-14 12:38:49'),(28828,'judge-event-evaluation-30238-1781404962',30238,626,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,9382,5804,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good try, Mosese!\r\nKeep practicing.\r\nPractise makes perfect!!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:42:42','2026-06-29 09:55:49'),(28829,'judge-event-evaluation-31056-1781405364',31056,623,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,9471,1404,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,66.00,-10,-4.00,'Great effort Tevita. I like that you chose this subject. However, in Portraiture, you should have your subject facing the camera! Also you need to enhance your photo, make it straight & blur the background so that only your subject stands out! You need to be mindful of the size criteria, it must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 11.7\" x 8.2\")!\r\nKeep working on your photography skills!\r\n\r\nThank you Tevita & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-14 12:49:24','2026-06-14 12:49:24'),(28830,'judge-event-evaluation-31302-1781469308',31302,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7556,4208,9608,2,'Collection','10',100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Appreciated all the great effort you have shown in getting this image captured. The picture portrayed the greatness of our Creator. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 06:35:08','2026-06-15 06:35:08'),(28831,'judge-event-evaluation-31046-1781470566',31046,623,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,9466,1404,9608,2,'Collection','10',100,99.00,-10,NULL