NULL,'Your poem is devotional and encouraging, with a strong refrain that reinforces the central theme of God’s faithfulness. While some phrases are familiar, the repeated invocation of “The God of Abraham” gives the poem individuality and strength. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 10:24:13','2026-06-15 10:24:13'),(28836,'judge-event-evaluation-30019-1781483235',30019,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9371,5804,9600,6,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'The emotional sincerity and creativity of your poem stand out, though rhythm and originality could be refined for stronger poetic impact.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 10:27:15','2026-06-15 10:27:15'),(28838,'judge-event-evaluation-29826-1781491922',29826,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8847,55,8703,2,'Open','11',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Zixin, for your effort. This is a beautiful photo and demonstrates skill in capturing the subject. \r\nFor future reference, please review the Convention guidelines carefully. \r\nAvoid unnecessary clutter in the frame, focus on the main image, and ensure the photo highlights the subject without distractions from surrounding elements such as side dishes.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 12:52:02','2026-06-15 12:52:02'),(28839,'judge-event-evaluation-29698-1781492602',29698,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7741,55,8703,2,'Open','11',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Yeonhee, for your effort. This is indeed a beautiful picture and reflects skill in capturing the subject. \r\nFor future reference, please review the Convention guidelines carefully. When taking a photo, ensure that the entire frame is captured so that the plate is fully included. In this photo, parts of the plate have been cut off, which should also have been included in the composition. Additionally, avoid unnecessary distractions in the background so that the main subject remains clear and prominent.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 13:03:22','2026-06-15 13:03:22'),(28840,'judge-event-evaluation-29806-1781493180',29806,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8848,55,8703,2,'Open','11',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Haoqian, for your effort. This is a lovely photo and reflects skill in capturing the subject. \r\nFor future reference, please review the Convention guidelines carefully. \r\nYour focus and composition are satisfactory; however, please avoid unnecessary distractions in the background so that the main subject remains clear and prominent.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 13:13:00','2026-06-15 13:13:00'),(28841,'judge-event-evaluation-29095-1781494247',29095,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7668,55,8703,2,'Open','11',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Dohun, for your effort. \r\nThis is a beautiful and creative photo that demonstrates strong artistic vision.\r\nContinue to utilize and refine your photography skills, as they show promise and creativity.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 13:30:47','2026-06-15 13:30:47'),(28842,'judge-event-evaluation-29325-1781494673',29325,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8868,55,8703,2,'Open','11',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Joshua, for your effort. This is a lovely picture and reflects creativity in capturing the subject. \r\nFor future reference, please review the Convention guidelines carefully. Since it can be difficult to bring a large spread of food into sharp focus, consider selecting a smaller portion—such as a bun or two with its decorations—and making that the focal point of your photo. This approach will help ensure clarity and highlight the intended subject without distractions.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 13:37:53','2026-06-15 13:37:53'),(28843,'judge-event-evaluation-31103-1781496534',31103,607,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,7727,55,9612,2,'Open','7',100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Try to focus on the subject and avoid any distractions behind and around the scene. \r\nGod bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 14:08:54','2026-06-15 14:08:54'),(28844,'judge-event-evaluation-30523-1781497483',30523,617,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,7249,5806,9612,2,'Open','7',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. In the future try to adjust your position so that the subject taken sits in the middle of the frame. God bless you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 14:24:43','2026-06-15 14:24:43'),(28845,'judge-event-evaluation-31279-1781497800',31279,642,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,9521,4208,9612,2,'Open','7',100,72.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Next time when taking a picture try to crop out distractions behind and also on the sides of the frame. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 14:30:00','2026-06-15 14:30:00'),(28847,'judge-event-evaluation-31372-1781498565',31372,642,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,7181,4208,9612,2,'Open','7',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. In the future try to take the picture where the subjects eyes or dominant facial features sit in the frame. There is still room for improvement. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 14:42:45','2026-06-15 14:42:45'),(28848,'judge-event-evaluation-30986-1781498705',30986,607,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,8867,55,9612,2,'Open','7',100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Next time eliminate all the distractions around the main subject.\r\nGod bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 14:45:05','2026-06-15 14:45:05'),(28849,'judge-event-evaluation-29654-1781499780',29654,607,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,9366,55,9612,2,'Open','7',100,62.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Next time always check your rule of thirds and the composition of your picture.\r\nGod bless you , still room for improvement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 15:03:00','2026-06-15 15:03:00'),(28850,'judge-event-evaluation-30534-1781500374',30534,617,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,7267,5806,9612,2,'Open','7',100,50.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Next time , focus on the composition of the subject and the distraction around it in order to gain more points. There is still room for improvement in the future. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 15:12:54','2026-06-15 15:12:54'),(28851,'judge-event-evaluation-31407-1781500832',31407,642,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,8717,4208,9612,2,'Open','7',100,52.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Make sure to look out for the composition of your subject and the rule of thirds. Most importantly the guidelines of taking a portrait picture. There is still room for improvement. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 15:20:32','2026-06-15 15:20:32'),(28852,'judge-event-evaluation-30527-1781501385',30527,617,24,24,7,2026,172,'450',NULL,7252,5806,9612,2,'Open','7',100,54.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. Be careful to always check the depth of field, the composition of the subject and the rule of thirds. There is no harm , in going back to the guidelines. Still room for improvement. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 15:29:45','2026-06-15 15:29:45'),(28853,'judge-event-evaluation-30544-1781505114',30544,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','3',0,5805,7789,4,'Open','20',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Very nicely presented\r\nI love the Greek theme you designed with\r\nKeep it up',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:31:54','2026-06-15 16:31:55'),(28854,'judge-event-evaluation-29940-1781505231',29940,626,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,9371,5804,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'This was a brave attempt at capturing lightning bolt, Perez. Well done.\r\nTo give a sense of visual and scale, don\'t just focus on the bolt, but try to include the surrounding (trees, mountains, etc)\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:33:51','2026-06-29 09:57:35'),(28855,'judge-event-evaluation-31250-1781505515',31250,642,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,8712,4208,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'You have managed to capture an unusual colored hibiscus. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:38:35','2026-06-15 16:38:35'),(28856,'judge-event-evaluation-30487-1781505757',30487,617,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,5806,7789,4,'Open','20',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'An interesting topic that is very nicely presented !\r\nJust slight errors here and there , and a few inconsistencies in the spacing and transitions( notably the list of planes at beginning , running into each other)\r\nFlawless otherwise !\r\nVinaka Mavericks, keep it up !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:42:37','2026-06-15 16:42:37'),(28857,'judge-event-evaluation-31162-1781506268',31162,623,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,9464,1404,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful shot, Rock.\r\nKeep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:51:08','2026-06-29 09:57:45'),(28858,'judge-event-evaluation-30546-1781506397',30546,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,5805,7789,4,'Open','20',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Wow , amazing presentation ! I love history , and this was a real brain thriller.\r\nJust a thought on design: \r\nWhilst it was amazing and eye catching on every page, one thing I\'ve learnt is that sometimes , \"less is more\".\r\nIt can get overwhelming when every page is filled with so many facts , and so many different images and backgrounds.Having some \' blank space \'  can allow the reader to feel the impact of your presentation even more.\r\nJust something to keep in mind \r\nKeep up the good work !\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:53:17','2026-06-15 16:53:17'),(28859,'judge-event-evaluation-31509-1781506616',31509,639,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,7774,4678,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,70.00,-10,-3.00,'A good effort Vincent. A great portrait of your Dad. Just remember, in this category, you need to have your subject a bit closer to your camera! Also use the natural light outside, instead of inside so that it avoids the shadows behind your Dad!\r\nAlways remember your size criteria, it MUST be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 16.6\" x 9.3\"). Keep working at your photography skills.\r\n\r\nThank you for your photo & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-15 16:56:56','2026-06-15 16:56:57'),(28860,'judge-event-evaluation-30545-1781506707',30545,6