224,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8761,5804,7240,2,'Collection','5,9',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, be mindful of any distracting items in the foreground and background (roof and shed/trees). Don\'t be afraid to play around with different angles. Maybe add a few more details to how you captured the photo. Keep improving and hope see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 15:38:00','2026-06-16 15:38:00'),(29041,'judge-event-evaluation-30221-1781588369',30221,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7356,5804,7240,2,'Collection','5,9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely photo, thank you. Make sure to check for orientation (landscape/portrait).',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 15:39:29','2026-06-16 15:39:29'),(29042,'judge-event-evaluation-30303-1781588758',30303,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8763,5804,7240,2,'Collection','5,10',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, balance the composition a bit more, be mindful of the focus (it doesn\'t blur the closer you look), as well as anything that may distract from the subject (power line). And details on how you came to take the photograph. Keep improving and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 15:45:58','2026-06-16 15:45:58'),(29043,'judge-event-evaluation-30192-1781589185',30192,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8758,5804,7240,2,'Collection','5,9',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo. Just a few tips, be mindful of the composition (car almost cut at the back), taking photos at night can be difficult so color, lighting and focus are important to keep an eye on. Maybe a similar photo taken in monochromatic could help really bring out the white car in the night. Add a few more details on how you came to capture the photograph. Keep improving and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 15:53:05','2026-06-16 15:53:05'),(29044,'judge-event-evaluation-30241-1781589218',30241,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7658,55,9612,2,'Open','8',100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort you put in to complete this event. When taking pictures please ensure that the subject is focal and there are no distractions around the subject. There is still room for improvement. God bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 15:53:38','2026-06-16 15:53:38'),(29045,'judge-event-evaluation-30198-1781590910',30198,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9372,5804,7240,2,'Collection','9',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo. I\'m not sure how you would be able to get a photo like this without making edits, as the center of the photo has color, while the around it everything is monochromatic. It is a nice photo regardless, just be mindful of anything that may draw attention away from the subject. Keep improving and hope to see more',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-16 16:21:50','2026-06-16 16:21:50'),(29046,'judge-event-evaluation-29668-1781591046',29668,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7799,55,9612,2,'Open','8',100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the effort put in to complete this event. When taking pictures try to avoid distra