ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 19:01:53','2026-06-17 19:01:53'),(29143,'judge-event-evaluation-31416-1781687443',31416,642,24,24,7,2026,21,'063',NULL,7186,4208,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,-5.00,'Great story Litiana. I love the message, and you are great at story-telling too. However, as an OPEN competitor, you need to make sure you have 1000 words. Also remember, it has to be \'double-spaced\' between lines!\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 19:10:43','2026-06-29 08:50:29'),(29144,'judge-event-evaluation-31416-1781687644',31416,642,24,24,7,2026,21,'063',NULL,7186,4208,7165,7,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,-5.00,'Great story Litiana. I love the message in your story. And it has so much application on how we see ourselves!\r\n\r\nJust a reminder, word count should be 1000 words & your story must be \'double-spaced\'\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 19:14:04','2026-06-29 08:50:29'),(29147,'judge-event-evaluation-30358-1781688513',30358,626,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,9384,5804,7165,7,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,0.00,'Great story Frances. However, you need to check that your work is neat! I did not see that in your story. There was no paragraph, using indents as well as \'double-spaced\'!!\r\n\r\nKeep improving your skills.\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 19:28:33','2026-06-17 19:28:33'),(29148,'judge-event-evaluation-30200-1781689324',30200,626,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,8762,5804,7165,7,'Collection',NULL,100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Great story Imanuela. Just a few things to remember, grammar is important to check thoroughly! \r\nKeep working on your writing!\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 19:42:04','2026-06-17 19:42:04'),(29149,'judge-event-evaluation-30201-1781690614',30201,626,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,7356,5804,7165,7,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Kalani. Just be careful with grammar & always put your word count!\r\nI enjoyed your story very much.\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:03:34','2026-06-17 20:03:34'),(29150,'judge-event-evaluation-30229-1781691038',30229,626,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,8755,5804,7165,7,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'I absolutely loved your story Shiloh. What a great message within this story, YES we do stray from His love but He never leaves us alone.\r\n\r\nThank you for this heart-warming story.\r\n\r\nEnjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:10:38','2026-06-17 20:10:38'),(29151,'judge-event-evaluation-31519-1781691410',31519,639,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,8880,4678,9549,2,'Collection','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'A beautifully executed close-up of a pink ginger bloom. You demonstrate excellent control of focus, exposure, and composition, producing a natural yet vivid image that captures the flower’s elegance and tropical vibrancy.\r\nWell done, Esther!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:16:50','2026-06-17 20:16:50'),(29152,'judge-event-evaluation-31499-1781691483',31499,639,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,7772,4678,9549,2,'Collection','8',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great shot, Abraham!\r\nA technically refined and visually captivating orchid portrait. You demonstrate strong control of focus, exposure, and composition, producing a natural yet striking image that stands out for its clarity and color harmony.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:18:03','2026-06-17 20:18:03'),(29153,'judge-event-evaluation-31512-1781692140',31512,639,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,7774,4678,9549,2,'Collection','8',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful portrait picture of your cat, Vincent.\r\nTry a slightly lower angle to emphasize the cat’s stature and make eye contact more engaging. Watch for overexposed highlights on white fur — soft morning or evening light helps balance contrast. Ensure the background foliage doesn’t distract; blur is good but avoid bright patches that pull attention away. A cleaner backdrop (single pot or wall) could make the cat stand out even more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:29:00','2026-06-17 20:29:00'),(29154,'judge-event-evaluation-29828-1781692406',29828,607,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9355,55,7165,6,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort Akosita. \r\nRemember meter, rhythm & rhyme must be consistent throughout your poem.\r\n\r\nI love the theme of your poem.\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:33:26','2026-06-17 20:33:26'),(29155,'judge-event-evaluation-30309-1781693079',30309,607,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8845,55,7165,6,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort Eta.\r\nBe careful with your meter & rhythm...rhyme is good!\r\n\r\nMake your poems longer, they are really good. Keep working on more poetry!\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:44:39','2026-06-17 20:44:39'),(29156,'judge-event-evaluation-31504-1781693568',31504,639,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,8878,4678,9549,2,'Collection','8',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A vivid and precise captured shot on automatic settings. Automatic focus can achieve sharpness and clarity in well‑lit, centered compositions. However, selecting the focus point manually ensures the subject’s eyes or bloom center remain the sharpest element, strengthening technical control and overall impact.\r\nLastly, the embedded device tag does not match the claimed Samsung A11 origin, indicating a documentation inconsistency.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-17 20:52:48','2026-06-17 20:52:48'),(29157,'judge-event-evaluation-30181-1781693578',30181,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9379,5804,7165,6,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,0.00,'Good effort Alayna. \r\nRemember to use \'figures of speech\" so that your poem\r\nhas more impact on the reader.\r\n\r\nThank you & enjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,