d phrasing (eg. line 3)which disrupts the flow of the poem but overall, you did great.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 10:09:31','2026-06-20 10:09:32'),(29273,'judge-event-evaluation-31376-1781915775',31376,642,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9520,4208,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A great poem Kinisimere. Your theme of God\'s daily presence and protection is consistent throughout your poem. You have a clear rhyme scheme and your use of poetic devices is good. To make your poem even better you could add more varied imagery to prevent monotony and may be consider incorporating more specific, concrete details to show rather than tell.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 10:36:15','2026-06-20 10:36:15'),(29274,'judge-event-evaluation-30691-1781916857',30691,641,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9501,5805,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'A creative way to document a biblical narrative of Moses\' journey. Your poem has a consistent structure and form and you have an effective use of religious imagery and symbolism. Good Job Gabriella!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 10:54:17','2026-06-20 10:54:17'),(29275,'judge-event-evaluation-31053-1781920721',31053,623,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7221,1404,9545,2,'Open','10',100,60.00,-10,NULL,'Good try, Eloni.\r\nKeep practicing and better luck next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 11:58:41','2026-06-20 11:58:41'),(29277,'judge-event-evaluation-31237-1781922970',31237,623,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9472,1404,9545,2,'Open','10',100,93.00,-10,NULL,' Well done, Tiatiana.\r\nThis is a striking photograph that effectively uses natural light and silhouette to capture a warm sunset evening. \r\nIn terms of Originality and Creativity, we get a lot of entries that is similar to yours.\r\nI would encourage students to capture something unique but appropriate to this category.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 12:36:10','2026-06-20 12:36:10'),(29278,'judge-event-evaluation-30551-1781923802',30551,641,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7143,5805,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'The theme of faith in God\'s plan is effectively communicated in the poem. The moral at the end ties the narrative in the poem very nicely. One area to really make your poem stand out is that the rhyme and meter scheme needs more consistency. Fantastic writing Jordan!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 12:50:02','2026-06-20 12:50:02'),(29279,'judge-event-evaluation-30904-1781923999',30904,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9521,4208,9545,2,'Open','10',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Gideon.\r\nI wonder how this would look if you revisit this alleyway either during sunrise or sunset.\r\nAlso, perhaps add just a little contrast and clarity to make your picture capture the audience.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 12:53:19','2026-06-20 12:53:19'),(29280,'judge-event-evaluation-31192-1781924919',31192,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9519,4208,9545,2,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Very impressive, Ivanah, well done!\r\nFew things that would be great.\r\n1. Probably try this at \"golden hour\". It\'s giving a silhouette and dark highlight.\r\n2. Just a bit of clarity to the mountains for detail.\r\n3. Perhaps you could brighten the 2 figures on the beach.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 13:08:39','2026-06-20 13:08:39'),(29281,'judge-event-evaluation-30690-1781925990',30690,641,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7145,5805,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You for the poem Kaleb. Your use of \"figures of speech\" in this poem is good. The progression from writer\'s block to creative flow is relatable. A few pointers to note, be thorough when checking your work of spelling, punctuation and choice of words to make your work more precise and effective. \r\nGood Job and keep striving.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 13:26:30','2026-06-20 13:26:30'),(29282,'judge-event-evaluation-31387-1781926017',31387,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7181,4208,9545,2,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Josaia.\r\nTo keep it short, the sky dominates the frame, which is a good thing. However, perhaps a wider crop would somehow give balance to the foreground and sky more evenly.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 13:26:57','2026-06-20 13:26:57'),(29283,'judge-event-evaluation-31500-1781926814',31500,641,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7147,5805,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Sally! Does your poem have a title? Anyway, very effective imagery being used throughout your poem. I like the way you have a clear thematic progression from darkness to light in your poem. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 13:40:14','2026-06-20 13:40:14'),(29284,'judge-event-evaluation-31382-1781927133',31382,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9520,4208,9545,2,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Kinisimere.\r\n1. It seems too much on the vertical. Crop for balance, add width.\r\n2. Perhaps you could experiment with highlights to focus on the fading sun and its reflection.\r\nThe inclusion of tire marks is creative and well thought of.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 13:45:33','2026-06-20 13:45:33'),(29285,'judge-event-evaluation-31470-1781927678',31470,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8716,4208,9545,2,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Well done. There\'s a great balance to this photograph.\r\nProbably, a gentle lift in shadows to give just a bit of light in the foreground, would make a great difference.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 13:54:38','2026-06-20 13:54:38'),(29286,'judge-event-evaluation-30482-1781928662',30482,617,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7819,5806,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'A lovely poem of your mother filled with raw emotions. The structure of the poem is well balanced and easy to follow. A few areas to take note of next time, be sure to have consistency in the rhythm and meter scheme as this will affect the flow of your poem. Also try enhancing some metaphors with more original imagery. \r\nGood Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 14:11:02','2026-06-20 14:11:02'),(29287,'judge-event-evaluation-31123-1781930050',31123,623,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7215,1404,9545,2,'Open','10',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'That\'s beautiful caption, Seko. Few adjustments would be:\r\n1. Increase contrast slightly(we should be able to see difference between dark and bright highlights)\r\n2. Probably add boat or palm tree in the foreground, would make it a more natural and relatable capture.\r\nVinaka\r\n\r\n\r\nVinaka.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 14:34:10','2026-06-20 14:34:10'),(29289,'judge-event-evaluation-30530-1781941507',30530,617,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8770,5806,9602,2,'Open','10',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Peniasi! Well done with Scape. Looking forward to seeing your photography skills grow, keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 17:45:07','2026-06-20 17:45:07'),(29290,'judge-event-evaluation-30541-1781941532',30541,617,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8792,5806,9602,2,'Open','10',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Sylvia! Well done in capturing a beautiful photo. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 17:45:32','2026-06-20 17:45:32'),(29301,'judge-event-evaluation-31387-1781945805',31387,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7181,4208,9602,2,'Collection','10',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Josaia! Continue to work on enhancing your photography skills. Good bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 18:56:45','2026-06-20 18:56:45'),(29303,'judge-event-evaluation-29811-1781950460',29811,607,24,24,7,2026,165,'406',NULL,7675,55,NULL,2,'Collection','11',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, but it feels less like a still life  since the indoor table setting elements like cuttlery and tissues are missing from the scene. The overexposure on the white table surface needs to be lowered to be prevent losing texture detail. Nevertheless, great photo.\r\n\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 20:14:20','2026-06-20 20:14:20'),(29304,'judge-event-evaluation-29811-1781950905',29811,607,24,24,7,2026,165,'406',NULL,7675,55,9603,2,'Collection','11',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'Great photo, but it feels less like a still life since the indoor table setting elements like cuttleries, table mat and tissues are missing from the scene. The overexposure on the white table surface needs to be lowered to prevent losing texture detail. Nevertheless, great effort.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 20:21:45','2026-06-20 20:21:45'),(29305,'judge-event-evaluation-31266-1781952564',31266,607,24,24,7,2026,165,'406',NULL,8826,55,9603,2,'Collection','11',100,64.00,-10,NULL,'   The bright cardboard debris and chaotic stray branches on the right create a massive visual distractions that evokes warmth and camping memories while the visible garbage dampens the cozy atmosphere. A lower straight on eye level angle is