ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 23:38:36','2026-06-20 23:38:36'),(29330,'judge-event-evaluation-31504-1781963098',31504,639,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,8878,4678,9603,2,'Collection','8',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful photo! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 23:44:58','2026-06-20 23:44:58'),(29331,'judge-event-evaluation-31512-1781963428',31512,639,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,7774,4678,9603,2,'Collection','8',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Good job! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-20 23:50:28','2026-06-20 23:50:28'),(29332,'judge-event-evaluation-30319-1782007854',30319,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7650,55,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You for your poem Manav. Your use of poetic devices such as the figures of speech in your poem really creates images of night time atmosphere. Lots of imagery in this piece. Good Job Manav.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 12:10:54','2026-06-21 12:10:54'),(29333,'judge-event-evaluation-30214-1782008611',30214,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7737,55,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You Patty for your beautiful poem. The theme of prayer is conveyed clearly and the simple language used makes the poem relatable to a wide audience. Just a note, your conclusion feels abrupt; a stronger final thought would make more impact.\r\nGood Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 12:23:31','2026-06-21 12:23:31'),(29334,'judge-event-evaluation-30846-1782009576',30846,623,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9472,1404,9611,6,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great poem showing good cosmic imagery, which creates a sense of wonder. I can also pick out effective use of alliteration in some lines. A few pointers to take note of, try to refine your rhyme scheme and also strengthen meter consistency. Your choice of words, will affect the rhyme and meter of your poem.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 12:39:36','2026-06-21 12:39:36'),(29336,'judge-event-evaluation-29805-1782012163',29805,607,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8848,55,NULL,2,'Open','10',100,99.00,-10,NULL,'Wow!!The dramatic sky with calm waters and boat is so creative and timing was perfect. Well done!\r\n However, because your report just describes the picture, and not how you took this photo, it makes me wonder how much editing was done to this photo, which I hope wasn\'t much.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 13:22:43','2026-06-21 13:22:43'),(29337,'judge-event-evaluation-31388-1782012640',31388,642,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7181,4208,7314,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Josiah,\r\nThank you for your entry.  I can see how this would be a subject that would appeal to you and many other young men.  When your camera setting is on manual you need to make sure that you tell us all of your settings, I did note that you had put the light meter down as 45, well done!  Your focus is a little off but I can see that there are leading lines to the vehicles and law of thirds does apply.  Great effort.  Keep on taking photos and have a play with some of the enhancements your camera has to offer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 13:30:40','2026-06-21 13:30:40'),(29338,'judge-event-evaluation-29820-1782012920',29820,607,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9352,55,9545,2,'Open','10',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo!\r\nA little more detail in your report (Where it was taken, time, etc) would add more weight to your entry.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 13:35:20','2026-06-21 13:35:20'),(29339,'judge-event-evaluation-31370-1782015099',31370,642,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,9520,4208,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Cropping was definitely an asset to this picture as it shows the repetitiveness of the lines of the buildings as well as gets rid of distractions from the subject for example the car and the road.  On the original photo the focus was more on the back of the car in front of the car you shot from.  A better shot would have been gained by stopping the car and getting out, positioning yourself to get any leading lines in and obey the law of thirds. Shooting through the glass of a car window is never a good idea.  Could you have wound the window down if you could not stop and get out?  You do have an eye for structure so keep looking for the perfect shot.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 14:11:39','2026-06-21 14:11:39'),(29346,'judge-event-evaluation-31471-1782019879',31471,642,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,8716,4208,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Peijing this ice sculpture definitely would have been truly breath taking.  The light behind the building in the sky was very pretty but probably did not enhance the ice sculpture as it was behind it and the sun had gone right down throwing the ice sculpture into shadow.  Perhaps a little earlier when the sun was a little higher would have shown the sculpture off at its best.  Could you have got closer?  Ice is not always an easy subject to photograph and sometimes the ice does not come out crisp and sharp.  There are some great tips given on the internet one being perhaps using HD as well as paying particular attention to light.  Also do put in the model and make of your camera.  Keep on taking photos.  Remember structure can also be close ups as well.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 15:31:19','2026-06-21 15:31:19'),(29348,'judge-event-evaluation-31481-1782021068',31481,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9525,4208,7167,12,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Julia! Remember all posters are to be A3 in size. Also be careful as there is a slot provided for your signature and date. These small details are important. However, This is a beautiful message and it matches the picture. Good job and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 15:51:08','2026-06-21 15:51:08'),(29349,'judge-event-evaluation-31280-1782021261',31280,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7559,4208,7167,12,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Mosese! Remember, all posters are to be A3 size. Also, there is a given place for your signature and date on the report. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 15:54:21','2026-06-21 15:54:21'),(29350,'judge-event-evaluation-31399-1782022404',31399,642,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,8717,4208,NULL,2,'Open','5,9',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'This could have easily fitted into the category \'scapes\' as well.  I loved the trees in your original rising high above the man-made structure, it gives a sense of power and magnificence.   I can understand why you used the cropping tool to focus in on your structure \"the white house\" for this entry so that it better suited the category.  Don\'t forget to write down your steps when you edited as I do not know if you made any other changes.  The image is pixilated. Perhaps if you were focusing on the structure, it would be better to get up close for a clear shot. with your camera rather than taking a whole shot of the coastline and bush line as well.  Keep on clicking you have a beautiful scenery shot.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 16:13:24','2026-06-21 16:13:24'),(29351,'judge-event-evaluation-31399-1782022947',31399,642,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,8717,4208,7314,2,'Collection','5,9',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo.  I love the original that shows the dominance of the bush background dwarfing the little white house.  This would have made a great scenic shot.  Remember when you are using enhancements like cropping to record it on your report.   Your cropped picture shows some pixilation.  Could you have got closer to your subject?  You have a good eye for what looks good.  Your photo had a good composition.  Keep taking photos.  Work on close ups of structures as well if this is an area that interests you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 16:22:27','2026-06-21 16:22:27'),(29352,'judge-event-evaluation-31256-1782023397',31256,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8712,4208,7167,12,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you for your work Qutololove! Beautiful message and beautiful picture. Make sure your poster is A3 in size. All the beyst in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 16:29:57','2026-06-21 16:29:57'),(29353,'judge-event-evaluation-29655-1782023475',29655,607,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9366,55,9545,2,'Open','10',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Great caption, Lydia!\r\nPerhaps, increase a bit of contrast to make mountains & clouds come alive. Also, I think around sunset/sunrise (golden hour) would really change the dynamics of this photo.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 16:31:15','2026-06-21 16:31:15'),(29354,'judge-event-evaluation-30528-1782025118',30528,617,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7252,5806,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Tubutubu thank you for entering your photo.  You have a chosen a good subject for your structure.  This is a very clear shot.  There is a little bit of distracting light on the left-hand side. This is a lens flare probably caused by the sun on your lense. This type of narrow beam is common when sunlight strikes the lens at a particular angle and reflects internally. I encourage you to take photos and play around with the editing tools to see what they can and can\'t do. Such a clear, crisp shot! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 16:58:38','2026-06-21 16:58:38'),(29355,'judge-event-evaluation-30315-1782025545',30315,607,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7675,55,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You Jennifer for your poem. You have a good use of contrast between peaceful and threatening imagery in your poem. The structure of your poem is good and so is the use of poetic devices.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 17:05:45','2026-06-21 17:05:45'),(29356,'judge-event-evaluation-30195-1782025774',30195,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8765,5804,7167,12,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Gemma! Remember that all posters are to be A3 in size. However, thank you for the message and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 17:09:34','2026-06-21 17:09:34'),(29357,'judge-event-evaluation-29694-1782026050',29694,607,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7743,55,9545,2,'Open','10',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'That\'s a beautiful field of purple flowers! And you did an awesome job  to capture it in a frame.\r\nPerhaps, you could pull away slightly to include a little more of the sky, this would give more balance and complete this photograph.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 17:14:10','2026-06-21 17:14:10'),(29358,'judge-event-evaluation-30182-1782026106',30182,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9380,5804,7167,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Grace! Good try but the size of the poster needs to be A3, it has to be your own work, and your needs to be filled with the process you took in completing the poster. All the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 17:15:06','2026-06-29 08:54:03'),(29359,'judge-event-evaluation-29828-1782026242',29828,607,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9355,55,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You Akosita for your poem. Some powerful imagery used in your poem. Just be careful of grammar as there are one or two awkward phrases used in this piece. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 17:17:22','2026-06-21 17:17:22'),(29371,'judge-event-evaluation-29665-1782028689',29665,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7731,55,7839,2,'Open','8',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'This picture seems to be taken from the net . Please you need to submit your own work Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 17:58:09','2026-06-21 17:58:09'),(29373,'judge-event-evaluation-30531-1782028917',30531,617,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,8770,5806,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Peniasi, so nice to view the photo you have taken.  It has good strong leading lines in it.  Your focus is not totally clear though and it is hard to depict the focal point.  I think it is about where the green building on the left hand side of the photo is.  Your subject matter is a good choice.  I see that you have edited the final photo, but you have not told me the steps you took on your report form.  You did however tell me where you were standing when you took the photo, which is a good choice of viewing point.  Next time record what you did to brighten your photo! From what I can see you have straightened your photo and brightened it, so congratulation on using your editing tools appropriately. There are structures in this picture e.g buildings.  Would it be more a city scape?',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 18:01:57','2026-06-21 18:01:57'),(29378,'judge-event-evaluation-30390-1782030251',30390,641,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9498,5805,7167,12,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Immanuel! Your picture does match the Bible verse and adds effect to its meaning. well done and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 18:24:11','2026-06-21 18:24:11'),(29380,'judge-event-evaluation-30911-1782030888',30911,623,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7610,1404,7167,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Matthew! Kindly note that you have to find a photo and a Bible verse and put them together. The photo should illustrate the Biblical message and your poster should be A3 size. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 18:34:48','2026-06-29 11:42:43'),(29386,'judge-event-evaluation-30989-1782032287',30989,607,24,24,7,2026,19,'061',NULL,7669,55,7166,5,NULL,NULL,100,53.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Christine.\r\nGood effort with your persuasive essay. Thank you for promoting peace rather than war and violence. The essay was well written but it lacked a \"oh wow\" or \"I didn\'t think of it like that\" effect. A persuasive essay must be forceful.  It must cause the reader to choose a position because the essay argued with facts, illustrations or real world examples. However good work with grammar, spelling and punctuation. Read more persuasive essays to sharpen your writing skills.  Thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 18:58:07','2026-06-21 18:58:07'),(29387,'judge-event-evaluation-29693-1782032432',29693,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7743,55,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'This is a wonderful, bright photo that shows the beautiful colors of nature. The warm afternoon sunlight makes the whole scene feel cozy and inviting. With a little more practice on keeping the main flower perfectly sharp and framing the shot, you will make even better photos!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 19:00:32','2026-06-21 19:00:32'),(29391,'judge-event-evaluation-31289-1782034387',31289,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8710,4208,7167,12,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Tong Xinning! Kindly note that the required size of a poster should be A3. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 19:33:07','2026-06-21 19:33:07'),(29394,'judge-event-evaluation-31288-1782035235',31288,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8709,4208,7167,12,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Shekinah! Poster size should be A3 and be careful with your main message. Every letter count, so check your spelling before submission. The picture should match the message and adds value to it. Vinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 19:47:15','2026-06-21 19:47:15'),(29395,'judge-event-evaluation-31287-1782035305',31287,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8709,4208,7167,12,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Shekinah! You have uploaded the same poster twice. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 19:48:25','2026-06-21 19:48:25'),(29396,'judge-event-evaluation-30405-1782035797',30405,641,24,24,7,2026,19,'061',NULL,7147,5805,7166,5,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Sally. Thank you for writing about success from God\'s point of view. It is an interesting essay but it could have have been longer if it had more evidence such as examples or facts to strengthen the argument.  Keep reading and writing to sharpen your skills. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 19:56:37','2026-06-21 19:56:37'),(29397,'judge-event-evaluation-31319-1782037325',31319,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7204,4208,7167,12,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Yuvan! Kindly remember that Poster size should be A3. All the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 20:22:05','2026-06-21 20:22:05'),(29398,'judge-event-evaluation-30521-1782037406',30521,617,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7256,5806,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,' You did a great job keeping the image sharp and clear instead of blurry or grainy. Beautiful and unique .Great work ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,