ULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 20:47:54','2026-06-21 20:47:54'),(29424,'judge-event-evaluation-30249-1782039095',30249,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7650,55,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This is a beautiful photo that shows the bright colors of nature. The mix of soft pink flowers and green leaves looks great. Excellent work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 20:51:35','2026-06-21 20:51:35'),(29425,'judge-event-evaluation-29682-1782039410',29682,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,8882,55,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'The dog is a great subject. The photo clearly captures the emotion and expression in its eyes and face.It can look more interesting if you place the dog slightly to one side, giving it room to \"look into\" the empty space. Great work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 20:56:50','2026-06-21 20:56:50'),(29426,'judge-event-evaluation-29653-1782039624',29653,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,9366,55,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A great shot that captures the beautiful flower,Good job',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 21:00:24','2026-06-21 21:00:24'),(29429,'judge-event-evaluation-31263-1782039765',31263,607,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,8838,55,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort in taking this beautiful shot .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-21 21:02:45','2026-06-21 21:02:45'),(29432,'judge-event-evaluation-30226-1782060417',30226,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,8866,55,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Gayeon. Thank you for your poem. The poem clearly reflected the idea of God\'s peace in difficult times. However when writing poetry keep these in mind: uniqueness, memorable imagery and a lasting impression on the reader. It is also a good idea to check the judges\' evaluation form as a guide. Keep practising. This is a great start.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 02:46:57','2026-06-22 02:46:57'),(29433,'judge-event-evaluation-30212-1782064187',30212,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9364,55,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Almirah. Thank you for your entry. This was a good start to poetry writing. Remember to check the judge\'s evaluation criteria before and during writing your poem as a guide. I like the enthusiasm in your writing more than your choice of topic. Keep reading and practising to sharpen your talent.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 03:49:47','2026-06-22 03:49:47'),(29434,'judge-event-evaluation-30319-1782065803',30319,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7650,55,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Manav. Thank you for your entry for poetry writing. I like the imagery and figures of speech in the poem. A longer poem to develop your midnight thoughts would have made it unique and memorable. Remember to use the judges evaluation criteria as a guide. Keep reading and practising your interest in writing. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 04:16:43','2026-06-22 04:16:43'),(29437,'judge-event-evaluation-30530-1782069934',30530,617,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8770,5806,9545,2,'Open','10',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'This is stunning, revealing a typical Fiji evening!\r\nWell done, Peniasi.  Perhaps a slight lift in the shadows would reveal more texture on trees, without loosing silhouette effect,\r\nVinaka.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:25:34','2026-06-22 05:25:34'),(29438,'judge-event-evaluation-30541-1782071227',30541,617,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8792,5806,9545,2,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Wow!!Thank you for this beautiful caption, Sylvia!\r\nJust a few adjustments that would elevate this photo.\r\n1. Slightly reduce highlights in the brightest clouds.\r\n2.Slight lift in the dark areas to reveal texture in the silhouette.\r\n3. Because of the dark width, there is a lack of balance in this frame, so avoid clipping sides, and also slight lift on the dark sides as well.\r\nVinaka.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 05:47:07','2026-06-22 05:47:07'),(29439,'judge-event-evaluation-29805-1782072334',29805,607,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8848,55,9545,2,'Open','10',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done! This is a beautiful caption.\r\n1. It looks like your highlights are a bit too intense in some areas.\r\n2. If you could perhaps move further back to capture this, so there could be more spacing between foreground and background would change the dynamics of this photo.\r\n\r\n3.I would suggest that you include more details on your report eg. Where did you take this photo? etc..\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 06:05:34','2026-06-22 06:05:34'),(29440,'judge-event-evaluation-30181-1782079211',30181,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9379,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Alayna. Your poem of your Mum has an affectionate tone that is genuine and heartfelt. You have also used some good metaphors in this piece. To really make your poem stand out, consider adding more specific, stand out verbs and specific anecdotes or adjectives that illustrate why Mum is heroic.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 08:00:11','2026-06-22 08:00:11'),(29441,'judge-event-evaluation-30156-1782080065',30156,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9376,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job Brian! A very honest and sincere poem of what you have gone through and the experience you had with your Mum.\r\nYour poem displays a clear emotional progression from crisis to faith. Just keep in mind the importance of having a rhyme and meter scheme to give your poem a great flow when reading.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 08:14:25','2026-06-22 08:14:25'),(29442,'judge-event-evaluation-30029-1782080694',30029,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8765,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'A great example of why we need to build our life on God. You seem to use all the poetic devices and mechanics well in this piece that you have done. The topic itself is also a good one to focus on.\r\nGood Job Gemma!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 08:24:54','2026-06-22 08:24:54'),(29443,'judge-event-evaluation-30021-1782081492',30021,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8762,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Good try Imanuela!\r\nA good Biblical theme and message. When choosing words especially rhyming words, also ensure that it makes sense and will not take you away from the theme. I would also like to point out that God clears our path away from sin not towards sin (line 3)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 08:38:12','2026-06-22 08:38:12'),(29444,'judge-event-evaluation-30020-1782082342',30020,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7356,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Kalani for your poem. An inspirational message of faith. Just a few pointers to keep in mind, ensure you have a consistent meter and syllable count to give your poem a better flow. Try to have stronger line endings to avoid some forced rhymes.\r\nAll the best Kalani!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 08:52:22','2026-06-22 08:52:22'),(29445,'judge-event-evaluation-30022-1782084243',30022,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8758,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Miriama for your poem. You have a simple but direct message of faith and gratitude. You also use effective storm imagery to represent life\'s difficulties. Just a suggestion, you could consider more varied line lengths and meter for greater poetic effect.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 09:24:03','2026-06-22 09:24:03'),(29447,'judge-event-evaluation-30251-1782084706',30251,626,24,24,7,2026,167,'411',NULL,9380,5804,7823,11,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,NULL,NULL,'Good job, I appreciate the effort, creativity and originality of the idea. Try using more tools offered by the paint application. Also your art should be realistic. Thank you!\r\nBreach of guideline: surrealism',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 09:31:46','2026-06-22 09:31:46'),(29448,'judge-event-evaluation-30023-1782084914',30023,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9372,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Nazarene for your poem. Your effective use of repetition to emphasize the main subject is good. Your word choice is clear and appropriate for a devotional theme. The use of figures of speech is also evident in the poem. One area you could really use to have very effective poems is the rhyme and meter scheme. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 09:35:14','2026-06-22 09:35:14'),(29449,'judge-event-evaluation-30542-1782085702',30542,617,24,24,7,2026,180,'461',NULL,7272,5806,7823,11,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,NULL,NULL,'Amazing work! I appreciate the highlights and textural effects used for the dove along with the details. Try and put just a little more effort into the background. Thank you for this beautiful piece!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 09:48:22','2026-06-22 09:48:22'),(29450,'judge-event-evaluation-31174-1782085755',31174,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7183,4208,9545,2,'Open','10',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Great timing on this sunset capture, Aviella.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 09:49:15','2026-06-22 09:49:15'),(29451,'judge-event-evaluation-30019-1782086382',30019,626,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,9371,5804,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'A good try Perez! The central metaphor of God as an oasis is strong and relatable. You also have some good imagery used in your poem- (sun is scorching, desert wasteland). A few suggestions, your poem could benefit by having a more consistent structure and stanzas. Also add more specific details or experiences of finding hope. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 09:59:42','2026-06-22 09:59:42'),(29452,'judge-event-evaluation-30247-1782087705',30247,607,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,7650,55,9545,2,NULL,NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Manav!\r\n1. incorporate foreground elements ( Tree tops, buildings) to provide a sense of scale and to give it a natural look.\r\n2. Try different angles, move away from eye-level, try low level to capture more of the horizon.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:21:45','2026-06-22 10:21:45'),(29453,'judge-event-evaluation-31211-1782087916',31211,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7557,4208,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'What a great poem that uses effective imagery and symbolism. The progression from a physical home to an emotional home is well presented. A few pointers to keep in mind, Your meter inconsistency occasionally disrupts the flow of your poem. Consider alternating between some stanzas with couplets and some with a different rhyme scheme for variety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:25:16','2026-06-22 10:25:16'),(29454,'judge-event-evaluation-30477-1782088410',30477,617,24,24,7,2026,183,'464','1',0,5806,7823,4,'Open','19',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!! A very informative and engaging presentation. Thank you for your effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:33:30','2026-06-22 10:33:30'),(29455,'judge-event-evaluation-29073-1782088413',29073,607,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,7707,55,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good try!\r\n1.Probably, try including a leveled horizon in your photo, eg. top of trees. This is just to give your photo a more balanced and natural look.\r\n2.Adjust, for any distortion to make clouds look natural.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:33:33','2026-06-29 09:31:44'),(29456,'judge-event-evaluation-31234-1782088749',31234,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7559,4208,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Mosese for your poem. You\'ve got strong visual imagery creating a clear picture of a rainbow. Also effective use of similes to enhance the rainbow\'s imagery. Just a caution on some of the words used especially rhyming words. Some rhymes feel forced or slanted (light/flow, breeze/dreams). Format could also affect how the poem is read.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:39:09','2026-06-22 10:39:09'),(29458,'judge-event-evaluation-31253-1782089612',31253,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8712,4208,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Qutololove for the poem. You have a generally good rhythmic flow with some lines having a strong meter scheme eg. (Do your ever stop and truly see/the wonders gifted endlessly) Your poem could really benefit from more original metaphors and also specific examples of what to appreciate. \r\nGood Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:53:32','2026-06-22 10:53:32'),(29459,'judge-event-evaluation-30128-1782089619',30128,626,24,24,7,2026,170,'414','1',0,5804,7823,4,'Collection','19',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Good job! This was a very beautiful and informative presentation. The information displayed was useful but made the slides a bit bulky. Thank you for your effort and creativity!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 10:53:39','2026-06-22 10:53:39'),(29461,'judge-event-evaluation-30127-1782090115',30127,626,24,24,7,2026,171,'415','1',0,5804,7823,4,'Collection','20',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing work Shiloh! This was a very beautiful presentation. Keep up the good work and thank you for your effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:01:55','2026-06-22 11:01:55'),(29462,'judge-event-evaluation-31278-1782090333',31278,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,8709,4208,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'What a great poem Shekinah! The poem has a good rhythm and flow, with effective imagery and metaphor. Your theme of divine love is clear. Be thorough with the meter schemes used as some lines have slight inconsistencies in meter, with a few forced rhymes (e.g. line/divine). All in all, you did well. Good Job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:05:33','2026-06-22 11:05:33'),(29463,'judge-event-evaluation-30129-1782090688',30129,626,24,24,7,2026,171,'415','2',0,5804,7823,4,'Collection','20',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Good work. Just try to use some animations to make the presentation flow. Thank you for your effort put into this interesting presentation!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:11:28','2026-06-22 11:11:29'),(29464,'judge-event-evaluation-31299-1782091131',31299,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7556,4208,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'A good poem Yahan. There\'s some effective use of sensory imagery and meaningful use of metaphors and similes. Theme of the poem is clear. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:18:51','2026-06-22 11:18:51'),(29465,'judge-event-evaluation-31465-1782091278',31465,642,24,24,7,2026,171,'415','1',0,4208,7823,4,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Great work! This was a very interesting and clear presentation. To make it more engaging try using more animations. Thank you for your creativity and effort!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:21:18','2026-06-22 11:21:18'),(29466,'judge-event-evaluation-31051-1782091670',31051,623,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,9468,1404,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Wow!!Absolutely beautiful photo of a cold night. \r\n1. Try to get the tree trunks in the frame, for a balanced composition.\r\n2. Adjust highlights/Shadows to make the snow pop against the dark sky.\r\n Also, please mention which country, you took this photo to give judges more details.\r\nOtherwise, well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:27:50','2026-06-22 11:27:50'),(29467,'judge-event-evaluation-31297-1782091752',31297,623,24,24,7,2026,160,'401',NULL,9470,1404,9545,2,'Collection','8',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Eparama.\r\nYou do have a talent in capturing not just good photos, but specific mood that viewers can relate to.\r\nUnfortunately, your report is not consistent with your photograph.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:29:12','2026-06-29 09:38:54'),(29468,'judge-event-evaluation-31312-1782091821',31312,642,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7558,4208,9611,6,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank You, Yuvann for the poem. You have a strong message of hope and comfort. I also picked a few effective use of contrasting imagery (darkness/light, suffering/grace). Just some pointers to help, consider varying the rhythm in some lines to create a more dynamic flow. Also the poem could really use more original metaphors and fresh imagery. All the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:30:21','2026-06-22 11:30:21'),(29470,'judge-event-evaluation-30546-1782092012',30546,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,5805,7823,4,'Open','20',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Gabriella and Om! This was a very interesting and informative presentation. The visuals, animations and layout were great. Thank you for your effort and creativity!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:33:32','2026-06-22 11:33:32'),(29471,'judge-event-evaluation-31451-1782092038',31451,642,24,24,7,2026,165,'406',NULL,9522,4208,9549,2,'Collection','11',100,74.00,-10,NULL,'A solid, clean, well‑presented photo. \r\nWith stronger lighting, more intentional composition, and a storytelling element, it could score significantly higher.\r\nGood effort, Vishali',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:33:58','2026-06-22 11:33:58'),(29472,'judge-event-evaluation-31290-1782092188',31290,642,24,24,7,2026,165,'406',NULL,8710,4208,9549,2,'Collection','11',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful, well‑executed photo showing strong technical skill and thoughtful composition. With a bit more creative storytelling and refined lighting, this could easily reach medal level.\r\nRefreshing photo, Esther!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 11:36:28','2026-06-22 11:36:28'),(29473,'judge-event-evaluation-31479-1782092384',31479,642,24,24,7,2026,165,'406',NULL,9525,4208,9549,2,'Collection','11',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'A stunning, well‑executed photo — technically strong and emotionally gentle. With a slightly more creative angle or thematic framing, this could easily reach top‑tier medal level.\r\nGreat effort, Julia!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-2