ou, Ivanah, for your effort. It’s a lovely poster. \r\nFor future reference, please review the guidelines. \r\nTry to place your text so that it doesn’t clash with the image. In your poster, you could have positioned the text in an area with more open space to avoid overlapping with the trees.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 12:50:31','2026-06-22 12:50:31'),(29497,'judge-event-evaluation-31413-1782097158',31413,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7186,4208,8703,12,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Litiana, for your effort. It’s a beautiful poster. \r\nFor future reference, please review the guidelines.\r\nI would suggest using a photo with a nature theme next time. \r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 12:59:18','2026-06-22 12:59:18'),(29498,'judge-event-evaluation-30477-1782097383',30477,617,24,24,7,2026,183,'464','1',0,5806,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for the excellent effort, Peniasi. Just a few points to note to improve on your presentation:\r\n- allow more time for your viewers to read through each slide and to appreciate the pictures (the presentation was only four minutes and you could have utilized the maximum time allowed)\r\n- Have someone proof read your presentation so that you do not lose marks in spelling, punctuation and grammar',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 13:03:03','2026-06-22 13:03:03'),(29499,'judge-event-evaluation-31393-1782097768',31393,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8799,4208,8703,12,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Alfred, for your poster. \r\n\r\nFor future reference, please refer to guidelines. \r\nI would suggest using your own photographs to avoid any issues with image sourcing or copyright. Additionally, you could improve the setting of your wording by adjusting the text placement and alignment so that it flows more naturally with the image’s composition. This will help the verse stand out while maintaining visual harmony.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 13:09:28','2026-06-22 13:09:28'),(29500,'judge-event-evaluation-31197-1782098073',31197,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8715,4208,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Jona, for your effort. It’s a beautiful poster, and the sunset background complements the verse from Genesis 1:1 wonderfully.\r\nFor future reference, please review the guidelines. I would suggest ensuring your font is slightly larger for better readability and avoiding clutter in the image so the focus remains clear. Try to center your design around one main subject to create a balanced and visually appealing composition.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 13:14:33','2026-06-22 13:14:33'),(29501,'judge-event-evaluation-30477-1782098345',30477,617,24,24,7,2026,183,'464','1',0,5806,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your effort, Peniasi. To assist you improve on your presentation, please note:\r\n- allow more time for your viewers to read through each slide and appreciate the pictures. (You could have utilized the ten minutes maximum time allowed)\r\n- get someone (supervisor or parent) to proof read the content so that you do not lose marks in the spelling, punctuation and grammar used.\r\nI liked the setting and the pictures - very appropriate. And what caught my attention was the fun fact that the phrase Do not be afraid is written 365 times in the Bible. WOW - one for each day of the year. What a great and loving God we serve!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 13:19:05','2026-06-22 13:19:06'),(29502,'judge-event-evaluation-31445-1782098445',31445,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9520,4208,8703,12,'Open',NULL,100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Kinisimere, for your excellent work. \r\nYour poster is beautifully done and shows great attention to detail. \r\nContinue to pursue your skills in design. Keep up the great work. \r\nGod bless!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 13:20:45','2026-06-22 13:20:45'),(29503,'judge-event-evaluation-31281-1782098814',31281,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9521,4208,8703,12,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Gideon, for your effort. It’s a beautiful poster, and the verse from Psalm 56:3 is well chosen—it conveys trust and faith beautifully.\r\n\r\nFor future reference, please review the guidelines. I would recommend using a blue-toned background instead of black or grey to make the design more visually appealing and uplifting. The lighter tones would also help the text stand out more clearly.\r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 13:26:54','2026-06-22 13:26:54'),(29504,'judge-event-evaluation-30128-1782101938',30128,626,24,24,7,2026,170,'414','1',0,5804,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,-5.00,'Thank you for your effort, Perez. I would like to encourage you that before you enter an event, please thoroughly understand the guidelines so that you do not lose marks in your entries for example your presentation should run through from the beginning to the end and it should not use live internet links (you had one for the National Anthem therefore points were deducted from the maximum time/number of slides criteria).\r\nYour choice of pictures was appropriate and your design shows that you are conversant with the power point software but to engage and allow readers to remember facts about Solomon, summarized bullet points would be excellent. Also, have an adult (Supervisor/parent) proof read the content of your slides to correct your spelling, punctuation and grammar errors.\r\nWe are grateful that God has given us different nations that we could called home here on earth. However, we are truly blessed to know that God is preparing a home for us in Heaven! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 14:18:58','2026-06-22 14:18:58'),(29505,'judge-event-evaluation-30128-1782103066',30128,626,24,24,7,2026,170,'414','1',0,5804,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,-5.00,'Thank you for your presentation, Perez. I would like to recommend that before your enter an event, please read and understand the guidelines so that you do not lose marks. For example, the navigation of your presentation should begin and run through to the end and the presentation must not use a live internet link (you have one for the National Anthem therefore points were deducted from the maximum time/number of slides criteria). Here are two tips to remember when doing your slides:\r\n- To engage and help your reader remember the facts, summarized bullet points would be excellent.\r\n- Get an adult (Supervisor/parent) to proof read your sentences to correct spelling, punctuation and grammar errors.\r\nThe choice of pictures were appropriate and the design used shows that you are conversant with the powerpoint software. We are grateful to God that we have different places that we could call home here on earth. However, you and I are truly blessed to know that God is preparing for us a home in Heaven!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 14:37:46','2026-06-22 14:37:46'),(29507,'judge-event-evaluation-31396-1782108861',31396,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8717,4208,9602,2,'Open','10',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome scape photo Tokasa! The sunset photo looks really beautiful and peaceful. Keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 16:14:21','2026-06-29 10:54:03'),(29508,'judge-event-evaluation-31470-1782108913',31470,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,8716,4208,9602,2,'Open','10',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Peijing! Well done with scape. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 16:15:13','2026-06-22 16:15:13'),(29509,'judge-event-evaluation-31382-1782108975',31382,642,24,24,7,2026,175,'453',NULL,9520,4208,9602,2,NULL,'10',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Kinisimere! Continue to enhance in your gift in photography. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-22 16:16:15','2026-06-22 16:16:15'),(29512,'judge-event-evaluation-31192-1782109