the effort put in to complete your entry. \r\nThere was no report to go with the picture of your crochet hence the decrease in points from certain areas. \r\nIf you are a beginner, then you certainly have the skill so don\'t give up but persevere to improve and surprise yourself with what you can do. \r\nBlessings for future endeavors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:24:09','2026-06-23 07:24:09'),(29551,'judge-event-evaluation-31251-1782163463',31251,607,24,24,7,2026,155,'373',NULL,8869,55,9545,70,'Open',NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Good try, Liviana.\r\nFor a small-size crochet, I would suggest you use smaller needles and fine threads.\r\nI would also suggest that you plan out your work, so you would have enough threads in stock.\r\nPlease note that for crochet, you have to submit your pattern for your entry.\r\nKeep practicing and thank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:24:23','2026-06-23 07:24:23'),(29553,'judge-event-evaluation-29829-1782163564',29829,607,24,24,7,2026,205,'556',NULL,7799,55,7823,17,'Open',NULL,100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Good job! Try using more techniques to achieve various textures and add more effort on the tone. Thank you for your creativity and effort!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:26:04','2026-06-23 07:26:04'),(29554,'judge-event-evaluation-30504-1782163656',30504,617,24,24,7,2026,142,'358',NULL,7272,5806,9485,64,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'I would rate these as delightful creative and well - executed handmade pieces. They are not polished like a factory - made but I can see the warmth and unique, if its put in a room it will perfectly add character to a room.\r\nWell done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:27:36','2026-06-23 07:27:36'),(29555,'judge-event-evaluation-30944-1782163677',30944,607,24,24,7,2026,204,'555',NULL,7804,55,9603,17,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Great Art work Jiaxing! Keep up the excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:27:57','2026-06-23 07:27:57'),(29556,'judge-event-evaluation-31156-1782163787',31156,626,24,24,7,2026,5,'009','3',0,5804,7167,9,'Collection','1',100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Kalani! Kindly note that a collection consists of things that are studied in Social Studies like artifacts, coins, flags, rocks etc. For Science collection it\'s flower, leaves, rocks, seeds, etc. Your collection is more of research. However, research is only for open grade students. Lastly, an exhibit needs to be able to be mounted so you\'ll need a hard cardboard as a base so it can stand. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:29:47','2026-06-23 07:29:47'),(29558,'judge-event-evaluation-31415-1782164102',31415,626,24,24,7,2026,131,'323',NULL,9373,5804,9570,70,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the beautiful work submitted, Alicia.\r\nYou did an excellent job.  Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:35:02','2026-06-23 07:35:02'),(29559,'judge-event-evaluation-31259-1782164147',31259,642,24,24,7,2026,198,'510',NULL,8712,4208,7839,53,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'The design in this art work is very good .Next time, try to make the lines straight and neat .This will make the shape stand out .Very creative .Thanks for the great effot ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:35:47','2026-06-23 07:35:47'),(29560,'judge-event-evaluation-31173-1782164224',31173,607,24,24,7,2026,205,'556',NULL,7804,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'A good effort with a creative sketch. However, the use of a whiteboard marker does not meet the requirements for a pen and ink medium. In future, use appropriate permanent ink penks and continue developing line quality and detail.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:37:04','2026-06-23 07:37:04'),(29561,'judge-event-evaluation-31355-1782164242',31355,607,24,24,7,2026,205,'556',NULL,9444,55,7823,17,'Open',NULL,100,59.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work! The tones could be more balanced and be more intentional with the details. But thank you for this beautiful piece and your effort and creativity!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:37:22','2026-06-23 07:37:22'),(29562,'judge-event-evaluation-31220-1782164247',31220,607,24,24,7,2026,204,'555',NULL,8854,55,9603,17,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Nice sketch Asher! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:37:27','2026-06-23 07:37:27'),(29563,'judge-event-evaluation-31239-1782164271',31239,623,24,24,7,2026,137,'352',NULL,9462,1404,7841,59,'Open',NULL,100,66.00,-10,NULL,'Appreciate the effort to the change of idea. Suggestions, also include the steps for how the stand was made to help complete the finishing of the product…. Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:37:51','2026-06-23 07:37:51'),(29564,'judge-event-evaluation-30497-1782164367',30497,617,24,24,7,2026,155,'373',NULL,8792,5806,9545,70,'Open',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Sylvia!\r\n1. Border is slightly ruffled because too many stitches causing it to bunch.\r\nDouble check your stich count to prevent increase that causes ruffling.\r\n2. Your sunflowers were unevenly spread out.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:39:27','2026-06-23 07:39:28'),(29567,'judge-event-evaluation-30509-1782164566',30509,617,24,24,7,2026,205,'556',NULL,7272,5806,7823,17,'Open',NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Nicely done! Thank you for your effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:42:46','2026-06-23 07:42:46'),(29568,'judge-event-evaluation-31145-1782164588',31145,626,24,24,7,2026,5,'009','4',0,5804,7167,9,'Collection','1',100,85.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Maloney! Kindly note that this is more of research. A collection consists of coins, miniature flags, artifacts & rocks for Social Studies, and flowers, leaves, seeds, etc. for Science collection. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:43:08','2026-06-23 07:43:08'),(29570,'judge-event-evaluation-31102-1782164624',31102,626,24,24,7,2026,14,'056','1',0,5804,7542,1,'Collection','3',100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'The projects must be entirely your own original work, meaning you must honestly cite every source and avoid any form of plagiarism or uncredited AI assistance. Furthermore, to remain eligible and maximize your score, you must strictly follow all official guidelines regarding layout, and research only for open grade students and according to your Pace level. However good try and hope you can do better in the next conventions.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:43:44','2026-06-23 07:43:44'),(29571,'judge-event-evaluation-30505-1782164771',30505,617,24,24,7,2026,204,'555',NULL,7272,5806,9603,17,'Open',NULL,100,98.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely sketch Tama! Keep up the excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:46:11','2026-06-23 07:46:11'),(29573,'judge-event-evaluation-30990-1782164912',30990,623,24,24,7,2026,142,'358',NULL,9472,1404,9485,64,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'There is a lot of creativity , hand work is really unique . This piece is very impressive and shows both imagination and skills.\r\nFor the finishing quality, the surfaces are slightly uneven, but thats typical of handbuilt clay art and adds character.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:48:32','2026-06-23 07:48:32'),(29574,'judge-event-evaluation-30973-1782164954',30973,607,24,24,7,2026,137,'352',NULL,9352,55,7841,59,'Open',NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'It’s a good display. A little unsure on the area of the painted over flower, as well as the paint marks on several of the letters. However, it is great effort, and I definitely recommend to continue working on this skill. Vinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:49:14','2026-06-23 07:49:14'),(29575,'judge-event-evaluation-29829-1782165039',29829,607,24,24,7,2026,205,'556',NULL,7799,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'A neat landscape with a clear composition and good effort in depicting the mountains and trees. The drawing demonstrates basic pen and ink skills; howeve, greater variety in line work, stronger contrast, and more convincing use of pen and ink techniques would add depth , texture and visual interest. Continue developing confidence  in combining different techniques to create a more dynamic and refined artwork.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:50:39','2026-06-23 07:50:39'),(29578,'judge-event-evaluation-31018-1782165173',31018,626,24,24,7,2026,192,'504',NULL,9373,5804,7839,17,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the work you have done . Next time  , you need to follow the guidelines so that you will not lose marks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 07:52:53','2026-06-23 07:52:53'),(29579,'judge-event-evaluation-31729-1782165301',31729,641,24,24,7,2026,15,'057','1',0,5805,7542,1,'Open','2',100,91.00,NULL,NULL,'Your project is