95.00,-10,NULL,'This is a well-executed pen and ink sketch that demonstrates strong technical skill, careful observation, and confident use of line work. The composition is balanced, and the textures and details add visual interest. To reach an even higher standard, consider pushing the contrast further by incorporating a wider range of line weights and shading techniques to create greater depth and focal emphasis. Overall, this is an impressive and polished piece of work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:12:14','2026-06-23 08:12:14'),(29609,'judge-event-evaluation-29547-1782166352',29547,607,24,24,7,2026,190,'502',NULL,9355,55,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Good job. Thank you for your effort. Remember to work within the guidelines.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:12:32','2026-06-23 08:12:32'),(29610,'judge-event-evaluation-31747-1782166370',31747,641,24,24,7,2026,13,'055','2',0,5805,7542,1,'Open','1',100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Your project is very well presented, but showing more unique ideas and creativity will make it stand out. Thank you for your effort, and I look forward to seeing you do even better at the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:12:50','2026-06-23 08:12:50'),(29611,'judge-event-evaluation-30167-1782166405',30167,607,24,24,7,2026,118,'308',NULL,8840,55,9485,64,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Your art work is colorful, skillfully and beautifully made. It demonstrates both creativity in concept and care. The mix of grapes, watermelon, bananas, and other fruits makes the basket lively and colorful. It shows imagination in combining different shapes and colors. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:13:25','2026-06-23 08:13:25'),(29613,'judge-event-evaluation-31380-1782166430',31380,626,24,24,7,2026,5,'009','1',0,5804,7167,9,'Collection','1',100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Joel! Kindly note that a flag collection needs to display real miniature flags. Drawings and photocopies are not allowed. However, you\'ve done great in researching all the flags. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:13:50','2026-06-23 08:13:50'),(29614,'judge-event-evaluation-29610-1782166440',29610,607,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,9364,55,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,71.00,-10,-4.00,'Very Good work. Nice imagination.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:14:00','2026-06-23 08:14:00'),(29615,'judge-event-evaluation-30969-1782166470',30969,607,24,24,7,2026,131,'323',NULL,7676,55,9570,70,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jessica for the beautiful work submitted. \r\nPoints were deducted because I couldn\'t find pattern with your report. \r\nYou have the skill and talent and I hope you will continue to produce beautiful creations in the future. Blessings! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:14:30','2026-06-23 08:14:30'),(29617,'judge-event-evaluation-30690-17821665