26-06-23 08:39:15'),(29664,'judge-event-evaluation-31334-1782168121',31334,607,24,24,7,2026,200,'551',NULL,8857,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'This watercolor painting demonstrates a good understanding of the medium, with pleasing color choices and a balanced composition. The subject is clearly presented, and there is evidence of thoughtful planning. To improve, work on achieving smoother washes, stronger tonal contrast, and cleaner edges where needed. Refining details and creating greater depth will enhance the overall impact of the painting. Overall, this is a commendable effort with good potential for further development.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:42:01','2026-06-23 08:42:01'),(29665,'judge-event-evaluation-31408-1782168204',31408,642,24,24,7,2026,136,'351',NULL,7186,4208,7841,58,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Project does not  have qualifying requirements for Wood Construction: two or more different wood joints to hold item together + source link for video is not listed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:43:24','2026-06-29 09:01:56'),(29666,'judge-event-evaluation-31442-1782168290',31442,626,24,24,7,2026,132,'324',NULL,8765,5804,9570,70,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Gemma. You have been very  creative in using the basic stitch to create a very interesting and useful baby accessory. \r\nWell done! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:44:50','2026-06-23 08:44:50'),(29667,'judge-event-evaluation-31357-1782168348',31357,607,24,24,7,2026,200,'551',NULL,9444,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'This is a well-executed watercolor painting with good color harmony and a convincing representation of the bunch of green grapes. The shading and form give the fruit a pleasing sense of volume. To improve further, ensure that all preliminary pencil guidelines are fully erased or minimized before applying the final presentation, as the visible pencil marks slightly distract from the finished artwork. Smoother blending and a little more tonal contrast would also enhance the realism. Overall, this is a strong piece with good technical skill.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:45:48','2026-06-23 08:45:48'),(29668,'judge-event-evaluation-31104-1782168353',31104,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,8764,5804,9603,17,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely art work Manshika. Keep it up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:45:53','2026-06-23 08:45:53'),(29670,'judge-event-evaluation-30974-1782168564',30974,607,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,7679,55,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'You have put a good effort on your work. Some points that will increase your capacity in this field. 1. Object or subject should be in the center. 2. Direction of light should show where the shadow falls. 3. The multi textual gives the depth and expression of reality of the subject. 4. Experiments various grades of pencils H, HB, B, B2, etc. Keep on learning new skills in art and may God bless you for your endeavors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:49:24','2026-06-23 08:49:24'),(29673,'judge-event-evaluation-31025-1782168659',31025,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9376,5804,9603,17,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Great art work Brian! Keep up the good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:50:59','2026-06-23 08:50:59'),(29674,'judge-event-evaluation-30501-1782168667',30501,617,24,24,7,2026,203,'554',NULL,8792,5806,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Good Work',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:51:07','2026-06-23 08:51:07'),(29675,'judge-event-evaluation-29606-1782168671',29606,607,24,24,7,2026,200,'551',NULL,8867,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'This watercolor painting presents the jellyfish in an appealing and creative way, with pleasing color choices that effectively capture the underwater atmosphere. The composition is balanced, and the subject is clearly recognizable. To improve further, develop stronger tonal contrast and smoother blending to give the jellyfish more depth and transparency. Adding finer details and enhancing the surrounding water textures would create greater realism and visual impact. Overall, this is a well-executed artwork with good artistic potential.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:51:11','2026-06-23 08:51:11'),(29676,'judge-event-evaluation-30167-1782168818',30167,607,24,24,7,2026,118,'308',NULL,8840,55,9488,64,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Based on the hand-built clay item, the variety of fruits creates a strong and balanced display. It is a charming piece of art displayed, and different bright colors stand out. Just be careful with your spelling when you are writing a report, and also check to see that your report is all filled out before submitting. When you are making a hand-built clay item, remember to check that the sides are even. Good try, all the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:53:38','2026-06-23 08:53:38'),(29677,'judge-event-evaluation-30998-1782168823',30998,623,24,24,7,2026,190,'502',NULL,9468,1404,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'Good job! It feels deeply expressive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:53:43','2026-06-23 08:53:43'),(29678,'judge-event-evaluation-29700-1782168832',29700,607,24,24,7,2026,200,'551',NULL,7799,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'This painting shows a sincere effort to capture a field of flowers and demonstrates a basic understanding of watercolor techniques. The choice of subject is attractive, and there is an attempt to create a natural landscape. To improve, focus on better control of the paint, cleaner brushwork, and stronger color blending. Developing the composition with clearer details, improved proportions, and greater contrast between the foreground and background will help create more depth and visual interest. Continued practice with watercolor techniques will lead to stronger and more confident results.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 08:53:52','2026-06-23 08:53:52'),(29680,'judge-event-evaluation-30496-1782168868',30496,617,24,24,7,2026,201,'552',NULL,8792,5806,7823,17,NULL,NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Good work on such a creative piece!',NULL,N