,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:00:02','2026-06-23 09:00:02'),(29685,'judge-event-evaluation-31283-1782169228',31283,642,24,24,7,2026,118,'308',NULL,8710,4208,9485,64,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'This vase is gracefully done. The limited colors that has been used makes it a unique article. It balances tradition with creativity, making it a strong student project. The brush work is neat, though some lines could be sharper for a more polished look. Well done!\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:00:28','2026-06-23 09:00:28'),(29686,'judge-event-evaluation-30895-1782169234',30895,623,24,24,7,2026,190,'502',NULL,7612,1404,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,55.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work! I think maybe you could add in other colors as well, probably like orange or yellow for your sunset background to make it pop a bit more. I think you did an awesome job. Your vision comes through strongly.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:00:34','2026-06-23 09:00:34'),(29687,'judge-event-evaluation-31385-1782169238',31385,642,24,24,7,2026,135,'350',NULL,9520,4208,7168,57,'Open',NULL,100,60.00,-10,-3.00,'Good effort, however, the missing tools is lathe and it is one of the major tools used for wood turning. Good presentation but can do better. Incomplete form, (Open or U/16) attention to details.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:00:38','2026-06-23 09:00:38'),(29688,'judge-event-evaluation-31089-1782169242',31089,623,24,24,7,2026,201,'552',NULL,9462,1404,7823,17,'Open',NULL,100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Great job!  I appreciate the colors and shadows used and textures of the tree. Thank you for your creativity and effort!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:00:42','2026-06-23 09:00:42'),(29689,'judge-event-evaluation-31086-1782169243',31086,626,24,24,7,2026,132,'324',NULL,9384,5804,9570,70,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful work, Frances.\r\nNote, the loose threads need to be secured well.\r\nThank you for your creativity. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:00:43','2026-06-23 09:00:43'),(29691,'judge-event-evaluation-31472-1782169276',31472,642,24,24,7,2026,4,'005','1',0,4208,7542,1,'Collection','1',100,82.00,NULL,NULL,'Your project matches your pictures well, but try to be more creative next time. Your work must be accurate, easy to read, and set up properly on your display board Always follow guidelines. Thank you for your effort, and I look forward to seeing you do even better at the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:01:16','2026-06-23 09:01:16'),(29692,'judge-event-evaluation-31425-1782169312',31425,642,24,24,7,2026,118,'308',NULL,9522,4208,9485,64,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This article is simple and elegant, embodying the essence of handmade pottery. Its imperfections are part of its charm, making it feel authentic and personal. Its not flashy, but it has quiet strength and beauty.\r\nBy observing the article there are minor handbuilt outcome, but it has its traditional look .Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N