,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:16:04','2026-06-23 09:16:04'),(29713,'judge-event-evaluation-31027-1782170243',31027,626,24,24,7,2026,4,'005','1',0,5804,7542,1,'Collection','1',100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Your project matches your pictures well, but using more unique and creative ideas will help it stand out. Everything on your display board must be written and shown accurately, and you must include your bibliography in the correct format. Thank you for your hard work, and I look forward to seeing you do even better at the next convention!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:17:23','2026-06-23 09:17:23'),(29714,'judge-event-evaluation-31146-1782170249',31146,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,8763,5804,9610,17,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'This is a neat and colorful drawing that shows care in filling and presenting the flower design. The colors are well chosen and applied with good effort, giving the piece an attractive appearance. Since the idea was taken from a coloring book, the focus here is mainly on execution rather than originality. To improve, encourage more independent design choices, smoother blending of colored pencil, and added detail or shading to create depth and make the flower appear more three-dimensional. Overall, this is a good effort with room to grow in creativity and technique.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:17:29','2026-06-23 09:17:29'),(29715,'judge-event-evaluation-30494-1782170305',30494,617,24,24,7,2026,5,'009','1',0,5806,7167,9,'Collection','1',100,88.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Shalom! You\'ve put up a beautiful exhibit for your collection. Kindly note that your reference is missing and it carries 10 points. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:18:25','2026-06-23 09:18:25'),(29716,'judge-event-evaluation-31283-1782170321',31283,642,24,24,7,2026,118,'308',NULL,8710,4208,9488,64,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'The hand-built vase shows an excellent shape of a vase. A lovely color was chosen to decorate the vase to stand out. Just remember that when you are doing a hand-built item, check to see that it is neatly done before submitting. Thank you for trying your best. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:18:41','2026-06-23 09:18:41'),(29717,'judge-event-evaluation-31500-1782170367',31500,641,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7147,5805,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Sally. \r\nI liked the poem. Great work with the syllables. Generally you alternated between 8 and 9 syllables in each line. Keep brainstorming, writing and researching for ideas and guidelines.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:19:27','2026-06-23 09:19:27'),(29718,'judge-event-evaluation-31093-1782170398',31093,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9378,5804,9603,17,'Collection',NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Liam! Keep accelerating in your art skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:19:58','2026-06-23 09:19:58'),(29719,'judge-event-eva