 of a dinosaur shows good effort and a clear understanding of the subject. The overall form is recognizable, and the artist has attempted to add color and detail to bring the drawing to life. To improve further, more thoughtful color choices would enhance realism and visual appeal, as some tones appear less natural for the subject. Strengthening shading, blending, and contrast would also help give the dinosaur more depth and a stronger three-dimensional effect. Overall, this is a solid piece with good potential for refinement.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:21:11','2026-06-23 09:21:11'),(29724,'judge-event-evaluation-31392-1782170562',31392,642,24,24,7,2026,136,'351',NULL,8717,4208,7841,58,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Project does not have qualifying requirements for Wood Construction: having two or more wood joints to hold item together + source links for photos n videos not listed on student report.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:22:42','2026-06-26 09:24:25'),(29726,'judge-event-evaluation-31015-1782170662',31015,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9379,5804,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,60.00,-10,-2.00,'More work and imagination needed. good try though.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:24:22','2026-06-23 09:24:22'),(29727,'judge-event-evaluation-31093-1782170671',31093,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9378,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'This is a pleasing colored pencil sketch of an ice cream that shows good effort and a clear understanding of the subject. The colors are appealing and the composition is neat, making the artwork visually attractive. To improve further, focus on smoother blending  and add stronger highlights and shadows to create a more realistic, three-dimensional effect. Paying attention to texture—especially in the ice cream and cone—would also enhance the overall quality. Overall, this is a well-presented piece with good artistic potential.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:24:31','2026-06-23 09:24:31'),(29728,'judge-event-evaluation-31098-1782170697',31098,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,8758,5804,9603,17,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing art work Miriama! Keep up the excellent work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:24:57','2026-06-23 09:24:57'),(29729,'judge-event-evaluation-31018-1782170725',31018,626,24,24,7,2026,192,'504',NULL,9373,5804,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Alicia! The detail is remarkable. Maybe add a frame next time. \r\nThank you for your effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:25:25','2026-06-23 09:25:25'),(29731,'judge-event-evaluation-31510-1782170786',31510,626,24,24,7,2026,129,'321',NULL,8765,5804,9545,69,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Gemma!\r\n1. Stitch lengths and angles vary within individual petal/leaf.\r\n2.The outline edges of flowers are slightly irregular, causing the flower to lose their shape.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,