es. \r\nBlessings and continue to challenge yourself with the skill and talents you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:27:17','2026-06-23 09:27:17'),(29736,'judge-event-evaluation-31318-1782170961',31318,642,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,7204,4208,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,63.00,-10,NULL,'Great job Yuvan! Such thoughtful composition. \r\nThank you for your effort.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:29:21','2026-06-23 09:29:21'),(29737,'judge-event-evaluation-30894-1782170965',30894,623,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,7612,1404,9603,17,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent art work Jessica.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:29:25','2026-06-23 09:29:25'),(29738,'judge-event-evaluation-31214-1782170971',31214,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,7360,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a strong and well-composed interior drawing that shows good understanding of perspective and spatial arrangement. The table, vase, and window are clearly identifiable, and the placement of objects creates a balanced and realistic scene. To improve further, refine the perspective lines—especially around the table and window—to make them more precise, and increase tonal contrast to strengthen depth and lighting effects. Overall, this is a very good piece with strong foundational skills and clear artistic development.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06