n\'t stretched tightly enough.\r\n2. The borders on the flowers are slightly uneven causing it to lose its shape.\r\n3. And inconsistency in strand thickness make some areas look slightly bumpy.\r\n4. And please with Embroidery, you need to submit you a Pattern, which in this case is a outline of your plan.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:42:39','2026-06-23 09:42:39'),(29760,'judge-event-evaluation-30502-1782171786',30502,617,24,24,7,2026,200,'551',NULL,8792,5806,7823,17,'Open',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely work! I love the mixture and balancing of colors and tones. Thank you for your creativity and effort!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:43:06','2026-06-23 09:43:06'),(29761,'judge-event-evaluation-31100-1782171812',31100,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,8758,5804,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,64.00,-10,-2.00,'Good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:43:32','2026-06-23 09:43:32'),(29762,'judge-event-evaluation-30983-1782171828',30983,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,8847,55,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Joren. \r\nThank you for your entry. I liked your the fresh and simple approach you have in your writing. Thank you for following the guidelines. Keep brainstorming, writing and researching to get better results in poetry writing next time. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:43:48','2026-06-23 09:43:48'),(29763,'jud