5.00,-10,-2.00,'Good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:54:20','2026-06-23 09:54:20'),(29790,'judge-event-evaluation-31137-1782172533',31137,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9372,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'This artwork shows a good attempt at capturing the changing colours of the evening sky during sunset. The warm tones are well selected and create a calm, atmospheric feeling. To improve further, focus on smoother blending between colours to avoid visible transitions, and increase tonal variation to better reflect depth in the sky. Overall, this is a strong and expressive study of evening sky colour.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:55:33','2026-06-23 09:55:33'),(29792,'judge-event-evaluation-31027-1782172543',31027,626,24,24,7,2026,4,'005','1',0,5804,9570,1,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Helena for the work and information you have shared. We praise God for His wonderful creation and provision to mankind. \r\nAlways keep in mind to include references for the place your information was taken from. \r\nGreat work! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:55:43','2026-06-23 09:55:43'),(29793,'judge-event-evaluation-31034-1782172572',31034,626,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,9374,5804,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,57.00,-10,NULL,'Good job! This has a lot of character.\r\nThank you so much for your effort and hard work!!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:56:12','2026-06-23 09:56:12'),(29794,'judge-event-evaluation-30995-1782172640',30995,623,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9466,1404,9603,17,'Collection',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing art piece Tarie! However, please provide checklist.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:57:20','2026-06-23 09:57:20'),(29795,'judge-event-evaluation-30308-1782172647',30308,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7655,55,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Bryan. \r\nI liked your fresh, original approach in writing this poem. Thank you for following the guidelines. You have the right idea. You tried to have 8 or 9 syllables per line throughout the poem. Keep brainstorming, researching guidelines and writing poems. I hope to see another entry next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:57:27','2026-06-23 09:57:27'),(29796,'judge-event-evaluation-31140-1782172684',31140,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9372,5804,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,70.00,-10,-2.00,'Very neat work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:58:04','2026-06-23 09:58:04'),(29797,'judge-event-evaluation-31193-1782172717',31193,642,24,24,7,2026,206,'557',NULL,9519,4208,7841,56,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,-10,NULL,'Lovely design. Please include the source link for the photo design from Pinterest to show specifics of where the photo came from. Keep it up.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:58:37','2026-06-23 09:58:37'),(29798,'judge-event-evaluation-30035-1782172744',30035,607,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,8854,55,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful work and you have put lots of effort into this work. Some hints that will assist you for excellent results. \r\n1. Convincing perspective about the subject will relate the story or theme behind your art. 2. In art report there is no draft like English composition only the steps or sequences of your work. 3. A slightly bigger black frame with white background will bring out the depth of your art. Keep up the good work and God bless you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:59:04','2026-06-23 09:59:04'),(29799,'judge-event-evaluation-31090-1782172782',31090,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9382,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'This is a first attempt at colored pencil sketching and shows a sincere effort to represent a sea landscape with a rising sun and coconut trees. The main elements are identifiable, and there is clear enthusiasm in trying to capture the scene. To improve, focus on better control of pencil pressure, smoother colour blending in the sky and sea, and clearer definition of the coconut trees to strengthen their shapes. With continued practice, you will build confidence and improve both accuracy and depth in future drawings.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:59:42','2026-06-23 09:59:42'),(29800,'judge-event-evaluation-31421-1782172796',31421,642,24,24,7,2026,113,'302',NULL,9522,4208,7802,59,'Collection',NULL,100,51.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort please refer to the guidelines it will guide you through on how to do a wood carving piece.\r\n\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 09:59:56','2026-06-23 09:59:56'),(29801,'judge-event-evaluation-31727-1782172881',31727,641,24,24,7,2026,18,'060','1',0,5805,7167,9,'Open','3',100,94.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Abigail and Gabriella! You\'ve done well but there is always room for improvement especially in your display. Good try and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:01:21','2026-06-23 10:01:21'),(29802,'judge-event-evaluation-31022-1782172885',31022,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9380,5804,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,68.00,-10,-2.00,'Good Work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:01:25','2026-06-23 10:01:25'),(29803,'judge-event-evaluation-30973-1782172887',30973,607,24,24,7,2026,137,'352',NULL,9352,55,7168,59,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, simple and good for hanging decoration. Carving word \"GOD is LOVE\" is a constant reminder when it is hanged up on the wall. Great effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:01:27','2026-06-23 10:01:27'),(29804,'judge-event-evaluation-29843-1782172888',29843,607,24,24,7,2026,144,'360',NULL,9365,55,9485,54,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'This project is imaginative, heartfelt and well executed. It succeeds as both an artistic scrapbook and a personal testamony. The  combination of basketball achievement, faith and creative design makes it stand out as more than just an article for convention ,its a personal testimony of growth and passion. Well done!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:01:28','2026-06-23 10:01:28'),(29805,'judge-event-evaluation-31104-1782172970',31104,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,8764,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,61.00,-10,NULL,'This piece shows an attempt to complete a colored pencil sketch, but it appears that a printing stencil has been used for the main outlines. While the coloring effort is present, the use of stencils limits the development of freehand drawing skills, which are important for artistic growth. To improve, Manshika is encouraged to practice free sketching to build confidence in drawing shapes, proportions, and composition independently before applying colour. Developing these foundational skills will lead to stronger creativity and overall improvement in future artworks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:02:50','2026-06-23 10:02:50'),(29806,'judge-event-evaluation-31141-1782172978',31141,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,8764,5804,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,60.00,-10,-2.00,'Good Work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:02:58','2026-06-23 10:02:58'),(29807,'judge-event-evaluation-31095-1782172985',31095,626,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,9378,5804,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,59.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome stuff Liam!! You\'ve captured something interesting here. I can see the thought you put into this piece.\r\nThank you for your hard work and effort!\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:03:05','2026-06-23 10:03:05'),(29808,'judge-event-evaluation-29543-1782173113',29543,607,24,24,7,2026,156,'374',NULL,7721,55,9545,70,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Nanise!\r\n1. There is a loose loop of yarn near the center of the bag.\r\n2. The transition where the white strap meets the bag, shows loose fiber.\r\n3.We do not see a Pattern submitted for this entry, therefore points were deducted accordingly.\r\nVinaka.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:05:13','2026-06-23 10:05:13'),(29809,'judge-event-evaluation-31020-1782173121',31020,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9380,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,59.00,-10,NULL,'This work shows a good effort and willingness to complete the task, and it is clear that Grace Tupou has engaged with the activity positively. However, the overall execution still needs improvement in areas such as control, accuracy, and detail. To progress further, continued practice is strongly encouraged, especially focusing on freehand sketching, smoother colouring, and better attention to proportions and shading. With regular practice, there will be noticeable improvement in future artworks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:05:21','2026-06-23 10:05:21'),(29810,'judge-event-evaluation-31144-1782173144',31144,626,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,8763,5804,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Good job Maloney! Thank you for effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:05:44','2026-06-23 10:05:44'),(29811,'judge-event-evaluation-31077-1782173158',31077,626,24,24,7,2026,198,'510',NULL,8755,5804,7542,53,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Your project matches your pictures well, but using more unique and creative ideas will help it stand out. Everything on your display board must be written and shown accurately, and you must include your bibliography in the correct format. Thank you for your effort, and I look forward to seeing you do even better at the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:05:58','2026-06-23 10:05:58'),(29812,'judge-event-evaluation-31032-1782173209',31032,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9376,5804,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,74.00,-10,-2.00,'Very Good Work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:06:49','2026-06-23 10:06:49'),(29813,'judge-event-evaluation-31742-1782173254',31742,639,24,24,7,2026,190,'502',NULL,7772,4678,7839,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Great job, Abraham! Your painting has excellent lighting and perfect perspective. To make your next painting even better, try adding more textures and using brighter highlights and darker shadows to make it pop. Awesome work, just make sure it is fully ready to hang next time!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:07:34','2026-06-23 10:07:34'),(29814,'judge-event-evaluation-31748-1782173264',31748,641,24,24,7,2026,18,'060','2',0,5805,7167,9,'Open','3',100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Reshika! Kindly note that there is always room for improvement especially in your display. Also note that spelling and Grammar in your report and your essay is also important. Well done and all the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:07:44','2026-06-23 10:07:44'),(29816,'judge-event-evaluation-31429-1782173322',31429,642,24,24,7,2026,206,'557',NULL,7186,4208,7841,56,'Open',NULL,100,73.00,-10,NULL,'It’s definitely a good design. Would suggest to not add too much of the white paint spots on the dove as it hides the outline of the body. Include the cut x-ray film with the report for further understanding of your step-by-step process. Keep improving!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:08:42','2026-06-23 10:08:42'),(29817,'judge-event-evaluation-31472-1782173334',31472,642,24,24,7,2026,4,'005','1',0,4208,9570,1,NULL,NULL,100,100.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Xinning for the very informative information. \r\nWe are so blessed to have all these herbal plants growing in our backyards. Blessings for the work done. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:08:54','2026-06-23 10:08:54'),(29818,'judge-event-evaluation-31332-1782173446',31332,642,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9527,4208,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,-1.00,'Good work should increase contrast by darkening areas.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:10:46','2026-06-23 10:10:47'),(29819,'judge-event-evaluation-31444-1782173535',31444,626,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,7360,5804,9627,17,'Collection',NULL,100,67.00,-10,NULL,'Impressive work Sailosi! The attention to detail is inspiring.\r\nThank you for your effort!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:12:15','2026-06-23 10:12:15'),(29820,'judge-event-evaluation-30318-1782173545',30318,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9444,55,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Joshua.\r\nThank you for writing your poem. I liked your original, fresh approach. I think you have the right idea so next time try something more difficult. Thank you for following the guidelines. Research guidelines, check the different types of poems, brainstorm for ideas and write. All the best next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:12:25','2026-06-23 10:12:25'),(29822,'judge-event-evaluation-29484-1782173575',29484,607,24,24,7,2026,115,'304',NULL,7639,55,9488,61,'Collection',NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'An outstanding and unique piece of metal sculpture, and an excellent formation. Well done! When doing a metal sculpture, just remember to check that it is done neatly and that there is no gap left when you spray paint. Thank you for trying your best. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:12:55','2026-06-23 10:12:55'),(29823,'judge-event-evaluation-31426-1782173604',31426,642,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9522,4208,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,72.00,-10,-1.00,'Nice work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL