wards excellence. Some hints to take note. 1. Invisible line will give you the depth of your art, from the background to the foreground. 2. Different pencils HB,H,B,B2 and etc gives the different shades 3. The direction of light shows where the shadow falls. Keep on acquiring new skills that will develop the way you do art. God bless you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:16:02','2026-06-23 10:16:02'),(29829,'judge-event-evaluation-31373-1782173801',31373,626,24,24,7,2026,112,'301',NULL,9372,5804,9602,58,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome wood construction Nazarene. I would definitely use this as a storage box for my stationary to keep it organized. Keep up the good work. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:16:41','2026-06-23 10:16:41'),(29831,'judge-event-evaluation-31225-1782173897',31225,607,24,24,7,2026,200,'551',NULL,7804,55,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'This is an outstanding watercolor piece that shows excellent control of the medium and a strong sense of composition. The colors are well-balanced and expressive, creating a pleasing visual harmony. You demonstrate confident brushwork and a clear understanding of blending and tonal variation, which adds depth and life to the artwork. Overall, this is a highly accomplished work with excellent artistic quality, Jiaxing!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:18:17','2026-06-23 10:18:17'),(29832,'judge-event-evaluation-31442-1782173913',31442,626,24,24,7,2026,132,'324',NULL,8765,5804,9545,70,'Collection',NULL,100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Great work, Gemma.\r\nYou still need to have a Pattern submitted so we can judge accordingly.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:18:33','2026-06-23 10:18:33'),(29833,'judge-event-evaluation-31055-1782173950',31055,623,24,24,7,2026,201,'552',NULL,7221,1404,9603,17,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Excellent art work Eloni! However, please sign off on your work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:19:10','2026-06-23 10:19:10'),(29834,'judge-event-evaluation-31393-1782173960',31393,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8799,4208,7167,12,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Hongcheng! Beautiful work and all the best in your other events at convention! vinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:19:20','2026-06-23 10:19:20'),(29835,'judge-event-evaluation-30513-1782174020',30513,617,24,24,7,2026,112,'301',NULL,8769,5806,7802,58,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort. Need touch up on your finishing part. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 10:20:20','2026-06-23 10:20:20'),(29836,'judge-event-evaluation-31182-1782174025',31182,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9519,4208,7167,12,'Open',NULL,100,92.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Ivanah! That was creative how you cut and Paste each letter for your Bible verse. Thank you & all the best in your other events at Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N