3 11:31:17'),(29899,'judge-event-evaluation-30859-1782178298',30859,642,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,8715,4208,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Jona,\r\nThank you for submission this year. Great effort in writing poetry. Syllables per line were almost consistent. Thank you for following the guidelines. You obviously have the right idea about writing poetry. Keep reading poems, brainstorming, researching guidelines  and practising different types of poems. All the best at Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:31:38','2026-06-23 11:31:38'),(29900,'judge-event-evaluation-31030-1782178325',31030,626,24,24,7,2026,112,'301',NULL,9376,5804,7802,58,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Good job. Scratches on the timber need vanishing would bring out the finishing product.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:32:05','2026-06-23 11:32:05'),(29901,'judge-event-evaluation-31259-1782178346',31259,642,24,24,7,2026,198,'510',NULL,8712,4208,NULL,53,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,0.00,'Great job on a well-presented project with clean, straightforward geometry. To stand out even more next time, try using tape-masking or precise carving for sharper lines, and push your creative ideas further. Also, make sure your display board is entirely accurate and your bibliography is perfectly formatted for the next convention. Thank you for your effort, and I look forward to seeing you do even better at the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:32:26','2026-06-23 11:32:26'),(29902,'judge-event-evaluation-31358-1782178389',31358,642,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,9521,4208,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Impressive.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:33:09','2026-06-23 11:33:09'),(29903,'judge-event-evaluation-31259-1782178444',31259,642,24,24,7,2026,198,'510',NULL,8712,4208,7542,53,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Great job on a well-presented project with clean, straightforward geometry. To stand out even more next time, try using tape-masking or precise carving for sharper lines, and push your creative ideas further. Also, make sure your display board is entirely accurate and your bibliography is perfectly formatted for the next convention. Thank you for your effort, and I look forward to seeing you do even better at the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:34:04','2026-06-23 11:34:04'),(29905,'judge-event-evaluation-31017-1782178505',31017,626,24,24,7,2026,190,'502',NULL,9373,5804,7839,17,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful piece .The mix of blue, purple, and pink looks very peaceful. The dark mountains and black birds stand out nicely against the bright sky.Next time you can make the sun the brightest spot so it looks like it is really glowing.The water at the bottom, make the reflection look more like the colors in the sky. Great work!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:35:05','2026-06-23 11:35:05'),(29907,'judge-event-evaluation-31098-1782178649',31098,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,8758,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort on the lily with a clear and recognizable form,Miri!. Work on smoother color blending and stronger shading contrast to add more depth and realism.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:37:29','2026-06-23 11:37:29'),(29908,'judge-event-evaluation-30913-1782178736',30913,623,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,7610,1404,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,78.00,-10,-2.00,'Impressive work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:38:56','2026-06-23 11:38:56'),(29909,'judge-event-evaluation-30994-1782178836',30994,623,24,24,7,2026,129,'321',NULL,9466,1404,9570,69,NULL,NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for the beautiful work, Tarek.\r\nJust a few hints to help you improve your embroidery, dear. \r\n1. Always include a picture or photo of your idea. \r\n2, try to learn the name of the embroidery stitches you use.\r\n3, avoid using knots to finish off.\r\nYou have the skill so keep working on improving those skills. Blessings on future creations.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:40:36','2026-06-23 11:40:36'),(29910,'judge-event-evaluation-30513-1782178933',30513,617,24,24,7,2026,112,'301',NULL,8769,5806,9602,58,'Collection',NULL,100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Asivorosi on your wood construction. Continue to be creative and keep practicing. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:42:13','2026-06-23 11:42:13'),(29912,'judge-event-evaluation-31179-1782