ncils that will improve your art such as H,HB,B B2 and etc.\r\n2. Light direction will indicate the fall of the shadow.3. The different shading will bring out both text texture and depth. 3. The report should have the steps and sequence of the progress of your work not a  draft as in English composition. Keep up the great work and God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:53:32','2026-06-23 11:53:32'),(29929,'judge-event-evaluation-31147-1782179689',31147,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,8761,5804,9610,17,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort and composition, Joel, but the use of overly bright colors reduces realism. Work on balancing tones and using more natural color variations to improve depth and overall harmony.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:54:49','2026-06-23 11:54:49'),(29930,'judge-event-evaluation-31427-1782179771',31427,642,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,9522,4208,9488,56,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!. An effort well portrayed as the colors chosen are striking, capturing attention. Just remember to check the guidelines and follow them for a better understanding of what to expect. Good try. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:56:11','2026-06-23 11:56:11'),(29932,'judge-event-evaluation-31258-1782179808',31258,642,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,8712,4208,9488,56,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done!. A lovely printing piece is portrayed. Just remember to include your original cuttings and follow the guidelines to help out with your printing. Job well done!. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:56:48','2026-06-23 11:56:48'),(29933,'judge-event-evaluation-31218-1782179823',31218,626,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,7359,5804,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Good effort and solid overall structure, but the proportions of the trunk are too large, which affects realism. Focus on correcting scale and proportion to improve accuracy, Harold.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:57:03','2026-06-23 11:57:03'),(29934,'judge-event-evaluation-31143-1782179888',31143,626,24,24,7,2026,190,'502',NULL,8763,5804,7839,17,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'The color blend looks like a real sunset and the trees at the bottom show a exactly where the ground is . You can use a darker color behind the yellow lights this will make them really glow.Next time ,try using a smaller brush to make the moon shape neat. You did a great job !',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 11:58:08','2026-06-23 11:58:08'),(29935,'judge-event-evaluation-31739-1782180002',31739,639,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,8878,4678,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Very good work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:00:02','2026-06-23 12:00:02'),(29937,'judge-event-evaluation-31102-1782180059',31102,626,24,24,7,2026,14,'056','1',0,5804,9570,1,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,NULL,NULL,'Your project is good, Mans