ank you for following the guidelines. To gain more points, research on poetry writing as well as reading and reflecting on the different types of poems. You have the right idea so keep writing. All the best in Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:18:56','2026-06-23 12:18:56'),(29955,'judge-event-evaluation-30483-1782181237',30483,617,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,7819,5806,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Very Impressive work-Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:20:37','2026-06-23 12:20:37'),(29956,'judge-event-evaluation-31158-1782181238',31158,626,24,24,7,2026,120,'310',NULL,7356,5804,9485,54,NULL,NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Praised for creativity and effort in making the scrapbook about the New Zealand trip, which  is seen as memorable and well done. Decorations and designs are good. Well done!\r\nThe background is noted as too plain, with a suggestion to use a brighter background to enhance the overall look.\r\n\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:20:38','2026-06-23 12:20:38'),(29957,'judge-event-evaluation-31435-1782181349',31435,626,24,24,7,2026,5,'009','2',0,5804,9545,9,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Great presentation, Harold!\r\n1. As with all presentation, Neatness is very important.\r\n  So, I would suggest, using hot glue gun to glue your coins onto the book.\r\n2. Your paper cut outs should also be cut out neatly.\r\n3. Bibliography and References needs to be included, page on its own.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:22:29','2026-06-23 12:22:29'),(29959,'judge-event-evaluation-30995-1782181361',30995,623,24,24,7,2026,193,'505',NULL,9466,1404,9610,17,NULL,NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A well-drawn piece with good color application and detail, Tarei. Completing the background would improve the overall presentation and help the subject stand out more effectively.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:22:41','2026-06-23 12:22:41'),(29960,'judge-event-evaluation-31356-1782181374',31356,607,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,9444,55,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'A good work effort had been shown on this artwork. These are some points that will help you to expand your skills and creativity. 1. The main object should be placed in the center. 2. They are different types of pencils that will bring out a various shades and textures. 3. The direction of light will indicate where the shadow fall. 4. The report must show the steps and sequence of your work . Keep on pressing on the good work and God bless. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 12:22:54','2026-06-23 12:22:54'),(29962,'judge-event-evaluation-31034-1782181572',31034,626,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,9374,5804,7839,17,'Collection',NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Very artistic indeed.The duckling looks very fluffy and cute.Next time you can leave a tiny white spot in the dark eye. This makes it look alive and shiny.You can add a simple ground line so the duckling does not look like it is floating .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NUL