han this. Complex of constructing but yet easy to set it up. Well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:01:30','2026-06-29 09:08:27'),(30006,'judge-event-evaluation-31459-1782183706',31459,642,24,24,7,2026,206,'557',NULL,8799,4208,9488,56,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'A printing piece that had a lovely color chosen for the printing piece. Just remember to read the guidelines to have a fair idea of what to expect in printing. And also be sure that it is neatly done before submitting. Great job!. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:01:46','2026-06-23 13:01:46'),(30007,'judge-event-evaluation-30846-1782183816',30846,623,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9472,1404,7166,6,NULL,NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Hello Tiatiana,\r\nThank you for your entry into poetry writing this year. I liked your topic, sincerity and expression. I would just add a caution about plagiarism which is included in the guidelines. Also check other online resources for writing poetry. You have the right idea. It only needs lots of practice and the knowledge for writing.  Its all part of learning for teachers and students alike. All the best for Student Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:03:36','2026-06-23 13:03:36'),(30008,'judge-event-evaluation-31458-1782184010',31458,642,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,9524,4208,9485,56,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'The gold colored bird print on a green background is noted as having a unique and appealing style. The bird\'s printing is good overall, though there is a slight print offset. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:06:50','2026-06-23 13:06:50'),(30009,'judge-event-evaluation-31767-1782184047',31767,641,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,9503,5805,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,67.00,-10,-3.00,'Good effort. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:07:27','2026-06-23 13:07:27'),(30010,'judge-event-evaluation-31405-1782184081',31405,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,8717,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,0.00,'The project matches the provided pictures well and features smooth paint application on the canvas panels.  You needs more unique, creative ideas and better tape-sealing to prevent paint bleeding under boundaries. Finally, a properly formatted bibliography must be included on the display board to complete the presentation. Good job, can be better to the next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:08:01','2026-06-23 13:08:01'),(30011,'judge-event-evaluation-31358-1782184094',31358,642,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,9521,4208,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'You have put a good amount of effort on this project. Some notes to consider to improve your capability in the area of art..\r\n1. Apply these types of pencils., HB, H,B,B2 and etc it will bring out the depth and the texture of your work. 2. The direction of light will show where the shadow falls. 3. The reports should show the steps and sequence of your work. Keep up the good work and may God bless you. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:08:14','2026-06-23 13:08:14'),(30012,'judge-event-evaluation-31392-1782184270',31392,642,24,24,7,2026,136,'351',NULL,8717,4208,7168,58,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good try for a wall hanging. Could do better. Be specific with your documentation, I have noted you use paints as well. However, Great Job, Tokasa.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:11:10','2026-06-26 09:24:25'),(30013,'judge-event-evaluation-31193-1782184270',31193,642,24,24,7,2026,206,'557',NULL,9519,4208,9488,56,'Open',NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'A well-presented piece portraying a lion. This piece was very creative, with fine colors chosen to capture the audience. The right choice of color was used for the Lion that stood out. Just remember to bring the original engraving for the printing. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:11:10','2026-06-23 13:11:10'),(30014,'judge-event-evaluation-31444-1782184532',31444,626,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,7360,5804,7839,17,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you !A wonderful drawing style.The dark shadow lines under the house makes it look real and the  bright white wall next to the dark black shadow make the the drawing pop. You can fill the space by adding rocks ,trees or grass .Great work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:15:32','2026-06-23 13:15:32'),(30015,'judge-event-evaluation-31369-1782184593',31369,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,9520,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,0.00,'The project matches the provided pictures well and your work needs more unique, creative ideas and better tape-sealing to prevent paint bleeding under boundaries. Finally, a properly formatted bibliography must be included. Thank you for your effort, and look forward to seeing you even better to next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:16:33','2026-06-23 13:16:33'),(30016,'judge-event-evaluation-31270-1782184685',31270,642,24,24,7,2026,206,'557',NULL,7181,4208,9488,56,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,-10,NULL,'A work piece well done. The deer portrayed on the print was outstanding!. Just remember to follow the guidelines to have a fair idea of what to expect in the printing. well done !. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:18:05','2026-06-23 13:18:05'),(30017,'judge-event-evaluation-31389-1782184958',31389,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,7562,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,-10,0.00,'Great work and well presented. Always include your source with a correct format. Thank you for your effort and can be doing better for next year convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 13:22:38','2026-06-23 13:22:38'),(30019,'judge-event-evaluation-31221-1782185809',31221,642,24,24,7,2026,136,'351',NULL,8715,4208,7168,58,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good Job, however be more careful with your documentation. Appropriate box was not tick correctly in your report. Great effort for building a tool box.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL