he shadow falls.3. In the report it must state the sequence and steps for of the project. Practice with new ideas that will produce excellence. Don’t give up may God bless your future endeavors.  \r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 14:14:02','2026-06-23 14:14:02'),(30024,'judge-event-evaluation-31198-1782188756',31198,642,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,8715,4208,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Wonderful work, indeed that has been demonstrated on this project. Just something to take note.1. It is important to start with an invisible line that will give a good placement of depth of a where your main object will be placed. 2. In the glass bottle it is clear to see the bottom of it so I reckon if it’s a glass mug, it should be so. But it seems the mug would be ceramic on which doesn’t show the bottom. So it is important to decide the type of object that will be drawn ahead of time. Thank you for the great work. May God continue to bless you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 14:25:56','2026-06-23 14:25:56'),(30025,'judge-event-evaluation-29610-1782189530',29610,607,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,9364,55,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'You have a good amount of effort on your project. Some suggestions that will help you to produce an excellent work.\r\n1. Playing variation of pencils will bring about the depth and texture .2.  Direction of light and where the shed falls will give an effective presentation.  Keep on learning and grasping new ideas that will improve your work through the level of excellence.. God bless you for your work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 14:38:50','2026-06-23 14:38:50'),(30026,'judge-event-evaluation-30228-1782190007',30228,607,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,7693,55,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,56.00,-10,NULL,'Thanks for the wonderful effort that you did on this project. Some important things to not note 1. The main object must be in the center.2. Use the various types of pencils to bring about shades, texture and depth. 3. The direction of the light reproduce where the shade fall. Get new ideas and do a lot of practice that reproduce for excellent work, may God bless you',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 14:46:47','2026-06-23 14:46:47'),(30028,'judge-event-evaluation-30510-1782190582',30510,617,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,7272,5806,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'You have put a great effort to bring about this tremendous work of art. Keep on learning new skills  and practice will give you excellence in the area of art. May the Lord continue to bless you as you excel in this area for the glory of God..\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 14:56:22','2026-06-23 14:56:22'),(30029,'judge-event-evaluation-31179-1782190895',31179,642,24,24,7,2026,176,'454',NULL,9519,4208,8702,2,'Open','12',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Bula Ivanah,\r\nThank you for your submission. Just a few tips to improve on come next year.\r\n1. Make sure the subject is the main focus in the photo. There should not be any distractions around the subject. For example; trees and people etc. Make sure to blur the background if there are so many distractions.\r\n2. You can always edit/enhance the picture for a good and brighter color composition of the photo.\r\nHowever, thank you for your hard work in getting this entry submitted. All the best for convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 15:01:35','2026-06-23 15:01:35'),(30030,'judge-event-evaluation-31401-1782191337',31401,642,24,24,7,2026,176,'454',NULL,8715,4208,8702,2,'Open','5,12',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Bula vinaka Jona,\r\nThank you for your submission. Please kindly note these few points;\r\n1. There are too many distractions in this photo. However, there is no focus on the subject.\r\n2. You can always blur out the distractions such as people, and take a clear and closer short of a single rugby player\r\nin the field to be the subject in this case.\r\nAgain, great effort Jona. There is always room for improvements. All the best for convention this year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 15:08:57','2026-06-23 15:08:57'),(30034,'judge-event-evaluation-30315-1782199320',30315,607,24,24,7,2026,6,'012',NULL,7675,55,7165,6,'Collection',NULL,100,55.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for the effort put in but please be careful when you use the internet as your guide because it could end up doing your work for you and takes away your own creativity & ability.\r\n\r\nEnjoy Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 17:22:00','2026-06-23 17:22:00'),(30035,'judge-event-evaluation-30695-1782199546',30695,607,24,24,7,2026,159,'400',NULL,8830,55,7165,2,'Collection','7',100,0.00,-10,-5.00,'Great photo Ziyi but remember that a Portraiture is of a person and not for food. This could have been entered under GENERAL category.\r\n\r\nEnjoy Student Convention 2026 ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 17:25:46','2026-06-29 10:02:51'),(30036,'judge-event-evaluation-31099-1782199869',31099,626,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,8758,5804,9485,56,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,NULL,'The image is distinctive and highlights the turtle well. The colors effectively represents the turtle\'s natural tones. the picture and background should be kept clean and tidy for better presentation.\r\nGood effort done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 17:31:09','2026-06-23 17:31:09'),(30037,'judge-event-evaluation-31756-1782200018',31756,623,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,9470,1404,7165,2,'Collection','10',100,86.00,-10,-2.00,'Awesome Eparama. Remember your size criteria, it must be 8\" x 10\" (yours was 8.3\" x 11.8\")!\r\nKeep working on your photography skills.\r\n\r\nEnjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 17:33:38','2026-06-23 17:33:38'),(30038,'judge-event-evaluation-30962-1782200214',30962,607,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,7675,55,7165,7,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,-5.00,'Good effort, however your Poetry writing was submitted to short story writing portal!\r\n\r\nPlease be careful in future.\r\nEnjoy Student Convention 2026',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 17:36:54','2026-06-29 11:13:32'),(30039,'judge-event-evaluation-31154-1782200397',31154,626,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,8762,5804,9