,NULL,7249,5806,7839,2,'Collection','8',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Great work .This piece should be in the macro event as it captures the extreme close-up photography, typically capturing tiny subjects .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 19:53:26','2026-06-23 19:53:26'),(30051,'judge-event-evaluation-30533-1782208910',30533,617,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,7267,5806,7839,2,'Collection','8',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'The colors are incredibly bright and beautiful. The deep pink flowers look great against the green leaves. The left side feels a bit crowded, and some flowers are cut off by the edge. Moving a bit to the left to capture the flower will minimise that. Overall , great effort in taking this photo.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 20:01:50','2026-06-23 20:01:50'),(30052,'judge-event-evaluation-30529-1782209396',30529,617,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,8770,5806,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'To the viewers ,the photo feel very peaceful.The bird looks beautiful as a dark shape against the bright water.The sparkling of the water under the bird\'s feet is wonderful .Great shot indeed.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-23 20:09:56','2026-06-23 20:09:56'),(30053,'judge-event-evaluation-30540-1782209934',30540,617,24,24,7,2026,173,'451',NULL,8792,5806,7839,2,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'A beautiful and charming picture of the cat .You did a great job capturing the cat\'s curious personality and striking gaze. The steel rod right is a distraction and it can be blurred . A bit more light behind the cat would have helped