es to have a fair idea on what to expect in printing. Thank you for trying your best. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 05:14:26','2026-06-24 05:14:26'),(30063,'judge-event-evaluation-31482-1782242203',31482,642,24,24,7,2026,120,'310',NULL,9525,4208,9485,54,NULL,NULL,100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Julia your scrapbook is culturally rich and historically significant. I can see that the scrapbook highlights Fiji\'s early missionary history, marking important cultural and spiritual events. Well done',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 05:16:43','2026-06-24 05:16:43'),(30065,'judge-event-evaluation-31781-1782242431',31781,641,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9489,5805,9613,17,NULL,NULL,100,82.00,-10,-1.00,'Nice work, good imagination.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 05:20:31','2026-06-24 05:20:32'),(30066,'judge-event-evaluation-31454-1782242620',31454,642,24,24,7,2026,206,'557',NULL,8716,4208,9488,56,'Open',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'The printing is a lovely piece, showing a pineapple, as the orange and dark green color stands out with a light color as its background. Just remember to include your original stencil when submitting and follow the guidelines to have a fair idea on what to expect in printing. Great job!. All the best at the convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 05:23:40','2026-06-24 05:23:40'),(30067,'judge-event-evaluatio