t background and white handprint grab the attention. The colors are well balanced, and mixing shapes with a handprint is very creative. To improve, you should use tape to make the lines straighter and add a second layer of paint so the colors look solid. Thank you for your effort, and look forward to seeing you even better  next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:23:39','2026-06-24 06:23:39'),(30086,'judge-event-evaluation-31352-1782247214',31352,607,24,24,7,2026,130,'322',NULL,8840,55,9545,69,'Collection',NULL,100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Rishika!\r\n1. Use a slightly thicker yarn or double up your strands to fully cover the plastic grid holes.\r\n2.Maintain one stitch direction for a unified texture(Orange and light blue at the bottom shows inconsistency.)\r\n3. You need to submit a Pattern, which I don\'t see.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:40:14','2026-06-24 06:40:14'),(30087,'judge-event-evaluation-31475-1782247302',31475,642,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,7560,4208,9485,56,NULL,NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'For your print, the green leaf against a light blue background is described as a nice match, showing good thought in color choicIe.\r\nThe design idea is strong and visually pleasing, but the lack of clarity and not clear printing reduce its impact.\r\nImproving neatness and good printing would elevate the quality significantly.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:41:42','2026-06-24 06:41:42'),(30088,'judge-event-evaluation-31077-1782247452',31077,626,24,24,7,2026,198,'510',NULL,8755,5804,7839,53,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Good job !Very intresting art work .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:44:12','2026-06-24 06:44:12'),(30089,'judge-event-evaluation-31746-1782247591',31746,641,24,24,7,2026,18,'060','3',0,5805,7167,9,'Open','3',100,96.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you Jordan! You have put up and interesting display. Thank you for the effort in putting this research together. However, there\'s always room for improvement. All the best in your other events at Student Convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:46:31','2026-06-24 06:46:31'),(30090,'judge-event-evaluation-31243-1782247760',31243,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,7181,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,0.00,'Your  artwork looks very neat and uses bright colors that fill the shapes nicely. You worked really hard to draw many different geometric patterns and chose a great frame for display. To improve, you should color more heavily to hide the white paper gaps and try using different tools to add texture. Thank you for your effort, and look forward to seeing you even better to next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:49:20','2026-06-24 06:49:20'),(30091,'judge-event-evaluation-31727-1782247812',31727,641,24,24,7,2026,18,'060','1',0,5805,9545,9,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,NULL,NULL,'Congratulations on a job well done!!\r\nYou have dissected this very well, and your explanations are quite clear!\r\nVinaka',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:50:12','2026-06-24 06:50:12'),(30092,'judge-event-evaluation-31258-1782247841',31258,642,24,24,7,2026,195,'507',NULL,8712,4208,9485,56,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,NULL,'The red flower on a white background is praised as good and unique, showing strong visual appeal. The clean white background enhances the uniqueness and makes the flower  stand out.\r\nThe concept and color choice are excellent, giving the flower a unique and striking presence.\r\nHowever , refining the edges with more precesion would elevate the print  from \'good and unique\' to truely stand out .\r\nWell done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:50:41','2026-06-24 06:50:41'),(30093,'judge-event-evaluation-31748-1782248098',31748,641,24,24,7,2026,18,'060','2',0,5805,9545,9,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done, Reshika!\r\nI love the way you came across quite strong on how it\'s our biblical responsibility to take care of our environment.\r\nThank you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:54:58','2026-06-24 06:54:58'),(30094,'judge-event-evaluation-31430-1782248216',31430,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,7565,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,75.00,-10,0.00,'You  should use painter\'s tape  to improve and to keep the lines perfectly straight and clean where different colors meet. The distribution of the large shapes is well-balanced across the page to create an energetic abstract design. Thank you for your effort, and look forward to seeing you even better to next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:56:56','2026-06-24 06:56:56'),(30095,'judge-event-evaluation-31210-1782248319',31210,642,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,7557,4208,7839,17,NULL,NULL,100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Nice piece of art .The subject really stand out against the white paper and the thick drips of wax looks real .Thank you for the great effort you put in doing this .',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:58:39','2026-06-24 06:58:39'),(30096,'judge-event-evaluation-29651-1782248390',29651,607,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,9366,55,7841,53,'Open',NULL,100,52.00,-10,NULL,'Please ensure that the 500 word explanation was submitted with the report as per the guidelines, as well as the framing of your project(also stated in the guidelines). I suggest to work on an A4 drawing paper, not on a paint canvas as your artwork needs to be framed and ready to hang. Good effort! Keep aiming for the best!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 06:59:50','2026-06-24 06:59:50'),(30097,'judge-event-evaluation-31414-1782248588',31414,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,7186,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,0.00,'Great work and  looks very clean and bright because the thick black lines separate the colors perfectly. Always very creative and you should press a bit harder or apply a second layer to eliminate any faint coloring streaks within the shapes. Look forward to seeing you even better to next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:03:08','2026-06-24 07:03:08'),(30098,'judge-event-evaluation-30992-1782248774',30992,642,24,24,7,2026,202,'553',NULL,7183,4208,7483,17,'Open',NULL,100,60.00,-10,NULL,'You did your best on this project acquire new skills and techniques it will produce excellence. These are some points to consider. 1. Use pencils H,HB, B B2 etc will give more expression on your wok. 2. Shading and light direction will enhance the depth of 2 or 3 dimensional. 3. It would be effective when the main object is fully seen. Keep on practicing with the new skills with right attitude.God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:06:14','2026-06-24 07:06:14'),(30099,'judge-event-evaluation-31746-1782248978',31746,641,24,24,7,2026,18,'060','3',0,5805,9545,9,'Open',NULL,100,100.00,NULL,NULL,'Well done, Jordan!\r\nYou\'ve articulated your research and thoughts quite clearly.\r\nThank you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:09:38','2026-06-24 07:09:38'),(30100,'judge-event-evaluation-31196-1782249074',31196,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,8715,4208,7841,53,'Open',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Please ensure that the 500 word explanation is submitted with your report, and the artwork is framed and ready to be hung, as per the guidelines. It is a good project. I’d like to suggest having the lines a little more thinner to make the colours more stand out, as well as framing it to project against dust stains along the sides. Keep improving this unique skill.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:11:14','2026-06-24 07:11:14'),(30101,'judge-event-evaluation-31178-1782249140',31178,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,9521,4208,7542,53,'Open',NULL,100,85.00,-10,0.00,'You  did an excellent job keeping the outline lines straight and thin throughout the entire composition.  You should color in multiple directions or layer the markers more carefully to smooth out the visible stroke streaks. Thank you for the good work and look forward to seeing you even better to next convention.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:12:20','2026-06-24 07:12:20'),(30102,'judge-event-evaluation-31318-1782249249',31318,642,24,24,7,2026,194,'506',NULL,7204,4208,7839,17,'Collection',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Very artistic .Great work. Both sides look neat and equal , showing long pointy legs looks very dramatic. Just some improvement on this -Spiders need eight long legs and you can draw clearer bumps where the legs bend to look more real. Thank you for the great effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:14:09','2026-06-24 07:14:09'),(30103,'judge-event-evaluation-30997-1782249784',30997,642,24,24,7,2026,209,'560',NULL,7183,4208,7841,53,'Open',NULL,100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Please read the guidelines that state a 500 word explanation must be submitted with the report; the source link of the ideas from Pinterest listed, and to title your project. It’s an awesome piece. Love the different styles. Definitely continue building on this God-given talent!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 07:23:04','2026-06-24 07:23:04'),(30104,'judge-event-evaluation-29604-1782249814',29604,607,24,24,7,2026,201,'552',NULL,8867,55,7823,17,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Good jo