 of the thickest part, so it doesn\'t peek through the open spaces.\r\n2. A report could be written by you, with instructions from mom on Pattern structure, stitch etc.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 08:10:54','2026-06-24 08:10:54'),(30128,'judge-event-evaluation-30493-1782252829',30493,617,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,7813,5806,7483,17,'Collection',NULL,100,64.00,-10,NULL,'You have demonstrated the level of your capability on this project. Some hints to assist you for future projects.1. Use good range of pencils HB,H,B,B1 and etc will bring about the depth and texture. 2. Direction of light and where the shadow fall will reveal the 2 or 3 dimensions of object.  3. It would effective when the subject is on the center of the board. Get new ideas that will improve your skill . God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 08:13:49','2026-06-24 08:13:49'),(30129,'judge-event-evaluation-31828-1782252963',31828,641,24,24,7,2026,131,'323',NULL,9500,5805,9545,70,NULL,NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, Suleigh!\r\n1. This piece curls slightly on the bottom right\r\nOtherwise well done.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 08:16:03','2026-06-24 08:16:03'),(30130,'judge-event-evaluation-31019-1782256215',31019,626,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,9373,5804,NULL,17,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'You have done an amazing project that you’ve displayed for this convention. Something to take note that will help you explore your area of art.  1. There are various tone of pencils H,HB,B,B2 it will produce a realistic resul