L,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-24 23:40:02','2026-06-24 23:40:02'),(30234,'judge-event-evaluation-30546-1782334585',30546,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,5805,NULL,4,NULL,NULL,100,98.00,-10,0.00,'Excellent work, Gabriella! As I view your presentation, I can see that you have put in a lot of planning and preparation into this. This is my first time to know of the Lusitania and in fifteen slides, I was able to capture the marvelous story of its journey (creation to destruction). To get full points, I recommend that you use navigation buttons [on the buttons have the word \'next\'] and thoroughly check spelling & grammar errors. The story of the Lusitania reminds us that God has given us the knowledge and talents to create wonderful things and yet these things will not last. So let us fixed our eyes on what lasts for eternity - our relationship with our Creator! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 06:56:25','2026-06-25 06:56:25'),(30237,'judge-event-evaluation-31477-1782336697',31477,642,24,24,7,2026,191,'503',NULL,7560,4208,7483,17,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Well done, you had shown the effort and your capability on this art project. These are some of the tips that will increase your capability in area of art. 1. There are various types of pencils that will bring about the texture and depth of an object.\r\n2. The direction of light and where the shadow fall creates a 2D or 3D illusion of the object . 3 . The report should mention the steps and sequence from the start to the completion of the project. Keep on learning new skills and God bless your future endeavors.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 07:31:37','2026-