:28:16'),(30296,'judge-event-evaluation-30911-1782359881',30911,623,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7610,1404,9547,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'AI is being used. How shall we judge this?\r\nThank you for being honest in your report.\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 13:58:01','2026-06-29 11:42:43'),(30297,'judge-event-evaluation-30959-1782383668',30959,607,24,24,7,2026,112,'301',NULL,8826,55,9602,58,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'I note that you have used Ice block sticks for your Wood Construction. Please do note that ice block sticks  do not meet the criteria  for Wood Construction. As Judges we encourage students to construct something creative from actual wood, (e.g. plywood, timber) with proper joinery using ( screws, nails, wood glue).  In the future please ensure that you understand the expectations of this event. Don\'t give up Aron, and be more creative on how you can make your Wood Construction stand out. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:34:28','2026-06-26 09:17:32'),(30298,'judge-event-evaluation-30988-1782383813',30988,607,24,24,7,2026,112,'301',NULL,8827,55,9602,58,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'I note that you have used Ice block sticks for your Wood Construction. Please do note that ice block sticks  do not meet the criteria  for Wood Construction. As Judges we encourage students to construct something creative from actual wood, (e.g. plywood, timber) with proper joinery using ( screws, nails, wood glue).  In the future please ensure that you understand the expectations of this event. Don\'t give up Joape, and be more creative on how you can make your Wood Construction stand out with its own unique twist. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:36:53','2026-06-26 09:16:49'),(30305,'judge-event-evaluation-31094-1782384442',31094,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,9378,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome comic Liam, well done.\r\n I encourage you to use more colors so that your comic can look bright, and please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:47:22','2026-06-25 20:47:22'),(30306,'judge-event-evaluation-31157-1782384457',31157,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,7356,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome work Kalani, however it would be great to see both the characters talk more so that whoever reads your comic will know what’s happening in each comic panel, and please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page. Overall you are a very talented and creative person. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:47:37','2026-06-25 20:47:37'),(30307,'judge-event-evaluation-31106-1782384550',31106,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,8764,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome work Manshika, well done. I have three points I would like to encourage with is to use a black pen to outline your work so that your characters can look bold with all the colors, and to add more panels to your comic. Please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page. Overall great work Manshika. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.\r\n ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:49:10','2026-06-25 20:49:10'),(30308,'judge-event-evaluation-31007-1782384624',31007,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,9371,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Great work Perez, well done. Your comic looks nice and colorful, however I would encourage you to use a black pen to outline your work so that it can stand out with the colors, and please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page. Overall your comic looks good with all the colors. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:50:24','2026-06-25 20:50:24'),(30309,'judge-event-evaluation-31088-1782384702',31088,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,9375,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Tapuaki for drawing an awesome comic. I would encourage you to use a black pen to outline your work so that your drawing can stand out, and to use a plain white paper so that when you color your drawings it doesn’t clash with the  colored paper background. Please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page. Otherwise I love your work and your effort put into it. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:51:42','2026-06-25 20:51:42'),(30310,'judge-event-evaluation-31148-1782384725',31148,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,8761,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome drawing and comic theme “Consistent” Joel. For future preferences I would recommend using a black pen after you have drawn out your characters with a pencil to outline your boxes and work so that it can look bold with all the colors, and please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page. Otherwise great effort put into your comic Joel. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:52:05','2026-06-25 20:52:05'),(30311,'judge-event-evaluation-31033-1782384739',31033,626,24,24,7,2026,197,'509',NULL,9374,5804,9602,18,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Faaulufalega, however I encourage you to use a black pen to outline your work so that it can stand out with the color\'s, and probably use a plain white paper so that when you color your characters it won’t clash with the colored paper in the background, and please submit the full 2 page documentation and not just 1 page, . Overall keep it up and keep building up your gift in drawing. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-25 20:52:19','2026-06-25 20:52:19'),(30313,'judge-event-evaluation-29861-1782384945',29861,607,24,24,7,2026,208,'559',NULL,7804,55,9602,18,'Open',NULL,100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing work Justin, well done. \r\nMoving forward, it would be great to see your documentation being written a bit neatly and darker so that judges can be able to read on what you’ve written for your Comic steps, and please submit the full 2 page form documentation and not just 1 page. Overall your comic looks creative and balanced.  God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N