dge-event-evaluation-29823-1782443451',29823,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7679,55,8703,2,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,-10,NULL,'The General Photography Guideline has been breached. \r\nThis entry should have been placed under Scapes because of the vast open sea in the background.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-26 13:10:51','2026-06-29 10:19:40'),(30338,'judge-event-evaluation-29318-1782444957',29318,607,24,24,7,2026,8,'014',NULL,7675,55,8791,8,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,-10,-4.00,'Thank you for your effort.\r\nFor 2027 Convention, improve on IV.\r\nIn addition, a book report should be presented in essay form.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-26 13:35:57','2026-06-26 13:35:57'),(30339,'judge-event-evaluation-30250-1782445488',30250,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7650,55,8703,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Poster guideline breached. \r\nThe work lacks originality and does not meet the requirement for student‑created content. \r\nEntries must reflect the student’s own creative effort rather than relying on pre‑designed or external sources.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-26 13:44:48','2026-06-29 10:24:18'),(30340,'judge-event-evaluation-30232-1782446060',30232,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7679,55,8703,12,NULL,NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Poster guideline breached. \r\nThe work lacks originality, copies ideas from the internet, and shows limited creativity. \r\nEntries must reflect the student’s own creative effort in both concept and execution.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-26 13:54:20','2026-06-29 10:21:07'),(30341,'judge-event-evaluation-30386-1782446150',30386,641,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9499,5805,8703,12,'Collection',NULL,100,90.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank you, Abigail, for your effort. \r\n\r\nIt is a beautiful poster. \r\nContinue to pursue your skills in design.\r\nFor future reference, try to keep your wording simple so that it enhances the balance of your poster. \r\nKeep up the great work! \r\n\r\nGod bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-26 13:55:50','2026-06-26 13:55:50'),(30342,'judge-event-evaluation-29826-1782520252',29826,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8847,55,7240,2,'Open','11',100,78.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips about the composition (the plate is slightly cut off on the right side), and the focus (perhaps instead of uploading as a pdf, simply upload the jpg. file). All in all keep it up and hope to see more in the future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 10:30:52','2026-06-27 10:30:52'),(30343,'judge-event-evaluation-29698-1782520681',29698,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7741,55,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your wonderful entry. Just a tip about the composition, try to get the whole bowl in the image as it cuts out on the sides. Also love the depth of the photo with the focus on the centre, but maybe keep the blur outside the bowl, and the cloth under the bowl being a plain colour will greatly enhance the photo. Keep it up and hope to see more. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 10:38:01','2026-06-27 10:38:01'),(30344,'judge-event-evaluation-29806-1782520996',29806,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8848,55,7240,2,'Open','5,13',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, when preparing to take the photo see if there are any items that may help or distract from the final image (coke bottle, small sign etc.). also don\'t forget to fill out all of the report (lighting conditions). Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 10:43:16','2026-06-27 10:43:16'),(30345,'judge-event-evaluation-30160-1782521265',30160,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7634,55,7240,2,'Open','11',100,59.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you. Unfortunately this photo was placed in the wrong category and age range. Please make sure that the correct event is chosen in the future.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 10:47:45','2026-06-27 10:47:45'),(30346,'judge-event-evaluation-29095-1782521731',29095,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7668,55,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo. Just a tip, keep an eye of the resolution and focus after making edits, sometimes it can cause other areas to appear more pixelated afterwards (grass in the foreground and hills). Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 10:55:31','2026-06-27 10:55:31'),(30347,'judge-event-evaluation-29325-1782522093',29325,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8868,55,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this awesome photo. Just a few tips, with the composition of the photo, perhaps trying several different angles to get the most out of the photo as the edges of the tray are slightly cut off. Also  maybe less of a blur from around the centre of the image and more. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:01:33','2026-06-27 11:01:33'),(30348,'judge-event-evaluation-29677-1782522361',29677,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8869,55,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this wonderful photo. Just a tip, be sure that the photo is composited properly (leaning slightly to the left). Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:06:01','2026-06-27 11:06:01'),(30349,'judge-event-evaluation-30248-1782522799',30248,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7650,55,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this amazing photo. Just a few tips, focus(the flowers are clear, however the area around has more of a pixelated appearance than a blur). Also the car being slightly visible may some distraction. All in all love it and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:13:19','2026-06-27 11:13:19'),(30350,'judge-event-evaluation-29823-1782523126',29823,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7679,55,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you. However this photo would have been better placed in Scape, also the picture is quite heavily pixelated. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:18:46','2026-06-29 10:19:40'),(30351,'judge-event-evaluation-31368-1782523520',31368,642,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,9520,4208,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this amazing photo. Just a few tips, when cropping try not to take too much from the photo as this will go against the guidelines. Also, keep an eye on the focus and resolution as this while begin to dip after cropping. Keep it up and hope to see more. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:25:20','2026-06-27 11:25:20'),(30352,'judge-event-evaluation-31412-1782523736',31412,642,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7186,4208,7240,2,'Open','5,11',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, keep an eye on the lighting, also the composition of the photo (balance, thirds etc.). Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:28:56','2026-06-27 11:28:56'),(30353,'judge-event-evaluation-29324-1782524131',29324,607,24,24,7,2026,176,'454',NULL,8868,55,7240,2,'Open','5,12',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, when taking group photos like this, be sure everyone is ready (one person in the back is blurry(exposure)). With regards to the composition the sign is cut half-way and some one\'s hand can be seen reaching from the right. Lighting can be tricky as well (and fluorescent lighting would be put under artificial lighting on the report). Keep it up and hope to see more. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:35:31','2026-06-27 11:35:31'),(30354,'judge-event-evaluation-31179-1782524400',31179,642,24,24,7,2026,176,'454',NULL,9519,4208,7240,2,'Open','5,12',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Really liked it. Just a few tips, a more focused and well composited photo would really enhance the photo. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:40:00','2026-06-27 11:40:00'),(30355,'judge-event-evaluation-31401-1782524876',31401,642,24,24,7,2026,176,'454',NULL,8715,4208,7240,2,'Open','5,12',100,73.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo. Just a few tips, a more focused photo would have been excellent. Also having the theme be on several players or one, instead of the whole stadium. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:47:56','2026-06-27 11:47:56'),(30356,'judge-event-evaluation-30245-1782525198',30245,607,24,24,7,2026,163,'404',NULL,8851,55,7240,2,'Collection','5,12',100,82.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, getting a closer shot without to much distractions in the background, would help to enhance the photo. Also make sure to fill out the report completely. Hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:53:18','2026-06-27 11:53:18'),(30357,'judge-event-evaluation-31446-1782525558',31446,642,24,24,7,2026,163,'404',NULL,9524,4208,7240,2,'Collection','5,12',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, watch for the focus that it doesn\'t become pixelated(this tends to happen with big group photos after cropping). Also keep an eye on the overall composition of the photo, as well as any thing that may cause distractions. All in all keep it and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 11:59:18','2026-06-27 11:59:18'),(30358,'judge-event-evaluation-31377-1782525860',31377,617,24,24,7,2026,163,'404',NULL,7260,5806,7240,2,'Collection','5,12',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for this amazing photo. Just a few tips, keep an eye on the overall composition of the photo, as well as the lighting and exposure. All in all keep it up and hope to see more. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 12:04:20','2026-06-27 12:04:20'),(30359,'judge-event-evaluation-30956-1782526179',30956,623,24,24,7,2026,164,'405',NULL,7612,1404,7240,2,'Collection','5,13',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a tip, when taking a macro photo of  any insect, try and get as close as possible, to make them appear much larger then usual. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 12:09:39','2026-06-27 12:09:39'),(30360,'judge-event-evaluation-31050-1782526429',31050,623,24,24,7,2026,164,'405',NULL,9474,1404,7240,2,'Collection','5,13',100,0.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you. However this photo should have been entered in the category of Nature, not Macro. Please try again next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 12:13:49','2026-06-28 16:50:44'),(30361,'judge-event-evaluation-30535-1782526690',30535,617,24,24,7,2026,164,'405',NULL,7812,5806,7240,2,'Collection','5,13',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just a few tips, watch for anything in the background that could draw attention from the main focus. Also the overall colour of the photo. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 12:18:10','2026-06-27 12:18:10'),(30362,'judge-event-evaluation-29695-1782526938',29695,607,24,24,7,2026,177,'455',NULL,7743,55,7240,2,'Open','5,13',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'What an awesome photo. Just a tip, trying getting as close as possible so that more focus is on the butterfly. and perhaps not to much blur on everything right around the butterfly, but more so further away. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 12:22:18','2026-06-27 12:22:18'),(30363,'judge-event-evaluation-30532-1782527143',30532,617,24,24,7,2026,177,'455',NULL,7267,5806,7240,2,'Open','5,13',100,85.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your entry. Just keep in mind the composition, lighting and exposure. Also the focus so that the pictured doesn\'t appear pixelated. Keep it up and hope to see more.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 12:25:43','2026-06-27 12:25:43');
INSERT INTO `judgeevaluations` VALUES (30365,'judge-event-evaluation-30546-1782544077',30546,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,5805,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,94.00,-10,0.00,'Excellent work, Gabriella! To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. As I view your presentation, I can see that you have put in a lot of planning and preparation into this. This is my first time to know of the Lusitania and in fifteen slides, I was able to capture the marvelous story of its journey (creation to destruction). To ensure you do not lose points, thoroughly check spelling & grammar errors. The story of the Lusitania reminds us that God has given us the knowledge and talents to create wonderful things and yet these things will not last. So let us fixed our eyes on what lasts for eternity - our relationship with our Creator!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 17:07:57','2026-06-27 17:07:57'),(30366,'judge-event-evaluation-30544-1782544179',30544,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','3',0,5805,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Excellent effort, Jordan. To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. A very interesting and informative presentation. Please keep in mind your choice of pictures so that it is not contradictory to Biblical Worldview. Civilization in Ancient Greece is a very broad topic but you have summarized the key points in a nutshell. The Bible is indeed the true and living word of God. May you and I continue be doers of God\'s word and not hearers only.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 17:09:39','2026-06-27 17:09:39'),(30367,'judge-event-evaluation-30487-1782544488',30487,617,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,5806,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Excellent effort, Narieta. To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. Your presentation is simple yet you were very creative in how you managed your pictures. Your choice of words made it easier for the viewer to understand the content. It is truly amazing to see the development of aircrafts; how it gets better and refined till today. Likewise, you and I are a work in progress; God is still refining us to become better ambassadors for Him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 17:14:48','2026-06-27 17:14:48'),(30368,'judge-event-evaluation-31404-1782544616',31404,642,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','1',0,4208,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,73.00,-10,0.00,'Thank you for your efforts, Tokasa and Litiana! To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. I believe that your presentation portrays an experience that you both have had which we can all relate to. However, I know that both of you would have done an excellent work if you had spent time to thoroughly plan the content of each slide. Please remember to use pictures that is consistent with the Convention Dress Code so that you do not lose points in this regard. As I watch your presentation, it brings to mind a true friend that we can rely on and the song \"What a friend we have in Jesus\"',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 17:16:56','2026-06-27 17:16:56'),(30371,'judge-event-evaluation-30129-1782548303',30129,626,24,24,7,2026,171,'415','2',0,5804,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Great effort, Imanuela! To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. However, you have chosen an interesting topic and the information and pictures you have presented were very appropriate. Before submitting your work, it would be wise to check it thoroughly - parts of a sentence were hidden due to a picture in front of it. We are thankful for the Aloe Vera plant and its beneficial use to us and we stand in awe of the one who created the aloe vera plant - God! ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 18:18:23','2026-06-27 18:18:23'),(30372,'judge-event-evaluation-30127-1782548418',30127,626,24,24,7,2026,171,'415','1',0,5804,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Well done, Shiloh! To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. However, you have neatly presented your slides with bullet points and one picture only. For the seven women of the Bible you have selected, you have highlighted an appropriate character they have displayed in their lifetime. Before submitting your work, it would be wise to check it thoroughly for typing errors etc. Yes, you are true that God will use anyone who has a willing heart to do his will. May we be courageous enough to stand up and say \"Here am I Lord, send me\" when an opportunity arises.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 18:20:18','2026-06-27 18:20:18'),(30373,'judge-event-evaluation-30547-1782548533',30547,641,24,24,7,2026,184,'465','2',0,5805,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,88.00,-10,0.00,'Excellent work, Caleb! To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. However, your powerpoint was very interesting and neat. You have also used appropriate pictures to get your message across. Before submitting your work, it would be wise to check it thoroughly - parts of a sentence were hidden due to a picture in front of it. It is truly amazing how God has created the brain and its capacity to instruct the other parts of the body. Your presentation reminds us that God will keep in perfect peace whose mind is stayed on Him.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 18:22:13','2026-06-27 18:22:13'),(30374,'judge-event-evaluation-31465-1782550919',31465,642,24,24,7,2026,171,'415','1',0,4208,9605,4,NULL,NULL,100,93.00,-10,0.00,'Excellent work, Yuvaan! To gain full marks I recommend that you read and understand the guidelines. After viewing your presentation, this should have been entered in the linear powerpoint event. However, your slides were succinctly presented engaging the viewer visually and mentally. Your design was simple yet looked professional. The raven was a bird that God used to sustain the prophet Elijah and also, Noah sent the raven to check whether the floodwaters had receded. This bird is one of God\'s marvelous creation. You and I are reminded that we must praise and worship the Creator of the raven!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 19:01:59','2026-06-27 19:01:59'),(30375,'judge-event-evaluation-30208-1782551301',30208,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8866,55,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,66.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your entry. Making the font a different colour would enhance the message of the poster. I would encourage to keep experimenting with poster ideas and the degree of difficulty in designing them.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 19:08:21','2026-06-27 19:08:21'),(30376,'judge-event-evaluation-30984-1782551803',30984,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8847,55,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,61.00,NULL,NULL,'I would encourage you to experiment with your poster production. A poster is more than just finding a picture and pasting a scripture onto it. There is much that can be done in font production in a poster to enhance the message. Keep experimenting and you\'ll be amazed at how your creativity develops.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 19:16:43','2026-06-27 19:16:43'),(30377,'judge-event-evaluation-29801-1782552561',29801,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7671,55,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,60.00,NULL,NULL,'If your birth year is 2010, that means you\'re turning 16 this year and you should have entered the \'Open\' category, Florence. When designing a message for a poster, it is very important that the picture matches the message you\'re wanting the viewer to receive. The scripture you\'ve chosen is a warning in Proverbs for us to avoid lifestyles that lure us away from God and His principles, yet you\'ve chosen a happy, laughing dog picture for that message so the viewer is receiving a mixed message when looking at the poster. The dog picture would be better for a message involving joy or freedom. In choosing a frame for the picture, a thinner border would not be quite as distracting to the message you\'re wanting the viewer to receive. Keep experimenting and you\'ll develop in your creativity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 19:29:21','2026-06-27 19:29:21'),(30379,'judge-event-evaluation-30246-1782553484',30246,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9352,55,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,65.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your poster, Lemuel. Remember that a poster requires a lot of thought and creativity. It is not as simple as finding a picture and typing a message onto the poster. A lot of creativity needs to go into the choice of font and font colour/design with creativity and effort in enhancing the font to match the poster. Your paperwork does not mention anything about your choice of the font to match the photo. Each step should be outlined/explained from beginning to end. keep experimenting with fonts production and I\'ll look forward to seeing another poster next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 19:44:44','2026-06-27 19:44:44'),(30380,'judge-event-evaluation-30250-1782553812',30250,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7650,55,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Remember that a poster requires a lot of thought and creativity. It is not as simple as finding a picture and typing a message onto it to call it a poster. A lot of creativity needs to go into the parts of the poster, choice of font and font colour/design with creativity and effort in enhancing the font to match the poster. Your paperwork does not mention anything about your production of the picture or choice of the font to match the photo. Each step should be outlined/explained from beginning to end. Keep experimenting with picture production, fonts production and I\'ll look forward to seeing another poster next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 19:50:12','2026-06-29 10:24:18'),(30381,'judge-event-evaluation-30232-1782554429',30232,607,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7679,55,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Remember that a poster requires a lot of thought and creativity. It is not as simple as finding a picture on the internet and copying it as your own. Unfortunately, this design is a T-shirt designed by someone else and available on the internet, so it is not honest to just copy that and call it your own design. That affects your integrity and is not honest. It\'s a very slippery slope to then enter it as your own poster creation. Please don\'t be tempted to do that.. A lot of creativity needs to go into the production of a poster picture, choice of font and font colour/design with creativity and effort in enhancing the font to match the poster. Each step should be outlined/explained from beginning to end. Keep experimenting with your own original design and I\'ll look forward to seeing another poster next year.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:00:29','2026-06-29 10:21:07'),(30382,'judge-event-evaluation-30386-1782555212',30386,641,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9499,5805,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Your entry should be \'Open\', not \'U16\', Abigail, as you\'re turning 16 this year. Creating a poster is not as simple as just finding a picture and adding text to that picture. I would encourage you to experiment with different design programs which can enhance a picture and also enhance fonts so there\'s effort seen in the production of your poster. Of course, using your own photo is best because then there\'s no copyright issues with using a picture from the internet, as you haven\'t given the details of the picture location as required by the poster report. Keep experimenting with originality and you\'ll see your creativity expand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:13:32','2026-06-27 20:13:32'),(30383,'judge-event-evaluation-30394-1782555835',30394,641,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7530,5805,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster should have been entered in \'Open\' not \'U16\', as you\'re turning 16 this year. Your paperwork needs a lot more explanation. If using your own photo, you need to explain where the picture was taken and then in your explanation steps, outline the work that was done in the actual production of the poster. Creating a poster is more than just adding a scripture to a picture. It involves production/enhancing of the photo and effort and time in enhancing the font choice and font colour. I\'d encourage you to explore more on the internet how to create original posters and you\'ll be surprised how your creativity develops.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:23:55','2026-06-27 20:23:55'),(30384,'judge-event-evaluation-29799-1782555853',29799,607,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9350,55,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Chelsea and well done on taking a cool structure photo of the University of RMIT in Melbourne. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:24:13','2026-06-27 20:24:13'),(30385,'judge-event-evaluation-31236-1782556370',31236,623,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9472,1404,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your efforts. I would encourage you to work on your paperwork to explain your choice of the picture and the font, as a poster is more than just typing a scripture onto a picture. It involves creativity in enhancing a picture and creativity in the choice of font, font colour and placement of the font on the picture. Each step has to be explained on your paperwork so a judge can see the amount of thought and work that\'s gone into the production of the poster. Keep experimenting and you\'ll see your creativity develop.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:32:50','2026-06-27 20:32:50'),(30388,'judge-event-evaluation-30996-1782557004',30996,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7183,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Your poster should be entered as \'Open\' and not \'U16\' as you\'re turning 16 this year.\r\nThank-you for your efforts. Remember that a poster is not as simple as having a picture and typing in a scripture or message + making sure there are no punctuation errors. It involves a lot of creativity in enhancing the picture and then time and effort in choice of font, creativity in font production etc. I would encourage you to explore Publisher and other computer programs that teach about picture and font enhancement and you\'ll be amazed at how creative your next Poster entry will be.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:43:24','2026-06-27 20:43:24'),(30389,'judge-event-evaluation-31281-1782557449',31281,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9521,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,72.00,NULL,NULL,'Your picture and verse match well, Gideon. I would encourage you to experiment more with font choices, colours and sizing, as the message is the most important thing for the viewer to see. Where the verse is from should be a smaller size and underneath the scripture, as the verse is the most important message you want the viewer to see. There needs to be effort seen in the composition of the font as it\'s not just as simple as choosing a font and typing it in. There are many enhancements you can do with fonts to show the effort in the production of the poster. Keep experimenting and you\'ll develop more in your creativity...thanks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:50:49','2026-06-27 20:50:49'),(30390,'judge-event-evaluation-30689-1782557878',30689,607,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7700,55,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Arielle for taking a good vehicle photo. Moving forward, I would encourage you to be creative on how you can make your vehicle photo stand out, and maybe you can go on google to get ideas for your photo and then add your own unique twist to it. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:57:58','2026-06-27 20:57:58'),(30391,'judge-event-evaluation-31393-1782557948',31393,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8799,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,66.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your entry. Always remember that a poster is much more than just finding a picture (in your paperwork, you have to list the picture link details from Pinterest) and typing in a message. It involves creativity in both the production of the picture, as well as the choice of a font and then enhancing the font to show effort in the production of the final poster. Please keep experimenting to enhance your creativity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 20:59:08','2026-06-27 20:59:08'),(30392,'judge-event-evaluation-29817-1782558260',29817,607,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7673,55,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,79.00,-10,NULL,'',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:04:20','2026-06-27 21:04:20'),(30393,'judge-event-evaluation-31182-1782558451',31182,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9519,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'I admire the effort you took in composing your poster, Ivanah. I would suggest experimenting with different font choices and artwork so that your message is clearly seen. I remember someone explaining Convention posters to me many years ago that it\'s similar to a billboard sign on the highway when you drive past. The viewer must be able to see the message in less that 1-2 seconds and if it takes longer than that, then the message has been lost. Keep experimenting and you\'ll develop more in your creativity...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:07:31','2026-06-27 21:07:31'),(30394,'judge-event-evaluation-29785-1782558679',29785,607,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7649,55,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,89.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo taken from the Sky tower Mackey, keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:11:19','2026-06-27 21:11:19'),(30395,'judge-event-evaluation-31197-1782558859',31197,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8715,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Your entry should be in \'Open\', not \'U16\', as you\'re turning 16 this year.\r\nPlease remember that creating a poster is more than just choosing a photo and typing in a scripture to match the photo. It involves enhancement of the picture and more so, creativity and effort in the choice of font and font enhancements. I\'d encourage you to experiment more with different computer programs in learning how to enhance pictures and fonts for maximum creativity and effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:14:19','2026-06-27 21:14:19'),(30396,'judge-event-evaluation-31127-1782558973',31127,607,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9356,55,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,87.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome vehicle photo Sharon, well done on the effort put into this photo. Continue to practice and build up your photography skills. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:16:13','2026-06-27 21:16:13'),(30397,'judge-event-evaluation-30243-1782559012',30243,607,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8851,55,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome shot Simon, and well done. I know it can be hard getting a perfect photo of a train that moves so fast, but I\'m pleased that you\'ve mastered the right timing to take this cool photo. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.\r\n',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:16:52','2026-06-27 21:16:52'),(30398,'judge-event-evaluation-31272-1782559489',31272,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7181,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your effort, Josaia.\r\nAlways remember to list the photo details/location from the internet as that is someone\'s else\'s work you\'ve copied, so you have to acknowledge that in your paperwork where it says \'Source of ideas/images\'. In typing in the scripture, remember that the verse is the message, not where it\'s located, so that should be the message the viewer sees immediately. Choosing a font and using different enhancements will indicate the amount of effort and time taken in the production of your poster and will earn you more points in the judge\'s form. Please continue to experiment.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:24:49','2026-06-27 21:24:49'),(30399,'judge-event-evaluation-31445-1782560059',31445,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,9520,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,68.00,NULL,NULL,'Always remember to read the guidelines and judge\'s form to make sure you\'ve covered all the required areas in the production of your poster (especially creating it as an A3 poster to start with). Remember that a poster has to show a lot of thought and effort in the choice of the picture, editing and enhancements done to the picture and more importantly, creativity in the choice of the font and creativity in the editing and enhancements of the font. (it\'s not as simple as just typing a scripture onto a picture). Keep experimenting with programs that teach how to enhance pictures and enhance fonts....God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:34:19','2026-06-27 21:34:19'),(30403,'judge-event-evaluation-31413-1782560783',31413,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7186,4208,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your poster, Litiana.\r\nRemember that creating a poster is more than just typing a scripture onto a picture.  It should involve evidence of effort in choice of font, creativity in the design and enhancements of the font and creativity in the use of the picture. In your poster, the verse should be the most important message seen, so needs to be larger and easier to read and the verse location in a smaller size (capital letters in some fonts are difficult to read). I\'d encourage you to experiment with Publisher and other programs that teach how to use enhancements in font usage and design.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:46:23','2026-06-27 21:46:23'),(30407,'judge-event-evaluation-31315-1782561290',31315,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7558,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'Wow, amazing photo captured Yuvaan. I\'ve always admired this iconic landmark in Singapore and hope that some day I can visit Singapore. Continue to build up and keep practicing on how you can make your photos stand out with your unique way of capturing iconic landmarks and places. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:54:50','2026-06-27 21:54:50'),(30408,'judge-event-evaluation-31323-1782561369',31323,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7204,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Yavan, and well done on your submission. However I have noticed that you and another student have the exact same photo. The difference between your photo is that it is zoomed in, and the other student\'s photo isn\'t zoomed in. I\'m just wondering if both of you submitted the exact same photo, but you edited yours before submitting it. Overall keep trying and don\'t give up. God bless and all the best at Convention2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:56:09','2026-06-27 21:56:09'),(30409,'judge-event-evaluation-31265-1782561409',31265,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8709,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,58.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Shekinah, and well done on your submission. However I have noticed that you and another student have the exact same photo. The difference between your photo is that it is zoomed in, and the other student\'s photo isn\'t zoomed in. I\'m just wondering if both of you submitted the exact same photo, but you edited yours before submitting it. Overall keep it up and don\'t give up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 21:56:49','2026-06-27 21:56:49'),(30410,'judge-event-evaluation-31456-1782561719',31456,642,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,8716,4208,7239,12,NULL,NULL,100,69.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you. Always remember to check your work for any spelling or punctuation errors before finalising your entry (stretch is missing the \'t\' and \'Out\' and \'Above\' should not have capital letters. In composing your poster, remember the judge has to see effort and creativity that has gone into the production eg. enhancing of the picture, choice of the font and enhancements to the font (it\' not just typing a scripture onto a picture that makes a poster).  Also, as the poster report requires, a picture that\'s been taken from the internet has to have the URL address listed as that is someone else\'s photo that has been used, not yours, and the author of that photo must be recognised. Keep experimenting and designing and you\'ll see your creativity develop..',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:01:59','2026-06-27 22:01:59'),(30411,'judge-event-evaluation-31308-1782561987',31308,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7556,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Yahan, and well done on capturing a nice photo. Although I would encourage you to be more creative in how you can take your structure photos in the future, and make it stand out with its special twist. Overall keep practicing and don\'t give up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:06:27','2026-06-27 22:06:27'),(30412,'judge-event-evaluation-30488-1782562402',30488,617,24,24,7,2026,181,'462',NULL,7267,5806,7239,12,'Open',NULL,100,86.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you, Narieta, for the time and effort taken into creating your original poster, acknowledging the different steps you took in composing the picture and then the effort in choosing and enhancing the fonts. I salute you you for reading the guidelines and following the required steps. Keep experimenting and you\'ll be amazed at the creativity God reveals in you.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:13:22','2026-06-27 22:13:22'),(30413,'judge-event-evaluation-31453-1782562474',31453,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9522,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo Vishali, however the photo you\'ve submitted is a bit blurry. Otherwise great photo you\'ve captured. Keep building up your photography skills and keep practicing on how you can be creative. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:14:34','2026-06-27 22:14:34'),(30414,'judge-event-evaluation-30230-1782562774',30230,607,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7675,55,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you. When you use someone else\'s internet picture, you have to acknowledge where it\'s from by writing in the URL on your report form. Remember that creating a poster is not just typing a scripture onto a picture but it has to show effort and time taken in enhancing the font and the picture. Creating your own picture will always earn more marks.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:19:34','2026-06-27 22:19:35'),(30415,'judge-event-evaluation-31291-1782563041',31291,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8710,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Amazing photo Tong, well done. However I would encourage you to crop the photo a bit from the silver railings or zoom and angle the camera to only have the Marine Bay Sands Hotel as the center of the photo. Overall great work on capturing this amazing photo. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:24:01','2026-06-27 22:24:01'),(30416,'judge-event-evaluation-30963-1782563142',30963,607,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8830,55,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,73.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you, Julia. Always remember that creating a poster is more than just typing a scripture onto a picture. To earn higher points, the judge has to see that a lot of time and effort has gone into designing the best font and enhancing the font (using different font design methods/colours/shading etc. eg. in Publisher or other computer programs).\r\nKeep creating for His glory.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:25:42','2026-06-27 22:25:42'),(30417,'judge-event-evaluation-31244-1782563292',31244,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8712,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo Qutololove, and well done. Continue to practice and enhance your photography skills. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:28:12','2026-06-27 22:28:12'),(30418,'judge-event-evaluation-30165-1782563603',30165,607,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7632,55,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,58.00,NULL,NULL,'I would encourage you to ask your supervisor to show you how to complete the report form, especially the step by step process at the bottom which has to listed \'step by step\'. Also, \'Microsoft\' is not enough information in the middle box. Be careful when choosing a photo that you\'ve taken in a small resolution as it will be blurry and pixelated if you expand it to A3 size for your poster. Keep trying and you\'ll do better next time.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:33:23','2026-06-27 22:33:23'),(30420,'judge-event-evaluation-31232-1782563939',31232,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7559,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,64.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Mosese on capturing a cool photo. Please note that Bear statues are not considered under the category (Structure/Vehicle). For future preference I would encourage you to google or read through the guidelines so that you can understand the meaning of the category. Otherwise keep trying and don\'t give up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:38:59','2026-06-27 22:38:59'),(30421,'judge-event-evaluation-31209-1782563943',31209,642,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7183,4208,9272,6,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,-10,NULL,'This poem has a really strong message about God’s power, love, and faithfulness. I especially liked the repeated \'He is\' statements because they give the poem a confident rhythm and make the message feel bold and worshipful.\r\n\r\nTo make the poem even stronger, I’d encourage you to vary the rhythm a little so certain lines stand out more and create more impact. A slightly more powerful final line or image could also leave whoever is reading it with an even stronger lasting impression.\r\n\r\nThis was such a beautiful poem on who God is and I pray you enter again next year! Can\'t wait to be apart of 24/7 in July! God bless and see you there :)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:39:03','2026-06-27 22:39:03'),(30422,'judge-event-evaluation-31436-1782563976',31436,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9524,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,80.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you, Cornelia.\r\nRemember that creating a poster is more than just typing in a scripture onto a picture. It involves effort in the design and/or enhancing of the picture and also designing and enhancing the fonts used in the poster. Keep practising and you\'ll see the creativity of your poster production expand.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:39:36','2026-06-27 22:39:36'),(30423,'judge-event-evaluation-30308-1782564288',30308,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7655,55,9272,6,'Open',NULL,100,79.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Bryan, great job on an amzing poem! This poem shares a lovely message about kindness, humility, and showing God\'s love in our lives. The rhyming flows naturally and makes the poem more enjoyable to read while the simple language helps the message come across clearly.\r\n\r\nTo make the poem even more memorable next time you could include a few more descriptive details or images to help bring the message to life. I’d also encourage them to vary the rhythm in a couple of places so the poem has a little more expression and impact as it builds to the ending. GREAT JOB! Thankyou for your submission, and I pray God blesses you as you finish this year of school! God bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:44:48','2026-06-27 22:44:48'),(30424,'judge-event-evaluation-31333-1782564353',31333,642,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9527,4208,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo of the Big Ben Clock Joshua. I would probably crop out the traffic light and maybe take the photo from a different angle so that the Clock would be the center of the photo. Otherwise great job and effort put into this photo. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:45:53','2026-06-27 22:45:53'),(30425,'judge-event-evaluation-31213-1782564416',31213,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7557,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,67.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you.\r\nAlways remember that creating a poster is more than just typing a scripture onto a picture, but it involves time and effort in creatively enhancing the picture and also the fonts which takes time and thought to receive more points on the judge\'s form. Keep designing to develop your creativity.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:46:56','2026-06-27 22:46:56'),(30426,'judge-event-evaluation-31328-1782564675',31328,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9527,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Unfortunately, this does not qualify as a poster as there is no message and not a completed background.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:51:15','2026-06-29 11:35:35'),(30427,'judge-event-evaluation-30318-1782565021',30318,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9444,55,9272,6,'Open',NULL,100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Joshua, this is a lovely poem showcasing your thoughts on school life and how you experience school. Im so glad it seems like a good time at school. Anyways what went good was that your poem captures the journey of school life in a warm and relatable way, celebrating both challenges and special memories made along the way. The rhyming is smooth and consistent, making it an enjoyable poem to read from beginning to end.\r\n\r\nTo make the poem even stronger, you could include a few more personal or descriptive details to help the reader picture the experiences being shared. The ending is meaningful, but adding one final line with a little more emotional impact could make the poem even more memorable. But overall this poem was GREAT! You get 5 stars! Good job, it is short but sweet. I hope you return next year for the next convention!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:57:01','2026-06-27 22:57:01'),(30428,'judge-event-evaluation-31481-1782565067',31481,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9525,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,75.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you.\r\nPlease remember that a poster requires more than just typing a verse onto a picture. It requires thought, time and effort in enhancing a picture (or creating your own, preferably) then using enhancements and creativity in\r\nchoosing fonts and creatively placing them. Keep practicing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:57:47','2026-06-27 22:57:47'),(30429,'judge-event-evaluation-30212-1782565170',30212,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,9364,55,9272,6,'Open',NULL,100,67.00,-10,-10.00,'Hi this was a lovely poem about embracing the night. I loved how you showed me all the amazing things about the night and gave me some new perspectives I never thought of. Especially how the night is calming and relieving rather than scary as most people think.\r\n\r\nHowever, I had to take away marks due to several factors. Firstly, convention guidelines state that \"The contestant must compose an original poetry composition with a Christian, patriotic, Biblical, evangelistic, \r\nor historical theme.\" Unfortunately, as lovely as it is, it does not follow those guidelines.\r\n\r\nIt also contains more than 32 lines. Each line is 1-2 sentences max unless utilizing effects such as:( I did not know. Never. I couldn\'t know) as an example. You had WAY more than the maximum number of lines and you had it formatted more like a book report or story, rather than a poem. Usually it would be a breach, but you got under 70points which means unfortunately you haven\'t placed.\r\n\r\nIt was a very good submission otherwise, and I hope you submit again next year (Because it really was lovely and you have an excellent writing style and have a real future in poetry)',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 22:59:30','2026-06-27 22:59:30'),(30430,'judge-event-evaluation-30539-1782565462',30539,617,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7813,5806,9602,2,'Collection','10',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo of the Opera House Shalom. However you could crop the photo a bit more from the water, otherwise you\'ve captured a beautiful photo, keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:04:22','2026-06-27 23:04:22'),(30431,'judge-event-evaluation-31280-1782565472',31280,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7559,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,71.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you, Mosese.\r\nRemember that creating a poster requires more than just typing a scripture or message onto a picture. It requires thoughtful effort in the choice of the background (designing your own background would earn more points) and then creatively choosing font enhancements. Always remember to check spelling before publishing (handiwork doesn\'t have a \'y\'). Keep practicing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:04:32','2026-06-27 23:04:32'),(30432,'judge-event-evaluation-30319-1782565760',30319,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7650,55,9272,6,'Open',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Manav! I love your interpretation of midnight thoughts, i thought it was beautiful! This poem creates a beautiful atmosphere in its vivid imagery and thoughtful choice of words. The emotion is subtle yet powerful, and the hopeful ending provides a satisfying contrast to the quiet loneliness at the beginning.\r\n\r\nAt times the poem moves too quickly from one image to the next so expanding on one or two ideas a little more could make the emotional journey even stronger. Paying close attention to punctuation and consistency between lines would also help the poem flow even more smoothly.\r\n\r\nYou did a wonderful job and I pray that you continue using your gift, but with God\'s kingdom. Great job!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:09:20','2026-06-27 23:09:20'),(30433,'judge-event-evaluation-31256-1782565836',31256,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8712,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your poster entry.\r\nRemember to check for any punctuation errors before publishing (semi-colon should be a colon in the scripture) and KJV should be smaller. The message is the most important part of the scripture.\r\nTo earn maximum points, there must be evidence of a lot of time and effort in the background picture (not just a photo, but your own created background will earn more points), then time and effort in choosing fonts and adding enhancements. Keep practicing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:10:36','2026-06-27 23:10:36'),(30435,'judge-event-evaluation-31501-1782566171',31501,639,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7772,4678,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome work in capturing a cool photo of your father\'s car Abraham. Continue to strive in your photography skills. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:16:11','2026-06-27 23:16:11'),(30436,'judge-event-evaluation-30214-1782566200',30214,607,24,24,7,2026,20,'062',NULL,7737,55,9272,6,'Open',NULL,100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Patty! Beautiful writing! I think this poem has a gentle, sincere tone that feels like a simple prayer itself, and the message comes across very clearly. I especially liked the lines We bring to Him our joy and pain, and Our hopes, our loss, our loss again because they add real emotional weight and honesty to the poem.\r\n\r\nTo make the poem even stronger, you could vary the rhythm a little in the middle section so it doesn’t feel quite as sing-song throughout. The ending is reassuring, but one final image or line that leaves a stronger emotional picture could make the poem even more memorable. \r\nAmazing effort thankyou for joining convention this year and doing such an amazing job! Terima-Kasih banyak (Indonesian for thankyou so much!) Good luck for all your convention events, Ill be cheering you on from the office!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:16:40','2026-06-27 23:16:40'),(30437,'judge-event-evaluation-31288-1782566466',31288,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8709,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,69.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you, Shekinah.\r\nAlways ask someone to check for errors as sometimes we don\'t see them if we\'ve been concentrating, but others can pick up errors for us to correct. (the semi-colon shouldn\'t be there as you\'ve used the word \'and\'; \'learn\' should be \'lean\' and \'Proverbd\' should be \'Proverbs\'. Remember that creating a poster is not just about typing a scripture onto a picture but it requires time, thought and effort in enhancing a background and creatively enhancing fonts. Keep practicing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:21:06','2026-06-27 23:21:06'),(30438,'judge-event-evaluation-31506-1782566527',31506,639,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8878,4678,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Salote for capturing a cool photo of your sister\'s bicycle. However you could\'ve cropped the photo from the sides so that the photo is focused on the bicycle itself, and maybe be more creative in making your photo look more interesting. Otherwise keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:22:07','2026-06-27 23:22:07'),(30439,'judge-event-evaluation-31287-1782566554',31287,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8709,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'This is a second copy of the entry and has already been marked',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:22:34','2026-06-27 23:22:34'),(30440,'judge-event-evaluation-31289-1782566806',31289,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8710,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,59.00,NULL,NULL,'Thanks-you.\r\nRemember to read the guidelines and judge\'s forms, so that you know you\'ve covered everything required in your poster construction. Also, please check punctuation.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:26:46','2026-06-27 23:26:46'),(30441,'judge-event-evaluation-29938-1782567098',29938,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8755,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful photo of the Bure\'s structure Shiloh. Continue to be more creative and keep striving in your photography gift. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:31:38','2026-06-27 23:31:38'),(30442,'judge-event-evaluation-31417-1782567244',31417,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9522,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you. I like the simplicity of your poster, Vishali, and the effort you took in creating it by hand. Remember that you have to acknowledge the originator of the design by listing the URL address from the internet, as it wasn\'t your own idea, but someone else\'s.\r\nUsing  a computer would enhance the neatness of your entry and you could still add your own butterfly sketchings. Keep practicing and you\'ll get better and better.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:34:04','2026-06-29 11:42:18'),(30443,'judge-event-evaluation-30148-1782567468',30148,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9379,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Alayna in capturing a beautiful and clear photo. Keep practicing and be creative on how you can make your photos stand out. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:37:48','2026-06-27 23:37:48'),(30444,'judge-event-evaluation-31301-1782567568',31301,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7556,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'I\'m sorry, but there\'s no accompanying message to this poster picture.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:39:28','2026-06-29 11:40:39'),(30445,'judge-event-evaluation-31316-1782567699',31316,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7558,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'I\'m sorry but there\'s no message on this poster.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:41:39','2026-06-29 11:40:05'),(30446,'judge-event-evaluation-30224-1782567956',30224,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8761,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Joel and well done on taking a good photo. Although I would encourage you to be more creative in your documentation part, and maybe you could\'ve taken the photo at an angle so the the roofing part won\'t spoil the photo. Overall keep striving and keep practicing. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:45:56','2026-06-27 23:45:56'),(30447,'judge-event-evaluation-31319-1782568087',31319,642,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7204,4208,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,70.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you.\r\nPlease remember that maximum points are awarded for time and effort involved in a poster\'s production, both in the choice of the background, (your own design preferably, or otherwise, enhancement of your own picture), as well as the choice and enhancing of fonts. Practicing using Publisher or other computer programs will help you with ideas and in developing new skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:48:07','2026-06-27 23:48:07'),(30448,'judge-event-evaluation-30194-1782568419',30194,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8765,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Gemma on capturing a calm photo of Tanoa Plaza Hotel at night. I would encourage you to keep practicing on how you can make your photos stand out, and be more lively in your documentation. Overall great work, keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:53:39','2026-06-27 23:53:39'),(30449,'judge-event-evaluation-30195-1782568524',30195,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8765,5804,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,74.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you for your poster entry.\r\nI\'d encourage you to practice your fonts enhancements with Publisher or other computer programs, as creating a poster requires more than just typing a scripture onto a picture, but requires time and effort in enhancing the fonts creatively. Using a photo for a background is easy, but creating your own background is even more creative.\r\nkeep practicing and you\'ll become more and more skilled in your poster creations...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-27 23:55:24','2026-06-27 23:55:24'),(30450,'judge-event-evaluation-30182-1782569089',30182,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9380,5804,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'I\'m sorry, Grace, but you can\'t copy a poster from Pinterest and call it your own. Please ask your supervisor to show you the guidelines for how to construct a poster using your own ideas (background and font enhancement for the scripture) and also how to complete the report form correctly. You will then be rewarded for your honesty, time and effort.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:04:49','2026-06-29 08:54:03'),(30451,'judge-event-evaluation-30221-1782569549',30221,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,7356,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Kalani for your entry, and for capturing a cool photo of the car. However the photo you\'ve submitted is rotated sideways. Moving forward please make sure that your photo is rotated straight before submitting it. Overall keep it up. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:12:29','2026-06-28 00:12:29'),(30453,'judge-event-evaluation-30723-1782569704',30723,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,8764,5804,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you.\r\nRemember that creating a poster is not about just typing a scripture onto a background picture, but to earn maximum points, the effort in designing the background and the effort involved in choosing fonts and enhancing them creatively should be seen on the report form and identified on the finished poster. I would encourage you to continue practising using Publisher and other computer programs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:15:04','2026-06-29 11:26:04'),(30454,'judge-event-evaluation-30152-1782569826',30152,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9371,5804,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,66.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you.\r\nRemember that creating a poster is not about just typing a scripture onto a background picture, but to earn maximum points, the effort in designing the background and the effort involved in choosing fonts and enhancing them creatively should be seen on the report form and identified on the finished poster. I would encourage you to continue practising using Publisher and other computer programs.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:17:06','2026-06-28 00:17:06'),(30455,'judge-event-evaluation-30303-1782569970',30303,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8763,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Maloney for taking a cool photo. For future preference I would suggest not to edit your photo too much because it can spoil the beauty of the photo, and make it to bright. Also be more creative in how you document for your photo so that when people read it they\'ll understand the reason you wanted to take a photo of a pedicular building. Otherwise don\'t give up and keep striving. God bless and all the best for Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:19:30','2026-06-28 00:19:30'),(30456,'judge-event-evaluation-30192-1782570550',30192,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,8758,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,86.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Miriama, and well done on taking a nice photo. From my end, I would encourage you to be more lively in your documentation that is submitted with your photo. Otherwise keep it up and keep practicing on your photography skills. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:29:10','2026-06-28 00:29:10'),(30457,'judge-event-evaluation-30291-1782571224',30291,626,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7360,5804,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'I\'m sorry but there\'s an AI watermark showing on the internet for your entry and as you have not explained what you changed from the original internet template, we are unable to mark your entry as you have not given the URL address for the original that you adjusted, which means it is not your own work.\r\nThe best policy is to create your own poster and add your own font enhancements to gain good marks.\r\nPlease try again using the Poster guidelines and judge\'s form as your safety boundary.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:40:24','2026-06-29 11:28:16'),(30458,'judge-event-evaluation-30198-1782571581',30198,626,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9372,5804,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome photo you\'ve capture Nazarene. Continue building up your photography skills and keep being creative. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:46:21','2026-06-28 00:46:21'),(30459,'judge-event-evaluation-30911-1782571638',30911,623,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,7610,1404,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,0.00,NULL,NULL,'I\'m sorry, but we are unable to award points on this entry due to it being AI generated. Matthew, please ask your supervisor to show you the guidelines for constructing a poster so that you can gain better marks next time for your own original work.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:47:18','2026-06-29 11:42:43'),(30460,'judge-event-evaluation-31052-1782571975',31052,623,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9468,1404,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'What an amazing dragon structure Ara. Continue to enhance your photography gift. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:52:55','2026-06-28 00:52:55'),(30461,'judge-event-evaluation-30390-1782572186',30390,641,24,24,7,2026,168,'412',NULL,9498,5805,7239,12,'Collection',NULL,100,78.00,NULL,NULL,'Thank-you Immanuel for your encouraging poster. I can see that you know that basics of enhancing fonts. Keep experimenting for the best font, font size, font colour and font enhancement as you continue to develop your skills. The next step is to learn how to design your own background instead of going the easy way of just using a photo as a background.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:56:26','2026-06-28 00:56:26'),(30462,'judge-event-evaluation-31045-1782572186',31045,623,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9463,1404,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,92.00,-10,NULL,'Beautiful  photo Gabriel, well done. Continue to build up your photography gift and keep being creative on how you can make your photos stand out. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 00:56:26','2026-06-28 00:56:26'),(30463,'judge-event-evaluation-31039-1782572478',31039,623,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9464,1404,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,93.00,-10,NULL,'What an awesome photo you\'ve captured Rock. Keep it up and please be more descriptive in your documentation so that when people read it they would understand exactly why you chose this category. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 01:01:18','2026-06-28 01:01:18'),(30464,'judge-event-evaluation-31058-1782573322',31058,623,24,24,7,2026,161,'402',NULL,9471,1404,9602,2,'Collection','9',100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Well done Tevita on capturing a nice photo. Probably for future preference when taking a photo of the building when the sun it out try and angle yourself facing a particular way so when you take the photo the sun\'s reflection won\'t be reflecting on the building glass. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 01:15:22','2026-06-28 01:15:22'),(30465,'judge-event-evaluation-31831-1782574387',31831,607,24,24,7,2026,113,'302',NULL,8826,55,9602,59,'Collection',NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Awesome work and wood carving skills Aaron.  Please note that whatever you plan to wood carve you have to submit a photo of the shell along with your written documentation. God bless and all the best at Convention 2026.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 01:33:07','2026-06-28 01:33:07'),(30466,'judge-event-evaluation-30159-1782583563',30159,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7634,55,7314,2,'Collection','5,9',100,68.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Amelia,\r\nWhat a beautiful city skyline. I loved your choice of subject as it had intense colour\'s against blacks.  This subject would make a beautiful landscape shot.  You have entered your photo in as a structure and yes buildings are structures but \'Scapes\' would have been a more fitting category.  Some technical issues that could help in the future would be to ensure that your focus is on the subject that you photo is about, your foreground was in focus but your buildings were not.  I can understand why you may have thought it best to use a flash but at night light disperses as you can see from the dispersion of light around the city buildings from the city lights. Not using a flash may have helped balance this dispersion.  You have a good eye for what looks good as a subject keep up the good work.  Note that when you take a manual shot as written in your report make sure that you include the aperture, shutter speed, iso and Light meter.  I am wondering if you actually meant you just shot the photo which means the camera was automatic.  Note for future submissions photos need to be submitted as a jpeg type format not on paper.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 04:06:03','2026-06-28 04:06:03'),(30467,'judge-event-evaluation-29634-1782583688',29634,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7696,55,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Eroni, for sharing your picture with me.  I really liked your choice of subject and the red lights with the dark at night made the subject matter attractive.  The subject also has leading lines that led the eyes to the tower.  However, on the left-hand side there is a windmill shaped light display in red that takes the eye away from the tower because it is more in focus than the tower in the background.  Keep taking photographs and try also to use some of the editing tools on your camera to crop out distracting elements.  I encourage you to play with all the editing tools that are allowable so that you can make the most of your wonderful picture. Note photos need to be submitted in photo format such as a jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 04:08:08','2026-06-28 04:08:08'),(30468,'judge-event-evaluation-31402-1782583781',31402,642,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,8715,4208,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jona, your picture makes me want to visit the gardens that you were at.  I like the way you focused right in on the top of the structure.  Some cropping may have enhanced your picture, the lighting and night sky definitely gave this picture a boost.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 04:09:41','2026-06-28 04:09:41'),(30469,'judge-event-evaluation-29608-1782583924',29608,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,8867,55,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Jonathan, for your entry.  I can see you have an appreciation for motorbikes.  You have written a good report that is filled out correctly and gives me and insight into why you chose the composition you did.  You did capture the power and style of the bike and your composition was a good one. Focus was slightly out and so some of the clean line was not as crisp as it could have been.  The choice of natural background against manmade was effective.  Keep on taking photos! Please ensure that you send a photo in photo format e.g jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 04:12:04','2026-06-28 04:12:04'),(30471,'judge-event-evaluation-30999-1782607692',30999,623,24,24,7,2026,8,'014',NULL,9468,1404,8791