-you, Sally, for your entry. Remember to have a title for your story.\r\nYour story is showing as partly AI-generated (maybe you did that to add better wording to your original story). I would encourage you not to do that as the story has to be the sole work of the student and it becomes a slippery slope when we go to AI sites as we cannot then honestly say it was 100% our own work. Always remember that the peace of God (our honesty and integrity on the inside) are always the plumbline by which we measure our walk with God and at the end of the day, your rewards at Convention should not condemn you, but should be a congratulations for a job 100% done by you...God Bless.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 13:32:44','2026-06-28 13:32:44'),(30487,'judge-event-evaluation-31377-1782618106',31377,617,24,24,7,2026,163,'404',NULL,7260,5806,7756,2,'Collection','12',100,96.00,-10,NULL,'The clarity of the photo is good, and it communicates the action well. Well done!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 13:41:46','2026-06-28 13:41:46'),(30488,'judge-event-evaluation-30245-1782618137',30245,607,24,24,7,2026,163,'404',NULL,8851,55,7756,2,'Collection','12',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Your report explains where and when you took the photo, but the photo does not clearly show an event or action. The person is only walking, so the picture does not tell a strong story or catch the viewer\'s attention. Next time, try to take a photo that shows more action or an important moment, so it matches the Event/Action category better. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NUL