nt-evaluation-31480-1782636167',31480,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,9525,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,77.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Abigail. You’ve shown good effort in capturing this photo, and the mood of the scene comes through clearly. The composition is decent, but there is still room to improve lighting, focus, and overall clarity. Keep practicing to further develop your skills as a photographer. However, this submission is marked as a breach because the image focuses only on a specific spot rather than capturing a broader scene (‘scape’/vast view requirement). The expected standard was a wider, more comprehensive view of the ocean.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 18:42:47','2026-06-28 18:42:47'),(30572,'judge-event-evaluation-31241-1782636275',31241,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7559,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'You have submitted a stunning seascape photograph capturing the sunset by the horizon. The color blend of orange and blue across the sea is beautifully balanced, creating a serene and natural atmosphere. The composition highlights excellent use of lighting and timing. Please also improve the clarity of your documentation by using correct grammar and neat writing, as this contributes to a stronger overall presentation.\r\nContinue refining your technique and presentation, your effort and artistic eye are commendable. Well done, Mosese!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 18:44:35','2026-06-28 18:44:35'),(30573,'judge-event-evaluation-31257-1782636562',31257,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,8712,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Qutololove. You’ve shown good effort in capturing this photo, and the mood of the scene comes through clearly. The composition is decent, but there is still room to improve lighting, focus, and overall clarity. Keep practicing to further develop your skills as a photographer.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 18:49:22','2026-06-28 18:49:22'),(30576,'judge-event-evaluation-31302-1782636800',31302,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7556,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,65.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Yahan. You’ve shown good effort in capturing this photo, and the mood of the scene is visually appealing. However, the image is not well-focused, which affects overall clarity. The composition is decent, but there is still room to improve sharpness, lighting, and focus. Keep practicing to further develop your skills as a photographer. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 18:53:20','2026-06-28 18:53:20'),(30577,'judge-event-evaluation-31452-1782637049',31452,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,9522,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,71.00,-10,NULL,'Great effort is shown in your submission. The scenery would benefit from improved clarity, and upgrading your camera quality or settings will help produce sharper, more defined images. In addition, inconsistencies in handwriting and ink within the documentation may result in loss of marks, so please ensure neat and consistent writing. Keep up the good work and continue developing your skills. Bless you!',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 18:57:29','2026-06-28 18:57:29'),(30578,'judge-event-evaluation-30538-1782637248',30538,617,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7813,5806,7756,2,NULL,NULL,100,84.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Shalom. You’ve shown good effort in capturing this photo, and the mood of the scene is visually appealing. However, the image is not well-focused, which affects overall clarity. The composition is decent, but there is still room to improve sharpness, lighting, and focus. Keep practicing to further develop your skills as a photographer. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 19:00:48','2026-06-28 19:00:48'),(30579,'judge-event-evaluation-31313-1782637385',31313,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7558,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,80.00,-10,NULL,'You have submitted a beautiful sunset photograph with a clear horizon. While the colors are present, they are not very enhancing, but your effort is evident in the overall composition. Documentation: The scanned copy is not clear, and this may affect your marks. Please ensure your documentation is neat and clearly presented. Keep up the good work and continue developing your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 19:03:05','2026-06-28 19:03:05'),(30581,'judge-event-evaluation-30526-1782637435',30526,617,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7245,5806,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,97.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Josaiah. You’ve shown good effort in capturing this photo, and the mood of the scene is visually appealing. Keep practicing to further develop your skills as a photographer. Noted for neat and well-organized report writing.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 19:03:55','2026-06-28 19:03:55'),(30582,'judge-event-evaluation-31321-1782637563',31321,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,7204,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,91.00,-10,NULL,'Nice work, Yuvan. You’ve shown good effort in capturing this photo, and the mood of the scene is visually appealing. Keep practicing to further develop your skills as a photographer. ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 19:06:03','2026-06-28 19:06:03'),(30583,'judge-event-evaluation-31273-1782637785',31273,642,24,24,7,2026,162,'403',NULL,8709,4208,7756,2,'Collection','10',100,70.00,-10,NULL,'You have submitted a beautiful sunset photograph taken from a hill overlooking houses in the valley. The warm tones and natural lighting create a pleasant atmosphere; however, the image is not very enhancing due to several visual distractions that draw focus away from the main scene. Improving composition and clarity will help strengthen the overall impact. Documentation: Please ensure your writing is clear, neat, and presentable to avoid point deductions. Great effort shown, continue developing your skills.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-28 19:09:45','2026-06-28 19:09:46'),(30584,'judge-event-evaluation-30231-1782663657',30231,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,9444,55,7314,2,'Open','6,9',100,76.00,-10,NULL,'Hi Joshua,\r\nI hope you enjoyed your cruise in the Yasawa Islands.  A ship is an amazing subject.  Some pixilation in your photo.  I would love to know why it was shot in monochromatic and whether you did any editing or not.  Keep taking photos and do play with the editing tools.  Remember though that any changes you make will need to be recorded.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 02:20:57','2026-06-29 02:20:57'),(30585,'judge-event-evaluation-30384-1782663854',30384,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7728,55,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,94.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you Seungwoo Jang, this is a lovely picture of a beautifully structured building.  I can see that you really looked for leading lines in the fenceline which led the eye through the building to the back of the building.  Well done.  Going through doorways always adds a 3-dimensional look to your photograph.  Melbourne is full of beautiful gothic architecture which makes it an awesome place to take photos for any budding photographer.  Considering you did not use any enhancements this photo can be considered a great shot.  If I used any tool, it may have been just slightly changing my horizon line by using the rotate tool in my edit on my phone.  You did well to take several images. Next time remember to submit your photo in a photo format, e.g. jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 02:24:14','2026-06-29 02:24:14'),(30586,'judge-event-evaluation-30242-1782664701',30242,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7658,55,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This photo looks amazing, very clear and crisp, very professional.  I am unsure as your documentation gives me very little information on how you came to arrive at this image.  You have told me that you set the focus on automatic but I have no idea of whether the camera settings are on automatic or manual.  Also, you have told me you changed the background to blur it, what tool on your camera did you use to achieve this?  You also told me that you added some quality to make it 4K, what tool did you use to achieve this?  Did you use an image enhancer?  Remember when submitting a photo, it needs to be in a photo format, e.g. jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 02:38:21','2026-06-29 02:38:21'),(30587,'judge-event-evaluation-29322-1782665536',29322,607,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7739,55,7314,2,'Open','5,9',100,69.00,-10,NULL,'What a moment to capture, you must have been excited to be able to get a photo of this car! Unfortunately, the photo is out of focus and blurred.  I do like the angle you took the car on.  In future take several photos, if you have time and play with the enhancements your phone to at least crop. Do include a full description of the steps you took to get the final photo you present.  In convention submit your photo in a photo format, e.g. jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 02:52:16','2026-06-29 02:52:16'),(30588,'judge-event-evaluation-30549-1782665832',30549,641,24,24,7,2026,174,'452',NULL,7530,5805,7314,2,'Open','5',100,83.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you, Om, for entering this photo.  The car is placed in a good position. Red is always a good color to use as subject matter as it pops out. How did you go about shooting this picture?  Did you squat down?  I see that you definitely liked the contrast of the background against the car. The crispness of the image is interfered with a bit from the light dispersion from the car\'s lights.  My eye is drawn to the wheel of the car. Perhaps your focal point could have been changed so that more of the upper part of the car was in clear focus. How could this be changed or enhanced?  The lighting of the church enhances the trees which are in the middle third of the picture but do not act as a distraction, well done.  I can see that your photography skills are evolving and you have an eye for detail.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 02:57:12','2026-06-29 02:57:12'),(30590,'judge-event-evaluation-29826-1782667161',29826,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8847,55,7314,2,'Open','5,11',100,88.00,-10,NULL,'This is a clear shot. Still life is a good subject and food even better as many people relate to it.  The color on the plate makes this photo appealing. My eye also is led to the cup; I am wondering if cropping may help eliminate this slight distraction. Do look at enhancement tools on your phone.  You do not need to use them but if you do record which ones you used. You have appeared to use law of thirds in your photo, I am not sure if this is intentional or not, but it works.  Remember to always send your photo into convention in a suitable photo format, e.g. jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 03:19:21','2026-06-29 03:19:21'),(30593,'judge-event-evaluation-29698-1782668261',29698,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7741,55,7314,2,'Open','5,11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'What a mouthwatering subject, makes me want to try some right now.  Your image is captivating.  What type of Samsung were you using? Food is always a good subject and is appeals to a huge audience.  Did you use cropping at all?  Or did you just take the shot using the law of thirds, if so, you did this very well!  I encourage you to keep taking photos as you have a good eye.  Remember when submitting photos for student convention it needs to be in a suitable photo format, e.g. jpeg.  You have captured the light on the strawberries beautifully.  This photo makes me excited.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 03:37:41','2026-06-29 03:37:41'),(30594,'judge-event-evaluation-29806-1782668300',29806,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8848,55,7314,2,'Open','5,11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'This definitely is a rich, captivating and inviting dish of food you have chosen.  Food is always a good subject and very appropriate to this category.  I like the way you have zoomed in with your camera and used the law of thirds when you took this shot.  You have picked up the light and light reflections in the oils from your food well.  Overall and excellent shot.  Don\'t forget when submitting a photo to student convention it needs to be in an acceptable photo format, e.g. jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 03:38:20','2026-06-29 03:38:20'),(30595,'judge-event-evaluation-30160-1782669401',30160,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7634,55,7314,2,'Open','5,11',100,81.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your photo, Amelia.  This definitely is a beautiful and clear photo that is well in focus.  Did you use any online enhancement program?  If so, this would need to be recorded and is not allowed.  However, settings on your phone for sensible enhancement may be used. This photo could be improved by cropping your photo. On the left-hand side of the photo, in background window reflection, there appears to be a bit of distortion, not sure why this is.  This subject should probably be in Nature, rather than general.  When sending in an entry to student convention it needs to be in an acceptable photo format, e.g. jpeg.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 03:56:41','2026-06-29 03:56:41'),(30596,'judge-event-evaluation-29095-1782670401',29095,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,7668,55,7314,2,'Open','5,11',100,95.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your very creative work. This definitely had symbolic meaning. It is great to see someone go out and think about what they are doing and what they are doing rather than just taking a shot and submitting it.  My eyes are drawn to the sun. Should the cross have been the subject, if so, the focus needed to be clearer on the cross. The cross to the side is minimized by the focus on the foreground of the picture. The grass at your focal point is crisp. Did you take several shots?    A thorough report submitted.  Details of changes made usually go down in comments section not in the Lighting which can be artificial e.g. neon lights, spotlights, photography lights or Natural e.g. sunlight.  I like the way a team effort went into getting your composition.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 04:13:21','2026-06-29 04:13:21'),(30597,'judge-event-evaluation-29325-1782670972',29325,607,24,24,7,2026,178,'456',NULL,8868,55,7314,2,'Open','5,11',100,90.00,-10,NULL,'Thank you for your submission.  The angle of your shot appealing, buns give leading lines.  Cropping would have enhanced the photo as you could have taken some of the background out.  When a photo is taken inside.  Inside lights in a room are called artificial light, as is a phone light, these lights are manmade.  Natural light occurs from the sun and moon mainly, they use no manmade lights.  They are God made.  ',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 04:22:52','2026-06-29 04:22:52'),(30598,'judge-event-evaluation-29874-1782681403',29874,617,24,24,7,2026,348,'768','1',0,5806,9626,31,'Open',NULL,100,81.00,NULL,NULL,'So motional and touching piece. Should mind your Dynamics in your this piece.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 07:16:43','2026-06-29 07:16:43'),(30599,'judge-event-evaluation-29874-1782692486',29874,617,24,24,7,2026,348,'768','1',0,5806,9615,31,'Open',NULL,100,91.00,NULL,NULL,'Excellent work, Apimeleki! This instrumental arrangement is uplifting, reverent, and well-suited for its context; the piano and violin balance each other beautifully. \r\n\r\nHowever, assessment in the originality section was limited due to the absence of both an original piece and documented permission from the copyright owner of the melody, as per the event guidelines. \r\n\r\nAside from that, I encourage you to keep glorifying God in future events presented in full, where the creative musical talent with which He has blessed you can shine in its entirety.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 10:21:26','2026-06-29 10:21:27'),(30600,'judge-event-evaluation-30229-1782698129',30229,626,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,8755,5804,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Great short story that blends adventure survival with a deeply spiritual allegory. Just needs a bit of work on sentence flow and tighten pacing to keep the narrative momentum strong.',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'2026-06-29 11:55:29','2026-06-29 11:55:29'),(30601,'judge-event-evaluation-30229-1782698384',30229,626,24,24,7,2026,7,'013',NULL,8755,5804,9600,7,NULL,NULL,100,90.00,-10,0.00,'Great short story that blends survival with a spiritual allegory. It could use a more heightened emotional climax during Lizzie\'s rescue.',NULL,N